abash
ABASH:<BR>(1) हेपयति (c. of ह्री);<BR>(2) लज्जयति<BR>(c. of लज्ज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abate
ABATE (v. t.):<BR>I To lessen, diminish: q. v.<BR>लघयति (nomi.).<BR>II Leg. t. t., To put down:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abate
ABATE (v. i.):<BR>(1) क्षीयते (Pass. of क्षि);<BR>(2)<BR>परि-हीयते। (Pass. of हा);<BR>(3) अप-चीयते (Pass.<BR>of चि): v. To decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abatement
ABATEMENT:<BR>I Decrease, diminution:<BR>q. v.: ह्रासः।<BR>II Diminution of price: Ph.<BR>I will make an a. of five per cent<BR>*पञ्चकं शतं<BR> लघयामि।<BR>III Leg. t. t.: v. Failure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abbess
