abbot
ABBOT:<BR>(1) विहारपतिः;<BR>(2) मठाध्यक्षः;<BR>(3)<BR>मठाधीशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abbreviate
