abdicate
ABDICATE (v. i.): *राज्यं स्वाधिकारं वा त्यजति, परि-<BR>त्यजति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abdicate
