aberration
ABERRATION:<BR>(1) भ्रमः;<BR>(2) विभ्रमः;<BR>(3) उन्मार्ग-<BR>गमनम्। Ph.<BR>a. of mind<BR>मतिभ्रमः, Sa. vi.:<BR>a. of<BR>light<BR>*तेजोभ्रान्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=001" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abet
