abiding
ABIDING (part. adj.):<BR>(1) स्थायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>स्थास्नु (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abidingly
