ability
ABILITY:<BR>I Power: q. v.<BR>(1) शक्तिः;<BR>(2)<BR>सामर्थ्यम्; Ph.: to the best or utmost of one's<BR>a.:<BR>(1) यावच्छक्यम्;<BR>(2) यावच्छक्तितः।<BR>II Men-<BR>-tal capacity<BR>(1) नैपुष्यम्;<BR>(2) वैचक्षण्यम्;<BR>(3)<BR>पाटवम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

abject
