able
ABLE (adj.):<BR>I Competent, having sufficient<BR>power:<BR>(1) समर्थः (र्था, र्थं);<BR>(2) शक्तः (क्ता,<BR> क्तं);<BR>(3) क्षमः (मा, मं).<BR>II Possessing mental<BR>capacity:<BR>(1) पटु (mfn.);<BR>(2) निपुणः (णा, णं);<BR>v. Clever, skilful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

able
