ablution
ABLUTION:<BR>(1) आचमनम् (of the mouth);<BR>(2)<BR>अङ्गस्नानम् (of the body);<BR>(3) प्रक्षालनम्: v.<BR>Washing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=002" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ably
