absurdity
ABSURDITY:<BR>I Want of sense or judgement:<BR>(1) आनर्थक्यम्;<BR>(2) अयाथार्थ्यम्;<BR>(3) असङ्गतिः<BR>II<BR>An absurd thing: Ph.<BR>what a.<BR>कः प्रमादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

