abyss
ABYSS:<BR>(1) गभीरगर्तः;<BR>(2) गभीररन्ध्रम्;<BR>(3)<BR>अगाधबिलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

