academy
ACADEMY<BR>I A school: q. v. विद्यालयः।<BR>II A society of learned men:<BR>(1) विद्वत्सभा<BR>(?);<BR>(2) पण्डितसभा (?).<BR>The royal a.<BR>*लण्डन-<BR>नगरस्य चित्रकरसभाः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

accede
