accent
ACCENT (subs.):<BR>I In speaking: स्वरः।<BR>The<BR>acute a.<BR>उदात्तः;<BR>the grave a.<BR>अनुदात्तः;<BR>the<BR>circumflex a.<BR>स्वरितः।<BR>II A peculiar tone in<BR>speaking स्वरः;<BR>with distinct articulation and<BR>a.<BR>अतिस्पष्टवर्णस्वरसंस्कारया K.<BR>III. An accentual<BR>mark: स्वरचिह्रम् (?).<BR>IV Language, expre-<BR>-ssions: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=005" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

