AFFLICTING, AFFLICTIVE:<BR>(1) पीडाकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) व्यथकः (का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=016" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

affliction
AFFLICTION:<BR>I Misforune, calamity: q. v.<BR>II Distress, grief; q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=016" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

affluence
