agree
AGREE (v. i.):<BR>I To concur: तथैव<BR>or<BR>एवं<BR> मन्यते (मन्, c. 4). In some cases, by circumlo.:<BR>my views about jail discipline a. with yours<BR>*कारा-<BR>गारशासनविषयमतान्यावयोरभिन्नानि;<BR>they a. as to the<BR>omniscience of God<BR>*ईश्वरस्य सर्वज्ञत्वविषये तेषामै-<BR>कमत्यम्।<BR>II To yield, assent:<BR>(1) सम्मतः (ता<BR> तं) भवति;<BR>(2) गृह्णाति, परि-, (ग्रह्, c. 9) (with<BR>acc.): v. To accept.<BR>III To resemble:<BR>q. v.: संवदति (वद्, c. 1);<BR>the characters a. with<BR>each other<BR>संवदन्त्यक्षराणि, Mu. v.<BR>IV To stipu-<BR>-late: q. v.: अभ्युपैति; we sent messengers to [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">Page019</a>]<BR>%Kāmamañjarī, a. ing that he, who would be<BR>sought for by her, would carry the ensign of<BR>victory<BR>काममञ्जरी यं कामयते स हरतु सुमगपताकामित्यभ्यु-<BR>पेत्य प्राहिणुव तस्यै दूतान्, D. ii. Ph.<BR>at the hour a. d<BR>upon<BR>निर्दिष्टसमये। V. Of food: Ph.<BR>One should<BR>eat what a. s with him<BR>हितमश्नियात्, Sr.<BR>VI<BR>Gram. t. t.: Ph.<BR>a verb a. s with its nomina-<BR>tive in number and person<BR>*वचनपुरुषविषये क्रिया<BR> कर्तारमनुगच्छति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=018" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

