agreement
AGREEMENT:<BR>I Compact;<BR>(1) संविद्,<BR>to<BR>violate an a.<BR>संविदं मिनत्ति (भिद्, c. 7), अतिक्रामति<BR>(क्रम्, c. 1), etc., M.;<BR>(2) नियमः;<BR>(3) समयः;<BR>(4) प्रतिज्ञा।<BR>II Harmony of opinions or feel-<BR>-ings:<BR>(1) ऐक्यम्;<BR>(2) ऐकमत्यम्;<BR>III Confor-<BR>-mity, consistency: q. v.:<BR>(1) सादृश्यम्;<BR>(2)<BR>अनुरूपम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

