AGROUND: Ph.<BR>the boat is a.<BR>*भूमिं स्पृशति नौः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ague
AGUE:<BR>I An intermittent fever:<BR>(1) विषमज्वरः;<BR>(2) कम्पज्वरः:<BR>a quotidian a.<BR>अन्येद्युष्कः,<BR>a tertian<BR>a.<BR>तृतीयकः,<BR>a quartan a.<BR>चतुर्थकः Sr.<BR>II<BR>The ague-fit:<BR>(1) वेपथुः;<BR>(2) कम्पः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ah
AH (inter):<BR>(1) हा (of grief etc.), v. Alas;<BR>(2) अहो (of surprise etc.) v. Oh;<BR>(3) आः<BR>(of contempt etc.),<BR>ah ! frowning at me<BR>आः<BR> मय्येव भ्रकुटीधरः संवृत्तः, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aha
AHA (inter): अहो (in all the senses of the<BR>English word).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ahead
AHEAD: v. Forward. To go a.: v. Go on. To<BR>get a.: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aid
AID (subs):<BR>I Assistance, help:<BR>(1) साहाय्यम्;<BR>(2) साहायकम्।<BR>II An auxiliary, a helper:<BR>(1) सहायः;<BR>(2) साहाय्यकारी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aid
AID (v. t.): साहाय्यं करोति (with gen.): v. To<BR>assist, help.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aide-de-camp
AIDE-DE-CAMP: *सहचरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ail
AIL (v. t.): Ph.<BR>what a. s thee<BR>का ते पीडा ?: v.<BR>III, unwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ailing
AILING (adj.):<BR>(1) पीडितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) बाधितः<BR>(ता, तं): v. III, unwell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ailment
AILMENT:<BR>(1) पीडा;<BR>(2) बाघा;<BR>(3) व्यथा;<BR>(4)<BR>आतङ्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aim
AIM (subs):<BR>I The object aimed at:<BR>(1) लक्षयम्;<BR>(2) शरव्यम्;<BR>(3) लक्षं।<BR>II The direction of a<BR>missile weapon: सन्धानम्।<BR>III A purpose,<BR>intention: q. v. चिकीर्षितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aim
AIM (v.):<BR>I To direct an arrow etc.: लक्षीकृत्य<BR> क्षिपति, अस्यति, etc. Ph.:<BR>a. ing at Śiva<BR>हरबद्ध-<BR>लक्ष्यः, Ku.<BR>II To aspire, endeavour to<BR>attain:<BR>(1) आकाङ्क्षति (काङ्क्ष्, c. 1),<BR>a. ing at<BR>your post<BR>पदकाङ्क्षिणा ते, Ku.;<BR>(2) ईप्सति (desi.<BR>of आप्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air
AIR (subs):<BR>I The atmosphere:<BR>(1) वायुः;<BR>(2) मरुत्;<BR>(3) मातरिश्वन् (m).<BR>II The space<BR>occupied by air:<BR>(1) वायुवर्त्मन्;<BR>(2) व्योमन्<BR>(n.): v. Sky.<BR>III Air in motion:<BR>(1)<BR>वायुः;<BR>(2) पवनः;<BR>(3) अनिलः;<BR>(4) वातः;<BR>(5)<BR>समीरणः;<BR>(6) गन्धवहः। Ph.<BR>for taking a.<BR>वायु-<BR>सेवनार्थम्;<BR>the vital a.<BR>प्राणः<BR>IV Manner, mien,<BR>look: q. v.: आकृतिः<BR>V A tune or melody:<BR>q. v.: रागः, Ph.: to take a.: i. e. to get<BR>abroad: q. v.: बहुलीभवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air
AIR (v. t.):<BR>I To admit the fresh air: सुप्र-<BR>वातः (ता, तं) करोति।<BR>II To dry: q. v. आतपे<BR> ददाति (दा, c. 3) (to expose to the sun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-balloon
AIR-BALLOON:<BR>(1) व्योमयानम्;<BR>(2) विमानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-bladder
AIR-BLADDER: *वायुकोषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-gun
AIR-GUN: *वायुवन्दुकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

airing
AIRING:<BR>I A walk or ride in the air: वायु-<BR>सेवनं<BR>or<BR>वायुपरिसेवनं।<BR>II An exposure to air:<BR>v. To air.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-pump
AIR-PUMP: *वायुनिष्कासनयन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

air-shaft
AIR-SHAFT: (in mines):<BR>(1) वायुच्छिद्रम्;<BR>(2)<BR>आलोकपथः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=019" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

airy
AIRY (adj.):<BR>I Consisting of air.<BR>(1) वायवः<BR>(वी, वं);<BR>(2) वायुमयः (यी, यं).<BR>II Relating<BR>to air: Ph.<BR>took an a. flight<BR>वियदुत्पपात, N. or<BR>विहायसा जगाम;<BR>the a. regions<BR>वायुवर्त्मन्, प्रवहमार्गः।<BR>III Open to air: सुवातः (ता, तं).<BR>IV<BR>Vain, trifling:<BR>(1) शून्यः (न्या, न्यं);<BR>(2)<BR>असारः (रा, रं). V. Gay, lively: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aisle
AISLE: No equiv.: प्रकोष्ठः may be used.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

akin
AKIN:<BR>I Related by blood:<BR>(1) सगोत्रः (त्रा, त्रं);<BR>(2) सनाभि (mfn.).<BR>II Allied by nature:<BR>(1)<BR>सद्दशः (शा, शं);<BR>(2) रूपः (पा, पं) affixed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alabaster
ALABASTER: श्वेतप्रस्तरविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alack
ALACK (inter.): अहह: v. Alas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alacrity
ALACRITY:<BR>(1) उत्साहः v. Zeal;<BR>(2) औत्सुक्यम्:<BR>v. Eagerness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarm
ALARM:<BR>I Alarm-cry: no equiv.:<BR>why<BR>don't you rouse your master by raising an a.<BR>किमि-<BR>त्युच्चैः शब्दं कृत्वा स्वामिनं न जागरयसि, H.<BR>II.<BR>Terror, fright, consternation: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>त्रासः;<BR>(2) परित्रासः;<BR>(3) उद्वेगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarm
ALARM (v. t.):<BR>(1) उद्वेजयति (c. of विज्),<BR>sum-<BR>mon Vasantasenā's mother without a. ing her<BR>वसन्तसेनामातरमनुद्वेजयन्नाह्वय, Mr. ix.;<BR>(2) आकुलयति<BR>(nomi.) (=to fill with anxiety);<BR>(3) त्रासयति<BR>(c. of त्रस्): v. To terrify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarmed
ALARMED (adj.):<BR>(1) उद्विग्नः (ग्ना, ग्नं);<BR>(2)<BR>आकुलः (ला, लं): v. Anxious<BR>(3) त्रस्तः (स्ता, स्तं)<BR>(=terrified);<BR>(4) विधुरः (रा, रं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarmed
ALARMED, BE:<BR>(1) उद्विजते (विज्, c. 6);<BR>(2)<BR>त्रस्यति (त्रस्, c. 4) v. To dread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarm-bell
ALARM-BELL: *विधुरघण्टा, शत्रोरागमनादिसूचनाय या<BR> घण्टा वाद्यते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarming
ALARMING (adj.):<BR>(1) उद्वेगकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>त्रासजननः (नी, नं): v. Dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alarum
ALARUM: *प्रबोधघण्टा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alas
ALAS:<BR>(1) अहह,<BR>a. ! the buds of the tree of Rāva-<BR>na's impolicy are as if scattered around<BR>अहह !<BR> रक्षपतेर्दुर्विनयविटपिकोरकाः परितः प्रकीर्णा इव, Vi. vi.;<BR>(2) हाहा,<BR>a. my Queen, my heart is bursting, my<BR>joints loosening<BR>हाहा देवि ! स्फुटति हृदयं स्त्रं सते देह-<BR>बन्धः, U. iii.;<BR>(3) हा,<BR>a. what has befallen<BR>हा,<BR> किमिदमापतितम्, K. ;<BR>(4) हन्त,<BR>a. you will be the<BR>first enemy of the man who never had an enemy<BR>हन्त जातमजातारेः प्रथमेन त्वयारिणा, Si. ii. 102.;<BR>(5)<BR>बत<BR>a. when you hear what has befallen me<BR>ममाद्य<BR> वृत्तान्तमिमं बतोदिता, N. i. 139.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alb
ALB: *कृष्टधर्मपुरोहितपरिहितं शुक्लाप्रपदीनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

albatross
ALBATROSS: *जालपादः समुद्रपक्षिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

albeit
ALBEIT: यद्यपि: v. Although.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

albino
ALBINO: श्वेतकायः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

albugo
ALBUGO: शुक्लम्; चक्षूरोगविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

album
ALBUM:<BR>photographic a.<BR>*आलेख्यपुस्तकम्;<BR>a. for<BR>inserting quotations<BR>*वचननिवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

albumen
ALBUMEN: Perh. श्वेतम् (of eggs); मज्जा (in<BR>the scientific sense) (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alchemist
ALCHEMIST:<BR>(1) रसायनविद् (?);<BR>(2) रससिद्धः<BR>(?);<BR>(3) रसज्ञः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alchemy
ALCHEMY, ALCHYMY:<BR>(1) रसायनं (?);<BR>(2)<BR>रससिद्धिः (?);<BR>(3) रसायन-विद्या (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alcohol
ALCOHOL: *मद्यसारः; *सुरावीजम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alcove
ALCOVE: गर्भगृहं (?): v. Recess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alcyon
ALCYON: मत्स्यरङ्गः: v. Kingfisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alder
ALDER: वृक्षविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alderman
ALDERMAN: *लण्डनादि-नगरस्य मेयरनाम्नः प्रधान-<BR>नायकस्य निम्नस्थोऽधिकारिभेदः; पौरवृद्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ale
ALE: यवसुरं: v. Beer. a. brewer: v. Brewer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ale-house
ALE-HOUSE: शौण्डिकालयः Sa. v.; *यवसुरापणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ale-house-keeper
ALE-HOUSE-KEEPER: शौण्डिकः (f. की); *यव-<BR>सुरविक्रयिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alee
ALEE: i. e. on or towards the lee: v. Lee.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alembic
ALEMBIC: बकः (?); बकयन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alert
ALERT: v. Watchful, vigilant; also nimble,<BR>brisk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alertness
ALERTNESS: v. Briskness, watchfulness,<BR>sprightliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alexandrine
ALEXANDRINE (subs): चतुर्दशाक्षरश्छन्दोविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

algebra
ALGEBRA: वीजगणितम्; A. ist. वीजगणितविशारदः<BR>(दा, दं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

algebraic
ALGEBRAIC, ALGEBRAICAL:<BR>(1) by tat. comp.;<BR>(2) *वीजगणितविषयकः (का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alias
ALIAS: Ph.<BR>Rama a. Rāmanānda<BR>*रामः यस्य<BR> रामानन्द इत्यपरनाम।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alibi
ALIBI: Ph.<BR>the prisoner proved an a.<BR>*वन्दी स्थाना-<BR>न्तरस्थितिं प्रतिपादयामास।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alien
ALIEN (subs): विदेशिन् (f. नी): v. Foreigner<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alien
ALIEN (adj.):<BR>I Not native विदेशीयः (या, यं) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">Page021</a>]<BR>II Unconnected: q. v. अप्रासङ्गिकः (की, कं)<BR>III Adverse: q. v.: विरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=020" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alienable
ALIENABLE: *हस्तान्तरीकरणीयः (या, यं); परै-<BR>रादेयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alienate
ALIENATE (v. t.):<BR>I Of property: हस्तान्तरं करोति<BR>or<BR>हस्तान्तरीकरोति (?)<BR>II Of affection: Perh.<BR>विघटयति (c. of घट्); विश्लेषयति (c. of शिलष्)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alienation
ALIENATION:<BR>I Of property: हस्तान्तरीकरणम्<BR>(?).<BR>II Of affection:<BR>(1) विघटनम् (?);<BR>(2) विश्लेषणम् (?).<BR>III Of mind: उन्मादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alight
ALIGHT:<BR>I To get down; q. v.: अव-तरति<BR>(तॄ, c. 1).<BR>II To settle on (as bees): पतति,<BR> नि-, (पत्, c. 1), the swan a. ed on the ground<BR>पपात भूमौ हंसः N. iii. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alike
ALIKE (adj.):<BR>(1) सदृशः (शा, शं);<BR>(2) तुल्यः<BR>(ल्या, ल्यं): v. Like, similar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alike
ALIKE (adv.): समं: v. Equally, similarly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aliment
ALIMENT: आहारः v. Food, nourishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alimentary
ALIMENTARY (adj.): v. Nourishing.<BR>The a.<BR>canal<BR>*आहारवाहिनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alimony
ALIMONY: ग्रासाच्छादनम्। K. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alive
ALIVE:<BR>I Living: q. v.: जीवत् (f. न्ती).<BR>II<BR>Active, lively: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alive
ALIVE, BE: जीवति,<BR>tell me, is my darling a.<BR>कथय<BR> जीवति मे प्रिया, Ma. ix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alkali
ALKALI:<BR>(1) क्षारः;<BR>(2) सर्ज्जिः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all
ALL (adj.)<BR>(1) सर्वः: (र्वा, र्वं);<BR>all of them, en-<BR>joying a. pleasures at a. times, reached the pin-<BR>nacle of happiness<BR>सर्वएव सर्वकालं सर्वसुखान्यभनुवन्तः<BR> परां कोटिमानन्दस्याध्यगच्छन्, K. ;<BR>(2) सकलः (ला,<BR> लं);<BR>(3) समस्तः (स्ता, स्तं);<BR>(4) निखिलः (ला,<BR> लं),<BR>knowledge of a. characters, erudition in the<BR>languages of a. countries, attainments in a. the<BR>Shastras<BR>सकललिपिञ्झानं निखिलदेशीयमाषापाण्डित्यं<BR> समस्तशास्त्रचातुर्यम्, D. ;<BR>(5) अखिलः (ला, लं);<BR>(6)<BR>कृत्स्नः (स्ना, स्नं);<BR>(7) समग्रः (ग्रा, ग्रं);<BR>(8)<BR>समुदायः affd.,<BR>or the abode of a. essence of<BR>beauty<BR>सौन्दर्यसारसमुदार्यानकेतनं वा, Ma. ii. Ph.<BR>the Supreme Spirit is a. joy<BR>आनन्दमयः परमात्मा,<BR>S. i. 13.: v. Full of;<BR>by a. means, one ought<BR>not to do anything without consideration<BR>सर्वथा<BR> अविचारितं कर्म न कर्तव्यम् H. i.;<BR>at a. events<BR>अन्ततः;<BR>a. along<BR>पूर्वावधि;<BR>a. around<BR>सर्वतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all
ALL (subs): सर्व;<BR>I want to hear a. about it<BR>सर्व<BR> श्रोतुमिच्छामि। Ph.:<BR>a. I can<BR>यथाशक्ति;<BR>a. of a<BR>sudden<BR>सपदि;<BR>in a.<BR>साकल्येन;<BR>does not breathe<BR>at. a.<BR>न मनागप्युच्छ्वसिति; K.;<BR>you are not kind<BR>at a.<BR>त्वयि दयालेशोऽपि न विद्यते;<BR>a. you have to<BR>say is this<BR>*इदमेव<BR>or<BR>केवलमिदमेव त्वया वाच्यम्॥।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-conquering
ALL-CONQUERING:<BR>(1) सर्वजयिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>सर्वदमनः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-destroying
ALL-DESTROYING:<BR>(1) सर्वध्वंसिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>सर्वङ्कषः (षा षं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-forgiving
ALL-FORGIVING:<BR>(1) सर्वंसहः<BR>or<BR>सर्वसहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2) सर्वसहिष्णु (mfn.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-glorious
ALL-GLORIOUS:<BR>(1) सर्वतेजोमयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>सर्वप्रतापवत् (f. ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-knowing
ALL-KNOWING: सर्वज्ञः (ज्ञा, ज्ञं);<BR>(2) सर्वविद्<BR>(mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-pervading
ALL-PERVADING:<BR>(1) सर्वव्यापिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>सर्वगतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-powerful
ALL-POWERFUL:<BR>(1) सर्वशक्तिमत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) सर्व-<BR>शक्तिसमन्वितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-seeing
ALL-SEEING:<BR>(1) सर्वदर्शिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) सर्वद्रष्ट्ट<BR>(f. ष्ट्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

all-wise
ALL-WISE:<BR>(1) सर्वञ्जः (ञ्जा, ञ्जं);<BR>(2) सर्वञ्जानमयः<BR>(यी, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allay
ALLAY (v. t.); शमयति, प्र-, (c. of शम्),<BR>a. s<BR>the heat<BR>शमयति परितापं Sa. iv.: v. To app-<BR>-ease, mitigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allegation
ALLEGATION:<BR>(1) वचनम्;<BR>(2) उक्तिः v. Asser-<BR>-tion, plea.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allege
ALLEGE (v. t.):<BR>I To affirm, to assert: q. v.:<BR>प्रति-जानीते (ज्ञा, c. 9).<BR>II To cite, quote.:<BR>q. v.: उदा-हरति (हृ, c. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allegiance
ALLEGIANCE: भक्तिः,<BR>they took an oath of a. to<BR>Caesar<BR>*वयं सिजारथक्ता इति शपथं चक्रुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allegorical
ALLEGORICAL: रूपकमयः (यी, यं) (?): v. Figu-<BR>-rative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allegorically
ALLEGORICALLY: Expr. by the adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allegorize
ALLEGORIZE:<BR>I To turn into allegory: *रूपक-<BR>क्रमेण वर्णयति (वर्ण, c. 10)<BR>II To interpret<BR>allegorically: *रूपकार्थं सं-योजयति (c. of.<BR>युज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alleviate
ALLEVIATE (v. t.):<BR>(1) शमयति, प्र-, (c. of शम्):<BR>(2) लघयति (nomi.): v. To mitigate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=021" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alleviation
ALLEVIATION:<BR>I Mitigation: q. v.: उपशमः<BR>II Extenuation: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alley
ALLEY (subs): A walk in a garden:<BR>(1)<BR>उद्वानपथः;<BR>(2) उद्यानवर्त्मन् (n);<BR>(3) वीथिः v.<BR>Avenue.<BR>II A narrow passage: सङ्कीर्णपथः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alliance
ALLIANCE: A union between states: सन्धिः;<BR>offensive and defensive a.<BR>परस्परोपकारसन्धिः, H.<BR>iv.: v. Treaty, league.<BR>II Union arising<BR>from marriage: सम्बन्धः<BR>matrimonial a.<BR>वैवाहिकः<BR> सम्बन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alligator
ALLIGATOR:<BR>(1) नक्रः;<BR>(2) कुम्भीरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alliteration
ALLITERATION: अनुप्रासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allocution
ALLOCUTION: v. Address.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allodial
ALLODIAL: Ph.<BR>a. land<BR>निष्करभूमिः (?).<BR>a. land<BR>belonging to a Brahmin<BR>ब्रह्मोत्तरः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allodium
ALLODIUM: i. e. freehold estate: v. Freehold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allot
ALLOT (v. t.):<BR>I Distribute: q. v. वि-भजति<BR>(भज्, c. 1)<BR>II To grant, assign: q. v.: ददाति<BR>(दा, c. 3).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allotment
ALLOTMENT:<BR>I The act of allotting:<BR>(1)<BR>विमागः;<BR>(2) विमजनम्।<BR>II That which is<BR>allotted: अंशः v. Share.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allow
ALLOW (v. t.):<BR>I To concede, permit:<BR>(1)<BR>अनु-मन्यते (मन्, c. 4), if you a. me space in<BR>(your)<BR>flower-bed<BR>यदि कुसुमास्तरणेऽवकाशमनुमन्यसे,<BR>Sa. iii.;<BR>(2) अनु-मेदते (मुद्, c. 1),<BR>now none<BR>is a. ed egress or ingress without a pass<BR>इदानीं न<BR> कोप्यमुद्रालाञ्छितो निष्क्रमितुं प्रवेष्टुंवानुमोद्यते, M. v.;<BR>(3) अनु-जानामि (ज्ञा, c. 9) v. To permit.<BR>II<BR>To grant, bestow: q. v. ददाति (दा, c. 3).<BR>III To acknowledge: q. v. स्वीकरोति (कृ,<BR>c. 8).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allowable
ALLOWABLE: v. Lawful, permissible. Not<BR>a.: v. Forbidden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allowance
ALLOWANCE:<BR>I Acknowledgment: q. v.:<BR>स्वीकारः।<BR>II Permission: q. v.: अनुज्ञा।<BR>III<BR>That which is allowed: no equiv.: वृत्तिः,<BR>of<BR>the Pandits enjoying my a. s.<BR>मद्दत्तां वृत्तिं भुञ्जानानां<BR> पण्डितानां, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allowance
ALLOWANCE, make: विगणयति (गण्, c. 10),<BR>making a. for the temptations of youth<BR>*यौवनस्य<BR> प्रलोभनानि विगणय्य: v. To consider.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alloy
ALLOY (v. t.): मिश्रयति (मिश्र्, c. 10): v. To<BR>mix: Ph.,<BR>a. ed with pain<BR>दुःखोपसृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं),<BR>D. s.;<BR>being a. ed with pain<BR>दुःखसंभिन्नतया,<BR>D. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alloy
ALLOY (subs.):<BR>I Any compound of two or<BR>more metals: मिश्रधातुः।<BR>II Evil mixed with<BR>good: Ph.<BR>enjoyed pleasures without a.<BR>*अवि-<BR>मिश्रितानि सुखान्यनुबभृव।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allude
ALLUDE:<BR>(1) उद्दिश्य<BR>or<BR>लक्षीकृत्य वदति, अभिधत्ते,<BR>etc. (in speaking);<BR>(2) लक्षीकरोति (=to<BR>point, refer); what ! this alludes to me<BR>कथमियं कथा मामेव लक्षीकरोति, Sa. vii. Ph. this<BR>mythological story is here a. d to (?) — इति<BR> पौराणिकी कथात्रानुसन्धेया, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allure
ALLURE (v. t.):<BR>(1) आकर्षति (कृष्, c. 1.), men<BR>are a. d by these sweet (but) false words<BR>आभिस्तावन्मधुराभिरनृतवाग्मिराकृष्यन्ते विषयिणः, Sa.<BR>v.;<BR>(2) हरति (हृ, c. 1.):<BR>even an old man<BR>like myself is, as a rule, a. d by pleasures<BR>ह्रियते<BR> विषयैः प्रायो वर्षीयानपि मादृशः, Ki. xi. 10.;<BR>(3)<BR>प्रलोभयति, (c. of लुभ्) v. To tempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allurement
ALLUREMENT: प्रलोभनम्: v. Temptation, entice-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alluring
ALLURING (adj.):<BR>(1) हारिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2)<BR>प्रलोभकः (का, कं);<BR>(3) आकर्षकः (की कं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

allusion
ALLUSION: Ph.<BR>his a. to my poverty<BR>*मम दारिद्र्पं<BR> लक्षीकृत्य स यदुवाच;<BR>there is not the least a. of<BR>Kṛṣṇa in the Rig Veda<BR>*ऋग्वेदे कृष्णस्याभासोऽपि<BR> न लक्ष्यते v. To allude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alluvial
ALLUVIAL: Ph.<BR>a. accretion<BR>*पयोवस्तभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ally
ALLY (subs): मित्रम्, M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ally
ALLY (v. t.)<BR>I To unite or connect: सम्बन्धं करोति,<BR> संबध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.)<BR>II To form an alliance<BR>with (between states).: सन्धिं करोति<BR>or<BR>संदधाति<BR>(धा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almanac
ALMANAC: पञ्जिका;<BR>a. maker<BR>पञ्जिकाकारः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almightiness
ALMIGHTINESS:<BR>(1) सर्वशक्तिमत्त्वम्;<BR>(2) सर्वशक्तित्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almighty
ALMIGHTY:<BR>(1) सर्वशक्तिमत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) सर्वशक्ति<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(3) सर्वशक्तिसमन्वितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almond
ALMOND: वादामम्।<BR>Bitter a.<BR>तिक्तवादामम्। A. tree<BR>वादामवृक्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almoner
ALMONER: *भिक्षावितरणकारी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

almost
ALMOST:<BR>(1) प्रायः (या, यं), it is a. morning now<BR>प्रभातप्राया रजनी, Sa. iv;<BR>(2) कल्पः (ल्पा, ल्पं), [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">Page023</a>]<BR>a. well<BR>प्रसन्नकल्पः, D. ii.; a. undertaken<BR>प्रतिपन्नकल्पम्। Ku. iii. 14;<BR>(3) भूयिष्ठः (ष्ठा, ष्ठं),<BR>a. extinguished<BR>निर्वाणभूयिष्ठम्, Ku. iii. 52.<BR>N. B. Note that these words are placed after<BR>adjectives or part. adj. s and that, there-<BR>-fore, when in Englsh a. qualifies verbs, it<BR>should be expressed in Sanskrit by corresp.<BR>part. adj. s:<BR>when I had a. finished<BR>*अवसितप्राये<BR> मम वाक्ये।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=022" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alms
ALMS:<BR>(1) भिक्षा;<BR>(2) भैक्षम्।<BR>To beg a.<BR>भिक्षते<BR>(भिक्ष्, c. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alms-giving
ALMS-GIVING:<BR>(1) दानधर्मः;<BR>(2) भिक्षादानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alms-house
ALMS-HOUSE:<BR>(1) दरिद्रशाला (?);<BR>(2) अनाथाश्रमः।<BR>(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aloe
ALOE: घृतकुमारी।<BR>a. wood.<BR>अगुरुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aloft
ALOFT:<BR>I On high: ऊर्ध्वम्।<BR>II In the air:<BR>(1) विहायसा;<BR>(2) आकाशपथेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alone
ALONE (adj.)<BR>I Without anybody else: एकाकिन्<BR>(f. नी),<BR>he could not remain a. even for a moment<BR>without him<BR>निमिषमपि तेन विना स्थातुमेकाकी न शशाक,<BR>K. v. Solitary.<BR>II One out of many:<BR>एकः (का, कं) (with एव<BR>or<BR>केवलम्),<BR>let Bhāgu-<BR>rāyana a. accompany me<BR>भागुरायण एक एव मामनुगच्छतु,<BR>Mu. iv.; let my intellect a. remain with me<BR>एका केवलम्॥॥।बुद्धिस्तु मा गान्मम, Mu. i.<BR>III By<BR>itself: केवलः (ला, लं),<BR>policy a. is cowardice<BR>कातर्यं<BR> केवला नीतिः R. xvii. 47. Ph.<BR>let imperiality be<BR>a.<BR>आस्ताञ्चक्रवर्तिता, D. viii.: v. To let alone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

along
ALONG (prep.): अनु, (in comp. or with acc.),<BR>a. the bank<BR>अनुकच्छम्; flows a. the city of Oudh<BR>वहत्ययोध्यामनु राजधानीम्, R.<BR>A. with:<BR>सह (with<BR>ins.): v. With.<BR>A. side<BR>पार्श्वतः।<BR>All a.<BR>प्रथमावधि।<BR>A. of: v. On account of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

along
ALONG (adv.): v. Onward, forward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aloud
ALOUD:<BR>(1) उच्चैः<BR>or<BR>उच्चैःस्वरेण (with a loud<BR>voice);<BR>(2) मुक्तकण्ठम् (with loosened<BR>throat);<BR>(3) प्रकाशम् (openly). To call a.:<BR>शब्दायते (nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alphabet
ALPHABET: वर्णमाला। a. ically:<BR>(1) वर्णक्रमेण;<BR>(2) वर्णानुसारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

already
ALREADY:<BR>(1) प्रागेव;<BR>(2) पूर्वमेव। Sometimes by<BR>sim. एव:<BR>he is a. come<BR>स आगत एव;<BR>the sun is<BR>already up<BR>उदित एव भास्करः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

also
ALSO: अपि; Chandrāpida a. entered into thoughts<BR>चन्द्रापीडोऽपि चिन्तां विवेश, K.;<BR>not only he who<BR>speaks ill of the great but a. he who hears<BR>न<BR> केवलं यो महतोऽपभाषने शृणोति तस्मादपि यः स Ku.<BR>v. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

altar
ALTAR (subs.):<BR>(1) वेदिः;<BR>(2) चैत्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alter
ALTER (v. t.):<BR>(1) करोति (कृ, c. 8.) (when the<BR>sense is clear):<BR>he concluded that the merchant<BR>had a. ed the R into S.<BR>रेफे सकारं वणिजा कारितं<BR> निश्चिकाय सः, Raj.;<BR>(2) By means of अन्यः<BR>(न्या, न्यत्), भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं) etc.:<BR>as if you are a.<BR>ed in appearance<BR>त्वमन्यमाकारमिवाभिपन्नः, Ki., iii.<BR>46.;<BR>(3) परिवर्तयति (c. of वृत्). c. l.)v. To change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alter
ALTER (v. i.): परिवर्तते (वृत्, c. 1.) v. To<BR>change, vary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alterable
ALTERABLE (adj.): परिवर्तनीयः (या, यं) v.<BR>Changeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alteration
ALTERATION:<BR>(1) परिवृत्तिः;<BR>(2) परिणामः;<BR>(3)<BR>विपाकः;<BR>(4) विकारः। N. B. The last three words<BR>refer to change in form etc. v. Change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

altercate
ALTERCATE (v. i.):<BR>(1) कलहायते (nomi);<BR>(2)<BR>वि-वदते (वद्, c. 1.) v. To wrangle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

altercation
ALTERCATION:<BR>(1) कलहः;<BR>(2) विवादः। v.<BR>Quarrel, wrangling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternate
ALTERNATE (adj.): Comp. with पर्याय-;<BR>with<BR>a. victory and defeat<BR>पर्यायजयावसादां, Ki. xvii.<BR>18.;<BR>a. angles<BR>*पर्यायकोणौ (m. dual);<BR>a.<BR>leaves<BR>*पर्यायदलानि (n. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternate
ALTERNATE (v. i.): Ph.<BR>the flood and ebb<BR>tides a. with each other<BR>*पर्यायेण वेलानां वृद्धिक्षयौ<BR> भवतः<BR>or<BR>वेलानां पर्यायवृद्धिक्षयौ।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternate
ALTERNATE (v. t.): Ph.<BR>to a. labour with<BR>repose<BR>*पर्यायेण श्रमविश्रामौ करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternately
ALTERNATELY: पर्यायेण, अनुक्रमेण (=in regular<BR>order).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternation
ALTERNATION:<BR>(1) पर्यायक्रमः;<BR>(2) पर्यायवृत्तिः;<BR>(3) परिवृत्तिः। (=change: q. v.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alternative
ALTERNATIVE:<BR>(1) विकल्पः;<BR>(2) पाक्षिकः Ph.:<BR>which a. shall<BR>I choose ‘be a deserter of my wife’<BR>or ‘be polluted with the touch of another's wife’<BR>दारत्यागी भवाम्याहो परस्त्रीस्पर्शपांशुलः, Sa. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

although
ALTHOUGH:<BR>(1) अपि: we remember that Vidura<BR>and others a. born Sudras were possessed of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">Page024</a>]<BR>superior knowledge<BR>विदुरप्रभृतयः शूद्रयोनिप्रभवा अपि-<BR>विशिष्टविज्ञानसम्पन्नाः स्मर्यन्ते, S. iii. 34.<BR>She will<BR>surely move a. she may be in a painting, will<BR>practise jugglery a. she may consist of a doll,<BR>will deceive a. she may be engraved<BR>नियतमियमाले-<BR>ख्यगतापि चलति, पुस्तमय्यपीन्द्रजालमाचरति, उत्कीर्णापि<BR> विप्रलभते, K.;<BR>(2) यद्यपि,<BR>a. we cannot extirpate<BR>pain, still we can put it down,<BR>यद्यपि न सन्निरूध्यते<BR> दुःखं तथापि तदभिभवः शक्यः कर्तुम्, T.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=023" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

altitude
ALTITUDE: उच्छ्रायः v. Height.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

altogether
ALTOGETHER:<BR>I Wholly, completely,: q. v.:<BR>(1) सर्वथा;<BR>(2) अशेषतः<BR>II Conjointly: q. v.:<BR>समम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

alum
ALUM:<BR>(1) स्फटी (f.);<BR>(2) स्फटिकारिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

always
ALWAYS:<BR>I Perpetually, constantly: q. v.:<BR>(1) सदा;<BR>(2) सर्वदा;<BR>(3) सततम्;<BR>(4) सर्वकालम्;<BR>(5) अनिशम्।<BR>II Invariably: q. v.: नियतम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amain
AMAIN:<BR>(1) प्रसभम्;<BR>(2) प्रसह्य;<BR>(3) बलात्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amalgam
AMALGAM: मिश्रधातुः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amalgamate
AMALGAMATE: मिश्रयति (मिश्र्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>mix, combine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amalgamation
AMALGAMATION: मिश्रणम् v. Mixture, combi-<BR>-nation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amanuensis
AMANUENSIS: लेखकः; योऽन्यस्य भाषितानुसारेण लिखति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amaranth
AMARANTH:<BR>I The plant: अम्लानः।<BR>II The<BR>flower: अम्लानपुष्पम् etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amass
AMASS (v. t.):<BR>(1) सं-चिनोति (चि, c. 5.);<BR>(2)<BR>सं-मरति (भृ, c. 1): v. To accumulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amateur
AMATEUR: यः (या, यं) आत्मविनोदनार्थं सङ्गीतादिकलां<BR> सेवते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amatory
AMATORY (adj.):<BR>(1) रसिकः (का, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>शृङ्गाररसप्रधानः (ना, नं) (such as a. verses);<BR>(3)<BR>प्रेमकरः (री, रं) (=producing love, such as a.<BR>potions);<BR>(4) कामिन् (f. नी). v. Amorous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amaze
AMAZE (v. t.): विस्माययति (c. of स्मि): v. To<BR>astonish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazed
AMAZED (adj.): विस्मयाकुलः (ला, लं): v. Asto-<BR>-nished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazedly
AMAZEDLY (adv.):<BR>(1) सविस्मयम्:<BR>(2) विस्मयेन;<BR>(3) By the adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazement
AMAZEMENT: विस्मयः: v. Astonishment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazing
AMAZING (adj.): विस्मयकरः (री, रं): v. Asto-<BR>-nishing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazingly
AMAZINGLY: expr. by the adj.: v. Amazing<BR>v. Also excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amazon
AMAZON: *पह्मिनी; रणप्रिया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambassador
AMBASSADOR:<BR>(1) दूतः,<BR>(2) राजदूतः। Ph.<BR>the<BR>English a. at Berlin<BR>*वार्लिनस्य इंलण्डीयराजदूतः or<BR>इंलण्डीयराजमन्त्री।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambassage
AMBASSAGE:<BR>(1) दौत्यम्;<BR>(2) राजदौत्यम्;<BR>(3)<BR>दूत्यं: v. Ambassador.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amber
AMBER (subs):<BR>(1) तैलस्फटिकः;<BR>(2) तृणमणिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambergies
AMBERGIES: अम्बरम् (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambient
AMBIENT: (adj.):<BR>(1) व्यापकः (का, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>परिवेष्टकः (का, कं): v. To encompass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambiguity
AMBIGUITY:<BR>(1) सन्देहः;<BR>(2) सन्दिग्धता;<BR>(3)<BR>सन्दिग्धार्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambiguous
AMBIGUOUS<BR>(1) सन्दिग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं);<BR>(2) सन्दिग्घार्थः<BR>(र्था, र्थं). Ph. it is a. here whether the word<BR>वन्द्यां<BR>means ‘captive’ or ‘adorable’<BR>अत्रवन्द्यामिति<BR> किं वन्दीभूतायामुत वन्दनीयमिति सन्देहः Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambiguously
AMBIGUOUSLY: expr. by the adj.: Ph.<BR>you<BR>have spoken a.<BR>*सन्दिग्धं तव भाषितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambit
AMBIT:<BR>(1) मण्डलम्;<BR>(2) चक्रम्: v. Circuit,<BR>compass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambition
AMBITION:<BR>(1) स्पृहा;<BR>(2) आकाङ्क्षा;<BR>(3) यशोलिप्सा<BR>(for fame);<BR>(4) राज्यलोभः (for royalty);<BR>(5)<BR>गौरवलालसा (for esteem);<BR>(6) and sim. com. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambitious
AMBITIOUS:<BR>(1) यशस्कामः (मा, मं) (for fame);<BR>(2) उच्चपदाभिलाषिन् (f. णी) (for high post)<BR>etc. v. Desirous of, eager. Ph.<BR>a. for your<BR>post<BR>पदकांक्षिणा ते Ku. iii. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amble
AMBLE (subs)<BR>(1) धौरितकम्;<BR>(2) धोरितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amble
AMBLE (v.):<BR>(1) Perh. धोरति (धोर्, c. 1);<BR>(2) धोरितगत्या चलति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambler
AMBLER: धौरितशीलः (ला, लं) (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambrosia
AMBROSIA: अमृतम्: v. Nectar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambulatory
AMBULATORY: चरिष्णु (Mfn.): v. Movable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ambuscade
AMBUSCADE, AMBUSH:<BR>I The place: पराभियो-<BR>गाय निभृतावस्थानम्।<BR>II The men: पराभियोगाय<BR> निभृतस्थापितसैन्यम्।<BR>to lie in a.:<BR>निभृतं तिष्ठति (स्था,<BR>c. 1)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ameliorate
AMELIORATE, AMELIORATION: v. To improve,<BR>improvement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amen
AMEN: ओ<BR>or<BR>आभ्। In non-ecclesiastical sense:<BR>तथास्तु; एवमस्तु।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=024" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amenable
AMENABLE:<BR>I Submissive, compliant: q. v.:<BR>अनुविधायिन् (f. नी).<BR>II Accountable to: Ph.<BR>a. to our government<BR>*अस्माकं शासनायत्ताः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amend
AMEND (v. i.): शुध्यति (शुध् c. 4): v. To mend,<BR>improve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amend
AMEND (v. t.): शोधयति (c. of शुध्): v. To<BR>correct, improve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amendment
AMENDMENT:<BR>I Correction, improvement:<BR>q. v.: शोधनम्।<BR>II A secondary resolution in<BR>a bill or motion: *शोधनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amends
AMENDS: v. Compensation, satisfaction. To<BR>make a.; v. To recompense, atone for<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amenity
AMENITY:<BR>(1) रम्यता;<BR>(2) मनोञ्जता: v. Agree-<BR>-ableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amerce
AMERCE: दण्डयति (दण्ड्, c. 10) (with double<BR>acc.): v. To fine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amercement
AMERCEMENT:<BR>(1) दण्डः;<BR>(2) अर्थदण्डः (=fine,<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amethyst
AMETHYST: आनीलः मणिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amiability
AMIABILITY: मनोञ्जता;<BR>(2) रमणीयता;<BR>(3) सुशी-<BR>लता, (good behaviour);<BR>(4) प्रियम्भावुकता<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amiable
AMIABLE:<BR>(1) सुशीलः (ला, लं) (=of good<BR>behaviour);<BR>(2) प्रेमार्ह्वः (र्हा, र्हं) (=deserving<BR>of affection);<BR>(3) रम्यः (म्या, म्यं)<BR>(=pleasant, agreeable)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amiably
AMIABLY: प्रीत्या: v. lovingly, affectionately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amicable
AMICABLE: मैत्रः (त्री, त्रं): v. Friendly, kind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amid
AMID, AMIDST:<BR>(1) मध्ये (with gen.),<BR>a. four<BR>fires<BR>हविर्भुजां चतुर्णां मध्ये, K. xiii. 41.;<BR>(2) by<BR>adj. s मध्यगतः (ता, तं), etc. Ku. v. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amiss
AMISS (adv.): expr. by the adj. s:<BR>(1) अयुक्तः<BR>(क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(2) सापराधः (धा, धं) etc.: v.<BR>Wrong.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amity
AMITY: मैत्री: v. Peace, friendship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ammonia
AMMONIA: निशादलः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ammoniac
AMMONIAC: निर्यासप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ammunition
AMMUNITION: युद्धोपकरणम्: (now=gunpowder,<BR>shot) q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amnesty
AMNESTY: क्षमा (=pardon, the meaning<BR>determined by the context).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

among
AMONG:<BR>I Amidst: q. v.: मध्ये (with gen.).<BR>II Making part of a number of:<BR>(1) मध्ये<BR>(with gen.),<BR>a. his very many sons<BR>अतिप्रभूतानां<BR> सुतानां मध्ये, K. ;<BR>(2) by loc.,<BR>Rambhā a. women<BR>and Rāma a. kings<BR>नारीषु रम्भा नृपतिषु रामः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amorous
AMOROUS:<BR>I Prone to love:<BR>(1) कामिन् (f.<BR>र्ना);<BR>(2) कामुकः (का, कं);<BR>(3) प्रेमशीलः (ला,<BR> लं).<BR>II In love: v. Enamoured.<BR>III Per-<BR>-taining to love: काम- (in comp.): v. Ama-<BR>-tory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amorously
AMOROUSLY:<BR>(1) सानुरागम्: v. Affectiona-<BR>-tely;<BR>(2) सकामम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amount
AMOUNT (subs): v. Sum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amount
AMOUNT (v. i.) Ph.<BR>a. ing to a lac<BR>लक्ष्यसंख्यकः (का,<BR> कं);<BR>these races together a. to fourteen<BR>एतान्येकत्र<BR> चतुर्दशकुलानि, K.;<BR>ascertain what the balance a. s<BR>to<BR>*कियदवशिष्टमिति परिज्ञायताम्;<BR>your argument a. s<BR>to this<BR>*एतदभिप्रायकस्ते तर्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amour
AMOUR: प्रणयः (=love),<BR>secret a.<BR>गुप्तप्रणयः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amphibious
AMPHIBIOUS: भूजलचरः (रा, रं) (?); पादिन् (f.<BR>नी). Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amphitheatre
AMPHITHEATRE:<BR>(1) रङ्गः;<BR>(2) रङ्गभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ample
AMPLE:<BR>I Specious: q. v.: विशालः (ला, लं)<BR>II Abundant, copious: q. v. प्रचुरः (रा, रं).<BR>III Not brief: विस्तृतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ampleness
AMPLENESS:<BR>I Spaciousness: q. v.: विशालता।<BR>II Abundance: q. v.: प्राचुर्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amplification
AMPLIFICATION:<BR>I Enlargement: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Of speech: विस्तरः<BR>or<BR>विस्तारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amplify
AMPLIFY: विस्तरतः<BR>or<BR>विस्तारेण वर्णयति, उप-, (वर्ण्,<BR>c. 1): v. To enlarge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amplitude i
AMPLITUDE I. Extent: q. v.: विस्तारः।<BR>II<BR>Greatness: q. v.: महत्त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amply
AMPLY: प्रचुरम्: v. Abundantly, sufficiently,<BR>fully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amputate
AMPUTATE: छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7): v. To cut<BR>off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amputation
AMPUTATION: अङ्गच्छेदः or sim. छेदः (when the<BR>meaning is clear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amulet
AMULET:<BR>(1) रक्षाकाण्डः; Sa. vii.;<BR>(2) कवच<BR>(mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amuse
AMUSE:<BR>I To entertain the mind agreeably:<BR>(1) वि-नोदयति (c. of नुद्), how shall I a. myself<BR>केनेदानीमात्मानं विनोदयामि, V. ii.;<BR>(2) रञ्जयति<BR>(c. of रञ्ज्), the prince was very much a. ed by [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">Page026</a>]<BR>his long description of his past valour, beauty and<BR>fortune<BR>अतीतस्वशौर्यरूपविभववर्णनावाचालेन तेन सुत-<BR>रामरज्यत राजपुत्रः, K.<BR>II. To delude: q. v.:<BR>छलयति (nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=025" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amused
AMUSED, BE:<BR>(1) रज्यते;<BR>(2) विनुद्यते (pass).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amusement
AMUSEMENT:<BR>(1) विनोदः;<BR>(2) विनोदनम्: v.<BR>Diversion, entertainment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pastime
PASTIME. To afford a.:<BR>(1) रञ्जयति<BR>(2) प्रीणयति<BR>(c. of प्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amuser
AMUSER: विनोदयितृ (m.): v. To amuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

amusing
AMUSING (part. adj.): विनोदिन् (f. नी): v.<BR>Pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

an
AN: v. A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anabaptism
ANABAPTISM: *यौवनमज्जनवादित्वम्: v. Ana-<BR>-baptist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anabaptist
ANABAPTIST: *यौवनमज्जनवादिन् (m.) कृष्टधर्मानु<BR> यायिंनां मध्ये ये यौवने जलमज्जनोत्सवमनुशासति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anachronism
ANACHRONISM: कालगणनाभ्रमः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anagram
ANAGRAM: *अक्षरविपर्यासः; शब्दस्याक्षराणां भिन्नसमा-<BR>वेशेनान्यशब्दकल्पनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analogical
ANALOGICAL: Ph.<BR>a. argument<BR>उपमानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analogically
ANALOGICALLY: सादृश्यात्; सादृश्यतस्; तुल्यरूप-<BR>तया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analogous
ANALOGOUS:<BR>(1) सदृशः (शा, शं);<BR>(2) तुल्यः<BR>(ल्या, ल्यं);<BR>(3) तुल्यरूपः (पा, पं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analogy
ANALOGY: सादृश्यम्: v. Resemblance, simila-<BR>-rity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analysis
ANALYSIS:<BR>I Philo. t. t.: no equiv.: *विश्लेषः।<BR>II Synopsis: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analytic
ANALYTIC, ANALYTICAL: *विश्लेषकः (f. षिका,<BR>n. पकं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

analyze
ANALYZE (v. t.): *वि-श्लेषयति (c. of शिलष्);<BR>विश्लेष्य परीक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anarchical
ANARCHICAL (adj.):<BR>(1) अराजकः (का, कं)<BR>(without a king);<BR>(2) विप्लुतः (ता, तं)<BR>( =turbulent);<BR>(3) *विप्लवकारिन् (f. णी) (=anar-<BR>-chist).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=026" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

anarchist
