angle
ANGLE (subs): (I) कोणः;<BR>(2) अस्नः। Right a.<BR>समकोणः;<BR>obtuse a.<BR>*विषमकोणः;<BR>acute a.<BR>समोन-<BR>कोणः, सूक्ष्मकोणः;<BR>alternate a.<BR>विपर्यस्तकोणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=027" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

angle
ANGLE (v).:<BR>(1) Perh. वडिशयति (nomi.);<BR>(2)<BR>वडिशेन मत्स्यान् विध्यति (व्यध्, c. 4.),<BR>or<BR>गृह्वाति<BR>(ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=027" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

angler
