animal
ANIMAL (adj.): Expr. by gen. of above:<BR>Ph.<BR>a. food<BR>आमिषम्: v. Or meat; a. pleasures<BR>विषयाः<BR>or<BR>विषयसुखानि (pl.):<BR>a. passions<BR>इन्द्रियाणि<BR>(n. pl.) (lit. organs of sense),<BR>or,<BR>कामादयः<BR> षड्रिपवः;<BR>the a. kingdom<BR>*जीवसृष्टिः, निखिलप्राणिवर्गः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=028" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

