animate
ANIMATE: (v. t.):<BR>I To give life to:<BR>(1)<BR>जीवयति (c. of जीव्);<BR>(2) जीवं सञ्चारयति (c. of<BR>चर्), P.<BR>II. FIG.: To encourage, incite q. v.:<BR>(1) आश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्);<BR>(2) प्रोत्साहयति<BR>(c. of सह्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=028" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

animate
