aspect
ASPECT:<BR>I Vision, glance: q. v. दृष्टिः।<BR>II<BR>Countenance, mien: q. v. आकारः।<BR>III<BR>Position: Ph. the house has a southern a.<BR>*दक्षिणमुखं गृहं।<BR>IV State of affairs:<BR>(1)<BR>अवस्था;<BR>(2) दशा। V. Of planets at birth:<BR>दशा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

