aspirate
ASPIRATE (subs.):<BR>I An aspirated sound:<BR>महाप्राणः (णा, णं)<BR>or<BR>महाप्राणवर्णः।<BR>II The mark,<BR>महाप्राणसूचकं चिह्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aspirate
