aspiration
ASPIRATION:<BR>(1) आकाङ्क्षा;<BR>(2) स्पृहा;<BR>(3) लालसा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aspire
ASPIRE:<BR>(1) आ-आङ्क्षति, अभि-, (काङ्क्ष्, c. 1.);<BR>(2) ईप्सति (desi. of आप);<BR>(3) स्पृहयति (स्पृह्,<BR>c. 10);<BR>(4) प्रार्थयते (अर्थ्, c. 10). R. i. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

aspiring after
ASPIRING AFTER (as adj.); v. Aspirant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asquint
ASQUINT:<BR>(1) साचि;<BR>(2) तिर्यक्;<BR>(3) वक्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ass
ASS:<BR>(1) गर्दभः;<BR>(2) रासभः;<BR>(3) खरः;<BR>(4)<BR>चक्रीवान्। Fig.: a stupid person: गर्दभः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

