ASSAIL: अभि-क्राभति, आ-, (क्रम्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assailable
ASSAILABLE: आक्रमणीयः (या, यं). Any a. point<BR>(1) रन्ध्रम्;<BR>(2) छिद्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=042" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assailant
ASSAILANT:<BR>(1) अभियोक्ता;<BR>(2) आक्रामकः;<BR>(3)<BR>अमिक्रामकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assassin
ASSASSIN:<BR>(1) घातकः;<BR>(2) चण्डालः<BR>or<BR>मातङ्गः (the<BR>a. class under the Hindoo Kings.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assassinate
ASSASSINATE:<BR>(1) घातयति (c. of हन्),<BR>or<BR>मारयति<BR>(c. of मृ),<BR>or<BR>वधं<BR>or<BR>हत्यां करोति (with gen.)<BR>(=to kill, murder);<BR>(2) उपांशु<BR>or<BR>निभृतं or<BR>गोपनेन वधं करोति etc. (=to kill by secret<BR>assault);<BR>(3) अवस्कन्द्य वधं करोति<BR>or<BR>घातयति<BR>(=to kill by surprise).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assassination
ASSASSINATION:<BR>(1) वधः (=murder, q. v.);<BR>(2) उपांशु-वधः (=murder by secret assault),<BR>Mu. ii.;<BR>(3) *सावस्कन्दहत्या (=killing by<BR>surprise)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assault
ASSAULT (subs.): आक्रमणम्: v. Attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assault
ASSAULT (v. t.): आ-क्रामति (क्रम्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>attack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assaulter
ASSAULTER: v. Assailant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assay
ASSAY (subs.): परीक्षा।<BR>A. of coin:<BR>नाणकपरीक्षा,<BR>Mr. Stand for Mricchaktikans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assay
ASSAY (v.):<BR>I Trans: परीक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.).<BR>II<BR>Intrans: यतते (यत्, c. 1.): v. To endeavour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assayer
ASSAYER, ASSAY-MASTER:<BR>(1) धातुपरीक्षकः;<BR>(2)<BR>नाणकपरीक्षकः (of coins).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assemblage
ASSEMBLAGE:<BR>(1) समूहः;<BR>(2) सङ्घातः;<BR>(3) समाहारः;<BR>(4) समुच्चयः;<BR>(5) सन्निपातः;<BR>(6) समवायः;<BR>(7)<BR>समुदयः;<BR>(8) संहतिः;<BR>(9) त्रातः;<BR>(10) निकरः;<BR>(11) by a deriv.,<BR>an a. of Kshatriyas<BR>राजन्यकम्;<BR>an a. of peacocks<BR>मायूरम्;<BR>an a. of men<BR>जनता;<BR>an a. of horses<BR>अश्वीयम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assemble
ASSEMBLE (v. i.):<BR>(1) सं-गच्छति, समा-, (गम्, c. 1.)<BR>the towns-people a. d<BR>समागमन्नागरजनाः, D. ii.;<BR>(2) समा-एति, समभि-, (इ, c. 2.);<BR>(3) संमिलति<BR>(मिल्, c. 6.), M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assemble
ASSEMBLE (v. t.):<BR>(1) संगमयति (c. of गम्);<BR>(2)<BR>मेलयति, सं-, (c. of मिल्), M. n.;<BR>(3) समाहरति<BR>(हृ, c. 1.),<BR>who a. d the kings<BR>समाहृतराजलोकम्, R.<BR>v. 64;<BR>(4) सन्नि-पातयति (c. of पत्),<BR>a. ing the<BR>citizens<BR>सन्निपात्य पुरौकसः, R. xv. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assembly
ASSEMBLY:<BR>(1) सभा;<BR>(2) सदस् (n.);<BR>(3) समाजः;<BR>(4) समज्या;<BR>(5) संसद् (f.);<BR>(6) परिषद् (f.);<BR>(7)<BR>गोष्टी। A. room<BR>(1) सभागारम्;<BR>(2) सदोगृहम्;<BR>(3) इन्द्रकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assent
ASSENT (subs.):<BR>(1) सम्मतिः; to obtain your a.<BR>तव सम्मतिमधिगन्तुं N. ii. 48.;<BR>(2) स्वीकारः<BR>(=acceptance: q. v.);<BR>(3) अनुमतिः (=per-<BR>-mission, a. of a superior).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assent
ASSENT (v. i.):<BR>(1) सम्मतः (ता, तं) भवति (भू, c. 1.);<BR>(2) अभ्युपैति (इ, c. 2.)<BR>or<BR>अभ्युपगच्छति (गम्, c. 1.)<BR>(with acc.)<BR>he is sure to a. to this also<BR>तदप्य-<BR>वश्यमसावभ्युपेष्यति D. ii.;<BR>(4) स्वीकरोति (=to<BR>accept: q. v.);<BR>(4) अनु-मन्यते (मन्, c. 4.) (rare<BR>in this sense), I a. ed to my father's proposal,<BR>तातस्य मतमन्वमंसि, D. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assentation
ASSENTATION: अनुमोदनम्: v. Compliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assentingly
ASSENTINGLY: Ph.:<BR>raised his hand a.<BR>*सम्मति-<BR>सूचकं स्वहस्तोत्तोलनं चकार।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assert
ASSERT: To affirm positively:<BR>(1) प्रति-जानीते<BR>(ज्ञा, c. 9.),<BR>if he were to a. that the duties of<BR>castes and religious orders were as unsettled in<BR>former times as at present<BR>इदानीमिव च कालान्तरेप्य-<BR>व्यवस्थितप्रायान् वर्णाश्रमधर्मान् प्रतिजानीत, S. iii. 33.;<BR>(2) ब्रवीति (ब्रू, c. 2.), वदति (वद्, c. 1.),<BR>or<BR>वक्ति<BR>(वच्, c. 2.) (=to say, but used in the sense<BR>of a. ing), S.;<BR>(3) प्रतिपादयति (c. of पद्)<BR>(=to establish),<BR>which a. that its nature is<BR>not earthly and deny that its nature is earthly,<BR>असंसारिस्वरूपप्रतिपादनाः संसारिस्वरूपप्रतिषेधनाश्च, S.<BR>iii. 43.<BR>II To maintain, claim, vindicate:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assertion
ASSERTION:<BR>I A positive statement:<BR>(1)<BR>वचनम्;<BR>(2) वादः;<BR>(3) उक्तिः।<BR>II Main-<BR>-tenance, vindication, claim: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assertor
ASSERTOR:<BR>I One who asserts: वादिन् (f. नी).<BR>II A maintainer: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assess
ASSESS:<BR>I To tax: करं निरूपयति (रूप्, c. 10.) or<BR>अवधारयति<BR>or<BR>निर्धारयति (धृ, c. 1.).<BR>II To value:<BR>q. v. Ph.<BR>to a. damages<BR>क्षतिं निरूपयति<BR>or<BR>निर्धारयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assessment
ASSESSMENT:<BR>I A valuation: *करनिरूपणम् or<BR>निर्धारणम्।<BR>II A tax: q. v.: करः।<BR>III Of<BR>damages: *क्षतिनिरूपणम्<BR>or<BR>-निर्धारणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assessor
ASSESSOR:<BR>I Of tax: *करनिर्धारकः।<BR>II Of a<BR>judge: सहायः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assets
ASSETS: सम्पत्तिः (property).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asseverate
ASSEVERATE: प्रति-जानीते (ञ्जा, c. 9.): To affirm,<BR>assert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=043" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asseveration
ASSEVERATION: प्रतिञ्जा: v. Affirmation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assiduity
ASSIDUITY:<BR>(1) अध्यवसायः;<BR>(2) उद्योगः;<BR>(3)<BR>अभियोगः: v. Diligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assiduous
ASSIDUOUS:<BR>(1) अध्यवसायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) उद्योगिन्<BR>(f. नी);<BR>(3) अभियोगवत् (f. ती): v. Diligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assiduously
ASSIDUOUSLY: v. Diligently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assign
ASSIGN:<BR>I To appoint, allot:<BR>(1) दिशति,<BR> निर्दिशति (दिश्, c. 6.);<BR>(2) कल्पयति, उप-, प्र-,<BR>(कॢप्, c. 10.)<BR>and should a. lands for his main-<BR>tenance<BR>भूम्यन्तरञ्च तद्वृत्त्यर्थमुपकल्पयेत्, K. b.<BR>II<BR>To allege: q. v.: निर्दिशति।<BR>III To trans-<BR>-fer property: समर्पयति (c. of ऋ): v. To<BR>bequeath.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assignation
ASSIGNATION:<BR>I Assignment: q. v.<BR>II An<BR>engagement: सङ्केतः। A lady going to an a.<BR>अभिसारिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assignee
ASSIGNEE: यस्मै सम्पत्तिः समर्प्यते सः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assignment
ASSIGNMENT:<BR>(1) दानम्;<BR>(2) समर्पणम्: v. To<BR>assign, allotment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assimilate
ASSIMILATE:<BR>I To make like: सदृशीकरोति:<BR>v. Like.<BR>II To convert into blood: v.<BR>To digest.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assimilation
ASSIMILATION:<BR>I A making like: सदृशीकरणम्।<BR>II Of food: पाकः: v. Digestion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assist
ASSIST:<BR>(1) साहाय्यं<BR>or<BR>साहाय्यकं<BR>or<BR>साहायकं करोति<BR>(with gen.),<BR>Sir, a. me in trouble<BR>क्लिष्टस्य मे<BR> क्रियतामर्थसाहाय्यकम्, D. viii;<BR>(2) उपकरोति।<BR>(=do good in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assistance
ASSISTANCE:<BR>(1) साहाय्यम्;<BR>(2) साहायकम्;<BR>(3)<BR>साहाय्यकम्;<BR>(4) उपकारः (=good in general).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assistant
ASSISTANT, ASSISTER:<BR>(1) सहायः;<BR>(2) साहाय्य-<BR>कारी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assize
ASSIZE:<BR>I A court of justice: विचारसभा (?).<BR>II Fixing the price of commodities: अर्थ-<BR>संस्थापनम्,<BR>the a. rate<BR>संस्थापितमूल्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

associate
ASSOCIATE (v. t.):<BR>(1) सं-योजयति<BR>or<BR>युनक्ति (युज्<BR>c. 10 and 7.);<BR>(2) सङ्गमयति (c. of गम्);<BR>(3)<BR>संश्लेषयति (c. of श्लिष्);<BR>(4) सम्बन्धयति (c. of<BR>बन्ध्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

associate
ASSOCIATE, WITH: संसर्गं करोति<BR>or<BR>व्रजति or<BR>संसृजति (सृज्, c. 8.) (rare) (with ins. or ins.<BR>and सह): Ph. leave off a. ing with bad men<BR>असत्सङ्गं परिहर;<BR>a. ion with lewd women<BR>संसर्गः सह<BR>पुंश्चलीमिः;<BR>by a. ing with inferior men<BR>हीनैः सह<BR> समागमात्;<BR>a. ing with the fallen<BR>पतितेन<BR> सहाचरन्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

associate
ASSOCIATE (subs.):<BR>I A friend, companion :<BR>q. v.: वयस्यः (स्या, स्यं)<BR>II A partner, con-<BR>-federate: q. v.: सङ्गिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

associate
ASSOCIATE (adj.): Ph.<BR>a. judge<BR>*विचारपतेः<BR> सहकारी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

association
ASSOCIATION:<BR>I Between men: संसर्गः।<BR>II A<BR>company, society: q. v.<BR>(1) सभा;<BR>(2) समाजः।<BR>III Connection: q. v:<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assonance
ASSONANCE: v. Harmony, rhyme.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assort
ASSORT (v.):<BR>I Trans.: v. To arrange,<BR>classify.<BR>II Intrans.: v. To suit, fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assortment
ASSORTMENT: विन्यासः: v. Arrangement,<BR>classification.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assuage
ASSUAGE: शमयति (c. of शम्): v. To alleviate,<BR>appease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assuagement
ASSUAGEMENT: प्रशमनम्: v. Alleviation, miti-<BR>-gation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assume
ASSUME:<BR>I To take:<BR>(1) गृह्णाति,<BR>she a. d this<BR>red dress<BR>काषाये गृहीते, Mal.;<BR>(2) धारयति or<BR>ध्रियते (धृ, c. 10. and 6.)<BR>you who a. d the form<BR>of the dwarf<BR>धृतवामनरूप, Gi. i. 9.;<BR>(3) बिभ्रति<BR>(भृ, c. 3.), Si. xiv. 86.<BR>II To arrogate:<BR>q. v.<BR>III To take for granted: प्रमितः (ता,<BR> तं)<BR>or<BR>सिद्धः (द्धा, द्धं) मन्यते (मन्, c. 4.): v. To<BR>suppose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assuming
ASSUMING (adj.):<BR>(1) अहङ्कारिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2)<BR>अवलिप्तः (प्ता, प्तं): v. Haughty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assumption
ASSUMPTION:<BR>I The act of taking:<BR>(1) ग्रहणम्;<BR>(2) धारणम्।<BR>II Arrogation: q. v.<BR>III A<BR>taking for granted: Ph.<BR>on the a. that the<BR>earth is fixed, you...<BR>पृथिवीं स्थिराम्मन्यमानस्त्वं:<BR>v. Supposition.<BR>IV The thing supposed:<BR>कल्पना।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assurance
ASSURANCE:<BR>I The act of assuring: v. To<BR>assure, affirmation.<BR>II Confidence: q. v.<BR>III Intrepidity: q. v.<BR>IV Impudence: q. v.<BR>v. Insurance: q. v. प्रागल्भ्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assure
ASSURE:<BR>I To make sure:<BR>(1) प्रत्याययति (c.<BR>of इ) (?);<BR>(2) विश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्) (?).<BR>II<BR>To confirm: q. v.<BR>III To insure: q. v. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=045" target="_blank">Page045</a>]<BR>Ph.;<BR>I feel a. d that he is alive<BR>*स जीवतीति-<BR>निश्चितं मे प्रतिभाति or sim. नूनं स जीवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=044" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assured
ASSURED (adj.):<BR>(1) निशिचतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>असन्दिग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं): v. Certain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

assuredly
ASSUREDLY:<BR>(1) निश्चितम्;<BR>(2) नृनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>असंशयम्: v. Certainly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

asterisk
