at
AT:<BR>I Of place: by loc.: who is at the door<BR>कोऽयं द्वारि तिष्ठति, Mu. ii.<BR>II Of time: by<BR>loc.:<BR>at midnight<BR>अर्द्धरात्रे।<BR>III Of price: by<BR>ins.: at what price have you bought this book<BR>कियता मूल्येनैतत् पुस्तकं गृहीतम्, P. ii. 4.<BR>IV Denot-<BR>-ing reason, occasion etc.: by ins.:<BR>at<BR>Rāma's command<BR>रामाज्ञया, R.: v. By, on. Ph.:<BR>at all<BR>मनागपि;<BR>at present<BR>अधुना;<BR>at first<BR>प्रथमम्;<BR>at least<BR>अन्ततस्;<BR>they are all at play<BR>सर्वे क्रीडन्ति;<BR>while the French and the Germans were at war<BR>*युध्यमानयोः फरासिजर्मानजात्योः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=045" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

