ATROCIOUS:<BR>(1) बीभत्सः (त्सा, त्सं),<BR>you great<BR>sinner, doer of impure, disgustful, a. deeds<BR>महापातकिन्, अशिष्टविकृतचेष्ट, बीमत्सकर्मन्। Vi. iii.<BR>v. Loathsome;<BR>(2) विकृतः (ता, तं) v. Dis-<BR>-gustful;<BR>(3) पापिष्ठः (ष्ठा, ष्ठं). v. Sinful;<BR>(4)<BR>नृशंसः (सा, सं). v. Cruel, Ph.<BR>a. crime<BR>घोरपातकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=046" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

