banker
BANKER:<BR>(1) श्रेष्ठिन् (m.) (?);<BR>(2) *धनागारपतिः;<BR>(3) कुसीदः; वार्द्धुषिकः (money-lender).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banking
BANKING:<BR>(1) व्यवहारः P. i.;<BR>(2) अर्थव्यवहारः;<BR>(3) अर्थप्रयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bank-note
BANK-NOTE: *धनागारपत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bankrupt
BANKRUPT (subs.): परिक्षीणो वणिक् (after M.);<BR>ऋणशोघनाक्षमो वणिक् (?)<BR>A fraudulent b.<BR>*प्रकाश-<BR>परिक्षीणः; उत्तमर्णप्रवञ्चनाय यो गतविभवतां प्रकाशयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bankruptcy
BANKRUPTCY: परिक्षीणता (?); ऋणशोघनाशक्तिः (?):<BR>गतविभावता (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banner
BANNER:<BR>(1) ध्वजः;<BR>(2) पताका;<BR>(3) केतुः;<BR>(4) वैजयन्ती;<BR>(5) केतनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banneret
