BANNOCK: पिष्टकविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
BANQUET (subs.): सम्भोजनम् (?); विशिष्टभोजनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
BANQUET (v. t.):<BR>(1) सम्-भोजयति (c. of भुज्);<BR>(2) भोजनविशेषैः सम्-तोषयति (c. of तुष्), H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banquet
BANQUET (v. i.):<BR>(1) भुंक्ते (भुज्, c. (?));<BR>(2)<BR>अभ्यव-हरति (हृ, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banter
BANTER (v. t.): परि-हसति (हस्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>joke, mock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banter
BANTER (subs.): परिहासः; v. Joke, jesting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

banterer
BANTERER:<BR>(1) परिहासवेदिन् (m.);<BR>(2) परिहासवेत्तृ<BR>(m.); v. Jester.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=055" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bantling
BANTLING:<BR>(1) डिम्भः;<BR>(2) अर्भकः; v. Infant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptism
BAPTISM: *अभिषेकः,<BR>a certificate of b.<BR>*अभिषेक-<BR>निदर्शनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptismal
BAPTISMAL: expr. by tat. comp, by font<BR>*अभिषेककुण्डम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=056" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

baptist
