bastard
BASTARD:<BR>(1) जारजः (जा, जं) (=child of a<BR>woman by her gallant);<BR>(2) कानीनः (ना,<BR>नं) (child of an unmarried woman);<BR>(3) कौलटेयः (यी, यं)<BR>or<BR>कौलटेरः (री, रं) =<BR>(child of a lewd woman);<BR>(4) कुण्डः (a b.<BR>son born when the husband is alive);<BR>(5)<BR>गोलकः (a b. son born after the death of the<BR>husband);<BR>(6) विजन्मन् (mfn.) (not born<BR>in lawful wedlock).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bastardy
