baste
BASTE (v. t.):<BR>I To beat with a stick:<BR>(1)<BR>यष्ट्याघातं करोति;<BR>(2) लगुडेन ताडयति (c. of तड्) :<BR>v. To beat.<BR>II To pour butter etc. over :<BR>सिञ्चति, नि-, (सिच् c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bastinade
BASTINADE (v. t.): *पादतले लगुडेन ताडयति (c. of<BR>तड्): v. To beat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bastinado
BASTINADO (subs.): *लगुडेन<BR>or<BR>यष्टिना पादतलताडनम्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

