batch
BATCH:<BR>I Of things:<BR>(1) गणः;<BR>(2) संघः :-<BR>II Of bread: *एककालपक्वः सन्धितापूपसंघः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

