BATHING (subs.):<BR>(1) स्नानम्;<BR>(2) अभिषेकः ;<BR>(3) मज्जनम्, निमज्जनम्;<BR>(4) अवगाहनम्;<BR>(4)<BR>आप्लावः v. To bathe.<BR>Relating to b.:<BR>स्नानीय<BR>(या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=058" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

