BATTERY:<BR>I Assault:<BR>(1) ताडनम्;<BR>(2) प्रहारः।<BR>II The act of battering<BR>(1) मर्दनम्;<BR>(2)<BR>विमर्दनम्;<BR>(3) मन्थनम्;<BR>(4) भञ्जनम्।<BR>III A line of<BR>cannon: *कामानचक्रम्।<BR>IV Galvanic b.:<BR>*प्रचलविदुज्जननी घटश्रेणी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

