BATTLE-DOOR: *कन्दुकताडनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

batlle-field
BATLLE-FIELD:<BR>(1) रणभूमिः;<BR>(2) रणाङ्गनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>युद्धभूमिः;<BR>(4) प्रधनक्षितिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

