BATTLEMENT: वप्रविशेषः; दन्तुरवृतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bauble
BAUBLE: *सुदृश्यमकिञ्चित्करद्रव्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bawd
BAWD:<BR>(1) कुट्टिनी;<BR>(2) शम्भली: v. Procuress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bawdry
BAWDRY: कुट्टिनीव्यवसायः and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bawdy
BAWDY: v. Obscene, filthy, unchaste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bawl
BAWL (v. i.):<BR>(1) उत्-क्रोशति (क्रुश्, c. 1);<BR>(2) उच्चैः शब्दायते (nomi.);<BR>(3) रसति (रस्, c. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bawling
BAWLING (subs.):<BR>(1) उत्क्रोशः;<BR>(2) विक्रोशः;<BR>(3) चित्कारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bay
BAY (adj.): पिङ्गः (ङ्गा, ङ्गं) (?). A b. horse:<BR>उकानहः (very rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bay
BAY (subs.):<BR>I An arm of the sea: *खातम्।<BR>II A Tree: वृक्षविशेषः।<BR>III In. pl., gar-<BR>-lands made of its branches: *जयमाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bay
BAY, AT: मुखामुखि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bay
BAY (v. i.):<BR>(1) बुक्कयति (बुक्क्, c. 10);<BR>(2)<BR>भषति (भष्, c. 1).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bayonet
BAYONET (subs.): निस्त्रिंशः may be used:<BR>Scimitar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=059" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

