biblical
BIBLICAL (adj.): expr. by comp., b. erudition<BR>*बाइबलपाण्डित्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=070" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

