BIER (subs.):<BR>(1) शवयानम्;<BR>(2) शववाहनम्;<BR>(3) कटः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=071" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

