BROOMSTICK: सम्मार्जनीदण्डः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

broth
BROTH:<BR>(1) मांसरसः (of meat), Śr.;<BR>(2) यूषः<BR>(of dal).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brothel
BROTHEL:<BR>(1) वेश्यालयः;<BR>(2) वेश्यागृहम्;<BR>(3)<BR>वेशः;<BR>(4) वेश्याजनसमाश्रयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brother
BROTHER:<BR>(1) भ्राता (a full or a step-b. and<BR>also used fig. like the English word);<BR>(2)<BR>सहोदरः<BR>or<BR>सोदरः<BR>or<BR>सोदर्यः<BR>or<BR>सगर्भः (=a full<BR>b.);<BR>elder b.:<BR>अग्रजः;<BR>younger b.<BR>अनुजः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brotherhood
BROTHERHOOD:<BR>I The state of being a<BR>brother: भ्रातृत्वम्।<BR>Proper b.<BR>सौभ्रात्रम् R. xvi.<BR>I.<BR>II. An association of men: v. Fraternity,<BR>society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brother-in-law
BROTHER-IN-LAW: () श्यालः (=wife's<BR>brother);<BR>(2) देवरः (=husband's younger<BR>brother);<BR>(3) भ्रातृश्वशुरः (=husband's elder<BR>brother);<BR>(4) भगिनीपतिः (sister's husband).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brotherly
BROTHERLY (adj.):<BR>I Pertaining to<BR>brothers:<BR>(1) भ्रात्रीयः (या, यं),<BR>(2) comp.<BR>with भ्रातृ, etc.<BR>II Becoming brothers:<BR>(1)<BR>भ्रातृसन्निभः (भा, भं);<BR>(2) भ्रातृरूपः (पा, पं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brotherly
BROTHERLY (adv.):<BR>(1) भ्रातृवत्;<BR>(2) भ्रातृ-<BR>सन्निभम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brow
BROW (subs.):<BR>I The eye b.:<BR>(1) भ्रूः,<BR>to<BR>knit the b. s<BR>भ्रूकुटिं बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.)<BR>or<BR>भ्रूभङ्गं<BR> करोति;<BR>(2) भ्रूलता।<BR>II The forehead: q. v.:<BR>ललाटम्।<BR>III Edge of a steep place: v. Edge,<BR>precipice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

browbeat
BROWBEAT: भ्रूकुटिं बध्वा<BR>or<BR>भ्रूभङ्गं कृत्वा भीषयते (c.<BR>of भी): Ph.<BR>b. ing me<BR>मय्येव भ्रूकुटीधरः संवृत्तः<BR>Vi.: v. To terrify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brown
BROWN (adj.):<BR>(1) कपिशः (शा, शं);<BR>(2) श्यावः<BR>(वा, वं);<BR>(3) पिशङ्गः (ङ्गी, ङ्गं);<BR>(4) पिङ्गलः<BR>(ला, लं): v. Tawny, dark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brown
BROWN (v. t.)<BR>I To make brown: कपिशयति<BR>(nomi.).<BR>II To brown (meat) in cooking:<BR>आरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं) करोति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

browse
