brunette
BRUNETTE:<BR>(1) श्यामा;<BR>(2) श्यामाङ्गी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brush
BRUSH (subs.):<BR>I Clothes -b.: *वस्त्रशोधनी।<BR>II Shoe -b. *पादुकासम्मार्जनी।<BR>III Painter's<BR>b.:<BR>(1) तूली, -लिका;<BR>(2) ईषिका;<BR>(3) शलाका;<BR>(4) कूर्च्चः;<BR>(5) वर्तिका।<BR>IV The brushy tail<BR>of a fox: बालधिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brush
BRUSH (vt.):<BR>I To take the dirt of:<BR>(1)<BR>मार्ष्टि (मृज्, c. 2.);<BR>(2) शोधयति (c. of शुध्)<BR>II To touch gently: घर्षति (घृष्, c. l.).<BR>III To b. off or away: निष्कासयति (c. of<BR>कस्): v. To remove.<BR>IV To b. up: v. To<BR>furnish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

