BRUSHWOOD:<BR>(1) शाखाग्राणि (n. pl.) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>इन्धनम् (=fuel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

