brutality
BRUTALITY:<BR>(1) नृशंसता<BR>(2) क्रौर्यम्: v. Cruelty,<BR>inhumanity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

