BRUTALIZE:<BR>(1) नृशंसीकरोति;<BR>(2) क्रूरीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brutally
BRUTALLY:<BR>(1) नृशंसम्;<BR>(2) क्रूरम्;<BR>(3) पशुवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brute
BRUTE (subs.):<BR>I A beast: q. v.: पशुः<BR>II<BR>A brutal man:<BR>(1) पशुः;<BR>(2) पिशाचः<BR>(=fiend). Ph.<BR>human b.<BR>नृपशुः; पुरुषपशुः,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brute
BRUTE (adj.):<BR>I Irrational: q. v.<BR>II Un-<BR>-civilised: q. v. Ph.<BR>by mere b. force<BR>*केवलं<BR> पशुसाधारणेन बलेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

brutish
BRUTISH, BRUTISHLY: v. Brutal, brutally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=091" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bryony
