BUNG (subs.): no equiv.: *मुखपिधानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bung
BUNG (v.): v. To stop, close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bung-hole
BUNG-HOLE: *मुखम्; मद्यभाण्डमुखम्: v. Hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bungle
BUNGLE (subs.):<BR>(1) प्रमादः;<BR>(2) स्खलितम्: v.<BR>Blunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bungle
BUNGLE (v.):<BR>I Intrans: v. To blunder.<BR>II Trans: v. To spoil, mar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bungling
BUNGLING (adj.): v. Unskilful, awkward,<BR>clumsy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bunglingly
BUNGLINGLY: v. Unskilfully, clumsily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bunting
BUNTING:<BR>I A bird: पक्षिविशेषः।<BR>II Stuff for<BR>flags: ध्वजनिर्माणोपयोगी पटविशेपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buoy
BUOY (subs.): नाविकेभ्यः सङ्कटस्थलप्रदर्शकं जलोपरि<BR> प्लवमानं चिह्रम्; *प्लवः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buoy up
BUOY UP (v. t.):<BR>I To keep afloat:<BR>(1) प्लावयति<BR>(c. of प्लु) (?);<BR>(2) उन्मज्जयति (c. of. मस्ज्)<BR>(?).<BR>II To support or sustain: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buoy up
BUOY UP (v. i.): Ph.<BR>merit will b. at last<BR>*न खलु<BR> गुणाः प्रच्छन्नास्तिष्ठन्ति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buoyancy
BUOYANCY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) प्लवनशीलता (?);<BR>(2)<BR>लघुता (=lightness).<BR>II Fig.: Cheerfulness,<BR>vivacity: q. v.: उल्लासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buoyant
BUOYANT:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) प्लवनशीलः (ला, लं) (?);<BR>(2) लघु (mfn.) (=light).<BR>II Fig.: Cheerful<BR>vivacious: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burbot
BURBOT: मत्स्यविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burden
BURDEN (v. t.):<BR>I Lit.: v. To load:<BR>II Fig.:<BR>To oppress: q. v.: पीडयति (पीड्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burden
BURDEN (subs.):<BR>I Load:<BR>(1) भारः, b. of state<BR>राज्यभारः, K.; what b. is great to the able<BR>कोऽतिभारः समर्थानाम्, H. iii.;<BR>(2) धुर् (f.),<BR>a beast<BR>of b.<BR>धुर्यः<BR>or<BR>धुरोणः;<BR>(3) भरः,<BR>all b. placed on a<BR>worthy minister<BR>योग्यसचिवे न्यस्तः समस्तो भारः। Ra.<BR>i. Ph.<BR>the b. of proof:<BR>प्रमाणभारः।<BR>II Taxes,<BR>pecuniary imposts: q. v.:<BR>unable to bear the<BR>b. s<BR>करभारासहाः, V. p.<BR>III The capacity of<BR>a ship: Ph.<BR>a boat of 100 maunds b.<BR>*शतमण-<BR>वाहिनी नौः।<BR>IV. B. of a song:<BR>(1) ध्रुवकम्;<BR>(2) अनुपदम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burdensome
BURDENSOME:<BR>(1) दुर्वहः<BR>or<BR>दुरुद्वहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2)<BR>दुर्भरः (रा, रं);<BR>(3) अतिभारिकः (का। कं) (Lit. and<BR>Fig.) Mu. vi.;<BR>(4) दुःसहः (हा, हं) (Fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burdock
BURDOCK: गुल्मभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bureau
BUREAU:<BR>I A desk: q. v.<BR>II A department:<BR>विभागः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=093" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burgess
BURGESS:<BR>I A burgher: q. v.<BR>II A repre-<BR>-sentative of a borough in Parliament: *नगर-<BR>प्रतिनिधिः or simp. प्रतिनिधिः (when the sense<BR>is clear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burgher
BURGHER:<BR>(1) *नागरः;<BR>(2) पौरः (=citizen).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burglar
BURGLAR:<BR>(1) सन्धिचौरः<BR>or<BR>सन्धिहारकः (a b.<BR>who enters by making a hole under the<BR>walls of a house);<BR>(2) कुड्यच्छेदिन् (m.) (by<BR>making a passage through a wall);<BR>(3)<BR>कपाटघ्नः (by breaking or opening a door):<BR>(4) खनिकः<BR>or<BR>खानिलः (rare) (=सन्धिचौरः);<BR>(5) कुजम्भ (म्भि) लः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burglarious
BURGLARIOUS: Ph.<BR>b. entry<BR>*जिहीर्षया<BR>or<BR>चुचोर-<BR>यिषया परगृहप्रवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burglary
BURGLARY: रात्रौ चौर्याद्यन्याय्यकर्मचिकीर्षया सन्धिं<BR> कृत्वा कुड्यं वा छित्वान्येन वा प्रकारेण परगृहप्रवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burial
BURIAL: निधानम्।<BR>B. ground:<BR>*निधानस्थली।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burin
BURIN: An engraver's tool: तक्षणी (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burlesque
BURLESQUE (adj.): हास्यकरः (री, रं)<BR>or<BR>हास्य-<BR>जनकः (का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burlesque
BURLESQUE (subs.): हास्यकरप्रबन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burlesque
BURLESQUE (v. t.): Ph.<BR>to b. my gait<BR>*उपहासार्थं<BR> मम गतिम् अनुकरोति (कृ, c. 8.): v. To imitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burly
BURLY: स्थूलः (ला, लं): v. Stout.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn
BURN (v. t.):<BR>(1) दहति (दह्, c. l.),<BR>I am b. ing<BR>Lankā in your presence<BR>तव प्रत्यक्षं लङ्का मया दह्यते,<BR>Ma. n. v.; but (it)<BR>is b. ing me<BR>मां पुनर्दहत्येव,<BR>Sa. iii.;<BR>b. t rice<BR>दग्धान्नम्,<BR>b. t wood<BR>दग्धकाष्ठम्;<BR>half b. t<BR>दग्धादग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं), D.;<BR>(2) प्लोषति<BR>(प्लुष्, c. l.) (rare),<BR>half b. t<BR>अर्धप्लुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं),<BR>Vi. vi. 4;<BR>(3) ज्वलयति (c. of ज्वल्) (to<BR>inflame), internal heat is b. ing my body<BR>ज्वलयति तनूमन्तर्दाहः, U. iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn
BURN (v. i.):<BR>I To be on fire, to blaze: q. v.<BR>ज्वलति (ज्वल्, c. l.),<BR>the light is b. ing<BR>ज्वलति<BR> प्रदीपः Mr. ii. To be inflamed with passion:<BR>(1) दह्यते (pass of दह्),<BR>my heart b. ing from<BR>contumely<BR>मम परिमवानलदह्यमानं चेतः, Ve. iii.;<BR>(2) तप्यते (pass. of तप्),<BR>who is b. ing with<BR>grief<BR>यः शोकेन तप्यते, U. iv.;<BR>(3) दीप्यते (दीप्,<BR>c. 4.) (of rage only), b. t with rage<BR>क्रुद्धोऽदीपि, B. Ph.<BR>my limbs are b. ing<BR>ज्वलन्ति<BR> मेऽङ्गानि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn down
BURN DOWN, BURN OUT (v. t.): दैति: v.<BR>To burn up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn out
BURN OUT (v. i.): शाम्यति (शम्, c. 4.): v. To<BR>go out, to be extinguished.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn up
BURN UP:<BR>(1) निर्-दहति (दह्, c. l.),<BR>as if b. ing<BR>up with his fiery look<BR>निर्दहन्निव दहनगर्भया दृशा, D.;<BR>(2) भस्मीकरोति (=reduce to ashes).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burn
BURN (subs.): दाहजं<BR>or<BR>दाहेन जनितं क्षतम् (hurt) or<BR>व्रणम् (wound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burner
BURNER:<BR>(1) दग्धा;<BR>(2) दाहकः B. (of a lamp):<BR>*दाहवर्धनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burning
BURNING (subs.):<BR>I Active: consuming<BR>with fire:<BR>(1) दाहः;<BR>(2) दहनम्;<BR>(3) प्लोषः<BR>(rare).<BR>II Passive: being on fire: ज्वलनम्<BR>(also of the b. of the face, etc.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burning
BURNING (adj.):<BR>I Active: expr. by a comp.<BR>with दाहः<BR>b. power<BR>दाहतक्तिः;<BR>b. fever,<BR>दाहज्वरः।<BR>II Passive: ज्वलत् (f. न्ती): v. Burn (v. i.)<BR>III Scorching, hot: q. v. Ph. b. scent:<BR>उग्रगन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burning-ground
BURNING-GROUND:<BR>(1) श्मशानम्;<BR>(2) शवसानम्<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burning glass
BURNING GLASS: *दाहककाचः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burnish
BURNISH (v. t.):<BR>(1) प्रमार्जयति (मृज्, c. 10.);<BR>(2) धावति (धाव्, c. l): v. To polish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burnish
BURNISH (subs.): v. Glass, lustre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burnt-offering
BURNT-OFFERING:<BR>(1) होमः (?);<BR>(2) वषट्कारः (?);<BR>(3) यागः (?): v. Sacrifice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burrow
BURROW (subs.):<BR>(1) विवरम्;<BR>(2) बिलम्;<BR>(3)<BR>गर्तः: v. Hole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burrow
BURROW (v. i):<BR>I Excavate a hole: विवरं or<BR>बिलं करोति (कृ, c. 8.).<BR>II To live in it: विवर<BR>or<BR>बिलं कृत्वा निवसति (वस्, c. l.).<BR>Any b. ing<BR>animal:<BR>बिलेशयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bursar
BURSAR:<BR>I A treasurer: q. v.<BR>II The holder<BR>of a bursary: *वृत्तिभुज् (mfn.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bursary
BURSARY:<BR>I A treasury: q. v.<BR>II A chari-<BR>-table foundation: *वृत्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burst
BURST (v. i.): स्फुटति (स्फुट्, c. 6.),<BR>my heart i<BR>b. ing<BR>स्फुटति हृदयम्, U. iii.;<BR>(2) विदलति (दल्<BR>c. l.) (=split), M. n.;<BR>(3) विशीर्यते (pass<BR>of शॄ) (=to split),<BR>a b. ing rock<BR>विशीर्यभानाश्म।<BR>Ki. xvi. 51.;<BR>(4) दीर्यते, वि-, (pass. of दॄ [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">Page095</a>]<BR>(to rend),<BR>my heart b.<BR>ममादीर्यत हृदयम्,<BR>to b.<BR>into tears<BR>रोदितुमारभते (रभ्, c. l.), K.;<BR>to b.<BR>with laughter or b. out laughing<BR>प्रहसितुम् आरभते;<BR>to b. forth (Lit.): निष्क्रामति (क्रम्, c. l.) or<BR>निर्गच्छति (गम्, c. l.); to b. forth (=to break<BR>out): उद्भिनत्ति (भिद् c. l.);<BR>tears b.<BR>forth<BR>अश्रुधारा प्रावर्तत (वृत् c. l.)<BR>or<BR>अश्रूणि निरगच्छन्;<BR>to b. open: v. To break open. To b. upon:<BR>आक्रामति (=to attack).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=094" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burst
BURST (v. t.):<BR>(1) स्फोटयति (c. of स्फुट्);<BR>(2)<BR>त्रोटयति (c. of त्रुट्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

burst
BURST (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: स्फोटनम्<BR>or<BR>स्फुटनम्।<BR>II<BR>Fig.: expr. by verb.:<BR>there was a b. of<BR>applause<BR>उदतिष्ठन् प्रशंसावाचः;<BR>b. of thunder<BR>स्फूर्ज-<BR>थुस्फूर्जितम्, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bury
BURY:<BR>I To inter a corpse:<BR>(1) नि-खनति<BR>(खन्, c. l.), b. d (him)<BR>in the ground<BR>वसुधायां<BR> निचछनतुः, R. xii. 30.;<BR>(3) नि-दधाति<BR>or<BR>धत्ते<BR>(धा, c. 3.) (=to place),<BR>bodies of mendicants<BR>should be b. d in holes<BR>भिक्षोः कलेवरं बिले निदध्यात्,<BR>M. n.<BR>II To conceal: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bush
BUSH:<BR>(1) गुल्मः;<BR>(2) क्षुपः;<BR>(3) छुपः;<BR>(4) भुण्टः;<BR>(5) गहनम् (=thicket). Ph.<BR>a bird in the hand<BR>is worth two in the b.:<BR>अध्रुवाद् ध्रुवं वरम् (?) (see<BR>H. i.); you are beating the b. for nothing:<BR>निरर्थकमिदमालोडयसि (?); hide yourself in the b.<BR>विटपान्तरितो भव, Sa. iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bushel
BUSHEL: मानविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bushy
BUSHY:<BR>I Full of bushes: गुल्मावृतः (ता, तं):<BR>Thick like a bush:<BR>(1) निविडः (डा, डं);<BR>(2) अविरलः (ला, लं). Ph.<BR>b. tail:<BR>दीर्धबालबालधिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

busily
BUSILY गाढम् (=deeply), engaged गाढं व्यापृतः<BR>(ता, तं): Industriously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

business
BUSINESS:<BR>I Occupation, profession: q. v.:<BR>(1) व्यवसायः;<BR>(2) कर्मन् (n.), Sa. v. Ph.:<BR>b.<BR>of a messenger<BR>दूत्यम्;<BR>b. of a barber<BR>नापित्यम्:<BR>II Mercantile transactions: व्यवहारः, P.<BR>III. Any affair, transaction:<BR>(1) कर्मन् (n.),<BR>a man of b.<BR>कर्मठः;<BR>(2) कार्यम्, a man of b.<BR>कार्यज्ञः:<BR>b. time<BR>कार्यकालः;<BR>(3) व्यापारः,<BR>this is<BR>your b.<BR>भवतस्तावदयं व्यापारः, H. iii.;<BR>(4) नियोगः:<BR>v. Employment.<BR>III Right of acting: Ph.<BR>what b. has he to send for you<BR>*त्वामाकारयितुं तस्य<BR>कोऽधिकारः।<BR>IV Concern: q. v.: Ph.<BR>what b.<BR>is it of yours,<BR>किन्ते प्रयोजनमनेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buskin
BUSKIN: पादुकाविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buss
BUSS: चुम्बनम्: v. Kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bust
BUST:<BR>I The trunk of body:<BR>(1) शरीरपूर्वभागः;<BR>(2) पूर्वार्धम्। R. ii. A statue representing the<BR>b.: पूर्वार्धप्रतिमा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bustard
BUSTARD: बृहत्पक्षिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bustle
BUSTLE (subs.):<BR>(1) सम्भ्रमः;<BR>(2) क्षोभः<BR>(=agitation: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bustle
BUSTLE (v. i): प्रधावति (धाव्, c. l.)(=to run):<BR>v. To be agitated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

busy
BUSY (adj.): व्यापृतः (ता, तं) (=employed:<BR>only of persons): v. Active, industrious.<BR>Ph.<BR>to-day is a b. day<BR>अद्य बहूनि कार्याणि कर्तव्यानि<BR>or<BR>द्रष्टव्यानि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

busy
BUSY: (v.): v. To occupy, attend to,<BR>employ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

busybody
BUSYBODY: यः पराधिकारचर्चां करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

but
BUT (subs. and v.): v. Butt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

but
BUT:<BR>I Except: अन्यः (न्या, न्यं) (with abl.),<BR>this is the doing of none b. Aghoraghanta<BR>नाधोर-<BR>धण्टादन्यस्य कर्मैतत्॥।, Ma. v. Ph.<BR>his life was<BR>nothing else b. a tissue of atrocious deeds<BR>*बीभत्स-<BR>कर्मसन्ततिरेव तस्य जीवितमासीत्;<BR>b. for the king,<BR>which of your younger brothers would forgive<BR>राजा नचेन्निषेद्धा स्यात् कः क्षमेत तवानुजः, Ve. i.;<BR>all<BR>b. finished<BR>सम्पूर्णप्रायः (या, यं),<BR>in the last page<BR>b. one,<BR>*उपान्त्यपृष्ठायाम्; b. by going to London,<BR>*लण्डनमगत्वा।<BR>II Only: q. v.: Ph.<BR>b. for a<BR>moment<BR>क्षणमात्रम्। R.<BR>III. Denoting contrast<BR>or opposition:<BR>(1) तु (never at the beginn-<BR>-ing of a clause),<BR>deep anxiety grinds my heart,<BR>b. it does not burst into two parts<BR>दलति हृदयं<BR> गाढोद्वेगो द्विधा न तु भिद्यते, U. iii.;<BR>(2) तु is often<BR>omitted^1,<BR>by sweet, b. false words<BR>मधुराभिरनृ-<BR>तवाग्भिः, Sa. v.; of what avail is (a servant)<BR>loyal, b. unwise and timid<BR>अप्राज्ञेन च कातरेण च गुणः<BR> स्यात् सानुरागेण कः, Mu. i.;<BR>internal heat is<BR>burning my body, b. does not reduce it to ashes<BR>ज्वलयति तनुमन्तर्दाहः करोति न भस्मसात्, U. iii.;<BR>(3) किन्तु<BR>or<BR>परन्तु (at the beginning) your<BR>union is easy. B. the report is, she said... [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">Page096</a>]<BR>समागमो वामयत्नसाध्यः किन्तु सा किल समगिरत्॥।<BR>D. ii.;<BR>(4) पुनः, it is like it, b. not the same<BR>सदृश एषः । न पुनः सः, Mr. Ph. (a) b. also:<BR>(1)<BR>अपि (indecl.):<BR>not only he who speaks ill of<BR>the great, b. also he who hears is a participator<BR>of the sin<BR>न केवलं यो महतोऽपभाषते शृणोति तस्मादपियः<BR> सपापभाक्, Ku. v. 83.;<BR>(2) अपितु (rare), U. ii.;<BR>(3) किन्तु (rare), not only to bring, b. also<BR>to bend (the bow) न केवलमानयनाय किन्त्वानमनाय,<BR>Pr.;<BR>(4) b. yet तथापि,<BR>surely this is so, b. yet<BR>seeing the action of some foolish men<BR>वाढमेवं तथापि<BR> प्रवृत्तान्युपलभ्य केषाञ्चिन्मन्दमतीनाम्, S.<BR>IV. Equiv.<BR>to that... not: Ph. there is none b. fears him<BR>न कोऽपि यस्तस्मान्न बिभेति:<BR>there is not a day b. he<BR>comes to my house<BR>*नैकोऽपि दिवसो गच्छति यदा स<BR> मम गृहं नागच्छति।<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=095" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butcher
BUTCHER (subs.):<BR>(1) सौनिकः<BR>or<BR>शौनिकः;<BR>(2)<BR>मांसिकः;<BR>(3) मांसविक्रयी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butcher
BUTCHER (v. t.):<BR>(1) हन्ति (हन्, c. 2.): v. To<BR>slay, kill;<BR>(2) विशसति (शस्, c. l.);<BR>(3)<BR>संज्ञपयति (c. of ज्ञा):<BR>(4) निर्वपति (वप् c. l.);<BR>(5) निसूदयति (सूद्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butchers broom
BUTCHER'S BROOM: सौनिकमार्जनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butchery
BUTCHERY<BR>(1) वधः;<BR>(2) विशसनम्: v. Slaughter,<BR>massacre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butler
BUTLER: भोजनपात्रमद्यादिरक्षकः सेवकः; *आसवपालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butt
BUTT (subs.):<BR>I An end, a limit: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Mark, target: q. v. लक्ष्यम्।<BR>III An object<BR>of ridicule:<BR>(1) उपहासास्पदम्;<BR>(2) हास्यभूमिः।<BR>IV A push or thrust with the head of an<BR>animal: शिरसा ताडनम्। V. A cask or vessel:<BR>(1) पात्रम्;<BR>(2) भाण्डम्।<BR>VI A short piece of<BR>land at the end of a field: आलिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butt
BUTT (v.):<BR>I To adjoin, bound: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To strike with the head: शिरसा ताडयति or<BR>आहन्ति (हन्, c. 2.): Ph. two rams are b. ing<BR>मेषौ युध्याते (युध्, c. 4. = to fight).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butter
BUTTER (subs.): नवनीतम्,<BR>fresh b.<BR>सद्यस्कं नवनीतम्,<BR>Bha. clarified b.:<BR>(1) घृतम्,<BR>(2) हविस (n.);<BR>(3) सर्पिस् (n.);<BR>(4) आज्यम्;<BR>(5) पुरोडाशम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butter
BUTTER (v.) नवनीतेन लिम्पति: v. To besmear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buttercup
BUTTERCUP: पीतपुष्पप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butterfly
BUTTERFLY:<BR>(1) तिन्तिलिः (?);<BR>(2) पिप्पिलिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

butter-milk
BUTTER-MILK:<BR>(1) तक्रम्;<BR>(2) कालशेयम्;<BR>(3) अरिष्टम्<BR>(4) दण्डाहतम्, A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

