button
BUTTON (subs.) *बुतामः।<BR>B. hole<BR>*बुतामच्छिद्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

button
BUTTON (v. t.) *बुतामं ददाति (दा, c. 3.)<BR>or<BR>लगयति<BR>(c. of लग्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buttress
BUTTRESS: *आलम्बः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buxom
BUXOM: प्रफुल्लवदनः (ना, नं): v. Comely, gay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buy
BUY (v. t.):<BR>(1) क्रीणाति<BR>or<BR>क्रीणीते (क्री, c. 9.);<BR>(2) अवक्रीणीते (rare);<BR>(3) गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.) (=to<BR>receive) (to be used only when the sense<BR>is clear):<BR>at what price have you bought this<BR>book<BR>कियता मूल्येनैष पुस्तको गृहीतः, P. ii. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buy back
BUY BACK or OFF: परिक्रीणीते (क्री, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buyer
BUYER:<BR>(1) क्रेतृ (f. त्री);<BR>(2) क्रयिन् (f. णी);<BR>(3) क्रयिकः (का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buying
BUYING: क्रयः।<BR>B. and selling<BR>क्रयविक्रयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buzz
BUZZ (v. i.):<BR>(1) गुञ्जति (गुञ्ज्, c. l.),<BR>not a single<BR>bee that did nat b. in a sweet low tone<BR>न<BR> षट्पदोऽसौ न जुगुञ्ज यः कलम्, B. ii. 19.;<BR>(2) सिड्क्ते<BR>(सिञ्ज्, c. 2.), B. xxii. 27.;<BR>(3) घुणघुणायते<BR>(nomi.), Kar. v. To sound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buzz
BUZZ, BUZZING (subs.):<BR>(1) गुञ्जितम्;<BR>(2)<BR>गुञ्जनम्;<BR>(3) हुङ्क्टतम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

buzzard
BUZZARD:<BR>I A bird: श्येनभेदः।<BR>II A block-<BR>-head: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by
BY (prep.):<BR>I Of place: (a) = near: q. v.:<BR>esp. by comp. with उप,<BR>b. the Ganges<BR>उपगङ्गम्:<BR>Ph. b. the side of (her)<BR>father<BR>पितुः पार्श्वे Ku.;<BR>(b)=past:<BR>(1) अतीत्य;<BR>(2) अतिक्रम्यः Ph.<BR>flows b. the city of Oude<BR>वहत्ययोध्यामनु राजधानीम्,<BR>R.;<BR>b. this road<BR>अनेन मार्गेण; (c) =on: by<BR>the ins.:<BR>b. land and water<BR>स्थलेन जलेन च।<BR>II<BR>Of time: (a) not later than: Ph.:<BR>b.<BR>this time, the day was complete<BR>अनेन समयेन<BR> परिंणतो दिवसः, K.; by the 1st of Vaisākha<BR>वैशाखस्य प्रथमदिवसात् पूर्वम् (?); (b) of succession:<BR>Ph.<BR>day b. day<BR>अनुदिनम्; month b. month<BR>मासे मासे।<BR>III Of other relations: (a) of<BR>an agent after pass. verb: by the ins.:<BR>should be forgiven b. you<BR>भवता मर्ष यितव्यः, Sa. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">Page097</a>]<BR>iv.;<BR>Bali was asked land by Vamana<BR>वामनेन<BR> वलिर्ययाचे वसुधाम्, S. k.; (b) Of the instrument:<BR>by the ins.: b. fans made of lotus-leaves<BR>नलिनीदलतालवृन्तैः, Sa. iii.; b. king's command<BR>राजाज्ञया;<BR>b. force<BR>प्रसह्य; (c) Of the cause,<BR>means, made, etc.: gen. by the ins., some-<BR>-times by part. s:<BR>b. reading Śāstras<BR>शास्त्राण्यधीत्य;<BR>b. hook or b. crook<BR>येन केन प्रकारेण;<BR>b. name<BR>Sutikshna, of peaceful character<BR>नाम्ना सुतीक्ष्ण-<BR>श्चरितेन दान्तः, R. xiii. 41.;<BR>b. heart<BR>कण्ठस्थः<BR>(स्था, स्थं), Bo.;<BR>b. nature<BR>प्रकृत्या<BR>or<BR>स्वभावतः;<BR>b. stealth<BR>चौरिकया;<BR>to sell b. weight<BR>तोलयित्वा<BR> विक्रीणीते (?);<BR>to sell b. the yard<BR>गजसंख्यया<BR> विक्रीणीते (?);<BR>b. one's self<BR>एककः (का, कं): v.<BR>Solitary;<BR>b. degrees<BR>क्रमशः; b. thousands<BR>सहस्रशः;<BR>b. crowds<BR>सङ्घशः;<BR>one b. one<BR>एकैकशः;<BR>man b. man<BR>प्रतिपुरुषम्: v. Each;<BR>he is taller<BR>than I b. half a foot<BR>*स मत्तोऽर्धपादोच्चः;<BR>a poem<BR>by Kālidāsa<BR>कालिदासकृतं काव्यम्; (d) In adjura-<BR>-tions: Ph.<BR>b. God<BR>ईश्वरं साक्षीकृत्य;<BR>I swear b.<BR>my sacerdotal thread<BR>शपामि ब्रह्मसूत्रेण, Ra. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=096" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by
BY (adv.):<BR>I Near: q. v.: निकटे।<BR>II Aside:<BR>v. Lay by, put by.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by and by
BY AND BY:<BR>(1) अचिरेण;<BR>(2) किञ्चित् पश्चात्<BR>(=little after).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by the by
BY THE BY: प्रसङ्गेन<BR>or<BR>प्रसङ्गात् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bygone
BYGONE:<BR>(1) अतीतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) अतिक्रान्तः<BR>(न्ता, न्तं);<BR>(3) गतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by-law
BY-LAW: *उपविधिः: v. Rule, ordinance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bypath
BYPATH, ROAD, or WAY:<BR>(1) विमार्गः;<BR>(2) विपथः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

by-place
BY-PLACE:<BR>(1) विजनप्रदेशः;<BR>(2) विविक्तस्थलम्;<BR>(3)<BR>विजनभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

bystander
BYSTANDER:<BR>(1) प्रेक्षकः (=a spectator);<BR>(2)<BR>पार्श्वस्थः (=one who is near).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

byword
BYWORD: v. Proverb. To become a b.<BR>उपहासास्पदं भवति (भू, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cab
CAB: अश्ववाह्ययानभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabal
CABAL (subs.):<BR>I A body of intriguers:<BR>*स्वकार्यसाधनाय गूढमन्त्रकारिणः (m. pl.).<BR>II Intri-<BR>-gue: q. v.: गूढमन्त्रणा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabal
CABAL (v. i.): *स्वकार्यसाधनाय गूढं मन्त्रयति (मन्त्र्,<BR>c. 10.) or sim. मन्त्रयति (when the sense is<BR>clear). v. To intrigue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabala
CABALA: *काबलम्; इहुदीनां निगूढशास्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabalist
CABALIST: *काबलविद् (mfn.); काबलज्ञः (f. ज्ञा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabalistic
CABALISTIC: काबलविषयकः (का, कं). In gen.<BR>sense: v. Mystical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caballer
CABALLER: v. Intriguer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabbage
CABBAGE: शाकप्रभेदः; *कबिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabin
CABIN:<BR>I A cottage: q. v.<BR>II Of a ship:<BR>कोष्ठः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabinet
CABINET:<BR>I A closet: q. v.<BR>II A piece of<BR>furniture: *दराजः: v. Chest.<BR>III The<BR>select council of a ruler: प्रधानमन्त्रिणां सभा।<BR>Ph.<BR>c. minister:<BR>मुख्यमन्त्रिन् (m.).<BR>IV A<BR>room for c. council: इन्द्रकम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cable
CABLE: पोतबन्धनाय स्थूलः शाणरज्जुः, लौहशृङ्ह्नलो वा;<BR> पोतबन्धनी (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabman
CABMAN:<BR>(1) प्रवहणवाहकः;<BR>(2) यानवाही: v.<BR>Charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cabriolet
CABRIOLET: चतुश्चक्रविशिष्टः सपिधानो लघुरथविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cachinnation
CACHINNATION:<BR>(1) अट्टहासः;<BR>(2) प्रहसनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>आच्छुरितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cackle
CACKLE (v.):<BR>(1) नदति (नद्, c. l.);<BR>(2) रौति<BR>(रु, c. 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cakle
CAKLE, CACKLING (subs.): नादः, c. of the geese<BR>हंसनादः: v. Noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cacophonous
CACOPHONOUS: श्रुतिकटु (mfn.), Kav. vii. 2.:<BR>v. Harsh, discordant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cacophony
CACOPHONY: श्रुतिकटुता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cadaverous
CADAVEROUS: v. Ghastly, pale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cadence
CADENCE:<BR>I Lit.: v. Fall.<BR>II Musical:<BR>(1) स्वरसंक्रमः (=modulation of voice), Mr.<BR>iii. 5.;<BR>(2) स्वरावरोहः (=fall of voice.),<BR>M. n.;<BR>(3) विरामः (=pause).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cadet
CADET:<BR>I A younger brother: अनुजः।<BR>II<BR>A younger son: कनिष्ठपुत्रः।<BR>III In the<BR>army: *कादितः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caesura
CAESURA: *विच्छेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cage
CAGE: (subs.):<BR>I For animals:<BR>(1) पिञ्जरम्;<BR>(2) पञ्जरम्;<BR>(3) वीतंसः।<BR>II For men: v. Prison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cage
CAGE (v. t.): पिञ्जरे निरुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>confine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=097" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cairn
CAIRN:<BR>(1) उपलराशिः;<BR>(2) पाषाणचितिः; and<BR>sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caitiff
