cajole
CAJOLE (v. t.): लालयति (लल, c. 10.): v. To<BR>deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cajoler
CAJOLER: लालिन् (f. नी) (?): v. Deceiver,<BR>flatterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cajolery
CAJOLERY: लालनम्: v. Flattery, deception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cake
