cake
CAKE (v. i.): पिण्डीभवति (भू, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calamine
CALAMINE: धातुविशेषः; *कलमिनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calamitous
CALAMITOUS:<BR>(1) विपन्नः (न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(2) विपद्ग्रस्तः<BR>(स्ता, स्तं);<BR>(3) आपदुपेतः (ता, तं);<BR>(4) व्यसनोपेतः<BR>(ता, तं): v. Unfortunate. Ph. ‘c. condition’<BR>विपद्दशा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calamity
CALAMITY:<BR>(1) विपद्;<BR>(2) आपद् (f.);<BR>(3)<BR>विपत्ति;<BR>(4) व्यसनम् (rare);<BR>(5) उपद्रवः (=public<BR>c.): v. Misfortune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calcination
CALCINATION:<BR>(1) गारणम्;<BR>(2) आतञ्चनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>प्रतीवापः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calcine
CALCINE:<BR>(1) गारयति (c. of गॄ);<BR>(2) आतञ्चयति<BR>(c. of तञ्च्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

