CALCIUM: *चूर्णसारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calculate
CALCULATE:<BR>(1) गणयति (=to count, reckon:<BR>q. v.);<BR>(2) निरूपयति (=to ascertain),<BR>c. a<BR>day suited for our departure<BR>निरूप्यतां तावदस्माकं<BR> प्रस्थानयोग्यदिवसः, Mu. iv. C. d.: i. e. adapted:<BR>v. To fit, suit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

calculation
