calculator
CALCULATOR:<BR>(1) गणकः;<BR>(2) निरूपकः (=one<BR>who ascertains).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=098" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

