candid
CANDID:<BR>I White: विशदः (दा, दं).<BR>II Fair<BR>frank, sincere: q. v.:<BR>(1) न्याय्यः (य्या, य्यं<BR>(=fair);<BR>(2) स्फुटभाषिन् (f. णी) (=frank)<BR>(3) निष्कपटः (टा, टं) (sincere).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=100" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

candidate
CANDIDATE:<BR>(1) आकाङ्क्षिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2) अर्थिन्<BR> प्र-, (f. नी),<BR>c. for poetic fame<BR>कवियशःप्रार्थी, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=100" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

candidly
