capable
CAPABLE:<BR>(1) शक्तः (क्ता, क्तं),<BR>with c. friends<BR>शक्तैः<BR> सुहृद्भिः, B.;<BR>c. of this work<BR>अस्य कर्मणः शक्तः Ve.<BR>iii.;<BR>(2) समर्थः (र्था, र्थं),<BR>c. of meeting<BR>परिसरण-<BR>समर्थः, Vi.;<BR>(3) क्षमः (मा, मं), c. of disordering<BR>विप्रकर्तुं क्षमः, Vi. N. B. Note the construction<BR>of these words;<BR>(4) शक्यः (क्या, क्यं) (in the<BR>passive sense):<BR>c. of being counteracted<BR>समाधातुं<BR> शक्यः, Vi. Be c.: v. Able, be-.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capacious
CAPACIOUS: i. e. spacious, large: q. v.<BR>(1)<BR>विशालः (ला, लं) (in breadth);<BR>(2) विपुलः (ला,<BR> लं) (in depth);<BR>(3) बहुग्रहः (हा, हं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capaciousness
CAPACIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) विशालता;<BR>(2) विपुलता: v.<BR>Largeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capacitate
CAPACITATE: v. To enable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capacity
CAPACITY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) धारणशक्तिः;<BR>(2) ग्रहण-<BR>सामर्थ्यम्;<BR>(3) better by circumlo.: v. Extent.<BR>Ph.<BR>a measure of c.<BR>प्रतीमानम्, M.<BR>II. Mental<BR>c.: ग्रहणसामर्थ्यम्,<BR>c. for all knowledge<BR>अशेषविद्या-<BR>ग्रहणसामर्थ्यम्, K.<BR>III. Ability: q. v.: शक्तिः,<BR>to<BR>the extent of one's c.<BR>यथाशक्ति।<BR>IV Outward<BR>condition: रूपम्,<BR>in the c. of a cook<BR>सूदरूपेण or<BR>सूदो भूत्वा। V. Legal c.: क्षमता (?).<BR>VI In<BR>geo.: गर्भफलम्, Li.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cap-a-pie
CAP-A-PIE: आपादमस्तकम्, सर्वाङ्ग- in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caparison
CAPARISON:<BR>I (subs.): कुथः: v. Trappings.<BR>II Verb: कुथेन मण्डयति, etc.;<BR>saw Indrāyudha<BR>c. ed with red cloth<BR>अरुणेनाश्वलङ्कारेणालङ्कृतमिन्द्रायु-<BR>धमद्राक्षीत्, K. C. ed: विभूषितः (ता, तं). N.<BR>i. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cape
CAPE:<BR>I A promontory: *प्रलम्बः।<BR>II For<BR>the shoulders: *स्कन्धच्छदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=101" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caper
CAPER (v.): कूर्दति, -ते (कूर्द्, c. l.), Ha.: v.<BR>To frisk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caper
CAPER (subs.):<BR>I For pickling: मुकुलविशेषः:<BR> *कफरी।<BR>II A skip, jump: q. v. To cut c. s:<BR>कू (कु) र्दति, -ते (कूर्द<BR>or<BR>कुर्द्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capillary
CAPILLARY:<BR>I (subs.); सूक्ष्मनाडीविशेषः; संयोगिनी।<BR>II Adj.: expr. by tat. comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capital
CAPITAL (adj.):<BR>I Chief, principal: q. v.<BR>II Excellent: q. v. Ph.<BR>c. letter<BR>*बृहदक्षरम्;<BR>c. punishment<BR>प्राणदण्डः;<BR>c. offence<BR>*प्राणदण्डार्हो-<BR>ऽपराधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capital
CAPITAL (subs.):<BR>I Of a column: चूडा (?).<BR>II Of a country: राजधानी,<BR>c. of the king<BR>Bhima<BR>मीमभूमिपतिराजधानी, N. vi. l. Ph.: the<BR>city named Puspapura (Patna) the c. of<BR>Magadha (Behar) *मगधदेशशेखरीभूता पुष्पपुरी नाम<BR> नगरी, D.<BR>III. A c. letter; *बृहदक्षरम्।<BR>IV<BR>Stock, principal q. v.:<BR>(1) मूलम्;<BR>(2) मूल-<BR>धनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitalist
CAPITALIST: Perh. मूलवत् (f. ती).<BR>Great c.<BR>स्फीत-<BR>सारधनः (ना, नं) D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitally
CAPITALLY: v. Chiefly. Ph.: to punish c.<BR>प्राणान् दण्डयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitation
CAPITATION: Ph. c. tax: v. Poll-tax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitol
CAPITOL: *रोमनगरस्थयुपितारदेवालयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitulate
CAPITULATE: शत्रुवशं स्वीकरोति, शत्रुहस्ते पुरं<BR>or<BR>दुर्गम्<BR> अर्पयति (c. of ऋ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capitulation
CAPITULATION: Ph.<BR>they agreed to a c. on these<BR>conditions<BR>एतैर्नियमैः पुरं<BR>or<BR>दुर्गमर्पयितुमभ्युपजग्मुः: v.<BR>To capitulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capon
CAPON: i. e. castrated cock: हृतमुष्ककुक्कुटः and<BR>sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caprice
CAPRICE:<BR>(1) कामचारः (anything done accor-<BR>-ding to one's fancy),<BR>this is c. of fortune<BR>दैवस्यात्र<BR> कामचारः, Mu. ii.;<BR>(2) चाञ्चल्यम् (=fickleness:<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capricious
CAPRICIOUS:<BR>(1) कामचारिन् (f. णी) (doing<BR>according to one's fancy):<BR>(2) चञ्चलः (ला, लं)<BR>(=fickle, unsteady: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capriciously
CAPRICIOUSLY: v. Whimsically.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capriciousness
CAPRICIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) कामचारिता;<BR>(2) चाञ्चल्यम्<BR>(=fickleness: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capricorn
CAPRICORN: मकरः<BR>or<BR>मकरराशिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capricum
CAPRICUM: रक्तमरीचः; रक्तमरीचलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capstan
CAPSTAN: भारोत्तोलनयत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capsular
CAPSULAR: कोशाकारः (रा, रं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capsule
CAPSULE:<BR>(1) वीजकोशः (षः), Bha;<BR>(2) कर्णिका,<BR>Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captain
CAPTAIN:<BR>I A chief: q. v.: अध्यक्षः।<BR>II A<BR>military officer: *गुल्मपतिः or (in gen. sense)<BR>सैन्याध्यक्षः<BR>or<BR>सेनानीः।<BR>III A naval officer<BR>पोताध्यक्षः<BR>or<BR>पोतनायकः।<BR>IV A master of the<BR>military art: v. General.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captaincy
CAPTAINCY or CAPTAINSHIP:<BR>(1) गुल्मपतिपद<BR>(military);<BR>(2) पोताध्यक्षपदम् (naval).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caption
CAPTION: v. Apprehension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captious
CAPTIOUS:<BR>I Disposed to find fault: (1<BR>दोषैकदृश् (mfn.);<BR>(2) पुरोभागिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) दोष-<BR>ग्राहिन् (f. णी).<BR>II Peevish, perverse: q. v.<BR>III Insidious, troublesome: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captiously
CAPTIOUSLY: v. Peevishly, insidiously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captiousness
CAPTIOUSNESS: v. Censoriousness, peevish<BR>ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captivate
CAPTIVATE (v. t.):<BR>I To enslave: वशीकरोति<BR>c.d by her good qualities<BR>तद्गुणैः वशीकृतः, D. I.<BR>To charm: q. v.: हरति (हृ, c. l.),<BR>c. d to<BR>eyes, as well as the minds, of all creatures<BR>जह<BR> सर्वभूतानां चक्षूंषि च मनांसि च, Mah.<BR>C. ing:<BR>मनोह<BR>(रा, रं): v. Charming, fascinating.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captive
CAPTIVE (subs.): वन्दी<BR>or<BR>वन्दि (f.),<BR>will bring<BR>back fortune as a c.<BR>श्रियं वन्दीमिव प्रत्यानेष्यति, M.<BR>ii. 52.: v. Prisoner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captive
CAPTIVE (adj.):<BR>(1) वन्दीकृतः (ता, तं).<BR>ma<BR>c. by the enemies of gods<BR>वन्दीकृता विबुधशत्रुमि<BR>V. ;<BR>(2) वन्दिः,<BR>c. women<BR>वन्दिस्त्रियः, Vi. vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captivity
CAPTIVITY: वन्दित्वम्: v. Slavery, subjection<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

captor
CAPTOR:<BR>(1) ग्राहकः;<BR>(2) जेता (=victor, con-<BR>- queror: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capture
CAPTURE (v.) गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.),<BR>and was c. d<BR>Chandavarman<BR>जगृहे च चण्डवर्मणा, D. i.;<BR>new<BR>c. d<BR>नवग्रहः (हा, हं), K.: v. To take.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capture
CAPTURE (subs.):<BR>I Seizure: q. v.: ग्रह-<BR>णम्,<BR>c. of cattle<BR>गोग्रहः, Mah.<BR>II Booty, prize<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

capuchin
CAPUCHIN:<BR>I A monk; यतिविशेषः।<BR>II<BR>monkey: वानरविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=102" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

car
CAR: रथः,<BR>procession of the c. of Jagannātha<BR>रथ-<BR>यात्राः v. Chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carat
CARAT:<BR>I A weight रत्तिका (properly about<BR>half a c.), K. b.<BR>II A 24th part, in<BR>measuring the fineness of gold: expr.<BR>by circumlo.:<BR>this is 18 c. gold<BR>*अस्य पादत्रयं<BR> स्वर्णम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caravan
CARAVAN: सङ्घः,<BR>c. of pilgrims<BR>यात्रिकसङ्घः;<BR>c. of<BR>merchants<BR>वणिग्गणः, Mal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caravansary
CARAVANSARY, CARAVANSERA: पथिकाश्रमः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caraway
CARAWAY:<BR>(1) अजमोहा;<BR>(2) उग्रगन्धा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carbine
CARBINE or CARABINE: *लघुबन्दुकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carbiner
CARBINER or CARABINEER: *लघुबन्दुकभृदश्ववारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carbon
CARBON: *अङ्गारसारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carbonic
CARBONIC: *अङ्गारसारजः (जा, जं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carbuncle
CARBUNCLE:<BR>I A tumour: विस्फोटः।<BR>II A<BR>gem: पद्मरागः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carcass
CARCASS:<BR>(1) शव (mn.);<BR>(2) मृतशरीरम्;<BR>(3)<BR>कुणप (mn.) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

card
CARD (subs.):<BR>I A playing c.: *तासम्,<BR>to play<BR>with c. s<BR>*तासैः क्रीडति;<BR>knave of c. s:<BR>*दासः,<BR>Diamond, heart, club and spade (of cards) *रक्तं,<BR> पीतं, श्यामं, कृष्णम्।<BR>II A visiting c. *नामपत्रम्।<BR>III A paper on which the points of a<BR>compass are marked: *दिग्भागपत्रम्।<BR>IV An<BR>instrument for combing wool: उर्णामार्जनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

card
CARD (v. t.): v. To comb, cleanse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cardamom
CARDAMOM:<BR>(1) एला,<BR>(2) कोरङ्गी (small c.);<BR>(3) चन्द्रबाला (large c.);<BR>(4) निष्कुटिः (large c.)<BR>(rare).<BR>C. -plant:<BR>एलालता, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carder
CARDER: Of wool: उर्णामार्जकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cardiac
CARDIAC:<BR>I (adj.): दीपनः (ना, नं), Śr.<BR>II<BR>(subs.): दीपनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cardinal
CARDINAL (subs.): *रोमकधर्मनियन्ता।<BR>C. ship, c.<BR>ate:<BR>*रोमकधर्मनियन्तृपदम्: कार्डिनालपदवी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cardinal
CARDINAL (adj.): i. e. chief, principal:<BR>c.<BR>virtue<BR>परमधर्मः। Ph.<BR>c. number<BR>एकादिसंख्या;<BR>c.<BR>points<BR>*प्रधानबिन्दवः (m. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

care
CARE (subs.):<BR>I Anxiety: q. v.: चिन्ता,<BR>free<BR>from c. about you<BR>त्वयि वीतचिन्तः, Sa. iv. Ph.:<BR>I am now free from c.<BR>लब्धमिदानीं स्वास्थ्यम्, Sa.<BR>iv.<BR>II The object of care: चिन्ता,<BR>a<BR>daughter born in this world is a great c.<BR>पुत्रीति<BR>जाता महतीह चिन्ता, P. i. 5.<BR>III Caution,<BR>attention<BR>(1) यत्नः, प्र-, (=diligence), although<BR>(I)<BR>was brought up with c.<BR>प्रयत्नसंवर्धितोऽपि, D.<BR>iv.;<BR>(2) अप्रमादः (carefulness);<BR>(3) आदरः<BR>(of treatment),<BR>display c. in the service of<BR>Rishis<BR>ऋषिजनपरिचर्यासु दर्शितादरा भव, K.<BR>IV.<BR>Charge, oversight:<BR>(1) रक्षा (=watching<BR>over), (but its)<BR>c. is with you<BR>रक्षा युष्मास्ववस्थिता,<BR>Ku. ii. 26.;<BR>(2) अवेक्षा (=looking after).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

care
CARE, TAKE:<BR>(1) रक्षति (रक्ष्, c. l.), (=watch<BR>over),<BR>you should t. c. of it at night and Vardha-<BR>mānaka in the day<BR>इदं रक्षितव्यं त्वया रात्रौ वर्धमान-<BR>केनापि दिवा, Mr. i.;<BR>I t. c. of the house<BR>गृह-<BR>रक्षां करोमि, H. iii.;<BR>(1) लालयति, -ते, (लल्, c.<BR>10.) (of children),<BR>you should t. c. of her as a<BR>child<BR>बालेव लालनीया, K. Take care =b ware:<BR>q. v.: अप्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं)<BR>or<BR>सावधानः (ना, नं) भव।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

care
CARE (v.):<BR>(1) गणयति (गण्, c. 10.) (=to<BR>reckon),<BR>did not c. what Rāma said<BR>अजीगण-<BR>द्दाशरथं न वाक्यम्, B. ii. 53.: he did not c. all these<BR>स तान्नाजीगणत्सर्वान्, B. xv. 5.;<BR>not c. ing even<BR>a straw for their husbands<BR>तृणायापि न गणयित्वा<BR> भर्तॄन्, D.;<BR>(2) ईक्षते, etc. (=to look: q. v.)<BR>does not c. for birth or beauty<BR>नाभिजनमीक्षते न<BR> रूपमालोकयते, K.;<BR>(3) आद्रियते (दृ, c. 6.) (=to<BR>regard), Ki, xvi. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

careen
CAREEN (v. t.): पार्श्वेन स्थापयति (c. of स्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

career
CAREER:<BR>I A race or race-course: q. v.<BR>II<BR>General course of conduct: चरितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

careful
CAREFUL:<BR>I Attentive: q. v.<BR>(1) अप्रमत्तः (त्ता,<BR> त्तं);<BR>(2) वीतप्रमादः (दा, दं);<BR>(3) सावधानः (ना,<BR> नं).<BR>II Anxious: q. v.:<BR>(1) सचिन्तः (न्ता,<BR> न्तं);<BR>(2) चिन्तावत् (f. ती);<BR>(3) चिन्ताशताकुलः<BR>(ला, लं). C. of or for:<BR>(1) चिन्तयति (चिन्त्, c.<BR>10.);<BR>(2) आद्रियते, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carefully
CAREFULLY:<BR>I With c.:<BR>(1) यत्नेन;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रयत्नतः;<BR>(3) निपुणम्,<BR>searching c.<BR>निपुणमन्विष्य D.<BR>ii;<BR>to consider c.<BR>निपुणं विचारयति, Mr.<BR>II<BR>Attentively:<BR>(1) अप्रमत्तम्;<BR>(2) अप्रमादेन;<BR>(3)<BR>सावधानेन।<BR>III Anxiously: q. v.: expr. by<BR>adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carefulness
CAREFULNESS:<BR>(1) अप्रमादः;<BR>(2) सावधानता;<BR>(3)<BR>चिन्ताकुलता (=anxiety).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=103" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

careless
CARELESS:<BR>I Inattentive, neglectful: q. v.:<BR>प्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं).<BR>To be c. of:<BR>न चिन्तयति (चिन्त्,<BR>c. 10)<BR>or<BR>विमावयति (c. of भू) (with acc.),<BR>is<BR>c. even of herself<BR>आत्मानमपि न विभावयति।<BR>II<BR>Said or done without care: प्रमत्त- in comp.<BR>III Free from care: निश्चिन्तः (न्ता, न्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carelessly
CARELESSLY:<BR>(1) प्रमादेन;<BR>(2) सप्रमादम्:<BR>(3)<BR>प्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं);<BR>(4) अनवधानेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carelessness
CARELESSNESS:<BR>(1) प्रमादः;<BR>(2) अनवधानम्;<BR>(3)<BR>असावधानता;<BR>(4) प्रमत्तता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caress
CARESS (v.): परिरभते (रभ्, c. l.)(=to<BR>embrace: q. v.);<BR>(2) क्रोडे करोति (to put<BR>in the lap): v. Also to fondle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caress
CARESS (subs.): परिरम्भः (=embrace: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caressingly
CARESSINGLY: वक्षसा परिरभ्य (=embracing),<BR>Ku. v. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caret
CARET: *पूरकः; असम्पूर्णलिखितविज्ञापनाय ‘A’<BR>इत्याकारचिह्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cargo
CARGO: expr. by द्रव्यं<BR>or<BR>भाण्डम्,<BR>what is the c. of<BR>the boat<BR>किंभाण्डपूर्णा नौः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caricature
CARICATURE (subs.): उपहास्यचित्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caricature
CARICATURE (v. t.) उपहास्यचित्रं लिखति (लिख्,<BR>c. 6.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caricaturist
CARICATURIST: उपहास्यचित्रकरः (?); उपहास्यचित्र-<BR>लेखकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

caries
CARIES, CARIOSITY: अस्थिव्रणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carious
CARIOUS: व्रणितः (ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carman
CARMAN:<BR>(1) सारथिः;<BR>(2) रथवाहकः;<BR>(3) शकट-<BR>वाहकः (of a cart).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carmelite
CARMELITE: *कर्मलीययतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carminative
CARMINATIVE (adj. or subs.): वातघ्नः<BR>or<BR>वायुघ्नः<BR>(घ्नी, घ्नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carmine
CARMINE (subs.): A red dye: लाक्षा (?).<BR>Dyed<BR>with c.<BR>लाक्षिकः (की, कं), S. k.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnage
CARNAGE: कदनम्: v. Slaughter, massacre.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnal
CARNAL:<BR>I Bodily, sensual: q. v. Ph.<BR>c.<BR>pleasure<BR>विषयसुखम्।<BR>II Lustful: q. v. Ph.<BR>c.<BR>desire<BR>कामः;<BR>c. knowledge:<BR>संसर्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnality
CARNALITY:<BR>(1) विषयासक्तिः (the state);<BR>(2) विषयोपभोगः (its indulgence): v.<BR>Sensuality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnally
CARNALLY: Ph.<BR>to know c.<BR>संसृजति (सृज्, c. 6.);<BR>or better by संसर्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnation
CARNATION:<BR>I Flesh colour: मांसवर्णः।<BR>II. A<BR>flower: रक्तवर्णपुष्पप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnival
CARNIVAL: *रोमकधर्मिणां मांसोत्सवः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carnivorous
CARNIVOROUS:<BR>(1) मांसभुज् (mfn.);<BR>(2) आमि-<BR>षाशिन्<BR>or<BR>पिशिताशिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) क्रव्यादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carob
CAROB: शिम्बिभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carol
CAROL (subs.): सङ्गीतम्: v. Song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carol
CAROL (v.): गायति (गै, c. l.): v. To sing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carotid arteries
CAROTID ARTERIES: Prob. मन्ये (f. dual), B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carousal
CAROUSAL, CAROUSE (subs.): पानगोष्ठीमहोत्सव<BR>or sim. पानगोष्ठी, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carouse
CAROUSE (v.):<BR>(1) अतिशयं पिबति (पा, c. 2.)<BR>(2) प्रभूतमद्यपानं करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carouser
CAROUSER: आपानपः, Ha.: v. Drinker, reveller.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carp
CARP (subs.): रोहितजातीयमत्स्यभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carp at
CARP AT (v.): अवक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.): v. To<BR>censure, to cavil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carpenter
CARPENTER:<BR>(1) तक्षकः;<BR>(2) त्वष्ट्ट (m.);<BR>(3)<BR>वर्धकिः;<BR>(4) सूत्रधारः;<BR>(5) तक्षन् (m.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carpentry
CARPENTRY:<BR>(1) दारुकर्मन् (n.) K.;<BR>(2) तक्षणम<BR>tools of c.<BR>तक्षणसाधनानि (n. pl.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carper
CARPER: v. Caviller, censurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carpet
CARPET (subs.): चित्रास्तरणम् (?). Ph. ‘on the c.’<BR>आलोच्यमानः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carpet
CARPET (v.): चित्रास्तरणैराच्छादयति (छद्, c. 10.)<BR>(=to cover: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carping
CARPING (adj.):<BR>(1) मिथ्यादोषदर्शिन् (f. नी) (?)<BR>(2) अवक्षेपिन् (f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carping
CARPING (subs.): अवक्षेपः: v. Cavil, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carpingly
CARPINGLY:<BR>(1) गुणापवादेन;<BR>(2) असूयया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carriage
CARRIAGE:<BR>I Conveyance: वाहनम्।<BR>II A<BR>vehicle:<BR>(1) यानम् (most gen. term),<BR>drive.<BR>in a c. and four<BR>चतुरश्ववाह्येन यानेन चलति;<BR>(2)<BR>रथः (spec. a war-chariot),<BR>a c. road<BR>रथ्या<BR>(3) स्यन्दनः (=a chariot);<BR>(4) पुष्परथः (= a<BR>pleasure-car);<BR>(5) कर्णीरथः;<BR>(6) प्रवहणम् (=a<BR>light covered car for ladies).<BR>III Gesture<BR>conduct, deportment: q. v. व्यवहारः।<BR>IV<BR>Management: q. v.: निर्वाहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carriage-maker
CARRIAGE-MAKER: रथकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carrier
CARRIER:<BR>(1) वाहकः;<BR>(2) वाहिन् (m.):<BR>(3)<BR>बोढा।<BR>Message c.:<BR>सन्देशहरः।<BR>Common c.:<BR>साधारण<BR> द्रव्यवाहकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=104" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carrion
CARRION: कुणपः,<BR>c. eater:<BR>कौणपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carrot
CARROT:<BR>(1) गर्जरम्;<BR>(2) पीतकन्दम्;<BR>(3) पिण्ड-<BR>मूलकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry
CARRY:<BR>I To convey: q. v. वहति, उत्-, (वह्,<BR>c. l.),<BR>c. ing him also on his shoulders<BR>तमपि<BR> स्कन्धेनोदुह्य, D. vi.; c. ing these two (i. e. the<BR>name Kshatriya and his bow) वहन् द्वयीम्, Ki.<BR>iii. 48.<BR>II To urge, impel: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>transfer: नयति (नी, c. l.)<BR>IV To accom-<BR>-plish: q. v. V. To carry one's self: v. To<BR>behave.<BR>VI To exhibit:<BR>(1) वहति;<BR>(2)<BR>expr. by gen. with अस्ति,<BR>it c. s no weight<BR>अस्य<BR> गौरवं नास्ति (?).<BR>VII<BR>To c. town or fort:<BR>हस्त-<BR>गतः (ता, तं) करोति। Ph.:<BR>to c. coals to New-<BR>castle<BR>कुवेराय धनं ददाति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry away
CARRY AWAY:<BR>(1) अपवहति;<BR>(2) नयति (नी, c.<BR>1.) (=to take). Ph.: (your)<BR>heart about to<BR>be c ed away<BR>अपह्नियमानं हृदयम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry back
CARRY BACK: v. To take back.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry off
CARRY OFF:<BR>I Lit.: अपवहति।<BR>II Fig.: हरति<BR>(हृ, c. l.),<BR>let him c. the ensign of triumph<BR>*स<BR> हरतु सुभगपताकाम्, D. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry on
CARRY ON:<BR>I To manage: q. v.: करोति<BR>(=to do, to perform: q. v.).<BR>II To<BR>promote: q. v.: उन्नयति (नी, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry out
CARRY OUT: i. e. to accomplish, effect:<BR>q. v.: निर्वाहयति (c. of वह्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry over
CARRY OVER: v. To carry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry round
CARRY ROUND: परिवहति (?) गृहाद्गृहं (house to<BR>house)<BR>or<BR>हस्ताद्धस्तान्तरं (from hand to hand)<BR>नयति (नी, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carry through
CARRY THROUGH:<BR>(1) लङ्घयति (लङ्घ्, c. 10.)<BR>(with abl. or ins. of the cause);<BR>(2) पारं<BR> नयति (नी, c. l.),<BR>may God c. you through<BR>all difficulties:<BR>*ईश्वरप्रसादात्सर्वकृच्छ्राणि लङ्घय or<BR>त्वामिश्वरः सर्वकृच्छ्राणां पारं नयतु।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cart
CART (subs.):<BR>(1) शकटः,<BR>a. toy c.<BR>शकटिका;<BR>(2)<BR>अनस् (n.) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cart
