cartage
CARTAGE: शकटशुल्कम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cart-horse
CART-HORSE: शाकटी<BR>or<BR>शाकटीनोऽश्वः, etc.: v.<BR>Horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cart-load
CART-LOAD:<BR>(1) शाकटीनः;<BR>(2) better by<BR>circum.<BR>five c. s of things<BR>पञ्जशकटपूर्णानि द्रव्याणि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carte-blanche
CARTE-BLANCHE: Ph. I have c. to go there<BR>स्वेच्छया गन्तुमनुमतोऽस्मि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cartel
CARTEL:<BR>I An agreement for the exchange<BR>of prisoners: नियमः।<BR>II A challenge to<BR>single combat: द्वन्द्वयुद्धाय समाह्वानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

