cartilaginous
CARTILAGINOUS: तरुणास्थिमयः (यी, यं) (?),<BR>Williams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

