cartouch
CARTOUCH:<BR>I A cartridge-box: q. v.<BR>II<BR>An architectural ornament: *पुटः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cartridge
CARTRIDGE: *चूर्णकोषः; त्रुटिः,<BR>C. -box:<BR>*चूर्णकोष-<BR>पेटिका।<BR>c. -paper:<BR>शक्तकागजविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carve
CARVE:<BR>I To cut artistically: expr. by<BR>उत्कीर्णः (र्णा, र्णं) (कृ, c. 6.), छुरितः (ता, तं) (छुर्,<BR>c. 6.),<BR>or<BR>उत्-लिखितः (ता, तं) (लिख्, c. 6.);<BR>whose<BR>borders are c. d with flowers<BR>कुसुमलवच्छुरितपर्यन्तः<BR>(न्ता, न्तं), D. ii.:<BR>whose borders^1 are c.d with<BR>plants<BR>पर्यन्तलिखितलतः (ता, तं), K. Ph.<BR>to c. out<BR>of<BR>कल्पयतिः v. To make;<BR>c. d work<BR>कारुकर्मन्<BR>(n.) (?).<BR>II To cut (of meat) (फालिकाभिः)<BR>कृन्तति (कृत्, c. 6.) (?).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carver
CARVER:<BR>I A sculptor:<BR>(1) कारुः (?);<BR>(2)<BR>तक्षकः (?).<BR>II A carving knife: *कृन्तनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carving
CARVING (subs.): कारुकर्मन् (n.) (?);<BR>(2) तक्षणी<BR>(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

carving-knife
CARVING-KNIFE: *कृन्तनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cascade
CASCADE: प्रपातः: v. Cataract. (I)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

case
CASE (subs.):<BR>I A covering or box: q. v.:<BR>आधारः,<BR>watch-c.<BR>*कालमापाधारः; printing c.<BR>*मुद्राचिह्नाधारः।<BR>II A box: q. v.<BR>III State,<BR>condition: q. v.<BR>IV Matter, circumstance:<BR>q. v.: अर्थः, represented the c. to Chaṇḍavarman<BR>तमर्थं चण्डवर्मणे निवेदयांचक्रुः, D. i. Ph.:<BR>in c.<BR>यदि<BR>(with विधिलिङ्) v. If;<BR>this being the c.<BR>एवं<BR> सति;<BR>in all c. s<BR>सर्वत्र;<BR>in this c.<BR>अत्र;<BR>in fever<BR>c. s<BR>ज्वरार्तानाम् (Lit., of those suffering from<BR>fever).<BR>V A lawsuit: q. v.:<BR>who have got<BR>c. s<BR>कः कः कार्यार्थी, Mr.;<BR>he loses that c.<BR>तस्मादर्थात्स<BR> हीयते, M.;<BR>when the c. is gained<BR>सिद्धेऽर्थे, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">Page106</a>]<BR>Vas.<BR>VI In gram. कारकम् (not applied to the<BR>gen.),<BR>objective c.<BR>कर्मकारकम्,<BR>c. ending<BR>विभक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=105" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

case
CASE (v.): v. To enclose, cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

case-harden
CASE-HARDEN (v.): बहिः कठिनीकरीति: v. To<BR>harden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

