CASEMATE: *आग्ने यगुलिभिरभेद्यप्रस्तरनिर्मितो गुप्तिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

