cash
CASH (v. t.): Ph.<BR>c. this bill<BR>*हुण्डिं दत्त्वा<BR> टङ्कमानय<BR>or<BR>हुण्डिं गृहीत्वा टङ्कं देहि (as the case<BR>may be).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

