CASSOCK: उपसंख्यानम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cassowary
CASSOWARY: पक्षिविशेषः; *कासोयारिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cast
CAST (v. t.):<BR>I To throw: q. v.: क्षिपति (क्षिप्,<BR>c. 6),<BR>c. this man into the ocean<BR>प्रक्षिपैनं सागरे, D.<BR>vi.;<BR>to c. on the ground<BR>अवनौ क्षिपति, Ki.;<BR>to<BR>c. lustre<BR>रुचं क्षिपति, Ki. v. 48;<BR>to c. eyes<BR>दृशं<BR> क्षिपति, D. vii. Ph.:<BR>to c. skin<BR>कञ्चुकं वि-मुञ्चति<BR>(मुच्, c. 6), M. n.;<BR>c. ing vote<BR>*सञ्चितमतम्।<BR>II To condemn: q. v. Ph. c. (in a suit)<BR>पराजितः (ता, तं), K. b.; हीनः (ना, नं), M.<BR>viii. 57.<BR>III To found: सं-दधाति<BR>or<BR>धत्ते<BR>(धा, c. 3) (?),<BR>to c. cannon<BR>*कामानं संदधाति।<BR>IV To distribute: q. v. V. To calculate,<BR>contrive: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cast
CAST (v. i.):<BR>I To contrive: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>warp: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cast aside
CAST ASIDE, CAST AWAY: v. Throw aside,<BR>throw away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cast down
CAST DOWN:<BR>I Lit.,: to throw down: q. v. Ph.<BR>with eyes c.<BR>अधोदृष्टि (mfn.)<BR>or<BR>अधोमुखः (f. खी),<BR>Ku. vi. 85.<BR>II Fig.: v. To deject, depress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

