CAST ON or UPON: Ph. the infamy was c. on us<BR>पातितमस्मास्वयशः, Mu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cast
CAST (subs.):<BR>I A throw: q. v.: क्षेपः।<BR>II<BR>The distance that a thing is thrown: क्षेपः<BR>III Throw of dice: अक्षपातः। IV. A chance<BR>or venture: q. v.<BR>V A tinge: q. v.<BR>VI Any<BR>-thing c. in metal: मूतिः।<BR>VII The assign-<BR>-ment of parts in a play: भूमिकासंविभागः (?).<BR>VIII A stroke or trick: q. v.<BR>IX A tube<BR>or funnel: q. v. Ph.: having a c. in the eye<BR>केकराक्षः (क्षी, क्षं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=106" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

