cataplasm
CATAPLASM: लेपः; प्रलेपः: v. Poultice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

catapult
