catarrh
CATARRH:<BR>(1) प्रतिश्यायः;<BR>(2) पीनसः: v. Cold.<BR>(II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=107" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

catastrophe
