centenary
CENTENARY (subs.): शतम्। ‘A c. of years:’<BR>(1)<BR>वर्षशतम्;<BR>(2) शतवर्षम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

