centipede
CENTIPEDE: An insect;<BR>(1) शतपदी<BR>or<BR>शतपादिका;<BR>(2) कर्णजलौकस् (f.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cento
