central
CENTRAL:<BR>(1) मध्यः (ध्या, ध्यं) (=middle):<BR>(2) मध्यस्थः (स्था, स्थं) (c. ly situated):<BR>(3)<BR>मध्यगतः (ता, तं) (pertaining to the centre).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

