centralize
CENTRALIZE (v.) एकत्र निवेशयति (c. of विश्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centre
CENTRE (subs.):<BR>I In geo.:<BR>(1) केन्द्रम्;<BR>(2)<BR>मध्यबिन्दुः, Su., Ph.<BR>c. of gravity<BR>*आकर्षणकेन्द्रम्;<BR>c. of motion<BR>*अयनकेन्द्रम्।<BR>II In gen.: मध्यम्,<BR>a staff passing through its c.<BR>तन्मध्यगो दण्डः, Su.,<BR>plunging into the c.<BR>विगाह्य मध्यम्, Ki. xvi.<BR>13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centre
CENTRE (v.): Ph.<BR>on whom your sons' hope of<BR>victory was c. d<BR>जयाशा यत्र वद्धा सुतैस्ते, Ve. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centric
CENTRIC, CENTRICAL: मध्यस्थः (स्था, स्थं): v.<BR>Central.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centrifugal
CENTRIFUGAL: Ph.<BR>c. force<BR>*केन्द्रापसारिणी शक्तिः,<BR>and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centripetal
CENTRIPETAL: Ph.<BR>c. force<BR>*केन्द्राभिसारिणी शक्तिः,<BR>and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

centurion
CENTURION: शतयोधपतिः (?): गुल्मपतिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

century
