cerebrum
CEREBRUM: अग्रमस्तिष्कम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cere-cloth
CERE-CLOTH, CEREMENT: सैक्थवसनम्, and sim.<BR>comp. s(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceremonial
CEREMONIAL (subs.): आचारः: v. Ceremony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceremonial
CEREMONIAL, CEREMONIOUS (adj.):<BR>I Ritual:<BR>q. v.<BR>II Formal: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceremoniously
CEREMONIOUSLY:<BR>I Formally: अत्यादरेण।<BR>II<BR>With due ceremony: यथाविधि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceremoniousness
CEREMONIOUSNESS: अत्यादरः, leave off this c.<BR>विमुच्यतामयमत्यादरः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceremony
CEREMONY:<BR>I A solemn observance: आचारः,<BR>observe c.<BR>आचारं समाचर, Ki. iii. 28;<BR>(2) उप-<BR>चारः (rare).<BR>marriage c.<BR>पाणिग्रहणोपचारः, Ku.;<BR>(3) विधिः,<BR>with due c.<BR>विधिवत्, R. Ph.<BR>master of<BR>c. s<BR>अध्यक्षः; सूत्रधारः (of a dramatic company)<BR>II Pomp: q. v.: आडम्बरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certain
CERTAIN:<BR>I Sure, undoubted:<BR>(1) निशिचतः<BR>(ता, तं) (ascertained), knows victory to be c.<BR>निशिचतं जयमवगच्छेत्, K. vi;<BR>(2) ध्रुवः (ध्रु वा,<BR> ध्रुवम्) (unalterable)<BR>know this for c.<BR>ध्रुवमेतदवेहि,<BR>Ki. ii. 22.:<BR>(3) अवश्यः (श्या, श्यं) (=inevi-<BR>-table),<BR>death is c.<BR>मरणमवश्यम्, Ve. iii.;<BR>(4)<BR>असन्दिग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं) (=undoubted q. v.);<BR>(5)<BR>स्थिरः (रा, रं) (=fixed).<BR>II Convinced: Ph.<BR>yet I do not feel c. from terror<BR>पुनस्तथाप्यतिभयेना-<BR>निश्चयः, V. ii.;<BR>when he was c. that I could<BR>not be dissuaded<BR>यदा नेयं शक्यते व्यावर्तयितुमिति<BR> निश्चयमधिगतवान्, K.<BR>III. Particular, but<BR>undefined: कश्चित् (काचित्, किञ्चित्),<BR>a c. young<BR>woman<BR>काचिद्युवतिः D.;<BR>in c. systems<BR>कासुचिच्छा-<BR>खासु, S. iv. 1. v. Some.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certainly
CERTAINLY:<BR>I Assuredly:<BR>(1) अवश्यम् (with-<BR>-out failure),<BR>what would c. take place<BR>अवश्य-<BR>म्भाविन् (f. नी). H;<BR>(2) ध्रुवम् (=unalterably),<BR>would c. have victory<BR>ध्रुवं जयाः (भवन्ति) (with<BR>gen.), Ka. xv. 12,<BR>(3) नूनम् (=surely), c. he<BR>is not as his dress (i. e. as he looks) नूनं तथा नैष<BR> यथास्य वेषः, Ki.;<BR>(4) असंशयम्: v. Undoub-<BR>-tedly;<BR>(5) नियतम् (fixedly);<BR>would c. give<BR>permission<BR>नियतमनुज्ञास्यति, D.;<BR>(6) निश्चितम्, N. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">Page112</a>]<BR>com.<BR>II In replies, to denote emphatic<BR>assent: expr. by repetition: is this your<BR>resolution? c. एष ते निश्चयः? बाढम्, एष मे स्थिरो<BR> निश्चयः, Mu. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=111" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certainness
CERTAINNESS, CERTITUDE: v. Certainty (I)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certainty
CERTAINTY:<BR>I Freedom from doubt:<BR>(1)<BR>निश्चयः;<BR>(2) स्थिरता (=fixedness);<BR>(3) अस-<BR>न्दिग्धता (=undoubtedness).<BR>II Anything<BR>certain; expr. by the adj., forsaking c. s<BR>ध्रुवाणि परित्यज्य, H. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certificate
CERTIFICATE: *निदर्शनम्, c. of good behaviour<BR>*सद्व्यवहारनिदर्शनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

certify
CERTIFY:<BR>I To attest: *निदर्शयति (c. of दृश्).<BR>II To inform; q. v. विज्ञापयति।<BR>III To<BR>verify: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cerulian
CERULIAN:<BR>(1) नीलः (ला, लं):<BR>(2) असितः (ता,<BR> तं) (poet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cerumen
CERUMEN:<BR>(1) कर्णमलम्;<BR>(2) तोक्मम्;<BR>(3)<BR>कर्णगुथः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ceruse
CERUSE: श्वेतरञ्जनम् (?); सीसकविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cessation
CESSATION:<BR>(1) विरामः;<BR>(2) विरतिः;<BR>(3) शमः,<BR> प्र-, उप-, (=being over);<BR>(4) विश्रामः or<BR>विश्रान्तिः (for a time); निवृत्तिः (=ending).<BR>C. of arms.<BR>अवहारः।<BR>Without c.:<BR>अविरतः (ता,<BR>): v. Incessant, -ly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cession
CESSION:<BR>(1) उत्सर्गः;<BR>(2) दानम्;<BR>(3) समर्पणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cessment
CESSMENT: v. Assessment, tax.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cestus
CESTUS:<BR>I A girdle: मेखला।<BR>II For hands:<BR>अङ्गुलित्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cetaceous
CETACEOUS: तिमिजातीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafe
CHAFE (v. i.):<BR>(1) क्षुभ्यति (क्षुभ्, c. 4);<BR>(2)<BR>क्षोभं गच्छति, Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafe
CHAFE (v. t.):<BR>I To rub: कण्डूयति, -ते,<BR>c. d<BR>the doe<BR>मृगीमकण्डूयत, Ku. ii. To irritate:<BR>q. v.: क्षोभयति (c. of क्षुभ्).<BR>III To fall: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafe
CHAFE (subs.):<BR>I Rubbing: कण्डूयनम्।<BR>II<BR>Irritation: क्षोभः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafer
CHAFER: कीटभेदः: v. Beetle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaff
CHAFF (subs.):<BR>I Lit:<BR>(1) तुषः;<BR>(2) बुषम्;<BR>(3) तुच्छम्।<BR>To remove the c.<BR>निर्वुषीकर्तुम्, M. n.<BR>II Fig.: v. Rubbish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaff
CHAFF (v.): परिहसति (हस्, c. l): v. To<BR>joke.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaffer
CHAFFER:<BR>I Intrans.: v. To bargain;<BR>negotiate.<BR>II Trans: v. To buy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaffinch
CHAFFINCH: क्षुद्रपक्षिभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaffless
CHAFFLESS:<BR>(1) निस्तुषः (षा, षं);<BR>(2) निर्बुषः<BR>(षा, षं); and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaffy
CHAFFY:<BR>I Containing chaff:<BR>(1) सतुषः<BR>(षा, षं) (=with c.);<BR>(2) तुषमयः (यी, यं)<BR>(=consisting of c.).<BR>II Resembling c.:<BR>तुषोपमः (मा, मं)<BR>III Light, worthless: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafing
CHAFING (of the skin): कण्डूयनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chafing-dish
CHAFING-DISH:<BR>(1) अङ्गारधानिका;<BR>(2) अङ्गार-<BR>शकटी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chagrin
CHAGRIN (subs.): मन्युः: v. Vexation, ill-<BR>-humour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chagrin
CHAGRIN (v.): v. To vex, mortify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chain
CHAIN (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) (शृङ्घलः (ला, लं),<BR>silver c.<BR>रजतशृङ्घलम्, D.;<BR>(2) निगडः (=fetter);<BR>(3) बन्धनम् (=bond).<BR>II Fig.:<BR>(1) शृङ्गलः<BR>(ला लं);<BR>(2) निगडः;<BR>(3) बन्धः।<BR>III A<BR>series: q. v. परम्परा। Ph., a c. of mountains:<BR>पर्वतश्रेणी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chain
CHAIN (v. t.): शृङ्गलेन<BR>or<BR>निगडेन बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chained
CHAINED:<BR>(1) निगडितः (ता, तं), with c. feet<BR>निगडितचरणः (णा, णं);<BR>(2) शृङ्घलितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chair
CHAIR (subs):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) *चौकिः, easy c.<BR>*आरामचौकिः;<BR>armed c.<BR>*बाहुयुक्तचौकिः;<BR>(2)<BR>पीठम् (=stool):<BR>(3) आसनम् (= any seat).<BR>II.<BR>Office: q. v.: पीठम् (?),<BR>who fills the c. of<BR>chemistry now-<BR>*सम्प्रति केनाधिष्ठितं रसायनपीठम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chairman
CHAIRMAN:<BR>I President: q. v.: सभापतिः<BR>II<BR>One who carries a chair: चौकिवाहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalcedony
CHALCEDONY: गोमेदः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalice
CHALICE: चषकः: v. Cup.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalk
CHALK (subs.):<BR>(1) कठिनी;<BR>(2) खटिका;<BR>(3)<BR>धातूपलः।<BR>Red c.:<BR>गैरिकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalk
CHALK (v. t.): कठिन्या<BR>or<BR>खटिकया चिह्नयति (चिह्न, c.<BR>10.)<BR>or<BR>अङ्कयति (अङ्क्, c. 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalk out
CHALK OUT (v. t.): निर्दिशति (दिश्, c. 6.),<BR>a c. ed<BR>out path<BR>निर्दिष्टमार्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalky
CHALKY:<BR>I Abounding in c.: कठिनीमयः (यी,<BR> यं) (?).<BR>II Resembling c.: कठिनीसदृश<BR>(शी, शं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

challenge
CHALLENGE (v. t.):<BR>I To call out:<BR>(1) आह्व- [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">Page113</a>]<BR>यते (ह्वे, c. l),<BR>Śiśupāla fearlessly c. d Kri-<BR>shna<BR>गतभीराह्वयत चेदिराण्मुरारिम्, Si. xx. 1.;<BR>(2)<BR>आकारयति (c. of कृ),<BR>to c. to war<BR>प्रधनायाकारयितुम्,<BR>Si. xvi. 52.<BR>II To defy: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>object to (as jurors) दूषयति (c. of दुष्) (?).<BR>IV To claim, demand: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=112" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

challenge
CHALLENGE (subs.):<BR>I Calling out to fight:<BR>आह्वानम।<BR>II Defiance: q. v.<BR>III Claim,<BR>demand: q. v.<BR>IV In law: दूषणम् (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

challenger
CHALLENGER: आह्वानकारिन् (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chalybeate
CHALYBEATE (adj.): लौहगर्भः (र्भा, र्भं) (?), and<BR>sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamber
CHAMBER:<BR>I A room: q. v.: कोष्ठः।<BR>II A bed-<BR>-chamber: q. v.<BR>III A close space: कोष्ठः (?).<BR>Ph.<BR>C. of commerce:<BR>वणिक्सभा (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamberlain
CHAMBERLAIN: कञ्चु किन् (m.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamber-maid
CHAMBER-MAID: *कोष्ठदासी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamber-pot
CHAMBER-POT: मूत्राधारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chameleon
CHAMELEON:<BR>(1) कृकलासः;<BR>(2) सरटः;<BR>(3) कुला-<BR>हकः;<BR>(4) प्रतिसूर्यः, -कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamfer
CHAMFER:<BR>I Verb: v. To groove, channel.<BR>II Subs.: v. Groove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamois
CHAMOIS: Perh: रुरुः; वातमृगविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chamomile
