champion
CHAMPION:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) योधः:<BR>(2) भटः।<BR>II<BR>Fig.: Defender: q. v.: गोप्त्ट (m.), c. of liberty<BR>*गोप्ता स्वाधीनतायाः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chance
CHANCE (subs.):<BR>I An accident: दैवम् (=fate:<BR>q. v.),<BR>disregarding c.<BR>दैवं निहत्य, H. Ph.:<BR>by<BR>c.<BR>दैवात्। v. Accidentally;<BR>game of c.<BR>अक्षादि-<BR>क्रीडा।<BR>II Any thing of c.: expr. by दैवायत्तः<BR>(त्ता, त्तं)<BR>or<BR>दैवाधीनः (ना, नं), high^1 birth is c.<BR>दैवायत्तं कुले जन्म, Ve.<BR>III Possibility of an<BR>occurrence सम्भवः (?),<BR>theory of c. s<BR>*सम्भवविज्ञानम्।<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chance
CHANCE (v. i.): expr. by दैवात्, etc.;<BR>I. c. d<BR>to be there<BR>दैवात्तत्राहमभवम्: v. Accidentally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chancel
CHANCEL: वृतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chancellor
CHANCELLOR: प्राड्विवाकः (?); मुख्यविचारकः (?).<BR>C. of the exchequer:<BR>कोषाधीशः; C. of a university:<BR>*विश्वविद्यालयाधीशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

