chandler
CHANDLER:<BR>I Lit: *वर्तिकारः।<BR>II Any dea-<BR>-ler: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

change
CHANGE (v. t.):<BR>I To alter:<BR>(1) परिवर्तयति (c.<BR>of वृत्)<BR>or<BR>परिवर्त्तं, परिवर्तनं<BR>or<BR>परिवृत्तिं करोति,<BR>should<BR>c. the deed<BR>करणं परिवर्तयेत्, M.;<BR>what, she had c. d<BR>her voice<BR>कथं स्वरपरिवर्तः कृतः, Mr. i.;<BR>(2) by<BR>अन्यः (न्या, न्यत्)<BR>or<BR>भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं)<BR>or<BR>अन्तर-<BR>-affixed:<BR>as if you are c. d in appearance<BR>त्वमन्य-<BR>माकारमिवाभिपन्नः। Ki. iii. 43.<BR>II To substi-<BR>-tute one for another:<BR>c. ing our rings<BR>अङ्गुलीयक-<BR>विनिमयं कृत्वा, D. ii.<BR>III To exchange:<BR>(1)<BR>परिवर्तयति (?);<BR>(2) by circulo:<BR>go and c. this<BR>note<BR>*पत्रमिदं दत्त्वा टङ्कमानय।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

change
CHANGE (v. i.):<BR>(1) परिवर्तते (वृत्, c. l),<BR>my<BR>character has c. d with my appearance<BR>रूपेणैव सह<BR> परिवृत्तो मे स्वमावः, D. iii.;<BR>in a moment, it c. s<BR>for me into something^1 else<BR>क्षणेन तन्मे परिवर्ततेऽन्यथा,<BR>V.;<BR>(2) by अन्यः (न्या, न्यत्)<BR>or<BR>भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं)<BR>ar<BR>अन्तर- affixed and a verb:<BR>seeing that its<BR>colour c. d in a golden vessel<BR>कनकभाजने वर्णान्तर-<BR>मुपगतमुपलभ्य, Mu.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

change
CHANGE (subs.):<BR>I Alteration:<BR>(1) परिवृत्तिः,<BR> परिवर्तः<BR>or<BR>परिवर्तनम् (best equiv.), c. of dress<BR>वेषपरिवर्तनम्, Sah.:<BR>in this world, full of c.<BR>परि-<BR>वर्तिनि संसारे, P.;<BR>(2) विपर्ययः (incongruous c.),<BR>c. of vehicles<BR>प्रवहाणां विपर्ययः, Mr.; c. of dress<BR>वेषविपर्ययः, P. i. 3.;<BR>(3) विकारः, विकृतिः or<BR>विक्रिथा (c. of form or nature: gen. for worse),<BR>even at death, there is no c. in the character of<BR>the good:<BR>प्राणान्तेऽपि प्रकृतिविकृतिर्जायते नोत्तमानाम्,<BR>Ma. n;<BR>(4) परिणामः (c. brought by time),<BR>D. s. Ph.:<BR>O, what a c. in the sites of these<BR>places<BR>अहो अनवस्थितो भूमिसन्निवेशः, U. ii.<BR>II Of<BR>Government: परिवर्तः<BR>or<BR>परिवृत्तिः<BR>III Ex-<BR>-change: q. v.<BR>IV Small coins, etc.: क्षुद्र-<BR>मुद्रा [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">Page114</a>] (?). Ph. give me c. for a 10-rupee note<BR>*दशटङ्कपत्रं गृहीत्वा टङ्कान् देहि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=113" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

changeable
CHANGEABLE:<BR>I Mutable, variable: q. v.<BR>II Fickle, inconstant: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

changeableness
CHANGEABLENESS: v. Mutability, fickleness,<BR>inconstancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

changeless
CHANGELESS:<BR>I Immutable: q. v.<BR>II Cons-<BR>-tant: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

changeling
CHANGELING: परिवर्तितशिशुः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

changer
CHANGER:<BR>I Lit.: परिवर्तकारिन् (f. णी).<BR>II<BR>A money-c.: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

channel
CHANNEL (subs.):<BR>I The bed of a stream:<BR>गर्भः।<BR>II Current: q. v.: स्रोतस् (n.)<BR>III A<BR>canal: प्रणाली।<BR>IV A strait.: q. v.: *सागर-<BR>सन्धिः।<BR>V A furrow, as in a column: रेखा।<BR>VI Means of conveying (as of news): मार्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

channel
CHANNEL (v. t.):<BR>I To cut channels in: कुल्याः<BR> खनति (खन्, c. 2.),<BR>or<BR>करोति (with loc.),<BR>II<BR>To groove: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chant
