CHANTRY: *गीतमन्दिरम्:.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaos
CHAOS:<BR>I Lit.: Ph. it was (all)<BR>c.<BR>आसीदिदन्तमो-<BR>भूतम्, M. i. 5.<BR>II Fig.: v. Confusion, dis-<BR>-order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaotic
CHAOTIC:<BR>I Lit.: Ph.<BR>the world was in a c.<BR>state:<BR>प्रकृतौ लीनं विश्वमासीत्, V. p. com.<BR>II<BR>Confused: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chap
CHAP (subs.):<BR>I A man or body: q. v.:<BR>माणवकः।<BR>II A cleft or gap: q. v. Ph.:<BR>c. in<BR>the feet.<BR>पाददारी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chapel
CHAPEL: धर्ममन्दिरम्: v. Church.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaplain
CHAPLAIN: पुरोहितः; आचार्यः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaplaincy
CHAPLAINCY, CHAPLAINSHIP: पौरोहित्यम्; आचार्य-<BR>त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaplet
CHAPLET:<BR>(1) माला;<BR>(2) स्रज् (f.): v. Gar-<BR>-land.<BR>C. of beads:<BR>अक्षमाला।<BR>C. on a peacock's<BR>head:<BR>शिखा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chapman
CHAPMAN: आपणिकः: v. Trader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chapter
CHAPTER:<BR>I A division of a book:<BR>(1)<BR>अध्यायः;<BR>(2) परिच्छेदः (=section);<BR>(3) उच्छ्वासः<BR>(rare).<BR>II A body of canons *केननसम्प्रदायः;<BR>धर्मोपासकाः (m. pl.).<BR>III Their meeting:<BR>केननसभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chapter-house
CHAPTER-HOUSE: केननसभागारम्; धर्मशाला (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

char
CHAR (v. t.): अङ्गारीकरोति (कृ, c. 8.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

char
CHAR, CHARE:<BR>I Subs: v. Job.<BR>II Verb:<BR>v. To perform, do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

character
CHARACTER:<BR>I A distinctive mark:<BR>(1)<BR>अक्षरम्,<BR>the c. s agree<BR>संवदन्त्यक्षराणि, Mu. v.;<BR>(2)<BR>वर्ण (mn.).<BR>II Moral qualities collectively:<BR>(1) शीलम्, whose caste and c. is not known:<BR>अज्ञातकुलशीलः (ला, लं), H.; possessed of c.:<BR>शीलसमन्वितः (ता, तं), Mr.;<BR>(2) स्वभावः,<BR>of a<BR>fallen c.:<BR>नष्टस्वभावः (वा, वं), M. n.;<BR>(3)<BR>चरित्रम्<BR>or<BR>चारित्रम्, even (my) c. has been stained:<BR>चारित्रमपि दूषितम्, Mr. iii. Ph.: a bad c.:<BR>(1)<BR>दुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) असत् (f. ती),<BR>by checking<BR>bad c. s:<BR>नियमनादसताम्, R. ix. 6.<BR>III Repu-<BR>-tation: q. v.<BR>IV Nature, characteristic:<BR>q. v.<BR>V. Quality, capacity: रूपम्। Ph.:<BR>assum-<BR>ing the c. of an astrologer:<BR>कार्तान्तिको नाम भूत्वा,<BR>D.<BR>VI. A person sp. in a play: अङ्गिन् (m.)<BR>(?): v. Part, person.<BR>Leading c.<BR>नायकः (the<BR>man), नायिका (the woman).<BR>VII Account,<BR>description: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

characteristic
CHARACTERISTIC (adj.):<BR>(1) स्वाभाविकः (की,<BR> कं): v. Natural;<BR>(2) विशेषः (षा, षं): v.<BR>Peculiar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

characteristic
CHARACTERISTIC (subs.): स्वभावः (=nature:<BR>q. v.),<BR>this is the c. of benevolent men<BR>स्वभाव एवैष<BR> परोपकारिणाम्, Sa.;<BR>(2) लक्षणम् (mark: q. v.),<BR>the c.s of a bold woman:<BR>प्रगल्भालक्षणम्, Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

characteristically
CHARACTERISTICALLY: सहजरीत्या (?); स्वभावा-<BR>नुयायि (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

characterize
CHARACTERIZE: (v.)<BR>I To be a charac-<BR>-teristic of: expr. by subs.: this c. s him:<BR>एष तस्य स्वभावः।<BR>II To assign a character<BR>to:<BR>(1) वर्णयति (वर्ण्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>describe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charade
CHARADE: सर्वतोभद्रः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charcoal
CHARCOAL: अङ्गार (mn.); अलातम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charge
CHARGE (v.):<BR>I To attack: q. v.: अभियुनक्ति<BR>(युज्, c. 7.).<BR>II To accuse: q. v.: अभियुनक्ति।<BR>III To load: q. v. Ph.:<BR>to c. a gun<BR>*वन्दुकं [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">Page115</a>]<BR>पूरयति।<BR>IV To command or exhort: q. v.:<BR>शास्ति (शास्, c. 2.). V. To regard as a debt<BR>(?): याचते (याच्, c. l.) (=ask), to c. interest:<BR>वृद्धिं याचते;<BR>to c. for delivery:<BR>समर्पणव्ययं<BR> याचते (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=114" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charge
CHARGE (subs.):<BR>I Attack: q. v.: अभियोगः<BR>II Accusation: q. v.: अभियोगः।<BR>III Burden,<BR>load: q. v.<BR>IV Injunction: q. v.<BR>V A<BR>trust: q. v.: निक्षेपः।<BR>VI Care, management:<BR>q. v.: रक्षा<BR>or<BR>रक्षणं,<BR>to give in c.:<BR>रक्षणार्थं ददाति।<BR>VII Money to be paid:<BR>(1) व्ययः<BR>(=expense);<BR>(2) अर्थः (=price);<BR>(3) देयम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chargeable
CHARGEABLE:<BR>I Subject to be accused:<BR>अभियोज्यः (ज्या, ज्यं).<BR>II S. to a claim:<BR>c.<BR>with taxes:<BR>देयशुल्कः (ल्का, ल्कं) (?).<BR>III Attri-<BR>-butable: q. v.<BR>IV Burdensome: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charger
CHARGER:<BR>I A large dish: पात्रम्।<BR>II A<BR>warhorse: वाजिन् (m.): v. Horse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charily
CHARILY: v. Sparingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chariness
CHARINESS: v. Parsimony.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chariot
CHARIOT:<BR>(1) रथः,<BR>to step a c.<BR>रथं स्थापयति, v.;<BR>(2) स्यन्दनः,<BR>to drive a c.<BR>स्यन्दनं वाहयति, Ku.:<BR>v. Carriage.<BR>One who fights from a c.<BR>रथिन्<BR>(m.), Mah;<BR>c. -race:<BR>रथचर्या (?), K.;<BR>divine<BR>c.<BR>विमान (mn.), Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charioteer
CHARIOTEER:<BR>(1) सारथिः;<BR>(2) सूतः;<BR>(3)<BR>नियन्तृ;<BR>(4) यन्तृ (m.);<BR>(5) क्षत्तृ (m.);<BR>(6)<BR>रथवाहकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charitable
CHARITABLE:<BR>I Liberal, bountiful: q. v.:<BR>वदान्यः (न्या, न्यं).<BR>II Benevolent, kind:<BR>q. v.: उदारः (रा, रं).<BR>III Favourable: q. v.:<BR>अनुकूलः (ला, लं). Ph.:<BR>c. dispensary<BR>*दानार्थम्<BR> औषधालयः;<BR>c. institution<BR>*दानप्रभवा शाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charitably
CHARITABLY: सदयम्: v. Kindly, favourably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charity
CHARITY:<BR>I Love: भूतानुकम्पा, R.<BR>II. Libera-<BR>-lity: q. v.: वदान्यता। An act of c.:<BR>(1) पूर्तम्<BR>(of public c.);<BR>(2) दत्तम् (of private c.),<BR>by<BR>acts of c.<BR>पूर्तदत्तसाघनैः, S.<BR>III. The disposition<BR>to form kindly judgment: औदार्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charlatan
CHARLATAN:<BR>(1) नरेन्द्राभिमानिन् (m.) (=a<BR>quack-doctor), D.;<BR>(2) कलाभिमानिन् (m.) (in<BR>gen.): v. Quack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charlatanry
CHARLATANRY:<BR>(1) कलाभिमानित्वम् (in gen.<BR>sense);<BR>(2) नरेन्द्राभिमानित्वम् (medical qua-<BR>-ckery).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charless wain
CHARLES'S WAIN:<BR>(1) सप्तर्षयः (m. pl.);<BR>(2)<BR>चित्रशिखण्डिनः (m. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charlock
CHARLOCK: सर्षपजातीयलताविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charm
CHARM (subs.):<BR>I A magic spell: मन्त्रः,<BR>a<BR>snake-catcher who is not versed in c. s and medi-<BR>cinal plants<BR>अमन्त्रौषधिकुशलो व्यालग्राही, Mu.<BR>II<BR>An amulet:<BR>(1) रक्षाकरण्डः, Sa.;<BR>(2)<BR>अपराजिता (a plant used as a c.), Sa.;<BR>III<BR>Anything that fascinates:<BR>(1) by the adj.:<BR>v. C.ing;<BR>(2) मनोहरत्वम् etc.,<BR>collecting the<BR>scattered c. s<BR>बहुधागतां कमनीयतां समभिहृत्य, Ki.<BR>Ph.:<BR>c. of beauty:<BR>रूपलावण्यम्; रूपसम्पद् (f.), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charm
CHARM (v. t.):<BR>I Lit.: मन्त्रैर्वशीकरोति।<BR>II To<BR>allay, assuage: q. v.<BR>III To enchant:<BR>(1)<BR>मोहयति, परि- (c. of मुह्), let (it) not c. you:<BR>भवन्तं मा मूमुहत्, Ma.;<BR>(2) हरति (हृ, c. l.) (=to<BR>allure),<BR>c. d the king<BR>धराधिपञ्जहार, R. ix. 69.;<BR>(3) रमयति (c. of रम्) (=to delight: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charmer
CHARMER:<BR>I Lit.: मन्त्रज्ञः: v. Magician.<BR>II An enchanter: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charming
CHARMING (adj.):<BR>(1) मनोहरः (रा, रं), and sim.<BR>comp. s,<BR>c. lake<BR>हृदयहारि सरः, K.;<BR>(2) मोहनः<BR>(नी, नं);<BR>(3) कमनीयः (या, यं): v. Beautiful,<BR>pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charmingly
CHARMINGLY: expr. by adj. or by past in-<BR>-declinable part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charnel-house
CHARNEL-HOUSE: मृतानामस्थिसञ्चयस्थानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chart
CHART: *सामुद्रचित्रम्: v. Map.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charter
CHARTER (subs.): शासनम् शास<BR>or<BR>नपत्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charter
CHARTER (v.):<BR>I To grant a c. to: शासनं<BR> ददाति (दा, c. 3.) (?), M. n.<BR>II To hire or let<BR>(a ship): q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

charterparty
CHARTERPARTY: *पोतभाटकसभयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chary
CHARY: v. Sparing, close.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chase
CHASE (v. t.):<BR>I To hunt, pursue: q. v.:<BR>मृग्यति<BR>or<BR>मृगयते (मृग्, c. 4 and 10).<BR>II To<BR>chase away or off: i. e. to drive away:<BR>q. v.: निरस्यति (अस्, c. 4.).<BR>III To engrave:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chase
CHASE (subs.):<BR>I Hunting: q. v.: मृगया।<BR>II Pursuit: q. v.: विमार्गणम्।<BR>III An [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">Page116</a>]<BR>open hunting ground: अनावृता मृगयाभूमिः।<BR>IV That which is chased: मृग्यः (ग्या, ग्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=115" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaser
CHASER:<BR>I Engraver: q. v.<BR>II Hunting:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chasm
CHASM:<BR>(1) रन्ध्रम्;<BR>(2) दरी;<BR>(3) विलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chaste
CHASTE:<BR>I Of morals:<BR>(1) सती (a c.<BR>woman);<BR>(2) शुचि (mfn.).<BR>II Pure,<BR>correct: q. v.: विशुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chastely
CHASTELY:<BR>I Of morals: शुचि।<BR>II Of<BR>language: विशुद्धम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chasten
CHASTEN, CHASTENING: v. Chastise, chastise-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chasteness
CHASTENESS: v. Chastity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chastise
CHASTISE (v. t.):<BR>(1) निगृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.): v.<BR>To punish;<BR>(2) उपालभते (लभ्, c. l) (re-<BR>-prove).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chastisement
CHASTISEMENT: निग्रहः,<BR>I will inflict proper c. on<BR>you:<BR>तव यथोचितं निग्रहं करोमि, P.: v. Punish-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chastiser
CHASTISER:<BR>(1) निग्रहीतृ (m.);<BR>(2) निग्रहकारिन्<BR>(m.): v. Punisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chastity
CHASTITY:<BR>I Female c.: सतीत्वम्।<BR>II Control<BR>of the passions: जितेन्द्रियत्वम्।<BR>III Purity of<BR>style: विशुद्धिः, Ki. xiv. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chat
CHAT (v. i.): विश्रब्धम् आलपति (लप्, c. l.): v.<BR>To converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chat
CHAT (subs.):<BR>(1) विश्रम्भालापः;<BR>(2) सङ्कथाः v.<BR>Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chattels
CHATTELS: अस्थावरसम्पत्तिः (moveable pro-<BR>-perty): v. Goods.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chatter
CHATTER (v. i.):<BR>I To utter inarticulate<BR>sounds:<BR>(1) किलकिलायते (nomi.) (of the<BR>monkey);<BR>(2) चटचटायते (nomi.) (as in fry-<BR>-ing);<BR>(3) किकिकरोति (of the jay);<BR>(4)<BR>चूङ्करोति (of young birds).<BR>II To jabber:<BR>जल्पति (जल्प्, c. l).<BR>III Of the teeth: ‘with<BR>c. ing teeth’ दन्तैर्दन्तान्निष्पीड्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chatter
CHATTER, CHATTERING (subs.):<BR>I An inarti-<BR>-culate sound:<BR>(1) किलकिलारवः, D;<BR>(2)<BR>चटचटाशब्दः, Mah. etc.<BR>II Idle talk: जल्पितम्:<BR>v. Babble.<BR>III Of teeth: दन्तसङ्घर्षणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chatterbox
CHATTERBOX:<BR>(1) वाचाटः;<BR>(2) वाचालः: v.<BR>Babbler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chatty
CHATTY: संलापिन् (f. नी): v. Talkative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheap
CHEAP:<BR>I Of small cost:<BR>(1) अल्पार्थः (र्था,<BR> र्थं);<BR>(2) अल्पभूल्यः (ल्या, ल्यं);<BR>(3) अल्पार्हः<BR>(र्हा, र्हं).<BR>II Easily procurable: सुलभः (भा,<BR> भं), and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheapen
CHEAPEN:<BR>(1) सुलभीकरोति (?);<BR>(2) मूल्यं पातयति<BR>(c. of पत्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheaply
CHEAPLY, CHEAP (adv.):<BR>(1) अल्पमूल्येन, very c.<BR>अल्पीयसा मूल्येन, D.<BR>(2) अल्पार्घेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheapness
CHEAPNESS:<BR>(1) अल्पमूल्यता;<BR>(2) अल्पार्धता;<BR>(3)<BR>सुलभत्वं, ता। For dif.: V. Cheap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheat
CHEAT (v. t.):<BR>(1) वञ्चते<BR>or<BR>वञ्चयते, प्र-, परि-, (वञ्च्,<BR>c. l. and 10.), (that)<BR>you will not be c. ed by<BR>rogues:<BR>न वञ्च्यसे धूर्तैः, K.;<BR>(2) प्रतारयति (c. of<BR>तॄ): v. To deceive;<BR>(3) विप्रलभते (लभ्, c.<BR>1.) (rare), I see none, who was not firmly<BR>embraced and at the same time c. ed by her (for-<BR>tune): न हि तं पश्यामि यो ह्यनया न निर्भरमुपगूढो यो<BR> वा न विप्रलब्धः, K.;<BR>(4) छलयति (nomi.), Gi. i.<BR>16.;<BR>(5) अभिसन्धत्ते (धा, c. 3.), by c. ing her<BR>इमामभिसन्धाय, Sa. N. B. Note how the indirect<BR>object is expressed in Sanskrit:<BR>you have<BR>c. ed me of my property:<BR>*वञ्चयित्वा मत्सम्पत्तिं<BR> हृतोऽसि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheat
CHEAT (subs.):<BR>I Cheating:<BR>(1) वञ्चना,<BR>(2)<BR>प्रतारणा: v. Deception.<BR>II A cheater:<BR>(1)<BR>वञ्चकः, प्र-,<BR>(2) प्रतारकः: v. Rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

check
CHECK (v. t.)<BR>I To restrain, curb, stop:<BR>q. v.: नि-यच्छति, सं-, (यम्, c. l.).<BR>II To<BR>reprove: q. v.<BR>III Of accounts: Perh:<BR>संशोधयति (c. of शुध्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

check
CHECK (subs.):<BR>I Restraint, hindrance:<BR>q. v.: प्रतिबन्धः।<BR>Without c.:<BR>निरर्गलम्, N.<BR>II A<BR>cheque: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

checker
CHECKER: v. Chequer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

checkmate
CHECKMATE:<BR>(1) *मातयति (nomi.),<BR>c. d.<BR>*मातः<BR>(ता, तं);<BR>(2) निश्चलः (ला, लं) करोति (?).<BR>(3)<BR>हन्ति (हन्, c. 2.), Rādhākānta.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheek
CHEEK:<BR>(1) कपोलः;<BR>(2) गण्डः;<BR>(3) गल्लः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheek-bone
CHEEK-BONE: कपोलास्थि (n.), and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheer
CHEER (subs.):<BR>I A shout of joy: हर्षनिस्वनः,<BR> आनन्दनिनादः, and sim. comp. s,<BR>with the c. s of<BR>the soldiers<BR>सैनिकहर्षनिस्वनैः, R. iii. 61.<BR>II A [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">Page117</a>]<BR>state of the mind: स्फूर्तिः, Ph.: ‘be of good c.’<BR>समाश्वसिहि।<BR>III Entertainment:<BR>good c.<BR>भोजन-<BR>विशेषाणि (n. pl.), H.<BR>IV. Countenance: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=116" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheer
CHEER (v. t.):<BR>I To gladden: q. v.: अभि-<BR>नन्दयति (c. of नन्द्).<BR>II To comfort: q. v.:<BR>समाश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्).<BR>III To salute or<BR>encourage with c. s हर्षनिस्वनैरभिनन्दयति।<BR>IV<BR>To incite: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheer
CHEER, CHEER UP (v. i.) सम्-आश्वसिति (श्वस, c.<BR>2.), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheerful
CHEERFUL: प्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं): v. Joyful, lively.<BR>“C. shouts” हर्षकिलकिलारवः D. vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheerfully
CHEERFULLY: Ph.:<BR>let the accomplished enjoy it<BR>c.:<BR>त- त्सुप्रसन्नमनसः कृतिनो भजन्ताम्, Vi. i: v.<BR>Gladly, joyfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheerfulness
CHEERFULNESS: प्रसन्नता<BR>or<BR>प्रसादः: v. Liveliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheerless
CHEERLESS:<BR>(1) विषण्णः (ण्णा, ण्णं);<BR>(2) अप्रसन्नः<BR>(न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(3) निरानन्दः (न्दा, न्दं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheese
CHEESE: *पणिरम्,<BR>c. monger:<BR>*पणिरविक्रेतृ (f. त्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheesf-cake
CHEESF-CAKE: *पणिरपिष्टकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chemical
CHEMICAL: रासायनः (नी, नं) (?), c. property:<BR>*रासायनधर्मः;<BR>c. combination:<BR>*रासायनसंयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chemically
CHEMICALLY: *रासायननियमानुसारेण, and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chemise
CHEMISE:<BR>(1) चलनम् (?);<BR>(2) युतकम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chemist
CHEMIST:<BR>I Lit.: रसायनविद्र (mfn.) (?); रसायन-<BR>प्रवीणः (णा, णं) (?); and sim. comp. s.<BR>II A<BR>druggist: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chemistry
CHEMISTRY: रसायनम् (?); पदार्थानां श्लेषविश्लेषपरिणाम-<BR>विज्ञानम्। Inorganic c. *भूतरसायनम्; organic c.:<BR>*व्यूढरसायनम्;<BR>practical c.<BR>*प्रयोगरसायनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cheque
CHEQUE: *धनपत्रम्; धनागाराद्धनदानार्थमनुज्ञापत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chequer
CHEQUER:<BR>I Lit: Ph.:<BR>with body c. ed with<BR>rainbow like-lines<BR>आखण्डलचापानुकारिभिर्लेखाभिः<BR> कल्माषितशरीरः, K.: v. To variegate.<BR>II To<BR>vary: मिश्रयति (मिश्र्, c. 10.): v. To mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chequered
CHEQUERED:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) कर्बुरः (रा, रं) or<BR>कर्बुरितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) शवलः (ला, लं);<BR>(3) कल्माषितः<BR>(ता, तं).<BR>II Fig.: Ph.: whose life is not c.?<BR>कस्यात्यन्तं सुखमुपनतं दुःखमेकान्ततो वा, Me.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chequer-work
CHEQUER-WORK: v. Tessellated, mosaic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cherish
CHERISH:<BR>I To foster, nurture: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>लालयति (लल्, c. 10.) (of children^1);<BR>(2)<BR>पालयति (पाल्, c. 10.) to<BR>c. virtue<BR>धर्मं पालयति,<BR>M. n.<BR>II To entertain, bear: बध्नाति, अनु-,<BR>(बन्ध्, c. 9.) (with loc.), c. ed great hatred (to-<BR>-wards her) द्वेषमल्पेतरं बबन्ध, D. vi.;<BR>who has<BR>c. ed enmity from before<BR>पूर्वानुबद्धवैरः, Mr.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cherisher
CHERISHER: पालयितृ (f. त्री): v. Encourager,<BR>supporter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cherry
CHERRY:<BR>I A fruit: *चेरिफलं।<BR>II A tree<BR>*चेरिवृक्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cherub
CHERUB: *किंरूपः; ईश्वरदूतविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chervil
CHERVIL: *पर्णभोदा; ओषधिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chess
CHESS: चतुरङ्गम्। C. -board:<BR>(1) शारिफलम्;<BR>(2)<BR>अष्टपादम्।<BR>King of c.:<BR>राजा;<BR>queen:<BR>राज्ञी;<BR>bishop:<BR>गजः;<BR>knight:<BR>अश्वः;<BR>castle:<BR>नौः;<BR>pawn:<BR>पदातिः;<BR>c. man:<BR>शारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chest
CHEST:<BR>I A box: q. v.: पेटिका।<BR>II The<BR>thorax, breast: q. v.: उरस् (n.), broad-c. ed<BR>व्यूढोरस्कः (स्का, स्कं), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chestnut
CHESTNUT (adj.): v. Red, brown. A c. horse:<BR>उकनाहः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chestnut
CHESTNUT (subs.): फलविशेषः।<BR>C.-tree:<BR>वृक्षविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chevaux-de-frise
CHEVAUX-DE-FRISE: v. Turnpike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chevalier
CHEVALIER: सादिन् (m.): v. Knight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chew
CHEW (v. t.): चर्वति<BR>or<BR>चर्वयति (चर्व्, c. l. and<BR>10.).<BR>To c. the cud:<BR>रोमन्थम् अभ्यस्यति (अस,<BR>c. 4.), Sa ii.<BR>or<BR>रोमन्थायते (nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chewing
CHEWING (subs.): चर्वणम्। Food which requires c.<BR>चर्व्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chicane
CHICANE (subs.):<BR>(1) छलम्;<BR>(2) कपटः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chicane
CHICANE (v.): छलं प्रयुनक्ति (युज्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>use.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chicanery
CHICANERY:<BR>(1) कपटः, skilful in following c.:<BR>कपटानुसारकुशलः, Mr.:<BR>(2) छलम्,<BR>c. is not admitted<BR>here:<BR>छलमत्र न गृह्यते, Mr.: v. Trick, so-<BR>-phistry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chiccory
CHICCORY: शाकप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chick
CHICK, CHICKEN: कुक्कुटशावः (of the hen); शावः<BR>(any young).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chicken-hearted
CHICKEN-HEARTED: i. e. timid, cowardly:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chicken-pox
CHICKEN-POX: सर्षपिका, Bha; बालानां रोगभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chick-pea
CHICK-PEA: चणकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chick-weed
CHICK-WEED: ओषधिविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=117" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chide
CHIDE:<BR>I To reprove, scold: q. v.: भर्त्सयति,<BR> निर्-, (भर्त्स्, c. 10.), but she chid her and rejected<BR>(her proposal): सा चैनां निर्भर्त्सयन्ती प्रत्याचचक्षे।<BR>II To roar: q. v.: रसति (रस्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chider
CHIDER: निर्भर्त्सयितृ (f. त्री): v. Reprover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chiding
CHIDING (subs.): भर्त्सना: v. Reproof.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chief
CHIEF (adj.):<BR>(1) प्रधानः (ना, नं), c. men (of a<BR>state) प्रधानपुरुषवर्गः, Mu. iii.; c. est reason:<BR>प्रधानतमं कारणम्, Mu. iv.;<BR>(2) मुख्यः (ख्या, ख्यं),<BR>c. minister:<BR>मुख्यमन्त्री, P.;<BR>(3) अग्रः (ग्रा, ग्रं) or<BR>अग्रिमः (मा, मं) (=front, first),<BR>c. seat:<BR>अग्रासनम्,<BR>Mu.;<BR>(4) वृन्दारकः (का, कं) rare: v. Also,<BR>first, great.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chief
CHIEF (subs.):<BR>(1) ईशः (=lord: q. v.),<BR>the c.<BR>of Kamroop:<BR>कामरूपाणामीशः, R. iv. 83.;<BR>(2)<BR>पतिः, अधि-, (=master: q. v.), c. of a clan:<BR>गणपतिः, Ki.;<BR>(3) नायकः (=leader),<BR>c. of police-<BR>men<BR>आरक्षकनायकः, D.;<BR>(4) by the adj. (rare),<BR>c. of Rākṣasas:<BR>नृभुजां प्रधानः, B.;<BR>(5) अग्रणी,<BR>and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chiefly
CHIEFLY:<BR>(1) प्रधानतः (=principally);<BR>(2)<BR>विशेषेण (=especially);<BR>(3) प्रायेण (= mostly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chieftain
CHIEFTAIN: ईशः: v. Chief (subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chilblain
CHILBLAIN:<BR>(1) विपादिका (of the feet);<BR>(2)<BR>हस्तस्फोटः (?) (of the hand).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

child
CHILD:<BR>I A boy or girl: q. v.:<BR>(1) शिशुः;<BR>(2) अर्भकः (rare);<BR>(3) पृथुकः (rare);<BR>(4) डिम्भः<BR>(rare).<BR>II With reference to parents, a<BR>son or daughter: q. v.:<BR>(1) अपत्यम्;<BR>(2) सूनुः<BR>(mf.);<BR>(3) सन्तानः;<BR>(4) तोकम् (rare). In addres-<BR>-sing children वत्स (m.) and वत्सा (f.) is<BR>generally used.<BR>To be with c.:<BR>पुत्रिणी, Mah:<BR>v. Pregnant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

child-bearing
CHILD-BEARING: v. Child-birth. Past c.:<BR>निष्फला (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

child-bed
CHILD-BED: प्रसवावस्था।<BR>In c.:<BR>जायमाने सन्ताने, and<BR>sim. expr. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

child-birth
CHILD-BIRTH:<BR>(1) प्रसवः; from the pains of c.<BR>प्रसववेदनया, K.:<BR>up to c.:<BR>आ प्रसवात्, Sr.;<BR>(2) प्रजननम्, Sr.;<BR>(3) गर्भनिर्गमः, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childhood
CHILDHOOD:<BR>(1) शैशवम्;<BR>(2) बाल्यम्;<BR>(3)<BR>कौमारम्;<BR>(4) शैशवावस्था;<BR>(5) बाल्यकालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childish
CHILDISH:<BR>I Pertaining to a child: ex-<BR>-pressed by gen. or comp.<BR>II Puerile,<BR>silly: q. v.: बालिशः (शा, शं),<BR>why do you<BR>entertain c. sentiments<BR>किं बालिशमतिमास्थितोऽसि,<BR>Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childishly
CHILDISHLY:<BR>(1) बालवत्;<BR>(2) शिशुरिवः v.<BR>Child and like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childishness
CHILDISHNESS:<BR>(1) शिशुत्वम् (rare), N. iii. 15.;<BR>(2) बालिश्यम्<BR>or<BR>बालिशता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childless
CHILDLESS:<BR>(1) निरपत्यः (त्या, त्यं);<BR>(2) अनपत्यः<BR>(त्या, त्यं);<BR>(3) निःसन्तानः (ना, नं);<BR>(4) अपुत्रः<BR>(त्रा, त्रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childlessness
CHILDLESSNESS:<BR>(1) निरपत्यता<BR>or<BR>अनपत्यता;<BR>(2)<BR>निःसन्तानता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

childlike
CHILDLIKE:<BR>(1) बालरूपः (पा, पं);<BR>(2) शिशुसदृशः<BR>(शा, शं); and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chill
CHILL (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: शीतम्: v. Cold.<BR>II<BR>Fig.: v. Discouragement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chill
CHILL (adj.):<BR>I Cold: q. v.: शीतः (ता, तं).<BR>II Affected with cold: शीतार्तः (र्ता, र्तं),<BR>and sim. comp. s<BR>III Dejected: q. v.:<BR>विषण्णः (f. ण्णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chill
CHILL (v. t.):<BR>I To cool: q. v.<BR>II To dis-<BR>-courage: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chilli
CHILLI: रक्तमरीचम्; लङ्कामरीचम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chilliness
CHILLINESS: शैत्यम्: v. Coldness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chilly
CHILLY: शिशिरः (रा, रं): v. Cold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chime
CHIME (subs.):<BR>I Harmony: q. v.<BR>II Har-<BR>-monious sound, as of bells: (?). घण्टारवः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chime
CHIME (v.):<BR>I To sound: q. v.: वादयति (c. of<BR>वद्).<BR>II To harmonise, correspond: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chimera
CHIMERA: कपोलकल्पितम्: v. Fancy, phantom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chimerical
CHIMERICAL: v. Imaginary, empty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chimney
CHIMNEY:<BR>I Hearth: q. v.<BR>II A passage<BR>for the exit of smoke: धूमनाली।<BR>III Of a<BR>lamp: *चुङ्गी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chimney-corner
