chimpanzee
CHIMPANZEE: वनमानुषः (?); वानरविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chin
CHIN:<BR>(1) चिवुकम्;<BR>(2) चिवु (n.) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

china
CHINA (adj.): चीन-,<BR>c. clay<BR>*चीनमृत्तिका;<BR>c. -<BR>orange:<BR>नारङ्गम्;<BR>c. -rose:<BR>जवा; c. -silk<BR>चीनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=118" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

