CHINA (subs.): i. e.:<BR>c. -ware:<BR>*चीनपात्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chine
CHINE:<BR>I The back-bone: q. v.<BR>II A piece<BR>of meat: Perh.: पृष्ठम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chink
CHINK (subs.):<BR>I A fissure: छिद्रम्।<BR>II Tinkl-<BR>-ing: शिञ्जितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

