chinky
CHINKY: छिद्रशतैरलङ्कृ तः (ता, तं): v. Gaping.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chintz
CHINTZ: *चित्रकार्पासम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chip
CHIP (subs.): खण्डः,<BR>a c. of wood<BR>काष्ठखण्डः: v.<BR>Piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chip
CHIP (v. t.): खण्डशः छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.)<BR>or<BR>कृन्तति<BR>(कृत्, c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chirp
