chirp
CHIRP, CHIRPING: विरावः: v. Noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chiretta
CHIRETTA: the plant:<BR>(1) भूनिम्बः;<BR>(2) किरात-<BR>तिक्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chisel
