chisel
CHISEL (v. t.): तक्षति, परि-, (तक्ष्, c. l.),<BR>c. ing<BR>with hatchets his Kshatriya body:<BR>क्षात्रदेहं परितक्ष्य<BR> टङ्कैः, Ana.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chit-chat
CHIT-CHAT: विश्रम्भालापः: v. Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chitterlings
CHITTERLINGS: भृष्टशौकरनाड्य: (f. pl.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chivalrous
CHIVALROUS: शौर्यदाक्षिण्यादिगुणोपेतः (ता, तं) (?):<BR>v. Brave, gallant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

