CHLORIDE: *पीतहरित-,<BR>c. of mercury:<BR>*पीतहरित-<BR>पारदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

