CHLORINE: *पीतहरितम्; पीतहरिद्वायुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chocolate
CHOCOLATE: *चकलाटम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choice
CHOICE (subs.):<BR>I The act of choosing:<BR>(1)<BR>ग्रहणम् (=acceptance);<BR>(2) वरणम् (= a. of a<BR>husband);<BR>(3) अभिलाषः (=desire). Ph. to<BR>make a c. of: v. To choose.<BR>II The power<BR>of c.: v. Option.<BR>III Discrimination:<BR>q. v.<BR>IV The thing chosen: expr. by<BR>adjs: ईप्सितः (ता, तं); अभीष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं), etc.<BR>Ph.:<BR>who is your c.:<BR>कस्मिंस्ते हृदयाभिनिवेशः;<BR>V. iii.<BR>V The best part of anything:<BR>रत्नम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choice
CHOICE (adj.):<BR>I Superior in quality:<BR>(1)<BR>विशिष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) सर्वोत्तमः (मा, मं) (=best);<BR>(3) महार्हः (र्हा, र्हं) (=valuable),<BR>c. bed:<BR>भहार्ह-<BR>शय्या, Ki. Ph.:<BR>with c. food:<BR>भोजनविशेषैः, A.<BR>II Select: q. v.<BR>III Frugal: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choicely
CHOICELY:<BR>I With choice:<BR>(1) समीक्ष्य;<BR>(2)<BR>परितो वीक्ष्य।<BR>II Excellently: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choiceness
CHOICENESS:<BR>(1) विशिष्टता;<BR>(2) उत्कर्षः: v.<BR>Excellence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choir
CHOIR:<BR>I A band of singers:<BR>(1) गायकगणः;<BR>(2) *सङ्गायकगणः।<BR>II A part of a church:<BR>*सङ्गायकभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choke
CHOKE:<BR>I To stifle, suffocate: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>check: q. v.<BR>III To offend: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choler
CHOLER:<BR>I The bile: q. v.: पित्तम्।<BR>II<BR>Anger: q. v.: क्रोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cholera
CHOLERA: विसूचिका, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choleric
CHOLERIC:<BR>I Irascible: q. v.: क्रोधनः (ना, नं).<BR>II Angry: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choose
CHOOSE (v.):<BR>I To select:<BR>(1) वृणीते (वृ, c. 9.)<BR>(=to accept as, husband), whether (she)<BR>would c. me:<BR>वृणीत मां नेति, R. vi. 68.;<BR>(2) मनो<BR> बध्नाति (बन्ध् c. 9.) (with loc.) (to set one's<BR>mind), she chose (it) in preference to others:<BR>मनो बबन्धान्यरसान् विलंध्य सा, R. iii. 4.;<BR>(3)<BR>अभिलषति (लष्, c. l.), and whom (she) may c.:<BR>यञ्चाभिलषेत्, D. vi.: v. To desire;<BR>(4) by<BR>circum.,<BR>which of the two you c.:<BR>तयोरभिभतं<BR> वद, Vi. vi.;<BR>(5) गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.) (=to<BR>take: only when the context fixes the<BR>meaning).<BR>II To elect, appoint: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chop
CHOP (subs.): मांसफालिका, N.: v. Piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chop
CHOP (v. t.):<BR>I To mince: q. v.: विशकलयति<BR>(nomi.).<BR>II To exchange: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>bandy: q. v. Comp. s: c. off: v. To cut<BR>off; c. up.: v. To devour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chop-house
CHOP-HOUSE: *मासंफालिकागृहम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chopper
CHOPPER, CHOPPING-KNIFE: छुरिकाविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=119" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

choral
CHORAL: साङ्गीतिकः (की, कं), Williams: v.<BR>CHOIR.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=120" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

chord
