circular
CIRCULAR (adj.): मण्डलाकारः (रा, रं): v.<BR>Round. Ph.<BR>c. are:<BR>वृत्तखण्डम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circularity
CIRCULARITY (subs.) लेखविशेषः; *चक्रम्, c. file<BR>*चक्रश्रेणी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circularity
CIRCULARITY: मण्डलता, परि-, Ki. xiv. 64.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circularly
CIRCULARLY:<BR>(1) मण्डलेन;<BR>(2) मण्डलाकारेण,<BR>M. n.;<BR>(3) चक्राकारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circulate
CIRCULATE (v. t.):<BR>I Of the blood: परि-चलति<BR>(चल्, c. 1.) (?).<BR>II Fig.: भ्रमति<BR>or<BR>भ्राम्यति (भ्रम्,<BR>c. l. and 4.),<BR>and this strange news c. d.<BR>among the citizens:<BR>अभ्रमच्च पौरजानपदेष्वियभद्भुताय-<BR>माना वार्ता, D. III. Ph.: c. ing medium:<BR>*विनिमयद्वारम्;<BR>c. ing library:<BR>*भ्राम्यत्पुस्तकालयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circulation
CIRCULATION:<BR>I Of the blood: परिचलनम् (?).<BR>II Diffusion:<BR>(1) प्रसर्पणम्;<BR>(2) प्रसरः।<BR>III<BR>Currency:<BR>(1) प्रचारः;<BR>(2) प्रचलनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

