circumcision
CIRCUMCISION: लिङ्गाग्रचर्मच्छेदः, -नम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumference
CIRCUMFERENCE:<BR>(1) परिधिः;<BR>(2) परिवेशः;<BR>(3) परिवेष्टनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumflex
CIRCUMFLEX: स्वरितः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumfluent
CIRCUMFLUENT: परितः<BR>or<BR>समन्ततः विसारिन् (f. णी)<BR>or<BR>प्रवहत् (f. न्ती) etc.: v. To flow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumpacent
CIRCUMPACENT:<BR>(1) चतुर्दिश्यः (श्या, श्यं);<BR>(2)<BR>परितः स्थितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumlocution
CIRCUMLOCUTION: भङ्गिः<BR>or<BR>वाक्यमङ्गिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumnavigate
CIRCUMNAVIGATE: नावा<BR>or<BR>पोतेन परिभ्रमति (भ्रम्,<BR>c. l.)<BR>or<BR>पर्यटति (अट्, c. 1.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumnavigation
CIRCUMNAVIGATION: पोतेन परिभ्रमणम्<BR>or<BR>पर्यटनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumnavigator
CIRCUMNAVIGATOR: पोतेन परिभ्रमकारिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumposition
CIRCUMPOSITION: मण्डलीकरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumscribe
CIRCUMSCRIBE:<BR>I To describe: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>confine, limit: नियच्छति (यम्, c. l.)<BR>III To<BR>encircle, surround: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumspect
CIRCUMSPECT:<BR>(1) स्मीक्ष्यकारिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2)<BR>विमृश्यकारिन् (f. णी): v. Careful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumspection
CIRCUMSPECTION:<BR>(1) समोक्ष्यकारिता;<BR>(2) विमृश्य-<BR>कारिताः v. Prudence, caution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=121" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumspectly
