circumstance
CIRCUMSTANCE (subs.):<BR>I Condition: q. v.:<BR>अवस्था।<BR>II An event, incident: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>वृत्तान्तः;<BR>(2) वृत्तम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumstanced
