circumstantial
CIRCUMSTANTIAL:<BR>I Minute, particular:<BR>q. v.: सविशेषः (षा, षं).<BR>II Consisting of<BR>particular incidents: Ph.: c. evidence:<BR>*वृत्तान्तघटितं प्रमाणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumstantially
CIRCUMSTANTIALLY:<BR>(1) सविशेषं (=minutely);<BR>(2) यथावृत्तम् (=as it happened).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumvallate
CIRCUMVALLATE: वप्रेण वेष्टयति (c. of वेष्ट्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumvent
CIRCUMVENT: प्रतारयति (c. of तॄ): v. To<BR>cheat, deceive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circumvention
CIRCUMVENTION: प्रतारणाः v. Fraud, deception.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

circus
CIRCUS: *मण्डलरङ्गः; मण्डलाकारो रङ्गभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

