CITIZENSHIP: पौरत्वम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

citrine
CITRINE: जम्बीराभः (भा, भं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

citron
CITRON:<BR>I The tree मातुलुङ्गः; -कः,<BR>(2) वीजपूरः।<BR>II The fruit: वीजपूरम्; मातुलुङ्गफलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

city
CITY (subs.):<BR>(1) नगरम्, -री;<BR>(2) पुरम्, -री;<BR>(3) पुर्<BR>(f.): v. town.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

city
CITY (adj.):<BR>(1) by a tat. com. a., c. gate:<BR>पुरद्वारम्;<BR>(2) पौरः (री, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

civet
CIVET: गन्धद्रव्यभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

