CIVET or CIVET-CAT: An animal:<BR>(1) गन्ध-<BR>मार्जारः;<BR>(2) गन्धोतुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

civic
CIVIC: पौरः (री, रं): v. Civil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=122" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

civil
