clang
CLANG, CLANK (subs): टङ्कारः<BR>or<BR>टङ्कृतम्,<BR>by the<BR>c. of bells:<BR>घण्टानां टङ्कृतेन, K.: v. Din, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clanship
CLANSHIP: गणत्वम्। (?): v. Clan, race.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clap
CLAP (v. t.): Ph.<BR>to c. the hands:<BR>करतालं or<BR>करतालिकां ददाति (दा, c. 3.), Si. xv. 39.;<BR>(2)<BR>तलतालं वादयति (c. of वद्), Mah.;<BR>(3) हस्त-<BR>तालम् अर्पयति (c. of ऋ), (rare), N. iii. 6.;<BR>to c. the wings:<BR>पक्षौ धुनोति<BR>or<BR>धुनुते (धु, c. 7.),<BR>N. iii. 1. C. sometimes = to applaud; also<BR>= to cast: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clap
CLAP, CLAPPING (subs.):<BR>I Of hands:<BR>(1)<BR>करताल-(ली)-दानम्;<BR>(2) तलतालवादनम्। N. B. C.<BR>did not, among the Hindus, usually ex-<BR>-press applause, but note the following ex.:<BR>cheered me with huzzas and c. s.<BR>हर्षयामासुर्मां<BR> सिंहनादतलस्वनैः, Mah.<BR>II Of thunder:<BR>(1)<BR>स्फूर्जथुस्फूर्जितम्, Vi.;<BR>(2) वज्रनिष्पेषः;<BR>(3) वज्र-<BR>निर्घोषः;<BR>(4) मेधगर्जितम्।<BR>III Any loud noise:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clapper
CLAPPER: of a bell: *घण्टाताडनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clap-trap
CLAP-TRAP: v. Deceptive, counterfeit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

claret
CLARET: रक्तवर्णो मद्यविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clarification
CLARIFICATION:<BR>(1) शोधनम्;<BR>(2) शुद्धिः;<BR>(3)<BR>पावनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clarify
CLARIFY:<BR>(1) शोधयति (c. of शु);<BR>(2) पुनाति<BR>(पू, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clarion
CLARION: काहलः (?); शुषिरवाद्यविशेषः।<BR>C. -et:<BR>मुरली (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clash
CLASH (v. i.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) संघट्टते<BR>or<BR>घट्टयति<BR>(घट्ट, c. l. and 10).;<BR>(2) समाहन्ति (हन्, c. 2.).<BR>II Fig. To contradict, interfere: q. v.:<BR>विरुणद्धि (रुध्। c. 7.) (with acc.).<BR>II Noise<BR>produced by c. ing: चटचटाशब्दः, Mah.<BR>III<BR>Opposition, contradiction: q. v.: विरोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clash
CLASH (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) संघट्टः;<BR>(2) समाघातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clasp
CLASP (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: *संश्लेषकः।<BR>II An<BR>embrace: q. v.: परिष्वङ्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clasp
CLASP (v. t.):<BR>I Fasten (with acc.): q. v.:<BR>सम्बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.).<BR>II Embrace: q. v.:<BR>परिष्वजते (स्वञ्ज्, c. l.). Ph.:<BR>with c. ed<BR>hands<BR>कृताञ्जलि<BR>or<BR>बद्धाञ्जलि (mfn.).<BR>III To<BR>entwine: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clasper
CLASPER: i. e. tendril: प्रतानः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clasp-knife
CLASP-KNIFE: भङ्गयोग्या छुरिका (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

class
CLASS (subs.):<BR>I Of individuals: gen. not<BR>expr. d:<BR>there can be no association between<BR>the higher and lower c. es:<BR>सहापकृष्टैर्महतां न संगतम्<BR>Ki.;<BR>c. es. of citizens:<BR>पौराणां श्रेणयः, Nil.: v.<BR>Party, caste.<BR>II Of students: श्रेणी (or -णिः).<BR>III A division of objects:<BR>(1) वर्गः,<BR>we will<BR>now specify the c. es. of flesh:<BR>अत ऊध्वं मांस-<BR>वर्गानुदेक्ष्याभः, Sr.;<BR>(2) गणः (specially of<BR>verbs);<BR>(3) जातिः (=species).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

class
CLASS (v. t.):<BR>(1) वर्गीकरोति (?);<BR>(2) वर्गान्<BR> निर्दिशति (दिश्, c. 6.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

classic
CLASSIC (subs.):<BR>I In pl. the Greek and<BR>Latin literature: *ग्रीकलाटिनसाहित्यम्।<BR>II A<BR>c. al writer: विशिष्टलेखकः, and sim. comp. s<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

classically
CLASSICALLY:<BR>I Well: विशिष्टम्।<BR>II In<BR>classes: श्रेण्यनुसारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

classification
CLASSIFICATION:<BR>(1) वर्गनिर्देशः (?);<BR>(2) वर्गी-<BR>करणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

classify
CLASSIFY: v. To class.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clatter
CLATTER (v.): v. To rattle, prate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clatter
CLATTER, CLATTERING (subs.):<BR>c. of thunder-<BR>clouds:<BR>घनघटाघर्घरध्वनिः: v. Rattle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clause
CLAUSE:<BR>I An article or stipulation: q. v.:<BR>प्रकरणम् (?).<BR>II A part of a sentence: अङ्ग-<BR>वाक्यम्, Nil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clavicle
CLAVICLE: जत्रु (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

claw
CLAW (subs.): नखः<BR>or<BR>नखरः, R. xvi. 16.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

claw
CLAW (v. t.): नखैर्विदारयति (c. of दॄ): v. To tear,<BR>scratch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clay
CLAY: चिक्वनमृत्तिका, Bha.; मृदुमृद् (f.), C., and<BR>sim. comp.s;<BR>potters' c.:<BR>कुलालमृत्तिका;<BR>bricks'<BR>c.:<BR>इष्टकामृत्तिका (?).<BR>Made of c.<BR>मृन्मयः: (यी, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clayey
CLAYEY: चिक्वनमृद्बहुलः (ला, लं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clean
CLEAN (adj.):<BR>(1) शुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं), वि-, परि-,<BR>c.<BR>after a bath:<BR>स्नानविशुद्धगात्रः (f. त्री), Ku.;<BR>(2)<BR>शुचि (mfn.) (gen. = pure), c. ivory throne:<BR>गजदन्तासनं शुचि, R.;<BR>(3) घौतः (ता, तं) (=<BR>washed), wearing a suit of fine c. clothes:<BR>धौते दुकूले दधता, K.;<BR>(4) निर्मलः (ला, लं) (=free<BR>from dirt: often = clear). To become c.:<BR>शुध्यति (शुध, c. 4.), M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=123" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clean
CLEAN (v. t.):<BR>(1) शोधयति, वि-, परि-, (c. of शुध्),<BR>should c. teeth every day:<BR>दन्तान्नित्यं विशोधयेत्,<BR>Sr.;<BR>(2) मार्ष्टि<BR>or<BR>मार्जयति, प्र-, सं-, (मृज्, c. 2<BR>and 10) (=by rubbing or brushing),<BR>c. ing<BR>of ornaments:<BR>भृषणमृजाक्रिया, D. vi.;<BR>(3) धावयति<BR>or<BR>धावति (धाव्, c. 10 and l.)(with water),<BR>call Radanikā to c. our feet:<BR>रदनिकां शब्दायस्व<BR> पादौ धावितुम्, Mr. iii.;<BR>(4) पुनाति (पू, c. 9.)<BR>(from dirt: gen. fig: v. To purify);<BR>(5)<BR>नेनेक्ति<BR>or<BR>निंक्ते, निर्-, (निज्, c. 3. and 2) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clean
CLEAN (adv.): v. Entirely, altogether.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleanliness
CLEANLINESS:<BR>(1) शुद्धिः, वि-, परि-;<BR>(2) शौचम्;<BR>(3) निर्मलता;<BR>(4) शौचपरायणता (?) (habitual<BR>c.). For dif.: v. Clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleanly
CLEANLY (adj.): आचारशुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं) (?)<BR>or<BR>शौच-<BR>परायणः (णा, णं) (?): v. Neat. Ph. c. (i. e.<BR>cleansing)<BR>powder:<BR>शोधनचूर्णम्, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleanly
CLEANLY (adv.): expr. by adj., c. dressed:<BR>शुचिवस्त्रधरः (रा, रं), V. p.: v. Neatly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleanness
CLEANNESS: v. Cleanliness, purity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleanse
CLEANSE (v.): शोधयति; पुनातिः v. To clean.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleansing
CLEANSING (subs.): Lit. or Fig.:<BR>(1) शोधनम् or<BR>शुद्धिः, वि-, परि-;<BR>(2) मार्जन-<BR>or<BR>मृजाक्रिया (by rubb-<BR>-ing or brushing);<BR>(3) धावनम् (with water).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear
CLEAR (adj.):<BR>I Transparent, bright:<BR>(1)<BR>विमलः, निर्मलः<BR>or<BR>अमलः (ला, लं),<BR>c. sky:<BR>विमलं नभः,<BR>Ki.;<BR>c. -rayed moon:<BR>विमलकिरणचन्द्रः, Ri.;<BR>(2) प्रसन्नः (f. न्ना),<BR>c. sky:<BR>प्रसन्नं नमः; the c.<BR>(lake)<BR>Mānasa:<BR>प्रसन्नं मानसम्, K.;<BR>(3) विशदः<BR>(दा, दं).<BR>II Plain, perspicuous: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>प्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(2) विशदः (दा, दं);<BR>(3) विमलः<BR>(ला, लं)<BR>or<BR>निर्मलः (ला, लं).<BR>III Audible: Ph.<BR>c. language:<BR>विविक्तवर्णा सरस्वती, Ki.:<BR>in c.<BR>voice:<BR>स्पष्टवर्णया गिरा, K.<BR>IV Evident: q. v.:<BR>Ph.:<BR>c. profit:<BR>शुद्धलाभः, my mind is c. (now):<BR>ममान्तरात्माविशदो जातः, Sa. iv.; c. of any crime:<BR>विशुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं), Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear
CLEAR (v. t.):<BR>I To make bright:<BR>(1) विशदी-<BR>करोति,<BR>I may c. your sight:<BR>दृष्टिं विशदां करवाणि,<BR>Sa. iii.;<BR>(2) प्रसादयति (c. of सद्) (rare).<BR>II<BR>To exculpate: शोधयति<BR>Kṛṣṇa accepted that<BR>precious gem to c. himself:<BR>अच्युतस्तन्मणिरत्नमात्म-<BR>शोधनाय जग्राह, V. p.<BR>III To make open:<BR>शोधयति,<BR>to c. a road:<BR>मार्गं शोधयति, M. vii.<BR>185.;<BR>with c. ed back:<BR>शुद्धपार्ष्णिः, R. Ph.:<BR>c.<BR>ed forests:<BR>विपिनानि प्रकाशानि चकार, R. iv. 31.<BR>IV Of profits: v. To gain. Ph.<BR>to c. a<BR>doubt:<BR>संशयं छिनत्ति, Da.; to c. a debt:<BR>ऋणं शोधयति, K. b.; to c. (i. e. to leap over)<BR>a<BR>ditch:<BR>परिखाम् उल्लङ्घयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear up
CLEAR UP (v. t.): विशदीकरोति (कृ, c. 8.): v. To<BR>explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear
CLEAR, CLEAR OFF, CLEAR UP (v. i.):<BR>(1)<BR>प्रसीदति (सद्, c. l.),<BR>the quarters c. ed:<BR>दिशः<BR> प्रसेदुः, S. p.;<BR>(2) प्रसादं गच्छति, व्रजति, etc.,<BR>the<BR>sky did not quite c. off:<BR>द्यौरुचितं प्रसाधं न गता<BR>(after Ki.);<BR>(3) विमलीभवति (भू, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clearance
CLEARANCE:<BR>I The act of c. ing: शोधनम्।<BR>II Of<BR>vessels: *शोधनम्।<BR>III Clear profit: शुद्धलाभः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clearly
CLEARLY: v. Plainly, distinctly, obviously,<BR>clear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear-headed
CLEAR-HEADED:<BR>(1) विमलधीः (n. -धि);<BR>(2)<BR>विशदबुद्धि (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clearness
CLEARNESS:<BR>I Trasparency, brightness:<BR>(1) प्रसादः<BR>or<BR>प्रसन्नता;<BR>(2) वैमल्यम्;<BR>(3) वैशद्यम्।<BR>II Plainness, perspicuity:<BR>(1) वैशद्यम्,<BR>impressive on account of c.:<BR>वैशद्यहृद्यः (द्या, द्यं),<BR>N.;<BR>(2) वैमल्यम्,<BR>perspicuity consists in c. of<BR>meaning:<BR>अर्थवैमल्यात्मा प्रसादः, Kav.;<BR>(3) निर्म-<BR>लत्वम्, S. Ph.:<BR>with c. of voice:<BR>स्पष्टवर्णया गिरा, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clear-sighted
CLEAR-SIGHTED: विमलदृश (mfn.) (Lit. and<BR>Fig.): v. Sagacious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleave
CLEAVE (v. i.):<BR>I To adhere: q. v.: सज्जते<BR>(सज्ञ्, c. 1).<BR>II To part asunder<BR>(1) स्फटति<BR>(स्फट्, c. 1);<BR>(2) दीर्यते।<BR>III To suit: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleave
CLEAVE (v. t.):<BR>(1) स्फाटयति (c. of स्फट्);<BR>(2)<BR>वि-दारयति (c. of दॄ).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleaver
CLEAVER: i. e. a butcher's knife: कर्तरी, K. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clef
CLEF: स्वरसंक्रमचिह्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleft
CLEFT (part. and adj.): v. Cloven.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleft
CLEFT (subs.):<BR>I A crack, chasm: q. v.:<BR>दरी।<BR>II A piece: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clemency
CLEMENCY:<BR>I Kindness: q. v.: दया।<BR>II<BR>Mildness: q. v.: मार्दवम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clement
CLEMENT: v. Kind, merciful, gentle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clemently
CLEMENTLY: सदयम्: v. Kindly, gently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=124" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clench
CLENCH (v.):<BR>I Lit.: to grasp: q. v. Ph.<BR>to c.<BR>the fist:<BR>मुष्टिं बध्नाति;<BR>to c. a nail:<BR>*नालम् आवर्ज्य<BR> बध्नाति।<BR>II Of arguments: द्रढयतिः v. To<BR>confirm, establish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clepsydra
CLEPSYDRA: कपालयन्त्रम्, Su. xiii. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clergy
CLERGY: पुरोहितवर्गः, and sim. comp. s<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clergyman
CLERGYMAN: पुरोहितः (?); धर्मशासकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clerical
CLERICAL:<BR>I Belonging to a clergyman:<BR>expr. by comp.,<BR>c. dress:<BR>पुरोहितवेषः।<BR>II<BR>Relating to a clerk: expr. by comp. or by<BR>gen.:<BR>c. mistake:<BR>लेखकस्य भ्रमः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clerk
CLERK:<BR>I A clergyman: q. v.<BR>II A scholar:<BR>q. v.<BR>III In ordinary sense: लेखकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clerkship
CLERKSHIP:<BR>I Business of a clerk: लेखकत्वम्<BR>(?); लेखकपदम्।<BR>II Scholarship: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clever
CLEVER:<BR>(1) चतुरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) विचक्षणः (णा।<BR> णं): v. Skilful, expert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleverly
CLEVERLY:<BR>(1) निपुणम्;<BR>(2) सपाटवम्;<BR>(3) चतुरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cleverness
CLEVERNESS:<BR>(1) वैचक्षण्थम्;<BR>(2) नैपुण्यम्;<BR>(3) चातु-<BR>र्यम्;<BR>(4) वैदग्ध्यम्।: v. Skilfulness, dexterity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clew
CLEW: v. Clue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

click
CLICK:<BR>I Verb: टङ्करोति (?).<BR>II Subs.:<BR>टङ्कारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

client
CLIENT:<BR>I A dependent: आश्रितः (ता, तं).<BR>II<BR>In law: *श्रावकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clientship
CLIENTSHIP:<BR>I Dependency: q. v.: अधीनता।<BR>II In law: *श्रावकत्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cliff
CLIFF:<BR>(1) प्रपातः;<BR>(2) भृगुः (rare),<BR>fall from a<BR>c.:<BR>भृगुपतनम्, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

climacter
CLIMACTER, CLIMACTERIC: परिणामकालः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

climate
CLIMATE:<BR>I Temperature etc.: देशप्रकृतिः (?);<BR>वायुतापौ (m. dual) (?).<BR>II A region: q. v.:<BR>प्रदेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

climax
CLIMAX:<BR>I Acme:<BR>(1) परा कोटिः;<BR>(2) चूडा।<BR>II<BR>In Rhetoric:<BR>(1) सारः, Kav. x. 37.;<BR>(2)<BR>सारालङ्कारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

climb
CLIMB (v.): अरोहति, अधि- (रुह्। c. 1), (with<BR>acc.)<BR>to c. up the top of a tree:<BR>वृक्षाग्रमारोहति, S.<BR>c. Ph.:<BR>c. d over the wall:<BR>प्राकारमत्यलङ्घयम्, D.<BR>iii.;<BR>he knows how to c.:<BR>स वृक्षाद्यारोढुं जानाति<BR>(sim. आरोढुं) (will be ambiguous, as it<BR>often means riding.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

climber
CLIMBER:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) भारोहिन्<BR>or<BR>अधिरोहिन्<BR>(f. णी);<BR>(2) आरोढ्ट (f. ढ्री).<BR>II A climbing<BR>plant:<BR>(1) व्रतती;<BR>(2) वल्लरी। The supporting<BR>tree on which a climber rises:<BR>(1) संश्रयद्रुमः,<BR>Ku.;<BR>(2) उपध्नतरुः, R.<BR>III A climbing bird:<BR>आरोहिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clime
CLIME: प्रदेशः: v. Climate, region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clinch
CLINCH: v. To clench.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clincher
CLINCHER: i. e. a decisive argument: उप-<BR>संहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cling
CLING (v. l.): सज्जते, आ-, प्र-, सं- (सञ्ज्, c. l.),<BR>who c. s to my dress:<BR>को नु खलु निवसने मे सज्जते,<BR>Sa. iv.;<BR>with trees c. ing:<BR>संसक्तक्षितिरुहजालम्,<BR>Vi.;<BR>(2) लगति, संलगति (लग्, c. l.),<BR>clung to<BR>the Śinsapā tree^1:<BR>शिंशपावृक्षे ललाग, Vet.;<BR>c.<BR>ing to the teeth:<BR>दन्तलग्नः (ग्ना, ग्नं), Ku. Ph.<BR>c. to a hope:<BR>आशां न मुञ्चति, जहाति, etc.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clinical
CLINICAL: Ph.<BR>c. medicine:<BR>शय्यागतरोगि-<BR>चिकित्सा (?), or -शास्त्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clink
CLINK (subs.): क्वणितम्: v. Tinkling, jingling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clink
CLINK (v.): क्वणति (क्वण्, c. l.): v. To tink-<BR>-le, jingle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

glip
GLIP:<BR>I To embrace, encompass: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To shear, cut off: कल्पति (क्ल्ट्प्, c. l), (rare),<BR>with hair, nails, and beard c. ped:<BR>कॢप्तकेशनखश्मश्रः,<BR>M. iv. 35.<BR>III To curtail: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clipping
CLIPPING: v. Cutting, paring.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clique
CLIQUE: दलम् (?): v. Faction, party.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloak
CLOAK (subs.):<BR>(1) कञ्चुकः,<BR>her body covered with<BR>a blue c. hanging down to the ankle:<BR>आगुल्फावल-<BR>म्बिना नीलकञ्चुकेनाच्छन्नशरीराम्, K.;<BR>(2) प्रावारः<BR>(gen. = blanket or shawl), Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloak
CLOAK (v.): अवगुण्ठयति (गुण्ठ्, c. 10): v. To<BR>hide, palliate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clock
CLOCK: *घटिका;<BR>sidereal-c.:<BR>*नाक्षत्रघटिका;<BR>what o'c. is it?<BR>*कियतो घटिका?<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clockwork
CLOCKWORK: घटीयन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clod
CLOD:<BR>(1) लोष्ट (mn.);<BR>(2) लेष्टुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clodhopper
CLODHOPPER: v. Clown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

glog
GLOG (v.): प्रतिबध्नाति (बन्ध, c. 9): v. To<BR>obstruct, fetter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

glog
GLOG (subs.):<BR>I A shoe: पादुका (gen. term).<BR>II An impediment: q. v.: प्रतिबन्धः।<BR>III Of<BR>animals: प्रतिबन्धः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=125" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloister
CLOISTER:<BR>I A portico: q. v.<BR>II A monas-<BR>-tery: q. v.: विहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloistral
CLOISTRAL: v. Monastic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close
CLOSE (v. t.):<BR>I To shut: q. v.: अपि-दधाति<BR>(धा, c. 3),<BR>c. the back door:<BR>पिधेहि पक्षद्वारकम्,<BR>Mr.;<BR>to c. the eyes:<BR>लोचने मीलयति, नि-, (c. of<BR>मोल्), Me.<BR>II To bring into contact: संहन्ति<BR>(हन्, c. 2).<BR>III To conclude, finish: q. v.:<BR>समापयति (c. of आप्).<BR>IV To confine: q. v.<BR>To c. in or round:<BR>परिवृणोतिः v. To surround.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close
CLOSE (v. i.):<BR>I To come together:<BR>(1) नि-<BR>मीलति (मील्, c. l) (of the eye);<BR>(2) समा-<BR>रोहति (रुह्, c. l) (of wounds).: v. To unite.<BR>II To come to an end: expr. by अवसितः<BR>(ता, तं), समाप्तः (प्ता, प्तं), etc.; when he c. d:<BR>वचस्यवसिते तस्मिन्, Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close on or upon
CLOSE ON or UPON: स्थिरीकरोतिः v. Agree,<BR>decide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close up
CLOSE UP: अवृणोति (वृ, c. 5): v. To block up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close with
CLOSE WITH:<BR>I To close on: q. v.<BR>II To unite<BR>with: q. v.<BR>III To grapple with: संगच्छति<BR>(गम्, c. 4), समेति (इ, c. 2), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close
CLOSE (adj.):<BR>I Shut fast:<BR>(1) पिहितः (ता,<BR> तं);<BR>(2) संवृतः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) बद्धः (द्धा, द्धं)<BR>(=bound).<BR>II Secret, retired: q. v.:<BR>विविक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR>III Confined, as air: निरुद्धः<BR>(द्धा, द्धं).<BR>IV Reticent, taciturn: q. v. V.<BR>Niggardly: q. v.: बद्धमुष्टि (mfn.).<BR>VI Dense,<BR>compact: q. v.: घनः (ना, नं).<BR>VII Ad-<BR>-joining, near: q. v.: सन्निहितः (ता, तं),<BR>are<BR>always c. at hand:<BR>हस्ते नित्यसान्निध्यानि, D.<BR>VIII<BR>Of style: v. Concise.<BR>IX Intimate:<BR>(1)<BR>घनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) निविडः (डा, डं),<BR>very c.<BR>friendship:<BR>निविडतमा मैत्री, Bha.<BR>X Accurate,<BR>careful: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close
CLOSE (adv.):<BR>I Densely: q. v.<BR>II Near:<BR>q. v.:<BR>(1) उपान्ते;<BR>(2) समीपतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close
CLOSE (subs.):<BR>I An enclosure: q. v.: वृतिः।<BR>II<BR>End, termination: q. v.: अवसानम्,<BR>c. of the<BR>day:<BR>दिवावसानम्, R.<BR>III Junction: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close-fisted
CLOSE-FISTED, CLOSE-HANDED: बद्धमुष्टि (mfn.),<BR>your c. ness in giving me a look:<BR>दृष्टिदाने तव बद्ध-<BR>मुष्टिता, N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

closely
CLOSELY: v. Densely; nearly; strictly;<BR>accurately; firmly; secretly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

closeness
CLOSENESS:<BR>I Compact: q. v.: घनता।<BR>II<BR>Nearness: q. v.: नैकट्यम्।<BR>III Niggardliness:<BR>q. v.<BR>IV Of air: निरुद्धवातता। V. Of style:<BR>v. Conciseness.<BR>VI Narrowness: q. v.<BR>VII Accuracy: q. v.<BR>VIII Secrecy: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

close-stool
CLOSE-STOOL: *उपशयनपीठम्; विण्मूत्राधारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

closet
CLOSET (subs.): कोष्ठः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

closet
CLOSET (v.):<BR>I To conceal: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>consult: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clot
CLOT (v. t.): पिण्ड (mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clot
CLOT (v.):<BR>(1) पिण्डीभवति;<BR>(2) घनीभवति।<BR>C. ted<BR>hair:<BR>जटा, -जूटः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloth
CLOTH:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) वस्त्रम्,<BR>coarse c.<BR>स्थूलवस्त्रम्,<BR>P. ii. 5.;<BR>fine c.:<BR>सूक्ष्मवस्त्रम्, N. com.;<BR>(2)<BR>पटः<BR>or<BR>पट्टः,<BR>making of different kinds of c.:<BR>अनेक-<BR>विधपटरचना, P. ii. 5.: v. Also clothes.<BR>II A<BR>profession: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clothe
CLOTHE (v.):<BR>I To put on c. s:<BR>c. ing her-<BR>self:<BR>गृहीतवस्त्रा, Ku.;<BR>c. ing himself:<BR>परिधाय<BR> वाससी, K.: v. To put on clothes.<BR>II To<BR>invest with raiment: वस्त्रं etc. परिधापयति (c.<BR>of धा)<BR>or<BR>वासयति (c. of वस्).<BR>III To pro-<BR>-vide with c. s: but should feed and c. her:<BR>ग्रासाच्छादनन्तु देयमेव, K. b.<BR>IV To cover or<BR>invest: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clothes
CLOTHES, CLOTHING:<BR>(1) वसनम्, when (her)<BR>c.<BR>were being drawn off:<BR>आकृष्यमाणे वसने, Mah.;<BR>(2) वस्त्रम्,<BR>taking off c.:<BR>वस्त्राणि मोचयित्वा, P.;<BR>(3) वासस् (n.),<BR>Basantasenā's c. are wet:<BR>क्लिन्ने<BR> वाससी वसन्तसेनायाः, Mr.;<BR>(4) अंशुकम्;<BR>(5)<BR>अम्बरम् (rare);<BR>(6) परिच्छदः,<BR>pretty c.<BR>कमनीयपरि-<BR>च्छदः, Ki.;<BR>(7) परिधानम् (=under-c.),<BR>by whom<BR>even her c. was taken away:<BR>येनास्याः परिधानमप्य-<BR>पहृतम्, Ve. N.B. The first five words gen. = a<BR>single piece of cloth and their dual is often<BR>used to denote a suit of c. as the Hindu's<BR>dress consisted only of two pieces of gar-<BR>-ment: v. Dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clothier
CLOTHIER:<BR>(1) पट-<BR>or<BR>पट्टकारः (maker);<BR>(2)<BR>वस्त्रविक्रेतृ (m.) (seller).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloud
CLOUD (subs.):<BR>(1) मेघः;<BR>(2) जलदः;<BR>(3) जल- [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">Page127</a>]<BR>धरः;<BR>(4) घनः;<BR>(5) पर्जन्यः;<BR>(6) अभ्रम्;<BR>(7) बला-<BR>हकः;<BR>(8) जीमूतः;<BR>(9) नीरदः;<BR>(10) पयोमुच् (m.).<BR>C. born:<BR>मेध्यः (ध्या, ध्यं);<BR>c.-producing:<BR>मेघ-<BR>ङ्करः (री, रं), Si. xx. 61. and 65.;<BR>a long<BR>line of c. s:<BR>कादम्बिनी, Ku. Fig.: a c. of dust<BR>धूलीपटलः;<BR>I am under a c. now:<BR>साम्प्रतं ममोपरि<BR> शनेर्द्यष्टिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=126" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloud-capped
CLOUD-CAPPED:<BR>(1) अभ्रंलिहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2) अभ्रं-<BR>कषः (षा, षं);<BR>(3) अम्बरलेखिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clouded
CLOUDED:<BR>I Lit: मेघावृतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) मेघा-<BR>च्छन्नः (न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(3) घनोपरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR>II<BR>Fig. v. Dark, gloomy, sullen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloudless
CLOUDLESS:<BR>(1) अमेघः (घा, घं);<BR>(2) निरभ्रः (भ्रा,<BR> भ्रं);<BR>(3) व्यभ्रः (f. भ्रा), V. p.;<BR>(4) वीतबलाहकः<BR>(का, कं), Ki.; and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloudy
CLOUDY:<BR>I Lit., clouded: q. v.:<BR>(1) अम्रितः<BR>(ता, तं), R. iii. 12;<BR>(2) साभ्रः (f. भ्रा), Me.<BR>ii. 29. Ph.<BR>c. weather<BR>दुर्दिनम्।<BR>II Fig., dark,<BR>obscure: q. v.: तमोवृतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clout
CLOUT: चीरम्: v. Patch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clove
CLOVE:<BR>I The plant: लवङ्गः।<BR>II The fruit:<BR>लवङ्गम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloven
CLOVEN:<BR>(1) स्फाटितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) दीर्णः, वि-,<BR>(र्णा, र्णं);<BR>(3) खण्डितः (ता, तं). C.-hoofed:<BR>द्विशफः (फा, फम्).<BR>C.-tongued:<BR>द्विजिह्वः (ह्वा, ह्वं)<BR>(=double-tongued), Śi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clover
CLOVER: त्रिपर्णी (?). To live in c. i. e. luxurious-<BR>ly: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clown
CLOWN:<BR>I A countryman:<BR>(1) ग्रामिकः;<BR>(2)<BR>ग्राम्यजनः;<BR>(3) कृषीवलः (=agriculturist).<BR>II A<BR>buffoon: q. v.: भण्डः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clownish
CLOWNISH:<BR>(1) ग्राम्यः (म्या, म्यं);<BR>(2) अशिष्टः<BR>(ष्टा, ष्टं) (not polite.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clownishness
CLOWNISHNESS:<BR>(1) ग्राभ्यता;<BR>(2) अशिष्टता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cloy
CLOY (v.): सं-तर्पयति (c. of तृप्): v. To sati-<BR>-ate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

club
CLUB (subs.):<BR>I A cudgel:<BR>(1) यष्टिः;<BR>(2)<BR>लगुडः,<BR>to maul severely with c. s.<BR>लगुडप्रहारैर्जर्जरी-<BR>करोति, P.<BR>II An association: q. v.: समाजः (?),<BR>who will not come to the c. today:<BR>योऽद्य समाजे<BR> नागमिष्यति, V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

club together
CLUB TOGETHER (v.):<BR>I To eat together: सं-<BR>खादति (खाद्, c. 1) (?)<BR>II To contribute: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

club-footed
CLUB-FOOTED: विकृतपादः (दा, दं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cluck
CLUCK (subs.): चूङ्कृतम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cluck
CLUCK (v.): चूङ्करोति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clue
CLUE:<BR>I A ball of thread: सूत्रकोपम् (?).<BR>II<BR>Anything serving to guide: Ph. to get a c.<BR>सन्धानं प्राप्नोति (?);<BR>to give a. c.<BR>सन्धानं ददाति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clump
CLUMP:<BR>(1) गुच्छः;<BR>(2) निचयः, संहतिः, etc. in<BR>comp.,<BR>a c. of creepers:<BR>विरुन्निचयः, Ve.;<BR>c. of<BR>plantain trees:<BR>कदलीषण्डः, Mah.<BR>or<BR>कदलीगुल्मः<BR>Ra.;<BR>(3) वनम् (a large c.),<BR>a c. of lotus:<BR>कुमु-<BR>द्वनम्, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clumsily
CLUMSILY:<BR>(1) असम्यक्;<BR>(2) असुन्दरम्;<BR>(3) अपटु।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clumsiness
CLUMSINESS:<BR>(1) असौन्दर्यम् (=inelegance^1);<BR>(2) ग्राम्यता (=rusticity);<BR>(3) अपाटवम् (=un-<BR>-skilfulness).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clumsy
CLUMSY:<BR>(1) असुन्दरः (री, रं) (=inelegant);<BR>(2) ग्राम्यः (म्या, म्यं) (=rustic);<BR>(3) अकृतिन्<BR>(f. नी) (=unskilful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cluster
CLUSTER (subs.):<BR>(1) चयः, नि-, c. of ashes:<BR>भस्मनां चयः, Ki.;<BR>(2) संहतिः, R.;<BR>(3) स्तवकः (of<BR>fruit or flower), with fresh c. s of flower<BR>प्रसूनस्तवकैर्नवीनैः, N.: v. Crowd, assemblage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cluster
CLUSTER (v.):<BR>c. ed by wind:<BR>अनिलेन विरचित-<BR>संहतिः, K.: v. To flock, swarm. “C. ing<BR>grapes.” *स्तवकमयानि द्राक्षाफलानि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clutch
CLUTCH (v.): आदत्ते (दा, c. 3): v. To seize,<BR>grasp.<BR>To c. the hand:<BR>मुष्टिं बध्नाति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clutches
CLUTCHES (subs.): हस्तः, under the c. of death:<BR>मृत्युहस्तवर्तिन् (f. नी), D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

clyster
CLYSTER: v. Injection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coach
COACH: रथः: v. Carriage, chariot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coach-man
COACH-MAN: सारथिः: v. Charioteer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coadjutor
COADJUTOR: सहायः: v. Assistant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coagulate
COAGULATE:<BR>(1) घनीभवति;<BR>(2) श्यामीभवति;<BR>(3) श्यायते (श्यै, c. l).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coagulation
COAGULATION: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coal
COAL:<BR>(1) अङ्गार, (=charcoal);<BR>(2) अङ्गाराश्मन्<BR>(m.)<BR>or<BR>अङ्गारमृत्तिका।<BR>C.-heaver:<BR>अङ्गारवाहकः (?).<BR>C.-pit:<BR>अङ्गारभूमिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coalesce
COALESCE: v. To unite, combine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coalition
COALITION: संयोगः: v. Communion, alliance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coarse
COARSE:<BR>I Not fine: स्थूलः (ला, लं), c. cloth<BR>स्थलवस्त्रम्, P.; body is of two kinds, c. and fine: [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=128" target="_blank">Page128</a>]<BR>द्विविधं शरीरं स्थूलं सूक्ष्मं च, S. iv. 3.<BR>II Rude,<BR>unpolished, mean: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=127" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coarsely
COARSELY: v. Rudely, impolitely, meanly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=128" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coarseness
COARSENESS:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) स्थूलता;<BR>(2) स्थौल्यम्।<BR>II Rudeness; vulgarity: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=128" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coast
