COHESIVE: संलग्नशीलः (ला, लं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cohort
COHORT गुल्मः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coif
COIF, COIFFEUR:<BR>(1) शिरस्कम्;<BR>(2) शिरस्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coil
COIL (subs.):<BR>(1) गुणः (of a rope);<BR>(2) कुण्डलम्<BR>(of a serpent);<BR>(3) व्यावर्तनम् (c. ing round),<BR>by the c. s of the serpent-king:<BR>व्यावर्तनैरहिपतेः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coil
COIL (v.):<BR>(1) पिण्डीकरोति (into a globe);<BR>(2)<BR>कुण्डलीकरोति, V. p. com.<BR>C. ed round by the<BR>serpent-king:<BR>सर्पराजेन भोगेनावेष्टितः (ता, तं), V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coin
COIN (subs.):<BR>(1) मुद्रा,<BR>copper -c.:<BR>ताम्रमुद्रा;<BR>(2)<BR>नाणकम् (rare), Mr. To pay any one in his own c.<BR>*सदृशशोधं ददाति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coin
COIN (v.):<BR>I To stamp: टङ्कयति (nomi.) (?).<BR>II To invent, originate: q. v. सृजति (सृज्,<BR>c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coinage
COINAGE:<BR>I Coining: टङ्कनम् (?).<BR>II Money<BR>coined: मुद्रा।<BR>III Invention: q. v.: सृष्टिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coincide
COINCIDE (v.):<BR>I To Agree, correspond,<BR>concur: q. v.<BR>II To agree in position:<BR>एकीभवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coincidence
COINCIDENCE:<BR>I Agreement, correspon-<BR>-dence: q. v.<BR>II Agreement in position<BR>expr. by verb.<BR>III Accident: दैवयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coincident
COINCIDENT, COINCIDENTAL:<BR>I Of time:<BR>समकालीनः (ना, नं).<BR>II Consistent: q. v.<BR>III<BR>Corresponding: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coiner
COINER:<BR>I Lit.: मुद्राकारः (?).<BR>II An inven-<BR>-tor, maker: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coition
COITION: सङ्गमः: v. Copulation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colander
COLANDER: चालनी (=a sieve).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cold
COLD (adj.):<BR>I Lit:<BR>(1) शीतः (ता, तं),<BR>c.<BR>weather:<BR>शीतकालः, Ri. vi. 7.;<BR>(2) शीतलः (ला,<BR> लं) (gen. = cool),<BR>c. nights:<BR>शीतला रात्रयः, Ri.<BR>V. 4.;<BR>(3) शिशिरः (रा, रं),<BR>c. as ice:<BR>तुषार-<BR>शिशिरः (रा, रं) K.;<BR>(4) हिमः (मा, मं) (rare);<BR>(5) तुषारः (रा, रं) (rare);<BR>(6) निरुष्णः (ष्णा, ष्णं),<BR>अघर्मः (र्मा। र्मं) etc. (poet). C. season:<BR>(1) हेमन्त<BR>(mn.) (from about the middle of November<BR>to about the m. of January);<BR>(2) शिशिर (mn.)<BR>(from a. the m. of J. to a. the m. of March).<BR>Ph.<BR>I am c.<BR>शीतं मे, P. iii. 7.<BR>III Fig.: in-<BR>-different, reserved: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cold
COLD (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) शीतम्,<BR>capacity of<BR>enduring c.:<BR>शीतसहिष्णुता, Ka.;<BR>(2) हिमम्,<BR>suffer-<BR>ing from c.:<BR>हिमार्तः Sa.; save me from c.:<BR>हिमत्राणं विधीयतां, P.<BR>II Catarrh:<BR>(1)<BR>प्रति(ती)श्यायः,<BR>giving c.:<BR>प्रतिश्यायकरः (री, रं),<BR>Sr.;<BR>(2) पीनसः,<BR>suffering from c.<BR>पीनसिन् (नी),<BR>Sr. Ph.:<BR>to catch c.:<BR>प्रतिश्यायः सम्-जायते (जन्,<BR>c. 4.)<BR>or<BR>भवति (with gen. of the person).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coldish
COLDISH: ईषच्छीतः (ता, तं): v. Cool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coldly
COLDLY: अनादरेणः v. Indifferently, coolly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=129" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coldness
COLDNESS:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) शैत्यम्<BR>or<BR>शीतता,<BR>from<BR>great c.:<BR>अतिशैत्यात्, M. n.;<BR>(2) निरुष्णता, etc.<BR>(poet).<BR>II Apathy, indifference: q. v.:<BR>अनादरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colewort
COLEWORT: शाकविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colic
COLIC:<BR>(1) शूलम्;<BR>(2) वातशूलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collapse
COLLAPSE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: संकोचः।<BR>II Fig.:<BR>क्षयः: v. Fall, ruin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collapse
COLLAPSE (v.):<BR>I To shrink up: q. v.:<BR>संकुचति (कुच्, c. 6.).<BR>II Fig.: to fail q. v.:<BR>क्षयं<BR>or<BR>नाशं गच्छति, व्रजति, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collar
COLLAR (subs.):<BR>(1) ग्रैवेयम्<BR>or<BR>ग्रैवेयकम्;<BR>(2)<BR>कण्ठिका;<BR>(3) कण्ठभूषणम्। C. (of machines):<BR>*परिकरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collar
COLLAR (v. t.):<BR>(1) ग्रैवेयकेन धरति (धृ, c. l.) or<BR>गृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.): v. To seize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collar-bone
COLLAR-BONE: जत्रु (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collate
COLLATE:<BR>I To compare critically:<BR>(1)<BR>परीक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.);<BR>(2) समवलोकते (लोक्, c. l.).<BR>II To appoint, to confer: q. v.: नियोजयति<BR>(युज्, c. 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collateral
COLLATERAL:<BR>I Indirect: q. v.: प्रासङ्गिकः<BR>(की, कं).<BR>II Of pedigree: not in the direct<BR>line: मिन्नशास्वः (खा, खं) (?); उपलोमः (मा,<BR> मं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collaterally
COLLATERALLY: Of indirect descent: expr.<BR>by circum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collation
COLLATION.<BR>I Comparison:<BR>(1) परीक्षा;<BR>(2)<BR>समवलोकनम्।<BR>II Presentation to a benefice:<BR>नियोगः<BR>or<BR>विनियोगः।<BR>III Cold repast: कल्यवर्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colleague
COLLEAGUE: सहकारिन् (f. णी) (?). C. -ship:<BR>सहकारित्वम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collect
COLLECT (v. t.):<BR>I To gather:<BR>(1) सं-गृह्वाति<BR>(ग्रह्, c. 9.),<BR>to c. dust:<BR>पांशून् संगृह्णाति, M.;<BR>(2)<BR>समाहरति (हृ, c. 1.),<BR>c. ing dictionaries:<BR>कोषान्<BR> समाहृत्य, Nil.;<BR>(3) समर्जयति (अर्ज्, c. 10.) (of<BR>earning),<BR>c. ing gems:<BR>समर्जयन् रत्नानि, K.;<BR>(4)<BR>सन्निपातयति (c. of पत्) (=to assemble: q. v.);<BR>(5) आदत्ते (दा, c. 3.) (=to take) (only of<BR>taxes etc.);<BR>(6) राशीकरोति, पूगीकरोति<BR>or<BR>पुञ्जी-<BR>करोति (c. into a heap). Ph.: to c. one's self<BR>आत्मानं संस्थापयति, पर्यव-, (c. of स्था), Mr. iii.<BR>To infer: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collect
COLLECT (v. i.):<BR>(1) समागच्छति (गम्, c. 2.), समैति<BR>(इ, c. 2.), etc.: v. To assemble;<BR>(2) राशी-<BR>भवति, पूगीभवति, पुञ्जीभवति (=to c. into a<BR>heap).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collect
COLLECT (subs.): सूक्तम् (?): v. Prayer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collected
COLLECTED (adj.): i. e. not disconcerted,<BR>cool: स्थिरः (रा, रं),<BR>you should be always c. like<BR>this:<BR>एवमेव सदा भाव्यं स्थिरेण॥।, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collection
COLLECTION:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) संग्रहः;<BR>(2)<BR>समाहारः (rare).<BR>II Assemblage, crowd:<BR>q. v.: सङ्घः।<BR>III Money collected. Ph.:<BR>pay your c. s<BR>*यद्धनं त्वया समाहृतं तद्देहि।<BR>IV Con-<BR>-clusion: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collective
COLLECTIVE:<BR>(1) समवेतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) संहतः (ता,<BR> तं).<BR>C. -ness:<BR>सङ्घवृत्तिता, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collectively
COLLECTIVELY: expr. by adj., the birds c.:<BR>संहतास्तु विहङ्गमाः, H.: v. Jointly, together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collector
COLLECTOR: संग्रहीतृ<BR>or<BR>समाहर्तृ (f. र्त्रीं) (?), tax -c.:<BR>*करसमाहर्ता; c. of a district (in India): करनायकः<BR>(after दण्डनायकः magistrate); c. of customs:<BR>*शुल्कनायकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

college
COLLEGE: विद्यालयः<BR>or<BR>प्रधानविद्यालयः, and sim.<BR>comp. s;<BR>of your c. -life<BR>अत्रमवतः विद्यागृहमधिवसतः,<BR>K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collegian
COLLEGIAN: छात्रः (=student, pupil: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collegiate
COLLEGIATE: expr. by com., c. church:<BR>*विद्यालयधर्ममन्दिरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collier
COLLIER: *अङ्गारखनकः<BR>or<BR>अङ्गाराशमखनकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colliery
COLLIERY: *अङ्गारखनिः; अङ्गाराश्मखनिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collision
COLLISION: सघट्टः (with a defining word when<BR>the sense is not clear, as *लोहपथयानसङ्घट्टः to<BR>denote railway c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collocation
COLLOCATION: वित्यासः: v. Arrangement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collop
COLLOP: फालिका,<BR>c. of meat:<BR>मांसफालिका, N.<BR>xvi. 82.: v. Piece.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colloquial
COLLOQUIAL: Ph.:<BR>c. language<BR>प्राकृतभाषा (?);<BR>c. talent:<BR>सम्भाषणशक्तिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colloquialism
COLLOQUIALISM: प्राकृतभाषाप्रयोगः (?), Latin c.:<BR>*प्राकृतलाटिनभाषाप्रयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colloquy
COLLOQUY: v. Coversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collude
COLLUDE: v. To conspire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collusion
COLLUSION:<BR>(1) निभृतसंयोगः (=secret union);<BR>(2) शठ्यम् (=deceit: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=130" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

collusively
COLLUSIVELY: निभृतसंयोगेन (?);<BR>(2) शाठ्येन:<BR>v. Deceitfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colocynth
COLOCYNTH:<BR>(1) इन्द्रवारुणी;<BR>(2) मृगादनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colon
COLON: *द्विबिन्दुचिह्नम्; कोलनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonel
COLONEL: वाहिनीपतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonelcy
COLONELCY, COLONELSHIP: *वाहिनीपतित्वम्;<BR> वाहिनीपतिपदम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonial
COLONIAL: expr. by comp. c. governor:<BR>*अधिनिवेशपालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonist
COLONIST: *अधिनिवेशिन् (f. नी)<BR>or<BR>अधिनिवेशवासिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonize
COLONIZE: *अधिनिवेशयति (c. of विश्),<BR>should c.<BR>places by the excess population of one's country:<BR>जनपदं स्वदेशाभिष्यन्दवमनेन निवेशयेत्, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colonnade
COLONNADE: *स्तम्भावलिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colony
COLONY: अधिनिवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colossal
COLOSSAL: महाप्रमाणः (णा, णं), K. v.: Huge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colossus
COLOSSUS: *कोलक्षः, बृहत्प्रतिमाभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colour
COLOUR (subs.):<BR>I A property of bodies:<BR>(1) वर्णः,<BR>seeing that it changed c. in a golden<BR>vessel:<BR>कनकभाजने वर्णान्तरमुपगतमुपलभ्य, Mu. ii.;<BR>(2) रागः<BR>or<BR>रङ्गः (rare),<BR>c. of the cheek:<BR>कपोल-<BR>रागः, Ki.<BR>II A pigment:<BR>(1) रङ्गः, of lasting c.<BR>स्थिररङ्गः (ङ्गा, ङ्गं);<BR>(2) वर्णः, -कः (rare),<BR>from the<BR>vividness of the c.<BR>वर्णकोच्छ्वासात्, Sa. vi. Ph.:<BR>you know how to paint sin in the blackest c. s:<BR>*घोरकृष्णरङ्गैः पातकं चित्रयितुं जानासि।<BR>III Pretext<BR>q. v.: व्यपदेशः।<BR>IV In pl. a. flag, ensign:<BR>q. v.: ध्वजः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colour
COLOUR (v. t.):<BR>I Lit:<BR>(1) रञ्जयति (c. of<BR>रञ्ज्);<BR>(2) वर्णयति (वर्ण्, c. 10.) (rare in this<BR>sense);<BR>(3) चित्रयति (चित्र्, c. 10.) (=to<BR>paint).<BR>II To palliate, pretend: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colour
COLOUR (v. i.): Ph.:<BR>his face c. ed<BR>*तस्य<BR> वदनमारक्तं बभूव<BR>or<BR>रक्तवर्णमापेदे<BR>or<BR>भेजे।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colourable
COLOURABLE: v. Plausible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coloured
COLOURED (adj.): Ph.:<BR>red -c.<BR>रक्तवर्णः (र्णा, र्णं);<BR>many -c.<BR>नानावर्णः (र्णा, र्णं)<BR>c. people.<BR>आफ्रिकादि-<BR>देशीयकृष्णवर्णलोकाः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colouring
COLOURING (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: रञ्जनम्।<BR>II Fig.,<BR>of style: वर्णनम्: v. Ornament.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colourist
COLOURIST: चित्रकरः (=painter: q. v.: not<BR>रञ्जकः, which = dyer).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colourless
COLOURLESS:<BR>(1) अवर्णः (र्णा, र्णं);<BR>(2) वर्णहीनः<BR>(ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colourman
COLOURMAN: रङ्गविक्रयी<BR>or<BR>रङ्गविक्रेता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

colt
COLT:<BR>(1) अश्वशावः (of a horse);<BR>(2) गर्दभशावः<BR>(of an ass).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

column
COLUMN:<BR>I A pillar: q. v.: स्तम्भः।<BR>II Mili-<BR>-tary: सूचिः<BR>or<BR>सूचिव्यूहः,<BR>should march in file or<BR>c.:<BR>दण्डव्यूहेन सूच्या वा यायात्, M.<BR>III Of a<BR>page: *धारा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comb
COMB (subs.):<BR>I For hair:<BR>(1) प्रसाधनी;<BR>(2)<BR>कङ्कतिका।<BR>II For carding wool: *मार्जनी (?).<BR>III Of a cock: चूडा।<BR>IV Honeycomb:<BR>q. v. V. A valley: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comb
COMB (v. t.): सम्मार्जयति (मृज्, c. 10): v. To dress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combat
COMBAT (subs.): v. Battle, contest. Ph.:<BR>single-c.<BR>द्वन्द्वयुद्धम्,<BR>close c.:<BR>नियुद्धम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combat
COMBAT (v. i.): v. To contend, struggle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combat
COMBAT (v. t.):<BR>I To fight with: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To oppose, resist: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combatant
COMBATANT:<BR>I Lit: योद्धृ (f. द्ध्री).<BR>II Fig.:<BR>विरोधिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combative
COMBATIVE: युयुत्सु (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combination
COMBINATION:<BR>(1) संहतिः,<BR>to break their c.:<BR>तत्सं-<BR>संहतिभेदाय, Mu. II.; c. even of little things:<BR>अल्पानामपि वस्तूनां संहतिः, H.;<BR>(2) समवायः,<BR>much<BR>more their c.:<BR>किमुतसमवायः, K.: v. Union.<BR>Ph.:<BR>c. of letters:<BR>सन्धिः, c. (in algebra)<BR>*समवायः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combine
COMBINE (v.):<BR>I Trans.: v. To join, unite.<BR>II Intrans.: expr. by the parts: संहतः<BR>(ता, तं), समवेतः (ता, तं),<BR>or<BR>मिलितः (ता, तं),<BR>they c. d together to invade it:<BR>इतमभियोक्तुं मिलिता<BR> बभुबुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combustible
COMBUSTIBLE:<BR>(1) दाह्यः (ह्या, ह्यं);<BR>(2) दहनीयः<BR>(या, यं). Any c. material:<BR>(1) दाह्यम्<BR>or<BR>दाह्य-<BR>पदार्थः;<BR>(2) इन्धनम्, R. xiii. 4.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

combustion
COMBUSTION:<BR>(1) दाहः;<BR>(2) दहनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come
COME:<BR>(1) आगच्छति (गम्, c. l), I am c. ing:<BR>अयमागतोऽस्मि, Mr. ix.; does not c. (back) yet:<BR>नाद्याप्यगच्छति, Mr. v.;<BR>will he c. here:<BR>किमय-<BR>मत्रागमिष्यति, K.;<BR>(2) एति (इ, c. 2),<BR>c. c. my<BR>child:<BR>एह्येहि वत्स, Vi. i.;<BR>(3) आयाति (या, c.<BR>2),<BR>came to Yudhishthira:<BR>युधिष्ठिरं समाययौ, Ki. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">Page132</a>]<BR>i. 1. Ph.:<BR>the summer season is c.:<BR>निदाधकालोऽ-<BR>यमुपागतः, Ri. i. l.;<BR>the news of his father's<BR>death is c.:<BR>तस्य पितृमरणवार्ता समागता। N. B. These<BR>verbs take an acc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=131" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come about
COME ABOUT: v. Pass, come to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come after
COME AFTER:<BR>I To go after, follow: q. v.:<BR>अनुगच्छति (गम्, c. l).<BR>II To come for: Ph.:<BR>he came after a book:<BR>*स पुस्तकार्थमाजगाम।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come again
COME AGAIN: प्रत्यागच्छति (गम्, c. l): v. To<BR>come back, return.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come along
COME ALONG:<BR>(1) आगच्छति;<BR>(2) एति: v. To<BR>come.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come at
COME AT: अधिगच्छति (गम्, c. l): v. To reach,<BR>attain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come away
COME AWAY:<BR>I To depart: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>come off: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come back
COME BACK:<BR>(1) प्रत्यागच्छति;<BR>(2) प्रत्यायाति (या,<BR>c. 2);<BR>(3) प्रत्यावर्तते (वृत्, c. 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come by
COME BY: i. e. to gain, obtain, acquire: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come down
COME DOWN:<BR>I To get down, descend: q. v.<BR>अवतरति (तॄ, c. l).<BR>II To be handed down:<BR>Ph. the writings of Kālidāsa have c. to us:<BR>कालिदासकृतप्रबन्धा अस्मत्सकाशमागताः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come forth
COME FORTH: निर्गच्छति (गम्, c. l): v. To<BR>come out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come in
COME IN:<BR>I To enter: q. v.: प्रविशति (विश्,<BR>c. 6):<BR>II To comply: q. v.<BR>III To become<BR>fashionable: v. Fashionable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come in for
COME IN FOR: Ph.: they did not c. in for a share:<BR>*अंशग्रहणाय नाजग्मुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come into
COME INTO: v. To agree, comply. Ph.:<BR>c.<BR>into vogue:<BR>प्रचलितः (ता, तं) भवति (भू, c. l);<BR>then they will c. into my power:<BR>वशमेष्यन्ति मे<BR> तदा, H. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come near
COME NEAR:<BR>I Lit.: उपसर्पति (सृप्, c. l): v.<BR>To approach.<BR>II Fig.: Ph.:<BR>nothing anci-<BR>ent or modern c. s near this achievement<BR>*एतादृशं<BR> कर्म कदापि न सम्पन्नम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come of
COME OF: i. e. to issue or produce from: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come off
COME OFF:<BR>I To come out of: निष्पतति (पत्,<BR>c. l),<BR>fire came off his eye:<BR>अक्ष्णः कृशानुः किल<BR> निष्पपात, Ku.:<BR>II To be carried through:<BR>निर्गच्छति।<BR>III To take place: q. v.: आपतति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come out
COME OUT:<BR>I Lit.: निर्गच्छति;<BR>(2) निष्क्रामति:<BR>v. To go out.<BR>II Of the teeth etc.:<BR>(1)<BR>उद्गच्छति, निर्-, (गम्, c. l);<BR>(2) उदेति (इ, c.<BR>2);<BR>(3) उद्भिनत्ति (भिद्, c. 7),<BR>as no beard<BR>had c. out<BR>अनुभ्दिन्नश्मश्रुराजितया, K. iii. To be<BR>published: निर्गच्छति<BR>or<BR>बहिर्गच्छति: v. To<BR>publish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come out to meet or receive
COME OUT TO MEET or RECEIVE:<BR>(1) प्रत्युद्गच्छति<BR>(गम्, c. l), R. viii. 64.;<BR>(2) प्रत्युदेति (इ,<BR>c. 2);<BR>(2) प्रत्युद्याति (या, c. 2).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come over
COME OVER:<BR>I To pass over: Ph.:<BR>if they get<BR>an assailant like you, they will leave him and c.<BR>over to you:<BR>त्वदृशमभियोक्तारमासाद्यै नं परित्यज्य त्वामे-<BR>वाश्रयन्ते, Mu. iv.<BR>II Of feelings, etc. Ph.:<BR>a sudden chill came over him<BR>*सहसा तस्य गात्रं<BR> शीतं बभूव।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come round
COME ROUND: Ph.:<BR>he will c. round to our<BR>opinion:<BR>स स्वमतं परित्यज्यास्माकं मतं ग्रहीष्यति or<BR>मतावलम्बनं करिष्यति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come short
COME SHORT: न्यूनीभवति (भू, c. l): v. To<BR>Fall short.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come to
COME TO:<BR>I Lit.: v. To come. N. B. With<BR>respect to persons सकाशं should be used:<BR>I have c. to you here:<BR>त्वत्सकाशमिहागतः, M. p.<BR>Ph.:<BR>c. to memory<BR>स्मृतिभागच्छति, A. r.;<BR>c. to<BR>one's ears:<BR>श्रुतिपथमायाति, Sa., श्रुतिमागच्छति, N.;<BR>c. to pieces:<BR>खण्डखण्डं भवति, let it never c. to pass:<BR>मास्मभूत्, Ki.;<BR>c. to one's self:<BR>संज्ञां लभते (लभ्, c.<BR>l) v. To recover;<BR>c. to life:<BR>उज्जीवति (जीव्,<BR>l);<BR>c. to an end:<BR>अवसानं गच्छतिः v. To end;<BR>c. to an agreement: v. To agree.<BR>II To<BR>arrive at: q. v.<BR>III: To amount to: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come up
COME UP:<BR>I Lit.: आपतति, प्रा-, सन्नि-, (पत्, c. l),<BR>saw Keyuraka c. -ing up:<BR>आपतन्तं केयूरकमद्राक्षीत्,<BR>K.<BR>II To spring, come out: q. v.: निर्गच्छति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come up to
COME UP TO:<BR>I To arrive at:<BR>(1) समुपगच्छति;<BR>(2) समागच्छति;<BR>(3) समायाति:<BR>(4) समुपसर्पति<BR>(सृप्, c. l).<BR>II Fig.: to equal: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come up with
COME UP WITH: v. To overtake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

come upon
COME UPON: आक्रामति (क्रम्, c. l): v. To attach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comedian
COMEDIAN:<BR>I An actor: q. v.: नटः।<BR>II A<BR>writer: *हर्षप्रधाननाटकलेखकः,<BR>or<BR>रचयितृ (m.) or<BR>-कृत,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=132" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comedy
COMEDY: *हर्षप्रधाननाटकं (or less precisely) नाटकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comeliness
COMELINESS: v. Suitableness, symmetry, gra-<BR>-cefulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comely
COMELY:<BR>I Becoming: q. v.<BR>II Beautiful,<BR>handsome: q. v.: सुदर्शनः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comet
COMET:<BR>(1) धूमकेतुः, Ku. iii. 32.;<BR>(2) केतुः, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cometary
COMETARY:<BR>(1) by comp. with धमकेतु-;<BR>(2)<BR>by gen. of धूमकेतु।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfit
COMFIT: v. Sweetmeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfort
COMFORT (v. t.): आश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्): v.<BR>Console, cheer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfort
COMFORT (subs.):<BR>I Consolation, solace:<BR>q. v.: आश्वासः।<BR>II Pleasure: सुखम्,<BR>enjoying<BR>every c.<BR>सर्वसुखान्यनुमवन्तः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfortable
COMFORTABLE:<BR>are you c. here:<BR>अप्यत्र भवत्याः<BR> सुखम्? V. p.: v. Pleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfortably
COMFORTABLY: सुख-, in comp.,<BR>sleeping c.:<BR>सुखसुप्तः<BR>(प्ता, प्तं), Mah.: v. Pleasantly, conveniently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comforter
COMFORTER: आश्वासकः or expr. by verb: v.<BR>To console.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comfortless
COMFORTLESS; v. Uncomfortable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comic
COMIC, COMICAL:<BR>I Diverting, sportive:<BR>q. v.:<BR>(1) हासकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) हासजननः (नी,<BR> नं).<BR>II Relating to a comedy:<BR>is this<BR>drama c.<BR>*अपि नाटकमिदं हर्षप्रधानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coming
COMING:<BR>I Subs: आगमः, -नं।<BR>II Adj.: आगा-<BR>मिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comma
COMMA: *कमा; पदविच्छेदकचिह्नविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

command
COMMAND (v. t.):<BR>I To give a c.:<BR>(1) आज्ञा-<BR>पयति, सं-, (c. of ज्ञा) (with two acc.), c. (me)<BR>what you have to be done:<BR>आज्ञापय यत्ते करणीय-<BR>मस्ति, Ku. iii. 3;<BR>(2) आ-दिशति, नि-, (दिश्,<BR>c. 6): v. To order.<BR>II To be in c. of:<BR>(1) अधितिष्ठति (स्था, c. l),<BR>the forces c. ed by my<BR>father:<BR>ताताधिष्ठितानां बलानाम्, Ve. iii.;<BR>(2) अध्यास्ते<BR>(आस्, c. 2),<BR>Virūpākṣa wanted to c. the<BR>heart of the city:<BR>विरूपाक्षः पुरोदरमव्यासिसिषांचक्रे,<BR>B. xiv. 16.<BR>III To govern, control: q. v.<BR>IV Of position; expr. by circum,<BR>the house<BR>c. s a beautiful view of the lake:<BR>*अस्माद्गृहात्सरः<BR> सुन्दरमवलोकयिन्तुं शक्यते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

command
COMMAND (subs.):<BR>I Order:<BR>(1) आज्ञा,<BR>at<BR>Rāma's c.<BR>रामाज्ञया, R.;<BR>(2) आदेश:<BR>or<BR>निदेशः,<BR>receiving their master's c.:<BR>भर्तुरादेशं समवाप्य, Ki.<BR>vi. 43,;<BR>(3) शासनम् (a stronger term),<BR>who<BR>would transgress your majesty's c.:<BR>कोदेवस्य शासन-<BR>मुल्लङ्घयिष्यति, Mu. iii.;<BR>(4) नियोगः (=direc-<BR>-tion),<BR>by his father's c.:<BR>पितुर्नियोगात्, R. xiv.<BR>43.<BR>II The power to c.: expr. by circum.,<BR>putting himself in c. of his treasury and army:<BR>तत्कोषवाहनमात्माधिष्ठितं कृत्वा, D. viii.: v. To<BR>command (II); appoint (him)<BR>to the c. of the<BR>army:<BR>अभिषिच्यतां सैनापत्ये, Ve.<BR>III Control,<BR>government: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commandant
COMMANDANT: v. Commander.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commander
COMMANDER:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) आज्ञापकः, c. of all kings:<BR>सर्वभूतलभुजामाज्ञापकः, Mu. ii.;<BR>(2) आदेष्ट्ट (m.).<BR>II<BR>Of an army:<BR>(1) सेनानीः;<BR>(2) सेनापतिः;<BR>(3)<BR>सेनाध्यक्षः<BR>III Of a vessel: पोताध्यक्षः; पोतनायकः;<BR>and im. comp. s. Ph.:<BR>c. -in-chief:<BR>महासनापतिः<BR>(used in ancient grants): v. Generalissimo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commemorate
COMMEMORATE: कीर्तयति, सं-, (कीर्त्, c. 10) (?):<BR>v. To celebrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commemoration
COMMEMORATION: संकीर्तनम् (?): v. Celebration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commemorative
COMMEMORATIVE: स्मारकः (की, कं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commence
COMMENCE:<BR>(1) आरभते (रभ्, c. l);<BR>(2) प्रक्रमते<BR>(क्रम्, c. l): v. To begin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commencement
COMMENCEMENT:<BR>(1) आरम्भः;<BR>(2) प्रारम्भः: v.<BR>Beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commend
COMMEND (v. t.):<BR>I To entrust, deliver: q. v.:<BR>अर्पयति (c. of ॠ).<BR>II To praise: q. v.: प्रशंसति<BR>(शंस्, c. l).<BR>III To recommend: q. v.<BR>IV To<BR>present as worthy of regard: expr. by अभि-<BR>मतः (ता, तं) or circum.,<BR>what you say does not<BR>c. to me:<BR>त्वद्वचो नामिनन्दामि, Sa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commendable
COMMENDABLE: शलाध्यः (ध्था, घ्यं): v. Praise-<BR>-worthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commendably
COMMENDABLY: v. Laudably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commendation
COMMENDATION:<BR>I Approbation, praise:<BR>q. v.<BR>II Recommendation: q. v.<BR>III Com-<BR>-pliments: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commendatory
COMMENDATORY:<BR>I Subs.: v. Praise.<BR>II Adj.:<BR>expr. by comp. Ph.:<BR>this is c.:<BR>अर्थवाद एषः, U.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commensurable
COMMENSURABLE: सजातीयः (या, यं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commensurate
COMMENSURATE:<BR>I Lit.: सजातीयः (या, यं) (?).<BR>II Proportional: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=133" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comment
COMMENT (v.):<BR>I To annotate: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To make remarks: अनुयुनक्ति (युज्, c. l) (?):<BR>v. Remark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comment
COMMENT (subs.):<BR>I In pl., observations,<BR>remarks: q. v.<BR>II Annotation, explana-<BR>-tion: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commentary
COMMENTARY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) व्याख्या;<BR>(2) वृत्तिः,<BR>c. on Manu:<BR>मनुवृत्तिः, K. b.;<BR>(3) टीका,<BR>Rāmā-<BR>yaṇa with its c.:<BR>सटीकं रामायणम्;<BR>(4) भाष्यम् (=c.<BR>on aphorisms).<BR>II Criticism: q. v. Ph.:<BR>c. s.<BR>of Caesar.:<BR>*किंशूरव्याख्यानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commentator
COMMENTATOR:<BR>(1) व्याख्यातृ (m.);<BR>(2) टीकाकारः;<BR>(3) भाष्यकारः (c. of aphorisms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commentitious
COMMENTITIOUS: काल्पनिकः (की, कं): V. Ficti-<BR>-tious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commerce
COMMERCE:<BR>I Trade, traffic: वाणिज्यम्।<BR>II<BR>Intercourse: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commercial
COMMERCIAL:<BR>(1) comp. with वाणिज्य-;<BR>(2)<BR>वाणिज्यविषयकः (का, कं).<BR>C.-treaty<BR>*वाणिज्य-<BR>द्रव्याणामागमनिर्गमविषयकः सन्धिः; a c. nation<BR>*वाणिज्यपरायणा जातिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commination
COMMINATION: तर्जनम्ः v. Threat, menace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commingle
COMMINGLE: मिश्रयति, सं-, (मिश्र्, c. 10.): v.<BR>To mingle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comminute
COMMINUTE: चूर्णयति (चूर्ण्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>pulverize, grind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commiserate
COMMISERATE: दयते (दय्, c. l.): v. To pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commiseration
COMMISERATION:<BR>(1) दया;<BR>(2) अनुकम्पाः v. Pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commissariat
COMMISSARIAT:<BR>I The department: *वीवध-<BR>दानविभागः<BR>II Commissaryship: अधिकारः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commissary
COMMISSARY: अधिकृतः (?),<BR>c. of horse:<BR>*अश्वाधि-<BR>कृतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commission
COMMISSION (subs.):<BR>I Perpetration: q. v.:<BR>Ph.:<BR>c. of sin:<BR>पापाचरणम्, K. b.;<BR>was caught in<BR>the c. of theft:<BR>चौर्यं कुर्वन् गृहीतः।<BR>II Entrusting:<BR>अर्पणम्, सम्-।<BR>III The business entrusted:<BR>नियोगः,<BR>attend to your c.:<BR>स्वं नियोगमशून्यं कुरु, Sa.<BR>IV A number of persons joined in an<BR>office or trust: *परीक्षकाः (m. pl.). V. Allow-<BR>-ance for transacting business: no equiv.:<BR>expr. by circum.<BR>VI In the army: पदम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commission
COMMISSION (v.): नियुंक्ते (युज्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>charge, empower.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commissioner
COMMISSIONER:<BR>I In gen. sense: अधिकृतः, a<BR>careless c.:<BR>अधिकृतः प्रमादी, H.<BR>II Of a divi<BR>sion: प्रदेशपालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commit
COMMIT (v. t.):<BR>I To entrust: q. v.: अर्पयति,<BR>सम्-, (c. of ॠ), c. these (prisoners) to his<BR>care:<BR>तस्मै समर्पयैतान्, P. Ph.: was c. ted to<BR>prison:<BR>बन्धनमनीयत, D. ii.; to c. to the<BR>sessions:<BR>*अधिवेशनविचारार्थम् अर्पयति; to c. to<BR>memory:<BR>कण्ठस्थं करोति; c. (this) to writing :<BR>अभिलिख्यताम्, Mr. ix.<BR>II To perpetrate :<BR>करोति (कृ, c. 8.),<BR>to c. crimes wilfully:<BR>कामतः<BR>पापानि करोति M.; one who c. s an offence :<BR>अपराधिन् (f. नी).<BR>III To match: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commitment
COMMITMENT: To the sessions: *अधिवेशन-<BR> विचारार्पणम्। For other senses: v. To commit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

committee
COMMITTEE: सभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commodious
COMMODIOUS: v. Convenient, comfortable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commodiously
COMMODIOUSLY: v. Conveniently, comfort<BR>ably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commodiousness
COMMODIOUSNESS:<BR>I Convenience: q. v.<BR>II.<BR>Spaciousness: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commodity
COMMODITY: पण्यम्, import and export of c. s<BR>पण्यानामागमनिर्गमौ, M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

common
COMMON (adj.):<BR>I Belonging to more than<BR>one:<BR>(1) साधारणः (णी णं), c. property<BR>साधारणधनम्, Da.;<BR>c. to many:<BR>बहुसाधारण<BR>(णी, णं), Da.;<BR>(2) सामान्यः (न्या, न्यं), thi<BR>(gem)<BR>is c. to me and Balabhadra:<BR>एतन्म।<BR> बलभद्रस्य च सामान्यम्, V. p.<BR>II Usual, ordinary<BR>(1) साधारणः (णी णं),<BR>c. council:<BR>साधारणसभा<BR>c. crier:<BR>*साधारणघोषकः;<BR>c. noun:<BR>*साधारणनाम<BR>(n.);<BR>(2) सामान्यः (न्या, न्यं), “c. dame”<BR>सामान्यनायिका, Sah.;<BR>c. weaver:<BR>साभान्यकौलिक<BR>P. ii. 5.;<BR>c. word:<BR>सामान्यशब्दः, N. d,; a c.<BR>man:<BR>सामान्यजनः, Ra. v. (इतरः, V. p.). Ph.<BR>c. saying:<BR>जनप्रवादः, N.;<BR>c. gender:<BR>स्त्रीपुंलिङ्गम्<BR>c. law:<BR>देशाचारः;<BR>the c. people:<BR>लौकिकाः, T.<BR>or<BR>प्रकृतयः, R.;<BR>c. sense:<BR>विवेकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

common
COMMON; IN:<BR>(1) सामान्येन<BR>or<BR>सामान्यतः,<BR>but the<BR>three gems were held in c.:<BR>किन्तु रत्नत्रयं साभान्ये<BR> स्थितभ्, Vet.;<BR>(2) साधारण्येन, in c. with others<BR>*अन्येषां साधारण्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

common
COMMON (subs.): साधारणप्रचारभूमिः, V. p. com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=134" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commonplace
COMMONPLACE:<BR>I Adj.: सामान्यः (न्या, न्यं).<BR>C.<BR>book:<BR>*सामान्यसन्निवेशः।<BR>II Subs.: साधारणप्रवादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commonage
COMMONAGE: साधारणभूमौ प्रचाराधिकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commonalty
COMMONALTY: v. Commons. (I)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commons
COMMONS:<BR>I The mass of the people:<BR>(1)<BR>प्रजाः (f. pl.);<BR>(2) प्रकृतयः (f. pl.);<BR>(3)<BR>लोकाः (m. pl.).<BR>The House of C.:<BR>*प्रजासभा।<BR>A member of the H. of C.:<BR>*प्रजासभासदस्यः or<BR>प्रजासभास्थः।<BR>II Provisions, food: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commonly
COMMONLY:<BR>(1) साधारण्येन;<BR>(2) सामान्यतः: v.<BR>Usually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commomwealh
COMMOMWEALH: साधारणतन्त्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commotion
COMMOTION: क्षोभः: v. Agitation, tumult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commune
COMMUNE (v. i.): सम्भाषते (भाष c. l.): v. To<BR>converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commune
COMMUNE: (subs.): मण्डलम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communicable
COMMUNICABLE:<BR>(1) देयः, प्र-, (या, यं), (what<BR>can be given);<BR>(2) कथनीयः (या, यं) (what<BR>can be spoken).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communicate
COMMUNICATE (v. t.):<BR>I To impart, bestow:<BR>q. v.:<BR>(1) ददाति (दा, c. 4.), to c. knowledge:<BR>विद्यां दातुम्, Ki.;<BR>(2) वितरति (तॄ, c. l.),<BR>c. d.<BR>meditation^1<BR>योगं विततार, Ki.<BR>II To reveal:<BR>q. v.:<BR>(1) कथयति (कथ, c. 10.), c. (to us)<BR>the cause of your distemper:<BR>कथय किंनिमित्तस्तेऽयं<BR> सन्तापः, Sa. iii.: v. To speak;<BR>(2) आख्याति<BR>(ख्या, c. 2.),<BR>what cannot be c. d:<BR>अनाख्येयः<BR>(या, यं), K.: v. To represent.<BR>III To<BR>share: q. v.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communicate
COMMUNICATE (v. i.);:<BR>I To share: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To converse: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communication
COMMUNICATION:<BR>I The act of imparting:<BR>(1) दानम्;<BR>(2) वितरणम्।<BR>II Conversation:<BR>q. v.<BR>III Intercourse: q. v.<BR>IV News:<BR>q. v.: सन्देशः: v. Passage: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communicative
COMMUNICATIVE: v. Frank, affable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communicativeness
COMMUNICATIVENESS: v. Frankness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

communion
COMMUNION:<BR>I Intercourse: q. v.: संसर्गः।<BR>II<BR>The Lord's supper: *प्रभोर्भोजनम्।<BR>III A.<BR>body of Christians: समाजः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

community
COMMUNITY:<BR>I Common possession: सामान्यम्।<BR>II A society of people: समाजः।<BR>III The<BR>people in general: प्रजाः (f. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commutable
COMMUTABLE: expr. by ph.: v. To COMMUTE.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commutation
COMMUTATION: परिवर्तनम्: v. Change, ex-<BR>-change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

commute
COMMUTE:<BR>I To exchange: q. v.<BR>II Of<BR>punishment:<BR>his sentence of death was c. d to<BR>banishment:<BR>*तस्य प्राणदण्डमुन्मूल्य निर्वासनभादिष्टम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compact
COMPACT (adj.):<BR>(1) संहतः (तां, तं), सु-;<BR>(2)<BR>निविडः (डा, डं);<BR>(3) सान्द्रः (न्द्रा, न्द्रं): v.<BR>Dense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compact
COMPACT (v. t.): सु-संहतः (ता, तं) करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compact
COMPACT (subs.): संविद् (f.): v. Contract,<BR>agreement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compactly
COMPACTLY: expr. by adj.: v. Densely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compactness
COMPACTNESS:<BR>I Density, solidity,: q. v.:<BR>संधातः<BR>II Of style: संक्षेपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

companion
COMPANION:<BR>(1) सहचरः (f. री),<BR>in the hand of<BR>his c. spring:<BR>सहचरमधुहस्ते, Ku.;<BR>(2) सखा<BR>(f. खी) (=boon c.),<BR>in the presence of her two<BR>c. s.:<BR>सख्योः समक्षम्, Ku.;<BR>(3) सहचारिन् (f. णी),<BR>they were c. s from childhood and exceedingly<BR>fond of each other:<BR>तौ बाल्यात् प्रभृति सहचारिणौ,<BR> परस्परमतीव स्नेहपरौ, P.: v. Also partner,<BR>attendant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

companionable
COMPANIONABLE: v. Affable, sociable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

companionship
COMPANIONSHIP:<BR>(1) साहचर्यम्, Ku.;<BR>(2) सह-<BR>चरत्वम्, M. n..<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

company
COMPANY:<BR>I Companionship: q. v. To bear<BR>c.: v. To accompany. To keep c.: v.<BR>To associate.<BR>II An assemblage or associa-<BR>-tion: q. v.:<BR>(1) समाजः;<BR>(2) दलम्।<BR>III For<BR>trading purposes: *दलम्।<BR>IV Of soldiers:<BR>(1) गुल्भः;<BR>(2) दलम् (?). V. A ship's crew:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comparable
COMPARABLE:<BR>(1) तुल्यः (ल्या, ल्यं);<BR>(2) सदृशः<BR>(शी, शं): v. Like.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comparative
COMPARATIVE<BR>I Not positive: Ph.:<BR>c. levity to<BR>water:<BR>*जलापेक्षया लाघवम्;<BR>the c. advantages of<BR>this place:<BR>अन्यान्यस्थानापेक्षायास्य स्थानस्य गुणाः।<BR>II<BR>In gram.: द्वयोरेकस्यातिशयद्योतकः (का, कं).<BR>III<BR>Based on comprehensive comparison:<BR>c. anatomy:<BR>*विश्वव्यवच्छेदविद्यासारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comparatively
COMPARATIVELY: often not expr., c. taller:<BR>द्राधीयस (f. सी), Ki. xi. 2.; c. lovelier: [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">Page136</a>]<BR>पूर्वाकाराधिकतररुच्, R. viii. 95.: v. Compara-<BR>-tive (I.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=135" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compare
COMPARE (v. t.):<BR>I To examine: q. v.: एकत्र-<BR>परीक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. l.).<BR>II To liken q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>तुलयति (तुल्, c. 10.),<BR>and it is c. d with the<BR>moon:<BR>तदपि च शशाङ्केन तुलितम्, J.;<BR>(2) उपमिमीते<BR>(मा, c. 3.),<BR>there is nothing to be c. d with<BR>you nor any thing with which you may be c. d:<BR>नोपमानमसि नाप्युपमेयः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compared with
COMPARED WITH:<BR>(1) तुलनया;<BR>(2) औपम्येन;<BR>(3) better by comp. degree.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comparison
COMPARISON:<BR>(1) तुला<BR>or<BR>तुलना,<BR>then there could<BR>be c. with her:<BR>अस्यास्ततः स्यात्तुलनापि नाम, N.;<BR>(2)<BR>उपभा, -नं,<BR>bore c. with trees:<BR>महीरुहाणामुपमानं<BR> दधुः, Si.: v. Likeness.<BR>Standard of c.:<BR>उपमानम्,<BR>your body which was the standard of c. on<BR>account of its beauty:<BR>उपमानमभूत्करणं यत्तव<BR> कान्तिमत्तया, Ku.<BR>Subject of c.:<BR>उपमेयः (या, यं)<BR>of the standard and the subject of c.<BR>उपमानोप-<BR>मेययोः, Kav.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compartment
COMPARTMENT:<BR>I Of an edifice:<BR>(1) कक्षा;<BR>(2) शाला;<BR>houses with numerous c. s:<BR>भूरिशालानि<BR> गृहाणि, Si.<BR>II A division:<BR>(1) खण्ड (mn.);<BR>(2) परिच्छेदः;<BR>(3) विमागः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compass
COMPASS (subs.):<BR>I Circuit, extent: q. v.:<BR>परिसरः।<BR>II An instrument: दिङ्निर्णययन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compass
COMPASS (v.):<BR>I To encompass: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>attain: q. v.: अधिगच्छति।<BR>III To contrive:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassion
COMPASSION:<BR>(1) अनुकम्पा,<BR>c. for animals:<BR>भूतानु-<BR>कम्पा, R.;<BR>(2) अनुक्रोशः (rare): v. Pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassion
COMPASSION, TO HAVE or FEEL: अनुकम्पते (कम्प्,<BR>c. l.) (with acc.). v.: To pity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassionate
COMPASSIONATE (adj.): करुणार्द्रः (र्द्रा, र्द्रं);<BR>(2)<BR>सदयः (या, यं);<BR>(3) कृपालु (mfn.);<BR>(4) दयालु<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(5) सानुकम्पः (म्पा, म्पं);<BR>(6) कारुणिकः<BR>(की, कं): v. Pitiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compassionately
COMPASSIONATELY:<BR>(1) सानुकम्पम्;<BR>(2) सदयम्;<BR>(3) कृपया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatible
COMPATIBLE: सुसङ्गतः (ता, तं): v. Suitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compatriot
COMPATRIOT: स्वदेशीयसहयोगिन् (m.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compeer
COMPEER: वयस्यः: v. Friend, companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compel
COMPEL:<BR>I To constrain: expr. by casual<BR>form with बलात्<BR>or<BR>बलेन,<BR>should be c. led to<BR>reside:<BR>बलाद् वासयितव्यः, Vri.; to c. to do work:<BR>बलादिष्टं कर्म कारयति, Viv.<BR>II To seize: बलाद्<BR> गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.). C. led: sometime = must:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compellable
COMPELLABLE: expr. by future pass. part:<BR>c. to pay:<BR>बलाद्दाप्यः (प्या, प्यं);<BR>c. to do:<BR>बलात्<BR> कार्यः (र्या, र्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complellation
COMPLELLATION: सम्भाषणम्; आभाषणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compend
COMPEND: v. Compendium.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendious
COMPENDIOUS: संक्षिप्तः (प्ता, प्तं): v. Brief, concise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendiously
COMPENDIOUSLY: समासेनः v. Briefly, concisely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compendium
COMPENDIUM:<BR>(1) सारः, c. of political science:<BR>नोतिसारः;<BR>(2) सारसंग्रहः, S. g.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensate
COMPENSATE (v. t.):<BR>I To recompense: उदयं<BR> ददाति (दा, c. 3.), Viv.<BR>II To counter-<BR>-balance, c. for: often expr. by दूरीकरोति<BR>(=distance.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compensation
COMPENSATION:<BR>(1) उदयः;<BR>(2) निष्कृतिः (of a<BR>debt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compete
COMPETE: स्पर्धते (स्पर्ध्, c. l.),<BR>the accursed<BR>Rākṣasa is c. ing with me:<BR>मया सह स्पर्धते<BR> राक्षसहतकः, Mu.: v. To emulate, contend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competence
COMPETENCE, COMPETENCY:<BR>(1) सामर्थ्यम्;<BR>(2)<BR>शक्तिः,<BR>according to one's c.<BR>शक्त्यपेक्षम्, N.: v.<BR>Ability, sufficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competent
COMPETENT:<BR>I Fit.: q. v.: योग्यः (ग्या, ग्यं),<BR>c. minister:<BR>योग्यसचिवः, Ra.;<BR>c. to give evi-<BR>dence:<BR>साक्षित्वयोग्यः (ग्या, ग्यं), K. b.<BR>II Able:<BR>q. v.: समर्थः (र्था, र्थं).<BR>III Belonging to:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competently
COMPETENTLY: expr. by adj.: v. Sufficiently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competition
COMPETITION: स्पर्धा (=emulation); प्रतियोगिता<BR>(=opposition); *सहार्थिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

competitor
COMPETITOR: प्रतिस्पर्धिन् (f. नी); सहार्थिन्<BR>(f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compilation
COMPILATION:<BR>I The act: सङ्कलनम्।<BR>II A<BR>compiled work: सङ्कलितग्रन्थः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compile
COMPILE (v. t.): Ph.:<BR>a Sanskrit dictionary c. d<BR>by Tārānāth Bhaṭṭāchārya<BR>श्रीतारानाथमट्टाचार्येण<BR> सङ्कलितं (कल् c. l. and 10.) संस्कृताभिधानम्;<BR>c. d. from the works of the elders:<BR>पूर्वेषां<BR> शास्त्राण्यालोड्योपन्यास्थत् (अस, c. 4.), D. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=136" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compiler
COMPILER: सङ्कलयितृ (f. त्री) (when the mean-<BR>-ing is clear); शास्त्रान्तरेभ्यः सङ्कलयितृ (f. त्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complacency
COMPLACENCY:<BR>I Satisfaction: q. v.: प्रसादः।<BR>II Civility: सौजन्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complacent
COMPLACENT: प्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं): v. Pleasing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complacently
COMPLACENTLY:<BR>(1) expr. by the adj;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रसन्नमनसा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complain
COMPLAIN:<BR>did not c. of her husband:<BR>भर्तुरवर्णं<BR> नावदत, R.; c. ed all this in piteous language:<BR>कथयमास तत्सर्वं खेदात्करुणभाषिणी, V. p.;<BR>other-<BR>wise I will go and c. in the court:<BR>अन्यथा राज-<BR>कुलं गत्वा निवेदयिष्यामि, P.: To represent,<BR>lament, accuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complainant
COMPLAINANT:<BR>(1) अभियोक्तृ (f. क्त्री);<BR>(2)<BR>अर्थिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) वादिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complaint
COMPLAINT:<BR>I In law: अभियोगः<BR>II A dis-<BR>-case: पीडा।<BR>III In gen. sense:<BR>(1) दुःखम्<BR>(=distress);<BR>(2) विलापः (= lamentation).<BR>Ph.:<BR>I have heard c. s against you:<BR>श्रुतो मया<BR> तवापवादः, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complaisance
COMPLAISANCE: दाक्षिण्यम्, from c. towards (us)<BR>seeking your favour<BR>प्रणयिषु दाक्षिण्यवशात्, V.: v.<BR>Courtesy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complaisant
COMPLAISANT:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) दक्षिणः (णा,<BR> णं);<BR>(2) दाक्षिण्यपरवशः (शा, शं), L.<BR>II Of<BR>acts: प्रियः (या, यं), conduct (of gentlemen)<BR>is<BR>c.:<BR>प्रियप्राया वृत्तिः, U.;<BR>with hundreds of c.<BR>language like these:<BR>इत्यादिभिः प्रियशतैः, U.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complaisantly
COMPLAISANTLY: दाक्षिण्येन<BR>or<BR>दाक्षिण्यातिशयेन: v.<BR>Courteously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complement
COMPLEMENT:<BR>I That which completes:<BR>पूरकः (का, कं).<BR>II An accessory: सहायः, Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complete
COMPLETE: (adj.):<BR>(1) पूर्णः (f. र्णा), परि-, सं-,<BR>(=full),<BR>not c. by one:<BR>एकेनापूर्णः (f. र्णा), R.<BR>iii. 33.;<BR>(2) समाप्तः (प्ता, प्तं) (=finished,<BR>concluded),<BR>one whose knowledge is c.:<BR>समाप्त-<BR>विद्यः (द्या, द्यं), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complete
COMPLETE (v. t.):<BR>I To accomplish, finish:<BR>(1) समापयति, परि-, (c. of आप्) (best equi.),<BR>to bring Chandrāpida, who had c. d his knowledge<BR>of all arts:<BR>परिसमाप्तसकलकलाविज्ञानं चन्द्रापीडमानेतुम्,<BR>K.;<BR>(2) अवसाययति (c. of सो),<BR>c. ing the injunc-<BR>tion:<BR>विधिमवसाय्य, R. v. 76;<BR>(3) अशेषयति<BR>(nomi.),<BR>c. ing what was to be done:<BR>कृत्य-<BR>मशेषयित्वा, Ku. vii. 29.<BR>II To make up:<BR>पूरयति, परि-, सं-, (पूर्, c. 10.), he has c. d it now:<BR>तदसौ सम्प्रति पर्य पूरयत्, Si. xvi. 36.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

completely
COMPLETELY:<BR>(1) सम्पूर्णम् (=fully);<BR>(2) अशेषतः<BR>and sim. comp. s (=without anything left),<BR>(their)<BR>wishes are c. fulfilled:<BR>निरवशेषं फलिता<BR> मनोरथाः, Ma. x.: v. Entirely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

completeness
COMPLETENESS:<BR>(1) सम्पूर्णता;<BR>(2) परिपूर्णता;<BR>(3)<BR>पूर्णता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

completion
COMPLETION:<BR>(1) समापनम् (the act): v. Accom-<BR>-plishment;<BR>(2) समाप्तिः (the state): v. End.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complex
COMPLEX: विषमः (मा, मं): v. Intricate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complexion
COMPLEXION:<BR>I Colour of the skin: वर्णः,<BR>of<BR>a dark c.:<BR>कृष्णवर्णः (र्णा, र्णं). Ph.: their c. fell:<BR>स विवर्णभावं प्रपेदे, R. vi. 63.<BR>II Appearance:<BR>q. v.: आकारः।<BR>III Temperament: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complexity
COMPLEXITY: वैषम्यम्: v. Intricacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compliance
COMPLIANCE:<BR>(1) अनुकूलता;<BR>(2) अनुवृत्तिः;<BR>(3)<BR>अनुविधायित्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compliant
COMPLIANT:<BR>I Pliant: q. v.<BR>II Obliging:<BR>(1) अनुरोधिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) अनुविधायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) अनुवृत्तिकुशलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complicate
COMPLICATE (v.):<BR>(1) विषमीकरोति;<BR>(2) सङ्कुली-<BR>करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complication
COMPLICATION: सङ्कटम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complicity
COMPLICITY:<BR>(1) सहायिता;<BR>(2) सहयोगिता;<BR>(3)<BR>सहकारिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compliment
COMPLIMENT (subs.): Perh: अभिनन्दनवचः,<BR>Paraśurāma presents his c. s. to the king of Ceylon<BR>and states:<BR>परशुरामो लङ्केश्वरमभिनन्ध ब्रवीति, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compliment
COMPLIMENT (v. t.): प्रशंसति (शंस्, c. l.): v.<BR>To praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complimentary
COMPLIMENTARY: अभिनन्दकः (का, कं); अभिनन्द-<BR>in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comply
COMPLY (v.):<BR>(1) अनुविधत्ते (धा, c. 3.): v. To<BR>obey;<BR>(2) अनुमन्यते (मन्, c. 4): v. To assent;<BR>(3) पूरयति (पूर, c. 10.): v. To satisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

complying
COMPLYING (adj.): v. Compliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

component
COMPONENT (subs.): साधनम्: v. Part, element.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comport
COMPORT (v.):<BR>I To agree: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>behave: q. v.: व्यवहरति (हृ, c. l.).<BR>III To<BR>bear: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=137" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compose
COMPOSE (v. t.):<BR>I To constitute: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Of books etc.:<BR>(1) रचयति, वि-, (रच्, c. 10.),<BR>c. d this aphorism:<BR>इदं सूत्रं रचयांचकार, Mis.;<BR>c. d by Bāṇabhaṭṭa:<BR>बाणभट्टविरचितः (ता, तं), K.;<BR>(2) प्रणयति (नी, c. l.), c. d the life of Rāma:<BR>रधुपतेः प्रणिनाय वृत्तम्, Ki.;<BR>(3) निबध्नाति (बन्ध्,<BR>c. 9.),<BR>this tale is c. d by him:<BR>तेनेयं कथा निबद्धा,<BR>K.;<BR>(4) सम्पादयति (c. of पद्), to c. a speech:<BR>भारतिं सम्पादयति, Ki.;<BR>(5) ग्रथ्नाति (ग्रन्थ्, c. 9.)<BR>(poet), Si.;<BR>(6) विदधाति (धा, c. 3.) (rare),<BR>B.<BR>III To settle: q. v.<BR>IV To calm,<BR>appease: q. v.: स्थिरीकरोति,<BR>Śakuntalā should<BR>be c. d by you two:<BR>भवतीम्यां स्थिरीकर्तव्या शकुन्तला,<BR>Sa. iv. V. In printing: *विन्यस्यति (अस, c. 4.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composed
COMPOSED (adj.):<BR>I Calm: स्थिरः (रा, रं),<BR>don't<BR>cry, be c.:<BR>अलं रुदितेन, स्थिरा भव, Sa. iv.<BR>II C.<BR>of: v. Made of, consisting of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composedly
COMPOSEDLY:<BR>(1) स्थिरम्;<BR>(2) शान्तचित्तेनः v.<BR>Calmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composedness
COMPOSEDNESS: v. Composure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composer
COMPOSER:<BR>I Of books etc.:<BR>(1) रचयितृ<BR>(f. त्री), वि-;<BR>(2) प्रणेतृ (f. त्री);<BR>(3) निबन्धृ (f. न्ध्री)<BR>(rare).<BR>II One who calms: शभयितृ (f. त्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composition
COMPOSITION:<BR>I Of books etc.:<BR>(1) रचना,<BR> वि-;<BR>(2) प्रणयनम्।<BR>II A book etc. composed:<BR>expr. by verb, this poem is Kālidās's c.:<BR>काव्यमिदं कालिदासेन प्रणीतम्: v. Work.<BR>III<BR>Combinatin: q. v.<BR>IV Adjustment of an<BR>obligation: Perh: निस्तारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compositor
COMPOSITOR: *विन्यासकारिन् (f. णी);<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compost
COMPOST:<BR>I Manure: q. v.<BR>II A mixture:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

composure
COMPOSURE: धैर्यम्,<BR>the son of Pāṇḍu, although<BR>enraged, maintained his c.:<BR>जहौ न धैर्यं कुपितोऽपि<BR> पाण्डवः, Ki.: v. Tranquillity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compotation
COMPOTATION:<BR>(1) सहपानम्;<BR>(2) सम्पीतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compound
COMPOUND (adj.): यौगिकः (किं, कं), c. word:<BR>यौगिकशब्दः। Ph.:<BR>c. interest<BR>चक्रवृद्धिः, Viv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compound
COMPOUND (subs.):<BR>I<BR>A. c. substance:<BR>यौगिक-<BR>पदार्थः।<BR>II A c. word:<BR>(1) योगिकशब्दः;<BR>(2)<BR>समासः,<BR>determined the analysis of c. s:<BR>समासयो-<BR>र्विग्रहं व्यवससुः, Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compound
COMPOUND (v. i.): v. To compromise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compound
COMPOUND (v. t.):<BR>I To make: q. v.: विरचयति<BR>(रच्, c. 10.), I will c. auspicious ointment:<BR>मङ्गलसमालभनं विरचयामि, Sa.<BR>II To combine:<BR>q. v.<BR>III To settle: संधत्ते (धा, c. 3.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprehend
COMPREHEND (v. t.):<BR>I To comprise,<BR>include: q. v.<BR>II To understand, grasp<BR>mentally:<BR>(1) गृह्वाति, परि-, (ग्रह्, c. 9.),<BR>you<BR>have well c. ed my meaning:<BR>सम्यग्गृहीतवानसि<BR> मदाशयम्, Mu. iii.;<BR>(2) वेत्ति (विद्, c. 2.),<BR>who<BR>c. s your real nature:<BR>याथार्थ्यं वेद कस्तव, R.: v.<BR>To understand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprehensible
COMPREHENSIBLE:<BR>(1) ग्राह्यः (ह्या, ह्यं), परि (rare),<BR>in easily c. discourse:<BR>सुखग्राह्यनिबन्धनेन, Ku.<BR>vii. 90.;<BR>not c.:<BR>दुर्ग्रहः (हा, हं) M. n.;<BR>(2)<BR>सुबोधः (धा, धं) (=easily c.), M. n.; not c.:<BR>दुर्बोधः (धा, धं), Ku. i. 6.: v. Intelligible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprehension
COMPREHENSION:<BR>I The act of comprehend-<BR>-ing:<BR>(1) बोधः,<BR>beyond c.:<BR>बोधातीतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) अनुभवः<BR>II A summary: q. v.<BR>III<BR>Understanding: q. v. धीः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprehensive
COMPREHENSIVE:<BR>(1) व्यापिन् (f. नी) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>विस्तीर्णः (र्णा, र्णं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprehensiveness
COMPREHENSIVENESS:<BR>(1) व्यापकता (?) (as of<BR>definitions);<BR>(2) विस्तीर्णता (?) (=extensive-<BR>-ness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compress
COMPRESS (v. t.): संक्षिपति (क्षिप, c. l.): v.<BR>To contact.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compressibility
COMPRESSIBILITY: सङ्कोचशीलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compressible
COMPRESSIBLE: सङ्कोचशीलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compression
COMPRESSION: सङ्कोचः, -नम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprise
COMPRISE: परिगृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.): v. To<BR>include, contain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comprised
COMPRISED, BE: अन्तर्भवति (भू, c. l.),<BR>is c. in<BR>motion:<BR>गमनेऽन्तर्भविष्यति, Ta.: v. To include.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compromise
COMPROMISE (v.):<BR>I To compound:<BR>*आपोषयति (पुष्, c. 10.).<BR>II To involve:<BR>संक्रामयति (c. of क्रम्), will c. me in this misdeed:<BR>इदमकार्यं मयि संक्रामयेत्, Mr.<BR>III To endanger:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compromise
COMPROMISE (subs.): *आपोषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compulsion
COMPULSION: बलम् (=force),<BR>everything done<BR>under c.:<BR>सर्वान् बलकृतानर्थान्, N. To use c.:<BR>सम्पीडयति (पीड्, c. 10.), Viv.: v. To compel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=138" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compulsory
COMPULSORY:<BR>I Compelling: expr. by बल<BR>or<BR>बलात्कारः,<BR>c. gift:<BR>बलाद्दत्तम्, M.<BR>II Obli-<BR>-gatory: expr. by अवश्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compunction
COMPUNCTION: अनुशयः: v. Repentance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

computable
COMPUTABLE:<BR>(1) गण्यः<BR>or<BR>गणनीयः (या, यं),<BR>not<BR>c.:<BR>अगण्य: (f. ण्या);<BR>(2) संख्येयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

computation
COMPUTATION: गणना: v. Reckoning, calcu-<BR>-lation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

compute
COMPUTE (v.): गणयति (गण्, c. 10.): v. Count,<BR>reckon.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

comrade
COMRADE: सहचरः (री, रं): v. Companion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concatenate
CONCATENATE: अनुबध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.): v. To<BR>connect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concatenation
CONCATENATION:<BR>(1) परम्परा;<BR>(2) अनुबन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concave
CONCAVE: *पुटाकारः (रा, रं); मध्यनिम्नः (म्ना, म्नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concavity
CONCAVITY: *पुटाकारता<BR>or<BR>पुटाकृतिः; मध्यनिम्नता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceal
CONCEAL (v. t.):<BR>(1) गूहति, -ते (गूह्, c. l.),<BR>to<BR>c. your good fortune:<BR>आत्मनो सौमाग्यं निगूहितुम्,<BR>V. ii.;<BR>I climbed up a tamarind tree and lay c.<BR>ed:<BR>चिञ्चावृक्षमारुह्य गूढतनुरतिष्ठम्, D. iv.;<BR>(2)<BR>गोपयति (गुप्, c. 10.),<BR>if it is not a subject to be<BR>c. ed:<BR>न चेद्गोप्यमस्ति, D. iv.;<BR>(3) प्रच्छादयति (c.<BR>of छद्), and those who c. it (stolen property):<BR>ये च प्रच्छादयन्ति तान्, Kat.: v. To cover;<BR>(4)<BR>निह्वुते (ह्नु, c. 2.) (=to keep back the truth),<BR>desirous of c. ing from the mistress:<BR>देव्या निह्नोतु-<BR>मिच्छुः, Mu.;<BR>(5) लीयते (ली, c. 4.) (=to lie c.<BR>ed),<BR>have now c. ed yourself in the mire:<BR>पङ्केऽधुना<BR> लीयसे, Ve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concealer
CONCEALER:<BR>(1) गूहकः, नि-;<BR>(2) गोप्तृ, सं-, (m.),<BR>buyer, receiver, and c. of stolen property:<BR>चोरित-<BR>द्रव्याणां क्रोता ग्रहीता संगोप्ता च, Viv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concealment
CONCEALMENT:<BR>(1) गोपनम्, सं-;<BR>(2) गूहनम्, नि-;<BR>(3) प्रच्छादनम्;<BR>(4) निह्नवः, अपह्नु तिः (of facts).<BR>In c.:<BR>गुप्तम्: v. Privately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concede
CONCEDE:<BR>I To allow: q. v.: अनुमन्यते (मन्,<BR>c. 4.).<BR>II To suffer to pass: क्षमते (क्षम्,<BR>c. l.): v. To admit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceit
CONCEIT:<BR>I Conception: q. v.<BR>II Freak,<BR>fancy: q. v.<BR>III Self -c.: अभिमानम्: v.<BR>Vanity.<BR>IV Opinion: q. v.: Ph.:<BR>to put any<BR>one out of c. with:<BR>विरञ्जयति (रञ्ज्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceited
CONCEITED: अभिमानिन् (f. नी): v. Vain, proud.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceitedly
CONCEITEDLY:<BR>(1) साभिमानम्;<BR>(2) साहङ्कारम्;<BR>(3) साटोपम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceitedness
CONCEITEDNESS: अभिमानिता: v. Vanity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceivable
CONCEIVABLE: भाव्यः (व्या, व्यं)<BR>or<BR>भावनीयः (या,<BR> यं), वि-<BR>fortitude whose power is not c.:<BR>धैर्यमबि-<BR>भाव्यवैभवम्, Ki.: v. Comprehensible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conceive
CONCEIVE (v.):<BR>I<BR>To c. a child:<BR>गर्भं दधाति or<BR>धत्ते (धा, c. 3.)<BR>or<BR>धारयति<BR>or<BR>धरति (धृ, c. 10.<BR>and 1.),<BR>to c. by him:<BR>तस्माद्गर्भं दधाति (after<BR>R.). Ph.:<BR>and the Queen of Benares c. d a<BR>daughter:<BR>काशिराजस्य पत्न्याश्च गर्भे कन्या आसीत्,<BR>V. p.: v. Pregnant.<BR>II To form in the<BR>mind: भावयति, वि-, (c. of भू),<BR>c. ing the frailty<BR>of every substance:<BR>भावयित्वानित्यतां सर्वभावानां,<BR>K.: v. Think, desire.<BR>III To imagine:<BR>q. v.: सम्भावयति (c. of भू),<BR>who would c. that<BR>king Chandragupta would sell ornaments:<BR>मौर्ये<BR> भूषणाविक्रयं नरपतौ को नाम सम्भावयेत्, Mu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concentrate
CONCENTRATE:<BR>I To bring together: समा-<BR>हरति (हृ, c. l.).<BR>II Of the mind expr. by<BR>adj.: एकाग्रचित्तः (त्ता, त्तं), अनन्यमनस्कः (स्का, स्कं),<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concentration
CONCENTRATION:<BR>I Bringing together:<BR>समाहारः<BR>II Of the mind:<BR>(1) एकाग्रता;<BR>(2)<BR>अनन्यमनस्कता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conception
CONCEPTION:<BR>I The act of conceiving (off-<BR>-spring):<BR>(1) गर्भाधानम्;<BR>(2) गर्भधारणम्।<BR>II For-<BR>-mation in the mind: भावना, वि-।: v.<BR>Imagination.<BR>III The faculty of c.: धीः।<BR>v. Understanding.<BR>IV Notion, idea: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concern
CONCERN (subs.):<BR>I Affairs, business: q. v.:<BR>व्यापारः<BR>II Care, anxiety: q. v.: चिन्ता।<BR>Ph.:<BR>with much c.:<BR>सोद्वेगम्, Mu.<BR>III A firm:<BR>सम्प्रदायः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concern
CONCERN (v.):<BR>I To affect the interest of:<BR>Ph.:<BR>this c. s you:<BR>भवतस्तावदयं व्यापारः, H.<BR>II<BR>To make interested in: expr. by verbs:<BR>चिन्तयति: (चिन्त्, c. 10.) (=to think)<BR>or<BR>अवेक्षते<BR>(ईक्ष्, c. 10.) (=to look after).<BR>III To make<BR>uneasy: expr. by adj. s: उद्विग्नः (ग्ना, ग्नं),<BR>उत्सुकः (का, कं)<BR>or<BR>व्यग्रः (ग्रा, ग्रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concerning
CONCERNING (prep.): विषयः (या, यं).: v.<BR>About (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=139" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concert
CONCERT (v.): मन्त्रयति (मन्त्र, c. 10.),<BR>well c. ed<BR>measures succeed:<BR>सिव्यन्ति कार्याणि सुमन्त्रितानि,<BR>B.: v. To devise, plan.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concert
CONCERT (subs.):<BR>I Agreement: q. v.:<BR>ऐक्यम्।<BR>II Harmony: q. v.<BR>III A musical<BR>entertainment: सङ्गीतम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concession
CONCESSION:<BR>I The act of conceding:<BR>(1)<BR>अनुमोदनम्;<BR>(2) अनुमतिः।<BR>II A boon: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conch
CONCH:<BR>I A shell: शङ्तः।<BR>II A Bahamite:<BR>*शङ्घः; बाहमवासिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conciliate
CONCILIATE (v.):<BR>(1) अनुरञ्जयति (रञ्ज्, c. 10.);<BR>(2) प्रसादयति (c. of सद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conciliation
CONCILIATION:<BR>(1) अनुरञ्जनम्;<BR>(2) प्रसादनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conciliatory
CONCILIATORY:<BR>(1) अनुरञ्जकः (का, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>प्रासादनः (ना। नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concise
CONCISE:<BR>I As applied to language:<BR>(1)<BR>संक्षिप्तः (प्ता, प्तं), Si. ii. 24.;<BR>(2) लघुः (f. घ्वी)<BR>(=terse), Si. ii. 23.<BR>II As applied to<BR>writers etc. expr. by the above:<BR>he is a<BR>very c. writer:<BR>तस्य भाषातिसंक्षिप्ता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concisely
CONCISELY:<BR>(1) संक्षेपतः: v. Briefly;<BR>(2)<BR>सलाघवम् v. Tersely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conciseness
CONCISENESS:<BR>(1) संक्षिप्तता;<BR>(2) लाघवम्, Ki.<BR>xi. 38.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclave
CONCLAVE:<BR>I A private assembly: गूढसभा।<BR>II Of cardinals: *रोमकधर्मनियन्तॄणां सभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclude
CONCLUDE (v.):<BR>I To shut up: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>include: q. v.<BR>III To infer, guess q. v.:<BR>भावयति (c. of भू).<BR>IV To finish: q. v.:<BR>समापयति (c. of आप्). Ph.:<BR>when he c. d:<BR>वचस्य-<BR>वसिते तस्मिन्, Ku. ii. 53;<BR>to c. a treaty:<BR>सन्धिं<BR> करोति<BR>or<BR>विदधाति (धा, c. 3.), H. V. To decide:<BR>q. v.: अवधारयति (धृ, c. 10.), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclusion
CONCLUSION:<BR>I End: q. v.:<BR>(1) समाप्तिः,<BR>c. of<BR>a song:<BR>गीतसमाप्तिः, K.;<BR>(2) अवसानम्,<BR>at the c. of<BR>Sunandā's speech:<BR>सुनन्दावचनावसाने, R.<BR>II<BR>Decision, determination: q. v.:<BR>(1) अवधारणा;<BR>(2) निर्णयः,<BR>come to a c.:<BR>निर्णयम् आसीदति, N.<BR>III Inference: q. v.: अनुभवः, K.<BR>IV<BR>Logical c.:<BR>(1) निगमनम्, N. d.;<BR>(2) निर्णयः,<BR>N. d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclusive
CONCLUSIVE: अखण्ड्यः (ण्ड्या, ण्ड्यं) (=irrefut-<BR>-able: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclusively
CONCLUSIVELY:<BR>(1) expr. by adj.;<BR>(2) निश्चयेन<BR>(=certainly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conclusiveness
CONCLUSIVENESS: अखण्डता<BR>or<BR>अखण्डनीयता (=irre-<BR>-futableness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concoct
CONCOCT (v.):<BR>I To digest: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>ripen: q. v.<BR>III To devise, contrive, plot:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concoction
CONCOCTION:<BR>I Digestion: q. v.<BR>II Contri-<BR>-vance: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concoctive
CONCOCTIVE: पाचनः (नी, नं): v. Digestive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concomitance
CONCOMITANCE: सङ्गः (with gen.); often<BR>expr. by sim. सह (=with).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concomitant
CONCOMITANT (adj.):<BR>(1) आनुषङ्गिकः (की, कं);<BR>(2) सहवर्तिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concord
CONCORD:<BR>I Union: q. v.: ऐक्यम्।<BR>II Com-<BR>-pact: q. v.<BR>III In gram:<BR>(1) अन्वयः, सम्-;<BR>(2) योजना,<BR>remote c.:<BR>व्यवहितयोजना, Da.<BR>IV<BR>Harmony: q. v.: ऐक्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concordance
CONCORDANCE:<BR>I Agreement: q. v.<BR>II A<BR>glossary: निर्घण्टः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concourse
CONCOURSE:<BR>I A crowd: q. v.: जनसमूहः।<BR>II A collection: समवायः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concrement
CONCREMENT:<BR>(1) संहतिः;<BR>(2) सङ्घातः, hard by c.:<BR>सङ्घातकठिनः (ना, नं), Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concrete
CONCRETE (adj.):<BR>I United in growth:<BR>(1) संहतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) सङ्घातवत् (f. ती).<BR>II Not<BR>abstract: Perh. स्थूलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concrete
CONCRETE (subs.): संहतपदार्थः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concubinage
CONCUBINAGE: विना विवाहेन सहवासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concubine
CONCUBINE: उपपत्नी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concupiscence
CONCUPISCENCE: कामः: v. Lust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concupiscent
CONCUPISCENT: कामुकः (का, कं): v. Lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concur
CONCUR:<BR>I To agree: q. v.: अभ्युपगच्छति (गम्,<BR>c. l.).<BR>II To assent: अनुमन्यते (मन्, c. 4.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concurrence
CONCURRENCE:<BR>I Union: q. v.<BR>II Agree-<BR>-ment, consent: q. v.: सम्मतिः Ph.: with-<BR>out the c. of (my)<BR>mother:<BR>अननुमोदिता मात्रा, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concurrent
CONCURRENT:<BR>I Concomitant: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Equal: q. v.: समानः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concurrently
CONCURRENTLY:<BR>(1) सममेव, Ku. iv. 22.;<BR>(2)<BR>सहैव, Ki. xiv. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

concussion
CONCUSSION: संक्षोमः: v. Agitation, shock.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condemn
CONDEMN (v. t.):<BR>I To censure: q. v.: निन्दति [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">Page141</a>]<BR>(निन्द्, c. l.)<BR>II To pass sentence: दण्डयति<BR>(दण्ड्, c. 10.)<BR>or<BR>दण्डं करोति<BR>or<BR>दण्डम् आज्ञापयति<BR>(c. of ज्ञा) Mu. Ph.:<BR>c. to death:<BR>वधम् आदिशति<BR>(दिश्, c. 6.), P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=140" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condemnable
CONDEMNABLE:<BR>(1) दण्डार्हः (र्हा, र्हं) (=deserv-<BR>-ing of punishment);<BR>(2) निन्द्यः (न्द्या, न्द्यं)<BR>(=censurable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condemnation
CONDEMNATION:<BR>I Censure: q. v.: उपालम्भः।<BR>II Judicial c.: अपराधनिर्णयः, and sim.<BR>comp. s;<BR>(2) दण्डप्रणयनम् (=passing sentence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condemnatory
CONDEMNATORY: अपराधवादिन् (f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condemner
CONDEMNER: अपराधवादिन् (f. नी) (?): v.<BR>Censurer. punisher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condensation
CONDENSATION:<BR>I The act: संहननम् (?).<BR>II<BR>The state: संहतिः।<BR>III Of stile: Perh: समाहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condense
CONDENSE:<BR>I Trans.: संहन्ति (हन्, c. 2).<BR>II<BR>Intrans.: संहतः (ता, तं) भवति (भू, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condenser
CONDENSER: संहतियन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condescend
CONDESCEND: प्रसीदति (सद्, c. l.) (=be<BR>pleased),<BR>c. to amuse yourself in the southern<BR>regions:<BR>प्रसीद रन्तुं मलयस्थलीषु, R. vi. 64.: v.<BR>To yield, vouchsafe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condescending
CONDESCENDING: दक्षिणः (णा,) (=com-<BR>-plaisant): v. Courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condescendingly
CONDESCENDINGLY: प्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं) भूत्वा;<BR> दाक्षिण्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condescension
CONDESCENSION:<BR>(1) दाक्षिण्यम् (=complaisance);<BR>(2) प्रसादः (=favour).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condign
CONDIGN: यथार्हः (र्हा, र्हं): v. Suitable; to<BR>deserve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condignness
CONDIGNNESS: यथार्हताः v. Fitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condiment
CONDIMENT: उपस्करः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condition
CONDITION:<BR>I State, predicament:<BR>(1) दशा,<BR>very bad c. of the tanks:<BR>दीर्घिकाणां सुदुर्दशा, Ku.;<BR>that (body)<BR>is reduced to this c.:<BR>तदिदं गतमीदृशीं<BR> दशाम्, Ku. iv. 5.;<BR>(2) अवस्था,<BR>in all c. s:<BR>सर्वा-<BR>वस्थासु, Me. ii. 47.<BR>II Stipulation:<BR>(1)<BR>समयः;<BR>(2) अभिसन्धिः।<BR>I will give it back on<BR>one c.;<BR>एकेनाभिसन्धिना प्रत्यर्पयामि, Sa.<BR>III<BR>Quality, property: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conditional
CONDITIONAL:<BR>I Lit:<BR>(1) समययुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(2) साभिसन्धि (mfn.).<BR>II In gram.: विकल्प-<BR>सूचकः (का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conditionally
CONDITIONALLY:<BR>(1) समयपूर्वकम्,<BR>(2) साभिसन्धि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condole
CONDOLE (v.):<BR>(1) शोचति (शुच्, c. l.): v. To<BR>grieve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condolence
CONDOLENCE: समदुःखता: v. Also grief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condonation
CONDONATION: क्षमा: v. Forgiveness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

condone
CONDONE: क्षमते (क्षम्, c. l.): v. To<BR>forgive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conduce to
CONDUCE TO or TOWARD:<BR>(1) वर्धयति (c. of<BR>वृध्) (=to increase)<BR>(2) आबहति (वह्, c. l.)<BR>(=to bring about);<BR>(3) जनयति (c. of जन्)<BR>(=to produce).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conducive
CONDUCIVE:<BR>(1) आवहः (हा, हं) in comp.,<BR>c. to<BR>sorrow:<BR>शोकावहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2) करः (री, रं) in<BR>comp. (=producing),<BR>c. to good:<BR>हितकर<BR>(री, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conduct
CONDUCT (subs.):<BR>I The act of leading:<BR>expr. by verb.<BR>II Management, guidance:<BR>q. v.<BR>III Skilful guidance: कौशलम्।<BR>IV<BR>One who c. s.: expr. by verb. V. Behavi-<BR>-our:<BR>(1) व्यवहारः;<BR>(2) वृत्तिः<BR>or<BR>वृत्तम्,<BR>by your<BR>c.:<BR>तव वृत्तेन, R.:<BR>(3) चेष्टा<BR>or<BR>चेष्टितम्,<BR>his brother's<BR>c.:<BR>भ्रातृचेष्टितम्, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conduct
CONDUCT (v. t.):<BR>I To lead:<BR>(1) नयति (नी,<BR>c. l.), c. (me) to my residence in a new cloud:<BR>नय मां नवेन वसतिं पयोमुचा, V. ;<BR>(2) प्रापयति (c. of<BR>आप्),<BR>to conduct mistresses to the residence of<BR>their lovers:<BR>कामिनां वसतिं प्रियाः प्रापयितुम्, Ku.<BR>iv. II.;<BR>(3) अनुगच्छति (गम्, c. l.) to accom-<BR>-pany Mr.<BR>II To direct, control: q. v.<BR>III<BR>To manage: q. v.: निर्वाहयति (c. of वह्).<BR>IV<BR>To behave: q. v.:<BR>(1) आचरति (चर्, c. l.);<BR>(2) व्यवहरति (हृ, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conductor
CONDUCTOR:<BR>I A leader, guide: q. v.:<BR>नायकः<BR>II Of heat, etc.: *प्रवाहकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conduit
CONDUIT: प्रणाली: v. Canal, pipe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cone
CONE:<BR>I A solid: शङ्कुः (?); सूचिघनक्षेत्रम्, K.<BR>d.<BR>II A cone-shaped fruit: *शङ्कुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coney or cony
CONEY or CONY: शशकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confabulate
CONFABULATE: संकथयति (कथ्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confabulation
CONFABULATION: संकथा: v. Conversation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confection
CONFECTION: *शर्कराफलादि (comp. शर्करोदकम्,<BR>Bha.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=141" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confectioner
CONFECTIONER:<BR>(1) आपूपिकः;<BR>(2) पिष्टकाजीवः;<BR>(3) मिष्टकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confectionery
CONFECTIONERY:<BR>(1) मिष्टम् (=sweetmeat);<BR>(2) पिष्टकः (=cake).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confederacy
CONFEDERACY:<BR>I A league: सन्धिः।<BR>II The<BR>states bound by a league: सन्धिबद्धराष्ट्राणि<BR>(n. pl.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confederate
CONFEDERATE:<BR>I Adj.: सन्धिबद्धः (द्धा, द्धं);<BR>संहतः (ता, तं) (=combined).<BR>II Subs.;<BR>मित्रम् (=ally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confederation
CONFEDERATION: v. Confederacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confer
CONFER (v. t.):<BR>(1) संवदति (वद्, c. l.): v. To<BR>converse;<BR>(2) मन्त्रयति (मन्त्र्, c. l.): v. To<BR>consult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confer
CONFER (v. t.); वितरति (तॄ, c. l.),<BR>to c. know-<BR>ledge:<BR>विद्यां वितरति, U.: v. To give.<BR>C. a<BR>favour:<BR>अनुगृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.): v. To<BR>favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conference
CONFERENCE: संवादः, Mah.: v. Conver-<BR>-sation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confess
CONFESS:<BR>I To acknowledge^1: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>स्वीकरोति;<BR>(2) प्रतिपद्यते (पद्, c. 4.),<BR>and he<BR>himself c. ed it:<BR>स्वयं च प्रतिपन्नः, Mr. x.<BR>II To<BR>disclose, reveal: q. v.: प्रकाशयति (c. of काश्).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confessedly
CONFESSEDLY: असंशयम् (=undoubtedly): v.<BR>Avowedly, undisputably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confession
CONFESSION:<BR>(1) स्वीकारः;<BR>(2) प्रतिपत्तिः: v.<BR>Acknowledgment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confessional
CONFESSIONAL: *स्वीकारश्रवणासनम्, and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confessor
CONFESSOR:<BR>I A priest who hears confes-<BR>-sions: *स्वीकारश्रोतृ (m.).<BR>II One who con-<BR>-fesses:<BR>(1) स्वीकर्तृ (m.);<BR>(2) अभ्युपगन्तृ (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confidant
CONFIDANT: विश्वासभूमिः, विश्रम्भभूमिः, and sim.<BR>comp. s:<BR>c. in one's all private affairs:<BR>सर्व-<BR>विश्रम्भभूमिः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confide
CONFIDE (v. i.): विश्वसिति (श्वस्, c. 2.): v.<BR>Rely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confide
CONFIDE (v. t.): न्यस्यति (अस्, c. 4.): v. To<BR>entrust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confidence
CONFIDENCE:<BR>I Reliance:<BR>(1) विश्वासः<BR>to<BR>give the birds c.:<BR>विश्वासाय विहङ्गानाम्, R. i. 51.;<BR>raising c.:<BR>विश्वासप्रदः (दा, दं), B. vi. 89.;<BR>(2) विश्रम्भः,<BR>an object of c.<BR>विश्रम्भस्थानम्, K. Ph.:<BR>had so much c. in her:<BR>तथा तस्यां विशश्वसुः, Ku.<BR>V. 15.: विश्रम्भं जग्मुः, M. n.;<BR>to inspire with<BR>c.:<BR>विश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्). H.;<BR>to do evil to<BR>one who has put c.:<BR>विश्रब्धे पापमाचरति, H.;<BR>order me with c. what is to be done:<BR>विश्रब्ध-<BR>मादिश्यतां कर्तव्यम्, K.<BR>II<BR>Self-c.:<BR>प्रागल्भ्यम् or<BR>प्रगल्भता, Ki. xvi. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confident
CONFIDENT:<BR>I Having confidence: विश्वासिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>II Bold, impudent: q. v.: प्रगल्भः<BR>(ल्भा, ल्भं).<BR>To be c. of:<BR>निश्चितः (ता, तं) मन्यते,<BR>is c. of victory:<BR>जयं निश्चितं मन्यते: v. Certain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confidential
CONFIDENTIAL:<BR>I Enjoying confidence:<BR>(1)<BR>विश्वस्त (f. स्ता);<BR>(2) विश्रब्ध (f. ब्धा);<BR>(3) आप्त<BR>(f. प्ता),<BR>with some c. princes:<BR>कतिपयाप्तराजपुत्र-<BR>परिवृतः, K.<BR>II Private, secret: Ph.: c. talk:<BR>विश्रम्भालापः, H.;<BR>in all c. matters:<BR>सर्वविश्रम्भेषु,<BR>K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confidentially
CONFIDENTIALLY:<BR>(1) विश्वस्तम्;<BR>(2) विश्रब्धम्, K.:<BR>v. Privately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confidently
CONFIDENTLY:<BR>I Boldly, firmly: q. v.:<BR>प्रगल्भम्।<BR>II Confidentially: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confiding
CONFIDING (adj.):<BR>(1) विश्वासभाज् (mfn.);<BR>(2)<BR>विश्वासभुज् (mfn.), N.; and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

configuration
CONFIGURATION: आकारः: v. Figure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confine
CONFINE (subs.): सीमा: v. Boundary.<BR>On<BR>the c s of:<BR>पर्यन्तस्थः (स्था, स्थं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confine
CONFINE (v. l.): v. To border.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confine
CONFINE (v. t.):<BR>(1) रुणद्धि, अव-, नि-, (रुध्,<BR>c. 7.),<BR>should be c. d in the Fail:<BR>चारके निरोद्धव्या,<BR>D. i.;<BR>(2) संयच्छति (यम्, c. l.) (=to c.<BR>tightly),<BR>c. d in irons:<BR>निगडसंयतः (ता, तं), Ra.;<BR>should c. her in the house:<BR>संयतां वासायेद्गृहम्, M.;<BR>(3) बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.) (=संयच्छति). Ph.:<BR>c. ed themselves to the boundaries of their divi-<BR>sions:<BR>प्रविभागसीमां न व्यतीयुः, R.: v. To<BR>transgress; to be c. d (i. e. in child-bed):<BR>आसन्नप्रसवा, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confinement
CONFINEMENT:<BR>I Restraint: q. v.<BR>II Impri-<BR>-sonment:<BR>(1) निरोधः, -नम्, अव-;<BR>(2) बन्धनम् (c.<BR>by tying),<BR>putting in c.:<BR>बन्धने क्षिप्त्वा, D. i.<BR>III In childbirth: प्रसवावस्था (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confirm
CONFIRM:<BR>I To make firm: द्रढयति (nomi.) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">Page143</a>]<BR>or<BR>दृढीकरोति,<BR>to c. it still more:<BR>दृढतरीकर्तम्,: v.<BR>To establish.<BR>II To ratify: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>c. Christians: *प्रतिपादयति (c. of पद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=142" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confirmation
CONFIRMATION:<BR>I Establishment: q. v.:<BR>दृढीकरणम्।<BR>II Ratification: q. v.<BR>III Of<BR>Christians: *प्रतिपादनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confirmatory
CONFIRMATORY: i. e. serving to confirm:<BR>expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confirmed
CONFIRMED (adj.):<BR>(1) दृढः (ढा, ढं): v. Firm;<BR>(2) स्थिरः (रा, रं): v. Constant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confiscate
CONFISCATE: Ph.:<BR>the king should c. their pro-<BR>perty:<BR>निःस्वान् कारयेन्नृ पः;<BR>the whole property should<BR>be c. d:<BR>सर्वस्वहारमर्हन्ति, M. ix. 231. and 242.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confiscation
CONFISCATION: सर्वस्वहरणम्। and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conflagration
CONFLAGRATION: दाहः,<BR>c. of Tripura:<BR>त्रिपुरदाहः,<BR>Ki.: v. Burning.<BR>C. in a forest:<BR>दावानलः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conflict
CONFLICT (subs.):<BR>I Contest: q. v.: विरोधः।<BR>II Opposition:<BR>(1) विरोधः, c. of two Smritis:<BR>स्मृत्योर्विरोधः, Y.;<BR>(1) विप्रतिषेधः,<BR>c. of the two<BR>duties:<BR>द्वयोः कार्ययोर्विप्रतिषेधः, Si. ii. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conflict
CONFLICT (v.): v. To contend, clash. C. ing:<BR>विरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confluence
CONFLUENCE:<BR>I Of rivers:<BR>(1) सङ्गमः;<BR>(2)<BR>सम्भेदः, this is the c. of the two great rivers:<BR>अयमसौ महानद्योः सम्भेदः, Ma. iv.;<BR>(3) तोयव्यति-<BR>करः (poet), R. viii. 95.<BR>II Concourse: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confluent
CONFLUENT: सहवाहिन् (f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conform
CONFORM:<BR>I Trans: v. To accommodate,<BR>suit.<BR>II Intrans.: v. To comply, obey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conformable
CONFORMABLE:<BR>I Suitable, like: अनुरूपः (पा,<BR> पं).<BR>II Compliant: अनुविधायिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conformably
CONFORMABLY: अनुसारेण: v. Accordance<BR>with, in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conformation
CONFORMATION:<BR>I Agreement: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Form: q. v.: आकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conformity
CONFORMITY: v. Agreement. In c. with: v.<BR>Accordace with, in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confound
CONFOUND:<BR>I To mix and confuse: expr.<BR>by मन्यते (मन्, c. 4),<BR>c. s ignorance of distinc-<BR>tion as impartiality:<BR>अविशेषज्ञतापक्षपातित्वमिति<BR> मन्यते, Ph.: c. ing, (lit. coupling)<BR>truth and<BR>falsehood:<BR>सत्यानृते मिथुनीकृत्य, S.<BR>II To per-<BR>-plex: q. v.: आकुलीकरोति (कृ, c. 8.). Ph.: being<BR>c. ed:<BR>ससम्भ्रमम्, V.<BR>III. To ruin: q. v.:<BR>उच्छिनति (छिद्, c. 7).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confoundedly
CONFOUNDEDLY: अत्यन्तम: v. Exceedingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confraternity
CONFRATERNITY: v. Fraternity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confront
CONFRONT:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) सम्मुखयति<BR>or<BR>अभिमुखयति<BR>(nomi.),<BR>to c. the Lord:<BR>ईशमभिमुखयितुम्, Ki.;<BR>(2) सम्मुखीकरोति<BR>or<BR>अभिमुखीकरोति, M. n.<BR>II To<BR>oppose: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confuse
CONFUSE:<BR>I To mix wrongly: सङ्किरति (क,<BR>c. 6): v. To mix.<BR>II To perplex: q. v.:<BR>आकुलीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confusedly
CONFUSEDLY:<BR>I With bewilderment: ससम्भ्रमम्।<BR>II Without order: क्रमं विहाय।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confusion
CONFUSION:<BR>I Irregular mixture: सङ्करः,<BR>c.<BR>of castes:<BR>वर्णसङ्करः, Kal.<BR>II Tumult, disor-<BR>-der: विप्लवः,<BR>when the duties prescribed by the<BR>Vedas and Smritis will be in a state of great c.:<BR>श्रौतस्मार्तधर्मे विप्लवमत्यन्तमुपगते, V. p. Ph.: in the c.<BR>(i. e. in the crowd): सङ्कुले, D.<BR>III Bewilder-<BR>-ment:<BR>(1) सम्भ्रमः;<BR>(2) वैलक्ष्यम् (from shame),<BR>Ra.<BR>IV Ruin, defeat: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confutation
CONFUTATION: खण्डनम्: v. Refutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

confute
CONFUTE:<BR>(1) खण्डयति (खण्ड्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>refute;<BR>(2) उत्तरं हरति (हृ, c. l.), Ki., or<BR>निरुत्तरीकरोति, M. n. (=to put to silence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congeal
CONGEAL (v.): Trans.: घनीकरोति (कृ, c. 8.)<BR>II Intrans.: धनीमवति (भू, c. l.), c. ed snow;<BR>घनीभूतो हिमः, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congener
CONGENER: सजातीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congenial
CONGENIAL:<BR>I Kindred: एकप्रकृति (mfn.) (?).<BR>II Suitable: q. v.: अनुरूपः (पा, पं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congeniality
CONGENIALITY: एकप्रकृतित्वम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congenital
CONGENITAL: सहजः (जा, जं); expr. by जन्मन्<BR>(n.),<BR>c. blindness:<BR>जन्मान्धता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conger
CONGER: The sea-eel: समुद्रकुञ्चिका (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congeries
CONGERIES: राशिः: v. Heap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congestion
CONGESTION: *रक्तसंग्रहः; शोणितसमाहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglobate
CONGLOBATE, -D: पिण्डीभूतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglomerate
CONGLOMERATE (v. t.): स्तूपीकरोति<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglomerate
CONGLOMERATE (subs.): स्तूपः: v. Mass.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglutinate
CONGLUTINATE: v. To cement, glue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conglutination
CONGLUTINATION: सन्धिः: v. Union.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congratulate
CONGRATULATE: अभिनन्दति (नन्द्, c. l.), c. d. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">Page144</a>]<BR>by the nuns:<BR>तापसीभिरभिनन्द्यमाना, Sa. N. B.<BR>Often expr. by दिष्टया (lit. by luck),<BR>I c.<BR>you on having such a boy as the gentle Rāma:<BR>दिष्टया वर्धसे यदीदृशस्ते वत्सो रामभद्रः, Vi.;<BR>we<BR>should c. ourselves that the king has returned to<BR>the city:<BR>दिष्टया राजा प्रतिनिवृत्तो नगरम्, V.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=143" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congratulation
CONGRATULATION: अभिनन्दनम् (?). To offer c.:<BR>v. To congratulate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congratulatory
CONGRATULATORY अभिनन्दकः (का, कं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congregate
CONGREGATE:<BR>I Intrans: समागच्छति (गम्,<BR>c. l.): v. To assemble.<BR>II Trans: समाह-<BR>रति (हृ, c. l.): v. To collect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congregation
CONGREGATION:<BR>I Collection: T. v.: समाहारः।<BR>II An assembly: v.: समाजः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congregational
CONGREGATIONAL: सामाजिकः (की, कं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congress
CONGRESS: महासभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congruity
CONGRUITY: सङ्गतता। C. (of a sentence):<BR>आकाङ्क्षा, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

congruous
CONGRUOUS: सङ्गतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conic
CONIC, -AL: *शङ्क्वाकारः (रा, रं). C. section:<BR>शङ्कुखण्डः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjectural
CONJECTURAL:<BR>(1) वैतर्किकः (की, कं) (rare):<BR>आनुमानिकः (की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjecture
CONJECTURE (subs.):<BR>(1) वितर्कः, your c. is right:<BR>उपपन्नस्ते वितर्कः,;<BR>(2) ऊहः<BR>or<BR>ऊहा (=guess);<BR>(3) शङ्का (=apprehension);<BR>(4) अनुमानम् (= in-<BR>-ference).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjecture
CONJECTURE (v.):<BR>(1) तर्कयति, वि- (तक्, c. 10)<BR>which do you c. (to be Śakuntalā): त्वं ताव-<BR>त्कतमां तर्कयसि, Sa. vi.;<BR>(2) ऊहते (ऊह्, c. 1),<BR>c. d that they were devoid of hostile feelings:<BR>औहिष्ट तान् वीतविरुद्धबुद्धीन्, B. iii. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjoin
CONJOIN: संयोजयति (युज्, c. 10): v. To<BR>join.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjoint
CONJOINT: संहतः (ता, तं): v. Unitedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjointly
CONJOINTLY:<BR>(1) expr. by adj.,<BR>but c.:<BR>संहतास्तु,<BR>H.;<BR>(2) सम्भूय,<BR>all c.:<BR>सर्वे सम्भूय, Mat: v.<BR>Together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugal
CONJUGAL: Ph.:<BR>c. love:<BR>दम्पत्योः प्रेम;<BR>transgression<BR>of c. duties:<BR>दम्पत्योः परस्परं धर्मव्यतिक्रमः, K. b.;<BR>c. fidelity:<BR>अव्यमिचारः, K. b.: v. Chastity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugality
CONJUGALITY:<BR>(1) दाम्पत्यम्;<BR>(2) संयोगः (=<BR>union).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugate
CONJUGATE (v): Ph.:<BR>c.<BR>भू<BR>in the<BR>लिट्। भूधातोर्लिट्-<BR>रूपाणि (n. pl.) ब्रूहि, वद, etc.: v. To say.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjugation
CONJUGATION:<BR>I The act: धातुरूपाख्यानम्।<BR>II<BR>A class of verbs: गणः।<BR>III A scheme:<BR>धातुरूपादर्शः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjunction
CONJUNCTION:<BR>I Union: q. v.<BR>II In gram.:<BR>समुच्चयार्थकमव्ययम्।<BR>III In astro.: योगः, सं-,<BR>Planetary c.:<BR>ग्रहयोर्योगः, Su.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjunctive
CONJUNCTIVE:<BR>I Connection: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Occasion: अवसरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjuration
CONJURATION:<BR>I An entreaty: q. v.<BR>II En-<BR>-chantment: q. v.: इन्द्रजालम्, to practise c.<BR>इन्द्रजालमाचरति, K.<BR>III Magic: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjure
CONJURE (v. t.):<BR>I To adjure, implore: q. v.<BR>II To enchant: मोहयति (c. of मुह्),<BR>c. ing<BR>the king af Mālava by my c. ing art:<BR>इन्द्रजाल-<BR>विद्यया मालवेन्द्र मोहयन्, D.<BR>C. up:<BR>उत्थापयति (c.<BR>of स्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conjurer
CONJURER: इन्द्रजालिकः<BR>or<BR>ऐन्द्रजालिकः Ra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connect
CONNECT: सम्बध्नाति, अभि-, (rare) (बन्ध्, c. 9.),<BR>it is not an iota c. ed with its faults or merits:<BR>तत्कृतेन दोषेण गुणेन वाऽणुमात्रे णापि स न सभ्बध्यते, S.;<BR>c. ed with each other:<BR>इतरेतराभिसम्बद्धः (द्धा, द्धं),<BR>N. d.: v. To unite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connectedly
CONNECTEDLY:<BR>(1) ससम्बन्धम्;<BR>(2) सङ्गतम् (con-<BR>-sistently).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connection
CONNECTION, CONNEXION:<BR>(1) सभ्बन्धः (best<BR>equiv.),<BR>an enviable c.:<BR>श्लाध्यसम्बन्धः, R.;<BR>the<BR>c. between the families of Fanaka and Raghu<BR>जनकानाञ्च रघूणाञ्च सम्बन्धः, Vi.;<BR>(2) सम्पर्कः,<BR>to<BR>disallow c.:<BR>सम्पर्कम् नानुजानाति, Mal.;<BR>(3) सङ्गः<BR>(=being together),<BR>with your c.:<BR>सङ्गेन वः,<BR>Ku.: v. Association;<BR>(4) प्रबन्धः (=connec-<BR>-tedness, as of a discourse), Ki.;<BR>(5) सङ्गमः<BR>(sp. sexual c.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connective
CONNECTIVE: सम्बन्धिन् (f. नी), Da.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connivance
CONNIVANCE: उपेक्षा (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connive at
CONNIVE AT: उपेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. l.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connoisseur
CONNOISSEUR:<BR>(1) गुणज्ञः;<BR>(2) अभिज्ञः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

connubial
CONNUBIAL: v. Conjugal, nuptial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conquer
CONQUER:<BR>(1) जयति (जि, c. l.), to c. Persia:<BR>पारसिकान् जेतुम्, R. iv. 60;<BR>one who has c. ed<BR>his passions:<BR>जितेन्द्रियः, Ku.;<BR>(2) विजयते (जि, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">Page145</a>]<BR>c. l.),<BR>c. ed him in battle:<BR>युधि तं विजिग्ये, Vi.;<BR>(3) निर्जयति, अवजयति (rare),<BR>one who has c. ed<BR>the world:<BR>अवजितभुवनः, Ki.: v. To subdue,<BR>subjugate, surmount.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=144" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conqueress
CONQUERESS:<BR>(1) जेत्री;<BR>(2) विजेत्री।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conquering
CONQUERING (adj.): जयिन्, विजयिन् (f. नी),<BR>c.<BR>power:<BR>विजयिवीर्यम्, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conqueror
CONQUEROR:<BR>(1) जेतृ, वि-, (rarely अव-,) (m.),<BR>c. of the (three)<BR>worlds:<BR>जगतां जेता, Vi.;<BR>(2)<BR>जित् (m.) in comp.,<BR>c. of Indra:<BR>इन्द्रजित्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conquest
CONQUEST:<BR>I The act: जयः, वि-: v. Victory,<BR>subjugation.<BR>II That which is conquered:<BR>expr. by जितः (ता तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consanguinity
CONSANGUINITY: सगोत्रता; सनाभिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscience
CONSCIENCE: no equiv.: *संज्ञानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscientious
CONSCIENTIOUS: संज्ञानिन् (f. नी): v. Upright,<BR>just.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscientiously
CONSCIENTIOUSLY: *संज्ञानेन; अमायया (=since-<BR>-rely).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscientiousness
CONSCIENTIOUSNESS: *संज्ञानिता; धार्मिकता (=<BR>piety); न्यापरायणता (=uprightness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscious
CONSCIOUS:<BR>I Possessing c. ness: चेतनः or<BR>सचेतनः (ना, नं), even by (those) who are not c.:<BR>विचेतनैरपि, Ku.<BR>II Aware, sensible: expr.<BR>by the verbs; जानाति (ज्ञा, c. 9.), वेत्ति (विद्,<BR>c. 2.), etc, (=to know: q. v.);<BR>though c.<BR>unable to control the organs:<BR>जानानाप्यप्रभवन्ती<BR> करणानाम्, K.;<BR>which one can only be c. of:<BR>स्वसंवेद्यः<BR>(द्या, द्यं), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consciously
CONSCIOUSLY:<BR>(1) ज्ञानात्;<BR>(2) ज्ञानतः;<BR>(3)<BR>ज्ञानपूर्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consciousness
CONSCIOUSNESS:<BR>I Sensation: चेतना<BR>or<BR>चैतन्यम्,<BR>deprived her of c.:<BR>तस्याश्चेतनां जहार, K.;<BR>(2)<BR>संज्ञा,<BR>to restore c.:<BR>संज्ञां ग्राहयति, K.<BR>II Know-<BR>-ledge:<BR>(1) ज्ञानम्;<BR>(2) उपलब्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscript
CONSCRIPT:<BR>I Sub.: v. Recruit.<BR>II Adj.:<BR>पत्रारोपितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conscription
CONSCRIPTION: बलसमुत्थानम्, D., and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecrate
CONSECRATE:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठापयति (c. of स्था) (of idols,<BR>etc.), Mat.,<BR>(2) पवित्रीकरोति<BR>or<BR>पवित्रयति (=to<BR>make sacred),<BR>will c. my language:<BR>मद्गिरं<BR> पवित्रयिष्यति, N. i. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecrate
CONSECRATE, -D (adj.): v. Sacred, holy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecration
CONSECRATION:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठापनम्, V. m.;<BR>(2)<BR>better by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecutive
CONSECUTIVE: expr. by adv.: अनुक्रमेण,<BR>for five<BR>c. years:<BR>अनुक्रमेण पञ्चवर्षम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consecutively
CONSECUTIVELY: अनुक्रमेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consent
CONSENT (subs.): सम्मतिः, to obtain your c.:<BR>तव सम्मतिमधिगन्तुम्, N. ii. 48.;<BR>sells without the<BR>c. of the owner:<BR>स्वाम्यसम्मतो विक्रीणीते, M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consent
CONSENT (v.):<BR>(1) सम्मतिं ददाति (दा, c. 3.);<BR>(2)<BR>सम्मतः (ता, तं) भवति। Ph.:<BR>I c. to what has been<BR>written above:<BR>मतं मे यदत्रोपरि लेखितम्, Y.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequence
CONSEQUENCE:<BR>I Result, effect: q. v.: फलम्,<BR>of evil c. s:<BR>अनिष्टफलः (ला, लं), Mu. Ph.: in c.<BR>of: v. For, account of, on;<BR>the c. of which<BR>was:<BR>ततः<BR>or<BR>अतः।<BR>II Logical: निगमनम्।<BR>III<BR>Importance. Ph.:<BR>of no c.<BR>निरर्थकः (का, कं);<BR>a matter of great c.<BR>गुर्वर्थः;<BR>doing what is of<BR>little c.:<BR>यत्किञ्चनकारिता, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequent
CONSEQUENT (adj.): v. Attendant. C. upon:<BR>v. After.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequent
CONSEQUENT (subs.):<BR>I Logic: निगमनम्।<BR>II<BR>Of rations: Perh. अन्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequential
CONSEQUENTIAL:<BR>I Lit.: आनुषङ्गिकः (की, कं).<BR>II Pompous, conceited: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequentially
CONSEQUENTIALLY:<BR>I Logically: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Eventually: q. v.<BR>III In a regular series:<BR>अनुक्रमेण, पौर्वापर्येण।<BR>IV Pompously, concei-<BR>-tedly: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consequently
CONSEQUENTLY: अतः, c. the behaviour of men is<BR>the same as of (lower)<BR>animals:<BR>अतः समानः<BR> पश्वादिभिः पुरुषाणां व्यवहारः, S.: v. Therefore.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conservation
CONSERVATION: रक्षाः v. Preservation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conservative
CONSERVATIVE (subs.): *नवविद्वेषिन् (f. णी);<BR>स्थितिपालः (ली, लं).<BR>C. ministry:<BR>*नवविद्वेषि-<BR>सचिवमण्डलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conservator
CONSERVATOR:<BR>(1) रक्षकः;<BR>(2) पालः, in comp.,<BR>c. of a forest:<BR>वनपालः: v. Preserver.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conservatory
CONSERVATORY: *प्रसूनशाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conserve
CONSERVE:<BR>I Verb: रक्षतिः v. To preserve.<BR>II Subs.: v. Preserve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consider
CONSIDER:<BR>I In gen. sense:<BR>(1) विचारयति (c. of<BR>चर्), if it is c. ed, this quitting of life (by [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">Page146</a>]<BR>widows)<BR>is selfish:<BR>अत्र हि विचार्यमाणे स्वार्थ एव<BR> प्राणपरित्यागोऽयम्, K.;<BR>(2) विमृश(ष)ति (मृश्,<BR>or<BR>-ष्, c. 6),<BR>without c. ing sayings of Manu<BR>and others:<BR>मन्वादिवाक्यान्यविमृश्य, Da.;<BR>(3)<BR>आलोचयति, समा-, पर्या-, (लोच्, c. 10.), c. ing<BR>their (comparative)<BR>importance and insignifi-<BR>cance:<BR>तेषां गुरुलघुभावं पर्यालोच्य, K. b.;<BR>(4) चिन्त-<BR>यति, परि-, वि-। सं-, (चिन्त्, c. 10.) (to<BR>think of), c. ing the painfulness of affection:<BR>चिन्तयित्वा दुःखतां स्नेहस्य, K.;<BR>(5) समीक्षते (ईक्ष्, c.<BR>1) (=to look at),<BR>age is not c. ed among elders<BR>in virtue:<BR>न धर्मवृद्धेषु वयः समीक्षते, Ku.<BR>II To<BR>regard, think: मन्यते (मन्, c. 4.),<BR>one who c. s<BR>himself learned:<BR>पण्डितम्मन्यः (न्या, न्यं), B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=145" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

considerable
CONSIDERABLE:<BR>I Respectable: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Moderately large: अनल्पः (ल्पा, ल्पं),<BR>a c.<BR>force:<BR>अनल्पं बलम्, D.: v. Many, large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

considerably
CONSIDERABLY: बलवत्, Sa.: v. Much, excee-<BR>-dingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

considerate
CONSIDERATE (adj.):<BR>I Mindful of the feel-<BR>-lings or rights of others: no equiv: सदयः<BR>(या, यं) (=kind), enjoyed in a c. manner:<BR>सदयं बुभुजे, R.<BR>II Circumspect: समीक्ष्यकारिन्<BR>(f. णी); विमृष्यकारिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

considerately
CONSIDERATELY:<BR>I With due regard to<BR>others: सदयम् (=kindly).<BR>II Circumspectly:<BR>(1) विमृश्य;<BR>(2) समीक्ष्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

considerateness
CONSIDERATENESS:<BR>I Thoughtful kindness:<BR>दया (?).<BR>II Prudence: समीक्ष्यकारिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consideration
CONSIDERATION:<BR>I Deliberation:<BR>(1) विचारः<BR>or<BR>विचारणा,<BR>agreed without c<BR>अविचारानुमतः (ता,<BR> तं), D. ii.;<BR>(2) आलोचना, सम-, परि-;<BR>(3)<BR>विमर्शः;<BR>(4) समीक्षा (=circumspection);<BR>(5)<BR>चिन्ता (=thinking).<BR>II Regard: आदरः।<BR>To<BR>have c. for:<BR>आद्रियते (दृ, c. 4.),<BR>has no c. for<BR>munificence:<BR>न त्यागमाद्रियते, K. In c. of: expr.<BR>by inde. past. part., in c. of its being the first<BR>(offence): प्रथममिति प्रेक्ष्य, Sa.: v. Account<BR>of, on.<BR>III Respectability: प्रतिष्ठा,<BR>of<BR>c.:<BR>लब्धप्रतिष्ठः (ष्ठा, ष्ठं): v. Chief.<BR>IV<BR>Motive, reason: q. v.: कारणम्। V. In law:<BR>अर्थः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consign
CONSIGN: v. To entrust, deliver, send.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consignment
CONSIGNMENT:<BR>(1) प्रेरणम् (=sending);<BR>(2)<BR>समर्पणम् (delivery);<BR>(3) निक्षेपः (=depositing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consist
CONSIST:<BR>I To subsist: q. v.<BR>II To be con-<BR>-sistent: v. Consistent.<BR>III To c. of: Ph.:<BR>on what it stands and of what it c. s of<BR>यदाधारं<BR> यदात्मकम्, V. p;<BR>the science of astronomy c. s<BR>of three branches<BR>ज्योतिःशास्त्रं स्कन्धत्रयाधिष्ठितम्,<BR>V. m.; the Gāyatri (metre) c. s of 24 syllables<BR>चतुर्विशत्यक्षरा गायत्री, Up.: v. C. ing of.<BR>IV<BR>To c. in.: Ph.:<BR>perspicuity c. s in clearness of<BR>meaning:<BR>अर्थवैमल्यात्मा प्रसादः, Kav.;<BR>grace c. s<BR>in picturesqueness of language:<BR>उक्तिवैचित्र्यरूपं<BR> माधुर्यम्, Kav.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consisting of
CONSISTING OF:<BR>(1) -मयः (यी, यं),<BR>food c. of<BR>water, fruit and roots:<BR>जलफलमूलमयेष्वाहारेषु, K.<BR>Ph.:<BR>an army c. chiefly of elephants:<BR>हास्तिक-<BR>प्रायं सैन्यम्, Ra.;<BR>(2) आत्मकः (का, कं), in beings<BR>c. of five (elements) पञ्चात्मकेषु भूतेषु, B. p.;<BR>(3)<BR>in some cases by deriv., c. of five elements:<BR>पाञ्चमौतिकः (की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consistence
CONSISTENCE, CONSISTENCY:<BR>I Firmness,<BR>stability: q. v.: स्थैर्यम्।<BR>II Combination:<BR>q. v.<BR>III Congruity: साङ्गत्यम्।<BR>IV Thick-<BR>-ness: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consistent
CONSISTENT:<BR>I Congruous: सङ्गतः (ता, तं).<BR>II Firm, solid: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consistently
CONSISTENTLY:<BR>(1) सङ्गतम्;<BR>(2) ससम्बन्धम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consistory
CONSISTORY: धर्मसभा (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consolable
CONSOLABLE:<BR>(1) आश्वासनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>शा (सा) न्त्वनीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consolation
CONSOLATION:<BR>(1) आश्वासः;<BR>(2) समाश्वासः;<BR>(3)<BR>शान्त्वनम्<BR>or<BR>सान्त्वनम्, -ना। To give c.: v. To<BR>console.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consolatory
CONSOLATORY:<BR>I Adj.: आश्वासकः (सिका, सकं);<BR>(2) शोकापनोदननिपुणः (णा, णं), K.<BR>II Subs.:<BR>सान्त्वनम्, उप-,<BR>with mild c. s:<BR>मृदुभिरुपसान्त्वनैः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

console
CONSOLE (v. t.):<BR>(1) आश्वासयति, सम्-, (c. of<BR>श्वस्), K.;<BR>(2) शा(सा)न्त्वयति, उप-, अभि-,<BR>(शान्त्व्<BR>or<BR>सान्त्व्, c. 10), B.;<BR>(2) अभ्युपपद्यते<BR>(पद्, c. 4),<BR>to c. Rali:<BR>रतिमभ्युपपत्तुम्, Ku.<BR>iv. 25;<BR>(3) प्रकृतौ स्थापयति (c. of स्था) (=to<BR>put in natural state), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

console
CONSOLE (subs.): निर्यूहः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=146" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consoler
CONSOLER: यः (या, यं) आश्वासयति: v. To<BR>console.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consolidate
CONSOLIDATE:<BR>(1) संहन्ति (हन्, c. 2.);<BR>(2) दृढी-<BR>करोति (=to make firm).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consonance
CONSONANCE:<BR>I Of sounds: साम्यम्।<BR>II Sui-<BR>-table, consistent: q. v. योग्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consonant
CONSONANT (adj.):<BR>I Accordant: समः (मा,<BR> मं).<BR>II Suitable, consistent: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consonant
CONSONANT (subs.):<BR>(1) व्यञ्जनम्<BR>or<BR>व्यञ्जनवर्णम्;<BR>(2) हल् (according to the arrangement of<BR>Pāṇini),<BR>ending in a c.:<BR>हलन्त (f. न्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consort
CONSORT (subs.): i. e. husband or wife: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consort with
CONSORT WITH: v. Associate with.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspicuous
CONSPICUOUS:<BR>I Manifest: q. v.: प्रकाशः or<BR>सुप्रकाशः (शा, शं).<BR>II Prominent, great:<BR>q. v.: उत्कृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspicuously
CONSPICUOUSLY: स्पष्टम्: v. Plainly, remar-<BR>-kably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspicuousness
CONSPICUOUSNESS:<BR>I Lit.: प्रकाशता।<BR>II Emi-<BR>-nence, renown: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspiracy
CONSPIRACY:<BR>(1) कुचक्रम् (=cabal);<BR>(2) उपजापः<BR>(=plot).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspirator
CONSPIRATOR:<BR>(1) कुचक्रिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2) उपजापक<BR>(f. पिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conspire
CONSPIRE: (v.):<BR>I To plot: q. v.: उपजपति<BR>(जप्, c. l.).<BR>II To combine, agree: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constable
CONSTABLE:<BR>(1) रक्षिन् (m.) (watchman);<BR>(2) नागरिकः (=municipal c.?), D. ii.<BR>Lord<BR>high c.:<BR>*महादण्डनायकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constancy
CONSTANCY:<BR>I Firmness:<BR>(1) स्थैर्यम्<BR>or<BR>स्थिरता;<BR>(2) निश्चलता।<BR>II Of mind: स्थैयम्: v. Forti-<BR>-tude, perseverance^1.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constant
CONSTANT:<BR>I Firm:<BR>(1) स्थिरः (रा, रं),<BR>my<BR>entire fortune is c.:<BR>स्थिरा मम सर्वसम्पत्, Si.;<BR>(2) अचलः<BR>or<BR>निश्चलः (ला, लं),<BR>regard for depen-<BR>dents is not c.:<BR>चलं गौरवमाश्रितेषु, Ku.;<BR>(3) अव-<BR>स्थितः<BR>or<BR>व्यवस्थितः (ता, तं) (rare),<BR>love for woman<BR>is not c.:<BR>प्रेम दयितास्वनवस्थितम्, Ku. iv. 28.<BR>II Continuous: q. v.: सततः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constantly
CONSTANTLY<BR>I Firmly:<BR>(1) स्थिरम्;<BR>(2) अच-<BR>लम्।<BR>II Continuously, perpetually: q. v.:<BR>सततम्,<BR>think of truths c. in your mind:<BR>तत्त्वं<BR> चिन्तय सततं चित्ते, J.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constellation
CONSTELLATION: राशिः,<BR>c. of the lion:<BR>सिंहराशिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consternation
CONSTERNATION: संत्रासः: v. Terror, amaze-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constipate
CONSTIPATE:<BR>(1) बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9);<BR>(2) अव-<BR>रुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.);<BR>(3) अवष्टभ्नाति, वि-, (स्तम्भ्,<BR>c. 9);<BR>(4) नह्यति, आ-, (नह्, c. 4.). N. B.<BR>These verbs take as their acc. मलम्, पुरीषम्,<BR>etc. C. ing: v. Costive (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constipation
CONSTIPATION:<BR>(1) बद्धविट्कता, and sim.<BR>comp. s, Sr.;<BR>(2) विष्टम्भः, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constituent
CONSTITUENT (adj.): Ph.:<BR>c. part:<BR>साधनम्: v.<BR>Element.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constituent
CONSTITUENT (subs.):<BR>I An elector: q. v.<BR>II A component: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constitute
CONSTITUTE:<BR>I To enact, establish: q. v.<BR>II To appoint, depute: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>form, compose. Ph.:<BR>after deciding what c. s<BR>a poem:<BR>काव्यस्वरूपं निरूप्य, Kav.;<BR>clearness of<BR>meaning c. s perspicuity:<BR>अर्थवैमल्यात्मा प्रसादः,<BR>Kav.; body or wealth does not c. manhood:<BR>न वपुर्वसु वा पुंस्त्वमूलम्, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constitution
CONSTITUTION:<BR>I Formation: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Natural condition, temperament: प्रकृतिः<BR>III Government: perh: तन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constitutional
CONSTITUTIONAL:<BR>I Inherent in the consti-<BR>-tution: स्वाभाविकः (की, कं).<BR>II Regulated<BR>by a c.: Ph.:<BR>c. government:<BR>*व्यवस्थिततन्त्रम्;<BR>c. law: *तन्त्रव्यवस्था।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constitutionally
CONSTITUTIONALLY:<BR>I Naturally:<BR>(1) प्रकृत्या;<BR>(2) स्वभावतः<BR>II Lawfully: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constrain
CONSTRAIN (v.):<BR>I To compel: q. v.: सम्पी-<BR>डयति (पीड्, c. 10.).<BR>II To restrain: q. v.<BR>III To compress: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constraint
CONSTRAINT:<BR>I Compulsion: q. v.<BR>II Res-<BR>-traint: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constrict
CONSTRICT (v.): संकोचति (कुच्, c. l.): v. To<BR>contract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

construct
CONSTRUCT (v.): निर्मिमीते (मा, c. 3.): v. To<BR>build, make.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

construction
CONSTRUCTION:<BR>I Making: निर्माणम्।<BR>II<BR>Form: q. v.<BR>III Of a sentence:<BR>(1) अन्वयः;<BR>(2) सम्बन्धः;<BR>(3) योजना।<BR>IV Sense, meaning:<BR>q. v. अर्थः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=147" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

constructive
CONSTRUCTIVE: Perh: फलार्थ, c. treason:<BR>फलार्थराजद्रोहः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

construe
CONSTRUE (v.):<BR>I To explain the construc-<BR>-tion of: अन्वयं वदति (वद्, c. l). To be c. d:<BR>(1) अन्वीयते (pass. of इ), Da.;<BR>(2) सम्बध्यते<BR>(pass of बन्ध्),<BR>why the word ‘so’ is not c. d<BR>with brother:<BR>तयापदं भ्रात्रैव कुतो न सम्बध्यते, Da.<BR>II To explain, interpret: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consubstantial
CONSUBSTANTIAL: सरूपः (पा, पं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consul
CONSUL:<BR>I Ancient: *कंसलः; दण्डनायकः।<BR>II<BR>An agent of a foreign government: अनुदूतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consulate
CONSULATE, CONSULSHIP: कंसलपदम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consult
CONSULT: मन्त्रयति, -ते (मन्त्र्, c. 10.),<BR>c. my<BR>good:<BR>मन्त्रयध्वं हितं मम, Mah.;<BR>c. ed with the<BR>ministers:<BR>मन्त्रिमिः सार्धं मन्त्रयामास,<BR>V p.: v.<BR>Also, to consider; attend; ask.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consultation
CONSULTATION:<BR>(1) मन्त्रणा;<BR>(2) मन्त्रः; -णं,<BR>to<BR>hold c.:<BR>मन्त्रं करोति, P.: v. Consideration.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consumable
CONSUMABLE: क्षयिन् (f. णी): v. Perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consume
CONSUME (v.): क्षपयति (c. of क्षिः): v. To<BR>destroy, waste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consumer
CONSUMER:<BR>I Destroyer: q. v.<BR>II Dev-<BR>-ourer: खादकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consummate
CONSUMMATE (v.): पूरयति (c. of पूर्): v. To<BR>complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consummate
CONSUMMATE (adj.): परिपक्वः (क्वा, क्वं): v.<BR>Perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consummation
CONSUMMATION:<BR>I Perfection: q. v.: परिपाकः,<BR>seeing his c. in civility:<BR>वीक्ष्य तस्य विनये परि-<BR>पाकम्, N.<BR>II Close, end: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consumption
CONSUMPTION:<BR>I Decay, destruction: q. v.<BR>क्षयः।<BR>II Of commodities: perh. best expr.<BR>by विक्रयः (=sale).<BR>III A disease:<BR>(1)<BR>क्षयरोगः;<BR>(2) यक्ष्मन्<BR>or<BR>राजयक्ष्मन् (m.);<BR>(3)<BR>शोषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

consumptive
CONSUMPTIVE: क्षयरोगिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contact
CONTACT: Lit.: स्पर्शः।<BR>II Association:<BR>q. v.: सम्पर्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contagion
CONTAGION:<BR>I Contact: स्पर्शः।<BR>II<BR>Infection<BR>by c.:<BR>स्पर्शसञ्चारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contagious
CONTAGIOUS: Ph.:<BR>c. disease<BR>आमयः स्पर्शसञ्चारी,<BR>Raj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contain
CONTAIN (v.):<BR>I To comprise:<BR>(1) by bah.<BR>comp.,<BR>a dwelling c. ing eight courts:<BR>अष्टप्रकोष्ठं<BR> भवनम्, Mr.: v. Having;<BR>(2) by गर्भः (र्भा,<BR> र्मं) in comp.,<BR>this house c. s men:<BR>पुरुषगर्भमेतद्<BR> गृहम्, Mu.;<BR>c. ing moral instruction:<BR>धर्मोपदेश-<BR>गर्भः (र्भा, र्भं), K.: v. Also, to hold, include.<BR>Ph.: I saw that it c. ed this couplet (lit.<BR>written on it) तस्यामिभामभिलिखितामार्यामपश्यम्,<BR>K.<BR>II To restrain: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

containing
CONTAINING: v. To contain (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contaminate
CONTAMINATE: दूषयति (c. of दुष्): v. To<BR>pollute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contamination
CONTAMINATION: दूषणम्: v. Pollution.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemn
CONTEMN: अवमन्यते (मन्, c. 4): v. To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemner
CONTEMNER: अवमन्तृ (f. न्त्री): v. Despiser.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemplate
CONTEMPLATE:<BR>I Trans.: v. To consider.<BR>II Intrans: ध्यायति (ध्यै, c. l).: v. To<BR>meditate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemplation
CONTEMPLATION:<BR>(1) चिन्ता: v. Considera-<BR>-tion;<BR>(2) ध्यानम्: v. Meditation. To have<BR>in c.: i. e. to intend or purpose: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemplative
CONTEMPLATIVE:<BR>(1) ध्यानपरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>चिन्ताप्रवणः (णा, णं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemplator
CONTEMPLATOR: ध्यानिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemporaneous
CONTEMPORANEOUS, CONTEMPORARY:<BR>(1)<BR>समकालः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) समकालीनः (ना, नं);<BR>(3)<BR>तुल्यकालः (ला, लं),<BR>these kings will be c.:<BR>एते<BR> तुल्यकाला भूभृतो भविष्यन्ति, V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contempt
CONTEMPT:<BR>(1) अवज्ञा, was turned out with c.:<BR>अवज्ञया निःसारितः, P.:<BR>(2) अवमानम्,<BR>c. of each<BR>other:<BR>अन्योन्यावमानम्, D.;<BR>(3) अनादरः, Ki.;<BR>(4) अवगणना, M. n. Ph.: to treat with c.:<BR>अवजानाति (ज्ञा, c. 9.): v. To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemptible
CONTEMPTIBLE:<BR>(1) निकृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं): v. Mean;<BR>(2) गर्हितः (ता, तं): v. Despicable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemptuous
CONTEMPTUOUS: v. Disdainful, haughty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contemptuously
CONTEMPTUOUSLY:<BR>(1) अवज्ञया;<BR>(2) सावज्ञम्;<BR>(3) सावमानम्,<BR>(4) अनादेरण;<BR>(5) अवगणनया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contend
CONTEND:<BR>(1) विगृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.) (=to<BR>contest), c. ing with the enemy of Namuchi<BR>(i. e. Indra): नमुचिद्विषा विगृह्य, Si. i. 51.;<BR>(2) विरुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.): v. To oppose;<BR>(3)<BR>विवदते (वद्, c. l.): v. To dispute.<BR>(4)<BR>स्पर्धते (स्पर्ध्, c. l.): v. To ire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=148" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contending
CONTENDING (part. adj.): विवदमानः (ना, नं);<BR>better expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

content
CONTENT (adj.):<BR>(1) सन्तुष्टः<BR>or<BR>तुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) सन्तोषवत् (f. ती) (rare), P. Ph.:<BR>you<BR>should be c.:<BR>त्वया सन्तोषः कार्यः, P. ii. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

content
CONTENT, TO BE: तुष्यति, सं-, (तुष्, c. 4.),<BR>an<BR>intelligent man is c. with whatever is his own:<BR>यस्य यावत् स तेनैव स्वेन तुष्यति वुद्धिमान्, V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

content
CONTENT (v. t.): सन्तोषयति (c. of तुष्): v.<BR>To satisfy, please.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

content
CONTENT (subs.):<BR>I Contentment: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Reward: q. v.: पारितोषिकम्।<BR>III Capacity:<BR>q. v.:<BR>the cubic c. s of a sphere:<BR>गोलस्यान्तर्गतं<BR> घनफलम्, Li.<BR>IV That which is contained:<BR>Ph.:<BR>the c. s of a book:<BR>यद्ग्रन्थे लिखितम्;<BR>table of<BR>c. s:<BR>निर्धण्टपत्रम्<BR>or<BR>सूचिपत्रम्, Maheshachandra.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contentedly
CONTENTEDLY: expr. by the adj.: सन्तुष्टः (ष्टा,<BR> ष्टं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contention
CONTENTION:<BR>I Contest, strife: q. v.: विवादः।<BR>II Controversy: q. v.: विवादः, Da. Ph.:<BR>your c. is not valid:<BR>*न सङ्गतस्ते वादः।<BR>III Ea-<BR>-gerness: q. v.: Ph.:<BR>“c. of mind”:<BR>मनः-<BR>संयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contentious
CONTENTIOUS: बिवादप्रियः (या यं): v. Quar-<BR>-relsome, litigious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contentiousness
CONTENTIOUSNESS: v. Quarrelsomeness, liti-<BR>-giousness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contentment
CONTENTMENT: सन्तोषः,<BR>there is no wealth like<BR>c.:<BR>सन्तोषतुल्यं धनमस्ति नान्यत्, P. ii. 6.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conterminous
CONTERMINOUS: एकसीमः (मा, मं) or by cir-<BR>-cum.: v. Border.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contest
CONTEST (subs.):<BR>I Dispute: q. v.: विवादः<BR>II Strife: विग्रहः,<BR>a furious c.:<BR>तुमुलो विग्रहः,<BR>Mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contest
CONTEST (v.):<BR>I To dispute: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>contend, fight: q. v.: विगृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contested
CONTESTED: expr. by विवाद in comp.: v.<BR>Disputed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

context
CONTEXT: perh. अन्वयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contexture
CONTEXTURE: v. System.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contiguity
CONTIGUITY:<BR>(1) संलग्नता;<BR>(2) सन्निकर्षः (=near-<BR>-ness):<BR>(3) सम्पर्कः (contact).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contiguous
CONTIGUOUS<BR>(1) संलग्नः (ग्ना, ग्नं) (=adjoin-<BR>-ing):<BR>(2) सन्निकृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं) (=adjacent:<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continence
CONTINENCE:<BR>(1) संयमः;<BR>(2) संयमिता;<BR>(3) जिते-<BR>न्द्रियता, -त्वं;<BR>(4) इन्द्रियजयः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continent
CONTINENT (adj.):<BR>I Chaste:<BR>(1) सयमिन् (f.<BR>नी);<BR>(2) जितेन्द्रियः (या, यं).<BR>II Continu-<BR>-ous: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continent
CONTINENT (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: वर्षः (?), V. p.<BR>II Europe as distinguished from England:<BR>*इयुरुपवर्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continental
CONTINENTAL:<BR>I Lit.: *वर्षीयः (या, यं)<BR>or<BR>वर्ष in<BR>comp.,<BR>c. congress:<BR>*वर्षसभा।<BR>II Of Europe:<BR>expr. by comp.,<BR>c. tour:<BR>इयुरुपवर्षभ्रमणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continently
CONTINENTLY:<BR>(1) संयमेन;<BR>(2) जितेन्द्रियतया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contingence
CONTINGENCE, CONTINGENCY:<BR>I Possibility:<BR>सम्भावना।<BR>II A casualty: expr. by words<BR>meaning uncertain, doubtful: follows c. s.<BR>अध्रुवाणि निषेवते, H.;<BR>even if his connection was<BR>a c.:<BR>सन्दिग्धोऽप्यस्य समागमो यदि स्यात्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contingent
CONTINGENT (adj.):<BR>(1) अनिशिचतः (ता, तं)<BR>(=uncertain);<BR>(2) सन्दिग्धः (ग्धा, ग्धं)<BR>(=doubtful),<BR>c. on:<BR>आयत्तः (त्ता, त्तं);<BR>c. on<BR>fate:<BR>दैवायत्तः (त्ता, त्तं), Ve.: v. To depend<BR>(II.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contingent
CONTINGENT (subs.): अंशः (=share): v.<BR>Quota.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contingently
CONTINGENTLY: v. Accidentally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continual
CONTINUAL:<BR>(1) नित्यः (त्या, त्यं) (prep=per-<BR>-petual);<BR>(2) अविरतः (ता, तं): v. Incess-<BR>-ant;<BR>(3) अविच्छिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं): v. Uninter-<BR>-rupted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continually
CONTINUALLY:<BR>(1) सततम्, in c. passing time:<BR>काले सततयायिनि, V. s.; v. Always:<BR>(2) अवि-<BR>रतम्: v. Incessantly;<BR>(3) मुहुर्मुहुः: v. Fre-<BR>-quently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuance
CONTINUANCE:<BR>I Constancy, stay: q. v.:<BR>स्थितिः, अव-।<BR>II Continuity: q. v. Ph.:<BR>of long<BR>c.<BR>बहुकालस्थायिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuation
CONTINUATION:<BR>I The act of continuing:<BR>expr. by circum.: v. To continue.<BR>II<BR>Continuity: q. v.<BR>III That which is con-<BR>-tinued, as the c. of a story: शेषः: v.<BR>Remainder, sequel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=149" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continue
CONTINUE (v. i.):<BR>I To stay: q. v.: तिष्ठति,<BR> अव-, (स्था, c. l).<BR>II To last: q. v.<BR>III<BR>To persevere: तिष्ठति, अव-,।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continue
CONTINUE (v. t.): expr. by adv., or by not<BR>and<BR>cease, by c. d calls:<BR>नित्यविहितोपहूतिषु, Si.;<BR>c. d to quarrel:<BR>कलहं कुर्वाणा न विश्राम्यति, P.;<BR>and c. d the journey day and night:<BR>दिवारात्रौ<BR> चावहत्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuity
CONTINUITY:<BR>(1) प्रसक्तिः:<BR>(2) प्रबन्धः,<BR>c. of<BR>making sacrifices:<BR>अध्वराणां क्रियाप्रबन्धः, R.;<BR>(3) अविच्छेदः (=uninterruptedness);<BR>(4)<BR>अविरामः (=unceasingness);<BR>(5) सातत्यम्<BR>(=perpetuity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuous
CONTINUOUS:<BR>(1) प्रसक्तः (f. क्ता),<BR>by c. perfor-<BR>mance:<BR>अविच्छिन्नादनुष्ठानात्, M. n.;<BR>(3) अविरतः<BR>(ता, तं): v. Incessant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuously
CONTINUOUSLY:<BR>(1) सततं<BR>or<BR>सन्ततम्, Ki.;<BR>(2)<BR>अविच्छिन्नम्;<BR>(3) अविरतम्;<BR>(4) प्रसक्तम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

continuously
CONTINUOUSLY: v. Continuity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contort
CONTORT: v. To distort (I), twist.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contortion
CONTORTION: v. Distortion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contour
CONTOUR:<BR>(1) आकारः (=form);<BR>(2) परिवेशः<BR>(=circumference).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contraband
CONTRABAND: निषिद्धः<BR>or<BR>प्रतिषिद्धः (द्धा, द्धं), K. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contract
CONTRACT (v. t.): (I) To bring into less com-<BR>-pass:<BR>(1) संकोचति (कुच्, c. l.)<BR>or<BR>संकोचं नयति<BR>(नी, c. l.), प्रापयति (c. of आप्), etc.;<BR>(2)<BR>कुञ्चयति, आ-, वि-, (c. of कुञ्च्);<BR>(3) संक्षिपति<BR>(क्षिप्, c. 6.) (=to shorten);<BR>(4) समूहति (ऊह्,<BR>c. l.) (=to bring together),<BR>as if c. ing the<BR>quarters:<BR>दिशः समूहन्निव, Ki.<BR>II To acquire,<BR>gain: q. v.: अधिगच्छति (गम्, c. l.).<BR>III In<BR>gram. संक्षिपति (?). Miscel:<BR>to c. a debt:<BR>ऋणं<BR> करोति,<BR>a debt c. ed by a husband:<BR>पतिकृतमृणम्,<BR>N. s.;<BR>to c. a disease:<BR>व्याधिम् अधिगच्छति (गम्,<BR>c. l.), अवाप्नोति (आप्, c. 5.), etc. Sr.;<BR>I will<BR>c. the union of Madalekhā with Vaiśampāyana:<BR>वैशम्पायनस्य मदलेखया सह घटनां कारयामि, K.;<BR>to c.<BR>friendship:<BR>सख्यं बध्नाति, Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contract
CONTRACT (v. i.):<BR>I To shrink:<BR>(1) संकुचति<BR>(कुच्, c. 6.),<BR>skin c. s:<BR>संकुचति चर्म, V. d;<BR>(2)<BR>कुञ्चति, वि-, आ-, (कुञ्च्, c. l.),<BR>with the brow<BR>c. ed:<BR>विकुञ्चितभ्रूलतम्, Ku. v. 74;<BR>(3) संकोचम्<BR>एति, व्रजति, etc.<BR>II To covenant:<BR>(1) समयं or<BR>संविदं करोति;<BR>(2) (अभ्युपैति (इ, c. 2.) (=to agree),<BR>c. ing for service:<BR>शुश्रूषामभ्युपेत्य, Vri.; Ph.:<BR>should reside the time c. ed for:<BR>कृतं कालं निवसेत्,<BR>Y.;<BR>should complete the time c. ed for:<BR>कृतं कालं<BR> समापयेत्, N. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contract
CONTRACT (subs,):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) नियमः;<BR>(2)<BR>समयः;<BR>(3) संविद्, -दा (f.),<BR>breach of c.:<BR>संविद्-<BR>व्यतिक्रमः, M.<BR>II A contracted word: संक्षिप्त-<BR>पदम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contractibility
CONTRACTIBILITY, CONTRACTILITY: संकोच-<BR>शीलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contractible
CONTRACTIBLE, CONTRACTILE:<BR>(1) संकोचशीलः<BR>(ला, लं);<BR>(2) कुञ्चनीयः (या, यं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contraction
CONTRACTION:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) संकोचः, -नम्;<BR>(2)<BR>कुञ्चनम्, वि-, आ-,<BR>II An abbreviation:<BR>संक्षेपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contractor
CONTRACTOR:<BR>(1) समयकारिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2) कृत-<BR>संविद् (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contradict
CONTRADICT:<BR>(1) वि- रुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.), प्रति-,<BR> उप-, (=to oppose), S.;<BR>(2) प्रतिषेधति (सिध्,<BR>c. l.), (= I),<BR>he would c. the variety of the<BR>world:<BR>स जगद्वैचित्र्यं प्रतिषेधेत्, S. iii. 33.;<BR>(3)<BR>प्रत्याख्याति (ख्या, c. 2.) (=gainsay): v. To<BR>deny. To c. a man: expr. by circum,<BR>he c.<BR>ed himself on many points:<BR>*स बहुनि विरुद्ध-<BR>वचनान्युवाच।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contradiction
CONTRADICTION:<BR>(1) विरोधः;<BR>(2) प्रतिषेधः;<BR>(2) प्रत्याख्यानम् (=denial).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contradictory
CONTRADICTORY:<BR>I Opposing in terms:<BR>(1) विरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं);<BR>(2) विरोधिन् (f. नी),<BR>these<BR>two assertions are c.:<BR>परस्परविरोधिनी वचने, Mu. i.<BR>II Repugnant, inconsistent: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contradistinction
CONTRADISTINCTION:<BR>(1) वैपरीत्यम्;<BR>(2) वैल-<BR>क्षण्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrariety
CONTRARIETY:<BR>I Contrary state: वैपरीत्यम्।<BR>II Inconsistency: विरोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrariwise
CONTRARIWISE:<BR>(1) वैपरीत्येन;<BR>(2) विपर्ययेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrary
CONTRARY (adj.):<BR>I In direction etc.:<BR>(1)<BR>प्रति in comp.,<BR>driven by c. wind:<BR>प्रतिवातप्रेरितः<BR>(ता, तं), D.;<BR>(2) प्रतीपः, वि-, (पा, पं), c. wind:<BR>प्रतीपपवनः, R. xi. 62.<BR>II Opposite:<BR>(1)<BR>विपरीतः (ता, तं), but it is c. with learned men: [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">Page151</a>]<BR>विपरीतन्तु विपश्चिताम्, M. n.;<BR>as you are of a c.<BR>mind:<BR>यतो विपरीतबुद्धिरसि P.;<BR>(2) विरुद्धः (द्धा,<BR> द्धं) (=contradictory).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=150" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrary to
CONTRARY TO: v. Against (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrary
CONTRARY (subs.):<BR>(1) विपरीतम्,<BR>in saying that<BR>the weak are incurable we get its c.:<BR>कृशा<BR> दुश्चिकित्स्या इत्युक्ते विपरीतं गृह्यते;<BR>(2) विपर्ययः,<BR>on<BR>the c.:<BR>तद्विपर्ययेण, S.;<BR>(3) प्रातिलोम्यम्, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrast
CONTRAST (v. t.): Ph.:<BR>c. the castes:<BR>वर्णभेदान्<BR> प्रदर्शय: v. Difference, to show.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrast
CONTRAST (v. i.): i. e., to stand in or exhibit<BR>c.: expr. by circum: v. Above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrast
CONTRAST (subs.):<BR>I In c. ing:<BR>(1) by<BR>क्व ।, क्व what a c. between the solar dynasty<BR>and (my)<BR>little mind:<BR>क्व सूर्यप्रभवो वंशः क्व<BR> चाल्पविषया मतिः, R. i. 2.;<BR>(2) अन्तरम् (=dis-<BR>-tance), that is the c. between you and Rāma:<BR>तदन्तरं ते रवुनन्दनस्य, Ma. n.<BR>II Obs.: v.<BR>Opposition, dissimilarity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contravene
CONTRAVENE: प्रतिहन्ति (हन्, c. 2.): v.<BR>Oppose, violate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contravention
CONTRAVENTION: व्यतिक्रमः: v. Violation,<BR>opposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contribute
CONTRIBUTE:<BR>I To give, grant: q. v.: ददाति<BR>(दा, c. 3.).<BR>II To help, benefit: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contributor
CONTRIBUTOR:<BR>I In gen. sense: दानम्।<BR>II<BR>Literary: प्रबन्धः (?), sends c. s to many papers:<BR>*बह्वीषु पत्रिकासु स प्रबन्धांँल्लिखति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contribution
CONTRIBUTION:<BR>I A giver: दातृ (m.).<BR>II<BR>Literary: लेखकः (=writer).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrite
CONTRITE: अनुशयिन् (f. नी): v. Penitent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contritely
CONTRITELY: सानुशयम्: v. Penitently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrition
CONTRITION: अनुशयः: v. Penitence, repen-<BR>-tance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrivance
CONTRIVANCE:<BR>I The act: कल्पना: v. In-<BR>-vention.<BR>II Plan, artifice: q. v.:<BR>(1) उपायः;<BR>(2) उपाधिः,<BR>this object cannot be accomplished<BR>without some c.:<BR>विनोपाधिनायमर्थो न साध्यः, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrive
CONTRIVE (v. t.):<BR>I To form:<BR>(1) उद्भावयति<BR>(c. of भू) (=to invent);<BR>(2) कल्पयति (क्ल्टप्,<BR>(c. 10.) (=to think out);<BR>(3) करोति (= to<BR>form):<BR>(4) चिन्तयति (=to consider).<BR>II<BR>To spend: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contrive
CONTRIVE (v. i.): v. To plan, plot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contriver
CONTRIVER<BR>(1) उद्भावयितृ (f. त्री);<BR>(2) कल्पयितृ<BR>(f. त्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

control
CONTROL (subs.):<BR>I Restraint: q. v.: यन्त्रणा,<BR> नि-,।<BR>II Command: यन्त्रणा, नि-, on whom<BR>(you)<BR>would exercise c.:<BR>यस्योपरि (तव)<BR>नियन्त्रणा स्यात्, K. Ph.: your (duty)<BR>is to keep<BR>me under your c. and mine to obey it.:<BR>वशित्वं<BR> वो वश्यता च मम, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

control
CONTROL (v.):<BR>(1) यच्छति, नि-, सं-, (यम्, c. l.),<BR>c. ing the passions:<BR>संयम्येन्द्रियाणि, K.;<BR>(2)<BR>यन्त्रयति (यन्त्र्, c. 10.),<BR>one whose mouth is not<BR>c. d:<BR>अयन्त्रितमुखः (खा, खं), D.;<BR>(3) नि-गृह्णाति,<BR> विनि-, सन्नि-, (ग्रह्, c. 9.),<BR>c. ing rage with<BR>patience:<BR>कोपं क्षमया निगृह्णन्, B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controller
CONTROLLER:<BR>(1) नियामकः,<BR>you are king, our<BR>c.:<BR>त्वं राजा नो नियामकः, A. r.;<BR>(2) नियन्तृ (m.);<BR>(3) निग्रहीतृ (m.);<BR>(4) नियन्त्रयितृ (m.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controversial
CONTROVERSIAL: expr. by comp., c. point:<BR>विवादपदम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controversialist
CONTROVERSIALIST: तर्किन् (f. नी); वादिन् (f.<BR>नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controversy
CONTROVERSY:<BR>(1) वादः,<BR>to win a c.:<BR>वादं<BR> जयति, Mah.;<BR>(2) विवादः, in literary c. s:<BR>विद्याविवादेषु, K.;<BR>(3) विचारः (=discussion),<BR>in a c. about truths:<BR>तत्त्वविचारमध्ये, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controvert
CONTROVERT: प्रतिक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.),<BR>c. the<BR>doctrine of transiency:<BR>क्षणिकत्वपक्षं प्रतिक्षिपन्ति,<BR>D. s.: v. To dispute, assail.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

controvertible
CONTROVERTIBLE:<BR>(1) प्रतिक्षेपणीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) खण्डनीयः (या, यं) (=refutable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumacious
CONTUMACIOUS: प्रतीपः (पा, पं), a c. servant:<BR>प्रेष्यः प्रतीपः, H.: v. Obstinate, perverse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumaciously
CONTUMACIOUSLY: प्रतीपम्: v. Obstinately,<BR>perversely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumaciousness
CONTUMACIOUSNESS, CONTUMACY: प्रतीपता: v.<BR>Obstinacy, insolence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumelious
CONTUMELIOUS: अवमानिन् (f. नी): v. Insolent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumeliously
CONTUMELIOUSLY: सावमानम्: v. Insolently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contumely
CONTUMELY: अवमानना: v. Insult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contuse
CONTUSE:<BR>I To pound: q. v.: पिनष्टि (पिष्,<BR>c. 7.).<BR>II To bruise: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

contusion
CONTUSION: i. e. a bruise: घृष्टम्, Ni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=151" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convalescence
CONVALESCENCE: (रोगात्) समुत्थानम्: v. Re-<BR>-covery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convalescent
CONVALESCENT: (रोगात्) समुत्थितः (ता, तं): v.<BR>To recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convene
CONVENE (v.):<BR>I Trans.: समाह्वयति (ह्वे, c. l.):<BR>v. To assemble, summon.<BR>II Intrans.:<BR>v. To meet, assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convenience
CONVENIENCE:<BR>I Fitness, suitability: q. v.<BR>II Ease, comfort: q. v. Ph.:<BR>according to<BR>one's c.:<BR>यथावसरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convenient
CONVENIENT:<BR>I Suitable: q. v.: उचितः (ता,<BR> तं).<BR>II Commodious: सङ्गतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conveniently
CONVENIENTLY:<BR>(1) सुखेन (=with ease);<BR>(2)<BR>यथावसरम् (at a c. time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convent
CONVENT: विहारः: v. Monastery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conventicle
CONVENTICLE: समाजः,<BR>who will not come to the<BR>c.:<BR>यः समाजे नागमिष्यति, V. p.: v. Assembly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convention
CONVENTION:<BR>I An agreement: q. v.: समयः,<BR>this c. was made by the sages:<BR>एवं मुनिगणैः समयः<BR> कृतोऽभूत्, V. p.<BR>II An assembly: q. v.: सभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conventional
CONVENTIONAL:<BR>(1) लौकिकः (की, कं) (=popu-<BR>-lar);<BR>(2) सर्वसम्मतः (ता, तं) (=approved by<BR>all).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

converge
CONVERGE: सन्निपतति (पत्, c. l.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convergence
CONVERGENCE, CONVERGENCY: सन्निपातः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convergent
CONVERGENT, CONVERGING (adj.): सन्निपातिन्<BR>(f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversable
CONVERSABLE: आलापिन् (f. नी): v. Affable,<BR>courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversableness
CONVERSABLENESS: आलापिता: v. Sociability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversant
CONVERSANT:<BR>(1) अभिज्ञः (ज्ञा, ज्ञं),<BR>I am not c.<BR>with such affairs:<BR>एवंविधानां वृत्तान्तानामनमिज्ञास्मि,<BR>K.;<BR>(2) कोविदः (दा, दं) (=learned),<BR>c. with<BR>all the Vedas:<BR>वेदसमुदायकोविदः, D.: v.<BR>Versed. Ph.:<BR>c. about<BR>-विषयकः (का, कं) in<BR>comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversation
CONVERSATION<BR>I Conduct, behaviour:<BR>q. v.<BR>II Intercourse, acquaintance: q. v.<BR>III Talk:<BR>(1) आलापः, संलापः,<BR>our c. was in<BR>one verse:<BR>आवयोरासीदेकयार्यया संलापः, D. vi.;<BR>(2) सम्भाषा, सम्भाषणम्, to hold c. with women:<BR>स्त्रीभिः सह सम्भाषणं करोति; स्त्रीभिः सम्भाषां समाचरति,<BR>M. viii. 360-1.;<BR>(3) सङ्कथा, we had some c.<BR>about news of the country<BR>सङ्कथा च देशवार्तानुविद्धा<BR> काचनावयोरभूत्, D. v.;<BR>(4) संवादः (rare), Mah;<BR>(5) कथोपकथनम्<BR>or<BR>कथानुकथनम्, N. IV. Sexual<BR>intercourse: सङ्गमः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversational
CONVERSATIONAL: expr. by comp., c. power:<BR>संलापशक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

converse
CONVERSE (subs.):<BR>I Conversation: q. v.<BR>II The contrary: q. v.:<BR>(1) विपरीतम्;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रातिलोम्यम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

converse
CONVERSE (v.):<BR>I To hold conversation:<BR>(1) सं-लपति, आ-, (लप्, c. l.),<BR>not c. ing even<BR>with Madalekhā:<BR>मदलेखामप्यनालपन्ती, K.;<BR>(2)<BR>सं-भाषते (भाष्, c. l.) privately c. s. with witnesses:<BR>मिथः साक्षिभिः सम्भाषते, M. viii. 55.;<BR>(3) सं-<BR>कथयति (कथ्, c. 10.) (rare);<BR>(4) सं-वदति (वद्,<BR>c. l.) (rare), while we are privately c. ing:<BR>रहः संवादिनौ आवाम्, R. xv. 92.<BR>II To have<BR>sexual intercourse: संगच्छति (गम्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversely
CONVERSELY: तद्विपर्ययेण, S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conversion
CONVERSION:<BR>I Change: q. v.: परिवर्तनम्।<BR>II<BR>Religious: Ph.:<BR>c. to Christianity:<BR>*स्वधर्मं<BR> परित्यज्य कृष्टधर्मग्रहणम्।<BR>III Interchange of<BR>words: व्यत्ययः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convert
CONVERT (subs.): *स्वधर्मं परित्यज्य धर्मान्तरग्राहिन्<BR>(f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convert
CONVERT (v. t.):<BR>I To change: q. v.<BR>II Of<BR>religion: *स्वधर्मं ग्राहयति (c. of ग्रह्).<BR>III<BR>To reform: q. v.<BR>IV To appropriate:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convert
CONVERT (v. i.):<BR>c. ed into mouse:<BR>मूषिको बभूव:<BR>v. To change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convex
CONVEX: *गण्डाकारः (रा, रं); मध्योच्चः (च्चा, च्चं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convexity
CONVEXITY: *गण्डाकारता, मध्योच्चता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convey
CONVEY:<BR>I To carry, transport: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>वहति (वह्, c. l.) (=to carry);<BR>(2) हरति<BR>(हृ, c. l.) (=to take),<BR>c. my message:<BR>सन्देशं<BR> मे हर, Me. i. 7.;<BR>(3) प्रापयति (c. of आप्) (=to<BR>cause to reach), c. ing my respects (to them):<BR>प्रापितमत्प्रणामः, R. xiv. 60.<BR>II To transfer<BR>(property): सम्-अर्पयति (c. of ऋ).<BR>III To<BR>impart: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conveyance
CONVEYANCE:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) वहनम्;<BR>(2) by<BR>verb,<BR>II Instrument of c.:<BR>(1) वाहनम्; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">Page153</a>]<BR>(2) यानम्: v. Carriage.<BR>III Transference:<BR>q. v.<BR>IV Deed of c.: *समर्पणपत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=152" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conveyancer
CONVEYANCER: *समर्पणपत्रकोविदः<BR>or<BR>पण्डितः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conveyancing
CONVEYANCING: *समर्पणपत्रव्यवहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conveyer
CONVEYER: वाहकः: v. Carrier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convict
CONVICT (subs.):<BR>(1) निर्णीतापराधः (धा, धं) (?);<BR>(2) आदिष्टदण्डः (ण्डा, ण्डं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convict
CONVICT (v. t.):<BR>I To find guilty: अपराधं<BR> निर्णयति (नी, c. l.),<BR>the judge c. ed him of<BR>murder:<BR>*धर्माधिकरणिकस्तस्य वधापराधं निर्णिनाय;<BR>c. ed by his own conscience:<BR>*स्वसंज्ञानेन निर्णीता-<BR>पराधः।<BR>II To prove: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

conviction
CONVICTION:<BR>I The act of finding guilty:<BR>अपराधनिर्णयः<BR>II Confutation: q. v.<BR>III<BR>Relief: विश्वासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convince
CONVINCE:<BR>(1) विश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्) (=to<BR>cause to believe);<BR>(2) सर्वसन्देहान् निराकरोति<BR>(कृ, c. 8.) (=to dispel all doubts). To be<BR>c. d: i. e., to be certain: निश्चयम् अधिगच्छति<BR>(गम्। c. l.), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convincing
CONVINCING:<BR>(1) विश्वासजननः (नी, नं) (=creat-<BR>-ing belief);<BR>(2) सर्वसन्देहमञ्जकः (का, कं)<BR>(=doubt-removing);<BR>(3) निश्चायकः (का, कं)<BR>(=making certain).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convincingly
CONVINCINGLY: सर्वसन्देहान् निराकृत्य, and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convocation
CONVOCATION:<BR>I The act: समाह्नानम्।<BR>II An<BR>assemblage: q. v.: सभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convoke
CONVOKE: समाह्वयति (ह्वे, c. l.): v. To<BR>assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convolution
CONVOLUTION: v. Fold, turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convolvulus
CONVOLVULUS: क्षीरविदारी (a species).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convoy
CONVOY (v.): v. To accompany, escort.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convoy
CONVOY (subs.):<BR>I Protection, attendance:<BR>q. v.<BR>II A protecting escort: रक्षकः<BR>(=guard).<BR>III A ship for c.: रक्षकपोतः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convulse
CONVULSE: सं-क्षोभयति (c. of क्षुभ्): v. To<BR>agitate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convulsion
CONVULSION:<BR>I Agitation: q. v.: संक्षोभः।<BR>II<BR>Involuntary contraction:<BR>(1) आक्षोपकः;<BR>(2)<BR>अपतन्त्रकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

convulsive
CONVULSIVE: आक्षेपिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cony
CONY: शशकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

coo
Coo (v. i.):<BR>(1) कौति (कृ c. 2.),<BR>flurried by c. ing<BR>birds:<BR>कुवत्पक्षिकुलाकुलाः, B.;<BR>(2) कूजति (कूज्,<BR>c. l.),<BR>of the c. ing dove:<BR>कूजत्कपोतस्य,<BR>Bham.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cook
COOK (v. t.):<BR>(1) पचति, -ते (पच्, c. l.),<BR>to c.<BR>rice:<BR>तण्डुलान् पचति, Bha; c. ed in ghee:<BR>घृतपक्वः (क्वा, क्वं), Bha.;<BR>c. ing vessel:<BR>पाकपात्रम्,<BR>Bha.;<BR>(2) साधयति (c. of सिध्) (rare),<BR>the<BR>way of c. ing food:<BR>अन्नानां साधनप्रकारः, Bha.;<BR>c. ed meat:<BR>सिद्धमांसम्, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cook
COOK (subs.):<BR>(1) पचकः;<BR>(2) सूपकारः;<BR>(3)<BR>वल्लवः;<BR>(4) सूदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cookery
COOKERY: पाककला।<BR>C. book:<BR>पाकशास्त्रम्, Bha.;<BR>skilled in c.:<BR>पाकपण्डितः, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cook-room
COOK-ROOM:<BR>(1) पाकशाला;<BR>(2) महानस (mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=153" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

cool
