devout
DEVOUT:<BR>I Pious:<BR>(1) धार्मिकः (का, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>धर्मपरायणः (णा, णं), Ph.: he is a d. Christian:<BR>*आत्यन्तिकी तस्य कृष्टधर्मे श्रद्धा।<BR>II Sincere: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

