DEVOUTLY:<BR>(1) भक्त्या;<BR>(2) भक्तिपुरःसरम्;<BR>(3)<BR>भक्तिपूर्वकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=195" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

devoutness
