DIETETICS: आहारविघिः, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

differ
DIFFER (v. i.):<BR>I To be unlike:<BR>(1) भिद्यते<BR>(pass. of भिद्) (rare),<BR>the prince did not d. from<BR>his cause:<BR>न कारणात् स्वाद्विभिदे कुमारः, R. v. 37.;<BR>you two d. in this:<BR>युवयोरिदमेव भिद्यते,; Si. xvi.<BR>70.;<BR>(2) विशिष्यते (pass. of शिष्), M. n.;<BR>(3) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">Page197</a>]<BR>better by the subs., in what do they d.:<BR>कस्तयोभेदः।<BR>II To disagree: विप्रतिपद्यते (पद्,<BR>c. 4.) Ph.:<BR>I d. from you:<BR>मम मतं भिन्नम्, or<BR>तन्मते न वर्ते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=196" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

difference
DIFFERENCE:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) भेदः, प्र-, वि-, and<BR>(yet)<BR>did not find any d. among the five:<BR>भेदं विवेद<BR> न च पञ्चसु कञ्चिदेषा, N. xiii. 41.;<BR>from the d. of<BR>the results and subjects of enquiry:<BR>फलजिज्ञास्यभेदात्,<BR>S.;<BR>(2) विशेषः (=distinction: q. v.);<BR>(3)<BR>तारतम्यम् (=d. in quality),<BR>O, what a d. in<BR>men:<BR>अहो तारतम्यं नराणाम्, Mr. x.;<BR>(4) अन्तरम्<BR>(=distance: to contrast two objects),<BR>the d.<BR>between you and me is like the d. between the<BR>ocean and the pond:<BR>अत्रमवतः किल मम च समुद्र-<BR>पल्वलयोरिवान्तरम्, Mal. Ph.:<BR>it makes no d.:<BR>अत्र<BR> नास्ति विशेषः।<BR>II Discordance: q. v.: विप्रति-<BR>पत्तिः, S.<BR>III Dissension: विवादः।<BR>IV In<BR>arith.: अन्तरम्,<BR>sum and d.:<BR>योगान्तरे, Vij.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

different
DIFFERENT:<BR>(1) मिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं), वि-, प्र-,<BR>men have<BR>d. tastes:<BR>भिन्नरुचिर्हि लोकः, R.;<BR>not d. from<BR>me:<BR>मत्तोऽविभिन्नः, V. p.;<BR>(2) by subs.,<BR>made<BR>many d. statements:<BR>वाक्यभेदान् बहुनकथयत्, Mu.<BR>ii.;<BR>(3) by अन्तरम् affixed,<BR>d. tastes:<BR>रसान्तराणि,<BR>R. x. 17.: v. Other: v. Unlike, various.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

differential
DIFFERENTIAL: v. Special. D. coefficient:<BR>*सूक्ष्ममानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

differentiate
DIFFERENTIATE: *सूक्ष्ममानं निरूपयति, (रूप्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

differently
DIFFERENTLY: v. Variously, otherwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

difficult
DIFFICULT:<BR>(1) Often by a comp. with दुर्,<BR>d. to understand:<BR>दुर्बोधः (धा, धं); d. to climb:<BR>दुरारोहः (हा, हं);<BR>d. to pass:<BR>दुर्गमः (मा, मं);<BR>(2) दुःख-, कष्ट-,<BR>or<BR>कृच्छ्र-, in comp. (of<BR>physical d. ies), very d. to procure food here:<BR>कष्टतरलभ्याहारमिदं स्थानम्, H.;<BR>(3) विषमः (मा, मं),<BR>although d. political science is dived into:<BR>विषमोऽपि<BR> विगाह्यते नयः, Ki.;<BR>(4) कठिनः (ना, नं)<BR>(=hard);<BR>(5) दुरूहः (हा, हं) (= obscure).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

difficulty
DIFFICULTY:<BR>I Arduousness:<BR>(1) काठिन्यम्;<BR>(2) वैषम्यम्।<BR>Without any d.:<BR>अनासायेन<BR>or<BR>सुखेनः<BR>v. Easily.<BR>With d.:<BR>कथमपि (=somehow),<BR>fixing his speech (i. e. controlling his emo-<BR>tions)<BR>with great d.:<BR>कथं कथमपि वचनं संस्थाप्य, V.<BR>ii.;<BR>(2) कथञ्चन<BR>or<BR>कथञ्चित् (=कथमपि),<BR>controlled<BR>their minds with d.:<BR>कथञ्चिदीशा मनसां बभूवुः,<BR>Ku. iii. 34.; दुःखेन, was able to feed with d.<BR>दुःखेन भोजयितुं शशाकः।: Si. v. 51.;<BR>(4) कृच्छ्रेण,<BR>Ki. iii. 42.;<BR>(5) कष्टेन, with great d.:<BR>महाकष्टेन, M. n.<BR>II Something difficult:<BR>(1) कृच्छ्रम्,<BR>in d. s:<BR>कृच्छ्रेषु, Ki. xi. 75.;<BR>(2)<BR>सङ्कटम् (=straits),<BR>his understanding not failing<BR>in d. s:<BR>कार्यसङ्कटेष्वविषण्णधीः, K.;<BR>(3) विघ्नः<BR>(=obstacle: q. v.);<BR>(4) expr. by adj.,<BR>d. s of grammar:<BR>व्याकरणस्य विषमाणि;<BR>may<BR>everybody overcome his d. s:<BR>सर्वस्तरतु दुर्गाणि, V.<BR>III Embarrassment, perplexity: q. v.<BR>IV<BR>An objection: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffidence
DIFFIDENCE:<BR>I Distrust: q. v.: अविश्वासः।<BR>II<BR>Modesty: q. v.: अप्रगल्भता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffident
DIFFIDENT:<BR>I Distrustful: q. v.: अविश्वासिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>II Modest: q. v.<BR>(1) अप्रगल्भः (ल्भा,<BR> ल्भं);<BR>(2) विलक्षः (क्षा, क्षं);<BR>(3) अधृष्टः (ष्टा,<BR> ष्टं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffidently
DIFFIDENTLY:<BR>(1) अप्रगल्भम्;<BR>(2) सवैलक्ष्यम्: v.<BR>Bashfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffuse
DIFFUSE (v. i.):<BR>(1) वि-सरति (सृ, c. 1.),<BR>the rays<BR>of the sun clearly d. d:<BR>स्फुटं विसस्रे सवितुर्मयूखैः,<BR>Ki.;<BR>(2) वि-सर्पति (सृप्, c. 1.),<BR>I smelt the d.<BR>ing scent of flower:<BR>विसर्पन्तं कुसुमगन्धमभ्यजिघ्रम्, K.:<BR>v. To spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffuse
DIFFUSE (v. t.):<BR>(1) विसारयति (c. of सृ);<BR>(2)<BR>विसर्पयति (c. of सृप्): v. To spread.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffuse
DIFFUSE (adj.):<BR>(1) विस्तृतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>विततः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) सुविस्तरः (रा, रं),<BR>very d.<BR>discourse:<BR>सुविस्तरतरा वाचः, Si. ii. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffusely
DIFFUSELY:<BR>(1) विस्तरशः;<BR>(2) विस्तरेण;<BR>(3)<BR>सविस्तरम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffuseness
DIFFUSENESS: विस्तारः। N. B. Better expr. by the<BR>adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffusion
DIFFUSION:<BR>(1) विसर्पणम्;<BR>(2) विसरः: v. Disse-<BR>-mination, extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diffusive
DIFFUSIVE:<BR>(1) विसृमरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) विसर्पणशीलः<BR>(ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dig
DIG (v.): खनति, -ते, (खन्, c. 1.),<BR>d. ging the<BR>place:<BR>स्थानं खनित्वा, P. v. 3.: to d. a well:<BR>कूपं खनति, Sr.; to d. gold from the ground:<BR>भूमिं खनित्वा, स्वर्णं गृह्णाति<BR>or<BR>भूमेः स्वर्णम् उत्खनति। [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">Page198</a>]<BR>Comp.:<BR>d. down:<BR>अवखनति;<BR>d. in:<BR>निखनति;<BR>d. out or up:<BR>उत्खनति। Ph.:<BR>to d. a subter-<BR>ranean passage:<BR>सुरङ्गं करोति, D.;<BR>to d. the<BR>ground:<BR>भूमिम् अवदारयति, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=197" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digest
DIGEST (subs.): संहिता,<BR>d. of Manu:<BR>मनुसंहिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digest
DIGEST (v. i.):<BR>I Of food:<BR>(1) जीर्यति (जॄ,<BR>c. 4.),<BR>what is eaten does not d. well:<BR>भुक्तं सम्यक्<BR> न जीर्यति, Sr.;<BR>(2) पच्यते, वि-, परि-, (pass. of<BR>पच्), Sr.;<BR>(3) पाकं<BR>or<BR>परिपाकं गच्छति, व्रजति,<BR>etc., Sr.<BR>II To suppurate: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digest
DIGEST (v. t.):<BR>I To arrange: q. v.<BR>II Of<BR>food: जीर्णं (f. र्णां) करोति<BR>or<BR>जरयति (c. of ज्दृ)<BR>(rare); I will eat and d. (Vrikodara): वृकोदरं<BR> संभक्ष्य जरयिष्यामि, Mah.<BR>III Fig.: to think<BR>over: अनुध्यायति, नि-, (ध्यै, c. l.), S.<BR>IV To<BR>brook: सहते (सह्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digestible
DIGESTIBLE:<BR>(1) शीघ्रपाकः (का, कं);<BR>(2) यः (या,<BR> यत्) (सुखेन) जीर्यति<BR>or<BR>पाकं गच्छति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digestion
DIGESTION:<BR>I Arrangement: q. v.<BR>II Of<BR>food:<BR>(1) पाकः, परि-,<BR>(2) जीर्णता।<BR>III<BR>Digestive power: अग्निः,<BR>and those persons<BR>who have good d.:<BR>ये च दीप्ताग्नयो नराः, Sr.;<BR>of<BR>weak d.:<BR>मन्दाग्नि (mfn.), Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digestive
DIGESTIVE: i. e. causing to digest: पाचनः<BR>(नी, नं), Sr. Ph.:<BR>d. organ:<BR>*पाकेन्द्रियम्,<BR> पक्वाशयः। D. power: v. Digestion (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digger
DIGGER:<BR>(1) खनकः;<BR>(2) खनितृ (m.);<BR>(3)<BR>खातकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digging
DIGGING: खननम्। Ph.:<BR>gold d. s:<BR>स्वर्णभूमयः<BR>(pl.), P. (or fully) खननयोग्याः स्वर्णभूमयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dight
DIGHT: v. To adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digit
DIGIT:<BR>I A measure: अङ्गुलम्,<BR>measuring three<BR>d. s:<BR>त्रङ्गुलः (ला, लं), Pa.<BR>II Any number<BR>under ten: *आदिसंख्या, Ph.: an eclipse of<BR>six d. s (d=½): अर्द्धग्रासः, Su.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dignified
DIGNIFIED:<BR>(1) अनुभाववत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) महानुभावः<BR>(वा, वं): v. Majesty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dignify
DIGNIFY: सं-भावयति, अनु-, (c. of भू): v. To<BR>honour, promote, adorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dignitary
DIGNITARY: उच्चपदाधिष्ठितः (ता, तं); लब्धप्रतिष्ठः<BR>(ष्ठा, ष्ठं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dignity
DIGNITY:<BR>I Honourableness:<BR>(1) महिमन् (m.),<BR>royal d.:<BR>राजमहिमा, Mal.;<BR>(2) अनुभावः, high d.:<BR>महानुभावः, Ki.<BR>II Of style: बोजस् (n.), Ki.;<BR>III High position:<BR>(1) उच्चपदम्;<BR>(2) प्रतिष्ठा: v.<BR>Honour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digress
DIGRESS: Ph.:<BR>I have d. ed. much from what I<BR>began to say:<BR>यत् कथयितं प्रवृत्तोऽस्मि तत्परित्यज्यैवाति-<BR>दूरमतिक्रान्तोऽस्मि, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digression
DIGRESSION: expr. by circumlo: v. To<BR>digress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

digressively
DIGRESSIVELY: expr. by circumlo, to talk d.:<BR>प्रस्तुतं परित्यज्य दूरमतिक्रामति (क्रम्, c. l.)<BR>or<BR>विषयान्तरं<BR> विस्तरेण विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dike
DIKE:<BR>I A channel: q. v.: प्रणाली।<BR>II Mound:<BR>q. v.: वप्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilapidated
DILAPIDATED:<BR>(1) विशीर्णः (र्णा, र्णं),<BR>with<BR>hundreds of d. edifices and turrets:<BR>विशीर्णतल्पाट्टशतः<BR>(ता, तं), R.;<BR>(2) जीर्णः (र्णा, र्णं) (=decayed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilapidation
DILAPIDATION:<BR>(1) विशीर्णता;<BR>(2) जीर्णता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilatation
DILATATION: विस्तारः v. Expansion, extension.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilate
DILATE:<BR>I To expand: q. v.: विस्तारयति (c.<BR>of स्तॄ).<BR>II To enlarge: q. v.: *विस्तरेण<BR> विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilatorily
DILATORILY:<BR>(1) विलम्बेन;<BR>(2) कालक्षेपेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilatoriness
DILATORINESS:<BR>(1) दीर्घसूत्रता, H.;<BR>(2) चिर-<BR>क्रियत्वम्, Nil: v. Slowness, tardiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilatory
DILATORY:<BR>I Of men: दीर्घसूत्र: (f. त्रा);<BR>(2)<BR>चिरक्रियः (या, यं).<BR>II Of acts: v. Slow, tardy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilemma
DILEMMA:<BR>I Log.: *खण्डसिद्धान्तः,<BR>the horns of<BR>a d.:<BR>खण्डसिद्धान्तशृङ्गौः (n. dual).<BR>II A diffi-<BR>-culty: q. v.: विकल्पः, Sah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilettant
DILETTANT, -e: *प्रियदर्शकः; आत्मविनोदार्थं कलासेवी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diligence
DILIGENCE:<BR>(1) उद्योगः;<BR>(2) अध्यवसायः;<BR>(3)<BR>अभियोगः;<BR>(4) उद्यमः;<BR>(5) अभिनिवेशः (appli-<BR>-cation);<BR>(6) प्रयत्नः (effort).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diligent
DILIGENT:<BR>(1) उद्योगिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) अध्यवसायिन्<BR>(f. नी);<BR>(3) उद्यमिन्;<BR>(4) अभियोगवत् (f. ती),<BR>Ki.: v. Active.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diligently
DILIGENTLY:<BR>(1) सोद्योगम्;<BR>(2) उद्यमेन;<BR>(3)<BR>सोत्साहम् (=zealously).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dill
DILL: a plant:<BR>(1) शालेयः (?);<BR>(2) शतपुष्पा (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diluent
DILUENT: तनूकरणशीलः (ला, लं) (?). Ph.:<BR>“there<BR>is no real d. but water”:<BR>यथार्थतो जलादन्यः पदार्थो<BR> नास्ति यः पदार्थान्तरान् तनूकरोति (thins)<BR>or<BR>विलयति<BR>(dissolves)<BR>or<BR>क्षीणीकरोति (weakens).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=198" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilute
DILUTE:<BR>I To thin, weaken, or dissolve:<BR>q. v.<BR>II To mix with water: जलेन मिश्रयति<BR>(मिश्र, c. 10.)<BR>or<BR>संसृजति (सृज्, c. 6.), M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dilution
DILUTION:<BR>I Attenuation, dissolution: q. v.<BR>II With water: जलेन मिश्रणम्।<BR>III A<BR>mixture: तनूकृतः (ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diluvial
DILUVIAL: नद्योत्सृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं), Vri.; strictly<BR>आप्लावजः (जा, जं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dim
DIM (adj.):<BR>I Obscure:<BR>(1) मलिनप्रभः (भा, भं);<BR>(2) मन्दकान्तः (न्ता, न्तं);<BR>(3) मन्दद्युति (mfn.).<BR>II Of sight: Ph.:<BR>his eyes are d.:<BR>न स सुतरां<BR> पश्यति<BR>or<BR>अस्पष्टं पश्यति।<BR>III Dull: स्थूलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dim
DIM (v.): तिमिरयति (nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimension
DIMENSION: परिमाणं<BR>or<BR>प्रमाणम्: v. Size, measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diminish
DIMINISH (v. i.): हासमुपैति: v. To decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diminish
DIMINISH (v. t.):<BR>(1) हासयति (c. of ह्नस्),<BR>should<BR>d. one mouthful:<BR>एकैकं ह्नासयेत् पिण्डम्, Pa.;<BR>(2)<BR>अपचिनोति (चि, c. 5.);<BR>(3) अल्पीकरोति, न्यूनी-<BR>करोति, etc. (=to make less);<BR>(4) लघयति (=to<BR>lighten).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diminution
DIMINUTION:<BR>I Decrease: q. v.: ह्रासः<BR>II<BR>Degradation, abasement: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diminutive
DIMINUTIVE:<BR>I Adj.: अल्पकायः (या, यं), Mah.<BR>II In gram.: ह्नस्वार्थकप्रत्ययः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimissory
DIMISSORY: Ph.:<BR>letter d.:<BR>अनुरोधपत्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimly
DIMLY:<BR>(1) अस्पष्टम् (=not clearly);<BR>(2) न<BR> सुतराम् (=not well), P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimness
DIMNESS:<BR>(1) अस्पष्टता (=obscurity: q. v.);<BR>(2) मान्द्यम् (=dulness: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimple
DIMPLE: भङ्गः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dimpled
DIMPLED: भङ्गिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

din
DIN (subs.): कलकलः: v. Noise, crash.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

din
DIN (v.):<BR>to d. the ears:<BR>श्रवणपुटं जर्जरीकरोति, K.:<BR>v. To deafen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dine
DINE (v.):<BR>I Trans: भोजयति (c. of भुज्):<BR>v. To feed.<BR>II Intrans: भोजनं करोति: v. To<BR>eat; dinner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dinginess
DINGINESS: कालिमन् (m.): v. Darkness, black-<BR>-ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dingle
DINGLE: दरी: v. Dale, valley.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dingy
DINGY: कालः (ला, लं) (?): v. Dark, black.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dining-room
DINING-ROOM: भोजनशाला, Ch., and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dinner
DINNER: भोजनम्, who invites and does not give d.:<BR>निमन्त्रयित्वा भोजनादायी, V. s.;<BR>d. plate:<BR>भोजन-<BR>भाजनम्, N.;<BR>it is time to bathe and take d.:<BR>समयः<BR> खलु स्नानभोजने सेवितुम्, V.: v. Food.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dinnerless
DINNERLESS:<BR>(1) भोजनविरहितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>अनशनेन<BR>or<BR>निराहारेण (=without food).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dint
DINT (subs.):<BR>I Blow: q. v.: प्रहारः।<BR>II Mark<BR>of blow: प्रहारचिह्नम्, and sim. comp. s. Ph.:<BR>by d. of:<BR>बलेन (in comp.): v. Means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dint
DINT (v. t.): चिह्नयति (चिह्न्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>mark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diocesan
DIOCESAN (subs): प्रधानाचार्यः: v. Bishop.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diocesan
DIOCESAN (adj.): i. e. pertaining to a<BR>diocese: expr. by comp. or by gen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diocese
DIOCESE: अधिकारः<BR>or<BR>प्रदेशः (when the exact<BR>sense is not clear), प्रधानाचार्यस्याधिकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dioptrics
DIOPTRICS: *तेजसो विषमगतिविज्ञानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dip
DIP (v. t.):<BR>I To plunge or immerse: मज्जयति<BR>(c. of मस्ज्,)<BR>the youths were d. d in the fair dame<BR>with all their soul:<BR>सर्वात्मनैव सुतनौ युवभिर्मज्जे,<BR>N.<BR>II To wet: q. v.: क्लेदयति (c. of क्लिद्).<BR>III To dip out: i. e. to take out: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dip
DIP (v. i.):<BR>I To immerse (lit. and fig.):<BR>मज्जति (भस्ज्, c. l.).<BR>II To d. into (books etc.):<BR>चुम्बति (चुम्ब्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dip
DIP (subs.):<BR>I Immersion: मज्जनम्।<BR>II In-<BR>-clination, slope,: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diphthong
DIPHTHONG: युक्तस्वरः (?); द्विस्वरः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diploma
DIPLOMA: *उपाधिपत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diplomacy
DIPLOMACY:<BR>I In gen. sense: सामन् (n.),<BR>these are the five forms of d. noted by those<BR>skilled in its practice:<BR>इति सामप्रयोगज्ञैः साम पञ्च-<BR>विधं स्भृतम्, Ka.;<BR>the milk ocean was churned<BR>by d.:<BR>क्षीराब्धिर्मथितः साभ्ना, Ka.<BR>II Envoys:<BR>दूतवर्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diplomatic
DIPLOMATIC: Ph.:<BR>d. skill:<BR>सामप्रयोगप्रावीण्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diplomatist
DIPLOMATIST: सामप्रयोगज्ञः, Ka, and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dire
DIRE: दारुणः (णा, णं): v. Dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

direct
DIRECT (adj.):<BR>I Straight: q. v.: ऋजु<BR>(mfn.):<BR>II Sincere: q. v.<BR>III Plain,<BR>express: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

direct
DIRECT (v. t.):<BR>I To aim, point: लक्षीकरोति। [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">Page200</a>]<BR>Ph.:<BR>d. ing the mind:<BR>मनः समाधाय, Ki.<BR>II<BR>To manage, govern: q. v.: शास्ति (शास्, c. 2.).<BR>III To guide: दिशति, निर्-, आ-, उप-, प्र-,<BR>(दिश। c. 6.),<BR>who would d. the way to Suvarṇa-<BR>pura:<BR>यः सुत्रर्णपुरपन्थानमुपदेक्ष्यति, K. IV. To<BR>order: q. v.: नियंक्ते, वि-, (युज, c. 7.),<BR>d. me<BR>what I shall give:<BR>प्रयच्छामि कमर्थं विनियुंक्ष्व माम्,<BR>Mah. v. To superscribe: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=199" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

direction
DIRECTION:<BR>I Management, guidance,<BR>command: q. v.<BR>II Order, prescription:<BR>q. v.: नियोगः, by the d. of (her)<BR>superior:<BR>गुरो-<BR>र्नियोगात्, Ku.<BR>III Line of motion: दिश् (f.),<BR>in whichever d. the eye is thrown:<BR>यस्यां यस्यां<BR> दिशि विक्षिप्यते चक्षुः, K.;<BR>in whatever d. the<BR>will of Providence runs:<BR>यया दिशा धावति<BR> वेधसः स्पृहा, N.;<BR>in every d.:<BR>प्रतिदिशम्, Ki.;<BR>cast his eyes in that d.:<BR>तामेव दिशं चक्षुः प्राहिणोत्,<BR>K.:<BR>IV The name and residence of a<BR>person: नामधामनी (n. du.). A board of<BR>directors: नायकवर्गः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

directly
DIRECTLY:<BR>I Instantly: q. v.: सपदि।<BR>II<BR>Immediately after:<BR>“d. he stopped”:<BR>विरतमात्रे<BR> तस्मिन्<BR>or<BR>तद्विरामानन्तरमेव।<BR>III Expressly: q. v.:<BR>स्पष्टम्।<BR>IV In a direct line: ऋजु,<BR>or<BR>सरलम्।<BR>V. As opposed to, inversely: अनुलोमेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

directness
DIRECTNESS: आर्जवम्: v. Frankness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

director
DIRECTOR: नायकः v. Manager, chief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

directory
DIRECTORY: *नामधामप्रदर्शिनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

direful
DIREFUL: दारुणः (णा, णं), नि-,: v. Dreadful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

direness
DIRENESS: दारुणत्वम्: v. Terribleness, horror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirge
DIRGE: करुणगीतम् (?).<BR>In d. s:<BR>करुणार्थग्रथितम् (?), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirgelike
DIRGELIKE: i. e. doleful: q. v.: करुणः (f. णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirk
DIRK: कृपाणी: v. Dagger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirt
DIRT: मल (mn.) (lit. and fig.),<BR>in a mind<BR>free from d.:<BR>अपगतमले मनसि, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirtily
DIRTILY:<BR>(1) मलिनम्;<BR>(2) मलीमसम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirtiness
DIRTINESS:<BR>(1) मालिन्यम्;<BR>(2) मलिनता;<BR>(3)<BR>समलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirty
DIRTY (adj.):<BR>(1) मलिनः (ना, नं),<BR>an old d. rag<BR>torn into hundred pieces:<BR>जीर्णशतखण्डमलिनकन्था,<BR>J.;<BR>d. by birth and in acts:<BR>जन्मकर्मतो मलिनः,<BR>(ना, नं), K.;<BR>(2) मलीमसः (सा, सं), a d. track:<BR>मलीमसा पद्धतिः, R.;<BR>(3) समलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dirty
DIRTY (v.): मलिनयति (nomi): v. To soil,<BR>befoul.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disability
DISABILITY:<BR>I Inability: q. v.<BR>II Legal d.:<BR>अनीशता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disable
DISABLE (v.): अवसादयति (c. of सद्),<BR>of d. d<BR>sight:<BR>अवसन्नदृश् (mfn.), R.: v. To weaken,<BR>unfit. Ph.: an outcaste is d. d from inheri-<BR>tance, (funeral)<BR>cake and water:<BR>अपपात्रितस्य<BR> रिक्थपिण्डोदकानि निवर्तन्ते, Sha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disabuse
DISABUSE: भ्रमं छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.), दूरीकरोति,<BR>etc.<BR>To d. of artifice:<BR>छलं निरस्यति (अस्, c. 4.),<BR>etc.: v. To dispel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disaccustom
DISACCUSTOM: v. Unaccustomed and to make.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disadvantace
DISADVANTACE (subs.):<BR>(1) अहितम्: v. Advan-<BR>-tage;<BR>(2) हानिः (=loss: q. v.);<BR>(3) पीडा<BR>(=inconvenience, trouble),<BR>and little d. to<BR>the farmer:<BR>क्षेत्रस्वामिनश्चाल्पा पीडा, Viv.;<BR>(4)<BR>बाधा (=पीडा), if of much use and little d.:<BR>महागुणोऽल्पबाधश्चेत्, N. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disadvantageous
DISADVANTAGEOUS:<BR>(1) अहितकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>अनर्थकरः (री, रं): v. Unfavourable; to injure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disadvantageously
DISADVANTAGEOUSLY: v. Unprofitably, un-<BR>-favourably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disaffect
DISAFFECT: अपरागं<BR>or<BR>विरागं जनयति, (जन्, c. 10.)<BR>(with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disaffected
DISAFFECTED:<BR>(1) विरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(2) अपरक्तः<BR>(क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(3) द्रोहबुद्धि (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disaffection
DISAFFECTION:<BR>(1) विरक्तिः;<BR>(2) विरागः;<BR>(3)<BR>अपरागः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagree
DISAGREE:<BR>I Not to agree, differ: q. v.:<BR>विसंवदति (वद्, c. l.).<BR>II In opinion:<BR>(1)<BR>विप्रतिपद्यते (पद्, c. 4.);<BR>(2) विवदते (वद्, c. 1.)<BR>(=to dispute).<BR>III To be unsuited: न<BR> रोचयति (c. of रुच्) (with acc.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagreeable
DISAGREEABLE:<BR>I Unpleasant, offensive:<BR>q. v.: अनभिमतः (ता, तं).<BR>II Unamiable,<BR>peevish: q. v.: प्रतीपः (पा, पं).<BR>III Con-<BR>-trary, unsuitable: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagreeableness
DISAGREEABLENESS:<BR>(1) अनभिमतता;<BR>(2) प्रतीपता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagreeably
DISAGREEABLY:<BR>(1) अनभिमतम्: v. Unpleasant-<BR>-ly;<BR>(2) प्रतीपम्: v. Peevishly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagreeing
DISAGREEING (adj.): विसंवदिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>विरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=200" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disagreement
DISAGREEMENT:<BR>I Difference: q. v.: विसंवादः।<BR>II In opinion: विप्रतिपत्तिः।<BR>III Dispute:<BR>विवादः; भेदः।<BR>IV Unsuitableness: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disallied
DISALLIED: विश्लेषितः (ता, तं); v. To sepa-<BR>-rate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disallow
DISALLOW: न अनुमन्यते (मन्, c. 4.); v. To<BR>allow, permit, and note.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disannul
DISANNUL:<BR>(1) विलुम्पति (लुप्, c. 6.):<BR>(2)<BR>खण्डयति (खण्ड्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disappear
DISAPPEAR:<BR>(1) अन्तर्धीयते<BR>or<BR>तिरोधीयते (pass. of<BR>धा) (as phantoms),<BR>the Father of the world d.<BR>ed:<BR>विश्वयोनिः तिरोदधे, Ku.;<BR>(2) तिरोभवति (भू,<BR>c. 1.) (= 1) Ki.;<BR>(3) नश्यति, वि-, (नश्, c.<BR>4.) (= to vanish),<BR>d. s although made motion-<BR>less with ties:<BR>सन्दाननिष्पन्दीकृतापि नश्यति, K.;<BR>(4) अदृश्यः (श्या, श्यं) भवति (= to become invi-<BR>-sible).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disappearance
DISAPPEARANCE:<BR>on the d. of the disease:<BR>विनष्टे<BR> च तदामये: v. To disappear, also departure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disappoint
DISAPPOINT: Ph.:<BR>I am d. ed in you:<BR>तय्यहं<BR> भग्नाशः;<BR>d. ed in love:<BR>खण्डितप्रणयः (या, यं);<BR>do<BR>not d. him:<BR>नास्याशां विफलां कुरु;<BR>better to be d. ed<BR>in an application to a great man:<BR>याच्ञा मोघा वर-<BR>मधिगुणे, Me.;<BR>d. ed by Śiva.<BR>शम्भुना विफलीकृतयत्नः,<BR>Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disappointment
DISAPPOINTMENT:<BR>(1) आशाभङ्गः (of hope);<BR>(2)<BR>याच्ञावैफल्यम्, M. n.; and sim. comp. s (in<BR>an application),<BR>the pain of d.:<BR>प्रणयभङ्गवेदना,<BR>Ki.<BR>(3) विप्रलम्भः (= deception: q. v.);<BR>(4)<BR>विषादः (= dejection).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disapprobation
DISAPPROBATION:<BR>(1) विमतिः;<BR>(2) निन्दावादः<BR>(expression of d.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disapproval
DISAPPROVAL:<BR>(1) अननुमोदनम्;<BR>(2) निन्दा: v.<BR>Censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disapprove
DISAPPROVE:<BR>(1) न अनुमोदते (मुद्, c. 1.);<BR>(2)<BR>निन्दति (निन्द्, c. 1.): v. To censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disarm
DISARM:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) निरस्त्रीकरोति;<BR>(2) अस्त्राणि<BR>or<BR>आयुधानि हरति (हृ, c. 1.).<BR>II Fig.: शमयति<BR>(c. of शम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disarrange
DISARRANGE:<BR>(1) आकुलीकरोति;<BR>(2) संक्षोभयति (c.<BR>of क्षुभ्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disarrangement
DISARRANGEMENT: संक्षोभः: V. Confusion,<BR>disorder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disarray
DISARRAY:<BR>I An army: व्यूहं भनक्ति (भञ्ज्, c.<BR>7.).<BR>II To disrobe: q. v.: विवस्त्रयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disaster
DISASTER: विपद् (f.)<BR>or<BR>विपत्तिः: v. Calamity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disastrous
DISASTROUS:<BR>(1) आत्ययिकः (की, कं);<BR>(2) दुरन्तः<BR>(न्ता, न्तं);<BR>(3) दारुणः (णा, णं) (= terrible).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disavow
DISAVOW: न स्वीकरोति: v. To deny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disavowal
DISAVOWAL: अस्वीकारः: v. Denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disband
DISBAND:<BR>I To dismiss: विसर्जयति (सृज्, c.<BR>10.).<BR>II To divorce: त्यजति (त्यज्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbar
DISBAR: *अभिभाषकमण्डलाद् बहिष्करोति (कृ, c. 8.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbark
DISBARK: अवतारयति (c. of तृ): v. To disem-<BR>-bark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbelief
DISBELIEF:<BR>(1) अविश्वासः;<BR>(2) अप्रत्ययः;<BR>(3)<BR>अश्रद्धा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbelieve
DISBELIEVE: न प्रत्येति (इ, c. 2.): v. Not<BR>to believe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbelieving
DISBELIEVING (adj.):<BR>(1) अविश्वासिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) अश्रद्धालु (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disburden
DISBURDEN: भारम् अवतारयति (c. of तॄ): v. To<BR>unburden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disburse
DISBURSE: व्ययते (व्यय्, c. 1.): v. To expend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disbursement
DISBURSEMENT: व्ययः: v. Expenditure, pay-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disc
DISC: v. Disk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discard
DISCARD: अपास्यति (अस, c. 4.): v. To reject,<BR>renounce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discern
DISCERN:<BR>I Mentally: विविनक्ति (विच्, c. 7.),<BR>does not d. what is his good:<BR>स्वहितं न विविनक्ति,<BR>Si.<BR>II With the eyes:<BR>(1) निभालयति (भल्,<BR>c. 10.),<BR>d. ing this ring:<BR>इदमङ्गुलोयकं निभालयन्ती,<BR>Mal.;<BR>(2) निर्वर्णयति (वर्ण्, c. 10.),<BR>d. ing my<BR>limbs:<BR>मदङ्गानि निर्वर्ण्य, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discernible
DISCERNIBLE:<BR>(1) निर्वर्ण्य (f. र्ण्या);<BR>(2) विभाव्य<BR>(f. व्या);<BR>(3) by verb: v. To discern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discerning
DISCERNING (adj.): सूक्ष्मदर्शिन् (f. नी): v.<BR>Sharp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discernment
DISCERNMENT: Judgement, sagacity: q. v.:<BR>विवेकः, (you)<BR>have spoken without d.:<BR>विवेकशून्यम-<BR>भिहितम्, Mal.<BR>II The act: विवेकः (rare),<BR>no d. could be made of any thing:<BR>न कस्यचिद्विवेक<BR> उपलेभे, Ki. ix. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discharge
DISCHARGE (v.):<BR>I Of burdens:<BR>(1) अवतार-<BR>यति (c. of तॄ);<BR>(2) अवरोपयति (c. of रुह्). [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">Page202</a>]<BR>II Of rivers: to enter the sea:<BR>(1) विशति,<BR> प्र-, (विश्, c. 6.);<BR>(2) याति (या, c. 2.) (to<BR>go).<BR>III To utter, give vent to, emit:<BR>q. v.: उद्गिरति (गॄ, c. 6.), Ki.; to d. rage:<BR>क्रूधं विसृजति, Si.<BR>IV To let fly:<BR>(1) मुञ्चति or<BR>मोचयति, निर्-, वि-, प्र-, (मुच्, c. 6. and 10.),<BR>d.<BR>ed a shower of arrows:<BR>शरवर्षं मुमोच, Ram.;<BR>(2) सृजति, वि-, (सृज्, c. 6.),<BR>to d. fire:<BR>अग्निं<BR> विसृजति, Sa.;<BR>(3) अस्यति (अस्, c. 4.).<BR>V To<BR>dismiss: q. v.: (कर्मणः<BR>or<BR>अधिकारात्) अपकर्षति<BR>(कृष्, c. 1.).<BR>VI To pay:<BR>(1) शोधयति, वि-,<BR>to d. a debt:<BR>ऋणं शोधयति, Vri.;<BR>(2) निर्यातयति<BR>(c. of यत्),<BR>for d. ing a debt:<BR>ऋणनिर्यातनाय,<BR>Viv.;<BR>(3) तरति, आ-, उत्-, (तॄ, c. 1.), N. s.<BR>VII To perform: q. v.: निर्वाहयति (c. of<BR>वह्). Ph.:<BR>you also d. your duty:<BR>त्वमपि स्वनियोग-<BR>मशून्यं कुरु, Sa. ii.<BR>VIII Of prisoners: मुञ्चति।<BR>IX Of pus: पूयते (पूय्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=201" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discharge
DISCHARGE (subs.):<BR>I Of a burden:<BR>(1) अव-<BR>तारणम्;<BR>(2) अवरोपणम्।<BR>II A letting fly:<BR>(1)<BR>मोक्षः,<BR>d. of arrows:<BR>बाणमोक्षः, Sa.;<BR>(2) विसर्जनम्;<BR>(3) असनम् (rare).<BR>III Dismissal:<BR>(1) पदभ्रंशः;<BR>(2) अधिकारच्युतिः;<BR>(3) कर्मापकर्षः।<BR>IV Payment:<BR>(1) शोधनम्, वि-,<BR>(2) निर्यातनम्।<BR>V Performance:<BR>q.v.: निर्वाहः।<BR>VI Acquittal: मुक्तिः।<BR>VII<BR>Emission: q. v.: स्रावः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discharger
DISCHARGER: of electric jars: *निःसारणदण्डम्।<BR>Arrow-d. (i. e. bow): इष्वासनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disciple
DISCIPLE:<BR>(1) शिष्य (f. ष्या),<BR>dialogue between a<BR>preceptor and his d.<BR>गुरुशिष्यसंवादः; Mah.;<BR>(2)<BR>अन्तेवासिन् (f. नी) (rare),<BR>of her d.:<BR>तदन्तेवासि-<BR>न्याः, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discipleship
DISCIPLESHIP:<BR>(1) शिष्यत्वम्;<BR>(2) अन्तेवासित्वम्<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disciplinarian
DISCIPLINARIAN:<BR>(1) शासनकर्तृ (m.) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>शासितृ (m.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discipline
DISCIPLINE (subs.): शासनम् (in all the senses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discipline
DISCIPLINE (v.):<BR>I To educate: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>bring under control: दमयति (c. of दम्).<BR>D. d.:<BR>दान्तः (न्ता, न्तं).<BR>III To chastise:<BR>शास्ति (शास्, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disclaim
DISCLAIM: प्रत्यारक्याति (ख्या, c. 2.): v. To<BR>deny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disclaimer
DISCLAIMER: प्रत्याखयानम्: v. Denial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disclose
DISCLOSE:<BR>I To uncover, open: q. v.:<BR>विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.).<BR>II To reveal, expose:<BR>q. v.: विवृणोति,<BR>to d. a secret:<BR>रहस्यं विवृणोति, D.<BR>viii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disclosure
DISCLOSURE:<BR>I Exposure: q. v.: विवृतिः।<BR>II<BR>That which is disclosed:<BR>these d. s.:<BR>एषां<BR> विवृतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discoloration
DISCOLORATION:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) वर्णान्तरजननम्;<BR>(2) विवर्णीकरणम्: v. To discolour.<BR>II Stain:<BR>q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discolour
DISCOLOUR:<BR>I To alter the colour: वर्णान्तरं<BR> जनयति (जन्, c. 10.) (with gen.).<BR>II To<BR>sully: विवर्णीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discomfit
DISCOMFIT: पराजयते (जि, c. 1.): v. Defeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discomfiture
DISCOMFITURE: पराजयः: v. Defeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discomfort
DISCOMFORT (subs.): क्लेशः: v. Distress, pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discomfort
DISCOMFORT (v.): पीडयति (पीड, c. 10.): v.<BR>To pain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discompose
DISCOMPOSE:<BR>I To break up: भनक्ति (भञ्ज्, c.<BR>9.).<BR>II To agitate, disturb: q. v.: आकुली-<BR>करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discomposure
DISCOMPOSURE:<BR>(1) व्याकुलता;<BR>(2) अधीरता: v.<BR>Agitation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconcert
DISCONCERT:<BR>I To frustrate, defeat: q. v.:<BR>खण्डयति (खण्ड्, c. 10.).<BR>II To confuse:<BR>क्षोभयति (c. of क्षुभ्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconnect
DISCONNECT: वियोजयति (युज्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconnection
DISCONNECTION: भेदः: v. Separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconsolate
DISCONSOLATE:<BR>(1) विषण्णः (ण्णा, ण्णं): v. Deject-<BR>-ed;<BR>(2) शोकसन्तप्तमानसः (सा, सं); v. Sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconsolately
DISCONSOLATELY:<BR>(1) सविषादम्;<BR>(2) सखेदम्: v.<BR>Sadly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disconsolateness
DISCONSOLATENESS:<BR>(1) विषण्णता:<BR>(2) निर्वेदः:<BR>(3) वैमनस्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontent
DISCONTENT, DISCONTENTMENT:<BR>(1) असन्तोषः;<BR>(2) असन्तुष्टिः;<BR>(3) असन्तुष्टता;<BR>(4) अनिर्वृतिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontent
DISCONTENT (v.): To dissatisfy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontent
DISCONTENT, DISCONTENTED (adj.):<BR>(1) असन्तुष्टः<BR>(ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) अनिर्वृतः (ता, तं): v. Content.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontentedly
DISCONTENTEDLY: expr. by adj., writes d.:<BR>असन्तुष्टो लिखति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=202" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontinuance
DISCONTINUANCE, DISCONTINUATION:<BR>I Cessa-<BR>-tion: q. v.: विरामः।<BR>II Disruption: विच्छेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontinue
DISCONTINUE (v. i.): विरमति (रम्, c. 1.): v.<BR>To cease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discontinue
DISCONTINUE (v. t.):<BR>I To stop, leave off:<BR>q.v.: समापयति (c. of आप).<BR>II To disunite:<BR>वियोजयति (युज्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discord
DISCORD:<BR>I In music:<BR>(1) विस्वरः;<BR>(2)<BR>अपरवः;<BR>II Dispute: q.v.: विवादः।<BR>III In<BR>gen. sense: v. D. -ance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discordance
DISCORDANCE:<BR>(1) वैषम्यम;<BR>(2) अनैक्यम्;<BR>(3) विरोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discordant
DISCORDANT:<BR>I Incongruous:<BR>(1) विषमः (मा,<BR> मं);<BR>(2) विरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR>II Dissonant:<BR>(1)<BR>प्रतिकूलः (ला, लं) (= disagreeable), even the<BR>cuckoo (would appear to)<BR>have a. d. voice:<BR>अप्य-<BR>न्यपुष्टा प्रतिकूलशब्दा, Ku.<BR>(2) कर्णकठोरः (रा, रं)<BR>(jarring), M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discount
DISCOUNT (v.):<BR>I To deduct a percentage:<BR>Ph.:<BR>to d. five per cent:<BR>*पञ्चकं शतं त्यजति (त्यज्,<BR>c. 1.).<BR>II To pay a bill, deducting the<BR>percentage: Ph.:<BR>d. this bill:<BR>*त्यागं गृहीत्वा<BR> हुण्डिमूल्यं देहि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discount
DISCOUNT (subs.): *त्यागः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discounter
DISCOUNTER: कुसीदः (= usurer: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discountenance
DISCOUNTENANCE:<BR>I To abash: q.v.: लज्जयति<BR>(लस्ज्, c. 10.).<BR>II To disapprove, oppose:<BR>q. v.: न अनुमोदते (मुद्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourage
DISCOURAGE:<BR>I To deject: q. v.: उत्साहभङ्गं<BR> करोति,<BR>d. d:<BR>भग्नोत्साहः (हा, हं). To be d. d:<BR>(1) सत्त्वात् परिभ्रश्यते (pass. of भ्रश्);<BR>(2) तेजसः<BR> प्र-भ्रश्यते, Mr.<BR>II To deter: q. v.: निषेधति<BR>(सिध्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discouragement
DISCOURAGEMENT:<BR>I Dejection: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>उत्साहभङ्गः;<BR>(2) सत्त्वभ्रंशः, Vi.<BR>II Hindrance,<BR>obstacle: q. v.: विघ्नः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discouraging
DISCOURAGING (adj.):<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2)<BR>उत्साहक्षयिन्। (f. णी);<BR>(3) प्रतिकूलः (ला, लं)<BR>(= unfavourable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discouragingly
DISCOURAGINGLY: expr. by adj., speaking d.:<BR>प्रतिकूलवादिन्, Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourse
DISCOURSE (subs.):<BR>I Speech, conversation:<BR>q.v.:<BR>(1) वचस् (n.);<BR>(2) भारती।<BR>II Tran-<BR>-saction: q.v.: व्यवहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourse
DISCOURSE (v.): वक्ति (वच्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>speak, converse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourteous
DISCOURTEOUS:<BR>(1) अविनीतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>अदक्षिण (f. णा): v. Courteous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourteously
DISCOURTEOUSLY:<BR>(1) अविनीतम्;<BR>(2) अदक्षिणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discourteousness
DISCOURTEOUSNESS, DISCOURTESY:<BR>(1) अविनयः;<BR>(2) अदाक्षिण्यम्: v. Courtesy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discover
DISCOVER:<BR>I To reveal, shew: q. v.: प्रकाशयति<BR>(nomi.).<BR>II To find out: prob. प्रकाशयति;<BR> आविष्करोति (used in Bengali), d. ed America:<BR>*आमेरिकामाविश्चकार।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discoverer
DISCOVERER:<BR>(1) प्रकाशकः;<BR>(2) आविष्कर्तृ (m.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discovery
DISCOVERY:<BR>I Revelation: q.v.: प्रकाशनम्<BR>II<BR>Finding out:<BR>(1) प्रकाशनम् (?)<BR>(2) आविष्कारः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discredit
DISCREDIT (subs.):<BR>I Disbelief: अविश्वासः।<BR>II<BR>Disgrace, infamy: q.v.:<BR>(1) अयशस् (n.);<BR>(2) कलङ्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discredit
DISCREDIT (v.):<BR>I To disbelieve: न प्रत्येति<BR>(इ, c. 2.).<BR>II To disgrace: q.v. कलङ्कयति<BR>(nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discreditable
DISCREDITABLE:<BR>(1) अयशस्करः (री, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>कीर्तिनाशिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) कलङ्कावहः (हा, हं);<BR>(4) गर्हितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discreet
DISCREET:<BR>(1) समीक्ष्य-<BR>or<BR>विमृश्यकारिन् (f. णी)<BR>(= circumspect);<BR>(2) परिणामदर्शिन् (f. नी)<BR>(= seeing the end);<BR>(3) विज्ञः (ज्ञा, ज्ञं)<BR>(= wise: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discreetly
DISCREETLY: समीक्ष्य: v. Prudently, wisely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discreetness
DISCREETNESS: v. Discretion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discrepancy
DISCREPANCY:<BR>(1) भेदः: v. Difference;<BR>(2)<BR>विरोधः: v. Contradiction.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discrepant
DISCREPANT: भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं): v. Different.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discretion
DISCRETION:<BR>I Discreetness:<BR>(1) समीक्ष्य-<BR>कारिता;<BR>(2) विवेकः; विज्ञता: v. Wisdom.<BR>II<BR>Entire control: Ph.:<BR>you have no d. in the<BR>matter:<BR>न ते इच्छाधीनमेतत्;<BR>act according to your<BR>d.:<BR>*यत् शोभनं मन्यसे तदेव कुरु;<BR>you have entire d.<BR>to do what becomes you in this case:<BR>यदत्रात्मनः<BR> समुचितं तत्र प्रभवति (भू, c. 1.) भवती, K.; at d.<BR>(i. e. without condition) विना समयेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discretionary
DISCRETIONARY: expr. by adv.: विवेकानुसारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discriminate
DISCRIMINATE: विविनक्ति (विच्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>Distinguish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=203" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discriminating
DISCRIMINATING, DISCRIMINATIVE (adj.):<BR>I<BR>Distinguishing: भेदक (f. दिका).<BR>II Capable<BR>of discrimination:<BR>(1) विशेषज्ञः (ज्ञा, ज्ञं);<BR>(2)<BR>गुणोदोषविद् (mfn.). Ph.:<BR>d. faculty:<BR>विवेकशक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discrimination
DISCRIMINATION: विवेकः: v. Discernment, dis-<BR>-cretion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discrown
DISCROWN (v.): मुकुटं हरति (हृ, c. 1.): v.<BR>Crown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discursive
DISCURSIVE:<BR>I Rambling: नानाविषयकः (का,<BR> कं), and sim. comp. s.<BR>II Rational: तार्किकः<BR>(की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discus
DISCUS:<BR>I A quoit: चक्रम्।<BR>II A disk: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discuss
DISCUSS (v.):<BR>I To disperse: q.v.<BR>II De-<BR>-bate: विचारयति (c. of चर्) (to consider<BR>thoroughly), (we will)<BR>d. whether different or<BR>not:<BR>भिद्यन्ते न वेति विचार्यते, S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discussion
DISCUSSION: विचारः, d. of the sense of passages:<BR>वाक्यार्थविचारणा, S.: Ph.:<BR>now we will follow<BR>the subject under d.:<BR>सम्प्रति प्रकृतमेवानुवर्तामहे, S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

discussive
DISCUSSIVE, DISCUTIENT: रसघ्नः (घ्नी, घ्नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disdain
DISDAIN (v.): अवजानाति (ज्ञा, c. 9.): v. To<BR>despise. Ph.:<BR>who d. ed people as straws:<BR>तृण-<BR>मिव परिभूतो यस्य गर्वेण लोकः, Ve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disdain
DISDAIN (subs.):<BR>(1) अवज्ञाः v. Contempt;<BR>(2)<BR>घृणाः v. Scorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disdainful
DISDAINFUL: expr. by adv.,<BR>his disdainful<BR>speech:<BR>स यदवज्ञयोवाच: v. Haughty, arrogant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disdainfully
DISDAINFULLY:<BR>(1) अवज्ञया;<BR>(2) अनादरेण;<BR>(3)<BR>सावलेपम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disdainfulness
DISDAINFULNESS: अवलेपः (= haughtiness: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disease
DISEASE (subs.):<BR>(1) रोगः (best equiv.),<BR>cured<BR>of mental d.:<BR>चिकित्सितमनोरोगः (गा, गं), Vi.<BR>vii.;<BR>(2) व्याधिः,<BR>oppressed^1 with d. s:<BR>व्याधिभिः<BR> परिपीडितान्, Bha.;<BR>(3) गदः, did not get over the d.:<BR>गदं नात्यगात्, R.;<BR>(4) आमयः, infectious d.:<BR>आमयः स्पर्शसञ्चारी, Raj.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diseased
DISEASED:<BR>(1) रोगग्रस्त (f. स्ता), a d. branch:<BR>रोगग्रस्ता शाखा, S. c.;<BR>(2) रोगोपसृष्ट (f. ष्टा),<BR>d.<BR>body:<BR>रोगोपसृष्टतनुः, R. viii. 94;<BR>(3) व्याधितः<BR>(ता, तं): v. Sick, ill. Ph.:<BR>he is d. both in<BR>body and mind:<BR>*तस्य शरीरमनसी रोगाक्रान्ते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disedge
DISEDGE:<BR>(1) कुण्ठयति (nomi.):<BR>(2) कुण्ठीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembark
DISEMBARK (v. i.):<BR>(1) अवतरति, अव-, (तॄ, c. 1.),<BR>we d. ed on a rock:<BR>शीलावलयमवतराम, D.;<BR>(2)<BR>अवरोहति (रुह्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembark
DISEMBARK (v. t.): अवतारयति (c. of तृ);<BR>(2)<BR>अवरोह (प) यति (c. of रुह्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembarkation
DISEMBARKATION:<BR>(1) अवतरणम्;<BR>(2) अवरोहणम्<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembarrass
DISEMBARRASS: मोचयति (मुच्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>free, extricate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembarrassment
DISEMBARRASSMENT: मोक्षः: v. Release.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembitter
DISEMBITTER: तिक्ततां नाशयति (c. of नश्)<BR>or<BR>हरति<BR>(हृ, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembodied
DISEMBODIED:<BR>I Disbanded: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Freed from the body: वीतशरीरः (रा, रं):<BR>v. Free from.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembogue
DISEMBOGUE: of rivers: v. To discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembowel
DISEMBOWEL: अन्त्राणि अपनयति (नी, c. 1.): v.<BR>To eviscerate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disembroil
DISEMBROIL: v. To disentangle, extricate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disenchant
DISENCHANT: Ph.:<BR>d. this place:<BR>*अत्रस्थां मायां<BR> नाशय<BR>or<BR>निर्धूनय, etc.:<BR>I will d. you:<BR>*तव मोहं<BR> दूरीकरोमि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disencumber
DISENCUMBER:<BR>I Lit.: भारं हरति (हृ, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>अपनयति (नी, c. 1.).<BR>II Fig.: to free:<BR>मोचयति (मुच्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disengage
DISENGAGE:<BR>I To detach: विश्लेषयति (c. of श्लिष्).<BR>II To release, free: मोचयति (मुच, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disengaged
DISENGAGED: i. e. at leisure: न व्यापृतः (ता,<BR> तं); कार्यविरतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disengagement
DISENGAGEMENT:<BR>I Release: q. v.: मुक्तिः।<BR>II Separation: q.v.: विश्लेषणम्।<BR>III<BR>Leisure: q.v.: विश्रामः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disennoble
DISENNOBLE: अवनमयति (c. of नम्): v. To<BR>degrade.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disentangle
DISENTANGLE:<BR>I Lit.: विभ्क(ज)टति (भ्कट्<BR>or<BR>जट्, c.<BR>1.) (??).<BR>II To extricate, free q. v.: मोचयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disentitle
DISENTITLE: अधिकारं नाशयति (c. of नश्)<BR>or<BR>लुम्पति<BR>(लुप्, c. 6.) (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disentrance
DISENTRANCE:<BR>the king was d.:<BR>नृपतेस्तमो नुनुदे,<BR>R.: v. Trance; to remove.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disesteem
DISESTEEM (v.): अवजानाति (ज्ञा, c. 9.): v. To<BR>slight, disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disesteem
DISESTEEM (subs.): अवज्ञा: v. Contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfavour
DISFAVOUR (subs.): निग्रहः<BR>or<BR>अवग्रहः (rare), [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">Page205</a>]<BR>the disposer of favours and d. s:<BR>अनुग्रहावग्रहयो-<BR>र्विधाता, Si.: v. Favour and not. Ph.:<BR>finding himself suddenly in royal d.:<BR>अकस्मादेव<BR> प्रसादपराङ्मुखमवनिपतिमवलोक्य, P. i. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=204" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfiguration
DISFIGURATION: v. Disfigurement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfigure
DISFIGURE (v.):<BR>(1) विरूपीकरोति<BR>or<BR>विरूपयति<BR>(nomi.),<BR>to d. a face:<BR>मुखं विरूपयति, D.;<BR>(2)<BR>विकरोति (rare),<BR>seeing himself d. d:<BR>आत्मानं<BR> विकृतं दृष्ट्वा, Mah.;<BR>(3) विकलीकरोति (by depri-<BR>-ving limbs),<BR>by whom my husband has been<BR>d. d:<BR>येन मे पतिर्विकलीकृतः, D.;<BR>(4) व्यङ्गयति<BR>(nomi.) (= 3),<BR>who can d. me:<BR>को मां व्यङ्गयितुं<BR> समर्थः, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfigurement
DISFIGUREMENT:<BR>I The state: वैरूप्यम्।<BR>II<BR>The act: expr. by verb. Ph.: d. of limbs:<BR>वैरूप्यमङ्गेषु, Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfranchise
DISFRANCHISE: *पौरत्वं लुम्पति (लुप्, c. 6.) or<BR>हरति (हृ, c. 1.),<BR>d. d:<BR>*हृतपौरत्वः (त्वा, त्वं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disfranchisement
DISFRANCHISEMENT: *पौरत्वहरणम्<BR>or<BR>-लोपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgorge
DISGORGE:<BR>(1) उद्गिरति, (गॄ, c. 6.);<BR>(2) उद्वमति<BR>(वम्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgrace
DISGRACE (subs.):<BR>I Disfavour: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Dishonour, ignominy:<BR>(1) अप(व)मानम्,<BR>whose notions of honour and d. have been erased<BR>by decrepitude:<BR>जरावलुप्तमानावमानचित्तः, D.;<BR>(2)<BR>अव-मानना, वि-, (the act), Ku.;<BR>(3) अभिभवः<BR>or<BR>पराभवः (rarely अभिभूतिः<BR>or<BR>पराभूतिः)<BR>(= humiliation),<BR>from fear of d.:<BR>अभिभूति-<BR>भयात्, Ki.;<BR>(4) निकृतिः<BR>or<BR>न्यक्कारः (= insult),<BR>the d. of being removed from the first seat:<BR>अग्रासनापनयजा निकृतिः, Mu.<BR>III That which<BR>brings disgrace. Ph.:<BR>there is nobody without<BR>some d.:<BR>नास्त्यकलङ्कः कोऽपि, Va.;<BR>the d. to the<BR>Paulastya race:<BR>पौलस्त्यकुलपांसनः, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgrace
DISGRACE (v.):<BR>I To dishonour:<BR>(1) अपमानयति,<BR> अव-, वि-, (c. of मन्);<BR>(2) परि-भवति, परा-,<BR> अभि-, (भू, c. 1.), Vi.<BR>II To revile: q. v.<BR>गर्हयति, वि-, (गर्ह्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgraceful
DISGRACEFUL:<BR>(1) गर्हितः, वि-, (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>अयशस्करः (री, रं) (= infamous):<BR>(3) ह्नेपण<BR>(f. णी) (= shameful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgracefully
DISGRACEFULLY:<BR>(1) मानमुन्मथ्य;<BR>(2) expr.<BR>by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgracefulness
DISGRACEFULNESS:<BR>(1) गर्हितता, etc.;<BR>(2)<BR>better by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgracious
DISGRACIOUS:<BR>(1) प्रसादहीनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2)<BR>प्रसादपराङ्भु खः (खा, खं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disguise
DISGUISE (subs.): छद्मन् (n.),<BR>Takshaka coming<BR>in d.:<BR>छद्मनोपेत्य तक्षकः, Mah.;<BR>flow of ambrosia<BR>under the d. of sweat:<BR>स्वेदच्छद्मामृतद्रवः, Ra. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disguise
DISGUISE (v. t.):<BR>I Lit.: Ph.: d. d as foresters:<BR>आटविकच्छद्मना, D.; we two d. d as Kāpālikas<BR>(beggars) आवां कापालिकवेषाच्छन्नौ, D. viii.<BR>II<BR>To conceal: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disguisedly
DISGUISEDLY:<BR>(1) छद्मना;<BR>(2) छद्मवेशेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgust
DISGUST (subs.):<BR>(1) जुगुप्सा;<BR>(2) घृणा, (my)<BR>d. being excited:<BR>समुत्पन्नघृणः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgust
DISGUST (v.): expr. by adj., घृणां जनयति (c. of<BR>जन्), उत्पादयति (c. of पद्), etc.<BR>D. ed i. e.<BR>offended:<BR>विरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disgustful
DISGUSTFUL, DISGUSTING (adj.):<BR>(1) बीभत्स (f.<BR>त्सा),<BR>with d. dresses:<BR>बिभत्सविन्यासैः, K.;<BR>(2)<BR>उद्वेगकरः (री, रं) (= alarming),<BR>d. even to the<BR>residents of the hell:<BR>नरकवासिनामप्युद्वेगकरम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dish
DISH (subs.):<BR>I A vessel: q. v.:<BR>(1) शरावः;<BR>(2) पात्रम्।<BR>II A made-d.:<BR>how many d. s have<BR>you got:<BR>*कियद्विधानि ते भोज्यानि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dish
DISH (v.): पात्रे<BR>or<BR>शरावे निवेशयति (c. of विश्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishabille
DISHABILLE: v. Deshabille, undress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishabit
DISHABIT (v.): निर्वासयति (c. of वस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dish-cloth
DISH-CLOTH, DISH-CLOUT: सम्मार्जनपटः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dish-cover
DISH-COVER: पिधानम् (?): v. Lid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishearten
DISHEARTEN: v. D. ed and to make; to<BR>deject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disheartened
DISHEARTENED:<BR>(1) मग्नमनस् (mfn.):<BR>(2) भग्न-<BR>मानसः (सा, सं), and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishevelled
DISHEVELLED: Ph.:<BR>with d. hair:<BR>प्रकीर्णकेशः<BR>(शी, शं), Mah.; विकीर्णमूर्द्धजः (जा, जं), Ku.<BR>असंयताकुलालकः (का, कं), K. ; and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonest
DISHONEST: अशुचि (mfn.): v. Honest and<BR>not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonestly
DISHONESTLY:<BR>(1) अन्यायेन;<BR>(2) वञ्चयित्वा<BR>(= deceiving),<BR>theft is taking other's property<BR>d.:<BR>वञ्चयित्वा परधनापहरणं स्तेयम्, Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonesty
DISHONESTY:<BR>(1) अशुचिता<BR>or<BR>अशौचम्: v. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">Page206</a>]<BR>Honesty;<BR>(2) जिह्मता (= crookedness);<BR>(3)<BR>छलम् (= fraud).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=205" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonour
DISHONOUR (subs.): अव(प)मानम्: v. Disgrace,<BR>ignominy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonour
DISHONOUR (v. t.):<BR>I To disgrace: q.v.:<BR>अपमानयति (c. of मन्).<BR>II To defile; q.v.:<BR>in d. ing respectable women:<BR>कुलवधूनां शीलपातने,<BR>D.<BR>III. Not to accept: प्रत्यारव्याति (रव्या, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonourable
DISHONOURABLE:<BR>I Of acts: अपयश- or<BR>अयशस्करः (री, रं): v. Disgraceful.<BR>II Of<BR>men: मानहीनः (ना, नं), P. i. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonourably
DISHONOURABLY: मानं प्रभृज्य: v. Disgrace-<BR>-fully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dishonourer
DISHONOURER:<BR>I In gen. sense: अपमानकर्तृ<BR>(m.).<BR>II A debaucher: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinclination
DISINCLINATION:<BR>(1) अनिच्छा;<BR>(2) विरक्ति:<BR>v. Aversion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disincline
DISINCLINE: निवर्तयति (c. of वृत्): v. To<BR>alienate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinclined
DISINCLINED: अनिच्छु (mfn.): v. Unwilling,<BR>averse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinfect
DISINFECT:<BR>(1) शोधयति (c. of शुध्) (= to<BR>purify);<BR>(2) अपनुदति (नुद्, c. 6.) (= to dis-<BR>-pel).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinfection
DISINFECTION:<BR>(1) शोधनम्: v. Purification;<BR>(2) निःसारणम्: v. Removal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disingenuous
DISINGENUOUS: अनृजु (mfn.): v. Insincere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disingenuously
DISINGENUOUSLY: अनृजुतया: v. Insincerely,<BR>crookedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disingenuousness
DISINGENUOUSNESS: अनृजुता: v. Insincerity,<BR>crookedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinherit
DISINHERIT:<BR>(1) भागानीशं (f. शां) करोति (?);<BR>(2) भागाधिकारं लुम्पति (लुप्, c. 6.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disintegration
DISINTEGRATION:<BR>(1) संहतिभेदः;<BR>(2) विश्लेषः<BR>(= disunion).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinter
DISINTER: उत्खनति (खन्, c. 6.) (= to dig up).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinterested
DISINTERESTED:<BR>(1) निःसङ्ग (f. ङ्गा), H.;<BR>(2)<BR>अपक्षपातिन् (f. नी) (= impartial);<BR>(2) निरीहः<BR>(हा, हं) (= indifferent).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinterestedly
DISINTERESTEDLY:<BR>(1) expr. by adj.;<BR>(2)<BR>विपक्षपातम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disinterestdness
DISINTERESTDNESS:<BR>(1) निःसङ्गता;<BR>(2) अपक्ष-<BR>पातिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjoin
DISJOIN: वियोजयति (c. of युज्): v. To separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjoint
DISJOINT:<BR>I To dislocate: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>break into pieces: q. v. D. ed: i. e. un-<BR>-connected: असम्बद्धः (द्धा, द्धं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjointly
DISJOINTLY: v. Separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjunction
DISJUNCTION: विश्लेषः: v. Disunion, separa-<BR>-tion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjunctive
DISJUNCTIVE: Ph.:<BR>d. conjunction:<BR>*विकल्पसूचक-<BR>मव्ययम्;<BR>d. proposition:<BR>विकल्पः, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disjunctively
DISJUNCTIVELY: v. Disjunctive, separately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disk
DISK:<BR>(1) बिम्ब (mn.) (the best equiv.);<BR>(2)<BR>परिधिः;<BR>(3) परिवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dislike
DISLIKE (subs.): विरागः: v. Aversion, hatred.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dislike
DISLIKE (v.): द्वेष्टि, वि-, (द्विष्, c. 2.) (= to hate),<BR>d. s what is pleasing:<BR>रम्यं द्वेष्टि, Sa.: v. To<BR>like and not; Ph.: and will d. and leave her<BR>विरक्तश्चैनां त्यक्ष्यति, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dislocate
DISLOCATE:<BR>I To disjoint: सन्धेः चालयति<BR>(c. of चल्); विसन्धीकरोति। D. d:<BR>(1) सन्धिमुक्तः<BR>(क्ता, क्तं), Sr.;<BR>(2) सन्धिविश्लिष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं),<BR>Bha.<BR>II To displace: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dislocation
DISLOCATION:<BR>I The act: विसन्धीकरणम्।<BR>II<BR>The state:<BR>(1) सन्धिमुक्तिः;<BR>(2) सन्धिविश्लेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dislodge
DISLODGE: निर्वासयति (c. of वस): v. To drive<BR>out.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disloyal
DISLOYAL: भक्तिहीनः (ना, नं), Mu: v. Un-<BR>-faithful, treacherous. Ph.: d. to a king:<BR>राजविरुद्धः (द्धा, द्धं), Mu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disloyally
DISLOYALLY: अभत्तया: v. Treacherously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disloyalty
DISLOYALTY: भक्तिहीनता: v. Unfaithfulness,<BR>treachery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismal
DISMAL:<BR>(1) अप्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं) (= cheerless);<BR>(2) दारुण (f. णा) (= dreadful);<BR>(3) सशोकः<BR>(का, कं) (= sorrowful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismally
DISMALLY:<BR>(1) दारुणम् (= horribly);<BR>(2) सशोकम्<BR>(= sorrowfully).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismalness
DISMALNESS:<BR>(1) दारुणता;<BR>(2) अप्रसादः: v.<BR>Horror, gloom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismantle
DISMANTLE:<BR>I Lit.: to disrobe: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Fig.: prob. नग्नीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismast
DISMAST (v.): कूपकं<BR>or<BR>गुणवृक्षं हरति, अप-, (हृ, c.<BR>1.) (with gen.).<BR>D. ed:<BR>हृत-<BR>or<BR>वीत -कूपकः<BR>(का, कं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=206" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismay
DISMAY (subs.):<BR>I Terror: q. v.: साध्वसम्।<BR>II Ruin: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismay
DISMAY: (v.): सन्त्रासयति (c. of त्रस्): v. To<BR>terrify.<BR>D. ed:<BR>सन्त्रस्तः (स्ता, स्तं); साध्वसपरीतः<BR>(ता, तं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismember
DISMEMBER: विघटयति (घट्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>sever; also to mutilate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismemberment
DISMEMBERMENT: विघटनम्: v. Separation,<BR>mutilation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismiss
DISMISS:<BR>I To let go: विसर्जयति (सृज्, c. 10.),<BR>d. ing the princes:<BR>विसर्जितराजलोकः, K.<BR>II. From<BR>an office: expr. by<BR>(1) भ्रंशयति, परि-, प्र-, (c. of<BR>भ्रंश्);<BR>(2) च्यावयति, परि-, प्र-, (c. of च्यु);<BR>(3)<BR>अवरोपयति (c. of रुह्);<BR>(4) अपकर्षति (कृष्, c. 1.);<BR>(5) आक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.) etc.:<BR>favour is<BR>replacing of Bhadrabhaṭa and Purusha Dutta who<BR>have been already d. ed:<BR>अनुग्रहस्तावदाक्षिप्ताधिकारयो-<BR>र्भद्रभटपुरुषदत्तयोः पुनरधिकारारोपणमेव, Mu.;<BR>whether<BR>you do not d. from their employments without<BR>first finding some fault:<BR>कच्चित्॥॥॥नापकर्षसि<BR> कर्मभ्यः पूर्वमप्राप्य किल्विषम्, Mah.;<BR>d. ing from<BR>their places:<BR>स्वाधिकाराम्यामवरोप्य, Mu.;<BR>with-<BR>out being d. ed:<BR>अभ्रष्टपदः, D.<BR>III To reject:<BR>प्रत्याख्याति (ख्या, c. 2.). To decree and d.:<BR>जयपराजयौ विदधाति, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismissal
DISMISSAL., DISMISSION:<BR>I Leave to depart:<BR>विसर्जनम्।<BR>II From employment: अधिकार-<BR>च्युतिः, Nil, and sim. comp. s etc.: v. To<BR>dismiss (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismount
DISMOUNT (v. t.):<BR>(1) अवरोहति;<BR>(2) अवतरति:<BR>v. To get down.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dismount
DISMOUNT (v. i.): पातयति (c. of पत्),<BR>d. s and<BR>kicks:<BR>पातयति पादेन ताडयति, Mr. vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobedience
DISOBEDIENCE:<BR>(1) आज्ञाभङ्गः, do not brook d.:<BR>नाज्ञाभङ्गं सहन्ते, Mu.<BR>(2) आदेशलङ्घनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>शासनव्यतिक्रमः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobedient
DISOBEDIENT:<BR>(1) आज्ञाभङ्गकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>निर्देशलङ्घिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) प्रतीपः (पा, पं) (= re-<BR>-fractory), H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobey
DISOBEY: आज्ञां न प्रतिपालयति (पाल्, c. 10.), or<BR>मनक्ति (भञ्ज्, c. 7.) (= break),<BR>or<BR>लङ्घयति<BR>(= transgress: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disoblige
DISOBLIGE: v. To oblige and not; to offend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobliging
DISOBLIGING: प्रतीपः (पा, पं): v. Uncivil,<BR>disagreeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobligingly
DISOBLIGINGLY:<BR>(1) प्रतीपम्;<BR>(2) अदाक्षिण्येन;<BR>(3) सविनयापराधम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disobliginess
DISOBLIGINESS:<BR>(1) प्रतीपता;<BR>(2) अदाक्षिण्यम्;<BR>(3) विनयापराधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disorder
DISORDER (subs.):<BR>I Confusion:<BR>threw the<BR>encampment in d.:<BR>सेनानिवेशं तुमुलं चकार, R. v.<BR>49.;<BR>the entire Zenana was thrown^1 in d.:<BR>सकल-<BR>मेवान्तःपुरमाकुलीबभूव, D.<BR>II Tumult: q. v.:<BR>तुमुलम्।<BR>III Disease: q. v.: पीडा।<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disorder
DISORDER (v.):<BR>I To confuse, discompose:<BR>आकुलीकरोति।<BR>II To derange: दोषान् जनयति<BR>(c. of जन्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disorderly
DISORDERLY:<BR>I In confusion: v. Disorder<BR>(I).<BR>II Not in proper order:<BR>(1) विशृङ्खलः<BR>(ला, लं);<BR>(2) विपर्यस्तः (स्ता, स्तं).<BR>III Tur-<BR>-bulent, unruly: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disorganisation
DISORGANISATION:<BR>I The act: उच्छेदः: v.<BR>Destruction.<BR>II The state: उच्छृङ्खलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disorganise
DISORGANISE:<BR>I To destroy, break up:<BR>उच्छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.).<BR>II To disorder:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disown
DISOWN: प्रत्याख्याति, (ख्या, c. 2.): v. To dent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparage
DISPARAGE: अधिक्षिपति, आ-, (क्षिप्, c. 6.): v.<BR>To detract, censure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparagement
DISPARAGEMENT:<BR>I Detraction, disgrace:<BR>q. v.: अधिक्षेपः।<BR>II Insult: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparager
DISPARAGER: अधिक्षेपकः: v. Detractor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparaging
DISPARAGING: (adj.): expr. by comp.,<BR>d.<BR>remarks:<BR>आक्षेपवचः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparagingly
DISPARAGINGLY: expr. by circumlo: v.<BR>Detractingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disparity
DISPARITY:<BR>(1) वैषम्यम्: v. Inequality:<BR>(2)<BR>भेदः: v. Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispassioned
DISPASSIONED, DISPASSIONATE:<BR>(1) वीतरागः (गा,<BR> गं);<BR>(2) वीतस्पृहः (हा, हं);<BR>(3) शान्तः (न्ता,<BR> न्तं): v. Calm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispassionately
DISPASSIONATELY: प्रशान्तम्: v. Calmly, impar-<BR>-tially.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispatch
DISPATCH: v. Despatch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispel
DISPEL:<BR>(1) नुदति, अप-, अपा-, व्यपा-, (नुद्, c. 6.),<BR>d. ed his doubt:<BR>तस्य वितर्कं नुनोद, Ki. iv. 5.; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">Page208</a>]<BR>(2) निर्-अस्यति, अप-, उत्-, (अस, c. 4.) (= to<BR>throw off),<BR>darkness has been d. ed:<BR>तमो<BR> निरस्तम्, R. v. 71.;<BR>(3) निर्-धूनोति, अव-, (धू,<BR>c. 5.) (= to shake off),<BR>d. ing your ignorance<BR>arising from inadvertence:<BR>निर्धय तमः प्रमादजम्,<BR>Ki. ii. 22.: v. To remove, drive away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=207" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispensary
DISPENSARY: औषधशाला (?); औषधालयः (?); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispensation
DISPENSATION:<BR>I Distribution: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Divine d.: नियमः: v. Order.<BR>III Legal:<BR>आदेशः: v. Also exemption.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispensator
DISPENSATOR, DISPENSER: v. Distributor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispensatory
DISPENSATORY: Ph.:<BR>d. power:<BR>*मुक्तिदा क्षमता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispense
DISPENSE (v.):<BR>I To distribute: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To d. with: Ph.: I cannot d. with a cap:<BR>*शिरस्त्रं विना स्थातुं न शक्नोमि;<BR>he can d. with<BR>your presence:<BR>*तवानुपस्थितिमनुमन्तुं शक्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disperse
DISPERSE (v. t.): किरति, वि-, (कॄ, c. 6.),<BR>d. ed up,<BR>sidewise, and down:<BR>ऊर्द्धन्तिरश्चीनमधश्च कीर्णैः,<BR>Ki.: v. To scatter, diffuse, dispel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disperse
DISPERSE (v. i.):<BR>(1) वि-सरति, प्र-, विप्र-, (सृ, c.<BR>1.): v. To spread;<BR>(2) नश्यति (नश्, c. 4.)<BR>(= to vanish). Ph.:<BR>d. ed to their several<BR>homes:<BR>स्वं स्वं गृहं जग्मुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispersedly
DISPERSEDLY:<BR>(1) सर्वतः (= on all sides);<BR>(2)<BR>इतस्ततः (= here and there)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispersion
DISPERSION:<BR>(1) विकिरणम् (= spreading);<BR>(2)<BR>विसर्पणम् (= diffusion);<BR>(3) better by verb.:<BR>“the jews in their d.”:<BR>बहुधागता इहुदयः (= after<BR>Ki.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispirit
DISPIRIT: सत्त्वं<BR>or<BR>तेजो भ्रंशयति (c. of भ्रंश्): v.<BR>To discourage, disheartened.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

displace
DISPLACE:<BR>I To put out of place: विपर्यस्यति<BR>(अस्, c. 4.).<BR>II To remove: q. v.<BR>III To<BR>discharge: पदात् आक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.), भ्रंशयति,<BR>(c. of भ्रंश्) etc.,<BR>who d.d Nahusha from the<BR>post of Indra:<BR>पदान्मघोनः प्रभ्रंशयां यो नहुषं चकार, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

displacement
DISPLACEMENT:<BR>I Lit.: विपर्यासः।<BR>II<BR>Removal, discharge: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

display
DISPLAY (v. t.):<BR>(1) दर्शयति (c. of दृश्): v. To<BR>exhibit;<BR>(2) प्रथयति (c. of प्रथ्): v. Known,<BR>to make. To d. itself: v. To reveal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

display
DISPLAY (subs.): विकाशः: v. Show. Ph.:<BR>d. s of poetic genius:<BR>कवित्वशक्तेर्विलासाः, N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

displease
DISPLEASE:<BR>(1) असन्तोषं जनयति (c. of जन्);<BR>(2)<BR>better by adj. असन्तुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं): v. Also<BR>to enrage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

displeasing
DISPLEASING (adj.): असन्तोषकरः (री, रं): v.<BR>Unpleasant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

displeasure
DISPLEASURE: असन्तोषः: v. Anger, dislike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disport
DISPORT:<BR>I Subs: v. Play.<BR>II Verb: v.<BR>To amuse, play.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disposable
DISPOSABLE:<BR>(1) प्रदेयः (या, यं) (what can be<BR>given);<BR>(2) विनियोज्य (f. ज्या)<BR>or<BR>योक्तव्य (f.<BR>व्या) (what can be employed).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disposal
DISPOSAL:<BR>I Arrangement: q. v.:<BR>(1)<BR>विन्यासः;<BR>(2) विरचना।<BR>II Regulation,<BR>management: q. v.: निर्वाहः।<BR>III Bestowal:<BR>q. v.<BR>IV Power, control, pleasure: q. v.:<BR>Ph.:<BR>since I saw you, I am at your d.:<BR>दर्शनात्<BR> प्रभृति परवानयं जनः, K.;<BR>this is at your d.:<BR>अत्र<BR> प्रभवति (भू, c. 1.) भवती।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispose
DISPOSE:<BR>I To arrange: q. v.: विन्यस्यति<BR>(अस्, c. 4.).<BR>II To employ, apply: q. v.:<BR>विनियोजयति (युज्, c. 10.).<BR>III To incline,<BR>impel: प्रचोदयति, (चुद्, c. 10.).<BR>D. d: i. e.<BR>bent:<BR>-प्रवण (f. णा)<BR>or<BR>-शीलः (ला, लं) in comp.<BR>Ph.:<BR>I am not d. d to follow you:<BR>तवानुवृत्तिं न<BR> च कर्तुमुत्सहे (सह्, c. 1.), Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispose of
DISPOSE OF:<BR>I To direct, employ: q. v.:<BR>निर्दिशति (दिश्, c. 6.).<BR>II To get rid of:<BR>(1)<BR>ददाति (दा, c. 3.): v. To give;<BR>(2) विक्रीणीते<BR>(क्री, c. 9.): v. To sell.<BR>III To finish: q. v.:<BR>समापयति (c. of आप्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disposer
DISPOSER:<BR>(1) विधातृ (m.);<BR>(2) नियन्तृ<BR>(m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disposition
DISPOSITION:<BR>I Disposal, arrangement:<BR>q. v.<BR>II Character: q. v.: स्वभावः।<BR>III<BR>Tendency, inclination: q. v.: प्रवणता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispossess
DISPOSSESS: निष्कासयति (c. of कस्),<BR>“d. the<BR>swain”:<BR>*भूमेर्ग्रामिकं निष्कासय: v. To drive<BR>away, deprive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispossession
DISPOSSESSION: निष्कासनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disproof
DISPROOF: निराकरणम्; v. Refutation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disproportion
DISPROPORTION:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) expr. by<BR>circumlo.;<BR>(2) वैषम्यम्।<BR>II Unsuitableness:<BR>अयोग्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=208" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disproportionate
DISPROPORTIONATE, DISPROPORTIONED: न<BR> तुलाधृतः (ता, तं), Vi.: v. Unequal, inade-<BR>-equate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disproportionately
DISPROPORTIONATELY:<BR>(1) विषमम्: v. Un-<BR>-qually:<BR>(2) असङ्गतम्: v. Unsuitably:<BR>(3)<BR>better by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disprove
DISPROVE: निराकरोति (कृ, c. 8.): v. To refute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputable
DISPUTABLE:<BR>(1) विवदनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>विवदितव्य (f. व्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputant
DISPUTANT:<BR>(1) विवदमानः (ना, नं);<BR>(2)<BR>विवादिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputation
DISPUTATION: विवादः: v. Dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputatious
DISPUTATIOUS:<BR>(1) विवादप्रियः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>विवादशीलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputatiously
DISPUTATIOUSLY: v. Obstinately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispute
DISPUTE (subs.):<BR>(1) विवादः,<BR>I do not like even<BR>their d.:<BR>एतेषां विवाद एव न मे रोचते, Mal. i.;<BR>if<BR>a d. arises about boundaries:<BR>सीमां प्रति समुत्पन्ने<BR> विवादे, M.;<BR>(2) कलहः (= altercation);<BR>(3)<BR>विचारः (= discussion);<BR>(4) वादः (= contro-<BR>-versy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dispute
DISPUTE (v.):<BR>I To debate, altercate:<BR>(1)<BR>विवदते (वद्, c. 1.),<BR>by the cries of people d. ing<BR>amongst themselves:<BR>अन्योन्यं विवदमानानां प्रजाना-<BR>माक्रोशैः, D. viii.;<BR>(2) कलहायते (nomi.) (= to<BR>quarrel), d. ing with a sage named Mandu:<BR>मन्दुनाम्ना मुनिना सह कलहायमानः, C. Ph.:<BR>a d. d<BR>point:<BR>विवादपदम्, M.<BR>II To deny: q. v.: विवदते,<BR>it is not to be d. d here:<BR>नैवात्र विवदितव्यम्, S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputeless
DISPUTELESS: निर्विवादः (दा, दं): v. Undisputed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disputer
DISPUTER:<BR>I A denier: q. v.: विवदितृ (m.).<BR>II One fond of disputes: विवादप्रियः, and<BR>sim comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disqualification
DISQUALIFICATION:<BR>I Disability: प्रत्यूहः<BR>(= obstacle).<BR>II Defect: निर्गुणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disqualify
DISQUALIFY: expr. by अक्षमः (मा, मं) (= in-<BR>-capable)<BR>or<BR>अयोग्यः (ग्या, ग्यं) (= unworthy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disquiet
DISQUIET (subs.): व्याकुलता: v. Anxiety, un-<BR>-easiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disquiet
DISQUIET (v.): आकुलयति (nomi.): v. To<BR>disturb, agitate. D.: v. Restless, uneasy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disquietness
DISQUIETNESS, DISQUIETUDE: v. Disquiet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disquisition
DISQUISITION: विचारः: v. Discussion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disregard
DISREGARD (subs.):<BR>(1) अनादरः;<BR>(2) उपेक्षा:<BR>v. Neglect, contempt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disregard
DISREGARD (v.):<BR>(1) उपेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.),<BR>a rising<BR>enemy should not be d. ed:<BR>उत्तिष्ठमानः परो नोपेक्ष्यः,<BR>Si.;<BR>(2) अवधीरयति (धीर्, c. 10.),<BR>this is the<BR>fruit of d. ing the advice of a friend:<BR>अवधीरित-<BR>सुहृद्वाक्यस्य फलमेतत्;<BR>(3) न आद्रियते (दृ, c. 6.)<BR>v. To care and not; despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disregardful
DISREGARDFUL: v. Regardless, negligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrelish
DISRELISH (subs.):<BR>(1) अरुचिः;<BR>(2) अनभिरुचिः।<BR>Ph.:<BR>arises d. for food:<BR>नान्ने रुचिर्भवति, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrelish
DISRELISH (v.): न अभिनन्दति (नन्द्, c. 1.), K.:<BR>v. To relish; not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disreputable
DISREPUTABLE: अपयशस्करः (री, रं): v. In-<BR>-famous, scandalous.<BR>A d. person:<BR>अभिशस्तः,<BR>Y.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrepute
DISREPUTE: अवज्ञा: v. Disgrace, infamy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrespect
DISRESPECT (subs.): असम्मानम्: v. Disregard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrespect
DISRESPECT (v.):<BR>(1) न सम्मानयति (c. of मन्);<BR>(2) उपेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrespectful
DISRESPECTFUL: सम्मानरहितः (ता, तं): v.<BR>Insolent, uncivil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrespectfully
DISRESPECTFULLY:<BR>(1) वीतसम्मानम्, etc.;<BR>(2)<BR>उपेक्षया (= disregardfully);<BR>(3) अनादरेण (= dis-<BR>-dainfully).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disrobe
DISROBE:<BR>(1) विवस्त्रयति (nomi.);<BR>(2) विवस्त्री-<BR>करोति;<BR>(3) by circumlo.,<BR>every body has been<BR>d. d except one — Bhīṣma:<BR>एकं शान्तनवं हित्वा सर्वे<BR> विवसनाः कृताः, Dh.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disruption
DISRUPTION:<BR>I Lit.: स्फुटनम्: v. To burst.<BR>II Fig.: भेदः। v. Rupture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissatisfaction
DISSATISFACTION:<BR>(1) असन्तोषः;<BR>(2) विरक्तिः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissatisfy
DISSATISFY: expr. by past part. D. ed:<BR>(1)<BR>असन्तुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) विरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissect
DISSECT:<BR>I Medically: व्यवच्छिनत्ति (छिद्, c.<BR>7.).<BR>II To examine minutely: खण्डशः<BR> समालोचयति (लोच्, c. 10.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissection
DISSECTION:<BR>I Lit.: व्यवच्छेदः।<BR>II Fig.:<BR>खण्डशः समालोचना (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissector
DISSECTOR: व्यवच्छेदकारिन् (m.) (?); व्यवच्छेदकः<BR>(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissemble
DISSEMBLE: निह्नुते, अप-, (ह्नु, c. 2.), Mu.: v.<BR>To conceal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=209" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissembler
DISSEMBLER:<BR>(1) नि-ह्नोत्रृ, अप-, (m.);<BR>(2)<BR>छाह्मिकः (= hypocrite).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissemblingly
DISSEMBLINGLY: नि-ह्नु त्य, अप-: v. Falsely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disseminate
DISSEMINATE:<BR>I To disperse: प्रकिरति (कॄ, c.<BR>6.),<BR>seeds d. d on the ground:<BR>बीजानि प्रकीर्णानि<BR> महीतले, Vri.<BR>II To spread: प्रसर्पति (सृप्, c.<BR>1.),<BR>the rumour d. d in every direction:<BR>प्रतिदिशं<BR> लोकवादः प्रासर्पत्, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissemination
DISSEMINATION:<BR>(1) प्रकिरणम्;<BR>(2) प्रसर्पणम्:<BR>v. Above.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disseminator
DISSEMINATOR: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissention
DISSENTION:<BR>I Disagreement: भेदः।<BR>II<BR>Quarrel: q. v.: कलहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissent
DISSENT (subs.):<BR>(1) वैमत्यम्;<BR>(2) असम्मतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissent
DISSENT (v.): वैमत्यं<BR>or<BR>असम्मतिं प्रकाशयति (c. of<BR>काश्). Ph.:<BR>without a d. ing voice:<BR>विना<BR> कस्यापि वैमत्येन<BR>or<BR>सर्वेषामेवैकमत्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissenter
DISSENTER: *विमतिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissentient
DISSENTIENT: Ph.:<BR>without a d. voice:<BR>*विना<BR> कस्यापि वैमत्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissertation
DISSERTATION:<BR>(1) प्रबन्धः;<BR>(2) निबन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disserve
DISSERVE: अपकरोति (कृ, c. 8.): v. To injure,<BR>disoblige.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disservice
DISSERVICE: अपकारः: v. Injury, disadvan-<BR>-tage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissever
DISSEVER: v. To sever.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissimilar
DISSIMILAR:<BR>I Unlike: q. v.: असदृशः (शी,<BR> शं).<BR>II Different: q. v.: भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissimilarity
DISSIMILARITY:<BR>(1) असादृश्यम् (= unlikeness):<BR>q. v.;<BR>(2) विभिन्नता (= difference: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissimulation
DISSIMULATION: छलम्: v. Hypocrisy^1, deceit.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by Scott Rhodes on 20260516. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/224.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissipate
DISSIPATE:<BR>I To disperse: q. v.: विकिरति<BR>(कॄ, c. 6.).<BR>II To squander, consume:<BR>अवक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissipated
DISSIPATED (adj.): i. e. dissolute:<BR>(1) खण्डित-<BR>वृत्तः (त्ता, त्तं);<BR>(2) नष्टचरित्रः (त्रा, त्रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissipation
DISSIPATION:<BR>I Dispersion: विक्षेपः।<BR>II Gay,<BR>vicious life: अनुकामीनता (?), B.; लाम्पट्यम्<BR>(= debauchery).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissociate
DISSOCIATE: विश्लेषयति (c. of श्लिष्): v. To<BR>separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissociation
DISSOCIATION: विश्लेषः: v. Separation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissoluble
DISSOLUBLE: द्राव्यः (व्या, व्यं): v. Soluble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissolute
DISSOLUTE:<BR>(1) उच्छृङ्खलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) उद्दामः<BR>(मा, मं),<BR>d. youths:<BR>उद्दामानि यौवनानि, Me.:<BR>v. Lewd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissoluteness
DISSOLUTENESS:<BR>(1) उच्छृङ्खलता;<BR>(2) लाम्पट्यम्<BR>(= lewdness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissolution
DISSOLUTION:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) विद्रावणम्;<BR>(2)<BR>विलयनम्;<BR>(3) विगलनम।<BR>II The state:<BR>(1)<BR>लयः, वि-, प्र-,;<BR>(2) गलनम्, वि-,;<BR>(3) द्रुतिः,<BR> वि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissolve
DISSOLVE (v. i.):<BR>(1) द्रवति, वि-, (द्रु, c. 1.),<BR>d.<BR>quick:<BR>द्रव द्रुतम्, N.;<BR>(2) गलति, वि-, (गल्, c.<BR>1.),<BR>difference and identity have d. d:<BR>भेदाभेदौ<BR> गलितौ, J.;<BR>(3) लीयते, वि-, प्र-, (ली, c. 4.),<BR>the<BR>star of the living world d. s:<BR>जीवलोकतिलकः<BR> प्रलीयते, Ma.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissolve
DISSOLVE (v. t.): द्रावयति, वि-, (c. of द्रु): v. To<BR>melt.<BR>To d. a parliament:<BR>महासभां द्रावयति (?):<BR>v. Also to break up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissonance
DISSONANCE, DISSONANCY: v. Discord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissonant
DISSONANT:<BR>I Discordant: विस्वरः (रा, रं).<BR>II Discrepant: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissuade
DISSUADE (v.): वारयति, नि-, (वृ, c. 10.),<BR>I gener-<BR>ously d. you:<BR>कारुण्यात्त्वां वारयामि, Mah.: v.<BR>To prevent; to advise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissuader
DISSUADER:<BR>(1) निवारकः;<BR>(2) निवर्तयितृ (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissuasion
DISSUASION:<BR>(1) निवारणम्;<BR>(2) निवर्तनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissuasively
DISSUASIVELY:<BR>(1) निवार्य;<BR>(2) निवर्त्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissyllabic
DISSYLLABIC: द्व्यक्षरः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dissyllable
DISSYLLABLE:<BR>(1) द्व्यक्षरम्;<BR>(2) द्व्यक्षरः शब्दः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distaff
DISTAFF:<BR>(1) तर्कुः;<BR>(2) तर्कुटी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distance
DISTANCE (subs.):<BR>I Space:<BR>(1) भूमिः<BR>(= space: q. v.), (I) have come such a d.:<BR>एतावतीं भूमिमायातः, K.;<BR>(2) अध्वन् (= way:<BR>q. v.), by what d. am I separated from my forces:<BR>कियताध्वना विच्छिन्नमितो बलं मे, K.<BR>II Remote-<BR>-ness:<BR>(1) दूरम्,<BR>from a d.:<BR>दूरात्, P.; (my)<BR>darling (is)<BR>at a d.:<BR>दूरे दयिता, Mu.;<BR>what is<BR>d. to the active:<BR>किं दूरं व्यवसायिनाम्, H. :<BR>(2) अन्तरम् (= interval),<BR>trees at a d. of<BR>three leagues:<BR>त्रिगव्यूत्यन्तरद्रुमाः, B. p.;<BR>(3)<BR>विप्रकर्षः,<BR>d. of time:<BR>कालविप्रकर्षः, Vi.<BR>III<BR>In association: अविश्रम्भता, K.: v. Also<BR>respect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=210" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distance
DISTANCE (v.):<BR>(1) दूरीकरोति, वि-,<BR>garden plants<BR>have been d. d by wild plants:<BR>दूरीकृता उद्यानलता<BR> वनलताभिः, Sa.;<BR>(2) दवयति (nomi.). (rare),<BR>d. ing the places reached:<BR>दवयत्प्राप्तमूर्वीविभागम्, B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distant
DISTANT:<BR>I Of objects: दूरस्थ (f. स्था). Ph.:<BR>the temple is not d. far:<BR>नातिदूरे सिद्धायतनम्।<BR>II<BR>Of relations, etc.:<BR>(1) दूरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>विप्रकृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं) (rare).<BR>III Not cordial:<BR>अविश्रम्भः (म्भा, म्भं).<BR>IV Discrepant, repug-<BR>-nant: विभिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distantly
DISTANTLY:<BR>I Remotely: दूर- in comp.<BR>II<BR>Not cordially: अविश्रम्भम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distaste
DISTASTE: अरुचिः: v. Disrelish, dislike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distasteful
DISTASTEFUL:<BR>I Of the palate:<BR>(1) अरुचि<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(2) अरुच्यः (च्या, च्यं). Ph.:<BR>is d. to<BR>the satiated:<BR>तृप्ताय न स्वदते, N.<BR>II Offensive,<BR>unpleasant: q. v.:<BR>(1) अरुचिरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) अरुच्यः (च्या, च्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distastefulness
DISTASTEFULNESS:<BR>(1) अरुचिता;<BR>(2) अरुचिरता;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distemper
DISTEMPER:<BR>I Disease: q. v.: पीडा।<BR>II<BR>Tumult: q. v.<BR>III Uneasiness: व्याकुलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distempered
DISTEMPERED:<BR>I Diseased: पीडितः (ता, तं).<BR>II Disturbed: व्याकुलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distend
DISTEND: आ-धमति (ध्मा, c. 1.): v. To inflate,<BR>swell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distension
DISTENS(T)ION: आध्मानम्: v. Inflation, extent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distich
DISTICH:<BR>(1) श्लोकः (= verse);<BR>(2) युग्मकम् (= a<BR>couple of verses).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distill
DISTILL (v. i.):<BR>I To drop: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>flow: q. v.<BR>III To use a still: *मद्यनिष्कर्षं<BR> करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distill
DISTILL (v. t.):<BR>I To let fall: पातयति (c. of<BR>पत्).<BR>II To extract: निष्कर्षति (कृष्, c. 1.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distillation
DISTILLATION: *मद्यनिष्कर्षः: v. To distill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distiller
DISTILLER: *मद्यनिष्कर्षकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distillery
DISTILLERY: *मद्यनिष्कर्षशाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinct
DISTINCT:<BR>I Different, separate: q. v.<BR>(1)<BR>विभिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(2) विविक्तः (क्ता, क्तं) (in<BR>philo), S.<BR>II Clear: स्पष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं): v.<BR>Clear (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinction
DISTINCTION:<BR>I Difference: q. v.: विशेषः,<BR>what d. have I between you and him:<BR>कः खलु मे<BR> त्वयि त्स्मिंश्च विशेषः, K.;<BR>to find d.:<BR>विशेषम्<BR> अवाप्नोति, N.;<BR>ignorance of d. s:<BR>अविशेषज्ञता, K.;<BR>without d.:<BR>निर्विशेषेण: v. Promiscuously.<BR>II<BR>Discrimination: विवेकः।<BR>III Division:<BR>q. v.: विभागः।<BR>IV Eminence:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठा;<BR>(2)<BR>गौरवम्;<BR>(3) ख्यातिः (= renown).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinctive
DISTINCTIVE:<BR>(1) विशेषकः (f. षिका);<BR>(2) भेदक<BR>(f. दिका);<BR>(3) विशेषः (षा, षं) (= peculiar).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinctively
DISTINCTIVELY: सविशेषम्<BR>or<BR>विशेषेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinctly
DISTINCTLY:<BR>I Separately: q.v.<BR>II Clearly:<BR>q. v.: सविशेषम्<BR>or<BR>विशेषेण,<BR>d. appears to me:<BR>सविशेषं<BR> मे प्रतिभाति, Ku. v. 35.<BR>III In distinct words:<BR>भिन्नार्थम्, Sa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinctness
DISTINCTNESS:<BR>I Difference:<BR>(1) भिन्नता;<BR>(2) पार्थक्यम्।<BR>II Clearness: q. v.: स्पष्टता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinguish
DISTINGUISH:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) विविनक्ति (विच्,<BR>c. 7.) (mentally),<BR>who can sufficiently d. what<BR>is good and what is not good:<BR>यः शुभमिदं न शुभ-<BR>मिदमिति विवेक्तुमलम्, K.;<BR>(2) विशिनष्टि (शिष्, c.<BR>7.) (= to particularize), d. es the sage in<BR>seven (verses): सप्तभिर्मुनिं विशिनष्टि, M. n.;<BR>(3)<BR>परिच्छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.) (= to mark out),<BR>the<BR>reverend lady should d. us as to our merits:<BR>भगवती नौ गुणदोषतः परिच्छेत्तुमर्हति, Mah.;<BR>(4)<BR>पृथक्करोति (= to separate: q. v.);<BR>(5) विभजति<BR>(भज्, c. 1.) (= to divide: q. v.).<BR>II To d.<BR>oneself: प्रतिष्ठां<BR>or<BR>उत्कर्षं<BR>or<BR>खयातिं लभते (लभ्,<BR>c. 1.),<BR>who d. ed himself in winning the affec-<BR>tion of his people:<BR>प्रजारञ्जनलब्धवर्णः, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinguishing
DISTINGUISHING (part. adj.): भेदक (f. दिका),<BR>d. property:<BR>भेदको गुणः, Si. ii.: v. Distinctive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distinguished
DISTINGUISHED: i. e. famous: q. v.:<BR>(1) लब्ध-<BR>प्रतिष्ठः (ष्ठा, ष्ठं);<BR>(2) विश्रुतः (ता, तं);<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distort
DISTORT:<BR>I To disfigure: q. v.: विरूपयति<BR>(रूप्, c. 10.).<BR>II To twist: q. v. व्याकुञ्चयति।<BR>III To pervert: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distortion
DISTORTION:<BR>I Crookedness, deformity:<BR>q. v.<BR>II Perversion: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distract
DISTRACT:<BR>I To draw away: q. v.: अपकर्षति<BR>(कृष, c. 1.).<BR>II To confuse: आकुलीकरोति<BR>(कृ, c. 8.);<BR>(2) मोहयति, वि-, (c. of मुह).<BR>III<BR>To make mad:<BR>d. ed mind:<BR>प्रविक्षिप्तं चेतः,<BR>Ma.: v. Mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=211" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distractedly
DISTRACTEDLY:<BR>(1) क्षिप्तवत्;<BR>(2) क्षिप्तचेतस्<BR>(mfn.): v. Madly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distractedness
DISTRACTEDNESS: क्षिप्तता: v. Madness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distraction
DISTRACTION:<BR>I Drawing away: अपकर्षः,<BR> -णम्।<BR>II Diversion: q. v.<BR>III Agitation,<BR>perplexity: q. v.: क्षोभः।<BR>IV Disorder:<BR>q.v. V. Madness: q. v.: क्षिप्तता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distrain
DISTRAIN: *सम्पीड्य गृह्नाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distraint
DISTRAINT: *सम्पीडनग्रहणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distraught
DISTRAUGHT: v. Distract.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distress
DISTRESS (subs.):<BR>I Misery, affliction:<BR>(1)<BR>दुःखम्, seeing no end of (my)<BR>d.:<BR>दुःखस्यान्तमपश्यन्ती,<BR>Mat.;<BR>(2) कष्टम्;<BR>(3) शोकः (= sorrow);<BR>(4) क्लेशः (= pain).<BR>II Calamity: q. v.:<BR>आपद् (f.).<BR>III A state of danger: कृच्छ्रम्।<BR>IV Distraining: *सम्पीडनग्रहणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distress
DISTRESS (v.):<BR>I To afflict:<BR>(1) व्यथयति (c.<BR>of व्यथ्);<BR>(2) पीडयति (पीड्, c. 10.);<BR>(3)<BR>दुःखाकरोति। D. ed:<BR>(1) दुःखितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>व्यथितः (ता, तं).<BR>II To distrain: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distressful
DISTRESSFUL: v. Distressing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distressing
DISTRESSING (adj.):<BR>(1) कष्टकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2)<BR>व्यथकः (का, कं);<BR>(3) दुःखबहुलः (ला, लं);<BR>(4) by subs,<BR>what can be more d.:<BR>ततो<BR> दुःखतरं नु किम्, G.;<BR>what else will be more d. to<BR>narrate:<BR>किं वापरमतः कष्टतरमाख्येयमन्यद्भविष्यति,<BR>K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distressingly
DISTRESSINGLY: v. Piteously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distribute
DISTRIBUTE:<BR>(1) वि-मजति (मज्, c. 1.) (= to<BR>divide: q. v.);<BR>(2) वितरति (तॄ, c. 1.) (= to<BR>give: q. v.);<BR>(3) विन्यस्यति (अस्, c. 4.) (= to<BR>arrange as of d. ing types);<BR>(4) परिकल्पयति<BR>(कॢप्, c. 1.) (= to assign).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distribution
DISTRIBUTION:<BR>(1) विभागः (= division);<BR>(2)<BR>विसर्गः (= giving),<BR>taking is for d.:<BR>आदानं हि<BR> विसर्गाय, R.;<BR>(3) विन्यासः (= arrangement).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distributive
DISTRIBUTIVE: Ph.:<BR>D. justice:<BR>*विभागकारिधर्मः;<BR>d. adjective:<BR>*विभागव्यञ्जकं विशेषणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distributively
DISTRIBUTIVELY:<BR>(1) विभागशः;<BR>(2) सविभागेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distributer
DISTRIBUTER:<BR>(1) विभागकर्तृ (m.);<BR>(2) दातृ<BR>(= giver: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

district
DISTRICT:<BR>(1) प्रदेशः (?);<BR>(2) मण्डलम् (?): v.<BR>Country, region.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distrust
DISTRUST (subs.):<BR>(1) अविश्वासः;<BR>(2) अप्रत्ययः<BR>v. Suspicion, doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distrust
DISTRUST (v.):<BR>(1) न विश्वसिति, etc.: v. To<BR>believe;<BR>(2) शङ्कते (शङ्क्, c. 1.): v. To sus-<BR>-pect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distrustful
DISTRUSTFUL:<BR>I Suspicious: q. v.: अविश्वासिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>II D. of: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

distrustfully
DISTRUSTFULLY:<BR>(1) अविश्वासेन;<BR>(2) साशङ्कम्<BR>(= apprehensively^1), and d. followed by Rati:<BR>रत्या च साशङ्कमनुप्रयातः, Ku.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disturb
DISTURB:<BR>I To derange:<BR>(1) विप्रकरोति (कृ,<BR>c. 8.);<BR>(2) आकुलीकरोति (to confuse).<BR>II<BR>To agitate: q. v.: आकुलीकरोति।<BR>III To<BR>interrupt: q. v.: प्रतिबध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 7.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disturbance
DISTURBANCE:<BR>I Commotion, disorder:<BR>q. v.: संक्षोभः।<BR>II Agitation: q. v.: संक्षोभः।<BR>III In law, perh. भङ्गः।<BR>IV The act:<BR>expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disturber
DISTURBER:<BR>(1) संक्षोमकः (= agitator);<BR>(2)<BR>विप्रकर्तृ (m.) (= deranger);<BR>(3) भञ्जकः<BR>(= interrupter).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disunion
DISUNION:<BR>I Separation: q. v.: वियोगः।<BR>II<BR>Disagreement: q. v.: भेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disunite
DISUNITE: वियोजयति (युज्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>separate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disuse
DISUSE (subs.):<BR>(1) अव्यवहारः: v. Use;<BR>(2)<BR>विरामः: v. Cessation.<BR>To fall into d.:<BR>विलुम्पति<BR>(लुप्, c. 6.), V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disuse
DISUSE (v.): v. To use and not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

disused
DISUSED: Ph.:<BR>d. to toil:<BR>अज्ञातपरिश्रमः (मा, मं);<BR>d. from pain:<BR>विरतवेदनः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ditch
DITCH (subs.):<BR>(1) परिखा (= moat),<BR>the d. es<BR>were filled up with spikes:<BR>परिखाः कीलैः सुनिचिताः<BR> कृताः, Mah.;<BR>(2) खातम् (= trench),<BR>near the<BR>d.:<BR>उपखातम्, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ditch
DITCH (v. t.):<BR>I To surround with a moat:<BR>परिखया वेष्टयति (c. of वेष्ट्).<BR>II To dig a d.:<BR>खातं करोति (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ditcher
DITCHER:<BR>(1) परिखाखनकः;<BR>(2) खातकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dittany
DITTANY: शाकभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ditto
DITTO:<BR>I Adj. or subs.: तथा।<BR>II Verb.:<BR>तथास्तु वदति (वद्, c. 1.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ditty
DITTY: गीतम्: v. Song.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=212" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diuretic
DIURETIC: मूत्रलः (ला, लं), Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diurnal
DIURNAL: आह्निकः (की, कं): v. Daily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divan
DIVAN:<BR>I A council: q. v.: सभा।<BR>II A<BR>c. -chamber: इन्द्रकम्।<BR>III A sofa: *दिव्या-<BR>सनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dive
DIVE (v.):<BR>I To plunge: वि-गाहते, व्यव-, (गाह्,<BR>c. 1.), they d. d into the Sarayū (for it), (but)<BR>were unsuccessful:<BR>बन्ध्यश्रमास्ते सरयूं विगाह्य, R.<BR>II Fig.: v. Bottom, absorb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diver
DIVER:<BR>I One who dives: विगाहकः।<BR>A river<BR>d.:<BR>नदीष्णः, R.<BR>II A bird:<BR>(1) जलकाकः;<BR>(2) मद्गुः;<BR>(3) प्लवः (applied also to other<BR>aquatic birds).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diverge
DIVERGE:<BR>I As opposed to converge:<BR>विसर्पति (सृप्, c. 1.) (?).<BR>II To deviate: q. v.<BR>III To differ: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divergence
DIVERGENCE: v. Deviation, difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divergent
DIVERGENT: विसर्पिन् (f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divers
DIVERS:<BR>(1) अनेकः (का, कं);<BR>(2) नाना-,<BR>d.<BR>coloured:<BR>नानावर्णः (र्णा, र्णं)<BR>or<BR>नानारागविरागः (गा,<BR> गं), Mah.: v. Several.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diverse
DIVERSE:<BR>I Different: q. v.: भिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं)<BR>II Various: q. v.:<BR>(1) नानाविधः (धा, धं);<BR>(2) पृथग्विधः (धा, धं), Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diversification
DIVERSIFICATION: भेदः (= difference: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diversify
DIVERSIFY:<BR>I To variegate: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>distinguish: q.v. विशिनष्टि: (शिष्, c. 7.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diversion
DIVERSION:<BR>I The act of turning aside:<BR>अपवाहनम्।<BR>II Amusement, sport: q. v.:<BR>विनोदः, -नम्,<BR>your friend without any d.:<BR>निविनोदां<BR> सखीं ते, Me.;<BR>wishing for d. by a war:<BR>रणेन<BR> विनोदमिच्छन्, Si.<BR>III Mil. t.t: expr. by<BR>verb: v. To divert (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diversity
DIVERSITY:<BR>I Dissimilitude: भिन्नता।<BR>II<BR>Variety: नानाविधत्वम्; better by adj.<BR>III<BR>Distinctness: पृथक्त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divert
DIVERT:<BR>I To turn aside: अपवाहयति (c. of<BR>वह).<BR>II To amuse: q. v.: विनोदयति (c. of<BR>नुद्).<BR>III Mil. t.t.: expr. by circumlo.:<BR>d. ing the enemy by appearing in front:<BR>पुरस्तु<BR> दर्शनं दत्त्वा तल्लक्ष्यकृतनिश्चयात्, Ka. xviii. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diverting
DIVERTING (adj.): विनोदिन् (f. नी); विनोदकरः<BR>(री, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divertingly
DIVERTINGLY: expr. by part., विनोदयन्<BR>(f. न्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divest
DIVEST (v.):<BR>I To strip: हरति (हृ, c. 1.),<BR>and soon d. ed him of his armour:<BR>जहार चास्माद-<BR>चिरेण वर्म, Ki.<BR>To d. of clothes:<BR>विवस्त्रयति<BR>(nomi.)<BR>or<BR>विवस्त्रीकरोति।<BR>II To deprive:<BR>q. v.: हरति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divide
DIVIDE (v. t.):<BR>I To apportion:<BR>(1) भजति<BR>(commonly) वि-, प्रवि-, सं-, (भज्, c. 1.),<BR>after the demise of the father, the sons should d.<BR>his property:<BR>पितर्यूर्द्धं गते पुत्रा विभजेयुर्धनं पितुः, N.<BR>s.;<BR>d. d among the two wives:<BR>पत्न्योर्विभेजे, R.<BR>x. 54.;<BR>(2) वण्टयति (वण्ट्, c. 10.),<BR>the rest<BR>should be d. d:<BR>शेषं वण्टनीयम्, Viv.<BR>II In<BR>arith:<BR>(1) भजति, वि-, d. ing (we)<BR>get the quo-<BR>tient:<BR>भजनाल्लब्धो गुण्यः, Li.;<BR>(2) हरति (हृ, c. 1.)<BR>d. d by the remainder:<BR>शेषैर्हृतः (ता, तं), Li.<BR>III To sever, separate, cut into pieces:<BR>q. v.: विभजति,<BR>as the Meru was not d. d and<BR>made over to the beggars:<BR>विभज्य मेरुर्न यदर्थिसात्कृतः,<BR>N.<BR>To d. into two:<BR>द्विधाकरोति;<BR>into three<BR>parts:<BR>त्रिधाकरोति, Ve.<BR>IV In opinion or<BR>interest: Ph.: (they are)<BR>neither combined nor<BR>d. d:<BR>न संहता न भिन्नवृत्तयः, Ki. i. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divide
DIVIDE (v. i.):<BR>(1) विभक्तः (क्ता, क्तं) भवति;<BR>(2)<BR>विभज्यते (pass.) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dividend
DIVIDEND:<BR>I In arith: भाज्यः, Li.<BR>II A share<BR>made by division: अंशः (= share); लामः<BR>(= profit).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divider
DIVIDER: भाजकः, विभाजकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divination
DIVINATION: v. Prophecy; augury; divine<BR>(v.) (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divine
DIVINE (adj.):<BR>(1) दिव्यः (व्या, व्यं) (best<BR>equiv.),<BR>d. hide:<BR>दिव्यमजिनम्, S. p.;<BR>d. bed:<BR>शयनं<BR> दिव्यम्, Mah.;<BR>(2) दैवः (वी, वं), d. language:<BR>दैवी वाक, U.;<BR>(3) by comp,<BR>d. intellect:<BR>देवधीः,<BR>B.;<BR>(4) अमानुषः (षी, षं) (= not human);<BR>अपार्थिवः (वी, वं) (not earthly), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divine
DIVINE (subs.): वेदविद् (mfn.): v. Theologian.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divine
DIVINE (v.):<BR>I To foresee: q. v.: पश्यति (दृश्,<BR>c. 1.) (= to see)<BR>or<BR>जानाति (ज्ञा, c. 7.) (= to<BR>know) (the context determining the exact<BR>sense).<BR>II To guess: ऊहते (उहू, c. 1.). [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">Page214</a>]<BR>III To practise divination: अनागतं<BR>or<BR>भवि-<BR>ष्यन्तं वक्ति (वच्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>वदति (वद्, c. 1.):<BR>v. Also augury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=213" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divinely
DIVINELY:<BR>I Lit.: देववत्: v. Extremely.<BR>II<BR>Providentially: ईश्वरेच्छया, नियत्या।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divineness
DIVINENESS: v. Divinity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

diviner
DIVINER:<BR>(1) दैवज्ञः (= astrologer);<BR>(2) निमित्तज्ञः<BR>(augur).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divining-bell
DIVINING-BELL: *विगाहयन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divinity
DIVINITY:<BR>I Divine nature:<BR>(1) दिव्यता,<BR>I<BR>have no doubt as to her d.:<BR>नहि मे संशीतिरस्या<BR> दिव्यतां प्रति, K.;<BR>(2) देवत्वम्, -ता,<BR>even a stone<BR>acquires d:<BR>अश्मापि याति देवत्वम्, H. ;<BR>(3) देवतानु-<BR>भावः, D.<BR>II A god: q. v. देवता।<BR>III<BR>Theology: वेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divisibility
DIVISIBILITY: भाज्यता, -त्वं, वि-, प्रति-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divisible
DIVISIBLE: भाज्यः (ज्या, ज्यं), वि-, प्रवि-, Viv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

division
DIVISION:<BR>I Partition: विभागः (rarely भागः<BR>or<BR>प्रवि-),<BR>d. of paternal property:<BR>विभागोऽर्थस्य<BR> पित्र्यस्य, Da.;<BR>one who knows d. s of countries<BR>and times:<BR>देशकालविभागवित्, Ka.<BR>II A section:<BR>विभागः,<BR>by the d. s of the army:<BR>अनीकानां विभागेन,<BR>Mah.<BR>III In arith:<BR>(1) भजनम्, Vij.:<BR>(2)<BR>हरणम्, Li.;<BR>(3) भागहारः,<BR>d. of fractions:<BR>भिन्न-<BR>भागहारः, Li.<BR>IV Discord, Disunion: q. v.<BR>v. Distinction: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divisor
DIVISOR:<BR>(1) भाजकः, Li.;<BR>(2) हरः, Vij.:<BR>(3)<BR>हारः Li.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divorce
DIVORCE (subs.): *विवाहलोपः; वैधविच्छेदः; त्यागः<BR>(= desertion).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divorce
DIVORCE (v.):<BR>I Lit.: *विवाहलोपं करोति;<BR> त्यजति, परि-, (त्यज्, c. 1.) (= to desert),<BR>d.<BR>ing an innocent wife:<BR>निर्दोषां पत्नीं परित्यजन्, V. s.<BR>II Fig.: निर्वासयति (c. of वस्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divorcement
DIVORCEMENT:<BR>“bill of d.”<BR>*विवाहलोपपत्रम्: v.<BR>Divorce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divulge
DIVULGE:<BR>I To reveal: q. v.: विवृणोति,<BR>to d.<BR>a secret:<BR>गुह्यं विवृणोति, D.<BR>II To impart:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

divulger
DIVULGER: भेत्तृ (m.) (= betrayer); better by<BR>verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dizziness
DIZZINESS: v. Giddiness, vertigo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dizzy
DIZZY:<BR>I Giddy: q. v.<BR>II Heedless: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do
DO (v. t.):<BR>I To effect:<BR>(1) करोति, कुरुते (कृ,<BR>c. 8.) (the best equiv.),<BR>command us what<BR>shall we d.:<BR>शाधि नः करवाम किम्, Ku. vi. 24.;<BR>what is to be done to Sthāvaraka:<BR>स्थावरकस्य किं<BR> क्रियताम्, Mr. x.; not knowing what to d.:<BR>किंकर्तव्यविमूढः (ढा, ढं), K.; to d. penance:<BR>तपांसि करोति, Ki.;<BR>(2) वि-दधाति<BR>or<BR>धत्ते (धा, c.<BR>3.),<BR>what is to be done with this wealth:<BR>किं<BR> विधेयमनयार्थसम्पदा, Si.;<BR>does both good and bad<BR>to animals:<BR>शुभञ्च विदधत्यशुभञ्च जन्तोः, Ma. i.;<BR>(3) अनुतिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.) (= to perform),<BR>this<BR>was done by fate:<BR>दैवेनेदमनुष्ठितम्, Mu. iii.;<BR>(4)<BR>निष्पादयति (= to accomplish: q. v.).<BR>II When<BR>standing for another verb, expr. by it or<BR>circumlo.:<BR>‘I have much to ask about it.’ ‘Do so<BR>calmly,’:<BR>‘बहु प्रष्टव्यमत्र’ । ‘विश्रब्धं पृच्छ,’ Nu. iii.;<BR>address me as you have been accustomed to d.:<BR>यथाम्यस्तमभिधीयताम्, U. i.;<BR>‘listen and feel sure<BR>of’, ‘I will do both’.:<BR>‘श्रूयतामवधार्यताञ्च’ । ‘उभयमपि<BR> क्रियते’, Mu. (in this last ex. क्रियते does not<BR>stand for the principal verbs, but उभयं<BR>means श्रवणं and अवधारणम्).<BR>III As simple<BR>auxiliary verb, not expressed:<BR>sir, d. assist<BR>me in trouble:<BR>क्लिष्टस्य मे क्रियतामर्थसाहाय्यकम्, D. viii.<BR>N. B. (a) When emphatic, expr. by words<BR>given under truly, surly, indeed. (b) In<BR>interrogative sentences, expr. by अपि, कच्चित्,<BR>etc.,<BR>do you set to penances according to your capa-<BR>bility:<BR>अपि स्वशत्तया तपसि प्रवर्तसे, Ku.<BR>IV To be<BR>done: as of meat, etc. सिध्यति (सिध्, c. 4.)<BR>Bha.<BR>V To deceive: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do
DO (v. i.):<BR>I To behave: q. v.<BR>II To fare:<BR>Ph.:<BR>how d. yow d.:<BR>स्वागतं ते, Mr. v.;<BR>asks how<BR>you are doing:<BR>त्वां कुशलं पृच्छति, Me.<BR>III To<BR>get on, succeed: q. v.: Ph.: I have done:<BR>साधयामि, R. xi. 91.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do away
DO AWAY: Ph.:<BR>do away with begging:<BR>कृतमेव<BR> याच्ञया, Ki. xiv. 20.:<BR>do away with (your)<BR>axe:<BR>समापयतु परशुम्, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do for
DO FOR:<BR>I Lit.: करोति,<BR>if you would do this<BR>for me:<BR>यदि मे भवानिदं कुर्यात्, M. b.<BR>II To do<BR>good: प्रियं करोति (with gen.),<BR>what more<BR>shall I do for you:<BR>किं ते भूयः प्रियं करोमि, Mr. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">Page215</a>]<BR>x.: v. Good, to do.<BR>III To destroy: q. v.:<BR>उत्सादयति (c. of सद्),<BR>I am done for:<BR>उत्सादि-<BR>तोऽस्मि, Mr. iv. To suit: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=214" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do into
DO INTO: Ph.:<BR>do into Persian:<BR>पारचीवाचा<BR> करोति, Raj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do up
DO UP: v. To pack.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do with
DO WITH: expr. by कार्य<BR>or<BR>अर्थः with ins.:<BR>what<BR>have you to do with him:<BR>कस्तेनार्थः, D. ii.;<BR>I have nothing to do with Mālavikā:<BR>न मे<BR> मालविकया कश्चिदर्थः, Mal. iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

do without
DO WITHOUT: expr. by circumlo.,<BR>unable to<BR>d. w. sensual pleasures even for a moment:<BR>इन्द्रियार्थपरिशून्यमक्षमः सोढुमेकमपि क्षणान्तरम्, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

docile
DOCILE:<BR>(1) विनेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) शिक्षाप्रवणः (णा,<BR> णं);<BR>(3) अनुविधायिन् (f. नी) (= pliant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

docility
DOCILITY:<BR>(1) विनेयता;<BR>(2) शिक्षाप्रवणता;<BR>(3)<BR>अनुविधायित्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dock
DOCK (subs.):<BR>I For ships: *पोताशयः, and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR>II For prisoners *वृतिः।<BR>III<BR>A plant:<BR>(1) लोलिका;<BR>(2) रक्तसौगन्धिकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dock
DOCK (v.):<BR>I Of ships: *पोताशये निवेशयति (c.<BR>of विश्).<BR>II To cut off: अवकृन्तति (कृत्,<BR>c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

docket
DOCKET (subs.):<BR>I A label or ticket: q. v.<BR>A summary: सारपत्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

docket
DOCKET (v.): सारपत्रं लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dock-tailed
DOCK-TAILED: छिन्नबालबालधि (mfn.), and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dock-yard
DOCK-YARD: *नौनिर्माणस्थानम्, and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

doctor
DOCTOR (subs.):<BR>I A physician: q. v.: वैद्यः।<BR>II A learned man: पण्डितः, ‘d. of laws’:<BR>धर्मशास्त्रविशारदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

doctor
DOCTOR (v. t.): चिकित्सति (कित्, c. 1.): v.<BR>To treat (III).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

doctorate
DOCTORATE, DOCTORSHIP: विशारदोपाधिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

doctrinal
DOCTRINAL: expr. by comp., d. difference:<BR>मतभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

doctrine
DOCTRINE:<BR>I Instruction: q. v.<BR>II An<BR>opinion:<BR>(1) मतम्,<BR>the d. of Chārvāka:<BR>चार्वा-<BR>कमतम्, D. s.;<BR>(2) वादः,<BR>atheistic d.:<BR>निरीश्वरो<BR> वादः, P. p.<BR>(3) तत्त्वम् (= truth).<BR>III Erudi-<BR>-tion: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

document
DOCUMENT: लेख्यम्,<BR>public d.:<BR>राजसाक्षिकं (or<BR>राजकीयं) लेख्यम्, V. s.;<BR>private d.:<BR>जानपदं लेख्यम्,<BR>Mi.;<BR>attested d.:<BR>ससाक्षिकं लेख्यम्, V. s.;<BR>to<BR>make a d.:<BR>लेख्यं करोति, Y. ; to renew a d.:<BR>अन्यलेख्यं कारयति, Y.: v. Writing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

documentary
DOCUMENTARY: Ph.:<BR>d. evidence:<BR>लेख्यप्रमाणम्;<BR>d. debt:<BR>लेख्यकृतमृणम्, Y.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=215" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

