dumpy
DUMPY: i. e. short and thick: a d. woman:<BR>अनायता स्थूलकाया नारी: v. Short, thick.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dun
DUN (adj.):<BR>I Swarthy: कपिशः (शा, शं).<BR>II<BR>Dark, gloomy: q. v.: घोरः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dun
DUN: (subs.):<BR>I A demand: प्रार्थना।<BR>II One<BR>who d. s: उत्पीडकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dun
