dunce
DUNCE: स्थूलबुद्धिः: v. Fool, block-head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dung
DUNG (subs.):<BR>(1) विष्ठा;<BR>(2) पुरीषम्;<BR>(3) मलम्;<BR>(4) गूथम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dung
