dung-hill
DUNG-HILL:<BR>I Lit.: शकृत्स्तोमः, and sim.<BR>com. s.<BR>II As a term of reproach: नीच-<BR>योनिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dunlin
