dupe
DUPE (subs.): विश्रम्भप्रवणः (= credulous). Ph.:<BR>I was their d.:<BR>*अहमासं तेषां कपटभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duplicate
DUPLICATE (subs.): *द्वितीया प्रतिलिपिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

