durability
DURABILITY:<BR>(1) स्थायित्वम्;<BR>(2) स्थिरता;<BR>(3)<BR>अक्षयता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

durable
DURABLE:<BR>(1) स्थायिन् (f. नी) (= lasting, abid-<BR>-ing):<BR>(2) स्थिरः (रा,) (= constant);<BR>(3)<BR>अक्षयः (या यं) (= undecaying).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

