DURABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

durance
DURANCE:<BR>I Duration: q. v.<BR>II Imprison-<BR>-ment: q. v.: निरोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duration
DURATION:<BR>I Durability: स्थितिः, अव-, व्यव-।<BR>II Abidingness: स्थायित्वम्। Ph.: of long d.:<BR>दीर्घस्थायिन् (f. नी);<BR>of short d.:<BR>अचिरस्थायिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

during
DURING:<BR>(1) by loc. abs.,<BR>d. whose reign:<BR>यस्मिन्<BR> महीं शासति, R.;<BR>(2) by loc., (when = in).<BR>d.<BR>youth:<BR>यौवनदशायाम्। H.;<BR>d. sleep:<BR>स्वप्ने, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dusk
DUSK (adj.): v. Dusky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dusk
