dust
DUST (subs.):<BR>(1) धूलि (ली) (f.),<BR>sea of d.:<BR>धूली-<BR>जलधिः, Ku.;<BR>(2) रजस् (n.),<BR>to put down d.:<BR>रजः<BR> शमयति, Ki.;<BR>(3) रेणु (mf.),<BR>to raise d.:<BR>रेणुमुत्था-<BR>पयति, R.;<BR>(4) पांशु (m.) (rare),<BR>the whole body<BR>smeared with d.:<BR>पांशूपलिप्तसर्वङ्गः, Mah. Ph.: to<BR>throw d. (fig.): धूलिं ददाति (used in Bengali.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dust
DUST (v.): i. e. to brush or sweep away d.:<BR>v. To brush; sweep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duster
