dustiness
DUSTINESS:<BR>(1) पांशुलता;<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

