dusty
DUSTY:<BR>I Filled with dust:<BR>(1) धूलिनिचितः<BR>(ता, तं);<BR>(2) रजोवृतः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) पांशुलः (ला,<BR> लं); etc.<BR>II Like dust:<BR>(1) धूलि-, d. white:<BR>*धूलिसितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duteous
DUTEOUS, DUTIFUL:<BR>(1) भक्तः (क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(2)<BR>भक्तिमत् (f. ती);<BR>(3) वश्यः (श्या, श्यं) (= sub-<BR>-missive);<BR>(4) अनुविधायिन् (f. नी) (= compli-<BR>-ant).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duteousness
DUTEOUSNESS, DUTIFULNESS:<BR>(1) भक्तिः;<BR>(2)<BR>वश्यता (=submissiveness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

duty
DUTY:<BR>I Moral obligation: धर्मः, caste-d. s:<BR>वर्णधर्मान्, S.;<BR>d. s of kings:<BR>राजधर्माः, V. s;<BR>to<BR>abandon d.:<BR>धर्म्यां क्रियां मुञ्चति, B. Ph.: it is the<BR>d. of i. e. it should be done by: v. Should, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">Page226</a>]<BR>ought.<BR>II Service: नियोगः, execute your d.:<BR>स्वनियोगमशून्यं कुरु, Sa. Ph.:<BR>one who has done<BR>one's d.:<BR>कृतकृत्यः, H.<BR>III Reverence: भक्तिः।<BR>IV An impost: शुल्क (mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=225" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

