DUUMVIR: *द्विपुरुषौ (dual).<BR>D. -ate:<BR>*द्विपुरुषाधि-<BR>कारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

