DWARFISHNESS:<BR>(1) खर्वता;<BR>(2) वामनता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

