DWELLING:<BR>(1) निवासः;<BR>(2) वसतिः;<BR>(3) वासः,<BR> आ-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dwelling-house
DWELLING-HOUSE:<BR>(1) वासगृहम्;<BR>(2) वशतिवेश्मन्<BR>(n.), Ki.; and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dwelling-place
DWELLING-PLACE: वासभूमिः, आ-, H. and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dwindle
DWINDLE: क्षीयते (pass. of क्षी): v. To waste<BR>away, decrease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dye
DYE (subs.):<BR>(1) रङ्गः;<BR>(2) रागः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=226" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

dye
