gather
GATHER (v.t.):<BR>I To collect, assemble: q.v.:<BR>आहरति, सम्-, (हृ, c. 1.).<BR>II To cull, pluck:<BR>(1) आ-हरति, समा-,<BR>g. flowers:<BR>कृसुमान्याहरत, Sa.<BR>iv.;<BR>(2) चिनोति (चि, c. 5.), comp.s.:<BR>(1)<BR>उच्चिनोति (= to g. by climbing up a tree), D.;<BR>(2) अव-चिनोति (= to g. on or from the<BR>ground), Ku. i. 60.;<BR>(3) लुनाति (लू, c. 9.)<BR>(= to pluck: q.v.).<BR>III To infer, con-<BR>-clude: q.v.: अवगच्छति (गम्, c. 1.),<BR>g. the<BR>sequel:<BR>परस्तादवगम्यत एव, Sa. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=307" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

gather
GATHER (v.i.):<BR>I To assemble: एकत्र<BR>or<BR>एकस्थ<BR>(f. स्था) भवति; come, let us quickly g. (round her);<BR>तदेहि, शीघ्रमेकस्था भवाम।<BR>II To foster: पच्यते<BR>(pass. of पच्), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=307" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

gather in
