gatherer
GATHERER:<BR>(1) समाहर्तृ (f. र्त्री);<BR>(2) संग्रहीतृ<BR>(f. त्री);<BR>(3) by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=307" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

gathering
GATHERING (subs.):<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) समाहारः;<BR>(2) संग्रहः;<BR>(3) अवचयः (of flowers etc.).<BR>II<BR>A crowd: q.v.: जनसमागमः।<BR>III A tumour:<BR>पक्वव्रणम्, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=307" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

gaudily
