HAMSTER: *शर्मण्यमूषकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hamstring
HAMSTRING (subs.): मन्दिरशिरा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hamstring
HAMSTRING (v.):<BR>I Lit.: मन्दिरशिराः छिनत्ति।<BR>II To disable: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hand
HAND (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) हस्तः,<BR>taking<BR>each other's h.:<BR>अन्योन्यहस्तग्राहम्, Vi. v.; h. to h.:<BR>हस्ताहस्ति;<BR>this kingdom has fallen into the h. s<BR>of the king of Ashmaka:<BR>अस्मकेन्द्रस्य हस्ते राज्यमिदं<BR> पतितम्, D. viii.; they touch each other's h.<BR>(= English shaking of h. s): अन्योऽन्यं हस्तं<BR> स्पृशतः, V. i.;<BR>who has earned the title of hero<BR>with his own h.:<BR>स्वहस्तार्जितवीरशब्दः, R. ii. 64.;<BR>Chandragupta is now under (my)<BR>h.:<BR>हस्ततलगतः<BR> सम्प्रति चन्द्रगुप्तः, Mu.;<BR>(3) करः, taking (her) by<BR>the h.: [तां] आददानः करेण, Ku. vii. 94.; carrying<BR>on one h...., on the other.... एकेन॥।<BR> अपरेण ॥॥करेण कलयन्तम्, K.; right h.: दक्षिणः or<BR>वामेतरः (= other than left) करः, R. ii. 31.;<BR>(3) पाणिः,<BR>with a club in h.:<BR>दण्डपाणि (mfn.);<BR>pressing of h. s (i.e. marriage): पाणिपीडनम्, Ku.;<BR>this arm is stretched, take (my) h. with (your)<BR>h. (in friendship): गृह्यतां पाणिना पार्ण्बिहुरेष प्रसारितः,<BR>Ram. iv. 4. 13. Ph.:<BR>(1) to join the h. s:<BR>हस्तौ समानयति, R. ii. 64. or gen. अञ्जलिर्बघ्नाति,<BR>M. n.; (b) fore h.: अग्रहस्तः, Ku. v. 63.; (c)<BR>on the one.....on the other: एकतः॥॥॥एकतः or<BR>अन्यतः, K.; (d) of on the other h..... अथ यदि<BR>॥॥।, K.; (e) on all h. s.: सर्वथा, K.; (f) at h.:<BR>प्रत्यासन्नः (न्ना, न्नं), The time for going home is at<BR>h.: प्रत्यासीदति गृहगमनकालः, K.: v. Near; (g) in<BR>h.:<BR>(1) lit. हस्ते, etc.;^1<BR>(2) fig. हस्तस्थ (f. स्था),<BR>हस्तगतः (ता, तं), etc.; (h)<BR>from h. to h.:<BR>हस्ताद्धस्तम्<BR>or<BR>-द्धस्तान्तरम्; (i) h. in h.:<BR>(1) =unitedly: q.v.:<BR>हस्ताहस्ति;<BR>(2) =fit: q.v.; (j) to lend a h.:<BR>हस्तं ददातिः v. To help; (k) off h.; out of h.:<BR>त्वरितम्:<BR>(1)<BR>to live from h. to mouth:<BR>यदर्जयति<BR> तदुदरपूरणायैव भवति<BR>II Handwriting: हस्तः,<BR>under his own h.:<BR>स्वहस्तपरिचिह्नतिः (ता, तं), Y.<BR>Ph.:<BR>he writes a good h.:<BR>शोभनं हस्तलिखितं तस्य।<BR>III Of a clock: प्रदर्शनी (?),<BR>hour -h.:<BR>*घटिका-<BR>प्रदर्शनीः v. Gnomon.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hand
HAND (v.):<BR>I To h. over: हस्ते<BR>or<BR>करे<BR>or<BR>पाणौ<BR> ददाति (दा, c. 3.).<BR>II To lead with the h.:<BR>हस्तेन<BR>or<BR>करेण<BR>or<BR>पाणिना गृहीत्वा<BR>or<BR>आदाय नयति<BR>(नी, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=332" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

