handful
HANDFUL:<BR>I Lit.: मुष्टिः।<BR>II Fig.: expr.<BR>by few, small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hand-gallop
