handicraft
HANDICRAFT: शिल्पां: v. Art, business.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handicraftsman
