handiwork
HANDIWORK:<BR>(1) हस्तकर्मन् (n.) (?);<BR>(2) better<BR>by sim. हस्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handily
HANDILY:<BR>(1) कृतहस्ततया;<BR>(2) हस्तलाघवेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handiness
HANDINESS:<BR>(1) कृतहस्तता;<BR>(2) लधुहस्तता;<BR>(3)<BR>हस्तलाघवम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handkerchief
HANDKERCHIEF: *रोमालम्; हस्तकेतुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handle
HANDLE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) मुष्टिः,<BR>the h. of<BR>swords and similar weapons is hilt:<BR>त्सरुः खड्गादि-<BR>मुष्टौ स्यात्, A.;<BR>(2) दण्डः,<BR>h. of a plough:<BR>ईषादण्डः;<BR>(3) तलः<BR>or<BR>तालः (rare).<BR>II Fig.: v. Tool.<BR>Ph.:<BR>to give a h.:<BR>अवसरं ददाति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handle
