handmaid handmaiden
HANDMAID HANDMAIDEN: चेटी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handsome
HANDSOME:<BR>I Beautiful: q.v.:<BR>(1) कान्तिमत्<BR>(f. ती);<BR>(2) लावण्यवत् (f. ती).<BR>II Ample,<BR>large: q.v.: यथेष्टः (ष्ठा, ष्टं).<BR>III Generous,<BR>liberal: q.v.: उदारः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handsomely
HANDSOMELY:<BR>I Beautifully: q.v.: शोभनम्।<BR>II Amply: यथेष्टम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handsomeness
HANDSOMENESS:<BR>I Beauty: q.v.<BR>II Genero-<BR>-sity: उदारता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handwriting
HANDWRITING:<BR>(1) हस्ताक्षरम्;<BR>(2) हस्तलिखितम्।<BR>Agreement of h.:<BR>हस्तसंवादः, Mu.<BR>v. Is this the h.<BR>of Śakaṭa Dāsa:<BR>किं शकटदासेन लिखितम् (?), Mu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

handy
HANDY:<BR>(1) कृतहस्त (f. स्ता);<BR>(2) लघुहस्त (f. स्ता):<BR>v. Dexterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hang
HANG (v. t.):<BR>I To suspend:<BR>(1) नि-,दधाति<BR>(धा, c. 3.) (= to put), on this (branch)<BR>bows have<BR>been hung:<BR>अस्यां धनूंषि निहितानि, Mah.;<BR>(2)<BR>बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.) (= to fasten: q.v.),<BR>hung<BR>banners:<BR>ध्वजान् बबन्धुः, B. iii. 5.<BR>II To kill by<BR>h. ing: उद्वध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.),<BR>he h. s him-<BR>self:<BR>अयमात्मानमुद्वध्नाति, Mu. vi.;<BR>here I will kill<BR>myself. h. ing on this Aśoka tree with this<BR>creeper:<BR>तदिहैवाशोकपादपेऽनया लतयोद्वध्यात्मानं व्यापा-<BR>दयिष्यामि, Ra. vii.<BR>III To lower: q.v.:<BR>नमयति (c. of नम्).<BR>IV To cover, adorn:<BR>q.v.: छादयति (छद्, c. 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hang
HANG (v. i.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) लम्बते, प्र-, (लम्ब, c. 1.)<BR>(= to dangle; h. down);<BR>(2) प्लवते (प्ल, c. 1.)<BR>(= to float);<BR>(3) तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.) (=to<BR>stay).<BR>II To h. on, to stick: सज्जते, आ-,<BR>(सञ्ज्, c. 1.),<BR>my heart h. s on her:<BR>आसज्जते मे<BR> हृदयमस्याम्, D. vi.<BR>III To h. on or upon, to<BR>depend: अवलम्बते, this action h. s on Chārudatta:<BR>व्यवहारोऽयं चारुदत्तमवलभ्बते, Mr. ix.<BR>IV To h.<BR>to, to cling: q.v.: सज्जते।<BR>V To h. over,<BR>impend:<BR>(1) उन्नमति (नम्, c. 1.) (= to rise);<BR>(2) better by उपरि।<BR>VI To h. back, to be<BR>in suspense: दोलायते (nomi.): v. Also to<BR>hesitate, decline.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hangdog
HANGDOG: nearest equiv. श्वपचः, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hanger-on
HANGER-ON: पादसेविन् (f. नी) (?): v.<BR>Dependant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hanging
HANGING (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: उद्वन्धनम्,<BR>one who<BR>dies by h.:<BR>उद्वन्धनमृतः (ता, तं), V. s.<BR>II That<BR>which is hung: perh. परिच्छदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=333" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hanging
