HORSE-CLOTH: अश्वपृष्ठावगुण्ठनपटः, K.; and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

horse-doctor
HORSE-DOCTOR:<BR>(1) अश्ववैद्यः;<BR>(2) शालिहोत्रज्ञो<BR> वैद्यः, P. v. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

horse-fly
HORSE-FLY: अश्वदंशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

