HORSE-GUARDS (pl.): अश्वारोहिदक्षिणः and sim.<BR>comp.s. The H.: a place in London:<BR>सैनिकसभागृहम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

