HORSE-HAIR: अश्वरो(लो)मन् (n.) and sim. comp.s:<BR>v. Hair.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

horse-laugh
HORSE-LAUGH: अट्टहासः;<BR>laughed a h.:<BR>जहास<BR> स्वनवद्धासम्, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

