horseman
HORSEMAN: अश्वारोहः<BR>or<BR>रूढः<BR>or<BR>-रोहिन् (m.) and<BR>sim. comp.s.;<BR>(2) अश्ववारः, Si.;<BR>(3) तुरङ्गसादिन्<BR>(m.), तुरङ्गिन् (m.), तुरङ्गस्थः, and sim. comp. s,<BR>Ku. xvi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

