HORSE-RACE: अश्वचर्या (after रथचर्या); अश्वप्लुतिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

