HORSE-SHOE:<BR>I subs.: नालम् (?).<BR>II Verb.:<BR>(अश्वस्य) नालानि बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.),<BR>h. er:<BR>नालबन्धः<BR>(after Hindi).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

