HORSE-WHIP:<BR>I Subs.:<BR>(1) कशा, Si. v. 10:;<BR>(2) अश्वताड(डि)नी, A.<BR>II Verb: कशाघातं<BR> करोति: v. To strike.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

