HORTICULTURE: उद्यानविद्या (?); उद्याननिर्माणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hosanna
HOSANNA: perh.: जय जय।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hose
HOSE:<BR>I Stocking: *पादावरणम्।<BR>II A pipe:<BR>चर्मकूपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=352" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

