HOT-HOUSE: *तप्तागारम् and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=353" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hotly
HOTLY:<BR>(1) चण्डम्, प्र-, उत्-;<BR>(2) उग्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=353" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

