HOT-MOUTHED:<BR>(1) चण्डमुख (f. खा);<BR>(2) उग्र-<BR>मुख (f. खा); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=353" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hotness
HOTNESS:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) उष्णता;<BR>(2) तप्तता; etc.:<BR>v. Heat.<BR>II Sharpness: q.v.: तीक्ष्णता or<BR>तैक्ष्ण्यम्।<BR>III Of temper:<BR>(1) चण्डता, प्र-;<BR>(2)<BR>उग्रता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=353" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hound
HOUND:<BR>(1) श्वन् (m.),<BR>let loose the h. s:<BR>विमुच्यन्तां<BR> श्वानः, K.;<BR>h. keeper:<BR>श्वगणी, R. ix. 53.;<BR>(2)<BR>कौलेयकः (= blood-h.);<BR>(3) मृगदंशकः<BR>or<BR>सारमेयः<BR>(= fox-h.?);<BR>(4) आखोटिकः, A.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=353" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

