husbandry
HUSBANDRY:<BR>(1) कृषिकर्मन् (m.), P.;<BR>(2) कृषिः<BR>(= agriculture).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hush
HUSH (interj.):<BR>(1) शान्तम्;<BR>(2) तूष्णीम्: v. Silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hush
