husky
HUSKY:<BR>I Lit.: सतुषः (षा, षं).<BR>II Rough:<BR>q.v.: रूक्ष (f. क्षा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

husting
