hustle
HUSTLE:<BR>(1) खलीकरोतिः, Mr. ii.;<BR>(2) निष्कासयति<BR>(c. of कस्) (= to drive out).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

huswife
HUSWIFE: गृहिणी: v. Housewife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hut
HUT:<BR>(1) कुटी, -रः:<BR>(2) उटजः;<BR>(3) पर्णशाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

