HUTCH: perh. कोष्ठः,<BR>rabbit-h.:<BR>शशकोष्ठः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

huzza
HUZZA:<BR>(1) जयध्वनिः;<BR>(2) जयारवः;<BR>(3) जयनादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hyacinth
HYACINTH: सुगन्धिलताभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

hyads
