hyaena
HYAENA: perh. तरक्षुः; मृगादनः (poet.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=357" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

