inalienable
INALIENABLE: न परैरादेयः (या, यं) and sim.<BR>expr. (?);<BR>(2) वहार्य (f. र्या). (what cannot<BR>be taken away).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inalienably
INALIENABLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

