inanimate
INANIMATE:<BR>(1) अचेतनः (ना, न);<BR>(2) विचेतनः<BR>(ना, नं);<BR>(3) निर्जीवः (वा, वं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inanimation
INANIMATION:<BR>I Lit.: अचेतनता, -त्त्वम्।<BR>II Ani-<BR>-mation: उल्लासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inanition
INANITION: असारता: v. Emptiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inapplicable
INAPPLICABLE: expr. by न लगति (लग्, c. 1.),<BR>etc.: v. To apply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inapposite
INAPPOSITE:<BR>(1) अयुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं);<BR>(2) असङ्गतः<BR>(ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inappreciable
INAPPRECIABLE: दुरुपलभ्यः (म्या, म्यं) (?): v. To<BR>appreciate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inapprehensible
INAPPREHENSIBLE:<BR>(1) दुष्परिग्रहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2)<BR>दुर्ग्रहः (हा, हं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inapproachable
INAPPROACHABLE: दुरासदः (दा, दं): v. In-<BR>-accessible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inappropriate
INAPPROPRIATE: अयोग्यः (ग्या, ग्यं): v. Undeser-<BR>-ving, fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inappropriately
INAPPROPRIATELY:<BR>(1) अयुक्तम्;<BR>(2) अनुचितम्;<BR>(3) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

