INAPTITUDE: अनुपयोगिता: v. Aptitude, incapa-<BR>-city.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inarticulate
INARTICULATE:<BR>(1) असोअष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) अस्फुटः<BR>(टा, टं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inarticulately
