inartificial
INARTIFICIAL:<BR>(1) अकृत्रिमः (मा, मं);<BR>(2) अकृतकः<BR>(का, कं): v. Also simple.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

