inattention
INATTENTION:<BR>(1) असावधानता;<BR>(2) अमनोयोगः;<BR>(3) प्रमादः<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inattentive
INATTENTIVE:<BR>(1) असावधानः (ना, नं);<BR>(2)<BR>अनवधानः (ना, नं)<BR>or<BR>अनवहितः (ता, तं) (= in-<BR>-advertent);<BR>(3) प्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं) (= careless);<BR>(4) अमनोयोगिन् (f. नी) (rare);<BR>(5) अनवेक्षिन्<BR>(f. णी) (= not looking after).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

