INATTENTIVELY:<BR>(1) असावधानतया;<BR>(2) अमनो-<BR>योगेन;<BR>(3) सप्रमादम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inaudible
INAUDIBLE: अस्फुटः (टा, टं) (= indistinct);<BR>better by circumlo.; न कर्णम् आयाति (या, c. 2.)<BR>or<BR>कर्णगोचरीभवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

