INCAPACITY:<BR>(1) असमर्थता;<BR>(2) अक्षमता;<BR>(3)<BR>असामर्थ्यम्;<BR>(4) शक्तिनता and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incarcerate
INCARCERATE: कारायां निरुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.): v.<BR>To imprison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incarnate
INCARNATE:<BR>(1) वपुष्मत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) मूर्तिमत्<BR>(f. ती);<BR>(3) विग्रहिन् (f. णी);<BR>(4) कायवत्<BR>(f. ती);<BR>(5) मूर्त (f. र्ता);<BR>(6) शरीरबद्ध (f. द्धा);<BR>(7) तनुं श्रितः (ता, तं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incarnation
INCARNATION:<BR>(1) अवतारः (= descent:) esp. of [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">Page370</a>]<BR>the ten i. s. of Viṣṇu);<BR>(2) शरीरग्रहम् and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=369" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incase
INCASE: आवृणोति (वृ, c. 5); v. To enclose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incautious
INCAUTIOUS:<BR>(1) प्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं): v. Careless,<BR>inattentive;<BR>(2) असमीक्ष्यकारिन् (f. णी) (= not<BR>circumspect).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incautiously
INCAUTIOUSLY:<BR>(1) प्रमादात्: v. Carelessly;<BR>(2) असमीक्ष्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incendiarism
INCENDIARISM:<BR>(1) गृहदाहः;<BR>(2) आगारदाहः; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incendiary
INCENDIARY:<BR>I Subs:<BR>(1) गृहदाहकः (f. हिका);<BR>(2) आगारदाहिन् (f. नी);<BR>II Adj.: expr. by<BR>comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incense
INCENSE:<BR>(1) धूपः;<BR>(2) सिह्लः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incense
INCENSE: (v.):<BR>I Lit.: धूप(पा)यति (धूप्,) c. 10.)<BR>or<BR>धूपेन वासयति (c. of वस्).<BR>II To kindle:<BR>q.v.: संघुक्षयति (c. of धुक्ष्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incentive
INCENTIVE:<BR>(1) कारणम् (= cause);<BR>(2) प्रलोभनम्<BR>(= temptation);<BR>(3) by verb: v. To<BR>urge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incertitude
INCERTITUDE: अनिश्चयः: v. Uncertainty, doubt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incessant
INCESSANT:<BR>(1) अविरतः<BR>or<BR>अनवरत<BR>or<BR>अनारतः<BR>(ता, तं);<BR>(2) अविश्रान्त<BR>or<BR>अश्रान्त (f. न्ता); v.<BR>Also continuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incessantly
INCESSANTLY:<BR>(1) अवोरतम्;<BR>(2) अनवरतम्;<BR>(3)<BR>अश्रान्तम्;<BR>(4) अविततम्: v. Also continually,<BR>always.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incest
INCEST:<BR>(1) अगम्यागमनम् (of men), V.;<BR>(2) गमनम्<BR>(when the sense is clear), i. with a mother:<BR>मातृगमनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incestuous
INCESTUOUS:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) अगम्यागामी;<BR>(2)<BR>अगम्यागन्तृ (m.).<BR>II Of acts: by comp.,<BR>for i.<BR>intercourse:<BR>अगम्यागमनार्थम्<BR>or<BR>अगम्यार्थम्, N.<BR>xvii. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incestuously
INCESTUOUSLY: expr. by adj or by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inch
INCH: सार्द्धाङ्गुलः (अङ्गुल = 2/3 of an i.). By i. es:<BR>अल्पाल्पशः: v. Gradually.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inchoate
INCHOATE: असम्पूर्ण (f. र्णा) (= incomplete);<BR>असमाप्तः (= unfinished); प्रारब्ध (f. ब्धा)<BR>(= begun).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incidence
INCIDENCE: पतनम्<BR>or<BR>पातः (?),<BR>angle of i.:<BR>*पात-<BR>कोणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incident
INCIDENT (adj.):<BR>I Carnal: q.v.:<BR>II Attach-<BR>-ing to: आनुपङ्गिक (f. की).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incident
INCIDENT (subs.):<BR>I Event: q.v.: वृत्तम्।<BR>II<BR>Episode: उपकथा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incidental
INCIDENTAL:<BR>I Accidental: q.v.: यादृच्छिक<BR>(f. की).<BR>II Occasionally: expr. by adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incidentally
INCIDENTALLY:<BR>I Accidentatlly: q.v.: समा-<BR>पत्त्या।<BR>II Occasionally:<BR>(1) प्रसङ्गात्;<BR>(2) कथा-<BR>प्रसङ्गेन, Ki. i. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incipience
INCIPIENCE, INCIPIENCY: प्रारम्भः: v. Beginning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incipient
INCIPIENT:<BR>(1) प्रथमः (मा, मं) (= first);<BR>(2) by<BR>subs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incised
INCISED:<BR>i. wound:<BR>छिन्नम्<BR>or<BR>छिन्नं व्रणम्, Ni.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incision
INCISION:<BR>(1) छेदः;<BR>(2) छिन्नम्: v. Cut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incisive
INCISIVE: अतितीक्ष्ण (f. क्ष्णा) (= very sharp:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incisor
INCISOR: राजदन्तः, N. vii. 46.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incite
INCITE: उत्साहयति, प्र-, सम्-, c. of. सह्),<BR>i. ing<BR>Bhānuvarman:<BR>भानुवर्माणं प्रोत्साह्य, D.: v. Also to<BR>impel, encourage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incitement
INCITEMENT:<BR>(1) प्रोत्साहः, -नम्;<BR>(2) by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inciter
INCITER: प्रोत्साहक (f. हिका)<BR>or<BR>प्रोत्साहयितृ (f. त्री).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incivility
INCIVILITY:<BR>(1) अशिष्टता;<BR>(2) विनयापराधः, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclemency
INCLEMENCY: perh. कर्कशता<BR>or<BR>रौक्ष्यम् (= harsh-<BR>-ness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inciement
INCIEMENT:<BR>I Harsh, cruel: निष्ठुरः (रा, रं).<BR>II Of weather: perh. कर्कशः (शाम् शं); दुर्दिनम्<BR>or<BR>वार्दलम् (of cloudy weather).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclination
INCLINATION:<BR>I Leaning: नतिः।<BR>II Fancy:<BR>q.v.: मावः।<BR>III Desire: q.v.: छन्दस् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incline
INCLINE: (subs.): उत्सर्पिणी (= ascending) or<BR>अवसर्पिणी (= descending) भूमिः, Mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incline
INCLINE (v. i.):<BR>I To lean: नमति (नम्, c. 1.).<BR>II To be disposed: expr. by -प्रवण (f. णा)<BR>in comp. or by अभिलाषः (= desire),<BR>however<BR>my mind is i. d:<BR>यथाविधो मे मनसोऽभिलाषः, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incline
INCLINE (v. t.):<BR>I To bend: q.v.: नमयति<BR>(c. of नम्).<BR>II To dispose: expr. as above:<BR>v. Also to induce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclined
INCLINED (adj.):<BR>I Disposed: -प्रवण (f. णा)<BR>in comp.<BR>II In. math, नतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclose
INCLOSE, INCLOSURE: v. Enclose, enclosure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

include
INCLUDE: expr. by अन्तर्मवति (भू, c. 1.) or<BR>अन्तर्वर्तते (वृत्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>अन्तःपतति (पत्, c. 1.)<BR>(= be i. d),<BR>some are. i. d. in these:<BR>केचिदन्तर्भवन्त्येषु, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">Page371</a>]<BR>Kav. viii. 7.;<BR>is i. d. in motion:<BR>गमनेऽन्तर्भविष्यति,<BR>Ta: v. To contain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=370" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclusive
INCLUSIVE: expr. by ins. or with सह्<BR>there i.<BR>of self:<BR>आत्मना तृतीयः, vi. i.;<BR>from Monday to<BR>Saturday i.:<BR>सोमवारमारभ्य सशनिवारपर्यन्तम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inclusively
INCLUSIVELY: सर्वं परिगृह्य<BR>or<BR>गृहीत्वा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incognito
INCOGNITO:<BR>(1) अवरुद्ध्व (द्धा, द्धं),<BR>some prince<BR>travelling i.:<BR>कोऽपि राजसूनुरवरुद्धश्चरन्, D. iii.;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रच्छन्न (f. न्ना) (= hidden), Ki. xvi. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incoherence
INCOHERENCE, INCOHERENCY:<BR>(1) असम्बन्धः;<BR>(2) असम्बद्धता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incoherent
INCOHERENT: असम्बद्ध (f. द्धा): v. Also inconsis-<BR>-tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incoherently
INCOHERENTLY: expr. by adj.,<BR>talking i.:<BR>असम्बद्ध-<BR>प्रलापिन् (f. नी), Sa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incombustible
INCOMBUSTIBLE:<BR>(1) अदाह्य (f. ह्या);<BR>(2) अदहनीयः<BR>(या, यं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

income
INCOME: आयः,<BR>without thinking of the i.:<BR>आयमना-<BR>लोच्य, H.;<BR>sources of i.:<BR>आयद्वाराणि, Mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incommensurable
INCOMMENSURABLE, INCOMMENSURATE: *विषम-<BR>मानः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incommode
INCOMMODE: बाधते (बाध्,) c. 1.) (?); पीडयति<BR>(पीड्, c. 10.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incommodious
INCOMMODIOUS: perh. असुखकरः (री, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incommunicable
INCOMMUNICABLE:<BR>(1) अप्रदेयः (या, यं) (what<BR>cannot be given);<BR>(2) अकथनीयः (या, यं)<BR>(= what cannot be told).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incomparable
INCOMPARABLE:<BR>(1) अनुपमः (मा, मं);<BR>(2) निरुपमः<BR>(मा, मं);<BR>(3) अतुलः (ला, लं);<BR>(4) अप्रतिमः<BR>(मा, मं);<BR>(5) अद्धितीयः (या, यं) (= without a<BR>second).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incomparably
INCOMPARABLY:<BR>(1) निर्विवादम् (= indisputably);<BR>(2) निःसन्देहम् (= undoubtedly);<BR>(3) परमम्<BR>(= exceedingly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompatibility
INCOMPATIBILITY:<BR>(1) विसंवादः (= disagree-<BR>-ment);<BR>(2) विरोधः (= opposition).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompatible
INCOMPATIBLE:<BR>(1) विरुद्ध (f. द्धा (= opposed);<BR>(2) by circumlo,<BR>vanity is i. with fortune:<BR>न<BR> मानिता चास्ति भवन्ति च श्रियः, Ki. xiv. 13.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompetence
INCOMPETENCE, INCOMPETENCY: अक्षमता: v.<BR>Incapacity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompetent
INCOMPETENT:<BR>(1) अक्षमः (मा, मं): v. Incap-<BR>-able;<BR>(2) अयोग्य (f. ग्या) (= unfit).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incomplete
INCOMPLETE:<BR>(1) असम्पूर्णता; (f. र्णा);<BR>(2) असमाप्त<BR>(f. प्ता) (= unfinished);<BR>(3) खण्डितः (ता, तं)<BR>(= broken).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompletely
INCOMPLETELY:<BR>(1) असम्पूर्णम्;<BR>(2) न पूर्णम् or<BR>सम्पूर्णम्<BR>or<BR>परिपूर्णम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incompleteness
INCOMPLETENESS:<BR>(1) असम्पूर्णता;<BR>(2) अपूर्तीः<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incomprehensibility
INCOMPREHENSIBILITY:<BR>(1) दुष्परिग्रहता;<BR>(2)<BR>दुर्ग्राहता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incomprehensible
INCOMPREHENSIBLE:<BR>(1) दुष्परिग्रहः (हा, हं);<BR>(2)<BR>दुर्ग्रहः (हा, हं);<BR>(3) दुर्बोधः (धा, धं) (rare), Ki.<BR>xviii. 31<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconceivable
INCONCEIVABLE:<BR>(1) अचिन्त्य (f. न्त्या);<BR>(2)<BR>अचिन्तनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(3) अविमाव्य (f. व्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconceivably
INCONCEIVABLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconclusive
INCONCLUSIVE: खण्डनीयः (या, यं) (what can be<BR>repelled).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconclusively
INCONCLUSIVELY:<BR>(1) अनिर्णयेन (?);<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconclusiveness
INCONCLUSIVENESS: खण्डनीयता; अनिर्णयः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconcruity
INCONCRUITY:<BR>(1) असङ्गतिः;<BR>(2) असाङ्गत्यम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incongruous
INCONGRUOUS: असङ्गतः (ता, तं): v. Also impro-<BR>-per.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incongruously
INCONGRUOUSLY:<BR>(1) expr. by adj.;<BR>(2) अनु-<BR>चितम् (= improperly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsiderable
INCONSIDERABLE: अबहु (f. ह्नी); v. Also little,<BR>moderate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsiderate
INCONSIDERATE:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) अविमृश्यकारिन्<BR>(f. णी);<BR>(2) असमीक्ष्यकारिन् (f. णी).<BR>II Of<BR>acts: expr. with अविमृश्य<BR>or<BR>असमीक्ष्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsiderately
INCONSIDERATELY:<BR>(1) अविमृश्य;<BR>(2) असमीक्ष्य;<BR>(3) अविविच्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsiderateness
INCONSIDERATENESS:<BR>(1) अविमृश्यकारिता;<BR>(2)<BR>असमीक्ष्यकारिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsistence
INCONSISTENCE:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) विसंवादः (= dis-<BR>-agreement);<BR>(2) विरोधः (= opposition).<BR>II<BR>Fickleness: q.v.: अस्यैर्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsistent
INCONSISTENT:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) विरुद्ध (f. द्धा)<BR>(= opposed);<BR>(2) असङ्गत्तः (ता, तं) (=incon-<BR>-gruous);<BR>(3) by न संवदति (वद्, c. 1.) (= dis-<BR>-agree).<BR>II Fickle: q.v.: अस्थिरः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsistently
INCONSISTENTLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsolable
INCONSOLABLE:<BR>(1) दुःसा(शा)न्त्वनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) निराश्वासः (सा, सं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=371" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsonant
INCONSONANT: expr. by न संवदति (वद्, c. 1.):<BR>v. Inconsistent, discordant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconstancy
INCONSTANCY:<BR>(1) अस्थिरता;<BR>(2) अनवस्थितः: v.<BR>Fickleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconstant
INCONSTANT:<BR>(1) अस्थिरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) अनवस्थितः<BR>(ता, तं): v. Fickle. constant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconsumable
INCONSUMABLE: अक्षयः (या, यं)<BR>or<BR>अक्षय्य (f. य्या),<BR>i. even after hundred year's enjoyment:<BR>वर्षशतोप-<BR>भोगेऽप्यक्षय्य (f. य्या), D. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontestable
INCONTESTABLE:<BR>(1) अखण्डनीयः (या, यं) (= in-<BR>-controvertible);<BR>(2) निर्विवादः (दा, दं) (= in-<BR>-disputable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontinence
INCONTINENCE, INCONTINENCY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1)<BR>असंयम।;<BR>(2) अजितेन्द्रियता।<BR>II Indulgence of<BR>lust: इन्द्रियासक्तिः। Ph.:<BR>arising from i.:<BR>रतिराग-<BR>सम्भवः (वा, वं), R. xix. 48.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontinet
INCONTINET: Lit.:<BR>(1) असंयतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>अजेतेन्द्रियः (या, यं).<BR>II Lustful: इन्द्रियासक्त<BR>(f. क्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontinently
INCONTINENTLY:<BR>I Lit.: असंयतम्।<BR>II Imme-<BR>-diately: q.v.: अचिरेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontrollable
INCONTROLLABLE:<BR>(1) निर्यन्त्रण (f. णा);<BR>(2)<BR>निरवग्रहः (हा, हं), Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontrovertible
INCONTROVERTIBLE: अखण्ड्य (f. ण्ड्या)<BR>or<BR>अखण्ड-<BR>नीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incontrovertibley
INCONTROVERTIBLEY: निर्विवादेन (= indisputa-<BR>-bly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconvenience
INCONVENIENCE:<BR>(1) असुखम् (?);<BR>(2) क्लेशः<BR>(= trouble);<BR>(3) पीडा (=pain).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconvenient
INCONVENIENT:<BR>I Unfit: q.v.: अयोग्य (f. न्या).<BR>II Incommodious:<BR>(1) असुखकरः (री, रं)<BR>(?);<BR>(2) क्लेशकरः (री, रं) (?);<BR>(3) पीडाकरः<BR>(री, रं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconveniently
INCONVENIENTLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconvertible
INCONVERTIBLE: अपरिवर्तनीयः (या, यं) (??);<BR>better by circumlo: v. To change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inconrporate
INCONRPORATE (v. t.):<BR>I To mix: q.v.: मिश्रयति<BR>(मिश्र्, c. 10.).<BR>II To unite: q.v.: संयोजयति<BR>(c. of युज्)<BR>III To form into a legal<BR>body: *समवायीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorporate
INCORPORATE (v. i.):<BR>(1) संसृज्यते (pass. of. सृज्);<BR>(2) मिश्रीमवति, सं-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorporation
INCORPORATION:<BR>I Union, combination:<BR>q.v.: संयोगः<BR>II Of companies etc: *सम-<BR>वायीकरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorporeal
INCORPOREAL:<BR>(1) अशरौरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) अदेहः<BR>(हा, हं);<BR>(3) अशरीरिन् (f. णी); and sim.<BR>comp.s.: v. Body, devoid of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incoprect
INCOPRECT:<BR>(1) अशुद्ध (f. द्धा);<BR>(2) म्रान्त (f. न्ता)<BR>(= erroneous);<BR>(3) मिथ्या (=false: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorrectly
INCORRECTLY:<BR>(1) अशुद्धम्;<BR>(2) म्रान्तम्;<BR>(3) मिथ्या;<BR>(4) नाञ्जसा (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorrectness
INCORRECTNESS:<BR>(1) अशुद्धिः;<BR>(2) असत्यता<BR>(= falsity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorricible
INCORRICIBLE: expr. by दर्दान्त (f. न्ता) (= in-<BR>-tractable, of persons only)<BR>or<BR>दुरन्त (f. न्ता)<BR>(= fatal, extreme).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorrigibly
INCORRIGIBLY:<BR>(1) expr. as above, to drink i.:<BR>दुरन्तं पिबति;<BR>(2) by circumlo: v. To correct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorrupt
INCORRUPT, INCORRUPTED: v. Incorruptible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorruptibility
INCORRUPTIBILITY:<BR>(1) अविनश्वरता;<BR>(2) अदुष्यता;<BR>(3) अभेद्यता: for dif.: v. Imperishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorruptible
INCORRUPTIBLE:<BR>(1) अविनश्वरः (रा, रं) (= im-<BR>-perishable):<BR>(2) अक्षयः (या, यं) (= undecay-<BR>-ing);<BR>(3) अद्रष्य (f. ष्या) (cannot be defiled);<BR>(4) अभेद्य (f. द्या) (as with bribe), K. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incorruptibly
INCORRUPTIBLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

increase
INCREASE: (v. i.):<BR>(1) वर्धते, वि-, परि-, सं-, प्र-,<BR> अभि-, (वृध्, c. 1.), the fish i. d there (i.e. became<BR>large): स तत्र ववृधे मत्स्यः, Mah. iii. 187. 22.;<BR>of<BR>i. d. spirit:<BR>विवृद्धतेजस् (mfn.), Ki. xvi. 7.; do<BR>your penances i. (i.e. advance): वर्धते ते तपः,<BR>B. vi. 69.;<BR>i. ing affection:<BR>वर्धमानः स्नेहः, H. ii.<BR>1.;<BR>(2) वृद्धिं गच्छति (गम्, c. 1.), याति (या, c. 2.),<BR>अश्नुते (अश्, c. 5.), etc.;<BR>(3) एधते, सम्-,<BR>(एध्, c. 1.) (rare);<BR>(4) उपचीयते (pass of चि).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

increase
INCREASE (v. t.):<BR>(1) वर्धयै, वि-, परि-, सं-, प्र-,<BR>(c. of वृध्),<BR>you are i. ing my curiosity:<BR>वर्धयसि<BR> मे कुतूहलम्, Mu. v.; does not i. it (fortune): न तां<BR> वर्धयति, H. ii. 5.; i. (= advance)<BR>them who<BR>flatter:<BR>तं वर्धयति यः स्तौति, K.;<BR>(2) वृद्धिं नयति<BR>(नी, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>लम्भयति (c. of लभ्), etc.;<BR>(3)<BR>एधयति, सम्-, (c. of एध्) (rare);<BR>(4) उप-चिनोति<BR>(चि, c. 5.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

increase
INCREASE (subs.):<BR>(1) वृद्धिः, (rarely) वि-, सं-,<BR>causing the i. of wealth:<BR>धनवृद्धिकरः (री, रं), [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">Page373</a>]<BR>K. b.; i. and decrease (of days): हानिवृद्धि-, Su.<BR>xii. 56.; the i. (i.e. interest)<BR>allowed by<BR>Vasistha:<BR>वसिष्ठविहिता वृद्धिः, M. viii. 140.;<BR>(2)<BR>वर्धनम्, सम्-, वि-, (= the act of i. ing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=372" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredibility
INCREDIBILITY:<BR>(1) अविश्वास्यता;<BR>(2) अश्रद्धेयता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredible
INCREDIBLE: अविंश्वास्य (f. स्या);<BR>(2) अश्रद्धेयः<BR>(या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredibly
INCREDIBLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredulity
INCREDULITY:<BR>(1) अविश्वासः;<BR>(2) अप्रत्ययः;<BR>(3)<BR>अश्रद्धा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredulous
INCREDULOUS:<BR>(1) अविश्वासिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>अविश्वासशीलः (ला, लं) (?): v. Credulous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incredulously
INCREDULOUSLY:<BR>(1) अविश्वासेन;<BR>(2) अश्रद्धया;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incriminate
INCRIMINATE: v. To implicate, criminate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incrust
INCRUST:<BR>(1) expr. by subs;<BR>(2) तिरस्करोति (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incrustation
INCRUSTATION:<BR>(1) बाह्यपटलम् (??);<BR>(2) तिरस्कारः<BR>(?),<BR>his rage was like iron i.:<BR>लौहतिरस्कार इवात्म-<BR>मन्युः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incubate
INCUBATE: अवतिष्ठते (स्था, c. 1.) (?) (comp.<BR>वसा in Bengali): v. Also to hatch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incubation
INCUBATION: अण्डपोषणम् (?); अण्डमृतिः (after<BR>Mah.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incubus
INCUBUS: i. e. nightmare: perh. भूतदर्शनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inculcate
INCULCATE: श्स्ति, अनु- (शास्, c. 2.): v. To<BR>advise, teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inculcation
INCULCATION: शासनम्, अनु-: v. Also teaching.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incumbency
INCUMBENCY: Ph.:<BR>during his i.:<BR>तस्याधिकारे।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incumbent
INCUMBENT (adj.): v. Indispensable, obliga-<BR>-tory.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incumbent
INCUMBENT (subs.): अधिकृतः (= employee).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incumber
INCUMBER: v. Encumber.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incur
INCUR:<BR>(1) मजते (भज्, c. 1.),<BR>he i. s guilt:<BR>स दोष-<BR>भाक्, Ku. v. 83;<BR>the doer of this i. s. the<BR>punishment of a thief:<BR>तत्कर्ता चौरदण्डमाक्, Mit.;<BR>(2) by circumlo. i. s the hatred of people:<BR>द्वेष्यतां याति लोके, P.: v. To become.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incurable
INCURABLE:<BR>(1) असाध्य (f. ध्या),<BR>i. piles:<BR>असाध्यो<BR> गुल्मः, Bha.;<BR>i. by physicians:<BR>मिषजामसाव्य<BR>(f. ध्या), R. viii. 93.;<BR>(2) अचिकित्स्य (f. त्स्या)<BR>(only of disease).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incurably
INCURABLY: expr. by adj or circumlo, i. ill:<BR>अचिकित्स्यरोगाक्रान्त (f. न्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incurious
INCURIOUS:<BR>I am i. about snakes:<BR>न नः कुतूहलमस्ति<BR> सर्पदर्शने, Mu. ii.: v. Curious, not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incursion
INCURSION: अवस्कन्दः: v. Inroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

incurvate
INCURVATE: वक्रीकरोति: v. To bend, crooked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indebted
INDEBTED:<BR>(1) ऋणिन् (f. नी) (Lit.: also<BR>rarely fig.);<BR>(2) उपकृतः (ता, तं): (fig.): v.<BR>Obliged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indebtedness
INDEBTEDNESS:<BR>I Lit.: ऋणित्वम्।<BR>II Fig.: expr.<BR>by ऋणम्: v. Also obligation, to owe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecency
INDECENCY: अश्लीलम्, -ता, i. is of there kinds<BR>(according)<BR>as it indicates shame, abhorrence, or<BR>evil:<BR>त्रिधाश्लीलं व्रीडाजुगुप्सामङ्गलव्यञ्जकत्वात्, Kav. vii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecent
INDECENT:<BR>(1) अश्लीलः (ला, लं),<BR>i. language:<BR>अश्लीला<BR> वाक्, Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecently
INDECENTLY:<BR>(1) अश्लीलम्;<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecision
INDECISION:<BR>I Hesitation: अनिश्चयः।<BR>II Fickle-<BR>-ness: q.v.:<BR>(1) चलचित्तता;<BR>(2) अस्थिरमनस्कता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecisive
INDECISIVE:<BR>(1) अनिश्चितः (ता, तं) (= not<BR>certain);<BR>(2) सन्दिग्ध (f. ग्धा) (= doubtful).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecisively
INDECISIVELY:<BR>(1) अनिश्चितम्;<BR>(2) सन्दिग्धम्: v.<BR>Doubtfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indeclinable
INDECLINABLE:<BR>i. word:<BR>अव्ययम्; i. compound:<BR>अव्ययीमावः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecorous
INDECOROUS:<BR>(1) अविनीतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) अनुचितः<BR>(ता, तं) (= improper).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecorously
INDECOROUSLY: expr. by adj.;<BR>(2) अविनयेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indecorum
INDECORUM: अविनयः: v. Also in decency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indeed
INDEED:<BR>I Emphatic:<BR>(1) -एव (enclitic), you<BR>know i. that from (the time of) deserting (his)<BR>wife:<BR>जानास्येव यथा वधूत्यागात् प्रभृति, U. ii.;<BR>(2)<BR>नूनम् (= surely: q.v.).<BR>II (In) fact: q.v.:<BR>वस्तुतः।<BR>III Of surprise: सत्यम् (= truly: q.v. t.),<BR>i. you have been informed by Chandrikā:<BR>सत्यं त्वं<BR> परिगतार्था चन्द्रिकया, Mah. iv.<BR>IV Concessive:<BR>(3) खलु,<BR>family knowledge is i. highly thought of<BR>by every body:<BR>कामं खलु सर्वस्यापि कुलविद्या बहुमता,<BR>Mal. i.;<BR>(3) किल,<BR>he i.:<BR>स किल, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefatigable
INDEFATIGABLE अखिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं): v. Assidu-<BR>-ous, diligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefatigableness
INDEFATIGABLENESS: अखिन्नता: v. Also assi-<BR>-duity, diligence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefatiably
INDEFATIABLY:<BR>(1) अखिन्नम्;<BR>(2) by adj.: v.<BR>Also diligently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=373" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefeasible
INDEFEASIBLE: अखण्ड्य (f. ण्ड्या)<BR>or<BR>अखण्डनीयः<BR>(या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefensible
INDEFENSIBLE: expr. by circumlo,<BR>your conduct<BR>is. i.:<BR>*वक्तुं न शक्यते किञ्चिच्चरितस्य कृते तवः v. Also<BR>to defend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefinite
INDEFINITE:<BR>(1) अनिर्वचनीयः (या, यं): v. Defina-<BR>-ble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indefinite
INDEFINITE:<BR>(1) अनिश्वितः (ता, तं) (= uncertain);<BR>(2) अस्थिरः (रा, रं) (= not fixed). Ph.: i. article:<BR>*अनिरूपकमव्ययम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indelible
INDELIBLE<BR>(1) अक्षरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) by circumlo:<BR>v. To efface.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indelicacy
INDELICACY: ग्राम्यता: v. Rudeness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indelicate
INDELICATE: ग्राम्य (f. म्या): v. Rude, offen-<BR>-sive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indelicately
INDELICATELY: अश्लीलम् (= indecently): v. Also<BR>rudely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indemnification
INDEMNIFICATION:<BR>(1) उदयदानम् (?);<BR>(2) क्षति-<BR>पूरणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indemnify
INDEMNIFY: उदयं दापयति (c. of दा)<BR>or<BR>ददाति<BR>(दा, c. 3.), Vi.: v. Also loss, make good.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indemnity
INDEMNITY:<BR>act. of i.:<BR>*रक्षाविधिः; क्षमाविधिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indemnonstrable
INDEMNONSTRABLE: असाध्य (f. ध्या) (?): v. To<BR>demonstrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indent
INDENT:<BR>I To notch: q.v.<BR>II Of sta-<BR>-tionery etc: perh. याचते (याच्, c. 1.) (= to<BR>ask).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indented
INDENTED:<BR>I Notched: दन्तुरः (रा, रं).<BR>II<BR>Sent for: याचितः (ता, तं) (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indenture
INDENTURE: नियमपत्रम् (??)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

independence
INDEPENDENCE:<BR>(1) स्वाधीनता;<BR>(2) स्वातन्त्र्यम्: v.<BR>Freedom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

independent
INDEPENDENT (adj.):<BR>I Free: q.v.:<BR>(1)<BR>स्वाधीनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) स्वतन्त्र (f. न्त्रा).<BR>II Not<BR>obsequious: स्वमतानुविधायिन् (f. नी) (?);<BR>अनुरोधाभेद्य (f. द्या) (?).<BR>III Bold, uncons-<BR>-trained: q.v.<BR>IV. I. of = exclusive of:<BR>q.v.: विहाय (with acc.): v. Also except.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

independent
INDEPENDENT (subs.): *स्वाधीनधर्भवादिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

independently
INDEPENDENTLY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) स्वआधीनतया;<BR>(2)<BR>स्वातन्त्रेण,<BR>i. of the husband:<BR>मर्तृतः स्वातन्त्र्येण, Da.<BR>II Apart from: expr. by अतिरेकेण in comp.<BR>or by विहाय (= excepting: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indescribable
INDESCRIBABLE:<BR>(1) अनिर्वचनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>अनुर्देशय (f. शया);<BR>(3) अनाख्येयः (या, यं); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indestructibility
INDESTRUCTIBILITY:<BR>(1) अविनश्वरता, -त्वम्;<BR>(2)<BR>अविनाशिता, -त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indestructible
INDESTRUCTIBLE: अविनश्वरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) अवि-<BR>नाशिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indeterminable
INDETERMINABLE:<BR>(1) अनवधारणीयः (या, यं),<BR>R. xiii. 5.; दुर्निरूपः (पा, पं), M. n.;<BR>(3)<BR>दुर्निरूपणीयः (या, यं) etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indeterminate
INDETERMINATE: v. Indefinite. Ph.:<BR>i. equa-<BR>tion:<BR>*बहुफलसमीकरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indeterminately
INDETERMINATELY: by adj. or Prest. part:<BR>v. To determine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

index
INDEX:<BR>I Of a book: सूचि (ची), -पत्रम्,<BR>alpha-<BR>betical i.:<BR>वर्णानुसारेण सूचिपत्रम्।<BR>II Of a dial, etc.:<BR>(?) प्रदेशिनी (= the i. finger).<BR>III In Math.:<BR>*रूपम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

india
INDIA: भारतभ्, -वर्षम्, I. is now under my sway:<BR>भारतं वर्षमद्य मम वर्तते वशे, SI. xiv. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indian
INDIAN: भारतवर्षीयः (या, यं) (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indicate
INDICATE:<BR>(1) सूचयति, सं-, परि-, (सूच्, c. 10.),<BR>i. d by curved frowns:<BR>आभुग्नभ्रुकुटीसंसूचितः (ता, तं),<BR>Vi. v. 21.;<BR>(2) व्यनक्ति (व्यञ्ज्, c. 7.),<BR>a cloud<BR>whose interval thunder is i. d by lighting:<BR>विद्यदु-<BR>व्यञ्जितवज्रगर्मजलदः, Vi.;<BR>(3) कथयति (कथ्, c. 10)<BR>(= to speak: q.v.),<BR>i. s the corporeal union of<BR>Śiva and Śivā:<BR>कथयति शिवयोः शरीरयोगम्, Ki. v.<BR>40.;<BR>(4) दर्शयति, प्र-, (c. of दृश्) (= to shew:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indication
INDICATION:<BR>(1) लक्षणम्,<BR>i. of fever:<BR>ज्वरलक्षणम्,<BR>Bha.;<BR>(2) व्यञ्जनम्, ? Ve. vi. 2.: v. Also mark,<BR>sign.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indicative
INDICATIVE:<BR>(1) सूचक (f. चिका),<BR>a noise i. of<BR>man:<BR>शब्दो मानुषसूचकः, A. r.;<BR>(2) व्यञ्जक (f. ञ्जिका),<BR>Kav.;<BR>(3) by verb.<BR>The i. or i. mood:<BR>*प्रवेद-<BR>नायां प्रयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indict
INDICT: समभि- युनक्ति<BR>or<BR>युंक्ते (युज्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>accuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indictable
INDICTABLE: समभियोज्य (f. ज्या); महा (= great)<BR>in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiction
INDICTION: *सूचना; पञ्चदशवर्षमितकालगणनाभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indictment
INDICTMENT: समभियोगः (?),<BR>bill of i.:<BR>*सममियोग-<BR>पत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=374" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indifference
INDIFFERENCE:<BR>I Apathy:<BR>(1) औदास्यम् or<BR>औदासीन्यम्;<BR>(2) उपेक्षा,<BR>harm in i.:<BR>उपेक्षायां दोषः,<BR>M. n.<BR>II Impartiality, evenness: q.v.:<BR>निःसङ्गता।<BR>III Passableness: expr. by adj.:<BR>v. Indifferent (III)<BR>IV Making no differ-<BR>-ence: निर्विशेषः v. Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiffererent
INDIFFERERENT:<BR>I Apathetic:<BR>(1) उदासः (सा, सं);<BR>(2) उदासीनः (ना, नं),<BR>even on an i. son or<BR>minister:<BR>सुतेऽमात्येऽप्युदासीने, H. ii. 134.;<BR>(3)<BR>निरीहः (हा, हं) (= without any effort). To<BR>bei.:<BR>(1) उदास्ते (आस्, c. 2.),<BR>men who are i.<BR>to enemies:<BR>नरोऽरौ य उदासते, Si. ii. 42.;<BR>(2)<BR>उपेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.), who is i. to (your)<BR>loosely<BR>hanging matted hair:<BR>उपेक्षतेयः श्लथलम्बिनीर्जटाः, Ku.<BR>v. 47.<BR>II Impartial, neutral: q.v.: निःसङ्ग<BR>(f. ङ्गा).<BR>III Passable: नात्युत्तमः (मा, मं); नाति-<BR>मन्दः (न्दा, न्दं) (?).<BR>IV Having no differ-<BR>-ence: निर्विशेषः (षा, षं); better by subs: v.<BR>Difference.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indifferently
INDIFFERENTLY,<BR>I Making no difference:<BR>निर्विशेषेण।<BR>II Without concern:<BR>(1) औदास्येन;<BR>(2) उपेक्षया;<BR>(3) by adj.<BR>III Impartially:<BR>q.v.: निःसङ्ग (f. ङ्गा).<BR>IV Passably: यथा<BR> तथा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigence
INDIGENCE, INDIGENCY:<BR>(1) दैन्यम् (= destitu-<BR>-tion);<BR>(2) दारिद्य्रम् (= poverty);<BR>(3) निःस्वता<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigenous
INDIGENOUS:<BR>(1) स्वदेशजः (जा, जं);<BR>(2) स्वदेश-<BR>जातः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) स्वेदेशोद्भवः (वा, वं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigent
INDIGENT:<BR>(1) दीनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) दरिद्रः (द्रा, द्रं);<BR>(3) निःस्वः (स्वा, स्वं);<BR>(4) अकिञ्चनः (ना, नं)<BR>(= having nothing), Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigestible
INDIGESTIBLE:<BR>(1) दुर्जरः (रा, रं) (rare), Sr.;<BR>(2) याः (या, यत्) कृच्छ्रे ण जीर्यति<BR>or<BR>पाकं गच्छति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigestion
INDIGESTION: अजीर्णता, अजीर्णम्, (rarely) अजीर्णाः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indignant
INDIGNANT: संजातमन्यु (mfn.): v. Enraged.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indignantly
INDIGNANTLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indignation
INDIGNATION: prob. मन्युः, अमि- applied<BR>equally to rage and sorrow, B. vi. 30.: v.<BR>Anger, rage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indignity
INDIGNITY: अपमानम्,<BR>pocketing i. ies.:<BR>अपमानं<BR> पुरस्कृत्य, J.: v. Insult.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indigo
INDIGO: नीलम्<BR>or<BR>निली,<BR>dyed with i.:<BR>नीलीरक्तः<BR>(क्ता, क्तं), A.s.;<BR>where i. is sown:<BR>वापिता यत्र<BR> नीली स्यात्, A.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indirect
INDIRECT:<BR>I Not direct: अनृजु (mfn.): v.<BR>Crooked.<BR>II Unfair, dishonest: q.v.:<BR>अनृजु (mfn.).<BR>III Not express: expr. by<BR>adv. Ph.:<BR>i. taxation:<BR>*वक्रकराधानम्; i. speech<BR>(in Gram.): प्रथमपुरुषोक्तिः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indirectly
INDIRECTLY: i.e. not expressly;<BR>(1) कटाक्षेण;<BR>(2) मङ्गया,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscrectness
INDISCRECTNESS:<BR>I Crookedness: q.v.: अनृजुता।<BR>II Unfairness: अनृजुता।<BR>II Of remarks,<BR>etc.: by adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscreet
INDISCREET: अविवेकः (का, कं).: v. Imprudent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscreetly
INDISCREETLY: अविवेकेन: v. Rashly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscretion
INDISCRETION: अविवेकः v. Imprudence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscriminate
INDISCRIMINATE: expr. by adv.: v. Also<BR>promiscuous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiscriminately
INDISCRIMINATELY:<BR>(1) निर्विशेषेण;<BR>(2) अविविच्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indispensible
INDISPENSIBLE:<BR>(1) निरुपेक्षणीयः (या, यं) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>अपरिहार्य (f. र्या) (= what cannot be avoided).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indispensibly
INDISPENSIBLY: expr. by adj., i. necessary:<BR>अत्यावश्यकीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indispose
INDISPOSE: v. Disqualify, disinclined.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indisposed
INDISPOSED:<BR>I Averse: q.v.: विरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR>II In health: किञ्चिदसुस्थः (स्था, स्थं): v.<BR>III<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indisposition
INDISPOSITION:<BR>I Aversion: q.v.: विरक्तिः।<BR>II<BR>Slight illness: असुस्थता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indisputable
INDISPUTABLE:<BR>(1) न विवदितव्य (f. व्या),<BR>S.;<BR>(2) अविवदनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(3) निर्विवादः<BR>(दा, दं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indisputably
INDISPUTABLY: निर्विवादेन, etc.:<BR>i. proved:<BR>अविवाद-<BR>सिद्ध (f. द्धा),<BR>V d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indissoluble
INDISSOLUBLE: अक्षरः (रा, रं); v. Also im-<BR>-perishable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indissolubly
INDISSOLUBLY: अक्षरम् (rare); better by circum-<BR>-lo: v. To dissolve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indistinct
INDISTINCT: अस्पष्ट (f. ष्टा)<BR>or<BR>अविस्पष्ट (f. ष्टा)<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indistinctly
INDISTINCTLY:<BR>(1) अस्पष्टम्;<BR>(2) न विस्पष्टतया, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indistinctness
INDISTINCTNESS:<BR>(1) अस्पष्टता,<BR>(2) न विस्पष्टता: v.<BR>Also confusion, uncertainty, obscurity<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indistinguishable
INDISTINGUISHABLE:<BR>(1) अपरिच्छेद्य (f. द्या);<BR>(2)<BR>परिच्छेत्तुमशक्य (f. क्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=375" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indite
INDITE: लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.): v. To write,<BR>compose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

individual
INDIVIDUAL (subs.): व्यक्तिः: v. Person.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

individual
INDIVIDUAL (adj.):<BR>I Single, one: q.v.<BR>II<BR>Distinctive: व्यक्तिगतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

individuality
INDIVIDUALITY:<BR>I A state of oneness:<BR>पृथक्त्वम्, Par.<BR>II The character of an indi-<BR>-vidual: व्यक्तिगतविशेषः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

individually
INDIVIDUALLY:<BR>I Singly: एकैकशः।<BR>II Inse-<BR>-parably: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indivisibility
INDIVISIBILITY:<BR>(1) अमाज्यता, -त्वम्;<BR>(2) अवि-<BR>माज्यता, त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indivisible
INDIVISIBLE:<BR>(1) अमाज्य (f. ज्या);<BR>(2) अविमाज्य<BR>(f. ज्या), Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indocile
INDOCILE:<BR>(1) अविनेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) अविधेयः<BR>(या, यं);<BR>(3) न वश्य (f. श्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indocility
INDOCILITY:<BR>(1) अविनेयता;<BR>(2) अविवेयता: v.<BR>Intractableness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indoctrinate
INDOCTRINATE: शिक्षापयति (c. of शिक्ष्); v.<BR>To instruct, teach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indolence
INDOLENCE:<BR>(1) तन्द्रा (= sloth);<BR>(2) आलस्यम्<BR>(= idleness);<BR>(3) स्तम्भः (?);<BR>(4) कर्मपराङ्मुरखता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indolent
INDOLENT:<BR>(1) तन्द्रितः (ता, तं) (= slothful);<BR>(2) अलसः (सा, सं) (= idle);<BR>(3) स्तब्ध (f. ब्धा)<BR>(rare), H. ii. 108.;<BR>(4) कार्यपराङ्मुख (f.<BR>खी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indolently
INDOLENTLY: expr. by adj.,<BR>to do i.:<BR>तन्द्रितः<BR> करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indiomitable
INDIOMITABLE:<BR>(1) दुर्दान्त (f. न्ता);<BR>(2) दुर्दमः<BR>(मा, मं);<BR>(3) अदम्य (f. म्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indoor
INDOOR (adj.); गृह- (= house) in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indoorse
INDOORSE, INDORSEMENT: v. Endorse, endorse-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indubitable
INDUBITABLE:<BR>(1) असन्दिग्ध (f. ग्धा);<BR>(2)<BR>निःसन्द्र्हः (हा, हं): v. Undoubted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indubitably
INDUBITABLY:<BR>(1) असंशयम्;<BR>(2) निःसन्देहम्: v.<BR>Undoubtedly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

induce
INDUCE:<BR>I To introduce: q.v.<BR>II To<BR>cause: q.v.: जनयति (c. of जन्).<BR>III To<BR>persuade, urge: q.v.:<BR>(1) प्रवर्तयति (c. of<BR>वृत्);<BR>(2) हरति (हृ, c. 1.) (= allure).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inducement
INDUCEMENT: no exact equiv.: प्रलोभनम्<BR>(= temptation: q.v.:) v. Also motive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

induct
INDUCT: प्रतिष्ठापयति (c. of स्था): v. To con-<BR>-secrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

induction
INDUCTION:<BR>I In philo: बहुदृष्टिमूलमनुमानम्;<BR> *आवहः।<BR>II Formal appointment: प्रतिष्ठापनम्<BR>(?).<BR>III Entrance, beginning, introduc-<BR>-tion: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inductive
INDUCTIVE:<BR>i. philosophy:<BR>*आवहदर्शनम्;<BR>i. reason-<BR>ing:<BR>*आवाहिकतर्कः साधारणदृष्टिमूलस्तर्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indue
INDUE: v. Endue, endow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indulce
INDULCE (v. i.): इन्द्रियुसुखेषु<BR>or<BR>इन्द्रियमोगेषु or<BR>विषयेषु आसक्तः (क्ता, क्तं)<BR>or<BR>निरतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indulge
INDULGE (v. t.):<BR>I To humour: लालयति<BR>(लल्, c. 1.).<BR>II To gratify: q.v.: तोषयति<BR>(c. of तुष्).<BR>III To grant: q.v.: वितरति<BR>(तॄ, c. 1.).<BR>IV To give way: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indulgence
INDULGENCE:<BR>I Humouring: लालनम्।<BR>II<BR>Gratification: q.v.:<BR>i. of passions:<BR>इन्द्रियासक्तिः।<BR>III Favour granted: प्रसादः। Ph.: to treat<BR>with i.: v. To indulge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indulgent
INDULGENT: expr. by verb: v. Also com-<BR>-pliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indulgently
INDULGENTLY: सदयम् (= kindly, mildly: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indurate
INDURATE: कठिनीकरोतिः v. To harden.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

industrious
INDUSTRIOUS:<BR>(1) कर्मिष्ठ (f. ष्ठा);<BR>(2) कर्मठः<BR>(ठा, ठं);<BR>(3) कर्मनिष्ठ (f. ष्ठा);<BR>(4) व्यवसायपरः<BR>(रा, रं);<BR>(5) परिश्रमिन्, (f. णी);<BR>(6) उद्योगिन्<BR>(f. नी); v. Active, diligent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

industriously
INDUSTRIOUSLY:<BR>(1) सोद्योगम्;<BR>(2) उद्यमेन;<BR>(3)<BR>अध्यवसायेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

industry
INDUSTRY:<BR>(1) व्यवसायः<BR>or<BR>अध्यवसायः,<BR>no work<BR>bears fruit without: i.:<BR>व्यवसायं विना कर्म न फलति,<BR>P. ii. 5.;<BR>(2) परिश्रमः (= labour);<BR>(3) उद्योगः<BR>(= effort);<BR>(4) अभियोगः (=diligence);<BR>(5)<BR>कर्मिष्ठता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

indwelling
INDWELLING (adj.):<BR>(1) हृदयस्थ (f. स्था;<BR>(2)<BR>अन्तर्वर्तिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inebriate
INEBRIATE (v.): मत्तीकरोतिः v. To intoxicate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inebriated
INEBRIATED: मत्तः (त्ता, त्तं): v. Drunk.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inebriation
INEBRIATION, INEBRIETY: मत्तता: v. Drunken-<BR>-ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineffable
INEFFABLE:<BR>(1) अनाखयेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>अनिर्वचनीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineffably
INEFFABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=376" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineffective
INEFFECTIVE: expr. by effective and not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineffectively
INEFFECTIVELY:<BR>(1) निष्फलम्;<BR>(2) व्यर्र्गम्: v. In<BR>vain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineffectual
INEFFECTUAL: निष्फलः (ला, लं): v. Fruitless.<BR>To make i.:<BR>मोघीकरोतिः v. To frustrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inefectually
INEFECTUALLY: निष्फलम्: v. Fruitlessly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inefficacious
INEFFICACIOUS:<BR>(1) न फलवत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) न<BR> गुणवत् (f. ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inefficacy
INEFFICACY:<BR>(1) निष्फलवत्ता;<BR>(2) निर्गुणवत्ता;<BR>(3)<BR>better by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inefficiency
INEFFICIENCY: असामर्थ्यम् (= incapacity): v.<BR>Efficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inefficient
INEFFICIENT:<BR>(1) कार्याक्षमः (मा, मं);<BR>(2) अदक्ष<BR>(f. क्षा) (= not expert);<BR>(3) अक्षमः (मा,<BR> मं) (= incapable^1).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inelegance
INELEGANCE:<BR>(1) अलावण्यम्;<BR>(2) अमाघुर्यम्: v.<BR>Elegance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inelegant
INELEGANT:<BR>(1) असुन्दरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) अमधुरः<BR>(रा, रं): v. Elegance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inelegantly
INELEGANTLY: कर्कशम् (harshly, roughly: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineligibility
INELIGIBILITY, INELIGIBLE: V. Eligibility,<BR>eligible; not.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineloquent
INELOQUENT: अप्रौढ (f. ढा) (?): v. Eloquent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inept
INEPT:<BR>I Improper: q.v.: अनुचितः (ता, तं).<BR>II Foolish, useless: q.v.: expr. by मूर्खता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ineptitude
INEPTITUDE:<BR>I Unfiyness: q.v.: अयोग्यता।<BR>II Foolish, useless: q.v.: expr. by मूर्खता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inequality
INEQUALITY: वैषम्यम्: v. Difference, equality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inert
INERT:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) जडः (डा, डं): v. Also<BR>immoveable.<BR>II Inactive: q.v.: जडः (डा, डं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inertia
INERTIA, INERTNESS: जाड्यम्<BR>or<BR>जडताः v. Also<BR>inactivity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inertly
INERTLY: जाड्येनः v. Slowly, indolently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inestimable
INESTIMABLE:<BR>(1) अगण्य (f. ण्या);<BR>(2) अनिरूप्य<BR>(f. प्या): v. Also invaluable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inevitable
INEVITABLE:<BR>(1) अवश्यम्माविन् (f. नी) (what<BR>must befall);<BR>(2) अपरिहार्य (f. र्या) (= un-<BR>-avoidable);<BR>(3) अनिवार्य (f. र्या) (= irre-<BR>-sistible).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inevitableness
INEVITABLENESS:<BR>(1) अवश्यम्भाविता;<BR>(2) अपरि-<BR>हार्यता;<BR>(3) अनिवार्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inevitably
INEVITABLY:<BR>(1) अवश्यम्: v. Must;<BR>(2)<BR>नियतम्: v. Certainly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexact
INEXACT: अयथार्थ (f. र्था): v. Also incorrect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexcusable
INEXCUSABLE:<BR>(1) अमर्षणीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>अक्षन्तव्य (f. व्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexcusably
INEXCUSABLY: विना केनापि कारणेन: v. Also<BR>excuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexhaustible
INEXHAUSTIBLE: अक्षयः (या, यं)<BR>or<BR>अक्षय्य (f.<BR>य्या), Me. ii. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexistence
INEXISTENCE: नास्तित्वम्, -ता, D. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexorable
INEXORABLE:<BR>(1) नानुरोध्य (f. ध्या) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>कठिनः (ना, नं) (= hard): v. Also impla-<BR>-cable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexorably
INEXORABLY:<BR>(1) निश्चलम् (= immoveably);<BR>(2) कठिनम् (= hardly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpediency
INEXPEDIENCY: अयोग्यता: v. Unfitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpedient
INEXPEDIENT: अयोग्य (f. ग्या): v. Unfit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexperience
INEXPERIENCE: अल्पदर्शिताः v. Experience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexperienced
INEXPERIENCED: अदृष्टकार्य (f. र्या): v. Experi<BR>enced.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpert
INEXPERT:<BR>(1) अदक्ष (f. क्षा);<BR>(2) अकुशलः (ला,<BR> लं): v. Expert.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpiable
INEXPIABLE:<BR>(1) अशोधनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>अमार्जनीयः (या, यं)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexplicable
INEXPLICABLE:<BR>(1) अव्याख्येयः (या, यं) (?);<BR>(2) दुर्व्याख्य (f. ख्या) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexplicably
INEXPLICABLY: prob. व्याख्यवां<BR>or<BR>विवृतिम् अतिक्रम्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpressible
INEXPRESSIBLE: अनाख्येयः (या, यं): v. Indes-<BR>-cribable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpressibly
INEXPRESSIBLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inexpressive
INEXPRESSIVE: अवाचकः (f. चिका): v. Ex-<BR>-pressive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inextiricable
INEXTIRICABLE:<BR>(1) अनिर्वाण्य (f. ण्या) (lit.);<BR>(2) अनुच्छेद्य (f. द्या) (fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inextricable
INEXTRICABLE:<BR>(1) अनुद्धरणीयः (या, यं;)<BR>(2)<BR>अमोच्य (f. च्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infalibility
INFALIBILITY:<BR>(1) अपातुकता (?); अभ्रान्तिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infallible
INFALLIBLE:<BR>I अपतनशीलः (ला, लं) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>अभ्रान्त (f. न्ता) (= unerring).<BR>II Certain:<BR>q.v.: घ्रुवः (वा, वं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infallibly
INFALLIBLY: घ्रुवम् (= certainly, rarely: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infamous
INFAMOUS:<BR>I Of acts:<BR>(1) अयशस्य (f. स्या),<BR>cruel and i.:<BR>नृशंसमयशस्यं च, Ram.;<BR>(2) अ- or<BR>अप-यशस्करः (री, रं);<BR>(3) अकीर्तिकरः (री, रं);<BR>(4) यशोघ्न (f. घ्नी).<BR>II Of men:<BR>(1) अ- or [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">Page378</a>]<BR>अप-यशस्विन्, (f. नी);<BR>(2) दुष्कीर्तिमत् (f. ती);<BR>(3) दुर्वृत्त (f. त्ता): v. Abandoned, wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=377" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infamously
INFAMOUSLY:<BR>(1) कीर्तिमुच्छेद्य;<BR>(2) यशो हत्वा;<BR>(3) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infamy
INFAMY:<BR>(1) अयशस् (n.),<BR>what i. is more horrible<BR>than this:<BR>किमयशो ननु घोरमतःपरम्, U. iii.;<BR>the<BR>i. was avoided and cast on us:<BR>परिहृतमयशः<BR> पातितमस्मासु च, Mu. ii.;<BR>to drink the poison<BR>of i.:<BR>अयशोविषं पिबति, Mr. z.;<BR>(2) अपयशस् (n.);<BR>(3) अकीर्तिः;<BR>(4) अख्यातिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infancy
INFANCY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) शौशवम्, and until (he)<BR>passes i. (comes to age): यावच्चातीतशैशवः, M. viii.<BR>27.;<BR>(2) बाल्यम्,<BR>i. childhood, and youth:<BR>बाल्य-<BR>कौमारयौवनम्, B. p.<BR>II Fig.: प्रथमावस्था।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infant
INFANT (subs.):<BR>(1) शिशुः, i. child of a Brahmin:<BR>शिशुर्द्विजस्य, U.;<BR>(2) बालः (f. ला) (= child),<BR>he while an i. was...:<BR>स बाल आसीत्, Si. i. 70.;<BR>(3) दारकः f. रिका),<BR>saw an i. crying:<BR>कमपि दारकं<BR> रुदन्तमद्राक्षम्, D. iv.;<BR>(4) अर्भकः (rare), R. iii.<BR>25.;<BR>(5) डिम्भ (f. म्मा) (in joke or con-<BR>-tempt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infant
INFANT (adj.): by comp.,<BR>i. lessons:<BR>बालपाठ्यानि,<BR>V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infanticide
INFANTICIDE:<BR>I The crime: बालहत्या and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR>II The criminal: शिशुघातिन् (f.<BR>नी) and sim. comp.s.: v. Killer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infantile
INFANTILE, INFANTINE: बालेयः (या, यं): v.<BR>Infant (adj.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infantry
INFANTRY:<BR>(1) पत्तिः or in pl. पत्तयः<BR>or<BR>पत्तिसैन्यम्;<BR>(2) पदातयः (m. pl.)<BR>or<BR>पदातिबलम्<BR>or<BR>पादातम्<BR>(rare), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infatuate
INFATUATE: मोहयति, सं-, परि-, (c. of मुह्),<BR>i. ing:<BR>परिमोहिन् (f. नी), Ki. xiv. 19.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infantuated
INFANTUATED: मूढः (ढा, ढं), वि-, सं-: v.<BR>Foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infantuation
INFANTUATION: मोहः, सं-, व्या-,<BR>what i.:<BR>को व्यामोहः:<BR>v. Foolishness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infeasibility
INFEASIBILITY: असाध्यताः v. Impossibility.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infeasible
INFEASIBLE: असाध्य (f. ध्या): v. Impossible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infect
INFECT:<BR>I In gen.: द्वषयति (c. of दुष्): v.<BR>To correct.<BR>II Of disease: expr. by<BR>स्पर्शेन सञ्चरति (the disease i. ing being the<BR>nom.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infection
INFECTION:<BR>I Lit.: स्पर्शसंचारः।<BR>II Fig.:<BR>expr. by सांक्रामिकः (की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infectious
INFECTIOUS:<BR>(1) स्पर्शसम्चारिन् (f. णी),<BR>the disease<BR>was i.:<BR>आमयः स्पर्शसंचारी, Raj.;<BR>(2) सांक्रामिकः<BR>(की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infelicity
INFELICITY: असुखम् -ता: v. Unhappiness,<BR>misery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infer
INFER: अनुमिमीते (मा, c. 3.);<BR>(2) ऊहते (= to<BR>guess).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inferable
INFERABLE:<BR>(1) अनुमेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) आनुमानिकः<BR>(की, कं) (= inferential).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inference
INFERENCE:<BR>(1) अनुमानम्, i. is of there kinds-<BR>antecedent (or a priori: where an effect is inferred<BR>from its cause), consequent (or a posteriori: where<BR>a cause is deduced from its effect), and analogous<BR>(where an object is guessed from common sign):<BR>त्रिविधमनुमानं पूर्ववत् (यत्र कारणेन कार्यमनुमीयते), शेषवत्<BR>(यत्र कार्येण कारणमनुमीयते), सामान्यतोदृष्टञ्च (यत्र<BR> लिङ्गस्य सामान्यात्॥॥लिङ्गी गम्यते), N. d.;<BR>(2)<BR>अनुमितिः (rare). To draw an i.: v. To infer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inferentially
INFERENTIALLY: अनुमानेन, S.; अनुमानपूर्वकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inferior
INFERIOR:<BR>(1) हीनः (ना, नं),<BR>from association<BR>with i. s.:<BR>हीनैः सह समागमात्, H.;<BR>a man of i.<BR>caste:<BR>हीनवर्णः, H.;<BR>but little i. to them:<BR>किन्तु<BR> किञ्चित्तेभ्यो हीनाः, Bha.;<BR>(2) ऊनः (ना, नं) (in<BR>comp.),<BR>not i. in qualities:<BR>गुणैरनूनः (ना, नं),<BR>R.;<BR>not i. to Chaitraratha:<BR>चैत्ररथादनूनः (ना, नं),<BR>R. vi. 50.: v. Also low, bad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inferior
INFERIOR, BE: हीयते, परि-, (pass. of हा),<BR>Your<BR>majesty is not i. to the ancient in good qualities:<BR>न पूर्वमनुष्येभ्यो गुणैः परिहीयते देवः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infernal
INFERNAL:<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) नारकः (की,<BR> कं), taken away to know the taste of i. tortures:<BR>कारणानां नारकीनां रसज्ञानायपनौतः, D. vii. I.<BR>regions: v. Hell.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infernally
INFERNALLY: expr. by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infertile
INFERTILE: अश्स्यप्रदः (दा, दं): v. Fertile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infest
INFEST:<BR>(1) बाधते (बाध्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>annoy;<BR>(2) व्याप्नोति (आप्, c. 5.) (= to<BR>pervade),<BR>the son of Parvata is indeed i. ed<BR>with my men:<BR>मद्भृत्यैः किल नाम पर्वसुतो व्याप्तः,<BR>Mu. iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infidel
INFIDEL: नास्तिकः may be used in every sense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=378" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infidelity
INFIDELITY:<BR>(1) नास्तिकता (?);<BR>(2) अश्रद्धा<BR>(= unbelief).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infinite
INFINITE:<BR>(1) अनन्तः (न्ता, न्तं) (= endless);<BR>(2) अमेयः (या, यं) (= unmeasurable). Ph.:<BR>it is i.:<BR>अस्येयत्ता नास्ति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infinitely
INFINITELY:<BR>(1) अनन्तम्;<BR>(2) अनन्तगुणम्, Vi.<BR>vi. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infinitive
INFINITIVE: *क्रियावाचकः; तुम् (in Sanskrit con-<BR>-jugation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infinity
INFINITY:<BR>(1) अनन्तता;<BR>(2) अमेयता;<BR>(3)<BR>असीमता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infirm
INFIRM: दुर्बलः (ला, लं): v. Feeble, weak.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infirmary
INFIRMARY: *दुर्बलाश्रमः v. Also hospital.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infirmity
INFIRMITY:<BR>(1) दुर्बलता;<BR>(2) दौर्बल्यम्: v. Weak-<BR>-ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflame
INFLAME:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) संधुक्षयति (c. of<BR>धुक्ष्),<BR>he whose fire of passion was thus i. d.:<BR>इथ्यं<BR> संधुक्षितमन्मथाग्निः D. ii.;<BR>(2) उद्दीपयति (c. of<BR>दीप्): v. To kindle:<BR>(3) ज्वलयति (c. of<BR>(ज्वल्),<BR>i. d. with rage:<BR>कोपज्वलितः (ता, तं), Ki.<BR>iii. 20.: v. To burn;<BR>(4) उत्तेजयति (तिज्,<BR>c. 10.): v. To excite.<BR>II In medical<BR>sense: दाहं जनयति (c. of जन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflammable
INFLAMMABLE: यः (या, यत्) शीघ्रं संधुक्ष्यते: v.<BR>Combustible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflammation
INFLAMMATION: दाहः,<BR>i. of the eyes:<BR>नयनयोर्दाहः,<BR>Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflammatory
INFLAMMATORY:<BR>I Lit.: by comp., i. fever:<BR>दाहज्वरः। I. (medicine): दीपनः (ना, नं), Bha.<BR>II Seditious: q.v.: perh संधुक्षक (f. क्षिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflate
INFLATE: आ-धमति (ध्मा, c. 1.), i. d. with pride:<BR>दर्पाध्मातः (ता, तं);<BR>i. d. for nothing:<BR>मिथ्याध्मातः,<BR>Vi. iii. 28.: v. Also flate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflation
INFLATION: उत्सेकः: v. Pride.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflect
INFLECT:<BR>I In gram.: रूयम् आख्याति (ख्या,<BR>c. 2.), ब्रविति (ब्रू, c. 2.), etc.: v. To say.<BR>II To bend: q.v.: नमयति (c. of नम्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflection
INFLECTION: रूपाख्यानम्: v. Declension, con-<BR>-jugation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflexibility
INFLEXIBILITY:<BR>(1) अनम्यता;<BR>(2) दुरानम्यता: v.<BR>Firmness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflexible
INFLEXIBLE:<BR>(1) अनम्य (f. म्या);<BR>(2) दुरानम्य<BR>(f. म्या): v. Also firm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflexible
INFLEXIBLE: v. Firmly, obstinately.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflexion
INFLEXION: v. Inflection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflict
INFLICT:<BR>to i. punishment:<BR>दण्डं प्रणयति (नी, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>पातयति (c. of पत्): v. To impose, apply.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infliction
INFLICTION:<BR>I The act:<BR>i. of punishment:<BR>दण्ड-<BR>प्रणयनम्;<BR>i. of torment:<BR>यातनाप्रयोगः।<BR>II Punish-<BR>-ment: q.v.: दण्डः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inflorescence
INFLORESCENCE: *पौष्पितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

influence
INFLUENCE (subs.):<BR>I In gen.: no exact<BR>equiv.:<BR>(1) बलम् (= force), by divine i.:<BR>दैवबलात्;<BR>(2) प्रभावः (= power),<BR>under the i. of the<BR>sage:<BR>ऋषिप्रमावात्, R.;<BR>(3) प्रभुत्वम् (= mastery),<BR>as they had no i.:<BR>अप्रभुत्वात्, D. i.;<BR>(4) वशम्<BR>(= subjection), a man under the i. of a woman:<BR>स्त्रीवशः, P.;<BR>(5) गौरवम् (weight),<BR>he has great i.<BR>with the king:<BR>राजन्निधौ महागौरवं तस्य।<BR>II Dis-<BR>-tinction: प्रत्रिष्ठा,<BR>a man of i.:<BR>प्रतिष्ठापन्नो जनः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

influence
INFLUENCE (v.):<BR>(1) चालयति (c. of चल्) (= to<BR>move);<BR>(2) प्रवर्तयति (c. of वृत्) (= to<BR>induce);<BR>(3) प्रणेदयति (नुद्, c. 10.) (= to<BR>impel). I. d. by = under the i. of: v.<BR>Subs.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

influential
INFLUENTIAL:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठापन्नः (न्ना, न्नं);<BR>(2) गौरव-<BR>भाज् (mfn.);<BR>(3) प्रभविष्णु (mfn.): v. Power-<BR>-ful, master.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

influenza
INFLUENZA: सर्वप्रभवः<BR>or<BR>सर्वजः प्रतिश्यायः, Sr. (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

influx
INFLUX:<BR>(1) आवेशः;<BR>(2) आगमः (= coming in).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infold
INFOLD: परिवेष्टयति (वेष्ट्, c. 10.): v. Encircle,<BR>embrace.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infoliate
INFOLIATE: पत्रावृतं (f. तां)<BR>or<BR>पत्रान्वितं (f. तां)<BR>करोति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inform
INFORM:<BR>I To form: q.v.<BR>II To animate:<BR>q.v.<BR>III To tell:<BR>(1) वि-ज्ञापयति (c. of ज्ञा),<BR>i. with my respects:<BR>विज्ञापय प्रापितमत्प्रणामः, R.<BR>xiv. 60.;<BR>(2) नि-वेदयति, आ-, (c. of विद्),<BR>otherwise I will i. the Court (against you): अन्यथा<BR> राजकुले निवेदयिष्यामि, P. i. 21.: v. Also to<BR>announce, say.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

informal
INFORMAL: अवैधिकः (की, कं)<BR>or<BR>विधिविरुद्ध (f.<BR>द्धा) (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

informality
INFORMALITY: अवैधता (?); सदोषता (= faulti-<BR>-ness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

informally
INFORMALLY: अविधिक्रमेण (?); सदोषम् (= faultily).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=379" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

informant
INFORMANT: विज्ञापक (f. पिका);<BR>(2) निवेदक or<BR>आवेदक (f. दिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

information
INFORMATION:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) विज्ञापनम्;<BR>(2)<BR>निवेदनम्<BR>or<BR>आवेदनम्।<BR>II Legal: नि-वेदनम्।<BR>III<BR>News: q.v.: वार्ता।<BR>IV Knowledge: q.v.:<BR>(1) ज्ञानम्;<BR>(2) बोधः;<BR>(3) आगमः (rare), his i. is<BR>like (his)<BR>wisdom:<BR>प्रज्ञया सदृशागमः, R. i. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

informer
INFORMER: आवेदकः, Mit.<BR>Common i.:<BR>सूचकः;<BR>professional i.:<BR>स्तोमकः, Kat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infraction
INFRACTION: लङ्घनम्: v. Violation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infrequency
INFREQUENCY: विरलता: v. Rareness, fre-<BR>-quency (not).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infrequently
INFREQUENTLY: विरलः (ला, लं): v. Rare, fre-<BR>-quent (not).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infrequently
INFREQUENTLY: कदाचित्: v. Rarely, some-<BR>-times.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infringe
INFRINGE:<BR>I To violate: q.v.: लङ्घ्वयति (लङ्घ्व,<BR>c. 10.).<BR>II To encroach. q.v.: expr. by<BR>ग्र्ह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infringement
INFRINGEMENT: लङ्घनम्: v. Violation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infuriate
INFURIATE (v.): उत्-कोपयति (c. of कुप्): v.<BR>To enrage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infuriate
INFURIATE, -D (adj.): क्रोधान्ध (f. न्धा): v.<BR>Enraged, mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infuse
INFUSE:<BR>I To pour in: निषिञ्चति (सिच्, c.<BR>6.).<BR>II To inspire: आदधाति, सम्-, (धा, c.)<BR>3.), by i. ing good breeding among the people:<BR>प्रजानां विनयाघानात्, R. i. 24.<BR>III For<BR>medical purpose: साधयति (C. of सिध्),<BR>is<BR>to be i. d. in eight-fold water:<BR>जलेऽष्टगुणिते साध्यम्,<BR>Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

infusion
INFUSION:<BR>I Pouring in: नीषेकः।<BR>II Inspi-<BR>-ration: आधानम्, सम्-।<BR>III A liquid obtained<BR>by i.:<BR>(1) जलम् (= water),<BR>i. of rice:<BR>तण्डुल-<BR>जलम्, Bha.;<BR>(2) क्वाथः (= decoction).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingathering
INGATHERING: (शस्य-) संग्रहः। Feast of i.:<BR>नवान्नम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenerate
INGENERATE: जनयति (c. of जन्): v. To<BR>beget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenious
INGENIOUS:<BR>(1) प्रवीण (f. णा);<BR>(2) विदग्ध (f.<BR>ग्धा): v. Clever, dexterous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingeniously
INGENIOUSLY:<BR>(1) प्रावीण्येन;<BR>(2) विदग्धम्: v.<BR>Dexterously, skilfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenuity
INGENUITY:<BR>(1) प्रावीण्यम्;<BR>(2) वैदग्ध्यम्: v.<BR>Dexterity, skill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenuous
INGENUOUS:<BR>I Noble: q.v.: अभिजातः (ता, तं).<BR>II Frank, generous: q.v.: उदारः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenuously
INGENUOUSLY: औदार्येण: v. Frankly, liberally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingenuousness
INGENUOUSNESS: औदार्यम्: v. Frankness, libera-<BR>-lity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingle
INGLE: अग्निः: v. Fire, fire-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inglorious
INGLORIOUS: अयशस्य (f. स्या): v. Infamous,<BR>glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingloriously
INGLORIOUSLY: v. Infamous, glorious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingloriously
INGLORIOUSLY: v. Infamously, disgracefully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingot
INGOT: पिण्ड (mfn.),<BR>i. of gold:<BR>हिरण्यपिण्डम्, N.<BR>xxii. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingraft
INGRAFT: निवेशयति (c. of विश्) (= to insert:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingrained
INGRAINED: दृढरञ्जितः (ता, तं) (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingrate
INGRATE, INGRATEFUL: 1. Ungrateful: q.v.:<BR>अकृतज्ञ (f. ज्ञा).<BR>II Unpleasant: q.v.:<BR>अहृद्य (f. द्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingratiate
INGRATIATE:<BR>he i. d himself with the king:<BR>सराज-<BR>प्रसादमाजनं बभूवः v. Favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingratitude
INGRATITUDE:<BR>(1) अकृतज्ञता;<BR>(2) अकृतवेदिता;<BR>(3)<BR>कृतघ्नता (= treachery).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingredient
INGREDIENT:<BR>(1) साधनम् (?); वस्तु (n.) (when<BR>the sense is clear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingress
INGRESS:<BR>(1) प्रवेशः, -नम्;<BR>(2) by verb,<BR>no one is<BR>allowed i. or regress:<BR>न कोऽपि निष्क्रभितुं प्रवेष्टुं<BR> वानुमोद्यते, Mu.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ingraft
INGRAFT: ग्रसते (ग्रस्, c. 1.): v. To swallow,<BR>overwhelm.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhabit
INHABIT: वसति, नि-, (with loc.), अधि-, (with<BR>acc.), (वस्, c. 1.): v. To dwell, live (III).<BR>Thickly i. ed:<BR>जनाकीर्ण (f. र्णा) (?). Thinly i. ed<BR>विरलजनः (ना, नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhabitable
INHABITABLE:<BR>(1) वासयोग्य (f. ग्या), निवासार्ह<BR>(f. र्हा) and sim. comp.s., the earth is not i.:<BR>न वासयोग्य वसुधा, N. i. 138.;<BR>(2) वा(व) स्तव्य (f.<BR>व्या);<BR>(3) वासतेयः (यी, यं) (rare), B.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhabitant
INHABITANT:<BR>(1) नि-वासिन् (f. नी),<BR>by the i. s<BR>of the earth, sky and heaven:<BR>क्षितिनमःसुरलोक-<BR>निवासिमिः, Ki. v. 3.;<BR>(2) occasionally by<BR>deriv.,<BR>i. of Oudh:<BR>आयोध्यिकः, U.; i. of this [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">Page381</a>]<BR>place:<BR>इहत्यः, D. iii. N. B. The names of coun-<BR>-tries (not towns) in Sanskrit denote also<BR>their i. s.:<BR>i. s. of Persia:<BR>पारसिका: (m. pl.);<BR>i. s.<BR>of Videha:<BR>विदेहाः, “अद्यैव प्रहारवर्मण्यधि विदेहा<BR> जाताः” D. iii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=380" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhalation
INHALATION:<BR>the external air inhaled by spirit<BR>is i., the internal air exhaled is exhalation:<BR>प्राणो<BR> यद्वाह्यं वायुमाचामति स श्वासः, यत्कौष्ठ्यं वायुं निःसार-<BR>यति स प्रश्वासः, P. d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhale
INHALE: आचामति (चम्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>प्रवेशयति (c.<BR>of विश्), com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inharimonious
INHARIMONIOUS: विस्वरः (रा, रं): v. Harmo-<BR>-nic, harmonious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inharmoniously
INHARMONIOUSLY: विस्वरम्, after C.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhere
INHERE:<BR>(1) वसति, नि-, (वस्, c. 2.),<BR>for excel-<BR>lences i. in affection not in things:<BR>वसन्ति हि प्रेभ्णि<BR> गुणाः न वस्तुनि, Ki. viii. 37.;<BR>(2) तिष्ठति (स्था c.<BR>1.) (= to remain: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inherent
INHERENT: expr. by inhere (= be i.) or by<BR>nature<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inherently
INHERENTLY: प्रकृत्या (= naturally: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inherit
INHERIT: expr. by प्राप्नोति (आप्, c. 5.): v.<BR>To get, possess.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inheritance
INHERITANCE:<BR>I Heritage:<BR>(1) दायः,<BR>divi-<BR>sion of i.:<BR>दायभागः, Da.;<BR>(2) ऋक्थम्,<BR>sharing an<BR>i.:<BR>ऋक्थमागिन् (f. नी), Y.<BR>II Act. of inheri-<BR>-ting: ऋक्थग्रहणम्, Viv. and sim. comp.s.<BR>III Possession, employment: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inheritor
INHERITOR: दायादः: v. Heir.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhibit
INHIBIT: नियच्छति (यम्, c. 1.): v. To check,<BR>restrain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhibition
INHIBITION: निषेधः (= prohibition).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhospitable
INHOSPITABLE: आतिथ्यविमुखः (खा, खं) v.<BR>Hospitable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhospitably
INHOSPITABLY: अनादरेण (= without attention).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhospitability
INHOSPITABILITY: आतिथ्यविमुखता and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhuman
INHUMAN: निर्दयः (या, यं): v. Cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhumanity
INHUMANITY: निर्दयता; v. Cruelly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhumanly
INHUMANLY: निर्दयम्: v. Cruelly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inhume
INHUME: निदधाति (धा, c. 3.): v. To bury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inimical
INIMICAL: अहितः (ता, तं): v. Hostile, un-<BR>-friendly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inimically
INIMICALLY:<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) अहितबुद्ध्या;<BR>(3) शत्रुवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inimitable
INIMITABLE:<BR>(1) अनुपमः (मा, मं): v. Incom-<BR>-parable;<BR>(2) असाधारण (f. णा): v. Uncom-<BR>-mon;<BR>(3) नानुकरणीयः (या, यं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inimitably
INIMITABLY: by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iniquitous
INIQUITOUS: अन्याय्य (f. य्या): v. Unjust,<BR>wicked.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iniquitously
INIQUITOUSLY: अन्यायतः<BR>or<BR>अन्यायेनः v. Wick-<BR>-edly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iniquity
INIQUITY:<BR>(1) अन्यायः;<BR>(2) अन्याय्यता: v. Wick-<BR>-edness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

initial
INITIAL (adj.): आदि- in comp.: v. First.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

initial
INITIAL (subs.): आद्यक्षरम्;<BR>(2) आदिवर्णः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

initiate
INITIATE:<BR>I To begin: q.v.: आरभते (रभ्, c.<BR>1.).<BR>II To instruct: q.v.: उपदिशति (दिश्,<BR>c. 6.).<BR>I. d.:<BR>दीक्षितः (ता, तं) (?).<BR>III To<BR>admit: q.v.: परिगृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

initiation
INITIATION:<BR>I Beginning: q.v.: आरम्भः।<BR>III<BR>Instruction:<BR>(1) उपदेशः;<BR>(2) दीक्षा (in sacri-<BR>-fices);<BR>(3) उपनयः, -नम् (of the first three<BR>castes with customary thread).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

initiatory
INITIATORY: expr. by comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inject
INJECT:<BR>(1) प्रवेशयति (c. of विश्);<BR>(2) निक्षिपति<BR>(क्षिप्, c. 6.): v. To throw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injection
INJECTION:<BR>I The act: प्रवेशनम्।<BR>II A clyster:<BR>वस्तिः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injudicious
INJUDICIOUS: अविवेकः (का, कं) (= imprudent:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injudiciously
INJUDICIOUSLY:<BR>(1) अविचार्य;<BR>(2) अविवेच्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injudiciousness
INJUDICIOUSNESS: अविवेकिता: v. Imprudence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injunction
INJUNCTION: शासनम्: v. Order, command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injure
INJURE:<BR>(1) अपकरोति (कृ, c. 8.);<BR>(2) क्षतं<BR> करोति, Kat.;<BR>(3) पीडयति (पीड्, c. 10.),<BR>who<BR>i. their own nest-trees:<BR>निजनीडद्रुमपीडिनः, N.;<BR>(4)<BR>हिनस्ति (हिंस्, c. 7.) (a much stronger<BR>term: often = to kill),<BR>he i. s all enemies of<BR>the Vedas:<BR>ब्रह्मद्विषो ह्ये ष हिनस्ति सर्वान्, Vi. i. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injurer
INJURER:<BR>(1) अपकर्तृ (f. त्री)<BR>or<BR>अपकारस्य कारक<BR>(f. रिका), Y.;<BR>(2) अनिष्टकारिन् (f. णी);<BR>(3)<BR>पीडयितृ (f. त्री)<BR>or<BR>पीडक (f. डिका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injurious
INJURIOUS:<BR>(1) अनिष्टकरः (री, रं) (= causing<BR>evil);<BR>(2) हानिकरः (री, रं) (= causing loss): [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">Page382</a>]<BR>(1) पीडाकरः (री, रं),<BR>throwing i things on a<BR>house:<BR>गृहे पीडाकरं द्रव्यं प्रक्षिपन्, V. s.;<BR>(4) बाधक<BR>(f. धिका),<BR>slightly i.:<BR>अल्पबाधः (धा, धं), N. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=381" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injuriously
INJURIOUSLY: expr. by pres. part or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injuriousness
INJURIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) पीडाकरता;<BR>(2) बाधकता,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injury
INJURY:<BR>I Harm:<BR>(1) अपकारः;<BR>(2) पीडा,<BR>from<BR>which there is much good and little i. to the far-<BR>mer:<BR>येन बहुतर उपकारः क्षेत्रस्वामिनश्चाल्पा पीडा, Viv.:<BR>(3) बाधा।<BR>II Hurt: क्षतम्<BR>or<BR>क्षतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

injustice
INJUSTICE:<BR>(1) अधर्मः (= ambiguous);<BR>(2)<BR>अन्यायः (= iniquity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ink
INK: मसि<BR>or<BR>मसी (also written with श and ष).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inkling
INKLING: वार्तामात्रावबोधनम्, D. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inkstand
INKSTAND: मसीपात्रम्, Mu. i.; मसीमाजनम्; and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inland
INLAND:<BR>I Lit.: आभ्यन्तरिकः (की, कं).<BR>II<BR>Domestic: देशीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inlay
INLAY:<BR>(1) प्रतिवपतिः (वप्, c. 1.), Si. iii. 5.;<BR>(2) अवनह्यति (नह्, c. 10.),<BR>rubies i. d on brace-<BR>lets:<BR>वलयावनद्धताम्राश्म-, Si. iii. 7.: v. To set.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inlayer
INLAYER: प्रतिवप्तृ (f. त्री): v. Setter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inly
INLY: अन्तर् (indec.): v. Internal, internally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inmate
INMATE: expr. by निवसति (वस्, c. 1.) (= to<BR>dwell); परिजनः (of the menials), ’येन तस्य<BR> गृहं प्रविश्य परिजनस्योपमर्दः क्रियते”, Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inmost
INMOST:<BR>“to prey on the i. vitals:”<BR>हृदयमर्माणि<BR> छिनत्ति, U.,<BR>or<BR>अन्त्रभेदनं करोति, Vi.;<BR>in the i.<BR>heart:<BR>हृदयोदरे (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inn
INN:<BR>(1) पथिकाश्रमः;<BR>(2) पान्थावासः। I. (of court):<BR>मठः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innate
INNATE: सहजः (जा, जं): v. Natural.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innately
INNATELY:<BR>(1) by adj.:<BR>(2) प्रकृत्या: v.<BR>Naturally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inner
INNER: अन्तर्- in comp.,<BR>i. appartments:<BR>अन्तःपुरम्,<BR>Ku. vii. 2.;<BR>the i. soul:<BR>अन्तरात्मा, U. iii. 37.:<BR>v. Internal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innermost
INNERMOST: v. Inner, inmost.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inn-keeper
INN-KEEPER: *आवासिकः (after शौण्डिकः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innocence
INNOCENCE:<BR>I Of men etc.:<BR>(1) निरापराधता;<BR>(2) अनपराधिता।<BR>II of acts etc.:<BR>(1) निर्दोषता;<BR>(2) अनवद्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innocent
INNOCENT:<BR>I Of men etc.: निरपराधः (धा, धं),<BR>the killer of the i. royal race:<BR>निरपराधराजकुलकदनः,<BR>Vi. iii.: v. Guiltless.<BR>II Of acts etc.:<BR>(1) निर्दोषः (षा, षं) (without fault);<BR>(2)<BR>निरवद्य (f. द्या) (against which nothing can<BR>be said),<BR>hurting i. grass:<BR>अनवद्यतृणार्दिनः, N.<BR>ii. 10.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innocently
INNOCENTLY:<BR>(1) निरपराधम्;<BR>(2) निर्दोषम्;<BR>(3)<BR>निरवद्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innocuous
INNOCUOUS: निर्दोषः (षा, षं);<BR>(2) अदोषलः (ला,<BR> लं) (rare), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innocuously
INNOCUOUSLY:<BR>(1) निर्दोषम्;<BR>(2) निरपराधम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innovate
INNOVATE: नूतनरीतिं<BR>or<BR>नव्यप्रथां प्रवर्तयति (c. of<BR>वृत्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innovation
INNOVATION:<BR>I The act: expr. by verb.<BR>II Change: नव्या रीतिः: v. New.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innovator
INNOVATOR: नव्यप्रथाप्रवर्तकः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innoxious
INNOXIOUS:<BR>(1) अहिंसक (f. सिका) (of animals);<BR>(2) निर्दोषः (षा, षं) (of things).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innuendo
INNUENDO: वक्रोक्तिः: v. Hint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innumerable
INNUMERABLE:<BR>(1) असंख्य (f. ख्या);<BR>(2)<BR>संख्यातीतः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) अगण्य (f. ण्या);<BR>(4)<BR>असंख्येयः (या, यं);<BR>(5) अतीतसंख्य (f. ख्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

innumerableness
INNUMERABLENESS:<BR>(1) असंख्यता;<BR>(2) अगण्यता;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inobservable
INOBSERVABLE:<BR>(1) अलक्ष्य (f. क्ष्या);<BR>(2) दुर्लक्ष्य<BR>(f. क्ष्या), Ki. xvii. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inoculate
INOCULATE:<BR>I To insert: निवेशयति (c. of<BR>विश्).<BR>II In medicine: (शीतलाबीजं) निवे-<BR>शयति (with loc.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inoculation
INOCULATION:<BR>I In gen.: निवेशनम्।<BR>II In<BR>medicine: शीतलाबीजनिवेशनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inodorous
INODOROUS: गम्धहीनः (ना, नं): v. Scentless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inoffensive
INOFFENSIVE: निरपराधिन् (f. नी); v. Innocent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inoperative
INOPERATIVE: निष्फलः (ला, लं): v. Effective.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inopportune
INOPPORTUNE: अप्राप्तकालः (ला, लं): v. Oppor-<BR>-tune.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inopportunately
INOPPORTUNATELY:<BR>(1) अकाले;<BR>(2) असमये;<BR>(3) अनवसरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inordinate
INORDINATE: अपरिमितः (ता, तं): v. Exces-<BR>-sive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inordinately
INORDINATELY: अपरिमितम्: v. Excessively.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inorganic
INORGANIC: निरिन्द्रियः (या, यं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquest
INQUEST: परीक्षा (= examination).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=382" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquire
INQUIRE etc.: v. Enquire etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisition
INQUISITION:<BR>I Enquiry, examination:<BR>q.v.: परीक्षा।<BR>II A court: *पाषण्डसंयमसभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisitive
INQUISITIVE: जिज्ञासु (mfn.), briefly to the i.:<BR>संक्षेपतोऽर्थजिज्ञासुभ्यः, S. c.: v. Also curious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisitively
INQUISITIVELY:<BR>(1) कौतुकेन;<BR>(2) कुतूहलात्;<BR>(3) सकौतुकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisitiveness
INQUISITIVENESS: कुतूहलम्: v. Curiosity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisitor
INQUISITOR:<BR>I In gen.: v. Inquisitive.<BR>II<BR>Reli.: *पाषण्डनियामकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inquisitorial
INQUISITORIAL: expr. by comp., i. tribunal:<BR>*पाषण्डसंयमसभा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inroad
INROAD:<BR>(1) उपद्रवः;<BR>(2) अवस्कन्दः<BR>(3) आक्रमः,<BR> -णम्।<BR>To make an i.:<BR>उप-<BR>or<BR>अभि-द्रवते (द्रु c.<BR>1.) (with acc.), Mah.; अवस्कन्दति (स्कन्द्,<BR>c. 1.) (with acc.), Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insalubrious
INSALUBRIOUS: रोगकरः (री, रं): v. Unhealthy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insane
INSANE: उन्मत्तः (त्ता, त्तं:) v. Mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insanely
INSANELY: उन्मत्तवत्: v. Madly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insanity
INSANITY: उन्मादः,<BR>acute i.:<BR>तरुण उन्मादः, Bha.:<BR>v. Madness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insatlable
INSATLABLE: expr. by न तृप्तिमधिगच्छति (गृम्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insatiableness
INSATIABLENESS: अतर्म्यता (rare): better by<BR>circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insatiably
INSATIABLY: अतृप्तः (प्ता, प्तं), Vi. iii. 24.;<BR>अपरितृप्तः (प्ता, प्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inscribe
INSCRIBE:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) अभिलिखति (लिख,<BR>c. 6.) (= to write);<BR>(2) मुद्रयति (मुद्र्, c. 10).<BR>(= to engrave).<BR>II In geom.<BR>to i. a. square<BR>in a circle:<BR>वृत्तान्तर्वर्गम् अभिलिखति<BR>or<BR>वर्णयति (वर्ण,<BR>c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inscription
INSCRIPTION: expr. by अभिलिखितः (ता, तं) or<BR>मुद्रितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inscrutability
INSCRUTABILITY:<BR>(1) अतर्क्यता;<BR>(2) दुर्लक्ष्यता;<BR>(3) दुष्प्रवेश्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inscrutable
INSCRUTABLE:<BR>(1) अतर्क्य (f. र्क्या);<BR>(2) दुर्लक्ष्य<BR>(f. क्ष्या);<BR>(3) दुष्प्रवेशः (शा, शं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inscrutably
INSCRUTABLY: expr. by adj. or comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insect
INSECT:<BR>(1) कीटः;<BR>(2) कृमिः (= worm).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insecure
INSECURE:<BR>I Not firm: अस्थिरः (रा, रं).<BR>II<BR>Apprehensive: साशङ्क (f. ङ्का).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insecurity
INSECURITY:<BR>I Unsafety: अस्थिरता।<BR>II<BR>Danger: q.v.: सङ्कटता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insensate
INSENSATE: निर्बोधः (धा, धं) (= stupid): v.<BR>Foolish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insensibility
INSENSIBILITY:<BR>I Unconsciousness: अचेतनता,<BR> -त्वम्; विचेतनता, -त्वम्; etc.<BR>II Dullness, tor-<BR>-por: जाड्यम्।<BR>III Indifference, hardness:<BR>q.v.: expr. by verb: v. Insensible (IV.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insensible
INSENSIBLE:<BR>I Imperceptible: q.v.: दुलक्ष्य<BR>(f. क्ष्या).<BR>II Not conscious:<BR>(1) अचेतनः<BR>(ना, नं), विचेतनः (ना, नं), वि-गतचेतनः (ना, नं),<BR>etc.;<BR>(2) विसंज्ञ (f. ज्ञा).<BR>III Benumbed:<BR>जडः (डा, डं).<BR>IV To emotion:<BR>(1) by<BR>उपेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.): v. Indifferent;<BR>(2) न<BR> चेतयति, -ते (चित्, c. 10.) (with acc.): v.<BR>Also hard cruel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insensibly
INSENSIBLY: v. Gradually, imperceptibly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inseparable
INSEPARABLE: अवियोज्य (f. ज्या): v. Separ-<BR>-able.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inseparably
INSEPARABLY: expr. by circumlo.; दृढम्<BR>(= firmly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insert
INSERT: निवेशयति (c. of विश्).<BR>the debtor shall<BR>i. his name with his own hand:<BR>ऋणी नाम स्वहस्तेन<BR> निवेशयेत्, Y., ii. 88.: v. Also to put.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insertion
INSERTION: निवेशः, -नम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inside
INSIDE (adv.):<BR>(1) अन्तर्;<BR>(2) अभ्यन्तरम् (= to<BR>i.);<BR>(3) अभ्यन्तरे (= in i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inside
INSIDE (subs.): अभ्यन्तरम्: v. Interior.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insidious
INSIDIOUS: कापटिकः (की, कं): v. Deceitful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insidously
INSIDOUSLY: कपटेनः v. Deceitfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insidiousness
INSIDIOUSNESS: कापट्यम्: v. Deceitfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insight
INSIGHT: ज्ञानम् (= knowledge).<BR>One who has a<BR>thorough i. of:<BR>पारदर्शिन् (f. नी), in comp.<BR>Getting thorough i.:<BR>आभ्यन्तरीकरणम्, D. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insignia
INSIGNIA:<BR>(1) लक्षणम्;<BR>(2) चिह्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insignificance
INSIGNIFICANCE:<BR>(1) निरर्थकता (not of men);<BR>(2) तुच्छता (= meanness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insignificant
INSIGNIFICANT:<BR>(1) निरर्थकः (का, कं);<BR>(2) तुच्छ<BR>(f. च्छा) (= mean, trivial).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insignificantly
INSIGNIFICANTLY:<BR>(1) निरर्थकम्;<BR>(2) तुच्छम्<BR>(= meanly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insincere
INSINCERE:<BR>(1) मौखिकः (की, कं) (= in mouth):<BR>v. Deceitful, false, affected, sincere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insincerely
INSINCERELY:<BR>(1) अनृजुः v. Crookedly;<BR>(2)<BR>कपटेनः v. Deceitfully:<BR>(3) मुखेन (= in mouth).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=383" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insincerity
INSINCERITY:<BR>(1) by adj.;<BR>(2) अनृजुता<BR>(= crookedness);<BR>(3) कपटता (= deceitful-<BR>-ness);<BR>(4) कृत्रिमता (affectedness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insinuate
INSINUATE (v. i.):<BR>I To creep in.: कटाक्षेण<BR> क्षाक्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 1.).<BR>II To ingratiate: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insinuate
INSINUATE (v. t.):<BR>I To infuse gently: अल्पाल्पं<BR> निवेशयति (c. of विश्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insinuating
INSINUATING (adj.): हृदयग्राहिन् (f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insinuatingly
INSINUATINGLY:<BR>thus i. addressed:<BR>इति प्रविश्याभि-<BR>हिता, Ku. v. 51. [प्रविश्यान्तर्गत्वाप्तवद्रहस्यमुद्भाव्येत्यर्थः,]<BR>M. n.].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insinuation
INSINUATION:<BR>I Ingratiating: expr. by<BR>verb.<BR>II A hint: कटाक्षाक्षेपः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insipid
INSIPID:<BR>(1) विरसः (सा, सं);<BR>(2) नीरसः (सा,<BR> सं);<BR>(3) रसहीनः (ना, नं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insipidity
INSIPIDITY:<BR>(1) नीरसता;<BR>(2) विरसता;<BR>(3)<BR>रसहीनता; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insipidly
INSIPIDLY: नीरसम्<BR>or<BR>विरसम् (lit. and fig.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insist
INSIST: न ग्रहं मुञ्चति (मुच्, c. 6.) (?); दार्ढ्ये न वदति<BR>(वद्, c. 1.) (= to say)<BR>or<BR>प्रार्थयते (अर्थ्, c.<BR>10.) (= to ask) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insnare
INSNARE: v. Ensnare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insobriety
INSOBRIETY: पानासक्तिः v. Drunkenness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insolence
INSOLENCE:<BR>(1) धाष्ट्यम्<BR>or<BR>धृष्टता;<BR>(2) अवलेपः or<BR>अवलिप्तता;<BR>(3) प्रगल्मता<BR>or<BR>प्रगल्भ्यम्;<BR>(4) औद्धत्यम्<BR>or<BR>उद्धतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insolent
INSOLENT:<BR>(1) धृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) प्रगल्म (f. ल्मा);<BR>(3) अवलिप्तः (प्ता, प्तं) (= arrogant);<BR>(4)<BR>उद्धतः (ता, तं) (= haughty).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insolently
INSOLENTLY:<BR>(1) धार्ष्ट्येन;<BR>(2) प्रगल्भम्;<BR>(3)<BR>सावलेपम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insoluble
INSOLUBLE:<BR>I Not soluble: expr. by न गलति<BR>(गल्, c. 1.): v. To dissolve.<BR>II Not to<BR>be solved:<BR>(1) असाध्य (f. ध्या) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>by circumlo.,<BR>it is i.:<BR>अस्योत्तरं दातुं न शक्यते,<BR>after Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insolvency
INSOLVENCY: परिक्षीणता (?); क्षीणधनता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insolvent
INSOLVENT: परिक्षीण (f. णा): v. Bankrupt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insomuch so
INSOMUCH SO or THAT: यतः<BR>or<BR>यस्मात् (= as).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspect
INSPECT: अवेक्षते (ईक्ष्, c. 1.): v. To look<BR>into, examine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspection
INSPECTION:<BR>(1) अवेक्षा;<BR>(2) परिदर्शनम्: v.<BR>Also examination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspector
INSPECTOR:<BR>(1) अवेक्षकः;<BR>(2) परिदर्शकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspectorship
INSPECTORSHIP:<BR>(1) अवेक्षकपदम् (?);<BR>(2) परि-<BR>दर्शकत्वम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspiration
INSPIRATION:<BR>I Inhalation: q.v.: श्वासः।<BR>II Divine prompting:<BR>by divine i.:<BR>आकस्मिक-<BR>प्रत्यवभासात्, U., ii.;<BR>one who has received i. of<BR>language:<BR>आविर्भूतशब्दब्रह्मप्रकाशः (शा, शं), U., ii.<BR>III Infusion: आधानम्, सम्-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspire
INSPIRE (v. i.):<BR>I To breath: q.v.: श्वसिति<BR>(श्वस्, c. 1.).<BR>II To blow: q.v.: वहति<BR>(वह्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspire
INSPIRE (v. t.):<BR>I To inhale: q.v.<BR>II To<BR>blow: पूरयति (पूर्, c. 10.).<BR>III To infuse:<BR>(1) वितरति (तॄ, c. 1.): v. To impart;<BR>(2)<BR>निवेशयति (c. of विश्) (= to instil);<BR>(3) सम्-<BR>आदधाति (धा, c. 3.) (= to put);<BR>(4) जनयति<BR>(c. of जन्) (= to cause),<BR>to i. with fear:<BR>भयं<BR> जनयति (with gen.).<BR>IV To disclose preter-<BR>-naturally: i. d (persons): दैवज्ञानापन्नाः;<BR>he was<BR>i. d. with this knowledge:<BR>ईश्वरप्रसादादिदं<BR> ज्ञानं लेभे, see Ki. iii. 23 and 25., N.<BR>xiv. 8.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inspirit
INSPIRIT: आश्वासयति (c. of श्वस्): v. To en-<BR>-courage, cheer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instability
INSTABILITY:<BR>(1) अस्थिरता;<BR>(2) अस्थैर्यम्;<BR>(3)<BR>अनवस्थितिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

install
INSTALL: प्रतिष्ठापयति (c. of स्था) (with loc. of<BR>the place).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

installation
INSTALLATION:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठापनम्;<BR>(2) प्रतिष्ठा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instalment
INSTALMENT:<BR>I Installation: q.v.<BR>II<BR>Part payment:<BR>(1) देयांशः (?);<BR>(2) *किस्ति<BR>(in the vernacular).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instance
INSTANCE (subs.):<BR>I Importance: गुरुत्वम्।<BR>II Solicitation: प्रर्थना।<BR>III Example:<BR>q.v.: उदाहरणम्,<BR>for i.:<BR>तथाहि;<BR>for i. Purūravas<BR>met destruction from a thirst after Brāhmin's<BR>money:<BR>तथाहि पुरूरवा ब्राह्मणधनतृष्णया विननाश, Va.<BR>As for i.:<BR>तद्यथा;<BR>as for i., in the entirety of<BR>the family etc. one attributes to himself “I am<BR>entire”:<BR>तद्यथा पुत्रमार्यादिषु सकलेष्वहमेव सकल<BR> इत्यात्मन्यध्यस्यति, S., Ph.:<BR>in the first i.:<BR>प्रथमतः;<BR>Visva Prakāśa in the three i. s.:<BR>त्रिषु विश्वप्रकाशः,<BR>Va. com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=384" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instance
INSTANCE (v.): उदागरणं, निदर्शनं,<BR>or<BR>दृष्टान्तं ददाति<BR>(दा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instant
INSTANT (adj.):<BR>I Earnest: q.v.: आग्रहवत्<BR>(f. ती);<BR>II Immediate:<BR>(1) सद्यः; i. death:<BR>सद्योमृत्युः;<BR>(2) by adv.: v.<BR>I ly (I.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instant
INSTANT (subs.):<BR>I Moment: q.v.: क्षणः।<BR>II A day of the current month:<BR>on the<BR>5th. i.:<BR>अस्य मासस्य पञ्चमदिवसे<BR>or<BR>आगामिनि or<BR>गते पञ्चमे दिवसे (according as it is coming or<BR>past).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instantaneous
INSTANTANEOUS:<BR>(1) क्षणमात्रभवः (वा, वं), Si.;<BR>(2) क्षणमात्रस्थायिन् (f. नी) M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instantaneously
INSTANTANEOUSLY:<BR>(1) क्षणेन;<BR>(2) मुहूर्तमात्रेण;<BR>(3) एकपदे।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instantly
INSTANTLY:<BR>I Immediately:<BR>(1) भटिति, Vi.<BR>i. 43.;<BR>(2) सपदि, Ki. xiii. 25;<BR>(3) तत्क्षणम्,<BR> -णात्, P. i. 5.;<BR>(4) द्राक्, Vi. i. 34.;<BR>(5) अधुनैव<BR>(= just now), Vi. iii. 34;<BR>(6) अञ्जसा<BR>(= quickly).<BR>II Urgently:<BR>(1) आग्रहपूर्वकम्;<BR>(2) निर्बन्धेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instead of
INSTEAD OF:<BR>I Before a subs.: स्थाने,<BR>i. of<BR>self:<BR>आत्मस्थाने, P. i. 4.;<BR>some read<BR>लासिका, i. of<BR>विलासिका: केचिद्विलासिकास्थाने लासिकेति पठन्ति, Sah.<BR>II Before pres. parts: expr. by negative,<BR>may be strengthened with वस्तुतः<BR>or<BR>प्रत्युत<BR>(= in fact):<BR>i. of amassing he squandered his<BR>money:<BR>सञ्चयमकृत्वा स धनं क्षपयामास।<BR>III Equal<BR>to: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instep
INSTEP: पिच (चि) ण्डिका; पिण्डिका, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instigate
INSTIGATE: प्रोत्साहयति (c. of सह्): v. To<BR>encourage excite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instigation
INSTIGATION: प्रोत्साहनम्: v. Envouragement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instigator
INSTIGATOR: प्रोत्साहकः। v. Inciter, encourager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instill
INSTILL:<BR>(1) निवेशयति (c. of विश्);<BR>(2) सम्-<BR>आदधाति (धा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instinct
INSTINCT (subs.):<BR>(1) अन्तःप्रवृत्तिः (?);<BR>(2)<BR>सहजज्ञानम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instinct
INSTINCT: (adj.):<BR>(1) उत्तेजितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>चलितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instinctive
INSTINCTIVE: expr. by adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instinctively
INSTINCTIVELY:<BR>(1) अन्तःप्रवृत्त्या (??);<BR>(2) स्वत<BR> एव (= naturally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

institute
INSTITUTE (subs.):<BR>I Maxim, precept: q.v.<BR>II An institution: समा (?).<BR>III In pl.<BR>संहिता,<BR>i. s. of Manu:<BR>मनुसंहिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

institute
INSTITUTE (v.): To establish, found: q.v.:<BR>स्थापयति (c. of स्था).<BR>II To begin: q.v.:<BR>उपक्रमते (क्रम्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

institution
INSTITUTION:<BR>I Establishment: स्थापनम्।<BR>II<BR>Instruction: शासनम्।<BR>III A society.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instruct
INSTRUCT<BR>(1) शिक्षापयति (c. of शिक्ष) (= to<BR>teach: q.v.:),<BR>i. me how to salute:<BR>केन प्रकारेण<BR> प्रणामः कर्तव्यस्तन्मां शिक्षापय, Vet. 25.;<BR>(2) शास्ति,<BR> अनु- (शास्, c. 2.), thus i. ing the elder of Arjuna:<BR>इत्यनुशासतमर्जुनाग्रजम्, Ki. ii. 54.;<BR>(3) उपदिशति<BR>(दिश्, c. 6.),<BR>by doing them in a better style,<BR>the girl as if i. s. me in return:<BR>तत्तद्विशेषकरणा-<BR>त्प्रत्युपदिशतीव मे बाला, Mal. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insiruction
INSIRUCTION:<BR>I Teaching:<BR>(1) शिक्षा;<BR>(2)<BR>उपदेशः,<BR>in receiving i.:<BR>उपदेशग्रहणे, Mal. i.<BR>II<BR>Education:<BR>(1) विनयनम्,<BR>thorough i. in the art<BR>of conversation:<BR>वचनकौशलेषु सम्यग्विनयनेन, D. ii.;<BR>(2) by verb.<BR>III Precept, command:<BR>q.v.: शासनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instructive
INSTRUCTIVE: शिक्षादायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) उपदेशगर्भ<BR>(f. र्भा);<BR>(3) अनुशास्क (f. सिका); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instructor
INSTRUCTOR:<BR>(1) शिक्षकः: v. Teacher;<BR>(2)<BR>शासकः (rare), Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instrument
INSTRUMENT:<BR>I Implement, tool: q.v.:<BR>यन्त्रम्,<BR>hand is the chiefest i.:<BR>हस्तं प्रधानतमं यन्त्राणाम्,<BR>Sr.;<BR>the chapter on i.s.:<BR>यन्त्राध्यायः, Go.<BR>Musical<BR>i.:<BR>वादित्रम्, Mah.<BR>II A deed: q.v.: लेखः।<BR>III An agent, tool: q.v.: साधनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insirumental
INSIRUMENTAL: expr. by subs.,<BR>I was i. in<BR>his release:<BR>तस्य मोक्षस्य साधनमहमासम्: v. Also<BR>cause. Ph.:<BR>i. case:<BR>करणम्;<BR>i. music:<BR>वादित्रम्:<BR>v. Music.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

instrumentality
INSTRUMENTALITY: expr. by साधनम् or by -द्वारकः<BR>(का, कं) in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insubordinate
INSUBORDINATE:<BR>(1) अवश्य (f. श्या);<BR>(2) अविधेयः<BR>(या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insubordination
INSUBORDINATION:<BR>(1) अवश्यता:<BR>(2) अविधेयता:<BR>(4) अननुविधायिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insufferable
INSUFFERABLE:<BR>(1) असह्य (f. ह्या);<BR>(2) दुःसहः<BR>(हा, हं);<BR>(3) असहनीयः (या, यं);<BR>(4) अविषह्य<BR>(f. ह्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=385" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insufferably
INSUFFERABLY:<BR>(1) असह्यम्;<BR>(2) दुःसहम्, etc.;<BR>(3)<BR>by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insufficiency
INSUFFICIENCY:<BR>(1) Defficiency, want: q.v.<BR>न्यूनता।<BR>II Inability, incapacity: q.v.:<BR>अक्षमता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insufficient
INSUFFICIENT:<BR>I Deficient:<BR>(1) न्यूनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) अप्रचुरः (रा, रं).<BR>II Incapable: q.v.:<BR>अक्षमः (मा, मं)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insufficiently
INSUFFICIENTLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insular
INSULAR:<BR>(1) by comp.<BR>(2) द्वैप्य (f. प्या), Si.<BR>iii. 76.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insulate
INSULATE:<BR>(1) पृथक्करोति;<BR>(2) विश्लेषयति (c. of श्लिष्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insult
INSULT (subs.):<BR>(1) अपमानः;<BR>(2) अवमानः, -ना;<BR>(3) विमानना: v. Disgrace, ignominy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insult
INSULT (v.): अप(व) मानयति (c. of मन्): v. To<BR>disgrace.<BR>I. ing language:<BR>आक्षेपवचः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insultingly
INSULTINGLY:<BR>(1) सावेलपम् (= insolently);<BR>(2)<BR>अवज्ञया (= despisingly);<BR>(3) साक्षेपम् (= abus-<BR>-ingly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insuperable
INSUPERABLE:<BR>(1) दुर्लघ्य (f. घ्या);<BR>(2) अनति-<BR>क्रमणीयः (या, यं);<BR>(3) दुरतिक्रम्य। (f. म्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insuperably
INSUPERABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insupportable
INSUPPORTABLE: दुर्वहः (हा, हं): v. Insufferable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insupportably
INSUPPORTABLY:<BR>(1) दुर्वहम्;<BR>(2) दुःसहम् (= in-<BR>-sufferably).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurance
INSURANCE:<BR>i. company:<BR>*अमिरक्षासमाजः। N. B.<BR>Wilson seems to think योगक्षेम as a sort of i.<BR>probably on M. vii. 127., but even<BR>Kulluka's interpretation does not counten-<BR>-ance it.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insure
INSURE:<BR>I To guard, secure: q.v.: रक्षति (रक्ष,<BR>c. 1.).<BR>II In mercantile sense: *अभिरक्षति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurer
INSURER: *अभिरक्षकः,<BR>life. i.:<BR>जीवनाभिरक्षकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurgent
INSURGENT: राजद्रोहिन् (f. णी): v. Rebellious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurmountable
INSURMOUNTABLE: अलंघ्य (f. घ्या): v. Insu-<BR>-perable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurrection
INSURRECTION: राजविद्रोहः v. Rebellion, revolt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

insurrectionary
INSURRECTIONARY: राजविद्रोहिन् (f. णी): v.<BR>Rebellious, seditious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intact
INTACT:<BR>(1) अखण्ड (f. ण्डा);<BR>(2) अविकलः (ला, लं):<BR>v. Entire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intangible
INTANGIBLE: दुर्ग्रहः (हा, हं): v. Tangible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

integer
INTEGER: पूर्णाङ्गः; समग्रसंख्या (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

integral
INTEGRAL:<BR>(1) अविकलः (ला, लं): v. Whole;<BR>(2) आवश्यकीयः (या, यं): v. Necessary.<BR>I.<BR>calculus:<BR>*समाहारगणितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

integrate
INTEGRATE:<BR>in calculus:<BR>*समाहारीकरोति; समा-<BR>हारं वदति (to say).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

integrity
INTEGRITY:<BR>I Entireness: q.v.:<BR>(1) अखण्डता;<BR>(2) अविकलता।<BR>II Honesty, uprightness: q.v.:<BR>आर्जवम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

integument
INTEGUMENT: वेष्टनम्, Bha.: v. Covering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intellect
INTELLECT:<BR>(1) बुद्धिः, one whose i. is (sharp)<BR>like<BR>the point of the Kuśa:<BR>कुशाग्रबुद्धि। (mfn.), R. v. 4.;<BR>(2) धीः,<BR>with all the excellences of i.:<BR>समग्रैर्धियो<BR> गुणैः, R. iii. 30.;<BR>(3) धिषणा (rare), guilty i.:<BR>पापधिषणा, Vi. vi. 8.: v. Also mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intellectual
INTELLECTUAL: In gen.: expr. by comp.,<BR>i.<BR>powers:<BR>बुद्धिवृत्तयः।<BR>II Mental: q.v.: मानसिकः<BR>(की, कं). Ph.:<BR>i. culture:<BR>शास्त्रानुशीलनम्<BR>or<BR>शास्त्र-<BR>दर्शनम् (?).<BR>III Intelligent: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intellectually
INTELLECTUALLY:<BR>(1) बुद्ध्या;<BR>(2) धिया;<BR>(3) धिषणया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligence
INTELLIGENCE:<BR>I Intellect: q.v.: बुद्धिः।<BR>II<BR>Knowledge imparted;<BR>(1) व्युत्पत्तिः;<BR>(2) आगमः<BR>(rare), K. i. 15.<BR>III News.: q.v.: वार्त्ता।<BR>IV<BR>An intelligent being: बुधः, वि-, N. i. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligencer
INTELLIGENCER: v. Messenger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligent
INTELLIGENT: v. Possessing (good) intellect:<BR>(1) बुद्धिमत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) धूमत् (f. ती);<BR>(3)<BR>उदारधी (n. धि) (= highly i.), R. iii. 30.;<BR>etc.<BR>II Well-informed: व्युतोअत्तिमत् (f. ती)<BR>or<BR>व्युत्पन्नचित्त (f. त्ता), S.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligential
INTELLIGENTIAL:<BR>I Of acts etc.: बुद्धिपूर्व (f. र्वा),<BR>Ki.<BR>II Mental: मानसिक (f. की).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligently
INTELLIGENTLY:<BR>(1) बुद्धिपूर्वम्;<BR>(2) चतुरम्: v.<BR>Skilfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligibility
INTELLIGIBILITY:<BR>(1) बोधगम्यता;<BR>(2) सुबोधता;<BR>(3) स्पष्टता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligible
INTELLIGIBLE:<BR>(1) बोधगम्य (f. म्या);<BR>(2) स्पष्ट<BR>(f. ष्टा) (= clear: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intelligibly
INTELLIGIBLY:<BR>(1) स्पष्टम् (= clearly: q.v.);<BR>(2)<BR>by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intemperance
INTEMPERANCE:<BR>I Incontinence: असंयमः।<BR>II<BR>In drink: अतिपानम्।<BR>III In. eating: अत्याहारः<BR>IV Excess: अतिभोगः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=386" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intemperate
INTEMPERATE:<BR>(1) असंयतः (ता, तं) (= inconti-<BR>-nent);<BR>(2) अतिपानासक्तः (क्ता, क्तं) (in drinking);<BR>(3) मोगासक्त (f. क्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intemperately
INTEMPERATELY:<BR>(1) असंयातम्;<BR>(2) अपरिमितम्<BR>(= immoderately).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intemperatness
INTEMPERATNESS: अतिपानासक्तिः, etc.: v. In-<BR>-temperate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intend
INTEND:<BR>(1) by subs.;<BR>(2) अमिप्रैति (इ, c. 2.);<BR>(3) संकल्पते (कॢप्, c. 1.),<BR>we were i. ed by you as<BR>their price:<BR>भवता वयमेतेषां मूल्यं कल्पिताः, Mu. v.;<BR>(4) प्रतिपद्यते (पद्, c. 4.),<BR>what the king of<BR>Vidarbha i. s.:<BR>किं प्रतिपद्यते वैदर्भः, Mal. i.;<BR>(5)<BR>इच्छति (इष्, c. 1.) (= to wish: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intendant
INTENDANT: अध्यक्षः v. Superintendent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intense
INTENSE: प्रचण्ड (f. ण्डा) (= fiery),<BR>i. heat:<BR>प्रचण्डा-<BR>तपः, Ki. i. 10.;<BR>(2) तीव्र (f. व्रा), i. affliction:<BR>तीव्राभिषङ्गः, Ku. iii. 73.: v. Sharp.;<BR>(3) नितान्तः<BR>(न्ता, न्तं) (= excessive: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intensely
INTENSELY:<BR>I Exceedingly: q.v.:<BR>(1) नितान्तम्,<BR>i. cold:<BR>नितान्तशीतः (ता, तं), D. vii.;<BR>(2) rarely<BR>by यङ्,<BR>to shine i.:<BR>देदीप्यते।<BR>II Attentively:<BR>q.v.: सावधानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intensify
INTENSIFY:<BR>(1) वर्धयति (c. of वृध्) (= to in-<BR>-crease);<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intensity
INTENSITY:<BR>(1) प्रचण्डता (as of heat);<BR>(2) तीव्रता<BR>(as of pain);<BR>(3) प्रगाढता। (as of love);<BR>(4)<BR>अतिशय:- in comp.: v. Excessive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intensive
INTENSIVE: In gram.: भृशार्थकः (का, कं), यङ्<BR>is<BR>also i.:<BR>भृशार्थे च यङ् स्यात्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intensively
INTENSIVELY: भृशार्थे; भृशार्थद्योतनाय।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intent
INTENT (subs.): v. Intention. Ph.:<BR>with<BR>deliberate i.:<BR>सङ्कल्पपूर्वकम्; to all i. s and purposes:<BR>सर्वथा;<BR>to the i. that:<BR>एतदभिप्रायकः (का, कं); the<BR>i. (of this passage)<BR>is...<BR>इति भावः, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intent
INTENT (adj.):<BR>I Fixed closely:<BR>(1) एकाग्र<BR>(f. ग्रा),<BR>i. on hearing their songs:<BR>तद्रगीतश्रवणैकाग्रा,<BR>R. xv. 66.;<BR>(2) एकाग्रचित्त (f. त्ता) (= with i.<BR>mind);<BR>(3) अनन्यमनस् (mfn.) (= 2);<BR>(4)<BR>एकायनः (ना, नं), -गतः (ता, तं);<BR>(5) एकतानः<BR>(ना, नं).<BR>II Engaged, bent:<BR>(1) अभिनिविष्टः<BR>(ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) अभियुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intention
INTENTION:<BR>I Purpose:<BR>(1) अभिप्रायः,<BR>it was<BR>the i. of Droṇa:<BR>एवं किल द्रोणस्याभिप्राय आसीत, Vi.;<BR>(2) संकल्पः (= determined wish), but (her)<BR>guardian's i. is to give her to a suitable person:<BR>गुरोः पुनरस्या अनुरूपवरप्रदाने संकल्पः, Sa. i.;<BR>(3)<BR>प्रतिपत्तिः (rare),<BR>what is your i. now:<BR>काद्य ते प्रति-<BR>पत्तिः, D. ii.;<BR>(4) आशयः (= design) evil-i. ed:<BR>पापाशयः, H. ii.: v. Also wish.<BR>II Intentness:<BR>q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intentional
INTENTIONAL: expr. by adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intentionally
INTENTIONALLY:<BR>(1) कामतः<BR>or<BR>कामात्, uni. or i.:<BR>अकामादथ कामतो वा, Pa.;<BR>(2) प्रतिपत्त्या (rare), R.:<BR>v. Also knowingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intently
INTENTLY:<BR>(1) एकाग्रचित्तेन;<BR>(2) अनन्यमनसा;<BR>(3)<BR>अनन्यवृत्ति (mfn.), अनन्यद्दष्टि (mfn.) (in seeing),<BR>etc., Ku. v. 20.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intentness
INTENTNESS:<BR>(1) एकाग्रता;<BR>(2) अनन्यमनस्कता;<BR>(3) अभिनिवेशः; etc.: v. Intent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inter
INTER: निदधाति (धा, c. 3.): v. To bury.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercalary
INTERCALARY: अधिकः (का, कं), Nil. “पञ्चमे पञ्चमे<BR> वर्षे द्वौ मासावुपजायतः ।” Mah. iv. 52.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercalate
INTERCALATE: अधिकदिनं निवेशयति (c. of<BR>विश्) (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercalation
INTERCALATION: of a day: अधिकदिननिवेशनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercede
INTERCEDE: अनुरुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interceder
INTERCEDER: अनुरोधकारिन्। (f. णी): v. Also<BR>mediator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercept
INTERCEPT (v.): निरुणद्धि (रुध्, c. 7.), Si. ii., 64.:<BR>v. Obstruct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercept
INTERCEPT (subs.): Of two circles: ग्रासः, A. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercession
INTERCESSION: अनुरोधः: v. Also mediation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercessor
INTERCESSOR: अनुरोधकारिन् (f. णी): v. Also<BR>mediator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercessory
INTERCESSORY: अनुरोध- in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interchange
INTERCHANGE (subs.):<BR>(1) विनिमयः,<BR>making i.<BR>of rings:<BR>अङ्गुलीयकविनिमयं कृत्वा, D.;<BR>(2) व्यतिकरः<BR>(of acts),<BR>i. of abuse:<BR>अधिक्षेपव्यतिकरः, D.:<BR>v. Exchange, change.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interchange
INTERCHANGE (v.):<BR>(1) by subs.;<BR>(2) दत्त्वा<BR> प्रतिगृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interchangeable
INTERCHANGEABLE:<BR>I Exchangeable: विनि-<BR>मेयः (या, यं).<BR>II Following alternately:<BR>पर्यायसेविन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interchangeably
INTERCHANGEABLY:<BR>(1) विनिभयेन (by ex-<BR>-change);<BR>(2) पर्यायेण (= alternately).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=387" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intercourse
INTERCOURSE:<BR>(1) सङ्गः, सङ्गमः<BR>or<BR>समागमः,<BR>by i.<BR>with inferiors:<BR>हीनैः सह समागमात्, H. i. 42.;<BR>i. with a lioness:<BR>केसरिकलत्रसमागमः, D. ii.;<BR>(2)<BR>संसर्गः,<BR>i. with wanton women:<BR>पुंश्चलिभिः सह संसर्गः,<BR>H. i. 113.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interdict
INTERDICT (subs.) निषेधः v. Prohibition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interdict
INTERDICT (v.): निषेधति (सिध्, c. 1.): v.<BR>To forbid, prohibit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interest
INTEREST (v.):<BR>I To amuse, delight: q.v.:<BR>रञ्जयति (रञ्ज्, c. 10.). Ph.:<BR>and he is i. ed<BR>in us:<BR>स च स्निह्यत्यावयोः (स्निह्, c. 4.), U., vi.<BR>II<BR>To concern: expr. with अर्थः: v. Do with.<BR>III Reflexively, to excite for another:<BR>he<BR>i. s himself much in philosophy:<BR>दर्शनासक्तचेता:<BR> सः (?): v. To attach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interest
INTEREST (subs.):<BR>I Concern: अर्थः,<BR>in your<BR>i.:<BR>त्वदर्थम्<BR>or<BR>त्वर्दथे।<BR>III Regard: q.v.: आदरः।<BR>To feel, take i.:<BR>आद्रियते (द्द, c. 4.), K. iii.<BR>Share: q.v.: अंशः।<BR>IV.: Good: q.v.:<BR>हितम्।<BR>V Affection: q.v.: स्नेहः।<BR>VI In<BR>commerce:<BR>(1) वृद्धिः,<BR>compound i.:<BR>मूलकलन्तरे,<BR>Vri.;<BR>(2) कलान्तरम्,<BR>capital and i.:<BR>मूलकलान्तरे,<BR>Li. Ph.: at five percent (per month): पञ्चकेन<BR> शतेन, Li. N. B. Note that i. means monthly i.<BR>unless specified.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interested
INTERESTED:<BR>I Partial: पक्षपातिन् (f. नी),<BR>I and the queen are i.:<BR>पक्षपातिनावहं देवी च, Mal.<BR>i.<BR>II Looking to one's own interest: स्वार्थ-<BR>परः (रा, रं,)<BR>or<BR>स्वार्थपरायण (f. णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interesting
INTERESTING (adj.):<BR>(1) हृदयग्राहिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2) मनोहरः (रा, रं);<BR>(3) रमणीयः (या, यं),<BR>i.<BR>story, go on:<BR>रमणीया कथा, ततस्ततः, Mal. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interfere
INTERFERE:<BR>I To clash: q.v.:<BR>II To inter-<BR>-meddle: q.v.:<BR>(1) हस्तं ददाति (दा, c. 3.)<BR>(?);<BR>(2) मध्ये तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.) (= to inter-<BR>-pose).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interference
INTERFERENCE: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interim
INTERIM: मध्यकालः, Ph.:<BR>in the i.:<BR>अस्मिन् काले।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interior
INTERIOR (subs.):<BR>(1) अभ्यन्तरम्;<BR>(2) गर्भः<BR>(= womb);<BR>(3) उदरम् (= heart),<BR>the i. of an<BR>edifice:<BR>मन्दिरोदरम्, Ri. v. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interior
INTERIOR (adj.): v. Inner, internal. Ph.:<BR>i. angle:<BR>अन्तर्गतकोणः, K. d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interjacent
INTERJACENT:<BR>(1) मध्यवर्तिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>मध्यस्थ (f. स्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interjection
INTERJECTION: भावव्यञ्जकमव्ययम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlace
INTERLACE: परिवेष्टयति (वेष्ट्, c. 10). (= to<BR>encircle: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlard
INTERLARD: सं-मिश्रयति (मिश्र्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interleave
INTERLEAVE:<BR>to i. a book:<BR>*पत्राणि पुस्तकान्तरिनवे-<BR>शयति (c. of विश्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interline
INTERLINE:<BR>To I. Latin and English:<BR>*पर्यायेण<BR> लाटिनेरेजीपंक्ती लिखति; with i. ar paraphrase:<BR>*सान्तःपंक्तिलिखितानुवादः (दा, दं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlineation
INTERLINEATION:<BR>I The act: expr. by verb.<BR>II An interlineated passage, etc.: *अन्तः-<BR>पंक्तिलिखितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlocutor
INTERLOCUTOR:<BR>(1) संवादकः;<BR>(2) संवादिन् (m.).<BR>(3) संवादकारकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interloper
INTERLOPER: *अनधिकारप्रवेशकः [आगन्तुकः many<BR>gen. do].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlude
INTERLUDE: *मध्यरङ्गः (after पूर्वरङ्गः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interlunar
INTERLUNAR: अमावस्या- in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermarriage
INTERMARRIAGE: expr. by विवाह (= marriage)<BR>and मध्ये (= between).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermarry
INTERMARRY:<BR>it is lawful to i. now:<BR>*अधुना मिन्न-<BR>जात्यां विवाहो न विधिविरुद्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermeddle
INTERMEDDLE: you are not to i. in my work:<BR>मम नियोगस्य चर्चा त्वया न कर्तव्या, H. ii.; i. ing:<BR>पराधिकारचर्चा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermediate
INTERMEDIATE:<BR>(1) मध्यवर्तिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2)<BR>अन्तर्वर्तिन् (f. नी): v. Middle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interment
INTERMENT: निधानम्: v. Burial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interminable
INTERMINABLE:<BR>(1) अनन्त (f. न्ता);<BR>(2) अप-<BR>र्यन्त (f. न्ता);<BR>(3) निरवधि (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interminably
INTERMINABLY:<BR>(1) अनन्तम्;<BR>(2) अपर्यन्तम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermingle
INTERMINGLE: मिश्रयति (मिश्र, c. 10.): v. To<BR>mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermission
INTERMISSION: विरामः<BR>or<BR>विरतिः: v. Cessation.<BR>Without i.:<BR>अविरतम्: v. Incessantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermit
INTERMIT:<BR>I Trans.: निवर्तयति (c. of वृत्).<BR>II Intrans: विरमति (रम्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>cease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermitient
INTERMITIENT: That (fever)<BR>which is not at all<BR>i. is called continuous:<BR>सन्तत्या योऽविसर्गी स्यात् [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">Page389</a>]<BR>सन्ततः स निगद्यते, Sr.;<BR>high i. fever:<BR>विषमज्वरः,<BR>Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=388" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermittently
INTERMITTENTLY: coming i. (of fever): चिरोत्थितः<BR>(ता, तं), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermix
INTERMIX: संमिश्रयति (मिश्र, c. 10.): v. To mix.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intermixture
INTERMIXTURE: संमिश्रणम्: v. Mixture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

internal
INTERNAL:<BR>(1) अन्तर् in comp.,<BR>i. heat:<BR>अन्तर्दाहः,<BR>U., iii. 31.;<BR>arising from i. disaffection:<BR>अन्तः-<BR>प्रकृतिप्रकोपजः (जा, जं), Ki. ii. 61.;<BR>(2) आभ्यन्तर<BR>(f. री) (rare),<BR>secretly fomenting external and<BR>i. discord:<BR>बाह्याभ्यन्तरान् कोपान् गूढमुत्पाद्य, D. viii.;<BR>(3) अन्तर्गतः (ता, तं) (what is in.), (but)<BR>as<BR>you know the i. feelings of animals:<BR>अन्तर्गतं प्राण-<BR>भृतां हि वेद सर्वं भवान् भावम्, R. ii. 43.;<BR>(4) अन्तःस्थ<BR>(f. स्था) (what stands in);<BR>(5) अन्तर्भवः<BR>(वा, वं) (what is born in).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

internally
INTERNALLY: अन्तर्,<BR>i. towards you:<BR>अन्तस्त्वां प्रति,<BR>Vi. iii. 43.;<BR>externally and i.:<BR>बहिरन्तश्च, Ki.<BR>ii. 53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

international
INTERNATIONAL:<BR>i. law:<BR>*राष्ट्राणां परस्पख्यवहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

internecine
INTERNECINE: perh. अन्तर्ध्वसिन् (f. नी): v.<BR>Destructive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

internuncio
INTERNUNCIO: of the pope: *अनुदूतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpolate
INTERPOLATE: स्वकृतेनान्यग्रन्थोब्धृतेन वा श्लोकादिना<BR> ग्रन्थं दूषयति (c. of दुष्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpolation
INTERPOLATION: expr. as above. The Bombay<BR>edition uses आधिक्यम् (= excess) for the i. s of<BR>the Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpolator
INTERPOLATOR: ग्रन्थदूषकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpose
INTERPOSE:<BR>I To introduce: निक्षिपति (क्षिप्,<BR>c. 6.): v. To cast.<BR>II To interfere: expr.<BR>by मध्ये तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>माध्यस्थ्यं करोति।<BR>III To intrude: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interposition
INTERPOSITION:<BR>I A coming between: मध्य-<BR>वर्तिता।<BR>II Mediation: माध्यस्थम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpret
INTERPRET: व्याख्याति (ख्या, c. 2.): v. To<BR>explain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpretation
INTERPRETATION: व्याख्या: v. Explanation,<BR>meaning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interpreter
INTERPRETER:<BR>I An. expositor: व्याख्यातृ (m.).<BR>II A translator:<BR>Persian i.:<BR>*पारसिकमाषाबोधकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interregnum
INTERREGNUM:<BR>in the i.:<BR>शून्ये सिंहासने: v.<BR>Regent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogate
INTERROGATE: प्रश्नं करोतिः v. To enquire,<BR>question.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogation
INTERROGATION: expr. by verb. Note of i.:<BR>*प्रश्नचिह्नम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogative
INTERROGATIVE: प्रश्नार्थकः (का, कं), “who” is i.:<BR>किं प्रश्ने।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogatively
INTERROGATIVELY: प्रश्नक्रमेण। (?); प्रश्नरूपेण (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogator
INTERROGATOR: प्राश्निकः, Mah. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrogatory
INTERROGATORY:<BR>I Subs.: v. Question.<BR>II<BR>Adj.: v. Interrogative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interrupt
INTERRUPT:<BR>(1) प्रतिबध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.),<BR>do not<BR>i. him:<BR>मैनमन्तरा प्रतिबध्नीतम्, Sa.;<BR>(2) उप-रुणद्धि,<BR> नि-, (रुध्, c. 7.) (= to check), to i. his progress:<BR>तत्प्रसरं निरोद्धुम्, Vi. iv. 6.;<BR>(3) आक्षिपति (क्षिप्,<BR>c. 6.) (= to throw out), i. ing his saying:<BR>अस्य वचनमाक्षिप्य, K.: v. Also to break off.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interruptedly
INTERRUPTEDLY: अन्तरा अन्तरा प्रतिबद्ध (f. द्धा).<BR>सविच्छेदम् (with breaks).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interruption
INTERRUPTION:<BR>(1) प्रतिबन्धः;<BR>(2) उपरोधः,<BR>i. of<BR>business:<BR>कार्योपरोघः, Sa.;<BR>(3) अन्तरायः, without i.<BR>to (your)<BR>other works:<BR>क्रियान्तरान्तरायंअन्तरेण, Mu.<BR>v. Also break.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intersect
INTERSECT: सम्पातं करोति, K.d.; अन्तरा छिनत्ति<BR>(छिद्, c. 7.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intersection
INTERSECTION: सम्पातः, K. d.; छेदः (the context<BR>determining the meaning).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intersperse
INTERSPERSE:<BR>the forest is i. d. with cocoanut<BR>trees:<BR>वानस्यान्तरान्तरा नारिकेलपादपाः, after K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interstice
INTERSTICE:<BR>(1) छिद्रम्;<BR>(2) रन्ध्रम्, without i.<BR>(adv.): नीरन्ध्रम्, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intertwine
INTERTWINE, INTERTWIST: संग्रथ्नाति (ग्रन्थ्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interval
INTERVAL:<BR>(1) अन्तरम्;<BR>(2) अन्तरालः, without i.:<BR>निरन्तरालः (ला, लं), Ki.;<BR>in the i.:<BR>अन्तराले, I.:<BR>v. Also permission. Ph.: after so long an i.:<BR>एतावत्कालान्तरम्; but on his saying without i.:<BR>तद्वाक्यसमकालन्तु, Mah. i. 131. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intervene
INTERVENE:<BR>I To interpose: मध्ये तिष्ठति (स्था,<BR>c. 1.).<BR>II Of time: अतिवहति (वह्, c. 1.):<BR>v. To pass.<BR>III To interrupt: अन्तरायो भवत्ति,<BR>R. xiv. 65.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intervening
INTERVENING (adj.): मध्यस्थ (f. स्था)<BR>or<BR>मध्यवर्तिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>I. spaces:<BR>अन्तरालः v. Interval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intervention
INTERVENTION: v. Interposition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=389" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interview
INTERVIEW: दर्शनम्, सं-: v. Conference, to<BR>meet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

interweave
INTERWEAVE: perh. संवपति (वप्, c. 1.);<BR>संग्रथ्नाति (ग्रन्थ्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intestacy
INTESTACY: expr. by circumlo: v. Intestate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intestate
INTESTATE:<BR>he died i.:<BR>*इच्छापत्रमकृत्वा ममार;<BR>this<BR>estate is i.:<BR>*एतत्सम्पत्तिविषयकमिच्छापत्रं न कृतम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intestinal
INTESTINAL: expr. by comp.: v. Intestine<BR>(subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intestine
INTESTINE (adj.): अन्तर् in comp.: v. Internal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intestine
INTESTINE (subs.): अन्त्राणि (n. pl.), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inthrall
INTHRALL: दासीकरोति: v. To enslave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimacy
INTIMACY: गाढसौहृदम्: v. Friendship. Ph.:<BR>Your Majesty were in terms of the greatest i.<BR>with the poet Kālidāsa:<BR>देव! कालिदासकविना सह<BR>[भवतः] नितान्तं निविडतमा मैत्री [आसीत्] Bho.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimate
INTIMATE (adj.): गाढः (ढा, ढं), प्र-, (= deep:<BR>q.v.): Ph.:<BR>i. friend:<BR>हृदयङ्गमः सखा, Ku. iv. 24.;<BR>i. relation:<BR>अन्तरङ्गः, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimate
INTIMATE (v.):<BR>(1) सूचयति (सूच्, c. 10.) (= to<BR>indicate: q.v.):<BR>(2) व्यनक्ति (अञ्ज्, c. 7.)<BR>(= to express: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimately
INTIMATELY:<BR>(1) गाढम्, प्र- (= deeply);<BR>(2)<BR>निविडम् (= closely).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimation
INTIMATION:<BR>(1) सूचना (= indication);<BR>(2)<BR>व्यञ्जनम् (= expression).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimidate
INTIMIDATE: भीषयते (c. of भी): v. To frighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intimidation
INTIMIDATION:<BR>(1) expr. by verb;<BR>(2) भीषिका<BR>or<BR>भीषा (= threat),<BR>dispossessing by i.:<BR>भीषया<BR> हरन्, M.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

into
INTO: मध्ये (with gen.): v. Within, in.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intolerable
INTOLERABLE: असह्य (f. ह्या),<BR>i. dust:<BR>असह्यरेणु-,<BR>Ri. i. 10.: v. Insufferable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intolerably
INTOLERABLY:<BR>(1) असह्यम्, etc.;<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intolerance
INTOLERANCE:<BR>(1) अक्षमा (= impatience);<BR>(2)<BR>कोपः (?), Raj. i. 200.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intolerant
INTOLERANT: अक्षमिन् (f. णी): v. Impatient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intonation
INTONATION: स्वरः v. Tone.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intone
INTONE: स्वरेण पठति (पठ्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>वाचयति<BR>(c. of वच्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intoxicate
INTOXICATE:<BR>(1) मादयति (c. of मद्);<BR>(2)<BR>मत्तीकरोति;<BR>(3) मदं जनयति (c. of जन्). I. d.:<BR>मत्तः (त्ता, त्तं): v. Drunk, To be i. d:<BR>(1)<BR>मदेन स्पृश्यते (pass of. स्पृश्), D. ii.;<BR>(2) क्षीवति,<BR> -ते (क्षीव्, c. 1.) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intoxicating
INTOXICATING (adj.):<BR>(1) मादक (f. दिका);<BR>(2)<BR>मदजननः (नी, नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intoxication
INTOXICATION: मत्तता: v. Drunkenness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intractable
INTRACTABLE:<BR>(1) दुर्दान्त (f. न्ता);<BR>(2) दुर्दमः<BR>(मा, मं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intractableness
INTRACTABLENESS:<BR>(1) दुर्दमता;<BR>(2) उदभ्यता;<BR>(3)<BR>दुर्दान्तता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intransitive
INTRANSITIVE: अकर्मकः (का, कं). I. ly: expr. by<BR>adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrench
INTRENCH:<BR>I To fortify with a trench:<BR>परिखया परिवेष्टयति (वेष्ट्, c. 10.).<BR>II To en-<BR>-croach: q.v.: गृह्वाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrenchment
INTRENCHMENT: परिखा: v. Ditch.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrepid
INTREPID: निर्भयः (या, यं): v. Fearless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrepidity
INTREPIDITY:<BR>(1) निर्मीकता;<BR>(2) निर्मयता;<BR>(3)<BR>अभयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrepidly
INTREPIDLY: निर्भयम्: v. Fearlessly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intricacy
INTRICACY:<BR>(1) विषमता;<BR>(2) वैषम्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intricate
INTRICATE:<BR>(1) विषमः: (मा, मं);<BR>(2) निगूढ (f. ढा)<BR>(= profound).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intricately
INTRICATELY:<BR>(1) विषमम्;<BR>(2) निगूढम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrigue
INTRIGUE (subs.):<BR>I A plot: उपजापः।<BR>II An<BR>amour: व्याभिचारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrigue
INTRIGUE (v. t.): उपजपति (जप्, c. 1.),<BR>we two<BR>together will i. with Nāgapāla:<BR>आवां सम्भूय<BR> नागपालमुपजपावः, D. viii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intriguer
INTRIGUER: उपजपकः, उपजापकारिन् (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrinsic
INTRINSIC: perh. यथार्थ (f. र्था) (= real: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrinsically
INTRINSICALLY: यथार्थतः (= really, truly:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

introduce
INTRODUCE:<BR>I To lead in: प्रवेशयति (c. of<BR>विश्):<BR>II To bring to be acquainted:<BR>perh. परिचयं जनयति (c. of जन्) (with gen.).<BR>III To bring into practice: प्रवर्तयति (c. of<BR>वृत्)<BR>IV To produce: q.v.: जनयति (c. of<BR>जन्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

introducer
INTRODUCER: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

introduction
INTRODUCTION:<BR>I Preface:<BR>(1) मुखबन्धः;<BR>(2)<BR>भूमिका;<BR>(3) प्रस्तावना (of a play).<BR>II Leading<BR>in: प्रवेशनम्।<BR>III Rudiments: उपक्रमणिका।<BR>IV<BR>In other senses: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=390" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

introductory
INTRODUCTORY:<BR>I Lit.: प्रावेशिकः (की, कं),<BR>i.<BR>song:<BR>प्रवेशिक्याक्षिप्तिका,<BR>V iv.<BR>II Preparatory:<BR>(1) expr. by subs.,<BR>i. chapter:<BR>मुखबन्धः, -अध्यायः;<BR>(2) प्रथमः (मा, मं) (= first) may occasionally<BR>do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

introspection
INTROSPECTION:<BR>(1) अन्तर्दर्शनम्;<BR>(2) दर्शनम्<BR>(= view) will gen. do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrude
INTRUDE: अनाहूतः (ता, तं) प्रविशति (विश्, c. 6.)<BR>(= to enter uninvited) (?): v. Also to<BR>encroach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrusive
INTRUSIVE: धृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं) (?); better by verb.:<BR>v. To intrude.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intrust
INTRUST: v. Entrust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intuition
INTUITION: *सहजज्ञानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intuitive
INTUITIVE:<BR>(1) *सहजज्ञानलब्ध। (f. ब्धा);<BR>(2) by<BR>adv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intuitively
INTUITIVELY: *सहजज्ञानेन। The idea probably<BR>occurs in Ki. xi. 8. “अविज्ञतेऽपि बन्धौ हि बला-<BR>त्प्रह्लदते मनः” (= for one i. knows a friend),<BR>in Ki. xiii. 6. “विमलं कलुषीभवच्च चेतः कथयत्येव<BR> हितैषिणं रिपुं वा”, and similar passages.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intussusception
INTUSSUSCEPTION: उदावर्तः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intwine
INTWINE: v. Entwine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

intundate
INTUNDATE: प्लावयति, आ-, परि-, (c. of प्ल): v.<BR>To deluge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inundation
INUNDATION:<BR>(1) वन्या;<BR>(2) जलाप्लावनम्: v.<BR>Flood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inure
INURE: अभ्यस्यति (अस्, c. 4.): v. To accustom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inturement
INTUREMENT: अभ्यासः: v. Practice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inurn
INURN: निदधाति (धा, c. 3.): v. To bury, put.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inutility
INUTILITY: उन्तुपयोगिता: v. Uselessness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invade
INVADE: अ-क्रमति (क्रम्, c. 1.),<BR>thus, i. ing the<BR>eastern provinces:<BR>पौरस्त्यातेवमाक्रामंस्तांस्तान् जनपदान्,<BR>R. iv. 34.: v. To attack, depredate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invader
INVADER: आक्रमणकारिन् (n.). Often expr. by<BR>enemy: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invalid
INVALID (adj.):<BR>I Weak: q.v.; दुर्बलः (ला,<BR> लं).<BR>II In law: अप्रमाणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invalid
INVALID (subs.):<BR>(1) रोगिन् (f. णी) (= sick);<BR>(2) असुस्थ (f. स्था) (= ill).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invalidate
INVALIDATE: मोघीकरोति: v. To frustrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invalidity
INVALIDITY: अप्रामाण्यम्; दुर्बलता (= weakness:<BR>q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invaluable
INVALUABLE:<BR>(1) अद्द्मूल्य (f. ल्या);<BR>(2) अनर्घ<BR>(f. र्घा)<BR>or<BR>अनर्घ्य (f. र्घ्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invaluableness
INVALUABLENESS:<BR>(1) अमूल्यता;<BR>(2) अनर्ध(र्घ्य)ता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invariable
INVARIABLE: expr. by adv.: v. Also un-<BR>-changeable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invariably
INVARIABLY:<BR>(1) नित्यम्;<BR>(2) सततम्: v. Always.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invasion
INVASION: आक्रमणम्: v. Attack, inroad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invective
INVECTIVE: आक्षेपः, अवक्षेपः<BR>or<BR>अधिक्षेपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inveigh against
INVEIGH AGAINST:<BR>(1) कुत्सां करोति (with gen.),<BR>Mah.;<BR>(2) धिक्करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inveigle
INVEIGLE:<BR>(1) प्रलोभयति (c. of लुभ्) (= to<BR>tempt);<BR>(2) पातयति (c. of पत्) (= to fell)<BR>(when the sense is clear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invent
INVENT: सुजति (सृज्, c. 6.): v. To create.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invention
INVENTION: सृष्टिः (both in good and bad<BR>sense).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inventive
INVENTIVE: Ph.:<BR>i. power:<BR>उद्भ्रावन-<BR>or<BR>उत्पादन-<BR>शक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inventor
INVENTOR: स्रष्टृ (m.) (= creator); उद्भ्रावयितृ<BR>(m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inventory
INVENTORY: परिसंख्या,<BR>“i. of all I have”:<BR>मम<BR> सर्वस्वपरिसंख्या (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inventress
INVENTRESS: स्रष्ट्री (?); उद्भावयित्री (?); प्रसूः<BR>(= mother).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inverse
INVERSE:<BR>(1) विपर्यस्त (f. स्ता) (?);<BR>(2) व्यत्यस्त<BR>(f. स्ता) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inversely
INVERSELY:<BR>(1) विपर्ययेण (?);<BR>(2) विपर्यासेन (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inversion
INVERSION:<BR>(1) विपर्ययः (?);<BR>(2) व्यत्ययः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invert
INVERT (v.t.): विपर्यासयति (c. of अस्) (?). Ph.:<BR>reads i. ing the first and the second personal pro-<BR>noun:<BR>युष्मदस्मदयोर्व्यत्ययेन पठति, Mu. v.; the thick-<BR>ness and thinness of trees are (now)<BR>i. ed:<BR>विपर्यासं<BR> यातो घनविरलमावः क्षितिरुहाम्, U. ii. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invest
INVEST:<BR>I To put on: q.v.: परिधापयति (c.<BR>of धा).<BR>II To endow: q.v.: योजयति (युज्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR>III To adorn: q.v.: भूषयति (भूष्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR>IV To besiege: q.v.: रुणद्धि (रुध,<BR>c. 7.)<BR>V Of money: प्रयोजयति (??),<BR>i. your<BR>money in shares:<BR>*त्वं धनेन मूलांशान् क्रीणीहि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investigate
INVESTIGATE: अनुसन्दधाति (धा, c. 3.) (?).: v.<BR>To enquire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investigation
INVESTIGATION: अनुसन्धानम्: v. Enquiry, exami-<BR>-nation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=391" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investigator
INVESTIGATOR: अनुसन्धातृ (m.): v. Enquirer,<BR>examiner.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investiture
INVESTITURE:<BR>(1) प्रतिष्ठा (?);<BR>(2) अभिषेकः (of<BR>kings);<BR>(3) उपनयः, -नम् (of the first three<BR>castes with their thread).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investment
INVESTMENT:<BR>I of money: प्रियोगः (?): v.<BR>To invest (v.).<BR>II A siege: q.v.: रोधः।<BR>III<BR>A robe: वासस् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

investeracy
INVESTERACY: gen. expr. by adj. I. of enmity:<BR>वैरानुबन्धः, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inveterate
INVETERATE:<BR>(1) बद्धमूलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) दृढमूलः<BR>(ला, लं);<BR>(3) स्थिरः (रा, रं): v. Firm. Ph.:<BR>not free form i. rage:<BR>भृशमासेवितया रुषा न मुक्तः,<BR>Ki. xiii. 5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inveterately
INVETERATELY:<BR>(1) निर्बन्धेनः;<BR>(2) अनुबन्धेनः<BR>v. Also firmly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invidious
INVIDIOUS:<BR>(1) द्वेवजनन (f. नी) (?);<BR>(2) सन्तापक<BR>(f. पिका) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invidiously
INVIDIOUSLY: द्वेषं<BR>or<BR>कोपं<BR>or<BR>सन्तापं जनयत्<BR>(f. न्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invidiousness
INVIDIOUSNESS: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invigorate
INVIGORATE: बलं<BR>or<BR>सत्त्वं<BR>or<BR>तेजो वर्धयति (c. of<BR>वृध्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invigorating
INVIGORATING: बलदः (दा, दं), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invigoration
INVIGORATION:<BR>(1) बलदानम्, Bha;<BR>(2) सत्त्वोपचयः;<BR>(3) तेजोवृद्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invincible
INVINCIBLE:<BR>(1) अजेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) दुर्जयः (या,<BR> यं);<BR>(3) अजय्य (f. य्या), Si. xx. 77.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invincibility
INVINCIBILITY, INVINCIBLENESS: अजेयया; दुर्जयता;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invincibly
INVINCIBLY:<BR>(1) दुर्जयम्। etc.;<BR>(2) better by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviolability
INVIOLABILITY:<BR>(1) अलङ्घ्यता;<BR>(2) अमतिक्रमणीयता;<BR>(3) अधृष्यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviolable
INVIOLABLE:<BR>(1) अलङ्घ्य (f. ङ्घ्या)<BR>or<BR>अलङ्घनीयः<BR>(या, यं), we have been made i. by demons:<BR>त्रिदशप्रतिपक्षस्यालङ्घ्वनीये कृते स्वः,<BR>V ii.;<BR>(2) अनति-<BR>क्रमणीयः (या, यं),<BR>your words are also i.:<BR>अनति-<BR>क्रमणीयवचनो भवानपि, Mu. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviolably
INVIOLABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviolate
INVIOLATE:<BR>(1) अखण्ड (f. ण्डा);<BR>(2) अक्षतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invious
INVIOUS: दुर्गमः (मा, मं): v. Impassable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invisibility
INVISIBILITY:<BR>(1) अदृश्यता;<BR>(2) अदर्शनीयता; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invisible
INVISIBLE:<BR>(1) अदृश्य (f. श्या) (best equiv.),<BR>i. forms.<BR>तनूरद्दृश्याः, Ki. xiv. 60.;<BR>(2) दृष्टिपथातीतः<BR>(ता, तं) and sim. comp.s. To become i.:<BR>i.e. to disappear: q.v.: अन्तर्धीयते (pass. of धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invisibly
INVISIBLY: expr. by adj. or comp., to strike i.:<BR>अदृश्यः प्रहरति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invitation
INVITATION: निमन्त्रणम्, उप-, in not keeping i.:<BR>निमन्त्रणातिक्रमे,<BR>V s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invite
INVITE (v.):<BR>I Lit.: निमन्त्रयति, उप- (मन्त्र्, c.<BR>10.),<BR>I will i. a Brahmin:<BR>अहं ब्राह्नणमुपनिमन्त्रयामि,<BR>Mr.; an i. d (person) and eating after saying<BR>“very well” [i.e. after accepting an invi-<BR>-tation]: निमन्त्रितस्तथेत्युक्त्वा भूञ्जानः, V. s.<BR>II Fig.:<BR>आह्वयति (ह्वे, c. 1.),<BR>as if. i. d by the cries of<BR>swans:<BR>कलहंसानं कोलाहलैराहूयमान इव, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviter
INVITER: निमन्त्रयितृ (f. त्री),<BR>and double food to<BR>the i.:<BR>निमन्त्रयितुश्व द्विगुणमन्नम्, V. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inviting
INVITING (adj.): i.e. alluring:<BR>(1) हारिन् (f.<BR>णी);<BR>(2) मनोहरः (रा, रं): v. Charming,<BR>beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invitingly
INVITINGLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invocation
INVOCATION: in books: मङ्गलाचरणम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invoice
INVOICE: *आवाहपत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invoke
INVOKE:<BR>(1) आह्वयति (ह्वे, c. 1.): v. To call;<BR>(2) वन्दते (वन्द्, c. 1.) (= to salute; in<BR>prayer), R. i. l.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

involuntarily
INVOLUNTARILY:<BR>(1) स्वेच्छया<BR>or<BR>स्वेच्छापूर्वं॥॥।न।<BR>: v. Voluntarily;<BR>(2) स्वेच्छाविरुद्धम् (against<BR>wish).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

involuntary
INVOLUNTARY:<BR>(1) न स्वेच्छापूर्व (f. र्वा): v. Volun-<BR>-tary;<BR>(2) स्वेच्छाविरुद्ध (f. द्धा) (against wish).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

involution
INVOLUTION:<BR>I Complication: जटिलता।<BR>II<BR>In math.; सवर्गीकरणम्<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

involve
INVOLVE:<BR>I To envelop: q.v.: अवगुण्ठयति<BR>(गुण्ठ्, c. 10.).<BR>II To comprise, contain:<BR>q.v.: परिगृह्वाति (गृह्, c. 9.).<BR>III To impli-<BR>-cate: expr. by लिप्तः (प्ता, प्तं),<BR>“his end with<BR>mine i. d.”<BR>तदर्थोमदर्थलिप्तः।<BR>IV To overwhelm:<BR>expr. by ग्रस्त (f. स्ता),<BR>i. d. in calamity:<BR>विपद्ग्रस्त<BR>(f. स्ता).<BR>V In math:<BR>i. ing to the third<BR>power:<BR>सदृशत्रयसंवर्गः, A. b.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

invulnerable
INVULNERABLE:<BR>(1) अभेद्य (f. द्या) (= not to<BR>be pierced), Ram.;<BR>(2) by circumlo.: v.<BR>Wound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=392" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inware
INWARE: अन्तर्गतः (ता, तं): v. Internal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inwardly
INWARDLY: अन्तर्: v. Internally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inweave
INWEAVE: perh. संवपति (वप्, c. 1.); संग्रथ्नाति<BR>(ग्रन्थ्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

inwrought
INWROUGHT:<BR>(1) छुरितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) अलङ्कृतः<BR>(ता, तं) (= adorned).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iodine
IODINE: *धूम्राश्मन् (m.); स्योदनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iota
IOTA:<BR>(1) अणुः,<BR>you have not an i. of fear:<BR>न तेऽस्ति<BR> भयमण्वपि, V. p. v. 37. 66;<BR>(2) लवः,<BR>even an i.<BR>of a master's favour:<BR>प्रभुप्रसादलवोऽपि, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

i o u
I O U: अहं त्वां धारयामीति पत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irascibility
IRASCIBILITY:<BR>(1) क्रोधशीलता;<BR>(2) सुलभकोपता;<BR>(3) चण्डता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irascible
IRASCIBLE:<BR>(1) क्रोधशीलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) सुलभ-<BR>कोपः (पा, पं), Sa.: v. Irritable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ire
IRE: कोपः: v. Anger, rage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ireful
IREFUL: अमर्षण (f. णा), Mah. iii. 33. 1.: v.<BR>Angry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irefully
IREFULLY: सकोपम्: v. Angrily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iridescent
IRIDESCENT: इन्द्रायुधसवर्ण (f. र्णा) (?): better<BR>by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iris
IRIS:<BR>I The rainbow: q.v.: इन्द्रायुधम्।<BR>II Of<BR>the eye: *उपतारा।<BR>III A plant: गोलोमी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irk
IRK: खेदयति (c. of खिद्): v. To trouble,<BR>weary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irksome
IRKSOME: खेदकरः (री रं): v. Tiresome, weari-<BR>-some.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iron
IRON (subs.):<BR>I The metal:<BR>(1) लोह<BR>or<BR>लौह<BR>(mn.),<BR>impure i.:<BR>अशुद्धलोहम्;<BR>i. -flying:<BR>लोहभवं<BR> चूर्णम्, Bha.;<BR>(2) अयस् (n.),<BR>tiffed or pointed with<BR>i.:<BR>अयोमुख। (f. खी), Ka.<BR>Wrought i.:<BR>कुशी।<BR>Green<BR>sulphate of i.:<BR>धातुशेखरः।<BR>Red sulphate of i.:<BR>धातु-<BR>काशीशम्। Made of i.:<BR>(1) लौह (f. ही);<BR>(2)<BR>लोहलः (ला, लं): v. Made of.<BR>II An iron<BR>implement: लोहयन्त्रम्<BR>or<BR>लौहः (?).<BR>III In.<BR>pl., fetters: q.v.: लौहशृङ्गलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iron
IRON (adj.): by comp.,<BR>i. image.<BR>लोहप्रतिमा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iron-hearted
IRON-HEARTED:<BR>(1) अयोहृदयः (या, यं), R. and<BR>sim. comp.s.;<BR>(2) अश्महृदयः (या, यं) (= stone-<BR>-hard), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iron
IRON (v.): *लैहेन श्लक्ष्णीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ironical
IRONICAL: काक्वाक्षिप्त (f. प्ता), Kav.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ironically
IRONICALLY:<BR>(1) कक्वाक्षिपय;<BR>(2) काकवाक्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ironmonger
IRONMONGER: लौहकारः<BR>or<BR>लोहकारः, Ram. ii.<BR>90. 23.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ironmongery
IRONMONGERY: लौहमाण्डानि (n. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irony
IRONY: काक्वाक्षिप्तं व्यङ्गम्, Kav.; काकुभाषितम् and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irradiate
IRRADIATE: दीपयति (c. of दीप्): v. To<BR>brighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irradiation
IRRADIATION: प्रद्योतनम्: v. Illumination.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrational
IRRATIONAL:<BR>I Void of reason:<BR>(1) विवेकहीनः<BR>(ना, नं), विवेकरहितः (ता, तं), etc.,<BR>even among<BR>the i. animals:<BR>पशोरपि विवेकविवर्जितस्य, p. ii. 55;<BR>(2) अविवेकः (की, कं), S.<BR>II Unreasonable:<BR>q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrationally
IRRATIONALLY:<BR>(1) अविवेकपूर्कम्;<BR>(2) निर्विवेकेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreclaimaeble
IRRECLAIMAEBLE: अशोध्य (f. ध्या): v. To<BR>reclaim.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreconcilable
IRRECONCILABLE:<BR>I Implacable: अप्रतिसमाघेयः<BR>(या, यं).<BR>II Inconsistent: असमञ्जसः (सा, सं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreconcilably
IRRECONCILABLY: अप्रतिसमाधेयम् (?); better by<BR>adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrecoverable
IRRECOVERABLE: असाध्य (f. ध्या): v. To<BR>recover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrefragable
IRREFRAGABLE: अखण्ड्य (f. ण्ड्या): v. Incontest-<BR>-able, undeniable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrefragably
IRREFRAGABLY: अखण्ड्यम्<BR>or<BR>अखण्डनीयम् (?);<BR>better by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrefutable
IRREFUTABLE:<BR>(1) अखण्ड्य (f. ण्ड्या);<BR>(2)<BR>better by circumlo.: v. To refute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irregular
IRREGULAR:<BR>(1) अवैधः (धा, धं) (= against<BR>rule): v. Regular;<BR>(2) विषमः (मा, मं) (= un-<BR>-even: as of motion);<BR>(3) उच्छृङ्ललः (ला, लं)<BR>(in conduct). In gram.: perh. विशेष-; निपातितः<BR>(ता, तं), Wilson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irregularity
IRREGULARITY:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) अवैधता;<BR>(2)<BR>वैषन्म्यम् (as of motion).<BR>II In gram.: निपातनम्<BR>(?).<BR>III Of conduct: उच्छृङ्गलं चरितम्, Vi.<BR>ii. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irregularly
IRREGULARLY:<BR>(1) अवैधम्;<BR>(2) विषमम्;<BR>(3)<BR>लिच्छृङ्गलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrelevant
IRRELEVANT:<BR>(1) अप्रासङ्गिकः (की, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>असंलग्न (f. न्गा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreligion
IRRELIGION:<BR>(1) अधर्मः, -ता;<BR>(2) विधर्मता: v.<BR>Impiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=393" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreligious
IRRELIGIOUS:<BR>(1) अधार्मिकः (की, कं);<BR>(2) विधर्मिन्<BR>(f. णी): v. Impious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreligiously
IRRELIGIOUSLY:<BR>(1) अधर्मेणः;<BR>(2) धर्ममुन्मथ्य, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreligiousness
IRRELIGIOUSNESS: अधार्मिकता: v. Irreligion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irremediable
IRREMEDIABLE:<BR>(1) अप्रतिकार्य (f. र्या;)<BR>(2)<BR>अप्रति(ती)कारः (रा, रं): v. Also incura-<BR>-ble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irremediably
IRREMEDIABLY: by adj. or comp., i. fierce:<BR>अप्रतीकारदारुणः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irremediably
IRREMEDIABLY:<BR>(1) अप्रतिसमाधेयम्;<BR>(2) better<BR>by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreparable
IRREPARABLE:<BR>(1) अप्रतिसमाधेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2)<BR>अप्रतिकार्य (f. र्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreprehensible
IRREPREHENSIBLE: अनिन्द्य (f. न्द्या): v. Blame-<BR>-less, faultless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreproachable
IRREPROACHABLE:<BR>(1) निरवद्य (f. द्या);<BR>(2)<BR>अनिन्द्व (f. न्द्या): v. Blameless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreproachably
IRREPROACHABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irresistible
IRRESISTIBLE:<BR>(1) अनिवार्य (f. र्या);<BR>(2) दुर्निवारः<BR>(रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irresistibly
IRRESISTIBLY: expr. by adj. or comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irresolute
IRRESOLUTE:<BR>I Fickle: q.v.: अस्थिरचित्तः (त्ता,<BR> त्तं).<BR>II Undertermined, hesitating: v.<BR>To hesitate, determine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irresolutely
IRRESOLUTELY: अस्थिरचित्तेन: v. Also hesita-<BR>-tingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irresolution
IRRESOLUTION:<BR>I Fickleness: q.v.: अस्थिर-<BR>चित्तता।<BR>II Hestitation: q.v.: अनिश्चयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrespective of
IRRESPECTIVE OF: विहाय (= leaving), अगणयित्वा<BR>(= not caring),<BR>or<BR>निरपेक्ष्य (without looking),<BR>(all with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irretrievable
IRRETRIEVABLE: अप्रतिसमाधेयः (या, यं): v.<BR>Irreparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreverence
IRREVERENCE:<BR>(1) अभक्तिः;<BR>(2) अनादरः (= dis-<BR>-regard).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irreverent
IRREVERENT:<BR>(1) मक्तिहीनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) अधार्मिक<BR>(f. की) (= irreligious).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrevocable
IRREVOCABLE:<BR>(1) अनिवर्त्य (f. र्त्या), Mit.;<BR>(2) better by circumlo.,<BR>the curse has been<BR>already pronounced, it is now i. by me:<BR>दत्त एव<BR> शापः सम्प्रति मया नान्यथा मवितुमर्हति, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrevocably
IRREVOCABLY: expr. by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrigate
IRRIGATE: सिञ्चति, अव-, नि-, (सिच्, c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irrigation
IRRIGATION:<BR>(1) सेकः, अव-;<BR>(2) सेचनम्, अव-,<BR>(of the act only).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irritability
IRRITABILITY:<BR>I Irascibility: चण्डस्वभावः।<BR>II<BR>A susceptibility: expr. by ज्वलति (ज्वल्, c. 1.)<BR>(= to burn): v. Also irascible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irritable
IRRITABLE:<BR>(1) कोअनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) क्रोधनः<BR>(ना, नं);<BR>(3) रोषण (f. णा);<BR>(4) चण्ड (f. ण्डा)<BR>or<BR>ण्डी of women).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irritate
IRRITATE:<BR>I To provoke: कोपयति, उत्-, प्र-:<BR>v. Enrage.<BR>II To excite: ज्वलयति (c. of<BR>ज्वल्) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irritation
IRRITATION:<BR>I Anger: q.v.: कोपः।<BR>II Of<BR>the body: ज्वाला (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irritative
IRRITATIVE: i.e. causing irritation: expr. by<BR>comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

irruption
IRRUPTION: उपद्रवः: v. Depredation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isinglass
ISINGLASS: *फोष्फुषम्; मत्स्यान्त्रजो घनसारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

islam
ISLAM: महम्मदीयधर्मः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

island
ISLAND (adj.):<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) द्वैप्य (f.<BR>प्या), Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

island
ISLAND (subs.): द्वीप (mn.), the i. of rāvā (?):<BR>यवद्वीपम्, Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

islander
ISLANDER: द्वीपवासिन् (m.), and sim. comp.<BR>inhabitant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isle
ISLE: v. Island,<BR>an alluvial i.:<BR>पुलिनम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

islet
ISLET: क्षुद्रद्वीप (mn.): v. Small.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isolate
ISOLATE: विश्लेषयति (c. of श्लिष्): v. To<BR>insulate.<BR>I. d from a society:<BR>अपपात्रितः<BR>(ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isolation
ISOLATION: expr. by above, separately: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isosceles
ISOSCELES:<BR>i. triangle^1:<BR>समद्विबाहुत्रिभुजः, K. d. and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isothermal
ISOTHERMAL: *समोत्तापगर्भ (f. र्भा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

issue
ISSUE (subs.):<BR>I Flow, egress: q.v.: निःसरणम्।<BR>II Result: q.v.:<BR>(1) फलम्;<BR>(2) परिणतिः<BR>(= end), whether there be a happy i. or not:<BR>कलयाणी परिणतिरस्तु वान्यथा, Vi. vi. 28.;<BR>(3)<BR>उदर्कः (= future),<BR>sweet in i.:<BR>उदर्कस्वादु (mfn.).<BR>III In law:<BR>point at i.:<BR>विचर्यविषयः।<BR>IV<BR>Progeny: q.v.: सनततिः।<BR>V A discharge:<BR>q.v.: स्रावः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

issue
ISSUE (v. i.):<BR>I To come out, flow: q.v.: अपैति<BR>(इ, c. 2.),<BR>i. ing from the arrow:<BR>अपयन धनुषः, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">Page395</a>]<BR>Ki.<BR>II To spring: q.v.: प्रभवति (भू, c. 1.).<BR>III To end: q.v.: परिणमति (नम्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=394" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

issue
ISSUE (v. t.):<BR>I To deliver: q.v.: समर्पयति<BR>(c. of ऋ).<BR>II To put into circulation:<BR>*बहिर्गमयति (c. of गम्) (after Bengali).<BR>III<BR>To publish: प्रचारयति (c. of चर्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

isthmus
ISTHMUS: *योजकः,<BR>i. of Suez:<BR>*सूयजयोजकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

it
IT: expr. by the “n., m., or f. form” of<BR>pron. s given under he according as the<BR>noun for which it stands is in Sanskrit<BR>n., m., or f.:<BR>I have to say much about it:<BR>मम<BR> बह्वाख्येयमत्र, Mr.; what is it (you)<BR>are thinking<BR>of:<BR>इदं किं चिन्तयते,<BR>Mr.; it is she:<BR>सैवेयम्, Na.;<BR>whether it (भाण्डकः)<BR>is the same or not:<BR>स एवैषा न<BR> वेति, Mr.; therefore it (पृथ्वी)<BR>looks even:<BR>अतः सा<BR> समा प्रतिभाति, Go.; its (मञ्जर्याः)<BR>smell:<BR>अस्या<BR> गन्धः, K.;<BR>is it true:<BR>अपि नाम सत्यम्, Ma.;<BR>it is<BR>said in the Purana that the earth is even:<BR>पुराणे<BR> भूः सभा कथयते, ङो।;<BR>it has been established in the<BR>first part that the Lord of all is the creative<BR>cause of the world:<BR>प्रथमेऽध्याये सर्वेश्वरो जगत उत्पत्ति-<BR>कारणम् प्रतिपादितम्, S.;<BR>if you think it not very<BR>tiresome to go:<BR>यदि नातिखेदकरं गमनं कलयसि, K.<BR>N. B. Note how it is expr. in such cases.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

italics
ITALICS: *इटालीयवर्णः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

italicize
ITALICIZE: *इटालीयवर्णैः लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itech
ITECH (subs.):<BR>(1) कण्डूः, of the i. of arrogance:<BR>दर्पजन्मनः कण्ड्वाः, Si. i. 48.;<BR>(2) कण्डूतिः;<BR>(3)<BR>खर्जूः (the disease);<BR>(4) कण्डूयनम् (i. ing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itch
ITCH (v.): कण्डूयति, -ते (nomi.), i. ing:<BR>कण्डूया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itchy
ITCHY: कण्डूलः (ला, लं): v. Itch (subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

item
ITEM:<BR>(1) पदम्;<BR>(2) विषयः (= subject).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iterate
ITERATE<BR>I To utter again: पुनः पुनर्वदति (वद्,<BR>c. 1.), वक्ति (वच्, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

iteration
ITERATION:<BR>I Repetition: पुनरुक्तिः।<BR>II Doing<BR>again: पुनःक्रिया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itinerant
ITINERANT:<BR>(1) भ्रमणशीलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) अटमानः<BR>(ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itinerary
ITINERARY: *भ्रमणवर्णनम् and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itinerate
ITINERATE<BR>(1) पर्यटनं करोति;<BR>(2) परिभ्रम्यति, (भ्रम्,)<BR>c. 4.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

itself
ITSELF: स्वयम्<BR>or<BR>स्वयमेव, Sr. Ph.: the mind i.:<BR>चेत एव, Ki.;<BR>by nature i.:<BR>स्वभावेनैव, H.;<BR>fresh<BR>cloud, by i.:<BR>केवलोऽपि नवाम्बुदः, R. xi. 80.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ivory
IVORY:<BR>I Subs: गजदन्तः and sim. comp.s.<BR>दन्तः (when meaning clear).<BR>II Adj.: expr.<BR>by comp.,<BR>swords with pure i. hilts:<BR>शुद्धदन्तत्सरू-<BR>नसीन, Mah.;<BR>i. seat:<BR>गजदन्तासनम्, R. xvii. 21.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ivy
IVY: लताविशेषः,<BR>“i. mantled”:<BR>*इव्यावगुण्ठितः<BR>(ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jabber
JABBER: जल्पति (जल्प्, c. 1.): v. To babble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jabberer
JABBERER: जल्पाकः: v. Babbler.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jabbering
JABBERING: जल्पितम्, प्र-: v. Babbling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=395" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jack
