jilt
JILT: (v.): विप्रलमते (लभ्, c. 1.).<BR>I am clearly<BR>j. ed:<BR>व्यक्तमस्मि विप्रलब्धा, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jingle
JINGLE (v.): शिंक्ते (शिञ्ज्, c. 7.): v. To tin-<BR>-kle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jingle
JINGLE (subs.): शिञ्ज<BR>or<BR>शिञ्जितम्: v. Tinkling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jingling
JINGLING (adj.):<BR>(1) शिञ्जन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) भण-<BR>भणायमानः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

job
JOB (subs.):<BR>I A work: सामान्यकर्मन् (n.).<BR>II J.<BR>A Public transaction for private profit:<BR>स्वार्थपरं कार्यम् (?). Ph.:<BR>to do a j. for one, i.e.<BR>to kill:<BR>शमयति (c. of शम्), Vi. iii. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jobber
JOBBER: सामान्यकर्मकारिन् (f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jockey
JOCKEY (subs.): अश्वलाक्षणिकः: v. Also groom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jockey
JOCKEY (v.): v. To cheat, deceive: (also of<BR>men).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jocose
JOCOSE:<BR>I Of expressions, etc.:<BR>(1) हास्यकरः<BR>(री, रं), etc. (= exciting laughter),<BR>j. and<BR>quarrelsome:<BR>हास्यकरः कलहरतिः, Sah.;<BR>(2)<BR>हास्यगर्भ (f. र्भा), etc. (= containing laugh-<BR>-ter);<BR>(3) विनोज्दिन् (f. नी)<BR>or<BR>विनोदकरः (री,<BR> रं) (= amusing).<BR>II Of persons: परिहास-<BR>शीलः (ला, लं); रसिकः (का, कं) (= witty).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jocosely
JOCOSELY:<BR>(1) परिहासेन;<BR>(2) परिहासपूर्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jocoseness
JOCOSENESS:<BR>I Of style, etc.: हास्यकरत्वम्, -ता,<BR>etc.<BR>II Of persons: परिहासशीलता, etc. Better<BR>by adj.: v. Jocose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jocular
JOCULAR, JOCULARITY: v. Jocose, -ness, -ly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jocund
JOCUND: सरसः (सा, सं): v. Merry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jog
JOG (v.):<BR>I To push gently: चालयति (c. of<BR>चल्) (?).<BR>II To j. on: मन्दं मन्दं सर्पति (सृप्,<BR>c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jog
JOG (subs.):<BR>“to give an invisible j.”:<BR>अदृश्यमषि-<BR>दपसारणं करोय्ति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jog-trot
JOG-TROT:<BR>I Lit.: गजगतिः (?).<BR>II A habi-<BR>-tual mode of action: गजगतिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

join
JOIN (v. t.:)<BR>I To unite: q.v.: युनक्ति<BR>or<BR>योज-<BR>यति, सं-, आ-, (युज्, c. 7. and 10.),<BR>you have j. ed<BR>yourself in great penances:<BR>आयोजिज्तस्तपसि<BR> महत्यात्मा, K.<BR>II To come to go over: गच्छति<BR>(गम्, c. 1.). याति (या, c. 2.), एति (इ, c. 2.), etc.,<BR>j. ed Yudhiṣṭhira with his forces:<BR>बलेनागादुयुधिष्ठिरम्।<BR>Dhṛṣṭaketu j. ed the sons of Pāṇḍu:<BR>धृष्टकेत्य्रुपाग-<BR>च्छत् पाण्डवान्; with the hill-chiefs, j. ed the sons<BR>of Pāṇḍu:<BR>पार्वतीयैर्महीपालैः सहितः पाण्डवानियात्;<BR>j. ed<BR>Duryodhana:<BR>दुर्योधनमुपयातौ, Mah. v. 19. 1-17.;<BR>to j. battle:<BR>रणं गच्छति, V. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

join
JOIN (v. i.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) संयुज्यते (pass. of युज्)<BR>(rare);<BR>(2) by युक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR>II To take<BR>part in:<BR>(1) उपागच्छति (गम्, c. 1.);<BR>(2)<BR>उपैति (इ, c. 2.);<BR>(3) आयाति (य, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joiner
JOINER:<BR>(1) सूत्रधारः;<BR>(2) तक्षन् (m.) (= carpen-<BR>-ter: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joint
JOINT (subs.):<BR>(1) सन्धिः,<BR>j. s are flexible and<BR>inflexible:<BR>सन्धयश्चेष्टावत्यः स्त्य्हिराश्च, Bha.;<BR>there are<BR>three j. s in every toe:<BR>एलैकस्यां पादाङ्गुल्यां त्रयस्न्न्यः<BR> सन्धयः, Bha.;<BR>out of j.:<BR>सन्धिमुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं), Sr.;<BR>(2) पर्वन् (n.) (in plants and animals: also<BR>the part between two j. s. in a plant: might<BR>be applied to a j. of meat),<BR>in every j. of the<BR>sugarcane:<BR>इक्ष्वोः पर्वणि पर्वणि, P. ii.;<BR>with j. s.<BR>rough like those of bamboo:<BR>वेणुकर्कशपर्व (f. र्वा),<BR>R. xii. 41.;<BR>(5) ग्रन्थिः (= knot).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joint
JOINT (v.):<BR>I To join: q.v.: सन्दधाति (धा,<BR>c. 3.)<BR>II To disjoint: वियोजयति (c. of युज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joint
JOINT (adj.):<BR>I Combined:<BR>(1) समवेतः (ता,<BR> तं);<BR>(2) संहतः (ता, तं).<BR>II Held in comp-<BR>-mon: साधारण (f. णी),<BR>j. property:<BR>साधारणधन्म्,<BR>Da.;<BR>j. -family property:<BR>संसृष्टिधनम्, Mit.:<BR>j.-<BR>stock-company:<BR>सम्भूयकारिणः or precisely *समवाय-<BR>मूलप्रयोक्तारः।<BR>III Sharing in common: सह-<BR>in comp.,<BR>j. heir;<BR>एकरिक्थिन् (f. नी), M. ix.<BR>162.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jointly
JOINTLY:<BR>(1) सह;<BR>(2) समवायेन;<BR>(3) सम्भूयः<BR>v. Unitedly, together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jointure
JOINTURE: सौदायिकं धनम् (?), Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joist
JOIST: *कीलकाष्ठम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joke
JOKE (subs.):<BR>(1) परिहासः,<BR>practical j.:<BR>*कर्मपरि-<BR>हासः: v. Jest.:<BR>(2) प्रहासः,<BR>even in j.:<BR>प्रहासनेऽपि,<BR>Ka. v. 20.;<BR>(3) नर्मन (n.) (= play),<BR>I speak<BR>in earnest, no j.:<BR>सत्यं ब्रवाणि, न नर्म, B. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joke
JOKE (v.):<BR>(1) परिहासं करोति;<BR>(2) क्रीडति (= to<BR>play)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joker
JOKER:<BR>(1) परिहासयितृ (m.);<BR>(2) परिहासवेत्त्<BR>(m.);<BR>(3) परिहासकारिन् (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joking
JOKING (subs.): परिहासः,<BR>away with j.:<BR>अलं<BR> परिहासेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=397" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jokingly
JOKINGLY:<BR>(1) परिहासेन;<BR>(2) परिहासपूर्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jollity
JOLLITY: आमोदप्रमोदः (?): v. Festivity, gaiety.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jolly
JOLLY: प्रपुल्लः (ल्ला, ल्लं): v. Merry, fine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jolly-boat
JOLLY-BOAT: no equiv.: केलि-नौः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jolt
JOLT, JOLTING (subs.):<BR>(1) उद्घातः,<BR>he went over<BR>the pleasant^1 road where there was no j.:<BR>ययावनुद्-<BR>घातसुखेन सोऽध्वना;<BR>(2) क्षोभः (?). R. i. 58.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jolt
JOLT (v.): उद्रघातं गच्छति (गम्, c. 2.): v. To<BR>shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jostle
JOSTLE: सं-बाधते (बाध्, c. 1.): v. To shake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jostling
JOSTLING (subs): संबाधा (?), Ki.;<BR>(2) संक्षोभः<BR>(= agitation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jot
JOT (subs.): कणः: v. Iota.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jot
JOT (v.):<BR>j. down:<BR>अभिलिखति (लिख्, c. 6.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jotting
JOTTING (subs.):<BR>where are my j. s:<BR>*क्व यन्मयाभि-<BR>लिखितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

journal
JOURNAL: पत्रिका (?): v. Also diary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

journalist
JOURNALIST: पत्रिकालोखकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

journey
JOURNEY (subs.):<BR>(1) प्रयाणम्: v. March;<BR>(2)<BR>expr. by words given under way,<BR>thus after<BR>a few day's j.:<BR>इत्यध्वनः कैश्चदहोभिरन्ते, R. xvi.<BR>35.;<BR>I wish you a pleasant j.:<BR>तव वर्त्मनि वर्ततां<BR> शिवम्, N. ii. 62.<BR>or<BR>शिवास्ते सन्तु पन्थानः,<BR>Sa. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

journey
JOURNEY (v.): प्रयाति (या, c. 2.): v. To<BR>march, travel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

journey-man
JOURNEY-MAN: भृतकः, Viv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jovial
JOVIAL:<BR>(1) प्रकुल्लः (ल्ला, ल्लं);<BR>(2) सोल्लासः (सा,<BR> सं): v. Merry.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joviality
JOVIALITY: प्रफुल्लता: v. Mirth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jowl
JOWL: गण्डः: v. Cheek.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joy
JOY (subs.):<BR>(1) हर्षः, प्र-,<BR>heavy with j.:<BR>हर्षजडः<BR>(डा, डं), R. iii. 68.;<BR>(2) आनन्दः,<BR>with tears<BR>of j.:<BR>आनन्दजाश्रुभिः,: v. Pleasure, delight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joy
JOY (v.):<BR>I To rejoice, be delighted: q.v.:<BR>हृष्यति (हृष्, c. 4.).<BR>II To delight, give<BR>pleasure: q.v.: हर्षयति (c. of हृष्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joyful
JOYFUL:<BR>(1) हृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं), प्र-, सं-;<BR>(2) आन-<BR>न्दितः (ता, तं): v. Also delightfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joyfully
JOYFULLY:<BR>(1) सानन्दम्;<BR>(2) हृष्टचित्तेन;<BR>(3)<BR>सोल्लासम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joyless
JOYLESS:<BR>(1) निरानन्दः (न्दा, न्दं);<BR>(2) अहर्षः<BR>(र्षा, र्षं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joyous
JOYOUS:<BR>(1) सानन्दः (न्दा, न्दं);<BR>(2) सहर्षः (सहर्षः) (र्षा,<BR> र्षं): v. Joyful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

joyously
JOYOUSLY:<BR>(1) सानन्दम्;<BR>(2) सहर्षम्: v. Joy-<BR>-fully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jubilant
JUBILANT:<BR>I Lit.: जयध्वनिं कृर्वन् (f. न्ती).<BR>II<BR>Joyful: q.v.: संहृष्ट (f. ष्टा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jubilee
JUBILEE:<BR>I Rapture: प्रहर्षः।<BR>II A season of<BR>joy:<BR>“the town was all a j. of feasts”:<BR>स्र्वं नगरं<BR> महोत्सवमयमासीत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judaical
JUDAICAL: *यिहुदीयः (या, यं).<BR>J. ly:<BR>*यिहुदीय-<BR>प्रकारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judaism
JUDAISM: *यिहुदीयधर्मः; also *यिहुदीयधर्मासक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judge
JUDGE (subs.):<BR>I Civil:<BR>(1) प्राड्विवाकः (the<BR>chief j.),<BR>an appeal lies to the c. j. from the<BR>decision of a king's employee:<BR>नृपाधिकृतकृतः प्राड्-<BR>विवाकसविधं परावर्तते, Mit.;<BR>(2) अधिकर्णिकः, धर्म-,<BR>(any j.),<BR>then enters the j. with the merchant<BR>and the writer:<BR>ततः प्रविशति श्रेष्ठिकायस्थपरिवृतोऽधि-<BR>करणिकः, Mr. ix.;<BR>(3) विचारकः, निर्णेतृ (m.),<BR>etc. (in gen. sense), the heads of families,<BR>classes and communities are j. s of the said<BR>(actions): कुलश्रेणिगणाध्यक्षाः प्रोक्तनिर्णयकारिणः, Vri.<BR>II An expert:<BR>(1) गुणदोषज्ञः;<BR>(2) विशेषज्ञः;<BR>(3) रसज्ञः (= appreciator).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judge
JUDGE (v.t.):<BR>(1) विचारयति (c. of चर्),<BR>as he<BR>j. s:<BR>विचारयति येनासौ। Vy.;<BR>(2) विवेचयति (c. of<BR>विच्);<BR>(3) निर्णयति (नी, c. 1.) (= to decide<BR>q.v.);<BR>(4) संचिन्तयति (चिन्त्, c. 10.) (= to<BR>think, consider: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judgment
JUDGMENT:<BR>I In law: निर्णयः। N. B. Not<BR>विचारः = enquiry, trial.<BR>II Notion, taste:<BR>q.v.: विचारः, Ku. v. 42.<BR>III Reason: q.v.:<BR>विवेकः।<BR>IV Divine: दण्डः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judgment-day
JUDGMENT-DAY: धर्मविचारदिनम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judgment-hall
JUDGMENT-HALL:<BR>(1) विचारसभा;<BR>(2) दह्र्मसभा।<BR>Court of j.: धर्माधिकरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judicial
JUDICIAL: व्यवहार- in comp., j. subordination:<BR>व्यवहारपराधीनता, Mr. ix.;<BR>j. proceedings consist<BR>of four parts:<BR>व्यवहारश्चतुष्पदः, Vri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judicially
JUDICIALLY:<BR>(1) विवार्य;<BR>(2) विचारं कृत्वा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judicious
JUDICIOUS: विवेकिन् (f. नी): v. Discreet, cir-<BR>-cumspect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=398" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judiciously
JUDICIOUSLY:<BR>(1) विवेकेन;<BR>(2) विवेकपूर्वकम्;<BR>(3)<BR>विविच्य।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

judiciousness
JUDICIOUSNESS: विवेकिता: v. Discretion,<BR>circumspection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jug
JUG: कमण्डलुः: v. Pitcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juggle
JUGGLE (v.):<BR>I To deceive: मोहयति (c. of<BR>मुह्),<BR>j. ing the chief of Mālwa with the art of<BR>j. ry:<BR>इन्द्रजालविद्यया मालवेन्द्रं मोहयन्, D.<BR>II To<BR>practise, j. ry: इन्द्रजालं करोति;<BR>j. ing men:<BR>इन्द्र-<BR>जालपुरुषाः, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juggle
JUGGLE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: इन्द्रजालम्, this is j.:<BR>इदमिन्द्रजालम्, Ra. iv. 19.<BR>II Deception:<BR>q.v.: माया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juggler
JUGGLER: ऐन्द्रजालिकः, Ra. iv.<BR>Hisrod:<BR>पिच्छिका, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jugglery
JUGGLERY:<BR>(1) इन्द्रजालम्;<BR>(2) कुहकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jugular
JUGULAR: by comp.,<BR>j. vein:<BR>गलधमनिः, Vi.<BR>The<BR>two external j. veins:<BR>मन्ये (f. dual), B. iii. 28.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juice
JUICE: रसः,<BR>j. of the date:<BR>खर्जूररसः, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juicy
JUICY:<BR>(1) रसमयः (यी, यं);<BR>(2) रसपूर्ण (f. र्णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jujube
JUJUBE:<BR>I The tree:<BR>(1) ब(व)दरः, -री, -रिका;<BR>(2) कर्कन्धुः।<BR>II The fruit: वदरम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

july
JULY: उत्तराषाढपूर्वश्रावणसंवादीयुरूपीयवर्षस्य सप्तमो मासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jumble
JUMBLE (v. t.): व्यामिश्रयति (मिश्र्, c. 10.): v.<BR>To mix, confuse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jumble
JUMBLE (subs.): सङ्करः (?): v. Confusion, mix-<BR>-ture.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jump
JUMP:<BR>I Subs: भम्पः: v. Leap.<BR>II Verb:<BR>भम्पं ददाति: v. To leap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

junction
JUNCTION:<BR>I Union: q.v.: योगः।<BR>II Of<BR>rivers: सङ्गमः।<BR>III Of rail lines *सङ्गमः,<BR>Kanoo j.: कोणसङ्गमः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juncture
JUNCTURE:<BR>I In gen.: सन्धिः,<BR>in the j. of the<BR>Tretā and Dwāpara:<BR>त्रेताद्वापरयोः सन्धौ, Mah.<BR>II Of time: क्षणम्: v. Time, opportunity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

june
JUNE: उत्तरज्यैष्ठपूर्वाषाढसंवादीयुरुपीयवर्षस्य षष्ठो मासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jungle
JUNGLE: ज (जा) ङ्गलम्,<BR>j. cock:<BR>वनकुक्कु टः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

junior
JUNIOR: कनिष्ठ (f. ष्ठा) (lit. and fig.): v.<BR>Young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juniper
JUNIPER: वृक्षभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

junk
JUNK: चीनदेशीयपोतः; *जङ्कम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

junket
JUNKET: v. Sweetmeat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juridical
JURIDICAL: expr. by comp.,<BR>j. seat:<BR>धर्मासनम्,<BR>Sa.;<BR>“in j. construction”:<BR>धर्मार्थेन (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jurisconsult
JURISCONSULT:<BR>(1) धर्मज्ञः, M.;<BR>(2) धर्मशास्त्रेषु<BR> कुशलः, N.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jurisdiction
JURISDICTION: अधिकारः,<BR>beyond j.:<BR>अधिकारबहिभतः<BR>(ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jurisprudence
JURISPRUDENCE: धर्मः, -शास्त्रम्,<BR>promulgators of<BR>systems of j.:<BR>धर्मशास्त्रप्रवर्तकाः, Y.; (precisely)<BR>*व्यवहारधर्मः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jurist
JURIST: धर्मशास्त्रकुशलः (ला, लं), -कोविदः (दा, दं),<BR>etc.; (precisely) *व्यवहारधर्मज्ञ (f. ज्ञा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juror
JUROR, JURY-MAN:<BR>(1) सभ्यः,<BR>the j. s are the<BR>examiners of actions:<BR>सभ्याः कार्यपरीक्षकाः, Vri.;<BR>(2) सभासद् (m.), P. i. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jury
JURY: सभ्याः (m. pl.), Mit.,<BR>the j. system:<BR>सभ्यैः<BR> सह विचारविधिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

just
JUST (adj.):<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) धार्मिक (f. की);<BR>(2) न्यायपरायण (f. णा); etc.<BR>II Of action,<BR>etc.:<BR>(1) न्याय्य (f. य्या);<BR>(2) न्यायसङ्गत (f.<BR>ता);<BR>(3) धार्म्य (f. र्म्या); etc.<BR>III Exact,<BR>proper: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

just
JUST (adv.):<BR>I In gen.: by -एव,<BR>j. so:<BR>एवमेव;<BR>j.<BR>now:<BR>इदानीमेव;<BR>j. here:<BR>इहैव, Sa. i.;<BR>j. the same<BR>feature:<BR>सैवाकृतिः, U., iv. 23.;<BR>complaisance is<BR>j. proper for affection:<BR>उचितमेव दाक्षिण्यं स्नेहस्य, U.<BR>iii.;<BR>j. at this moment:<BR>अस्मिन्नेव क्षणे, D. v.; j.<BR>before sunrise:<BR>अनुक्षित एव भास्करे।<BR>II Only:<BR>j.<BR>wait a moment:<BR>मुहूर्तं तावत्तिष्ठ, Sa.;<BR>so much sun-<BR>shine as is sufficient for lotus-blowing:<BR>तावन्तमेवा-<BR>तपं तनोति यावन्मात्रेण कमलोन्मेषो साध्यते, Ku. ii.<BR>23.<BR>III = instantly; now: q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justice
JUSTICE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) धर्मः;<BR>(2) न्यायः<BR>(= equity).<BR>II Justness: न्याय्यता।<BR>III<BR>Just treatment: expr. by circumlo,<BR>you will<BR>have j. in his hands:<BR>*तद्धस्ते ते समुचितविचारो<BR> भविष्यति।<BR>IV A judge: धर्माध्यक्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justiciary
JUSTICIARY:<BR>(1) धर्माध्यक्षः;<BR>(2) प्राड्विवाकः: v.<BR>Judge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justifiable
JUSTIFIABLE: expr. by comp.: v. To justify.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justifiably
JUSTIFIABLY: न्यायतः (= justly): v. Rightly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justification
JUSTIFICATION:<BR>I Excuse: (मर्षणीयं ?) कारणम्,<BR>admitting pleads j.:<BR>प्रपद्य कारणं ब्रूते, Mit.<BR>II<BR>Absolution: शोधनम्<BR>or<BR>शुद्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justifier
JUSTIFIER:<BR>I One who defends: expr. by<BR>verb.<BR>II Absolver: शोधकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=399" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justify
JUSTIFY:<BR>I To defend: न्याय्यः (f. य्या) इति<BR> प्रदर्शयति (c. of दृश्)<BR>or<BR>प्रतिपादयति (c. of पद्).<BR>II To clear: q.v.: शोधयति (c. of शुध्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justly
JUSTLY:<BR>(1) न्यायतः;<BR>(2) यथान्यायम्;<BR>(3) यथार्थतः<BR>(= rightly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

justness
JUSTNESS: न्याय्यता: v. Just, justice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

jut
JUT (v.): प्रलम्बते (लम्ब्, c. 1.),<BR>j. ting:<BR>प्रलम्ब (f.<BR>म्बा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juvenile
JUVENILE: बालः, in comp.,<BR>j. sports:<BR>बालक्रीडाः<BR>(m. pl.): v. Youthful, childish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juvenility
JUVENILITY: कौमारावस्था v. Youthfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

juxtaposition
JUXTAPOSITION:<BR>(1) सन्निधानम्<BR>or<BR>सान्निध्यम्, -योगः;<BR>(2) सन्निकर्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kale
KALE: शाकभेदः; *कविः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kalendar
KALENDAR: v. Calendar.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kalif
KALIF: *कालपः: v. Emperor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kangaroo
KANGAROO: an animal: *कङ्गरुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keel
KEEL: नौकातलम् (?); *कीलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keen
KEEN:<BR>I Sharp: q.v.: तीक्ष्ण (f. क्ष्णा),<BR>K.-<BR>pointed:<BR>तिक्ष्णाग्र (f. ग्रा),<BR>with a k. edge:<BR>तीक्ष्णधारः<BR>(रा, रं).<BR>II Severe: q.v.: तीज्व्र (f. व्रा),<BR>also, thundering saying with k. impetus:<BR>अहह<BR> तीव्रसंवेगो वाग्वज्रः, U. i.<BR>III Eager: q.v.<BR>IV<BR>In mind: सूक्ष्मबुद्धि (mfn.): v. Also sharp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keenly
KEENLY:<BR>(1) तीक्ष्णम्: v. Sharply;<BR>(2) तीव्रम्:<BR>v. Severely, bitterly:<BR>(2) अत्यन्तम्: v. Ex-<BR>-ceedingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keenness
KEENNESS: q.v.: तीक्ष्णता।<BR>II Severity: q.v.:<BR>तीव्रता।<BR>III Eagerness: व्यग्रता (= shrewd).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keen-eyed
KEEN-EYED, KEEN-SIGHTED:<BR>(1) सूक्ष्मबुद्धि (mfn.);<BR>(2) दूरदर्शिन् (f. नी); (far-sighted);<BR>(3) चतुरः<BR>(रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keen-sightedness
KEEN-SIGHTEDNESS:<BR>(1) सूक्ष्मबुद्धः;<BR>(2) दूरदर्शिता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep
KEEP (v. t.):<BR>I To retain:<BR>(1) रक्षति, सं-, परि-,<BR> अभि- (रक्ष्, c. 1.),<BR>Mālavikā is kept out of the<BR>sight of His Majesty:<BR>मालविका भर्तूर्दर्शनपथाद्रक्ष्यते,<BR>Mal. i.;<BR>to k. counsel;<BR>मन्त्रं संरक्षति, Ka.;<BR>can<BR>I k. my tongue now:<BR>किमिदानीहं जिह्वां रक्षितुं<BR> समर्थेऽस्मि,<BR>V ii.;<BR>(2) धरति<BR>or<BR>धारयति (धृ, c.<BR>l. and 10.) (= to hold), should k. in mind:<BR>हृदि धर्तुमर्हसि, M. n.; therefore you k. (it): तस्मात्<BR> स्वयं धारय, Mr. iii.<BR>II Fig., to observe:<BR>रक्षति, सं-, etc.,<BR>to keep a promise:<BR>प्रतिज्ञां परिरक्षति,<BR>Sca.;<BR>k. ing of a vow:<BR>व्रताभिरक्षा, Ki.<BR>III To<BR>preserve: रक्षति, etc.,<BR>to k. the hair:<BR>केशानां<BR> रक्षणार्थाय, Pa.<BR>IV To have: q.v.: रक्षति (?:<BR>used in Bengali). Ph.:<BR>have you kept the<BR>secret I entrusted:<BR>रक्ष्यते भवता रहस्यनिक्षेपः,<BR>V ii.;<BR>to k. daily accounts of receipts and expenses:<BR>नित्यमायव्यये अनुतिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.) (?), Mah.<BR>ii. 5. 72.;<BR>to k. bed:<BR>शय्यायां तिष्ठति;<BR>he k. s a<BR>school:<BR>तस्य विद्यागृहमस्ति;<BR>to k. bad hours:<BR>विलम्बेन<BR> शय्यां गच्छति (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep
KEEP (v.i.):<BR>I To last, stay: q.v.: तिष्ठति<BR>(स्था, c. 1.).<BR>II To remain, continue:<BR>आस्ते (आस्, c. 2.),<BR>to k. crying:<BR>रुदन्नास्ते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep back
KEEP BACK: रक्षतिः v. To withhold, restrain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep company
KEEP COMPANY:<BR>I To associate: q.v.: संसरी-<BR>करोति।<BR>II To accompany: q.v.: सहचरी-<BR>मवति (with gen.), N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep down
KEEP DOWN: निर्गृह्लाति (ग्रह, c. 9.): v. To<BR>check, repress.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep off
KEEP OFF:<BR>I Trans: निवर्तयति (c. of वृत्):<BR>v. To prevent.<BR>II Intrans: निवर्तते (वृत्,<BR>c. 1.): v. To obtain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep on
KEEP ON: न विरमति (रम्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>श्राम्यति (श्रम्,<BR>c. 4.) (with inf. or loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep to
KEEP TO: अनुवर्तते (वृत्, c. 1.): v. To follow.<BR>Ph.:<BR>k. ing to one's own religion:<BR>स्वधर्मवर्तित्वम्,<BR>Mah. iii. 313. 88.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep up
KEEP UP: रक्षति: v. To keep, maintain, hold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keep
KEEP (subs.): of a castle: गुप्तिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keeper
KEEPER:<BR>I Lit.: रक्षकः।<BR>II As of a park:<BR>पालः, -कः,<BR>k. of a prison:<BR>गुप्तिपालकः, Mr. vi.;<BR>(2) rarely by deriv.,<BR>dog k.:<BR>श्वगणी, R. ix.<BR>53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keeping
KEEPING (subs): रक्षा, अभि-, etc.: v. To keep.<BR>In k. with i.e.<BR>agreeing:<BR>संवादिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keepsake
KEEPSAKE: प्रीतिदायः (?), Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

keg
KEG: भाण्डविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ken
KEN: गोचरः, beyond the k. of speech and mind:<BR>अतीत्य वाचां मनसाञ्च गोचरम्, Ki. xviii. 41.: v.<BR>View.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=400" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kennel
KENNEL:<BR>I A cot: कुक्कुरशाला (?).<BR>II A pack:<BR>दलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kerb-stone
KERB-STONE: निरोधोपलः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kerchief
KERCHIEF: आवरणम् (any covering): v. Also<BR>hand-k.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kernel
KERNEL:<BR>I Of a fruit: बीजम्,<BR>as if its seeds have<BR>been thrown out by the k.-eating time:<BR>बीजभुजादसीयं<BR> कालेन निष्ठ्यूतमिवास्थियुथम्, N.<BR>II. Of flesh:<BR>गण्डः (?), Bha.<BR>III Fig.: मूलम्: v. Bottom.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kernelly
KERNELLY:<BR>(1) बीजमयः (यी, यं);<BR>(2) बीजपूर्ण<BR>(f. र्णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kestrel
KESTREL: भासः (?); श्येनः (= falcon).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ketch
KETCH: पोतविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kettle
KETTLE:<BR>(1) कटाहः;<BR>(2) पिठरः;<BR>(3) कन्दुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kettle-drum
KETTLE-DRUM:<BR>(1) भेरी (large k. ?);<BR>(2) गुञ्जा<BR>(small k. ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

key
KEY:<BR>I Of a lock:<BR>(1) अङ्कुटः (?);<BR>(2) कुञ्चिका<BR>(?).<BR>II In gen.: उद्घाटकः,<BR>becomes a k. in a<BR>locked door:<BR>उद्घाटको भवति यन्त्रदृढे कपाटे, Mr. iii.<BR>III Explanation: q.v.: व्याख्या।<BR>IV Key-<BR>-note: वादिन् (m.), Wilson.<BR>V Of a country:<BR>शरणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

key-hole
KEY-HOLE: अङ्कुटच्छिद्रम् and sim. comp.s. (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

key-stone
KEY-STONE: *सारप्रस्तरः; सन्धानप्रस्तरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kibe
KIBE:<BR>(1) पादस्फोटः;<BR>(2) विपादिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kick
KICK (v.):<BR>(1) पादेन प्रहरति (हृ, c. 1.), ताडयति<BR>(तड्, c. 10.)<BR>or<BR>हन्ति, आ-, (हन्, c. 2.),<BR>k. ed<BR>on the head:<BR>पदा मूर्द्ध्रि प्राहरत्, Mah.;<BR>(2) पादं<BR> क्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.) (of horses ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kick
KICK, KICKING (subs.):<BR>(1) पादप्रहारः;<BR>(2)<BR>पदाघातः;<BR>(3) पादक्षेपः (of horse ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kid
KID:<BR>I Lit.: छागशावः, -कः and sim. comp.s.<BR>II A child: बालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kidnap
KIDNAP:<BR>(1) हरति (हृ, c. 1.), to k. women:<BR>नारीं हरति, Mit.: v. Also to steal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kidnapper
KIDNAPPER: नरहर्तृ, Mit.<BR>K. of women:<BR>स्त्रीहर्तृ<BR>(m.), Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kidnapping
KIDNAPPING (subs.): नरहरणम्, etc.; k. of boys:<BR>बालहरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kidney
KIDNEY: बु(बृ)क्कः,-क्का<BR>or<BR>-क्कन् (m.),<BR>the K. s;<BR>वृक्कयो-<BR>र्युगलम्, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kidney-bean
KIDNEY-BEAN: शि (सि) म्बा (म्बि:<BR>or<BR>म्बी);<BR>शि (सि) म्बिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kill
KILL:<BR>(1) हन्ति, नि-, (हन्, c. 2.),<BR>k. ed Satrā-<BR>jita in sleep:<BR>सुप्त सत्राजितं जघान,<BR>V p.;<BR>to k. by<BR>poison:<BR>विषेन हन्ति, D. iv.;<BR>let not duty k. ed k.<BR>us:<BR>मा नो धर्मो हतोऽवधीत्, Mah. iii. 313. 128. (वध्,<BR>only in ऌट् and लुङ्);<BR>(2) व्यापादयति (c. of<BR>पद्),<BR>k. the wretch:<BR>दुरात्मानं व्यापादय, Ma. iv.;<BR>(3) मारयति (c. of मृ) (rare),<BR>to k. as they k.<BR>animals:<BR>पशुमारणं मारयितुम्, Sa. vi.;<BR>(4) सूदयति,<BR> नि-, (सूद्, c. 10 (= to slay: q.v.):<BR>(5)<BR>नाशयति, वि-, (c. of नश्) (= to destroy: q.v.);<BR>(6) परलोकं नयति (नी, c. 1.), गमयति (c. of<BR>गम्), etc. (= to send to the next world).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

killer
KILLER:<BR>(1) हन्तृ, नि- (f. न्त्री);<BR>(2) in comp.,<BR>Brahmin-k.:<BR>ब्रह्महा, V. s.;<BR>k. of enemies:<BR>शत्रुघ्नः;<BR>(3) घातिन् (f. नी) (gen. in comp.), bird-k.:<BR>पक्षिघाती, V. s.;<BR>k. of Madhu:<BR>मधुसूदनः;<BR>k. of<BR>Naraka:<BR>नरकान्तकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

killing
KILLING (subs.):<BR>(1) वधः;<BR>(2) हत्या,<BR>Brahmin<BR>k.:<BR>ब्रह्महत्या, V. s.:<BR>(3) हननम्, नि-, k. of Kṛṣṇa:<BR>कृष्णहननम्, M. n.;<BR>(4) घातः (rare), k. of brutes:<BR>पशुघातः, Mr.;<BR>(5) सूदनम्, नि- (= slaying).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kiln
KILN:<BR>(1) पाकपुटी;<BR>(2) आपाकः,<BR>like pots, etc.<BR>thrown in the k.:<BR>आपाके निक्षिप्तस्य घटादेः, V. d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kimbo
KIMBO: भुग्न (f. ग्ना), अव-: v. Crooked,<BR>arched (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kin
KIN: v. Kindred (subs. and adj.). When<BR>affix, expr. by -कः,<BR>manikin:<BR>माणवकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kind
KIND (subs.):<BR>I Race, genus: जातिः।<BR>II Sort:<BR>(1) भेदः,<BR>k. s. of heroes:<BR>नायकभेदाः, Sah.;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रकारः (of things etc.);<BR>(3) -विधः (धा, धं) in<BR>comp.,<BR>of three k. s:.<BR>त्रिविधः (धा, धं);<BR>of the same<BR>k.:<BR>तथाविधः (धा, धं);<BR>of how many k. s:<BR>कतिविधः<BR>(धा, धं). Ph.: (a) a kind of = somewhat:<BR>q.v.; (b) in k.: i. e. not in money: expr.<BR>by the commodity implied.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kind
KIND (adj.):<BR>I Generous, merciful:<BR>(1)<BR>दयालु (mfn.),<BR>as if by k. penance:<BR>दयालुनेव तपसा,<BR>Ki. vi. 27.;<BR>(2) दयावत् (f. ती) (of persons<BR>only);<BR>(3) सदयः (या, यं). Ph.:<BR>k. act:<BR>उपकारः:<BR>v. Good (subs.).<BR>II Of words:<BR>(1) प्रियः<BR>(या, यं);<BR>(2) मधुरः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kind-hearted
KIND-HEARTED: सदयहृदयः (या, यं), Gi. i. 13.<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=401" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindle
KINDLE (v. t.):<BR>(1) उत्-दीपयति, सं- (c. of दीप्),<BR>k. d the Pāṇḍavas with glances:<BR>पाण्डवान् सन्दीपया-<BR>मास कटाक्षपातैः, Mah. ii. 67. 42.;<BR>(2) सं-धुक्षयति<BR>(c. of धुक्ष्): v. To inflame, lighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindle
KINDLE (v. i.):<BR>(1) दीप्यते, उत्-, सं- (दीप्, c. 4.),<BR>the<BR>Raghu chief k. d with rage:<BR>क्रुद्धोऽदीपि रघुव्याघ्रः,<BR>B.;<BR>(2) संधुक्षते (धुक्ष्, c. 1.): v. Also to<BR>lighten, take fire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindliness
KINDLINESS:<BR>(1) सौम्यता;<BR>(2) सौजन्यम् (= good<BR>nature).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindly
KINDLY (adj.):<BR>I Kindred: सजातीयः (या, यं).<BR>II Soft, gentle: q.v.: सौम्य (f. म्या).<BR>III<BR>Kind: q.v.: सदयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindly
KINDLY (adv.):<BR>(1) सदयम्,<BR>enjoyed k.:<BR>सदयं बुभुजे,<BR>R. viii. 7.;<BR>(2) दयापुरःसरम्, etc.;<BR>(3) दयालुतया।<BR>To speak k.:<BR>प्रियं<BR>or<BR>मघुरम् वक्ति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindness
KINDNESS:<BR>I The feeling:<BR>(1) दया, show k.:<BR>दर्शय दयाम्, K. ; (they)<BR>feel even for them:<BR>दयास्ति<BR> तास्वपि, Mah. ii. 68. I.;<BR>k. is desire for the<BR>happiness of all:<BR>दया सर्वसुखैषित्वम्, Mah. iii.<BR>313. 19.;<BR>(2) दयालुता, ou of k. for the poor:<BR>दीनदयालुतया, N. i. 143.<BR>II An act of k.:<BR>(1) अनुग्रहः: v. Favour;<BR>(2) हितम्: v.<BR>Good.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindred
KINDRED (subs.):<BR>I Relationship:<BR>(1)<BR>बन्धुता;<BR>(2) ज्ञातेयम्<BR>or<BR>ज्ञातिभावः<BR>or<BR>ज्ञातित्वम्।<BR>II<BR>Relatives:<BR>(1) बन्धुता (rare), Ki. i. 10.;<BR>(2)<BR>बन्धवः (m. pl.): v. Relative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kindred
KINDRED (adj.): the union of the k. (couple):<BR>समगुणयोगः, R. vi. 85.: v. Akin (II), con-<BR>-genial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kine
KINE: गावः (f. pl.): v. Cow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

king
KING:<BR>(1) राजन् (m.),<BR>great k.:<BR>महाराजः, अधिराजः;<BR>k. of k.s (gen. Kuvera): राजराजः;<BR>(2) नृपः,<BR> भूपतिः, महीपालः, and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kingdom
KINGDOM:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) राज्यम्,<BR>obtaining the k.<BR>bequeathed by his father:<BR>गुरुणा दत्तं राज्यं प्रतिपद्य,<BR>R. iv. 1.; placed (him)<BR>in the k.:<BR>राज्ये समादधुः,<BR>R. xvii. 8.;<BR>(2) राष्ट्रम् (= country);<BR>(3) राजत्वम्,<BR>-ता (= royal power).<BR>II Fig.: mineral k.:<BR>*धातुसृष्टिः; these are the three k. s of nature:<BR>*तिस्रो नैसर्गिकपदार्थानां जातयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kingfisher
KINGFISHER: मत्स्यरङ्गः (ङ्कः); मत्स्याशनः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kingly
KINGLY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) राजकीयः<BR>(या, यं).<BR>II Like a king: राजसदृशः (शी, शं);<BR>राजसन्निभः; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kings-evil
KING'S-EVIL: a disease: गण्डमाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kinsfolk
KINSFOLK:<BR>(1) बान्धवाः (m. pl.);<BR>(2) बन्धुवर्गः,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kinsman
KINSMAN:<BR>(1) बन्धुः;<BR>(2) बान्धवः: v. Relative<BR>(subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kiss
KISS (subs.):<BR>(1) चुम्बनम्,<BR>to give a k.:<BR>चुम्बनं<BR> ददाति, H.<BR>or<BR>अर्पयति, J. ;<BR>(2) चुम्बितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kiss
KISS (v.):<BR>(1) चुम्बति<BR>or<BR>चुम्बयति, परि-, नि-, आ-,<BR>(चुम्ब्, c. l. and 10.),<BR>to k. you:<BR>त्वां निचुम्बितुम्,<BR>Ch.;<BR>k. ed the darling on the face<BR>प्रियामुखं चुचुम्ब,<BR>Ku.;<BR>(2) निंस्ते, परि-, (निस्, c. 2 (rare).<BR>To<BR>k. the lips:<BR>अधरं पिबति (पा, c. 1.) (poet), Sa.;<BR>to k. on the head:<BR>मूर्द्धनि उपजिघ्रति<BR>or<BR>उपा-<BR>or<BR>आ-<BR>(ध्रा, c. 6.), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kisser
KISSER:<BR>(1) चुम्बकः;<BR>(2) परिणिंसकः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kitchen
KITCHEN:<BR>(1) पाकशाला;<BR>(2) महानसम्,<BR>I am well<BR>up in k. work:<BR>कुशलोऽस्मि महानसे, Mah.;<BR>(3)<BR>रसवती (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kitchen-garden
KITCHEN-GARDEN:<BR>(1) शाकवाटिका;<BR>(2) शाकशकटम्<BR>(rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kitchen-maid
KITCHEN-MAID: (पाकशालायां नियुक्ता) चेटी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kite
KITE:<BR>I The bird: चिल्लः।<BR>II The toy: चिल्लः<BR>(?); मासः, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kitten
KITTEN: मार्जारशावः, -कः and sim. comp.s.: v.<BR>Cat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knack
KNACK: कौशलम्: v. Skill, dexterity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knapsack
KNAPSACK: *पाथेयमस्त्रा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knave
KNAVE: धूर्तः: v. Rogue.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knavery
KNAVERY: धूर्तता: v. Villainy, deceit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knavish
KNAVISH: धूर्त- in comp.,<BR>k. fellow:<BR>धूर्तजनः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knavishly
KNAVISHLY: कपटेन: v. Deceitfully, dis-<BR>-honestly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knavishness
KNAVISHNESS:<BR>(1) धूर्तता;<BR>(2) कापट्यम्: v.<BR>Deceitfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knead
KNEAD: मर्दयति, सं-, परि-, वि-, (मृद्, c. 10.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kneading-trough
KNEADING-TROUGH: द्रोणिः (णी) (gen. term:<BR>not nec. for kneading).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knee
KNEE: जानु (n.),<BR>k. -joint:<BR>जानुसन्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knee-deep
KNEE-DEEP:<BR>(1) जानुदघ्न (f. घ्नी);<BR>(2) जानुमितः<BR>(ता, तं);<BR>(3) जानुद्वयसः (f. सी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=402" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knee-pan
KNEE-PAN: जानुफलकम्, Wilson.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

kneel
KNEEL: also with<BR>down:<BR>जानुम्यां महीं गच्छति<BR>(गम्, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>नमति (नम्, c. 1.). K. ing, k,<BR>etc. is expr. also by जानुम्यां स्थित्वा, क्षिति-<BR>तलनिहितजानु (mfn.), K. , and sim. expr.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knell
KNELL:<BR>I Lit.: *प्रेतघण्टा।<BR>II Death, end:<BR>q.v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knife
KNIFE:<BR>(1) छुरिका;<BR>(2) कर्तरिका;<BR>(3) दात्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knight
KNIGHT (subs.):<BR>I A champion: मटः।<BR>II A<BR>title: *अनुबेरणः, भटः,<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knignt
KNIGNT (v.): *अनुबेरणं<BR>or<BR>भटं करोति, भटोपाधिं<BR> ददाति (दा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knight-errant
KNIGHT-ERRANT:<BR>(1) भटः;<BR>(2) वीरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knighthood
KNIGHTHOOD:<BR>I The dignity: *अनुबेरणत्वम्;<BR> मटपदम्।<BR>II The knights collectively^1: expr.<BR>by pl.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knightly
KNIGHTLY: expr. by gen. or comp.: v.<BR>Heroic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knit
KNIT (v.):<BR>I To fasten: q.v.: बध्नाति (बन्ध्,<BR>c. 9.).<BR>II With needles: सं-सीव्यति (सिव्,<BR>c. 4.).<BR>III To connect: q.v.: संयोजयति<BR>(c. of युज्). Ph.:<BR>to k. the brows:<BR>भ्रूकुटीं बध्नाति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knob
KNOB:<BR>I A lump:<BR>(1) पिण्ड (mn.);<BR>(2)<BR>गण्डः;<BR>(3) गुल्मः;<BR>(4) गेण्डुः (of balls, etc.).<BR>II A knot: ग्रन्थिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knobbed
KNOBBED, KNOBBY:<BR>(1) पिण्डिलः (ला, लं) (?);<BR>(2) ग्रन्थिलः (ला, लं) (= knotty).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knock
KNOCK (v.): आ-हन्ति, सम्-, (हन्, c. 2.): v.<BR>To strike, beat.<BR>K. against:<BR>प्रतिहन्ति (with ins.<BR>of the English acc.). K. down: (a) to fell:<BR>पातयति (c. of पत्), I will k. d. all your teeth:<BR>पातयिष्यामि दशनान् वदनादखिलांस्तव, V.p. xvi.<BR>7.; (b) in auction: *आह्वानं समापयति (c. of<BR>आप्). K. in or on the head (fig.): समापयतिः<BR>v. Also to frustrate. K. off: (a) to k. out:<BR>q.v.; (b) in auction: v. K. down (b); (c)<BR>to cease: q.v. K. out: (a) to fell: पातयति;<BR>(b) to force out: बहिष्करोति। K. under: v.<BR>To yield, submit^1. K. up: (a) to assure:<BR>*द्वारे समाहत्य प्रबोधयति (c. of बुध्); (b) to be<BR>k. ed up: परि-क्लाम्यति (क्लम्, c. 4.): v. Fatigued.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knock
KNOCK, KNOCKING (subs.):<BR>(1) आघातः, सम्-;<BR>(2) अभिघातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knocker
KNOCKER: of a door: *द्वारताडनी; द्वाराहतियन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knock-kneed
KNOCK-KNEED:<BR>(1) संज्ञु (mfn.);<BR>(2) संहतजानु<BR>(mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knoll
KNOLL: नाकृः: v. Also mound.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knot
KNOT (subs.):<BR>I A tie:<BR>(1) ग्रन्थिः, Ku. iii.<BR>46.;<BR>(2) बन्धः, -नम्, M. n.<BR>To tie up the hair in<BR>a k.:<BR>वेणीं बध्नाति, Mu.;<BR>having k. ted hair:<BR>जटिलः<BR>(ला, लं), S. p.<BR>II Of plants: ग्रन्थिः: v.<BR>Joint.<BR>III Fig., bond: q.v.: बन्धः।<BR>IV A<BR>cluster, circle: मण्डलम्।<BR>V A knotty point:<BR>ग्रन्थिः,<BR>in this work I have carefully inserted k.s<BR>here and there:<BR>ग्रन्थग्रन्थिरिह क्वचित् क्वचिदपि न्यासि<BR> प्रयत्नान्मया, N. xxii. 154.;<BR>to loosen a k.:<BR>ग्रन्थिं<BR> श्लथीकरोति, N.<BR>VI. A bird: पक्षिविशेषः।<BR>VII<BR>In ships:<BR>it goes ten k. s an hour:<BR>*होरायां पञ्च-<BR>क्रोशं गच्छति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knot
KNOT (v.): ग्रन्थिं बघ्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knot-grass
KNOT-GRASS, KNOT-WEED: ग्रन्थिमती; (?);<BR>(2)<BR>ग्रन्थिदूर्वा (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knottiness
KNOTTINESS:<BR>(1) ग्रन्थिलता;<BR>(2) ग्रन्थिमत्ता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knotty
KNOTTY:<BR>(1) ग्रन्थिलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) ग्रन्थिमत्<BR>(f. ती).<BR>K. point:<BR>ग्रन्थिः: v. Knot<BR>(V.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knout
KNOUT: कशा (?): v. Also scourge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

know
KNOW (v.):<BR>(1) जानाति, वि-, सं-, परि-, प्र-, or<BR>जानीते (ज्ञा, c. 9 (best equiv.),<BR>everybody does<BR>not k. everything:<BR>न हि सर्वः सर्वं जानाति, Mu.;<BR>I<BR>don't k. how it is propitiated:<BR>न जाने कथं साराधिता<BR> भवति, V. ;<BR>don't you k. she is Chandrarekhā:<BR>किं न<BR> जानासि सा खलु चन्द्ररेखेति, V. t.;<BR>did not k. that<BR>a long while had passed:<BR>महान्तं कालमतिक्रान्तं नाज्ञा-<BR>सीत्, K. ;<BR>you k. how to amuse the queen:<BR>जानासि<BR> देवीं विनोदयितुम्, U. ;<BR>I do not k. any other man<BR>except you:<BR>त्वां विहाय न जाने पुरुषान्तरम्, H. ii.;<BR>(2)<BR>वेत्ति (विद्, c. 2.),<BR>k. me to be (your) husband's<BR>friend:<BR>भर्तुर्मित्रं मां विद्धि, Me.;<BR>one who k. s all<BR>that is to be k. n.:<BR>विदितसकलवेदितव्यः (व्या, व्यं)<BR>V. t.;<BR>(3) अवैति (इ c. 2.), I k. your strength:<BR>अवैमि ते सारम्, Ku.;<BR>(4) अवगच्छति (गम्, c. 1.)<BR>(= to find out, understand), k. ing the body<BR>to be reduced to (a subject) of talk (only): अवगम्य<BR> कथीकृतं वपुः, K. ;<BR>(5) बुध्यते (बुध्, c. 4 (= to<BR>understand: q.v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=403" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knowable
KNOWABLE:<BR>(1) वि-ज्ञेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) वेदितव्य<BR>(f. व्या), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knowing
KNOWING (adj.):<BR>I Well-informed:<BR>(1)<BR>ज्ञानिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) विज्ञ (f. ज्ञा).<BR>II Cun-<BR>-ning: q.v.: विदग्ध (ग्धा).<BR>III Acquainted<BR>with:<BR>(1) ज्ञ (f. ज्ञा), अभि-, in comp.,<BR>k.<BR>Śāstras:<BR>शास्त्रज्ञः;<BR>(2) -विद् (mfn.) in comp.,<BR>k. Veda:<BR>वेदविद् (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knowingly
KNOWINGLY (adv.):<BR>(1) by pres. part.,<BR>who<BR>did not k. release Jānakī<BR>मुमोच जानन्नपि जानकीं न<BR> यः, Si.;<BR>(2) ज्ञानतः;<BR>(3) ज्ञानात्;<BR>(4) ज्ञानपूर्वम्,<BR>Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knowledge
KNOWLEDGE:<BR>(1) ज्ञानम्,<BR>k. is comprehension of<BR>truths:<BR>ज्ञानं तत्त्वार्थसम्बोधः, Mah.;<BR>false k.:<BR>मिथ्या-<BR>ज्ञानम्, S. ;<BR>k. is a burden without action:<BR>ज्ञानं मारः<BR> क्रियां विना, H. ;<BR>light of k.:<BR>ज्ञानप्रदीपः, D. ;<BR>k. of<BR>one's feelings:<BR>भावज्ञानम्, Mah. iii. (in this sense,<BR>gen. expr. by verb);<BR>(2) विद्या (= gen.<BR>learning),<BR>one destitute of k. is a beast:<BR>विद्या-<BR>विहीनः पशुः, J. ;<BR>k. of weapons and sciences:<BR>विद्या<BR> शस्त्रस्य शास्त्रस्य, H. ;<BR>(3) संविद् (rare),<BR>Lord of<BR>k.:<BR>संविदामीशः, Ki. Ph.:<BR>to come to the k. of:<BR>श्रुतिम्<BR> आयाति, etc.;<BR>or has it come to the k. of the spy-<BR>eyed king:<BR>चारेक्षणस्य नृपतेः श्रुतिमागतो वा, Mr. ix.<BR>9.;<BR>to have a k. of:<BR>जानाति, अभि-: v. Acqu-<BR>-ainted.:<BR>carnal k.:<BR>भोगः, सं-, V. t.; with,<BR>without my k. (= informing, not i. me) मां<BR> विज्ञाप्य, अविज्ञाप्य, (= I knowing, not k.);<BR>विज्ञाते, अविज्ञाते मयि<BR>or<BR>मद्गोचरेण, मदगोचरेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

known
KNOWN (adj.): i. e. celebrated, renowned:<BR>q.v.: प्रसिद्ध (f. द्धा).<BR>Well-k.:<BR>सुप्रसिद्ध (f. द्धा).<BR>Ill-k.:<BR>अप्रसिद्ध (f. द्धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

known
KNOWN, BE:<BR>(1) by ज्ञातः (ता, तं), is it k. that:<BR>ज्ञातो नु किम्, Mr. ix. 9.;<BR>(2) by विदितः (ता, तं),<BR>be it k. to your excellent Majesty:<BR>विदितमस्तु देव-<BR>पादानाम्, Sa. vi.;<BR>(3) by प्रसिद्ध (f. द्धा) (of<BR>what is well-k.),<BR>if God is well-k. from peo-<BR>ples' souls:<BR>यदि लोके ब्रह्मात्मत्वेन प्रसिद्धमस्ति,<BR>S. i. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

known
KNOWN, BECOME: प्रथते (प्रथ्, c. 1.),<BR>afterwards<BR>k. among people by her name:<BR>प्रजासु पश्चात्प्रथितं<BR> तदाख्यया, Ku. v. 7.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

known
KNOWN, MAKE:<BR>I To disclose: q.v.: प्रकाशी-<BR>करोति।<BR>II To inform: q. v.: विज्ञापयति (c.<BR>of ज्ञा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knuckle
KNUCKLE: पर्वन् (n.); R. xii. 41.; अङ्गुलिसन्धिः,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

knurl
KNURL, KNURLY: v. Knot, knotty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

koran
KORAN: *कोराणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

label
LABEL (subs.): *लेपपत्रम्; बीजकम्, Monier<BR>Williams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

label
LABEL (v.): *लेपपत्रं सज्जयति (c. of सज्ज्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labial
LABIAL:<BR>I Adj.: औष्ठ्य (f. ष्ठ्या).<BR>II Subs.:<BR>ओष्ठ्यवर्णः; औष्ठ्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laboratory
LABORATORY: Of chemists: *कर्मकुलम् and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laborious
LABORIOUS:<BR>I Requiring labour:<BR>(1) श्रम-<BR>साध्य (f. ध्या);<BR>(2) प्रयासकरः (री, रं) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR>II Industrious: q. v.: परिश्रमिन्<BR>(f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laboriously
LABORIOUSLY:<BR>(1) परिश्रमेण;<BR>(2) श्रमपूर्वम्;<BR>(3)<BR>सप्रयासम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laboriousness
LABORIOUSNESS:<BR>I Toilsomeness: प्रयासकरता;<BR>etc.<BR>II Industry: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labour
LABOUR (v.):<BR>I To toil:<BR>(1) परिश्रमं करोति;<BR>(2) आयासं करोति।<BR>II To work: कर्म करोति।<BR>III To strive: यत्नं<BR>or<BR>उद्योगं करोति।<BR>IV To<BR>be in travail: प्रसवावस्थायां वर्तते।<BR>V To 1.<BR>under, suffer: बाध्यते (pass. of बाध्) or<BR>बाधितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labour
LABOUR (subs.):<BR>I Toil:<BR>(1) श्रमः, परि-,<BR>languid with l.:<BR>परिश्रमक्रान्त (f. न्ता), Ki. iv.<BR>17.;<BR>(2) आयासः<BR>or<BR>प्रयासः (= exertion),<BR>then<BR>why vain l.:<BR>तत् किं वृथा प्रयासेन, P.<BR>II. Work:<BR>q. v.: कर्मन् (n.).<BR>III Of childbirth: प्रसवा-<BR>वस्था (the state); प्रसववेदना (of the pains).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laboured
LABOURED (adj.):<BR>(1) श्रमसिद्ध (f. द्धा) (?);<BR>(2) आयाससिद्ध (f. द्धा) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labourer
LABOURER:<BR>(1) कर्मकरः, will do work like l. s:<BR>कर्म कर्मकरवत् करिष्यति, Si.;<BR>(2) कर्माजीवः;<BR>(3)<BR>कर्मजीवी,<BR>artisans and l. s:<BR>शिल्पिनः कर्मजीविनश्च,<BR>V. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laburnum
LABURNUM: सुन्दरवृक्षविशेषः; लावण्यः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=404" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labyrinth
LABYRINTH: दुर्लक्ष्यनिर्गमा वाटी<BR>or<BR>वाटिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

labyrinthian
LABYRINTHIAN, LABYRINTHINE: अतिगहनः (ना,<BR> नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lac
LAC:<BR>I The substance:<BR>(1) लाक्षा;<BR>(2) अलक्तः;<BR>(3) जातु, -कम् (n.).<BR>II The number: लक्षम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lace
LACE (subs.):<BR>I A string or cord: सूत्रम्।<BR>II A fabric: *सूत्रजालम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lace
LACE (v.): सूत्रजालेन मण्डयति (मण्ड्, c. 10.),<BR>“l. d<BR>with silver”<BR>*रजतजालमण्डितः (ता, तं): v. Also<BR>to fasten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lacemaker
LACEMAKER: *जालकर्मकरः; सूत्रजालकरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lacerate
LACERATE: भिनत्ति (भिद्, c. 7.): v. To rend,<BR>tear.<BR>L. d wound:<BR>भिन्नम्, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laceration
LACERATION:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) भेदनम्;<BR>(2)<BR>विभेदः;<BR>(3) विदारणम्;<BR>(4) पाटनम्, वि-।<BR>II The<BR>breach made: भेदः, वि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lack
LACK (subs.): अभावः: v. Want, deficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lack
LACK: (v.): expr. by subs.: v. To want,<BR>deficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lack-a-day
LACK-A-DAY: अहो दुर्दिनम्: v. Alas.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lack-brain
LACK-BRAIN: निर्बुद्धि (mfn.): v. Fool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lackey
LACKEY: चेटः (= servant.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laconic
LACONIC:<BR>(1) लघु (mfn.);<BR>(2) संक्षिप्त (f. प्ता)<BR>(= concise).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laconically
LACONICALLY:<BR>(1) लाघवेन;<BR>(2) सलाघवम्;<BR>(3)<BR>संक्षेपेण (= concisely).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laconism
LACONISM:<BR>I The style: लाघवम्, Ki.<BR>II A<BR>saying: लघूक्तिः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lacquer
LACQUER (LACKER) (subs.): *लाक्षकण (लाक्षा<BR>= lac).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lacquer
LACQUER (LACKER) (v.): *लाक्षकेण लिम्पति (लिप्,<BR>c. 6.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lacteal
LACTEAL, LACTEUS: क्षीरिन् (f. णी). L. vessel:<BR>अन्नरसवाहि स्रोतस् (n.), after Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lad
LAD:<BR>(1) बालः: v. Boy;<BR>(2) अर्भकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ladder
LADDER: सोपानम्, -मार्गः, -पथः, R. vi. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lade
LADE: v. To load. L. n = loaded: v. Load.<BR>L. out: v. To ladle.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lading
LADING (subs.): expr. by भाण्डम्: v. Freight,<BR>cargo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ladle
LADLE (subs.): दर्विः<BR>or<BR>दर्वी, giving two l. s of rice:<BR>ओदनस्य दर्वीद्वयं दत्त्वा, D. vi.<BR>Sacrificial l:<BR>श्रुवः,<BR>Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ladle
LADLE (v.):<BR>l. out:<BR>दर्व्या बहिष्करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lady
LADY:<BR>I Corresponding to lord:<BR>(1) ईश्वरी,<BR>l. of life:<BR>प्राणेश्वरी;<BR>(2) देवी (in addressing),<BR>L.<BR>Kādambarī:<BR>देवी कादम्बरी।<BR>II Mistress: q. v.:<BR>गृहिणी।<BR>III A good woman:<BR>(1) आर्या;<BR>(2)<BR>gen. expr. by वनिता, etc.,<BR>ladies go the way<BR>of their husbands:<BR>प्रमदाः पतिवर्त्मगाः, Ku. iv.<BR>33.: v. Woman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lady-day
LADY-DAY: *देवीपर्वन् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lady-like
LADY-LIKE: आर्यः (र्या, यं): v. Also noble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ladyship
LADYSHIP: देवी, “देव्या॥॥॥परिचर्यासुखम्, K. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ladys maid
LADY'S MAID: प्रसाधिका, R. vii. 7.; अलङ्कर्त्री,<BR>M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lag
LAG (v.): मन्दायते (nomi.): v. Also to loiter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laggard
LAGGARD, LAGGING (adj.): मन्दकर्मन् (mfn.):<BR>v. Idler, loiterer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lagoon
LAGOON:<BR>(1) अनूपः (= marsh);<BR>(2) पल्वलम्<BR>(= shallow pond).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laic
LAIC: by comp. or gen.: v. Layman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lair
LAIR:<BR>(1) निलयः (= abode);<BR>(2) बिलम् (= den).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laird
LAIRD: v. Lord, leader.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laity
LAITY:<BR>(1) गृहस्थाः (m. pl.); प्राकृताः (m. pl.)<BR>(= common people).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lake
LAKE:<BR>(1) ह्रदः,<BR>in a deep l.:<BR>ह्रदे गमीरे, N.;<BR>(2)<BR>सरस् (n.), -वरः,<BR>the l. called Acchoda:<BR>अच्छोदं<BR> नाम सरः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamb
LAMB:<BR>I The animal: भेषशावः and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR>II The flesh: मेषशावामिषम् and<BR>sim. expr. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lambent
LAMBENT: प्रलम्ब (f. म्बा) (?) (comp. लम्ब with<BR>L. lambo).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lambkin
LAMBKIN: क्षुद्रमेषशावः and sim. expr.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lame
LAME (adj.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) खञ्ज (f. ञ्जा);<BR>(2)<BR>पङ्गु (mfn.);<BR>(3) खोडः (डा, डं)<BR>or<BR>खोरः (रा, रं)<BR>(rare).<BR>To be l.:<BR>खञ्जति (खञ्ज्, c. l.).<BR>II<BR>Imperfect. weak: दुर्बलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lame
LAME (v.): खञ्जीकरोति;<BR>(2) by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamely
LAMELY: Lit. खञ्जवत्।<BR>II Imperfectly: अस-<BR>म्यक्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lameness
LAMENESS:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) खञ्जता;<BR>(2) पङ्गुता; etc.<BR>II Weakness: q.v.: दुर्बलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lament
LAMENT (v.):<BR>(1) वि-लपति (लप्, c. l.),<BR>the<BR>chief of Kośala thus l. ing:<BR>विलपन्निति कोशलाधिपः, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">Page406</a>]<BR>R. viii. 70.;<BR>(2) क्रन्दति (क्रन्द्, c. 1.): v.<BR>To cry;<BR>(3) रोदिति (रुद्, c. 2.): v. To<BR>weep;<BR>(4) शोचति, अनु-, (शुच्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>grieve;<BR>(5) परिदेवयति (देव्, c. 10 (rare),<BR>Ram. ii. 85. 15.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=405" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lament
LAMENT (subs.): v. Lamentation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamentable
LAMENTABLE:<BR>I Deplorable: शोचनीयः (या,<BR> यं)<BR>or<BR>शोच्य (f. च्या), अनु-।<BR>II Mourning:<BR>by comp.,<BR>“l. eye”:<BR>शोकचक्षुः; by the l words:<BR>परिदेविताक्षरैः, Ku. iv. 25.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamentation
LAMENTATION:<BR>I Bewailing:<BR>(1) विलापः;<BR>(2) परिदेवनम्<BR>or<BR>परिदेवितम् (rare);<BR>(3) रोदनम्<BR>= weeping).<BR>II In. pl., a book of the<BR>Bible: *विलापकाण्डः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamented
LAMENTED (adj.): as = dead: स्वर्गीयः (या, यं)<BR>(= heavenly) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamina
LAMINA: शकलम् (??): v. Plate, scale.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laminate
LAMINATE, -D: शकलिन् (f. नी) (?): v. Also<BR>plated.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamp
LAMP: दीपः, प्र-, like the moving flame of a l.:<BR>सञ्चारिणी दीपशिखेव, R. vi. 67.: v. Also light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamp-black
LAMP-BLACK:<BR>(1) कज्जलम्;<BR>(2) दीपकिट्टम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamp-stand
LAMP-STAND:<BR>(1) दीपवृक्षः;<BR>(2) प्रदीपपादपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lampoon
LAMPOON (subs.): *निन्दालेखः; अपवादबन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lampoon
LAMPOON (v.): *निन्दालेखपात्रं करोति; प्रबन्धेन अप-<BR>वदति (वद्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lamprey
LAMPREY: कुञ्चिका (??): मत्स्यविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lance
LANCE (subs.):<BR>(1) कुन्तः;<BR>(2) प्रासः: v. Dart.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lance
LANCE (v.): (कुन्तेन) विध्यति (व्यध्, c. 4.): v.<BR>To pierce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lancer
LANCER: कुन्तपाणिः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lancet
LANCET: शलाका,<BR>l. s are of various shapes and<BR>for various purposes:<BR>शलाकायन्त्राणि नानाप्रकाराणि<BR> नानाप्रयोजनानि, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lancet-window
LANCET-WINDOW: *शलाकाशिरागवाक्षः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

land
LAND (subs.):<BR>I Opp. to water: स्थलम्,<BR>pro-<BR>ceeded by l.:<BR>प्रतस्थे स्थलवर्त्मना, R. iv. 60.<BR>II<BR>Any portion of it.: भूमिः<BR>or<BR>भूः, grant of l.:<BR>भूदानम्, He.<BR>III Soil.: q. v.: भूमिः<BR>or<BR>भूः,<BR>shall:<BR>till low l. where water accumulates:<BR>निम्नां हि वाह-<BR>येद्भूमिं यत्र विश्राम्यते जलम्, Pa.<BR>IV L. ed pro-<BR>-perty: भूः<BR>or<BR>भूमिः।<BR>V A country: q. v.:<BR>देशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

land
LAND (adj.): by comp.,<BR>L.-lotus:<BR>स्थलपद्मम्;<BR>l.-war:<BR>स्थलविग्रहः, H. iii.;<BR>l.-gods:<BR>भूमिदेवाः,<BR>Ma.: for dif.: v. Land (subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

land
LAND (v.):<BR>I Trans: अवतारयति (c. of तृ).<BR>II Intrans: अवतरति (तॄ, c. 1.): v. To<BR>disembark.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landed
LANDED (adj.): expr. by comp., l. proprietors:<BR>भूस्वामिनः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landing
LANDING (subs.): अवतरणम्<BR>or<BR>उत्तरणम्। L. place:<BR>तरः, -स्थानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landlady
LANDLADY:<BR>I Of a house: गृहस्वामिनी (?).<BR>II Of land: भूस्वामिनी (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landlord
LANDLORD:<BR>I Of a house: गृहस्वामिन् (m.).<BR>II Of land: भूस्वामिन् (m.), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landmark
LANDMARK:<BR>(1) सीमाचिह्नम्<BR>or<BR>सीमालिङ्गम्,<BR>shall<BR>always cause these public l.s.:<BR>प्रकाशचिह्नान्येतानि<BR> सीमायां कारयेत् सदा, Vri.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landrail
LANDRAIL: पक्षिचिशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landscape
LANDSCAPE:<BR>I Scene: q. v.: भूमागः।<BR>II A<BR>picture:<BR>to print l. s:<BR>*मनोहरभूमागान् चित्रयति।<BR>“L. gardening”:<BR>*मनोहरोद्यानरचना।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landslip
LANDSLIP: अवसर्पिणी भूमिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

land-tax
LAND-TAX: भूमेः करः; भूकरः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

landward
LANDWARD: स्थलाभिमुखम्: v. Towards.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lane
LANE:<BR>(1) गलिः (?);<BR>(2) कुपथः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

language
LANGUAGE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: माषा,<BR>proficiency<BR>in the l. s of all countries:<BR>निखिलदेशीयभाषापाण्डित्यम्,<BR>D. ;<BR>(2) वाच् (f (= speech),<BR>formerly they<BR>also had l. like men:<BR>एतेषामपि पुरा पुरुषाणामिव वागा-<BR>सीत्, H. ;<BR>to render into the Persian l.:<BR>पारसीय-<BR>वाचा करोति, Raj.<BR>II Diction.:<BR>(1) भारती,<BR> सरस्वती, etc.,<BR>l. perspicuous but deep:<BR>प्रसन्नगम्मीर-<BR>पदा सरस्वती, Ki.<BR>(2) उक्तिः, वाक्यम्, etc.,<BR>pictur-<BR>esqueness of l.:<BR>उक्तिवैचित्र्यम्, Kav.<BR>III Words,<BR>speech: q. v.: वचस्,<BR>with haughty l.:<BR>वचोभि-<BR>रुद्धतैः, Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languid
LANGUID:<BR>(1) ग्लानः (ना, नं),<BR>she looks l. from<BR>love:<BR>मदनग्लानेयमालक्ष्यते, Sa.;<BR>(2) म्लानः (ना, नं),<BR>परि-, Ki. ii. 2.;<BR>(3) क्लान्त (f. न्ता), परि-, the<BR>waist (has become)<BR>very l.:<BR>मध्यः क्लान्ततरः, Sa.<BR>iii. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languidly
LANGUIDLY: क्लान्तः (न्ता, न्तं), etc.: v. Also<BR>weakly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=406" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languidness
LANGUIDNESS:<BR>(1) ग्लानिः;<BR>(2) म्लानिः;<BR>(3)<BR>क्लान्तिः, परि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languish
LANGUISH:<BR>(1) सीदति, अव-,: v. To droop,<BR>fade;<BR>(2) क्लाम्यति, परि-: v. Wearied;<BR>(3)<BR>क्षीयते (pass. of क्षि): v. To waste;<BR>(4) ग्लायति<BR>(ग्लै, c. 1 (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languishing
LANGUISHING (adj.): languishingly: v.<BR>Languid, languidly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

languor
LANGUOR:<BR>(1) ग्लानिः;<BR>(2) म्लानिः;<BR>(3) क्लान्तिः,<BR> परि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lank
LANK:<BR>I Loose: शिथिलः (ला, लं).<BR>II Lean:<BR>q. v.: कृशः (शा, शं).<BR>III Languid: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lankness
LANKNESS:<BR>(1) शिथिलता (= looseness);<BR>(2)<BR>कृशता (= leanness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lanky
LANKY: v. Lank.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lantern
LANTERN: *लण्ठनः: v. Also lamp, light.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lantern-jawed
LANTERN-JAWED: क्षीणवदनः (ना, नं) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lap
LAP (subs.):<BR>I Of a garment: अञ्चल (mn.).<BR>II Of the body:<BR>(1) क्रोडम्;<BR>(2) अङ्कः;<BR>(3)<BR>उत्सङ्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lap
LAP (v.):<BR>I To lick: q. v.: लेढि (लिह्, c. 2.).<BR>II To overlap: q. v.: वेष्टयति, परि-, (वेष्ट्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lap-dog
LAP-DOG: *अङ्ककुक्कुरः; क्रोडकुक्कुरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapful of
LAPFUL OF (= adj.): अङ्कपूर्ण (f. र्णा) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapidary
LAPIDARY: उपलशोधकः ; रत्नसम्मार्जकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapis lazuli
LAPIS LAZULI:<BR>(1) नीलोपलः;<BR>(2) असिताश्मन् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lappet
LAPPET: अञ्चल (mn (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapse
LAPSE (subs.):<BR>I Flow, motion: q. v.: गतिः।<BR>II A failing: स्खलितम्।<BR>III Fall: q. v.: पातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapse
LAPSE (v.):<BR>I To pass: q. v.: याति (या, c. 2.).<BR>II To err.: स्खलति (स्खल्, c. 1.).<BR>III To<BR>fall: q. v.: पतति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapstone
LAPSTONE: *अङ्कोपलः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lapwing
LAPWING:<BR>(1) कोयष्टिः, -कः;<BR>(2) पङ्ककीरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larboard
LARBOARD: नावो वामभागः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larceny
LARCENY: चौर्यम्: v. Theft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larch
LARCH: *नारक्षः, वृक्षविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lard
LARD (subs.): शूकरमेदस् (n.) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lard
LARD (v.):<BR>I To grease: q. v.<BR>II fatten:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larder
LARDER: खाद्यगृहम् and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

large
LARGE:<BR>I In size or extent:<BR>(1) बृहत् (f. ती),<BR>a l. wrapper:<BR>बृहद्बृहतिका, Ki.;<BR>with l. halls of<BR>precious stones:<BR>बृहन्मणिशिलाशालः (ला, लं), Ku.;<BR>(2) विशालः (ला, लं),<BR>a l. silk-cotton tree:<BR>विशालः<BR> शाल्मलीतरुः H. ;<BR>his eyes l.:<BR>विशाले तस्य लोचने,<BR>Ri.;<BR>(3) विपुलः (ला, लं), and the world is l.:<BR>विपुला च पृथ्वी, Ma.;<BR>a l. river:<BR>विपुला नदी,<BR>Mah.;<BR>(4) महत् (f. ती),<BR>having l. arms:<BR>महा-<BR>भुजः (जा, जं), R. ;<BR>a very l. fish:<BR>सुमहान्मत्स्यः,<BR>Mah.;<BR>(5) पृथु (f. थुः<BR>or<BR>थ्वी);<BR>(6) पृथुलः<BR>(ला, लं);<BR>(7) व्यूढः (ढा, ढं);<BR>(8) उरु (f. रुः<BR>or<BR>र्वी).<BR>II Fig., noble, far-sighted: बृहत्<BR>(f. ती),<BR>l. -hearted:<BR>बृहन्मनस् (mfn.), Ki.<BR>III<BR>Numerous, populous: महत् (f. ती),<BR>of the<BR>very l. army of the Śavaras:<BR>अतिमहतः शवरसैन्यस्य,<BR>K. ; although (his)<BR>seraglio was l.:<BR>अवरोधे<BR> महत्यपि, R.<BR>IV. Abundant, ample: q. v.:<BR>विपुलः (ला, लं).<BR>V Diffuse: q. v.: विपुलः<BR>(ला, लं),<BR>in neither very concise nor very l.<BR>writing:<BR>नातिलघुविपुलरचनाभिः,<BR>V m. Ph.: at<BR>l.: (a) without restraint: स्वेच्छाधीनः (ना,<BR> नं); (b) diffusely: विस्तरशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

large-hearted
LARGE-HEARTED:<BR>(1) बृहन्मनस् (mfn.), Ki.<BR>(2) विपुलहृदयः (या, यं), J.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

largely
LARGELY: बहुः v. Copiously, diffusely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

largeness
LARGENESS:<BR>(1) बृहत्त्वम्,<BR>from (my) l.:<BR>बृहत्त्वात्,<BR>Mah.;<BR>(2) विशालता;<BR>(3) विपुलता;<BR>(4) महत्वम्;<BR>(5) पृथुता;<BR>(6) पृथुलता: v. Large.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

largess
LARGESS: दानम्: v. Present, gift.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

largish
LARGISH: किञ्चिद्बृहत् (f. ती): v. Large, some-<BR>-what.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lark
LARK:<BR>I The bird: (भा) मरद्वाजः।<BR>II Frolic:<BR>केलिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larva
LARVA: कोषः (शः) (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

larynx
LARYNX:<BR>(1) कण्ठनालः (ली);<BR>(2) कृकः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lascivious
LASCIVIOUS: लम्पटः (of men): v. Lustful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lasciviously
LASCIVIOUSLY:<BR>(1) कामचेतसा;<BR>(2) कामचक्षुषा (in<BR>looking);<BR>(3) by सकामः (मा, मं), Ram.:<BR>v. Also lustfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lasciviousness
LASCIVIOUSNESS: लाम्पट्यम्: v. Also lust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lash
LASH (subs.):<BR>I The instrument: कशा (षा)।<BR>II<BR>Its stroke:<BR>(1) कषाघातः, कशाताडनम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=407" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lash
LASH (v.):<BR>I To strike with a l.: कशया हन्ति,<BR> आ-, अभि- (हन्, c. 2.): v. To beat, lash (II)<BR>II Fig., to satirize: वाक्सायकैः तुदति (तुद्,<BR>c. 6.)<BR>or<BR>भिनत्ति (भिद्, c. 7.).<BR>III To throw<BR>up: उत्क्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.).<BR>IV To fasten:<BR>q. v.: बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lassitude
LASSITUDE:<BR>(1) ग्लानिः: v. Languor;<BR>(2) तन्द्रा:<BR>v. Sloth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

last
LAST (subs.): *मूलपादुका; पादुकालिङ्गम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

last
LAST (adj.):<BR>I Final:<BR>(1) अन्त्य (f. न्त्या) or<BR>अन्त- in comp.,<BR>l. syllable<BR>अन्त्याक्षरम्; to the l.:<BR>अन्तपर्यन्तम्;<BR>at l.:<BR>अन्ते [शेषे<BR>or<BR>अवशेषे is used in<BR>this sense in Bengali, but I do not remem-<BR>-ber any instance in Sanskrit];<BR>(2) चरमः<BR>(मा, मं),<BR>nor the l.:<BR>नापि चरमः, D.s.;<BR>(3) पश्चिमः<BR>(मा, मं),<BR>getting up at the l. watch:<BR>याम उत्थाय<BR> पश्चिमे, Mah.; l. order of (their)<BR>master:<BR>मर्तुः<BR> पश्चिमाज्ञा, R. xvii. 8.<BR>II Preceding:<BR>(1)<BR>पूर्वः (र्वा, र्वं) (= former);<BR>(2) गतः (ता, तं)<BR>(= past),<BR>l. year:<BR>गतवर्षः। Ph.:<BR>l. evening:<BR>ह्यः<BR> प्रदोषे: v. Yesterday.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

last
LAST (adv.): v. Lastly,<BR>l. -born:<BR>जघन्यजः<BR>(जा, जं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

last
LAST (v.): तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.), l. s one moment:<BR>तिष्ठत्येकक्षणम्,<BR>V ii. 1.; l. ing but one moment:<BR>क्षणमात्रस्थायिन् (f. नी), M. n.: v. To remain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lasting
LASTING (adj.):<BR>(1) स्थायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) स्थास्नु<BR>(mfn.),<BR>l. fame:<BR>स्थास्नु यशः, Ki. ii. 19.;<BR>(3)<BR>चिरस्थायिन् (f. नी) (= l. long).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lastingly
LASTINGLY: expr. by adj. or comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lastly
LASTLY:<BR>(1) चरमम्<BR>or<BR>चरमतः;<BR>(2) पश्चिमतः (rare);<BR>(3) अन्ततः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latch
LATCH: खिल्लः (?); अर्गलः (= bolt).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latchet
LATCHET: of a shoe: सूत्रम् (??); बन्धनी (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

late
LATE (adj.):<BR>I Long delayed: expr. with<BR>विलम्बेन<BR>or<BR>चिरेण, the summer is l. this year:<BR>*अस्मिन् वर्षे चिरेणागतो निदाघः।<BR>II Far advanced:<BR>परिणतः (ता, तं),<BR>l. in the day:<BR>परिणते दिवसे। Ph.:<BR>at l. hours (of night): अकाले or (?) रिरंसाकाले, D.<BR>III Departed, out of office: पूर्वतनः (नी, नं).<BR>IV Not long past: expr. with इतः किञ्चित्<BR> पूर्षम्, L. p.:<BR>(1) परः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) अधस्तनः (नी, नं)<BR>(of persons or things in position), l. r than<BR>the works.<BR>ग्रन्थानामधस्तनः, Mahesha.: v.<BR>Deceased: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

late
LATE (adv.):<BR>I At an advanced time:<BR>(1)<BR>विलम्बेन;<BR>(2) चिरेण। Ph.:<BR>sooner or l. r:<BR>अद्य श्वो<BR> वा;<BR>too l.:<BR>अतीतकालः (ला, लं), वि-, R. v. 14.<BR>II Lately: q. v.<BR>III Far in the night:<BR>अकाले<BR>or<BR>असमये। Ph.:<BR>of l.:<BR>अधुनातनकाले;<BR>(2)<BR>इदानीन्तनकाले;<BR>(3) अधुना- (= now: in connec-<BR>-tion with formerly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lately
LATELY:<BR>(1) इदानीमेव (?);<BR>(2) किञ्चित्पूर्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lateness
LATENESS: expr. as described under late.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latent
LATENT: निगूढः (ढा, ढं): v. Hidden, invisible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lateral
LATERAL:<BR>(1) by comp.: v. Side;<BR>(2) पार्श्विकः<BR>(का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laterally
LATERALLY: पार्श्वतः: v. Sidewise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lath
LATH: सूक्ष्मफलकः, Monier Williams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lathe
LATHE:<BR>(1) कुन्दः;<BR>(2) म्रमिः (मः).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lather
LATHER: (subs.) फेनः (the exact sense being<BR>determined by context): v. Foam.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lather
LATHER (v.): फेनायते: v. To froth.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latinist
LATINIST: *लाटिनमाषाभिज्ञः, -विशारदः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latinity
LATINITY: *विशुद्धलाटिनम्; लाटिनम् will often do.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latitude
LATITUDE:<BR>I Geo.: अक्षांशः, Su. com.; अक्ष-<BR>भागः, Gan. Ph.:<BR>place of no. l.:<BR>निरक्षदेशः;<BR>they<BR>have no l.:<BR>तासु नाक्षस्योन्नतिरष्यते, Su. xii. 42.;<BR>celestial l:<BR>विक्षेपः, Su.<BR>II Breadth: q. v.<BR>III<BR>Laxity, freedom: गुरुलाघवम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latitudinal
LATITUDINAL: expr. by comp., l. difference:<BR>अक्षभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latitudinarian
LATITUDINARIAN: *शिथिलघर्मभक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latitudinarianism
LATITUDINARIANISM: *शिथिलधर्मभक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latter
LATTER (adj.): उत्तरः (रा, रं) (in all the senses):<BR>v. Former, subsequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

latterly
LATTERLY: परेण। (= afterwards: ?): v. (Of)<BR>late.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lattice
LATTICE: Ph.:<BR>l. window:<BR>जालमार्गः; l. work:<BR>जालकर्मन् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laud
LAUD (v.): प्रशंसति (शंस्, c. 1.): v. To praise,<BR>celebrate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudable
LAUDABLE: प्रशस्य (f. स्या): v. Praiseworthy,<BR>excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudableness
LAUDABLENESS:<BR>(1) प्रशस्यता;<BR>(2) प्रशस्तता;<BR>(3)<BR>उत्कृष्टता (= excellence).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=408" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudably
LAUDABLY:<BR>(1) प्रशस्तम्;<BR>(2) by comp. or<BR>circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudanum
LAUDANUM: *अहिफेनरसः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudation
LAUDATION: प्रशंसा (प्रशस्ति वचनम्, Mr.: v.<BR>Praise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laudatory
LAUDATORY:<BR>(1) प्रशंसक (f. सिका);<BR>(2) स्तावक<BR>(f. विका).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laugh
LAUGH (v.): हसति (हस्, c. 1.), l. ed violently:<BR>स्वनवज्जहास,<BR>V p.;<BR>the ladies l. ed:<BR>जहसुरङ्गनाः,<BR>K. ;<BR>he l. s at Daśānana and others:<BR>दशाननादीन्<BR> हसत्यसौ, S. i. 71.;<BR>to l. at:<BR>हास्यम्, Vi. iii. 28.:<BR>v. Also to smile., deride. Ph.:<BR>to l. down or<BR>out:<BR>अप (व) हसति;<BR>to l. in one's sleeve:<BR>अन्तर् हसति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laugh
LAUGH, LAUGHING (subs.):<BR>(1) हास्यम्;<BR>(2) हासः;<BR>(3) हसितम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laughable
LAUGHABLE:<BR>(1) हासकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) हास्य-<BR>जननः (नी, नं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laughably
LAUGHABLY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laughing-stock
LAUGHING-STOCK:<BR>(1) हास्यास्पदम्;<BR>(2) हास्य-<BR>पात्रम्; etc.: v. Object.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laughter
LAUGHTER: हासः: v. Laugh (subs.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

launch
LAUNCH (v.):<BR>I Of vessels: वाहयति (c. of वह).<BR>II To level: क्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.).<BR>III To<BR>expatiate: प्रपञ्चयति (पञ्च्, c. 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laundress
LAUNDRESS: वस्त्रधाविका (?): v. Washerwoman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laundry
LAUNDRY: धावनशाला (?); रजकगृहम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laureate
LAUREATE:<BR>I Lit.: *नारलमालिन् (f. नी).<BR>II<BR>Fig.: स्रग्विन् (f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laurel
LAUREL (subs.): *नारलः (use m. for tree, n. for<BR>ornament).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laureled
LAURELED, LAURELLED: *नारलभूषितः (ता, तं)<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lava
LAVA: *उद्गारः ; आग्नोयोद्गारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavatory
LAVATORY:<BR>I A place: *प्रक्षालनस्थानम्।<BR>II A<BR>wash: q. v.:<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lave
LAVE: प्रक्षालयति (क्षाल्, c. 10.): v. To wash,<BR>bathe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavender
LAVENDER:<BR>l. water:<BR>*लावन्दरजलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laver
LAVER: प्रक्षालनपात्रम् (?). and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavish
LAVISH (v.):<BR>(1) वर्षति (वृष्, c. 1 (= to<BR>shower), K. ;<BR>(2) अवाकिरति (कृ, c. 6 (= to<BR>scatter down): v. Also to spend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavish
LAVISH (adj.):<BR>I Prodigal, wasteful: q. v.:<BR>अतित्यागिन् (f. नी).<BR>II Wild, unrestrained:<BR>q. v.<BR>III Immoderate: अपरिमितः (ता, तं).<BR>IV Bestowing much: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavishly
LAVISHLY: अपरिमितम् (immoderately). To<BR>give l.: v. To lavish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lavishness
LAVISHNESS: अतिव्ययः: v. Prodigality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

law
LAW:<BR>I A command: शासनम्।<BR>II Natural:<BR>नियमः (?).<BR>III Statute: विधिः (?).<BR>IV Juris-<BR>-prudence: q. v.: Ph.:<BR>l. asks you:<BR>व्यवहारस्त्वां<BR> पृच्छति, Mr. ix.;<BR>who has come to l. against<BR>me:<BR>केन सह मम व्यवहारः Mr.: v. Action, to<BR>inform; against (the common)<BR>l.:<BR>स्मृतिविरुद्धम् or<BR>स्मृत्यपेतेन मार्गेण;<BR>l. -breaker:<BR>विधिभेदकः (?) (after<BR>स्थितिभेत्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

law-book
LAW-BOOK: स्मृतिशास्त्रम् (used of Hindu 1. s.);<BR>*विधिग्रन्थः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawful
LAWFUL:<BR>(1) वैधः (धी, धं) (?);<BR>(2) न्याय्य (f. य्या)<BR>(= just).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawfully
LAWFULLY: विध्यनुसारेण (?); न्यायतः (= justly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawfulness
LAWFULNESS:<BR>(1) वैधता (?).:<BR>(2) न्याय्यता<BR>(= justness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawgiver
LAWGIVER: विधिप्रवर्तकः (?); स्मृतिकारः (only of<BR>the Smritis).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawless
LAWLESS:<BR>I Lit.: अवैधः (धी, धं) (?).<BR>II Un-<BR>-restrained: अनियन्त्रण (f. णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawlessly
LAWLESSLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawlessness
LAWLESSNESS:<BR>I Lit.: अवैधता।<BR>II Fig.:<BR>अनियन्त्रणा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawn
LAWN:<BR>I Of grass: तृणभूमिः (?) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR>II A sort of fine linen क्षौमम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawsuit
LAWSUIT:<BR>(1) व्यवहारः v. Action;<BR>(2) विवादः:<BR>v. Dispute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lawyer
LAWYER:<BR>(1) विधिज्ञः (?): v. Jurist;<BR>(2) व्यव-<BR>हारिकः (?) (= practising 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lax
LAX (adj.):<BR>I Loose: q. v.: शिथिलः (ला, लं).<BR>II Not strict: शिथिलः (ला, लं) (?); मृदु<BR>(f. द्वी) (= gentle).<BR>III Of the bowel:<BR>शिथिलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laxative
LAXATIVE: रेचकः (f. चिका): v. Purgative.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laxity
LAXITY: शैथिल्यम्: v. Looseness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laxly
LAXLY: शिथिलम्: v. Loosely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laxness
LAXNESS: शिथिलता: v. Looseness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay
LAY (v.):<BR>I To place, put: q. v.: निदधाति [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">Page410</a>]<BR>(धा, c. 3.).<BR>II To cause to lie: शाययति<BR>(c. of शी) (rare): v. To lie.<BR>III To fell:<BR>q. v.: पातयति (c. of पत्).<BR>IV Miscell.:<BR>to l.<BR>dust:<BR>रजः शमयति, Ki. vi. 27.;<BR>to l. eggs:<BR>अण्डक-<BR>विमोक्षणं करोति, P. (H. has प्रसूते, not अण्डानि प्रसूते:<BR> डिम्बान् ददाति is used in the vernacular);<BR>to l.<BR>a snare:<BR>उन्माथं प्रयोजयति, Mah.;<BR>to l. com-<BR>mand:<BR>शासनं प्रयोजयति;<BR>to l. paint, etc:<BR>रङ्गं, etc.<BR>ददाति;<BR>to l. siege:<BR>रोधं करोति, (with gen.);<BR>“when the winds are laid”:<BR>शान्ते वाते;<BR>l. blame<BR>upon:<BR>दोषम् आरोपयति (c. of रुह्) (with loc.);<BR>to l. waste:<BR>खिलीकरोति: v. To devastate;<BR>to l.<BR>a tax, etc.:<BR>करं, etc. स्थापयति (c. of स्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=409" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay aside
LAY ASIDE:<BR>I Not to retain:<BR>(1) अप-अस्यति,<BR> निर्- (अस्, c. 4.),<BR>how all that was suddenly<BR>l. d a:<BR>सर्वं तदेकपदमेव कथं निरस्तम्, Vi. iii. 13.;<BR>(2)<BR>विमुञ्चति (मुच्, c. 6.) (= to leave: q. v.), l. ing<BR>a. (her)<BR>necklace:<BR>हारं विमुच्य, Ku. v. 8.<BR>II To<BR>reserve: q. v.:<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay before
LAY BEFORE: उपन्यस्यति (अस्, c. 4.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay by
LAY BY: रक्षति (रक्ष्, c. 1.): v. To keep,<BR>reserve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay down
LAY DOWN:<BR>I To abandon: q. v.: मुञ्चति, वि-,<BR>(मुच्, c. 6.),<BR>l. d d. arms:<BR>शस्त्राणि मुमोच, Ki. ii. 9.<BR>II To determine, decide: q. v.: निर्धारयति<BR>(धृ, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay hold of
LAY HOLD OF: गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9.): v. To<BR>catch, seize.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay in
LAY IN: संचिनोति (चि, c. 5.),<BR>how much blood<BR>you have l. d in:<BR>कियत् प्रभूतं त्वया सञ्चितं रुधिरम्, Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay on
LAY ON: of blows: ददाति (दा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay open
LAY OPEN: विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.): v. To dis-<BR>-close, open.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay out
LAY OUT:<BR>I Of corpses:<BR>l. d out the corpse of<BR>Bāli on the litter:<BR>आरोप्य शिविकायां तु बालिनं नष्ट-<BR>जीवितम् (वाससाच्छादयामास माल्येनावचकार च), Ram.<BR>II To use: q. v.: प्रयोजयति (युज्, c. 10.).<BR>III To plan: परिकल्पयति (कॢप्, c. 10.).<BR>IV<BR>To exert: q. v.: v. To intend, purpose:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay to
LAY TO:<BR>I To impute: q. v.<BR>II Of ships:<BR>गतिरोधं करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay together
LAY TOGETHER: समाहरति (हृ, c. 1.): v. To<BR>collect. Ph.:<BR>l. heads:<BR>एकत्र मन्त्रयति, (मन्त्र्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay up
LAY UP:<BR>I To store, l. in: q. v.: संचिनोति<BR>(चि, c. 5.).<BR>II In pass., confined to bed:<BR>उत्थातुं अक्षमः (मा, मं): v. Also bed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay upon
LAY UPON: i. e. to wager: q. v.: पण्यतां नयति<BR>(नी, c. 1.), Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay wait for
LAY WAIT FOR: क्रमं कृत्वा निभृतं तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.),<BR>P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay
LAY (subs.):<BR>I A song: q. v.: गीतम्।<BR>II A<BR>meadow: भूमिः।<BR>III A layer: स्तरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lay
LAY (adj.): v. Layman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

layer
LAYER:<BR>I A stratum: स्तरः,<BR>and how many<BR>l. s.:<BR>कति स्तराश्च, Li. 198.<BR>II Of a plant:<BR>perh. मूलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laying
LAYING (subs.): of eggs: अण्डमोक्षणम्, प्रसवः,<BR>(?), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

layman
LAYMAN: गृहस्थः (= householder); प्राकृतः (= com-<BR>-mon man); ग्राम्यः (= villager).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lazar
LAZAR: पापरोगिन् (f. णी); पापरोगपीडितः (ता, तं);<BR>etc., M. v. 164.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lazaretto
LAZARETTO: LAZARHOUSE: *पापरोगशाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lazily
LAZILY:<BR>(1) आलस्येन;<BR>(2) तन्द्रितः (ता, तं);<BR>(3)<BR>जाड्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

laziness
LAZINESS:<BR>(1) तन्द्रा: v. Sloth;<BR>(2) आलस्यम्:<BR>v. Idleness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lazy
LAZY:<BR>(1) अलसः (सा, सं);<BR>(2) तन्द्रायुक्त<BR>(f. क्ता);<BR>(3) तन्द्रितः। (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lead
LEAD (subs.):<BR>I The metal: सीसम्, -कम्, Bha.<BR>Red l. powder:<BR>सिन्दूरम्।<BR>II Precedence: expr.<BR>by adj. or verb,<BR>to take the l.:<BR>अग्रतो याति, H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lead
LEAD (v. t.):<BR>I To guide:<BR>(1) नयति (नी, c. 1.)<BR>(= to conduct: q. v.);<BR>(2) आदिशति (दिश्,<BR>c. 6 (with gen.)<BR>or<BR>आदेशयति (c. of दिश्)<BR>(in showing),<BR>l. me the way:<BR>आदिशतु मे मार्गम्,<BR>V<BR>ii. Ph.:<BR>with the hand led the daughter of<BR>the Chief Mountain to the marriage chamber:<BR>क्षितिधरपतिकन्यामाददानः करेण॥॥।कौतुकागारमागात्,<BR>Ku. vii. 94.;<BR>led by her finger:<BR>त्वदीयामङ्गुलिमव-<BR>लम्ब्य, R. iii. 25.;<BR>l. to success:<BR>सिद्धिं नयति, Ki.<BR>II To command: q. v.: अधितिष्ठति (स्था,<BR>c. l.). Ph.:<BR>led by whom:<BR>यं पुरस्कृत्य, Ku.<BR>ii. 52.<BR>III To go before: पुरो गच्छति (गम्,<BR>c. l.), etc. (with gen.).<BR>IV To pass, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">Page411</a>]<BR>spend: q. v.: नयति: v. To influence: हरति<BR>(हृ, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=410" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lead
LEAD (v. t.):<BR>I To go before: पुरो भवति, etc.<BR>Ku. xiii. 11.<BR>II To tend:<BR>the road l. ing to<BR>the Golden City:<BR>सुवर्णपुरगामी पन्थाः, Ku.<BR>poverty<BR>l. s to shame:<BR>दारिद्र्याद्धियमेति, Mr. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaden
LEADEN:<BR>I Lit.: सीस- in comp.: v. Lead,<BR>made of.<BR>II Dull, heavy: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leader
LEADER:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) नेतृ (m.), l. of armies:<BR>नेता चमूनाम्, R. : v. Commander;<BR>(2) नायकः,<BR>l. of sailors:<BR>नाविकनायकः, D. : v. Chief.<BR>II A<BR>leading article: *मुख्यप्रबन्धः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leadership
LEADERSHIP:<BR>(1) नेतृत्वम् (?);<BR>(2) नायकत्वम् (?):<BR>v. Command.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leading
LEADING (adj.): मुख्य (f. ख्या),<BR>l. men:<BR>मुख्याः:<BR>v. Chief, first.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leading
LEADING (subs.): सीसद्रव्याणि (n. pl (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leading-strings
LEADING-STRINGS: बालानामालम्बनसूत्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaf
LEAF (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: पत्रम्,<BR>in a small basin<BR>of l. ves:<BR>पत्रपुटे, R. ;<BR>(2) पर्णम्,<BR>knows even the l. ves<BR>of the whole of this forest:<BR>सकलस्यास्य कान्तारस्य<BR> पर्णानामप्यभिज्ञः, C. viii.;<BR>living on tree-l. ves natura-<BR>lly withered:<BR>स्वयंविशीर्णर्द्रुमपर्णवृत्तिता, Ku.<BR>II Of<BR>metal: पत्रम्, of gold, that is, of (its)<BR>l. ves made<BR>very thin:<BR>स्वर्णस्य अतितनूकृतपत्रस्य, Bha.<BR>III Of a<BR>book: पत्रम्। Ph.: you should turn over a new l.:<BR>*त्वया मिन्नवृत्तिर्निषेवनीया।<BR>IV Of a door:<BR>कपा (वा) ट (mn.),<BR>with folded l. ves:<BR>दत्तकपाटः,<BR>Va.; l. -breaker (i. e. thief): कपाटघ्नः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leafless
LEAFLESS:<BR>(1) निष्पत्रः (त्रा, त्रं);<BR>(2) अपत्रः (त्रा,<BR> त्रं);<BR>(3) अपर्ण (f. र्णा); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leafy
LEAFY:<BR>(1) पत्रावृतः (ता, तं), and sim. comps.<BR>(= coverd with leaves);<BR>(2) पत्रमयः (यी, यं)<BR>(= consisting of l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

league
LEAGUE (subs.):<BR>I A compact: सन्धिः or<BR>rarely^1 सन्धानम्,<BR>to form l.:<BR>सन्धिं करोति<BR>or<BR>कुरुते,<BR>H. ;<BR>shall either quickly set to l.:<BR>क्षिप्रं वा सन्धिकामः<BR> स्यात्, Mah.<BR>II Two miles: गव्यूतिः,<BR>going<BR>about three l. s.:<BR>गव्यूतित्रितयमिव गत्वा, K. : v. Mile.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

league
LEAGUE (v.): सन्दधाति (धा, c. 3.),<BR>shall never<BR>l. with false irreligious people:<BR>सत्यधर्मव्यपेतेन<BR> सन्दध्यान्न कदाचन, H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaguer
LEAGUER:<BR>I A camp.: निवेशः।<BR>II Siege: रोधः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leak
LEAK (subs): छिद्रम्, Ph.: to spring a l.: expr.<BR>by छिद्रं जायते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leak
LEAK (v.):<BR>the house l. s:<BR>गृहे जलं स्रवतिः v. To<BR>ooze. L. out: of secrets, etc.: स्रवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leakage
LEAKAGE: स्रुतिक्षतिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaky
LEAKY: छिद्रपूर्ण (f. र्णा) (full of chinks).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lean
LEAN (subs.): मेदोहीनं मांसम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lean
LEAN (adj.):<BR>(1) कृशः (शा, शं), परि-, with l. limbs:<BR>परिकृशैरङ्गैः, Ki.<BR>(2) तनु (f. न्वी) (= thin);<BR>(3) क्षीण (f. णा), परि-, (that has lost flesh);<BR>(4) क्षामः (मा, मं) (rare) (= 3).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lean
LEAN (v.):<BR>I To 1. on or upon: अवलम्बते<BR>(लम्ब्, c. 1 (with acc.).<BR>II To be dis-<BR>-posed: प्रवण (f. णा).<BR>III To bend, deviate:<BR>नमति, अव-, (नम्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leanness
LEANNESS:<BR>(1) कृशता<BR>or<BR>कार्श्यम्, परि-;<BR>(2) क्षीणता,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leap
LEAP (subs.):<BR>(1) प्लुतिः<BR>or<BR>प्लु तम्,<BR>deer's l.:<BR>हरिणप्लु तम्,<BR>U. ;<BR>(2) लम्फः<BR>or<BR>भम्पः (म्पा) (= jumping),<BR>and<BR>those l. s to hell<BR>पातालभम्पाश्च ताः, Vi. v. 53.;<BR>(3) वल्गितम् (= skipping).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leap
LEAP (v.):<BR>(1) प्लवते (प्लु, c. 1.):<BR>l. down:<BR>अव-<BR>प्लवते;<BR>l. up:<BR>उत्प्लवते;<BR>l. forth:<BR>आप्लवते;<BR>(2) वल्गते,<BR> -ति (वल्ग्, c. 1.) (= to skip);<BR>(3) लम्फं or<BR>भम्पं ददाति। L. over: (लम्फेन, etc.) लङ्घयति (लङ्घ्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leap-frog
LEAP-FROG: दर्दुरप्लावः, B.p. x. 18. 15.; मण्डूक-<BR>प्लु तिः, com.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaping
LEAPING (subs.): प्लुतिः; प्लवनम्: v. Leap.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leapingly
LEAPINGLY: i. e. by leaps: प्लु तैः, U.; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leap-year
LEAP-YEAR: *अधिवर्षः (after अधिमासः): v.<BR>Bissextile.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

learn
LEARN:<BR>I To gain knowledge:<BR>(1) शिक्षते<BR>(शिक्ष्, c. 1.),<BR>shall not l. the language of<BR>barbarians:<BR>न म्लेच्छभाषां शिक्षेत, Vas.;<BR>(2) अध्येति<BR>(इ, c. 2 (gen. = to study),<BR>he l. t the Vedas<BR>as well as their limbs in their entirety:<BR>अध्यगीष्ट स<BR> वेदांश्च वेदाङ्गानि च सवर्शः, Mah. i. 128. 37.;<BR>(3)<BR>शिक्षां गृह्णाति (ग्रह्, c. 9 (with gen.), V. p.<BR>II<BR>To get information: अवगच्छति (गम्, c. 1.):<BR>v. To know, understand.<BR>III To teach:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

learned
LEARNED:<BR>I Erudite:<BR>(1) विद्वस् (f. -दुषी); [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">Page412</a>]<BR>(2) पण्डितः (ता, तं);<BR>(3) विपश्चित् (mfn.);<BR>(4) बुधः (धा, धं), वि-।<BR>II L. in:<BR>(1) अभिज्ञः<BR>(ज्ञा, ज्ञं): v. Knowing;<BR>(2) अधीतिन् (f. नी),<BR>l. in the four Vedas:<BR>अधीती चतुर्ष्वाम्नायेषु, D. v.:<BR>v. Proficient.<BR>III Of works etc.: पाण्डित्य-<BR>व्यञ्जक (f. ञ्जिका) (= indicative of learing) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=411" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

learnedly
LEARNEDLY:<BR>(1) पाण्डित्येन (?);<BR>(2) वैदुष्येण (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

learner
LEARNER:<BR>(1) शिक्षा-<BR>or<BR>विद्या-ग्राहक (f. हिका);<BR>(2) शिष्यः (= pupil).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

learning
LEARNING (subs.):<BR>(1) विद्या,<BR>as a rule, men of<BR>equal l. cavil at each^1 other's reputation:<BR>प्रायः<BR> समानविद्याः परस्परयशःपुरोभागाः, Mal i. 19.;<BR>(2)<BR>शिक्षा, (rare),<BR>they may show their l.:<BR>ते दर्शयेयुः<BR> स्वां शिक्षाम्, Mah. i. 132. 3.;<BR>(3) पाण्डित्यम्<BR>(= erudition);<BR>(4) वैदुष्यम् (= 3.: rare);<BR>(5) अभिज्ञता (= knowingness): v. Proficient.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lease
LEASE (subs.): पट्टः<BR>or<BR>पट्टोलिका (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lease
LEASE (v.): पट्टेन ददाति (?) (after Bengali): v.<BR>Also to hire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leasehold
LEASEHOLD: पट्टकृतः (ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leash
LEASH:<BR>I A thong: चर्मबन्धः।<BR>II Three: त्रयम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

least
LEAST (adj.): expr. by words given under<BR>little with अपि, (you)<BR>should not feel the l.<BR>sorrow for it:<BR>अल्पोऽपि नात्र कर्तव्यः शोकः, V. p.;<BR>the l. acceptance:<BR>अणुरपि परिग्रहः, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

least
LEAST (adv.):<BR>(1) अत्यल्पम्;<BR>(2) अल्पिष्ठम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

least
LEAST, AT: अन्ततः, Kav.: v. Also certainly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

least
LEAST, THE or IN THE (adv.):<BR>(1) अल्पमपि;<BR>(2) अण्वपि;<BR>(3) मनागपि; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leather
LEATHER: चर्मन् (n.),<BR>l. bag:<BR>चर्मभस्त्रिका, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leather-bottle
LEATHER-BOTTLE: दृतिः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leather-dresser
LEATHER-DRESSER: *चर्मसंस्कारकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leathern
LEATHERN:<BR>(1) चर्म- in comp.;<BR>(2) चर्ममयः<BR>(यी, यं);<BR>(3) चार्मिकः (की, कं) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leathery
LEATHERY: चर्मसदृशः (शी, शं); better with<BR>adv. चर्मवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave
LEAVE (subs.):<BR>I Permission: q. v.: अनुज्ञा।<BR>Ph.:<BR>by your l.:<BR>तवानुमते, Mah.<BR>II Depar-<BR>-ture: विदायः, give me l. (to depart): विदायो<BR> दीयतामिति, Ma. n. v. 99. L. (of absence): विदायः<BR>(used in Bengali);<BR>privilege l.:<BR>*देयविदायः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave
LEAVE (v.):<BR>I To forsake, abandon: q. v.:<BR>त्यजति, परि-, (त्यज्, c. 1.). Ph.: it is not proper<BR>to l. him alone:<BR>न युक्तमेनमेकाकिनं कर्तुम्, K.<BR>II To bequeath: q. v.: ददाति (दा, c. 3.).<BR>III To suffer to remain: स्थापयति (c. of स्था):<BR>v. To remain.<BR>IV To entrust: q. v. न्यस्यति<BR>(अस्, c. 4.)<BR>or<BR>न्यासीकरोति,<BR>certainly Rākṣasa<BR>will not l. his family with men who are not his<BR>equals:<BR>नूनं ह्यनात्मसदृशेषु राक्षसः कलत्रं न्यासीकरिष्यति,<BR>Mu. i.: v. To refer: perh. न्यस्यति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave behind
LEAVE BEHIND: पश्चात् करोति (कृ, c. 8.), R.<BR>xvii. 18.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave for
LEAVE FOR: प्रतिष्ठते (स्था, c. 1 (with acc.)<BR>Si. iii. 1.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave off
LEAVE OFF:<BR>I To cease, desist: q. v.:<BR>l. ing<BR>off crying:<BR>विलापाद्विरता, R. xiv. 71;<BR>when the<BR>rain left off:<BR>शान्ते पानीयवर्षे, H.<BR>II To leave,<BR>abandon: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leave out
LEAVE OUT:<BR>(1) त्यजति, परि-;<BR>(2) वर्जयति: v.<BR>To omit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaven
LEAVEN (subs.); किण्वः: v. Ferment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaven
LEAVEN (v.):<BR>I To ferment: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>taint, imbue: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leaving
LEAVING:<BR>I Lit.: शिष्टम्, अव-।<BR>II Refuse:<BR>उच्छिष्टम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecherous
LECHEROUS: कामासक्तः (क्ता, क्तं): v. Lustful,<BR>lewd.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecherousness
LECHEROUSNESS: कामासक्तिः: v. Lust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecture
LECTURE (subs.):<BR>I Reading: *प्रपाठः।<BR>II<BR>A reproof: शासनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecture
LECTURE (v.):<BR>I Of l.s: *प्रपठति (पठ्, c. 1.).<BR>II To reprove: शास्ति (शास्, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecture-room
LECTURE-ROOM: *प्रपाठशाला<BR>or<BR>कोष्ठः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lecturer
LECTURER: *प्रपाठकः; शासकः (= instructor).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ledge
LEDGE:<BR>I Ridge: q. v.: कटकम् (?).<BR>II A<BR>row: आलिः।<BR>III A layer: स्तरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ledger
LEDGER: गणनापत्रिका (?), Raj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lee
LEE: हठभुमिः (?) [हड्ता used among the boat-<BR>-men].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leech
LEECH:<BR>I The reptile^1:<BR>(1) रक्तपा;<BR>(2) जलौकाः;<BR>(3) जलोरगी। II. A physician: q. v.: मिषज्<BR>(m.).<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leek
LEEK: कन्दविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leer
LEER (v.): कटाक्षेण विध्यति (व्यध्, c. 4.): v. To<BR>glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=412" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leer
LEER (adj.): रिक्तः (क्ता, क्तं): v. Empty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leeringly
LEERINGLY: कटाक्षपातैः: v. Glance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lees
LEES:<BR>(1) मलम्;<BR>(2) उच्छिष्टम् (= refuse).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

left
LEFT (adj.):<BR>(1) वामः (मा, मं) (= best equiv.),<BR>on the l.:<BR>वामतः;<BR>l. hand:<BR>वामहस्तः;<BR>(2) सव्य (f.<BR>व्या);<BR>(3) दक्षिणेतरः (रा, रं) (poet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

left-handed
LEFT-HANDED: वामहस्तः (स्ता, स्तं) (?). [सव्यसाचिन्<BR>is not = 1. and used mostly of Arjuna].<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leg
LEG:<BR>I Of animals: जङ्घा।<BR>II Of a table, etc.:<BR>पादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legacy
LEGACY: (*इच्छापत्रेण) दानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legal
LEGAL:<BR>(1) वैधः (धी, धं) (?);<BR>(2) विधिसंगतः<BR>(ता, तं) (?).<BR>L. proceeding:<BR>व्यवहारः: v. Action.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leagalize
LEAGALIZE: *वैधीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legally
LEGALLY:<BR>(1) विधिक्रमेण (?);<BR>(2) विध्यनुसारेणः<BR>v. Also justly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legate
LEGATE: दूतः: v. Ambassador, deputy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legatee
LEGATEE: *इच्छापत्रधनाधिकारिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legation
LEGATION:<BR>I Lit.: दौत्यम्।<BR>II The residence:<BR>दूतावासः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legend
LEGEND:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) कथा (= story);<BR>(2)<BR>इतिहासः पुरातनः, Mah.<BR>II An inscription:<BR>शासनम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legendary
LEGENDARY:<BR>(1) पौराणिकः (की, कं) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>मिथ्या (= false).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legerdemain
LEGERDEMAIN: माया (?): v. Jugglery.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legging
LEGGING: जङ्घात्राणम्, and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legibility
LEGIBILITY:<BR>(1) सुपठता;<BR>(2) सुपाठ्यता; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legible
LEGIBLE:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) सुपठ। (ठा, ठं);<BR>(2)<BR>सुपाठ्य (f. ठ्या); etc.<BR>II Fig.: expr. with<BR>वाचयति, निर्- (c. of वच्): v. To read.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legibly
LEGIBLY: सुपठम् (?); better by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legion
LEGION: चमूः (?): v. Army, host.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legionary
LEGIONARY:<BR>I Lit.: by comp.<BR>II Fig:<BR>प्रभूतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legislate
LEGISLATE: विधिं विदधाति (धा, c. 3 (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legislation
LEGISLATION: विधिविधानम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legislative
LEGISLATIVE: विधिविधातृ (f. त्री) (??); व्यवस्थापक<BR>(f. पिका) (in Bengali) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legislator
LEGISLATOR: विधिविधातृ (m (??); व्यवस्था-<BR>कारकः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legislature
LEGISLATURE: विधिविधातारः (m. pl.); व्यवस्था-<BR>पकाः (m. pl (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legitimacy
LEGITIMACY:<BR>I Legality: वैधता (??).<BR>II Of<BR>birth: सुजन्मता (??).<BR>III Genuineness: यथार्थता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

legitimate
LEGITIMATE:<BR>I Legal: वैधः (धी, धं) (?).<BR>II<BR>Of birth: सुजन्मन् (mfn (?).<BR>III Genuine:<BR>यथार्थ (f. र्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lagitimately
LAGITIMATELY: यथान्यायम् (= justly); यथार्थतः<BR>(= truly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leguminous
LEGUMINOUS: शिम्बिजः (जा, जं), Bha. Ph.:<BR>l.<BR>plants:<BR>शिम्बिधान्यम्, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leisure
LEISURE:<BR>(1) अवकाशः;<BR>(2) अवसरः, Sa. Ph.:<BR>at l.:<BR>प्राप्तावसरः (रा, रं), लब्धावसरः (रा, रं), etc.;<BR>want of l.:<BR>अनवकाशः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leisurely
LEISURELY (adj.):<BR>(1) मन्थरः (रा, रं): v.<BR>Slow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leisurely
LEISURELY (adv.):<BR>(1) मन्दं मन्दम्;<BR>(2) शनैः<BR> शनैः: v. Slowly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lemon
LEMON:<BR>I The tree:<BR>(1) जम्बीरः;<BR>(2) निम्बूः<BR>II The fruit:<BR>(1) जम्बीरम्<BR>or<BR>जम्बीरफलम्;<BR>(2) निम्बूफलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lemonade
LEMONADE: पानीयविशेषः; जम्बीरजलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lend
LEND (v.): ददाति (दा, c. 3.): v. To give,<BR>borrow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lender
LENDER: उत्तमर्णः: v. Also usurer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

length
LENGTH:<BR>(1) दैर्घ्यम्:, another cloth 3(1/2) cubits in l.<BR>दैर्ध्ये सार्धकरत्रयापरपटी, Li.;<BR>whose breadth is five<BR>cubits, l. eight cubits:<BR>यद्विस्तृतिः पञ्चकराष्टहस्तं दैर्घ्यं<BR> च, Li.;<BR>(2) आयतिः<BR>or<BR>आयामः (rare);<BR>(3)<BR>परिमाणम् (= measure: as of time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

length
LENGTH, AT:<BR>I Copiously, fully: सविस्तरम्,<BR>K.<BR>II. At last: शेषे, अव- (?).<BR>III After a<BR>long time: दीर्घकालानन्तरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lengthen
LENGTHEN:<BR>I Trans: दीर्घीकरोति,<BR>l. ing the body<BR>with speed:<BR>वेगदीर्घीकृताङ्गः, Ku. iii. 76.;<BR>l. ing<BR>the cry of geese:<BR>दीर्घीकुर्वन् कूजितं सारसानाम्, Me.<BR>i. 32.: v. Also tend, prolong.<BR>II Intrans:<BR>दीर्घीमवति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

length-wise
LENGTH-WISE:<BR>(1) दैर्घ्ये;<BR>(2) अन्वायामम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lengthy
LENGTHY<BR>(1) विस्तीर्ण (f. र्णा);<BR>(2) विस्तृतः (ता,<BR> तं): v. Also long.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leniency
LENIENCY:<BR>(1) दया: v. Kindness:<BR>(2) मार्दवम्:<BR>v. Mildness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lenient
LENIENT:<BR>(1) सदयः (या, यं): v. Kind, merci-<BR>-ful;<BR>(2) मृदु (f. द्वी): v. Mild.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=413" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leniently
LENIENTLY:<BR>(1) सदयम् (= kindly);<BR>(2) मृदु<BR>(= mildly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lenity
LENITY: v. Leniency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lens
LENS: *दृष्टिकाचः; वीक्षणकाचः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lent
LENT: कुष्टीयपर्वभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lenten
LENTEN:<BR>I Lit.: *लेण्टीयः (या, यं).<BR>II Fig.:<BR>v. Spare, plain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lentil
LENTIL: मसूरः<BR>or<BR>मसुरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leonine
LEONINE: सैहः (ही, हं). Ph.:<BR>l. verse:<BR>*लैयनच्छन्दः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leopard
LEOPARD:<BR>(1) चित्रकः;<BR>(2) उपव्याघ्रः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leper
LEPER:<BR>(1) कुष्ठिन् (f. नी), M.;<BR>(2) कुष्ठरोगिन्<BR>(f. णी);<BR>(3) कुष्ठपीडितः (ता, तं), Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leprosy
LEPROSY:<BR>(1) कुष्ठम्;<BR>(2) महाव्याधिः (a gen.<BR>term).<BR>Spotted l.:<BR>चित्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leprous
LEPROUS:<BR>(1) कुष्ठिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) कुष्ठरोगाक्रान्तः<BR>(न्ता, न्तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

less
LESS (adj.):<BR>(1) न्यूनः (ना, नं);<BR>(2) ऊनः (ना,<BR> नं),<BR>if it is l.:<BR>ऊनाञ्चेत्, V. s.: v. Little.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

less
LESS (adv.):<BR>(1) न्यूनम्;<BR>(2) अल्पतरम् (?).<BR>Much l.: q. v.: किमुत।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

less
LESS (suff.):<BR>(1) अ- (or अन्- before vowels),<BR>childless:<BR>अपुत्रः (त्रा, त्रं)<BR>or<BR>अनपत्यः (त्या, त्यं);<BR>(2) निर्-,<BR>fearless:<BR>निर्भयः (या, यं): v. Devoid<BR>of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lessee
LESSEE: भाटकेन क्षेत्रादिग्रहीतृ (m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lessen
LESSEN: न्यूनीकरोति (trans)<BR>or<BR>न्यूनीभवति (in-<BR>-trans): v. To diminish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lesson
LESSON:<BR>I That which is taught:<BR>(1) पाठ्यम्,<BR>read boy's l. s:<BR>पपाठ बालपाठ्यानि, V. p.;<BR>(2)<BR>शिक्षा (= instruction),<BR>to take l.:<BR>शिक्षां गृह्वाति,<BR>Mah.<BR>II A portion to learn at one time:<BR>पाठः।<BR>III Reproof: शासनम्,<BR>to give l.:<BR>शासनं<BR> करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lessor
LESSOR (v.): पट्टदातृ (f. त्री) (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lest
LEST: expr. by कदाचित् with विधिलिङ्,<BR>l. he see<BR>you:<BR>कदाचित् त्वां स पश्येत्; नोचेत् with लट्: v.<BR>Otherwise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let
LET:<BR>I To allow, permit: q. v.<BR>II As<BR>sign of imper. mood:<BR>(1) by लोट्,<BR>let him<BR>be entirely so:<BR>तथाविधस्तावदशेषमस्तु सः, Ku.;<BR>l. him say all he thinks proper to say:<BR>उच्यतां स<BR> वचनीयमशेषम्, Ki.;<BR>l. it be what may be:<BR>यदस्तु<BR> तदस्तु, Ma.;<BR>(2) by लुङ् after मा, l. it never<BR>come to pass:<BR>मा स्म भूत्, Ki.;<BR>l. not cupid enchant<BR>you:<BR>मा मूमुहद्भवन्तमनन्यजन्मा, Ma.<BR>III To<BR>lease: भाटकेन ददाति, (दा, c. 3.).<BR>IV Of<BR>blood: स्रावयति (c. of स्रु): v. Bleed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let alone
LET ALONE: न बाधते (बाध्, c. 1.).<BR>L. a. its<BR>seeing, I have never heard i of it:<BR>न च तां श्रुत-<BR>वानस्मि, दूरे तदृर्शनं पुनः, K. s. xxv. 31.<BR>L. a.<BR>principle:<BR>*निर्बाधं तत्त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let down
LET DOWN:<BR>(1) अवतारयति (c. of तॄ);<BR>(2)<BR>अवरोहयति (c. of रुह्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let fly
LET FLY, LET OFF: मुञ्चति (मुच्, c. 6.): v. To<BR>discharge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let go
LET Go, LET LOOSE: मुञ्चति<BR>or<BR>मोचयति: v. To<BR>release, set free.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let in
LET IN: प्रवेशयति (c. of विश्): v. To admit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

let out
LET OUT:<BR>I To let go: q. v.<BR>II To lease:<BR>भाटकेन ददाति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lethal
LETHAL: प्राणहरः (रा, रं): v. Fatal, deadly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lethargic
LETHARGIC, -AL:<BR>(1) जडः (डा, डं) (= dull);<BR>(2) निद्रालसः (सा, सं) (= sleepy).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lethargy
LETHARGY:<BR>(1) जाड्यम् (= dullness);<BR>(2) निद्राल-<BR>सता (= sleepiness);<BR>(3) तन्द्रा (= lassitude).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lethe
LETHE: विस्मृतिः: v. Forgetfulness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

letter
LETTER:<BR>I Of the alphabet:<BR>(1) अक्षरम्;<BR>(2)<BR>वर्णः।<BR>The l.<BR>अ (a), क (k), etc.: अकारः, ककारः,<BR>etc.;<BR>the l.<BR>र (r): रेफः।<BR>II Literal statement:<BR>शब्दार्थः। Ph.:<BR>to the l.:<BR>यथावचनम्: v. Also lite-<BR>-rally.<BR>III An epistle:<BR>(1) पत्रम्,<BR>send a l.:<BR>पत्रं<BR> प्रेषय, A r.;<BR>(2) लेखः,<BR>to open a l.:<BR>लेखम् उन्मुञ्चति,<BR>K;<BR>to seal a l.:<BR>लेखं मुद्रयति, Mu.; a l. carrier:<BR>लेखहारकः, K. Ph.:<BR>a man of l.s<BR>कृतविद्य (f. द्या):<BR>v. Learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lettered
LETTERED (adj.): i. e. educated, learned:<BR>q. v.: कृतविद्य (f. द्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

letter-writer
LETTER-WRITER: पत्रलेखकः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lettuce
LETTUCE: शाकभेदः; *लक्तकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levant
LEVANT: भूमध्यसागरस्य पूर्वप्रान्तः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levee
LEVEE: दर्शकमेला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

level
LEVEL (adj.): समः (मा, मं),<BR>on a l. ground:<BR>सम-<BR>भूमौ;<BR>l. with the ground:<BR>भूमिसमः (मा, मं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

level
LEVEL (subs.):<BR>I Even surface: समभूमिः।<BR>Ph.:<BR>water always finds its own l.:<BR>*जलं सर्वत्र<BR> समं तिष्ठति।<BR>II Equality: q. v.: समता। Ph.: [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">Page415</a>]<BR>on a l. with:<BR>समः (मा, मं): v. Equal;<BR>to rise<BR>above the l. of:<BR>अतिवर्तते (वृत्, c. 1.).<BR>III Ins-<BR>-trument for taking l.: सूत्रम् (?), Williams.<BR>IV Plan. scheme: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=414" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

level
LEVEL (v.):<BR>I To make 1.: समीकरोति,<BR>the<BR>earth all around was l. ed:<BR>क्षितिः परितः समीकृता,<BR>Ku. xiv. 44.<BR>II To direct: expr. with<BR>लक्षीकरोति (with acc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leveller
LEVELLER: i. e. one who l. s.: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levelling
LEVELLING:<BR>I Subs.: समीकरणम्।<BR>II Adj.:<BR>expr. by part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levelness
LEVELNESS: समता: v. Equality.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lever
LEVER: *तुलायन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leverage
LEVERAGE: *तुलायन्त्रयोगः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leveret
LEVERET: शशशावकः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leviable
LEVIABLE: आदापनीयः (या, यं) (?): v. To<BR>levy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

leviathan
LEVIATHAN: तिमिङ्गिलः (?); मातङ्गनक्रः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levite
LEVITE:<BR>I Lit.: *लैविः।<BR>II A priest: पुरो-<BR>हितः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levitical
LEVITICAL, -LY: Priestly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levity
LEVITY: लवुता<BR>or<BR>लाघवम्<BR>or<BR>लघिमन् (m.), so that<BR>(he)<BR>does not understand my l.:<BR>न च मेऽघिगच्छति<BR> यथा लघुताम्, Si. ix. 56.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levy
LEVY (subs.):<BR>I Of troops, etc.: उत्थानम्, सम्-।<BR>II Of taxes, etc.: समाहारः।<BR>II An army:<BR>आसारः, M. n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

levy
LEVY (v.):<BR>I Of troops: उत्थापयति, सम्-, (c.<BR>of स्था): v. To raise.<BR>II To collect:<BR>q. v.: समाहरति (हृ, c. 1.): v. Also to im-<BR>-pose.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lewd
LEWD:<BR>(1) कामुकः (की, कं);<BR>(2) कामिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) कामवशः (शा, शं);<BR>(4) कामरतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lewdly
LEWDLY: सकामः (मा, मं): v. Lasciviously,<BR>lustfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lewdness
LEWDNESS: कामुकता: v. Lust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lexicographer
LEXICOGRAPHER: कोषकारः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lexicography
LEXICOGRAPHY: कोषरचना (?) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lexicon
LEXICON: कोषः (शः): v. Dictionary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liability
LIABILITY: expr. by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liable
LIABLE: expr. by circumlo,<BR>in default of the<BR>principal, a surety who stands to produce him is l.<BR>to pay his debt:<BR>यो यस्य प्रतिभूस्तिष्ठेद्दर्शनायेह मानवः।<BR>अदर्शयन् स तं तस्मै प्रयच्छेत् स्वधनादृणम्, Kat.: v.<BR>Also subject.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liaison
LIAISON: गुप्तप्रणयः: v. Also intercourse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liar
LIAR:<BR>(1) मिथ्यावादिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) अनृतभाषिन्<BR>(f. णी); etc.: v. False.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libation
LIBATION: अभिघारः (both of the act and of<BR>the liquor), Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libel
LIBEL (subs.): परि (री) वादलेखः: v. Calumny.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libel
LIBEL (v.): परिवादं लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.): v.<BR>To defame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libellous
LIBELLOUS: परिवादगर्भ (f. र्भा): v. Calumni-<BR>-ous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberal
LIBERAL (adj.):<BR>I Catholic: उदारः (रा, रं),<BR>for to the l. minded, the (whole) earth is kindred:<BR>उदारचरितानां हि वसुधैव कुटुम्बकम्, H. II. Boun-<BR>-tiful:<BR>(1) वदान्य (f. न्या), gone to another l.<BR>(person): गतो वदान्यान्तरम्, R.;<BR>(2) त्यागशालिन्<BR>(f. नी), Si.;<BR>(3) दानशौण्ड (f. ण्डा), A.;<BR>(4)<BR>मुक्तहस्त (f. स्ता) (= open-handed).<BR>III Pro-<BR>-fuse: q. v.: प्रचुरः (रा, रं). Ph.: l. arts:<BR>उच्चविद्याः (f. pl.) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberal
LIBERAL (subs.): *उदारः, l. government:<BR>*उदाराणां शासनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberality
LIBERALITY:<BR>I of mind: औदार्यम्<BR>or<BR>उदारता।<BR>II Munificence:<BR>(1) वदान्यता;<BR>(2) त्यागशालिता;<BR>etc. III. A gift.: दानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberally
LIBERALLY:<BR>I Unselfishly: उदारम्।<BR>II Bounti-<BR>-fully: मुक्तहस्तम्।<BR>III Not strictly: असंयतः (??);<BR>मावतः (= by purport).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberate
LIBERATE: मोक्षयति (मोक्ष्, c. 10.): v. Manu-<BR>-mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberation
LIBERATION: मोक्षः,<BR>l. of slaves:<BR>दासस्य मोक्षः,<BR>Va.: v. Release.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberator
LIBERATOR:<BR>(1) मोक्षकः, परि-;<BR>(2) मोचकः, वि-,<BR> सं-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libertine
LIBERTINE:<BR>(1) खण्डितवृत्त (f. त्ता) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>मग्नचारित्रयन्त्रण (f. णा), D. xiii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libertinism
LIBERTINISM: व्यभिचारः: v. Profligacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liberty
LIBERTY:<BR>I Freedom: q. v.: स्वाधीनता।<BR>II<BR>Permission: q. v.: अनुज्ञा।<BR>III Privilege:<BR>अधिकारः।<BR>IV Breach of decorum: अविनयः,<BR>etc.,<BR>the l. I have taken:<BR>मम विनयापराधः, Vi.<BR>Ph.:<BR>you are at l. to go:<BR>गच्छ यथेच्छम्, N.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=415" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libidinous
LIBIDINOUS: कामुकः (की, कं): v. Lewd, lust-<BR>-ful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libra
LIBRA: तुला, -राशिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

librarian
LIBRARIAN: *पुस्तकशालाध्यक्षः, -नायकः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

library
LIBRARY:<BR>I Collection of books: पुस्तकानि<BR>(n. pl (?); पुस्तकसंग्रहः (??); etc.<BR>II The<BR>place: *पुस्तकशाला; पुस्तकागारम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

libration
LIBRATION: तुलाकरणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

license
LICENSE (subs.):<BR>I Permission: अनुज्ञा।<BR>II<BR>Its document: अनुज्ञापत्रम् (?).<BR>III Excess of<BR>liberty: अनियन्त्रणा (?). Ph.:<BR>poets have free<BR>l.:<BR>निरङ्कुशाः कवयः, S.k.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

license
LICENSE (v.): अनुजानाति (ज्ञा, c. 9.): v. To<BR>permit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

licentiate
LICENTIATE: *लब्धाधिकारः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

licentious
LICENTIOUS:<BR>I Using licence: अनियन्त्रण (f.<BR>णा) (?).<BR>II Lewd, dissolute: q. v.: उद्दामः<BR>(मा, मं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

licentiousness
LICENTIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) अनियन्त्रणा (?);<BR>(2) उद्दामता;<BR>(3) कामुकता (= lewdness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lichen
LICHEN: *लैक्षणः; शूकरी (a kind of moss).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lick
LICK: लेढि<BR>or<BR>लीढे, आ-, अव-, परि-, सं-, (लिह्, c.<BR>2.),<BR>fire l.s up Lankā:<BR>लङ्कां हुताशो लीढे, Vi.<BR>vi. 4.<BR>L. up:<BR>ग्रसते: v. To devour.<BR>L. the<BR>dust:<BR>भूमौ शेते (शी, c. 2.): v. To perish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lickerish
LICKERISH: v. Nice, dainty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

licking
LICKING (subs.):<BR>I लेहः, -नम्, etc.<BR>II Beating:<BR>ताडनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

licorice
LICORICE:<BR>(1) यष्टिमधु;<BR>(2) मधुयष्टिः, -का;<BR>(3)<BR>क्लीतकम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lictor
LICTOR:<BR>(1) दण्डधरः (?);<BR>(2) यष्टिधरः (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lid
LID:<BR>I Lit.: पिधानम्,<BR>II Eye-l.: q. v.:<BR>नेत्रच्छदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie
LIE (subs.):<BR>(1) अनृतम्;<BR>(2) असत्यम्;<BR>(3) अलीकम्;<BR>(4) वितथम्;<BR>(5) मिथ्योक्तिः;<BR>(6) मृषावादः; etc.:<BR>v. False.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie
LIE (v.):<BR>I To speak falsely: अनृतं वदति<BR>(वद्, c. 1.), etc.<BR>II To be prostrate, stret-<BR>-ched out: शेते (शी, c. 2 (with loc.), अधि-<BR>(with acc.),<BR>he must be lying in this tank:<BR>नूनं<BR> तेन सरसीमेनामधिशयितेन मवितव्यम्, Ve. vi.<BR>III<BR>To remain, rest: q. v.: आस्ते (आस्, c. 2.).<BR>IV To lodge: वसति (वस्, c. 1.).<BR>V To<BR>consist, be included: q. v.: अन्तर्भवति।<BR>VI<BR>To be situated: expr. with अवस्थितः (ता,<BR> तं): v. Situated.<BR>VII To be sustainable:<BR>perh. वर्तते (वृत्, c. 1.); gen. expr. with<BR>पश्यति (= to see). Ph.:<BR>“for that has ever lain<BR>at their hearts”:<BR>*तेषामेतद्धि सन्ततं मनसि स्थितम्;<BR>l. in the way:<BR>अन्तरायो मवति; l. hard upon:<BR>पीडयति (पीड्, c. 10).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie by
LIE BY:<BR>I To remain: तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.).<BR>II<BR>To rest: शेते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie down
LIE DOWN:<BR>(1) शेते (शी, c. 2 (often = sleep),<BR>leaving off desire for food, I lay d. on a lonely<BR>bed:<BR>दूरीकृताहारस्पृहो विविक्ते तल्पेऽशयिषि, D.;<BR>(2)<BR>संविशति (विश्, c. 2.),<BR>passed the night lying d.<BR>on a Kusha bed:<BR>संविष्टः कुशशयने निशां निनाय, R.;<BR>(3) निषीदति (सद्, c. 2.),<BR>lying d. on the bare<BR>ground:<BR>निषीदती स्थण्डिल एव केवले, Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie in
LIE IN: i. e. in child-bed: expr. with प्रसवावस्था।<BR>L. in wait:<BR>निभृतं तिष्ठति (स्था, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie on or upon
LIE ON or UPON: expr. with अधीनः (ना, नं):<BR>v. To depend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie over
LIE OVER: तिष्ठति (?) (used in Bengali).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie to
LIE TO: perh. रुद्धगति (mfn.): v. To check.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lie with
LIE WITH:<BR>I Lit. or sexually: शेते।<BR>II To<BR>belong to: expr. with अधीनः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lief
LIEF: कामम्, प्र-: v. Also willingly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liege
LIEGE: अधीनः (ना, नं): v. Dependant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lien
LIEN: *दाविः (after Bengali).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lier
LIER: expr. by verb.: v. To lie down, lie<BR>in wait.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lieu
LIEU: Ph.:<BR>in l. of:<BR>स्थाने or स्थले (with gen.).<BR>Ph.: read यावत् in l. of तावत् : यावदित्यत्र तावदिति<BR> पठ।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lieutenant
LIEUTENANT:<BR>I In the army: no equiv.:<BR>v. Captain.<BR>II In gen.: अनु- in comp.<BR>l.-<BR>governor:<BR>अनुशासकः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life
LIFE:<BR>I Of men or animals:<BR>(1) जीवनम् or<BR>जीवितम्,<BR>I did not quit l.:<BR>जीवितं नोत्सृष्टवती, K.;<BR>longing for my own death simply that he may be<BR>(recovered)<BR>to l.:<BR>तज्जीवितायै वात्ममरणाय स्पृहयन्ती,<BR>K.;<BR>(2) प्राणाः (m. pl.),<BR>takes one's l.:<BR>प्राणान्<BR> हरति, A r.; my l. is moving (i. e. I am dying):<BR>प्रचलन्ति हि मे प्राणाः, Vi.; I will give you my l.: [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">Page417</a>]<BR>प्राणान् ते दास्यामि, A. r.;<BR>(3) असवः, (m. pl.),<BR>why my l. did not go out at the time:<BR>असवो मे<BR> तत्क्षणे केन हेतुना नोद्गच्छन्ति स्म, K. II. Life-<BR>-time:<BR>(1) जीवनम्<BR>or<BR>जीवितम्,<BR>the l. of animals<BR>consists of four or five days:<BR>जीवितं जन्मवतां<BR> चतुःपञ्चान्यहानि, D.;<BR>throughout one's l.:<BR>यावज्जीवम्।<BR>H. s.;<BR>(2) आयुस् (n.),<BR>having long l.:<BR>दीर्घायुस्<BR>(mfn.), Sr.<BR>III Fig.:<BR>(1) जीवनम्<BR>or<BR>जीवितम्,<BR>you are (my)<BR>l.:<BR>त्वं जीवितम्, U. iii. 26.;<BR>(2) प्राणाः,<BR>D.<BR>IV. Conduct: q. v.: वृत्तम्<BR>or<BR>वृत्तिः।<BR>V.<BR>Vivacity, energy: q. v.: perh. प्राणाः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=416" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life
LIFE, BRING TO: जीवयति, उत्-, सं-, (c. of जीव्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life
LIFE, COME TO: उज्जीवति (जीव्, c. 1.),<BR>the living<BR>beings suddenly came to l.:<BR>उदजीवत् सहसैव<BR> जीवलोकः, Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life-blood
LIFE-BLOOD: fig.: perh प्राणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life-boat
LIFE-BOAT: *जीवनत्राणम्, जीवनरक्षा-नौः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life-guard
LIFE-GUARD: perh. जीवितरक्षाधिकृतः: v. Body-<BR>-guard.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life-insurance
LIFE-INSURANCE: v. Insurance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lifeless
LIFELESS:<BR>I Dead: q. v.: गतासु (mfn.);<BR>विगतजीवितः (ता, तं); and sim. comp.s.<BR>II<BR>Inanimate: q. v.: निर्जीवः (वा, वं).<BR>III<BR>Flat, dull: q. v.: निस्तेजस् (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

life-time
LIFE-TIME: जीवितकालः: v. Life (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lift
LIFT (subs.):<BR>(1) उत्तोलनम्;<BR>(2) उन्नमनम्;<BR>(3)<BR>उत्थापनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lift
LIFT (v. t.): उत्तोलयति (तुल्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>raise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ligament
LIGAMENT: बन्धः: v. Bandage, joint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ligature
LIGATURE: बन्धः: v. Bandage, band.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light
LIGHT (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) आलोकः, to give l.:<BR>आलोकं ददाति, Si. xx. 38.;<BR>(2) प्रकाशः,<BR>like l.<BR>and darkness:<BR>तमःप्रकाशवत्, S.; by the l. of plants:<BR>ओषधिप्रकाशेन, Ku. vi. 43.;<BR>(3) प्रभा (= shining<BR>l.),<BR>l. of the moon:<BR>इन्दुप्रभा Su.;<BR>(4) ज्योतिस्<BR>(n (= 3);<BR>(5) तेजस् (rare), Par.<BR>II<BR>That which gives 1.:<BR>(1) आलोकः,<BR>I noticed<BR>a l. in the street:<BR>राजवीथ्यामालोकमलक्षयम्, D. ii.;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रदीपः (gen. =lamp),<BR>l. of knowledge:<BR>ज्ञानप्रदीपः,<BR>D. III. A window: q. v.: आलोकमार्गः, R.<BR>vii. 6.<BR>VI Fig., publicity: q. v.: प्रकाशता,<BR>to get to l.:<BR>प्रकाशतां गच्छति, Mu. To see l. or<BR>come to l.:<BR>प्रकाशीभवति, Mu. To bring to l.:<BR>प्रकाशयति, (nomi.). V. In painting: प्रकाश-<BR>भागः (?).<BR>VI Illustration:<BR>to throw l.:<BR>विशदी-<BR>करोतिः v. To explain.<BR>VII Construction:<BR>according to one's l.:<BR>स्वव्याख्यानुसारेण। VIII. A<BR>noteworthy: तेजस् (n.) (?). Ph.:<BR>l. of coun-<BR>tenance i. e. favour:<BR>प्रसादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light
LIGHT (adj.):<BR>I Not heavy: लघु (f. ध्वी).<BR>II Of food: लघु (f. ध्वी), goat-flesh is l.:<BR>छागमांसं लघु, Bha.<BR>III Active, nimble: लघु<BR>(f. ध्वी),<BR>l.-handed:<BR>लघुहस्त (f. स्ता).<BR>IV<BR>Lightly armed: perh. लघु (f. ध्वी). V. Un-<BR>-settled, volatile: लघु (f. ध्वी), by l. conduct:<BR>लघुवृत्तितया, Ki. ii. 53.<BR>VI Gay: लघु (f. ध्वी),<BR>as with their l. appearance:<BR>दर्शनेन लघुना यथा तयोः,<BR>R. xi. 12.<BR>VII Of colours: लघु (f. ध्वी) (??).<BR>[पातला is used in vernacular].<BR>VIII Not<BR>dark: सालोकः (का, कं), etc.: v. Also moon<BR>-l. Ph.:<BR>make l. of:<BR>लघूकरोति, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light
LIGHT (v. t.):<BR>I To kindle:<BR>(1) दीपयति, सं-,<BR> प्र-, आ-, उत्-, (c. of दीप्),<BR>l. ed the fire:<BR>पावकं<BR> समदीपयत्। R.;<BR>I will l. the funeral pile:<BR>चिता-<BR>मादीपयामि, Ve. vi.;<BR>(2) ज्वलयति, प्र-, (c. of<BR>ज्वल्),<BR>l. the fire quick:<BR>अग्निं त्वरितं ज्वलय, M. n.<BR>II To furnish with l. s: सालोकं (कां) करोति।<BR>III To make l.:<BR>(1) दीपयति, etc.,<BR>l. ing the<BR>sky with its rays:<BR>दीपयन्नथ नमः किरणैघैः, Ki. ix.<BR>23.:<BR>(2) द्योतयति, प्र-, उत्-, वि-, (c. of द्युत्), Si.<BR>ii. 7.;<BR>(3) भासयति, उत्-, वि-, अव-, (c. of भास्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light upon
LIGHT UPON: पतति, नि-, (पत्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>alight.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighted
LIGHTED, BE:<BR>(1) दीप्यते, प्र-, सं- (दीप्, c. 4.),<BR>when the lights were being l.:<BR>प्रदीप्यमानेषु प्रदीपेषु,<BR>K.;<BR>(2) ज्वलति, प्र- (ज्वल्, c. 1 (= to burn),<BR>l. lamp:<BR>प्रज्वलितदीपिका, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighten
LIGHTEN (v. t.):<BR>I To illumine: v. To light<BR>(III). II. To make less heavy: लघयति<BR>(nomi.)<BR>or<BR>लघूकरोति,<BR>to l. a burden:<BR>धुरं लघयति,<BR>R. III. To alleviate, mitigate: लघयति, V.;<BR>लघूकरोति, Ve.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighten
LIGHTEN (v. i.):<BR>I To flash: द्योतते, वि- (द्युत्,<BR>c. 1.).<BR>II To clear: प्रसादं गच्छति (गम्, c.<BR>l.), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=417" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighter
LIGHTER: a boat: तरालुः (न्धुः) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighterman
LIGHTERMAN: नाविकः: v. Boatman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

light-fingered
LIGHT-FINGERED: लघुहस्त (f. स्ता) (?): v.<BR>Thievish.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighthearted
LIGHTHEARTED: प्रफुल्लचेतस् (mfn.) and sim.<BR>comp.s. N. B. लघुचित्त (f. त्ता), gen. means<BR>fickleminded.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lighthouse
LIGHTHOUSE: *आलोकशरणम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lightly
LIGHTLY:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) लघु, even rising l.:<BR>लघु लघूत्थितापि, Sa. iv.;<BR>(2) लाघवेन।<BR>II Cheer-<BR>-fully:<BR>(1) सोल्लासम्;<BR>(2) प्रफुल्लम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lightness
LIGHTNESS:<BR>(1) लधुता;<BR>(2) लघिमन् (m.),<BR>cause<BR>of the l. of women:<BR>योषितां लघिम्नः कारणम्:, K.:<BR>v. Levity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lightning
LIGHTNING (subs.):<BR>(1) विद्युत् (f.);<BR>(2) तडित्<BR>(f.);<BR>(3) सौदामिनी। Ph.: struck with l.:<BR>वज्राहतः (ता, तं): v. Thunder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lightning-conductor
LIGHTNING-CONDUCTOR: *तडित्प्रवाहकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lightsome
LIGHTSOME: प्रफुल्लः (ला, लं): v. Cheerful, gay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

like
LIKE (adj. or adv.):<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) सदृशः<BR>(शी, शं), it is l. (it)<BR>but not the same:<BR>सदृश<BR> एष न पुनः सः, Mr. ix.;<BR>(2) तुल्यः (ल्या, ल्यं)<BR>(= matching),<BR>you choose him l. you by birth,<BR>in beauty, in fresh age:<BR>कुलेन कान्त्या वयसा नवेन<BR> त्वमात्मनस्तुल्यममुं वृणीष्व, R. vi. 79.;<BR>(3) with इव<BR>in comparing,<BR>l. fortune:<BR>श्रीरिव, U.;<BR>(4) -वत्<BR>in comp. (adv.),<BR>l. water:<BR>जलवत्, J.;<BR>(5)<BR>occasionally by comp.,<BR>beautiful l. the<BR>moon:<BR>इन्दुसुन्दर (f. री), Mal. [In such cases,<BR>उपमः (मा, मं), -निभः (भा, भं), (rarely) -प्रतिमः<BR>(मा, मं), -प्रख्यः (ख्या, ख्यं) -प्रतीकाशः (शा, शं),<BR>etc. may be used in comp.]: v. Also equal,<BR>same.<BR>II Likely: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

like
LIKE, JUST: in adv. ial phrase: निर्विशेषेण in<BR>comp.,<BR>just l. a son:<BR>सुतनिर्विशेषेण; just l. day:<BR>दिवसनिर्विशेषेण, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

like
LIKE (v.):<BR>(1) expr. with: रोचते (रुच्, c. 1.)<BR>(with dative of the person l.ing), I l. that:<BR>तन्मह्यं रोचते;<BR>(2) with प्रीतिः (= pleasure),<BR>she did not l. him:<BR>न स तस्याः प्रीतये बभूव: v.<BR>(Be) pleased, love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

like
LIKE, LIKING (subs.):<BR>(1) प्रीतिः, love or l.:<BR>प्रणयः प्रीतिर्वा, Mr.;<BR>(2) रुचिः, अभि-: v. Taste.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

likelihood
LIKELIHOOD: v. Probability.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

likely
LIKELY: expr. with प्रायेण: v. Probable, pro-<BR>-bably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

like-minded
LIKE-MINDED: एकमनस् (mfn.) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liken
LIKEN: उपमिमीते (मा, c. 3.): v. To compare.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

likeness
LIKENESS:<BR>I Resemblance: q. v.: सादृश्यम्,<BR>so close l.:<BR>ईदृशं सौसादृश्यम्, Na.<BR>II Image,<BR>portrait: q. v.: सादृश्यम्, sketching my l.:<BR>मत्सादृश्यं लिखन्ती, Me. ii. 24.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

likewise
LIKEWISE:<BR>(1) तथा: v. So;<BR>(2) अपि: v. Also.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lilac
LILAC: सुरभिकुसुमम्; पारसिकगुल्मभेदः; *लिलाकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liliputian
LILIPUTIAN: वामनः (नी, नं): v. Also petty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lily
LILY: नलिनी (the plant), नलिनम् (the flower):<BR>v. Lotus.<BR>L. of the valley:<BR>*कन्दरालः; सुरभि-<BR>कुसुममञ्जरीकः काण्डहीनो गुल्मभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limb
LIMB:<BR>I Of the body:<BR>(1) अङ्गम्, over every l.:<BR>सर्वाङ्गीणः (णा, णं), V.;<BR>(2) अवयवः,<BR>description<BR>of every l.:<BR>प्रत्यवयववर्णना, V. ii. II. Fig.:<BR>(1)<BR>अङ्गम्,<BR>l. s of the Vedas:<BR>वेदाङ्गानि, Mah.;<BR>(2)<BR>अवयवः, while any l. of the Nanda family is alive:<BR>कस्मिंश्चिदपि जीवति नन्दान्वयावयवे, Mu.<BR>III Edge,<BR>border: q. v.: कोटिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limbed
LIMBED<BR>(1) अङ्गिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) सावयवः (वा, वं),<BR>etc.<BR>Slender-l.:<BR>कृशाङ्ग (f. ङ्गी);<BR>well-l.:<BR>शोभनाङ्ग<BR>(f. ङ्गी); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limber
LIMBER (adj.): कोमलः (ला, लं): v. Soft,<BR>pliant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limbo
LIMBO: निरयः: v. Hell, prison.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lime
LIME (subs.):<BR>I A tree: जम्बीरः।<BR>II Its. fruit:<BR>जम्बीरम्।<BR>III Bird l.: q. v.: क्षारकः (?), Mah.<BR>IV. Quick-l.: चूर्णम्,<BR>l. stone:<BR>चूर्णोपलः (?). चूर्ण-<BR>खण्डः (?): Ph.:<BR>l. -water:<BR>सुधा, l. -water-maker:<BR>सुधाकारः, Ram.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lime
LIME (v.): L. Lit.: क्षारकं सज्जयति (c. of सज्ज्)<BR>(?).<BR>II To ensnare: q. v.:<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lime-burner
LIME-BURNER: चूर्णकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lime-kiln
LIME-KILN: चूर्णापाकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limit
LIMIT (subs.):<BR>(1) अवधिः;<BR>(2) सीमा (boundary);<BR>(3) अन्तः (= end). To set l. s to: v. Limit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limit
LIMIT (v.):<BR>I To set l. to.: सीमां निर्घारयति<BR>(धृ, c. 10.).<BR>II To confine, restrain: q. v.:<BR>नियच्छति, सं-, (यम्, c. 1.).<BR>III To define,<BR>determine: निरूपयति (रूप्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=418" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limitation
LIMITATION: v. To limit.<BR>L. Act:<BR>*कालस्थापक-<BR>विधिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limited
LIMITED (adj.): perh. निबद्ध (f. द्धा): v.<BR>Narrow, small. Ph.:<BR>l. monarchy:<BR>*संयतराज्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limitedly
LIMITEDLY: निबद्धम् (??); परिमितम् (= modera-<BR>-tely).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limitless
LIMITLESS: निरवधि (mfn.): v. Boundless,<BR>infinite.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limn
LIMN (v.): आ-लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.): v. To<BR>paint, represent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limner
LIMNER: चित्रकरः: v. Painter.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limp
LIMP (v.):<BR>(1) खञ्जति (खञ्ज्, c. 1.):<BR>(2) खोडति<BR>or<BR>खुण्डते (खोड्<BR>or<BR>खुण्ड्, c. 1.);<BR>(3) (व)लङ्गति<BR>(वङ्ग्<BR>or<BR>लङ्ग्, c. 1.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limp
LIMP, LIMPING (subs.): expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limp
LIMP, LIMPING (adj.):<BR>(1) खोड (f. डा);<BR>(2)<BR>खञ्ज (f. ञ्जा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limpid
LIMPID: स्वच्छ (f. च्छा): v. Clear, transparent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limpidness
LIMPIDNESS, LIMPIDITY: स्वच्छता: v. Clearness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

limy
LIMY:<BR>I Covered with bird-lime: क्षाराक्त<BR>(f. क्ता) (?): v. Viscous.<BR>II Containing<BR>lime: चूर्णगर्भ (f. र्भा) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linch-pin
LINCH-PIN:<BR>(1) अक्षाग्रकीलः;<BR>(2) (आ) अणिः;<BR>(3)<BR>उद्रथः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lincture
LINCTURE, LINCTUS:<BR>(1) अवलेहः;<BR>(2) लेह्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linden
LINDEN: वृक्षविशेषः; *तिलिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

line
LINE (subs.):<BR>I As of the body: रेखा,<BR>straight<BR>l.:<BR>सरला रेखा;<BR>curve l.:<BR>कुटिला रेखा, K. d.;<BR>of<BR>the l. s drawn on a l. from a point without it:<BR>एकचिह्नादन्यरेखोपरि कृतासु रेखासु, K. d. II. A<BR>cord: सूत्रम्,<BR>fishing l.:<BR>वडिशसूत्रम्; measuring l.:<BR>मानसूत्रम्; hauling l. (for boats): गुणः।<BR>III Lint<BR>or flax: q. v.<BR>IV A row as in a book: पंक्तिः।<BR>v. =words,<BR>to draw a l. or few l. s:<BR>पञ्चषाण्य-<BR>क्षराणि<BR>or<BR>कतिपयवर्णान् लिखति।<BR>VI Military:<BR>drawing up in l. s:<BR>दण्डव्यूहः;<BR>he is not in the<BR>l. s:<BR>नासौ सेनानिवेशे।<BR>VII Course of conduct,<BR>etc.: मार्गः: v. Way.<BR>VIII As of steamers:<BR>expr. with परम्परा।<BR>IX Genealogical: q. v.:<BR>क्रमः (= order), gen. expr. by pl. X. Direc-<BR>-tion: q. v.: दिश् (f.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

line
LINE (v.):<BR>I To cover the inside of: अन्तर<BR> छादयति (छद्, c. 10.) (?).<BR>II To place along<BR>the side of: the streets were l. d with troops:<BR>बलैरधिष्ठिता रथ्या दण्डाभ्याम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lineage
LINEAGE:<BR>(1) अन्वयः;<BR>(2) कुलम्: v. Family,<BR>noble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lineal
LINEAL: expr. with पुत्रपौत्रादिक्रमेण (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lineament
LINEAMENT: आकारः: v. Feature, form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linear
LINEAR:<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) रेखामयः (यी, यं)<BR>(= consisting of lines).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linen
LINEN: क्षौमः (मा, मं),<BR>l. cloth:<BR>क्षौमं वस्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linendraper
LINENDRAPER:<BR>(1) क्षौमविक्रेतृ (f. त्री) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>क्षौमपटविक्रयिन् (f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linendrapery
LINENDRAPERY: क्षौमाणि (n. pl (?); क्षौमवस्त्राणि<BR>(?); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linger
LINGER: चिरायते। (nomi.): v. To delay, slow.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lingerer
LINGERER: चिरक्रियः (या, यं): v. Also to delay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lingering
LINGERING (adj.): As of diseases: दीर्घ (f. र्घा)<BR>(= long); चिर- in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lingering
LINGERING (subs.):<BR>(1) विलम्बः (= delay);<BR>(2)<BR>कालक्षेपः (= throwing away time)<BR>(3) विचिकित्सा<BR>(= hesitation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lingeringly
LINGERINGLY:<BR>(1) विलम्बेन (= with delay);<BR>(2) मन्दं मन्दम् (= slowly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linguist
LINGUIST:<BR>(1) भाषाविद् (mfn.);<BR>(2) भाषाप्रवीण<BR>(f. णा);<BR>(3) भाषापण्डितः (ता, तं); etc.: v.<BR>Proficient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linguistic
LINGUISTIC: Ph.:<BR>l. science, l. s:<BR>*भाषातत्त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liniment
LINIMENT: आलेपः<BR>or<BR>प्रलेपः: v. Ointment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lining
LINING (subs.): *अन्तश्छदः: v. To line.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

link
LINK (subs.):<BR>I As of a chain: सन्धिः (??).<BR>II A chain: q. v.: शृङ्खलम्। III. A torch:<BR>q. v.: उल्का।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

link
LINK (v.): संयोजयति (युज्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>connect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linnet
LINNET: पक्षिविशेषः; *अतसीभुज् (m.); लीनातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

linseed
LINSEED: अतसी, -बीजम्,<BR>l. oil:<BR>अतसीतैलम्, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lint
LINT: क्षौमबन्धः (?: comp. पटबन्धः, Sr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lintel
LINTEL: द्वारोर्द्धकाष्ठम्<BR>or<BR>दारु (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lion
LION:<BR>(1) सिंहः;<BR>(2) केश (स) रिन् (m.);<BR>(3)<BR>मृगराजः (poet). Ph.:<BR>l's share:<BR>प्रधानभागः;<BR>l.<BR>of the day:<BR>तत्कालसिंहः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lioness
LIONESS:<BR>(1) सिंही;<BR>(2) मृगराजवधूः, etc. (poet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lion-mettled
LION-METTLED: सिंहसत्त्व (f. त्त्वा) (??) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=419" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lip
LIP (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) ओष्ठः (gen. = upper<BR>l. as distinguished from अधरः = lower 1.);<BR>(2) दशनच्छदः; दशनवासस्, etc. (poet).<BR>II<BR>Fig. =mouth: q. v.: मुखम्: v. Also tongue.<BR>III Edge, as of a vessel.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lip
LIP (v.): अधरं पिबति (पा, c. 1.) (with gen.):<BR>v. To kiss.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lip
LIP (adj.):<BR>l.-salve:<BR>ओष्ठाञ्जनम्; l.-loyalty:<BR>मौखिकमक्तिः;<BR>l.-honeyed:<BR>मुखमधु (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lipped
LIPPED: expr. by comp.,<BR>Bimba-l.:<BR>बिम्बोष्ठ<BR>(f. ष्ठा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquify
LIQUIFY: द्रावयति (c. of द्रु): v. To melt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquid
LIQUID (adj.):<BR>I Lit.: द्रवः (वा, वं).<BR>II<BR>Clear, transparent: q. v.: स्वच्छ (f. च्छा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquid
LIQUID (subs.):<BR>(1) द्रवः;<BR>(2) द्रवपदार्थः; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquidate
LIQUIDATE: शोधयति (c. of शुध्): v. To clear,<BR>pay.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquidity
LIQUIDITY द्रवता, -त्वम्, Par.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquor
LIQUOR:<BR>I A liquid: q. v.<BR>II An intoxi-<BR>-cating drink:<BR>(1) आसवः: v. Wine;<BR>(2)<BR>पेयम् (= drink), Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liquorice
LIQUORICE: यष्टिमधु (n.): v. Licorice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lisp
LISP, LISPING: v. Stammer, stammering.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

list
LIST (subs.):<BR>I Border: q. v.: प्रान्तः।<BR>II<BR>An enclosed field: वीथिः, Si. Ph.:<BR>to enter<BR>the l. s:<BR>रणं गच्छति, V. p.<BR>III A catalogue:<BR>नामावलिः। Ph.: civil l.: (a)<BR>of officers:<BR>राजकर्म-<BR>कराणां नामावलिः (?); (b)<BR>of expenses:<BR>*राजव्यय-<BR>पत्रिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

list
LIST (v.):<BR>I To please: q. v.:<BR>II To en-<BR>-list: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

list
LIST, LISTEN:<BR>(1) शृणोति (श्रु, c. 5 (both of<BR>hearing and of attending);<BR>(2) कर्णं ददाति<BR>(दा, c. 3 (= to lend ear);<BR>(3) कर्णे करोति<BR>(to yield), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

listener
LISTENER: श्रोतृ (f. त्री): v. Hearer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

listless
LISTLESS:<BR>(1) अनवहितः (ता, तं) (= careless);<BR>(2) निरीहः (हा, हं) (= indolent, indifferent).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

listlessly
LISTLESSLY:<BR>(1) निरुत्साहेन (= without zeal);<BR>(2) जाड्येन: v. Indolently.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

listlessness
LISTLESSNESS:<BR>(1) निरीहता: v. Indifference;<BR>(2) जाड्यम्: v. Inactivity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litany
LITANY: (?) सूक्तम्: v. Prayer, hymn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

literal
LITERAL: v. L. ly.<BR>L. -sense:<BR>प्रकृतार्थः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

literally
LITERALLY:<BR>I Not figuratively: परमार्थतः,<BR> यथार्थतः<BR>or<BR>अन्वर्थतः, you are l. a Rākṣasa:<BR>अन्वर्थतो राक्षसोऽसि, Mu. v.<BR>II Not liberally:<BR>perh. यथार्थतः, etc.; with यथा, तथा,<BR>translate l.<BR>into Sanskrit:<BR>*यथेंरेजीभाषायां संस्कृतेन तथा कुरु।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

literary
LITERARY:<BR>L. conversation:<BR>शास्त्रालापः;<BR>l. his-<BR>tory:<BR>*शास्त्राणामितिहासः;<BR>l. man:<BR>पण्डितः;<BR>l.<BR>fame:<BR>पाण्डित्ययशस्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

literate
LITERATE: पण्डितः: v. Learned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

literature
LITERATURE:<BR>(1) शास्त्रम्;<BR>(2) साहित्यम् (used in<BR>Bengali).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lithe
LITHE, LITHESOME: v. Flexible, soft.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lithographer
LITHOGRAPHER: *प्रस्तरलेखकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lithography
LITHOGRAPHY: *प्रस्तरलेखकला or -विद्या।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lithotomy
LITHOTOMY: अश्मरीच्छेदः and sim. comp.s<BR>(comp. Sr.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litigant
LITIGANT: विवदमानः (ना, नं), D. viii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litigate
LITIGATE: expr. with व्यवहारः, Mit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litigation
LITIGATION:<BR>(1) व्यवहारः;<BR>(2) विवादः (= dis-<BR>-pute).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litigious
LITIGIOUS:<BR>(1) व्यवहारप्रियः (या, यं) (?);<BR>(2)<BR>विवादशीलः (ला, लं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litigiousness
LITIGIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) व्यवहारप्रियता (?);<BR>(2) विवाद-<BR>शीलता (?), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litter
LITTER (subs.):<BR>I The vehicle:<BR>(1) शिविका;<BR>(2) शिरस्का (rare).<BR>II Of straw: तृणसंस्तरः।<BR>III Of young: सहजातः शावकगणः।<BR>IV Dis-<BR>-order: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

litter
LITTER (v.):<BR>I To bring forth: q. v.: सूते<BR>(सू, c. 2.).<BR>II With straw: तृणैः संस्तृणाति,<BR> आ-, (स्तॄ, c. 9.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

little
LITTLE (adj.):<BR>(1) अल्पः<BR>or<BR>स्वल्पः (ल्पा, ल्पं),<BR>giving l. milk:<BR>अल्पक्षीरः (रा, रं), Mah.;<BR>going a l. distance:<BR>स्वल्पमन्तरं गत्वा, L.;<BR>I do<BR>not see the least reason to call it false:<BR>नाल्पमपि<BR> कारणमस्य मिथ्याभिधाने पश्यामि, K.; a l. (man):<BR>अल्पकः, Si. xvi. 28.;<BR>l. fishes:<BR>अल्पका मत्स्याः,<BR>Ram. ii. 69. 28.;<BR>(2) क्षुद्रः (द्रा, द्रं) (= small),<BR>a l. fish:<BR>क्षुद्रमत्स्यः, Mah.;<BR>(3) स्तोकः (का,<BR> कं) (rare),<BR>a l. way:<BR>स्तोकं मार्गम्, P. Ph.:<BR>a l. man:<BR>माणवकः;<BR>a l. horse:<BR>अश्वकः; a l.<BR>while: v. While.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=420" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

little
LITTLE, A LITTLE (adv.):<BR>(1) ईषत्,<BR>smiling a<BR>l.:<BR>ईषद्विहस्य, K.;<BR>(2) किञ्चित्,<BR>l. less than ten<BR>thousand winters:<BR>किञ्चिदूनं शरदामयुतम्, R.;<BR>a l.<BR>ashamed:<BR>किञ्चिदुपजातलज्जः, K.;<BR>(3) अल्प- in<BR>comp.,<BR>l. heard of:<BR>अल्पश्रुतः (ता, तं), Kar.;<BR>a l. remaining:<BR>अल्पावशिष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं), Vi.;<BR>(4)<BR>मनाक्,<BR>going up a l.:<BR>मनागिवोपसृत्य, D.;<BR>(5)<BR>स्तोकम्,<BR>l. by l.:<BR>स्तोकं स्तोकम्, Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

little
LITTLE (subs.):<BR>(1) किञ्चित्,<BR>if (he) would delay<BR>a l.:<BR>यदि किञ्चिद्विलम्बेत, R.;<BR>(2) अल्पम्,<BR>wish-<BR>ing to lose much for a l.:<BR>अल्पस्य हेतोर्बहु हातुमि-<BR>च्छन्, R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

little-minded
LITTLE-MINDED: अल्पचेतस् (mfn.), Ram. vi.<BR>100. 6., and sim. comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

littleness
LITTLENESS: अल्पता (lit. and fig.), from our l.:<BR>निजयाल्पतया, Ki. vi. 37.;<BR>(2) क्षुद्रताः v.<BR>Smallness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liturgic
LITURGIC, -AL: expr. by comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liturgy
LITURGY: सूक्तसमष्टिः; स्तोत्रपद्धतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

live
LIVE (v.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) जीवति (जीव्, c. l.),<BR>I will not l. any more:<BR>अत ऊर्द्ध्वं न जीवामि, A. r.;<BR>why the sinner is allowed to l.:<BR>किंनिमित्तं<BR> पातकी जीव्यते, Mr.;<BR>(2) प्राणिति (अन्, c. 2.),<BR>so long as I am l. ing:<BR>यावत् प्राणिमि, K. II.<BR>To sustain life:<BR>(1) जीवति, उप-, आ-,<BR>l.ing on<BR>the produce of trees:<BR>वृक्षजीविकया जीवन्, B. p.:<BR>(2) वर्तयति (c. of वृत्), l. ing on wild fruits:<BR>वन्येन वर्तयन्, R. xii. 20. Ph.: l. ing on leaves:<BR>पर्णवृत्तिता, Ku.;<BR>l.ing by gambling:<BR>द्यूतोपजीविन्<BR>(f. नी), Mr. III. To dwell:<BR>(1) वसति,<BR> नि-, (वस्, c. 1.),<BR>were they known to be l. ing<BR>there:<BR>न खलु विदितास्ते तत्र निवसन्तः, Mu.;<BR>(2)<BR>l.ing together:<BR>सह जीवन्तः, Mit. To l. with:<BR>(1) सह वसति,<BR>will always l. with you:<BR>त्वया<BR> सार्धं सदा वत्स्यति, Mah. iii. 231. 6.;<BR>(2)<BR>संवसति, M. IV. To spend life: जीवनं नयति<BR>(नी, c. 1.)<BR>or<BR>गमयति (c. of गम्)<BR>or<BR>यापयति<BR>(c. of या)<BR>or<BR>अति-वाहयति (c. of वह्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

live
LIVE (adj.): जीवत् (f. न्ती): v. Alive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

livelihood
LIVELIHOOD:<BR>(1) जीविका, आ-, उप-, to get l.:<BR>जीविकां प्राप्नोति, S. k.; (it)<BR>has become my l.<BR>now:<BR>आजीविकेदानीं संवृत्ता, Mr.;<BR>(2) आजीवः,<BR> -नम्,<BR>pure l.:<BR>विशुद्ध आजीवः, Sa.;<BR>(3) वृत्तिः,<BR>(rarely वर्तनम्),<BR>for l.:<BR>वृत्त्यर्थम्, H.;<BR>(4) जीवनम्<BR>(rare),<BR>means of l.:<BR>जीवनोपायः, D.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liveliness
LIVELINESS:<BR>(1) उल्लासः;<BR>(2) प्रहर्षः (= joy);<BR>(3) प्रफुल्लता (= vivacity) (?);<BR>(4) स्फूर्तिः (= ani-<BR>-mation).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

livelong
LIVELONG:<BR>I Living long (rare); चिरजीविन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>II Long: दीर्घ (f. र्घा), ‘l. night’:<BR>दीर्घयामा त्रियामा, Me. ii. 47.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lively
LIVELY:<BR>I Living: q. v.<BR>II Merry, gay:<BR>(1) प्रफुल्ल (f. ल्ला);<BR>(2) उल्लसः (सा, सं);<BR>(3)<BR>हृष्ट (f. ष्टा) (= merry).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

liver
LIVER: यकृत्,<BR>l. disease:<BR>यकृद्रोगः, Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

livery
LIVERY:<BR>I Delivery, deliverance: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Dress: q. v.: वेषः। Ph.:<BR>l. -stable:<BR>*भाटकाश्व-<BR>शाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

livid
LIVID: श्यावः (वा, वं)<BR>or<BR>श्याववर्ण (f. र्णा) (?),<BR>D. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lividness
LIVIDNESS, LIVIDITY: श्यावता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

living
LIVING (adj.):<BR>I Having life: सजीवः (वा, वं).<BR>A l. being:<BR>जीवः;<BR>the land of the l.:<BR>जीवलोकः,<BR>H. II. Alive: जीवत् (f. न्ती).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

living
LIVING (subs.):<BR>I Livelihood: q. v.: जीविका।<BR>II Estate: q. v.: सम्पत्तिः। For other senses:<BR>v. To live.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lizard
LIZARD:<BR>(1) गृहगोधा;<BR>(2) ज्येष्ठी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lo
LO: पश्य<BR>or<BR>पश्य पश्य: v. To look.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

load
LOAD (subs.):<BR>I Burden: q. v.: भारः। II. A<BR>quantity carried at once: भारः,<BR>brought a l.<BR>of fuel:<BR>इध्मानां भारमाजह्रे, Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

load
LOAD (v. t.):<BR>I Lit.: expr. by subs.: v. To<BR>fill, put.<BR>II Fig., as to l. the stomach:<BR>पूरयति (पूर्, c. 10 (= to fill).<BR>III To adul-<BR>-terate: q. v.<BR>IV To charge: पूरयति (?).<BR>V. To heap: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loaded
LOADED:<BR>the boat is l. with iron:<BR>लौहभृता नौः (?);<BR>l. gun:<BR>पूरितं बन्दुकम्;<BR>heavily l.:<BR>भाराक्रान्त (f.<BR>न्ता) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

load-stone
LOAD-STONE:<BR>(1) अयस्कान्तः;<BR>(2) चुम्बकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loaf
LOAF: अपूपः (?), रोटिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loam
LOAM: कर्दमभूमिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loamy
LOAMY:<BR>l. soil:<BR>कर्दमभूमिः (?): v. Also clayey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loan
LOAN:<BR>(1) ऋणम्: v. Debt;<BR>(2) धारः: v. To<BR>owe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=421" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loath
LOATH (adj.): अनिच्छुकः (का, कं): v. Loth,<BR>unwilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loathe
LOATHE: घृणते (घृण्, c. l.): v. To hate, abhor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loathing
LOATHING (subs.): घृणाः v. Hatred, abhorrence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loathsome
LOATHSOME:<BR>(1) बीमत्सकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) अति-<BR>कुत्सितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loathsomeness
LOATHSOMENESS:<BR>(1) बीभत्सता;<BR>(2) कुत्सितता;<BR>(3) गर्हणीयता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lobby
LOBBY: प्राग्वंशः (?): *प्रवेशशाला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lobe
LOBE: पालिः (?),<BR>l. of the ear:<BR>कर्णपालिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lobster
LOBSTER: महाचिङ्गारिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

local
LOCAL: स्थानीयः (या, यं),<BR>l. paper:<BR>*स्थानीय-<BR>पत्रिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locality
LOCALITY:<BR>I Place: q. v.: स्थानम्।<BR>II Posi-<BR>-tion: संस्थानम्<BR>or<BR>संस्थितिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locally
LOCALLY: gen. expr. by तत्र (there)<BR>or<BR>यत्र<BR>(where).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locate
LOCATE: स्थापयति (c. of स्था): v. To place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loch
LOCH: सरस् (n.): v. Lake.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lock
LOCK (subs.):<BR>I For doors: ताल (mn.), -क<BR>(mn.). II. A fastening: बन्धः, -नम्। III. A<BR>kind of wear: बन्धः (?).<BR>IV Of a gun:<BR>*तालम्, -कम्; अग्नियोजकम्। V. Of hair: पाशः:<BR>v. Hair. N. B. शिखण्डः, -कः and काकपक्षः are<BR>used of children's l.s. VI. A grapple:<BR>निष्पेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lock
LOCK (v.):<BR>I To fasten: q. v.: बध्नाति (बन्ध्,<BR>c. 9.).<BR>II To confine: q. v.: निरुणद्धि (रुध्,<BR>c. 7.).<BR>III To embrace tightly: निष्पिनष्टि<BR>(पिष्, c. 7.), Ki.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locked-jaw
LOCKED-JAW, LOCK-Jaw:<BR>(1) हनुस्तम्भः<BR>or<BR>हनुग्रहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locker
LOCKER: पेटिका (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locket
LOCKET: *सम्पुटकः (सम्पुट is like l.s though<BR>not worn).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locksmith
LOCKSMITH: तालकारः (?); तालककारः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locomotion
LOCOMOTION: सञ्चारः: v. Motion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locomotive
LOCOMOTIVE: सञ्चारिन् (f. णी): v. Moving.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locum-tenens
LOCUM-TENENS: कार्यकरः (?); पदस्थः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locus
LOCUS: In math.: *निधानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

locust
LOCUST: शलभः<BR>or<BR>शरमः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodge
LODGE (v. i.):<BR>(1) वसति, नि- (वस्, c. l.): v.<BR>To reside;<BR>(2) अवतिष्ठते (स्था, c. l.): v. To<BR>stay;<BR>(2) विश्राम्यति (श्रम्, c. 4 (= to rest),<BR>do me the favour of l. ing in my house to-night:<BR>मम गृहेऽद्य विश्रमितुमनुग्रहः क्रियताम्, D. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodge
LODGE (v. t.):<BR>I To place, put: q. v.: स्थाप-<BR>यति (c. of स्था).<BR>II To harbour: वासं<BR> ददाति; gen. expr. by intrans. Ph.:<BR>to l.<BR>information:<BR>आवेदनं करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodgement
LODGEMENT: वासः, नि-, Si. xii. 62.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodger
LODGER: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodging
LODGING (subs.):<BR>(1) वासः, नि-,: v. residence:<BR>(2) by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lodging-house
LODGING-HOUSE: No equiv.: *अवस्थानगृहम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loft
LOFT: of a house: अट्टः।<BR>Hay-l.:<BR>तृणकोष्ठः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loftily
LOFTILY: उन्नतम्, सम्-; उद्धतम् (= haughtily).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loftiness
LOFTINESS:<BR>I Lit.: उन्नतिः, सम्-,<BR>the l. of your<BR>mind is like the l. of your summits:<BR>मनसः शिखरा-<BR>णाञ्च सदृशी ते समुन्नतिः, Ku. vi. 66.<BR>II Fig.:<BR>(1) उन्नतिः, सम्-;<BR>(2) उन्नतत्वम्,<BR>the same natural<BR>l.:<BR>तदेव नैसर्गिकमुन्नतत्वम्, R. v. 37.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lofty
LOFTY:<BR>(1) उन्नतः (ता, तं), सम्;<BR>the l. assem-<BR>blage of kings:<BR>अवनीभृतां समुन्नतो गणः, Si. xv.<BR>21.;<BR>(2) तुङ्ग (f. ङ्गा): v. High.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

log
LOG: 1. Of wood: स्थूलकाष्ठम्, etc.: v. Wood.<BR>II In ships: *गतिमापः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logarithm
LOGARITHM: *संवर्गमानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

log-book
LOG-BOOK: गतिपत्रिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loggerhead
LOGGERHEAD: स्थूलबुद्धि (mfn.).<BR>To be at or fall<BR>or go to l.:<BR>कलिं गच्छति: v. Strife.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logic
LOGIC:<BR>(1) न्यायः,-शास्त्रम्;<BR>(2) तर्कविद्या।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logical
LOGICAL:<BR>(1) by comp.:<BR>(2) न्यायिन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) तार्किकः (की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logically
LOGICALLY:<BR>(1) न्यायानुसारेण;<BR>(2) न्यायेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logician
LOGICIAN:<BR>(1) नैयायिकः;<BR>(2) तर्कशास्त्रविशारदः<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

logomachy
LOGOMACHY: वितण्डा (?); शब्दविवादः (??), Wil-<BR>-liams.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loin
LOIN:<BR>(1) श्रोणिः;<BR>(2) कटिः।<BR>Its cavities:<BR>कुकुन्दरे<BR>(n. dual).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loiter
LOITER: कालं क्षिपति (क्षिप्, c. 6.): v. To<BR>delay, linger.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loiterer
LOITERER:<BR>(1) कालक्षेपकः;<BR>(2) अलसः (= idler).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lone
LONE, LONELY:<BR>I Solitary:<BR>(1) विविक्त (f.<BR>क्ता),<BR>l. place giving content to soul:<BR>चित्त-<BR>निर्वृतिविधायि विविक्तम्, Ki. ix. 71.;<BR>(2) निर्जनः (ना, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">Page423</a>]<BR>नं) (= without any man).<BR>II Alone:<BR>(1)<BR>expr. with एकाकिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) अनाथः (था,<BR> थं) (= helpless).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=422" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loneliness
LONELINESS:<BR>(1) विविक्तता (= solitude);<BR>(2)<BR>अनाथता (= helplessness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lonesome
LONESOME, LONESOMENESS: v. Lonely, lone-<BR>-liness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long
LONG (v.):<BR>(1) स्पृहयति (स्पृह्, c. l (with<BR>dat.), l. ing for my own death for his life:<BR>तज्जीवितायात्ममरणाय स्पृहयन्ती, K.;<BR>(2) गृध्यति<BR>(गृध्, c. 4 (rare),<BR>l.ing for the son:<BR>पुत्र-<BR>गृद्धिनी: V. p.: v. To desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long
LONG (adj.):<BR>(1) दीर्घः (र्घा, र्घं) (in all senses),<BR>l. -eared:<BR>दीर्घकर्ण (f. र्णा), H.; in l. journeys:<BR>दीर्घेऽध्वनि, Ka.;<BR>for a l. time:<BR>दीर्घकालम्, K.;<BR>l. sorrow:<BR>दीर्घशोकः, K.;<BR>l. sleep:<BR>दीर्घनिद्रा,<BR>R.;<BR>a vowel is short, long or protracted:<BR>अज्-<BR>भ्रस्वदीर्घप्लुतः, Pāṇini.;<BR>(2) आयतः (ता, तं) (lit.),<BR>how broad, how l.:<BR>किंविस्ताराः किमायताः, Mah.<BR>ii. 6. 16.;<BR>thrice l.:<BR>त्रिगुणमायतः (ता, तं),<BR>Mat.;<BR>(3) आयामवत् (f. ती) (= 2),<BR>l. black<BR>hair:<BR>आयामवान्नीलो मूर्धजकलापः, D. vi.;<BR>(4)<BR>विस्तीर्ण (f. र्णा) (in extent),<BR>news about Kusu-<BR>mapura is l.:<BR>विस्तीर्णः कुसुमपुरवृत्तान्तः, Mu. ii.;<BR>(5) चिरः (रा, रं) (of time only), l. standing:<BR>चिरस्थितिः, D. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long
LONG (adv.): I. In comp.: by adj.,<BR>l. -ex-<BR>tended:<BR>दीर्घविस्तारः (रा, रं).<BR>II Through,<BR>throughout: q. v.<BR>III Of time: दीर्घकालम्<BR>or often चिरम्,<BR>live l.:<BR>चिरं जीव, D. iii. Ph.:<BR>(a) how l. did you see (him): कियच्चिरं दृष्टस्त्वया,<BR>K.;<BR>how l. after:<BR>कियच्चिरेण, Sa.; (b) too l.:<BR>सुचिरम्, K.;<BR>not very l.:<BR>नातिचिरम्, K.; (c)<BR>ere l.:<BR>अचिरेण<BR>or<BR>अचिरात्, Vi.; (d) as l. as:<BR>यावत्;<BR>as l. as one lives:<BR>यावज्जीवेत्, D.s.;<BR>lived<BR>as l. as he wished:<BR>यावदिच्छमुषितम्, Mu. iii.;<BR>(e)<BR>so l.:<BR>तावत्, so l. his fame is constant:<BR>तावदस्य स्थिरं यशः, Ki. xi. 61.; (f) l. after:<BR>दीर्घकालानन्तरम्, बहोः कालात्, U.; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longevity
LONGEVITY:<BR>(1) दीर्घजीवनम्;<BR>(2) दीर्घायुस् (n.);<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longing
LONGING (subs.): स्पृहा,<BR>for what things the<BR>Princess of Magadha feels a l.:<BR>स्पृहावती वस्तुषु<BR>केषु मागधी, R. iii. 5.;<BR>(2) तृष्णा: v. Thirst.;<BR>(3) अभिलाषः: v. Desire;<BR>(4) दोहदम् (of a<BR>pregnant woman), M.n.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longingly
LONGINGLY: सस्पृहः (हा, हं): v. Also eagerly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longish
LONGISH: दीर्घदीर्घ (f. र्घा): v. Somewhat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longitude
LONGITUDE: I. Length: q. v.<BR>II In Ast.:<BR>रेखान्तरम्। Ph.: distance of the place (in. l.):<BR>देशान्तरम्, Su. i. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longitudinal
LONGITUDINAL: expr. by adv. or comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

longitudinally
LONGITUDINALLY: दैर्घ्येणः v. Length.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long-lived
LONG-LIVED:<BR>(1) आयुष्मत् (f. ती);<BR>(2) चिर-<BR>जीविन् (f. नी);<BR>(3) चिरञ्जीवः (वा, वं);<BR>(4)<BR>दीर्घजीविन् (f. नी);<BR>(5) दीर्घायुस् (mfn.);<BR>(6)<BR>जैवातृक (f. का) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long-sighted
LONG-SIGHTED:<BR>(1) दूरदृश् (mfn.),<BR>vultures are<BR>l.:<BR>दूरदृशो गृध्राः, Ana.;<BR>(2) दूरदृष्टि (mfn.), A. r.;<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long-sightedness
LONG-SIGHTEDNESS:<BR>(1) दूरद्दष्टिः;<BR>(2) दूरदर्शिता; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long sufferance
LONG SUFFERANCE, LONG-SUFFERING: चिरसहि-<BR>ष्णुता: v. Patience.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long-suffering
LONG-SUFFERING (adj.):<BR>(1) चिरसहिष्णु (mfn.);<BR>(2) बहुक्षमः (मा, मं): v. Patient.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

long-winded
LONG-WINDED: fig.: दीर्घसूत्र (f. त्रा): v.<BR>Tedious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

looby
LOOBY: स्थूलबुद्धि (mfn.): v. Blockhead.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look
LOOK (v.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) पश्यति (दृश्, c. l.)<BR>(with acc.) l.: पश्य, U. vi.;<BR>(2) आ-लोकयति,<BR> अव-, वि-, (लोक्, c. 10);<BR>(3) दृष्टिपातं करोति,<BR>R. viii. 18.; v. Also to see.<BR>II To face:<BR>q. v. III. To appear:<BR>(1) दृश्यते, अभि-, प्रति-,<BR>(pass. of दृश्), l.s as if floating (in the air):<BR>प्लवमानेव दृश्यते, Mah. ii. 10. 4.;<BR>(2) लक्ष्यते, सं-,<BR> -परि-, आ-, (pass. of लक्ष्), Sa. iii. 12.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look about
LOOK ABOUT: Lit. or fig.: परितो वीक्ष्यते (ईक्ष्,<BR>c. l.), etc., Ki. ii. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look after
LOOK AFTER:<BR>I To attend: q. v.:<BR>(1) पश्यति;<BR>(2) अवेक्षते।<BR>II To expect: q. v.: प्रेक्षते।<BR>III<BR>To search: q. v.:<BR>(1) पश्यति;<BR>(2) अवेक्षते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look at
LOOK AT: पश्यति, etc., does not l. at character:<BR>न शीलं पश्यति, K.: v. Look. (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look down
LOOK DOWN:<BR>I Lit.: v. Down, look.<BR>II<BR>To l. down on: अवमन्यते (मन्, c. 4.): v.<BR>To despise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=423" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look for
LOOK FOR: v. Look after, expect, search.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look in the face
LOOK IN THE FACE:<BR>(1) सम्मुखीभवति (with<BR>gen.);<BR>(2) अभिमुखयति (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look in
LOOK IN, INTO: (?) पश्यति,<BR>should himself l. into<BR>income and expenditure:<BR>पश्येदायव्ययौ स्वयम्, Y.;<BR>(2) अव-ईक्षते, वि-,<BR>or<BR>सम्-,<BR>should always l. into<BR>Śāstras:<BR>नित्यं शास्त्रावेक्षी स्यात्, V. s.;<BR>(3)<BR>अवलोकयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look on
LOOK ON:<BR>I Lit.: प्रेक्षते।<BR>II To consider,<BR>regard: q. v.: मन्यते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look out
LOOK OUT: अवेक्षते (lit. and fig.): v. Also<BR>to attend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look over
LOOK OVER: पश्यति (?);<BR>(2) अवेक्षते (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look through
LOOK THROUGH: Fig.: पर्यवेक्षते।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look to
LOOK TO:<BR>I To pay attention to: वि-ईक्षते,<BR> सम्-, for, the age of luminaries is not l. ed to:<BR>तेजसां हि न वयः समीक्ष्यते, R. II. To fix hopes<BR>on: प्रेक्षते, अभि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look up
LOOK UP:<BR>(1) उद्वीक्षते;<BR>(2) उत्पश्यति;<BR>(3) उदी-<BR>क्षते। These verbs take an acc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look up to
LOOK UP TO: प्रतीक्षते,<BR>to those who are l. ed up<BR>to:<BR>प्रतीक्ष्येषु, R. v. 14.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look
LOOK (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) विलोकनम्, अव-, even<BR>by (your)<BR>l.:<BR>विलोकनेनैव, Si.;<BR>(2) दृष्टिः<BR>or<BR>दर्शनम्,<BR>with a favourable and pleasant l.:<BR>दृष्ट्या प्रसादामलया,<BR>R. II. Expression of countenance, aspect:<BR>दर्शनम्,<BR>oh, how sweet is their l.:<BR>अहो मघुरमासां<BR> दर्शनम्, Sa. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

looker
LOOKER: दर्शकः।<BR>L. on:<BR>प्रेक्षकः: v. Spectator.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

looking
LOOKING (subs.):<BR>(1) दर्शनम्,<BR>l. round:<BR>परि-<BR>दर्शनम्;<BR>(2) प्रेक्षणम्;<BR>l. up:<BR>उद्वीक्षणम्, l. into:<BR>अवेक्षणम्;<BR>(3) विलोकनम्,<BR>l. into:<BR>अवलोकनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

looking glass
LOOKING GLASS:<BR>(1) आदर्शः;<BR>(2) दर्शनम् (rare):<BR>v. Mirror.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

look out
LOOK OUT:<BR>I Lit.: अवेक्षा, सम्-।<BR>II The<BR>place: अवेक्षास्थानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loom
LOOM (subs.):<BR>(1) तन्त्रम्;<BR>(2) तन्त्रवापः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loom
LOOM (v.):<BR>I Lit.: लक्ष्यते (pass. of लक्ष्):<BR>v. To appear, look.<BR>II Fig.: शोभते (शुभ्,<BR>c. l.): v. To shine.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loon
LOON: I. A rascal: धूर्तः। II. A bird: जाल-<BR>पादः पक्षिभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loop
LOOP (subs.):<BR>(1) पाशः (?);<BR>(2) छिद्रम् (= hole).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loop
LOOP (v.): बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9 (= to fasten:<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loop-hole
LOOP-HOLE: छिद्रम् (?); रन्ध्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loose
LOOSE (adj.):<BR>I Not tight:<BR>(1) शिथिलः (ला,<BR> लं),<BR>l. tie:<BR>शिथिलबन्धनम्, M. n.<BR>(2) श्लथः (था,<BR> थं), परि-, प्र-।<BR>II Free: q. v.: मुक्तः (क्ता, क्तं).<BR>III Unrestrained, dissolute: q. v.: उच्छृ-<BR>ङ्ह्वलः (ला, लं).<BR>IV Of bowels: शिथिलः (ला,<BR> लं).<BR>V Of soil: शिथिलः (ला, लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loose
LOOSE, LOOSEN (v.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) शिथिलीकरोति,<BR>etc.;<BR>(2) शिथिलयति (nomi.), l. ed bracelet:<BR>शिथिलितवलयः, Sa. iii. 10.<BR>II To free, untie:<BR>q. v.: मुञ्चति<BR>or<BR>मोचयति (मुच्, c. 6 and 10.),<BR>l. ed from all ties:<BR>निर्मुक्तसमस्तबन्धनः (ना, नं),<BR>A. r.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loosely
LOOSELY:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) शिथिलम्;<BR>(2) श्लथम्,<BR>l.<BR>hanging:<BR>श्लथलम्बिन् (f. नी), Ku. v. 47.<BR>II<BR>Dissolutely, unchastely, carelessly: q. v.:<BR>उच्छ्टङ्खलः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

looseness
LOOSENESS:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) शिथिलता;<BR>(2) श्लथता,<BR> प्र-, परि।<BR>II Of morals: उच्छ्टङ्खलता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loosening
LOOSENING, LOOSING:<BR>I Lit.: शिथिलीकरणम्।<BR>II<BR>Freeing: विमोचनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lop
LOP (v.): आ-छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.): v. To cut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lop-sided
LOP-SIDED: विषममरः (रा, रं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loquacious
LOQUACIOUS: वावदूकः (का, कं): v. Talkative,<BR>noisy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loquaciousness
LOQUACIOUSNESS, LOQUACITY:<BR>(1) वावदूकता;<BR>(2) वाचालता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lord
LORD (subs.):<BR>(1) ईशः,<BR>the L. of the past, the<BR>future, and the present:<BR>भूतभव्यभवदीशः, Ki.;<BR>(2)<BR>ईश्वरः,<BR>the l. of Kāmrupa:<BR>कामरूपेश्वरः, R.: v.<BR>Master. Ph.: ‘my l.’ (as a term of<BR>address) देवः<BR>or<BR>आर्यपुत्रः (by wives)<BR>or<BR>मर्तृ (m.)<BR>(by menial servants): v. Master.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lord
LORD (v.): प्रभुत्वं करोति (with gen.): v. To<BR>domineer, rule.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lords supper
LORD'S SUPPER: ईश्वरश्राद्धम्; कृष्टश्राद्धम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lordly
LORDLY: I. Noble, dignified: q. v.<BR>II<BR>Haughty, imperious: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lordship
LORDSHIP:<BR>I As title: देवः: v. (My) Lord.<BR>II Dominion, power: q. v.: प्रभुत्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lore
LORE: विद्या: v. Learning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=424" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lorn
LORN: अनाथः (था, थं): v. Forlorn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lose
LOSE: I. To cause to be taken: हारयति, अप-,<BR>(c. of हृ), I. lost ten sovereigns in gambling:<BR>दशसुवर्णं द्यूते हारितम्, Mr.;<BR>to l. wife:<BR>पत्नीं<BR> हारयति, Vi. v. 23.<BR>II To be deprived of:<BR>वियुज्यते (pass. of युज्): v. To deprive, de-<BR>-void of.<BR>III To fall from: q. v.: भ्रश्यति,<BR> -ते, परि-, प्र-, (भ्रंश्, c. 4.),<BR>l.s spirits:<BR>प्रभ्रश्यते<BR> तेजसः, Mr.<BR>IV Opposed to win: पराजयते<BR>(जि, c. l.) (rare),<BR>what you first lost:<BR>किन्नु पूर्वं<BR> पराजैषीः, Mah. ii. 67. 7.<BR>IV To miss.: expr.<BR>with नश्यति (नश्, c. 4.), प्र-,<BR>one who has lost<BR>his way:<BR>प्रनष्टवर्त्मन् (mfn.), K.;<BR>Vasantasenā<BR>is lost:<BR>नष्टा वसन्तसेना, Mr. i. V. To ruin,<BR>destroy: q. v.: नाशयति (c. of नश्).<BR>VI Of<BR>time: v. To spend, waste. Ph.:<BR>to l.<BR>oneself:<BR>बुद्ध्य परित्यज्यते, Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loser
LOSER: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loss
LOSS:<BR>I Waste:<BR>(1) हानिः, l. of capital:<BR>मूलहानिः, Vri.;<BR>(2) क्षतिः to make good a l.:<BR>क्षतिं पूरयति (?).<BR>II Destruction: नाशः,<BR>l.<BR>of wealth:<BR>अर्थनाशः।<BR>III Fall: भ्रंशः,<BR>l. of<BR>caste:<BR>जातिभ्रंशः।<BR>IV Deprivation: वियोगः,<BR>l. of life:<BR>प्राणवियोगः।<BR>V Defeat: q. v.:<BR>पराजयः। Ph.:<BR>l. of time:<BR>कालहरणम्, etc.;<BR>at a<BR>l. what to do:<BR>किंकर्तव्यतामूढः (ढा, ढं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lot
LOT:<BR>I Part, share: q. v.: भागः।<BR>II Fate,<BR>fortune: q. v.: भाग्यम्।<BR>III Chance, hazard:<BR>casting of l.s:<BR>गुटिकापातः, Da.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loth
LOTH: अनिच्छु (mfn.): v. Unwilling.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lotion
LOTION: धावनम् (?): v. Liniment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lottery
LOTTERY: गुटिकापातः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lotus
LOTUS:<BR>(1) पद्मम्;<BR>(2) कमलम्;<BR>(3) नलिनम्;<BR>(4)<BR>अरविन्दम्। Blue-l.:<BR>(1) उत्पलम्;<BR>(2) इन्दीवरम्।<BR>White-l.:<BR>पुण्डरीकम्।<BR>Red-l.:<BR>कोकनदम्। The<BR>plant:<BR>(1) नलिनी;<BR>(2) कमलिनी;<BR>(3) मृणालिनी;<BR>(4) पद्मिनी।<BR>Its stalk:<BR>नालः।<BR>Its root:<BR>शालूकम्।<BR>Its film:<BR>(1) मृणालम्;<BR>(2) विसम्। Its filament:<BR>किञ्जल्कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loud
LOUD:<BR>with a l. voice:<BR>उच्चैः,<BR>l. cry:<BR>महाशब्दः:<BR>v. Cry, noise, shout: v. Also noisily.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loud
LOUD, LOUDLY (adv.):<BR>(1) उच्चैः;<BR>(2) उच्चकैः;<BR>(3) प्रोच्चैः;<BR>(4) उच्चैः =स्वरेण;<BR>(5) महाशब्देन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loudness
LOUDNESS: v. Loud, clamour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lounge
LOUNGE (v.):<BR>(1) विश्राम्यति (= to rest);<BR>(2)<BR>कालं क्षिपति (= to spend time).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lounge
LOUNGE (subs.): शयनम् (= bed, couch).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lounger
LOUNGER: expr. by verb.: अलसः (सा, सं)<BR>(= idle).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

louse
LOUSE:<BR>(1) उत्कुणः;<BR>(2) यूकः;<BR>(3) केशकीटः।<BR>Its eggs:<BR>लिक्षा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lousewort
LOUSEWORT: वृक्षविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lousy
LOUSY:<BR>(1) उत्कुणिन् (f. नी) (?);<BR>(2) यूकोपद्रुतः<BR>(ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lout
LOUT (subs.): वृषलः (?): v. Clown.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loutish
LOUTISH: ग्राम्य (f. म्या) (?): v. Rude, awk-<BR>-ward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love
LOVE (subs.):<BR>I Affection: q. v.:<BR>(1) प्रेमन्<BR>(n.),<BR>man's l. for woman is inconstant:<BR>दयिता-<BR>स्वनवस्थितं नृणां॥ प्रेम, Ku. iv. 28.;<BR>(2)<BR>प्रणयः,<BR>are you attached to, or in l. or friendship<BR>with her daughter:<BR>अस्ति भवतोऽस्या दुहित्रा सह<BR> प्रसक्तिः प्रणयः प्रीतिर्वा, Mr. ix.;<BR>(3) अनुरागः<BR>(= fondness),<BR>mutual l. is the best thing in<BR>matches:<BR>इतरेतरानुरागो दारकर्मणि परार्द्धं मङ्गलम्,<BR>Ma. ii.;<BR>(4) कामः (= amorous l.),<BR>for he<BR>whom you look would fall in l. with you:<BR>यं हि<BR> त्वमभिवीक्षेथाः स कामवशगो भवेत्, Mah.; l.-sick:<BR>कामार्त (f. र्ता), Me.; कामातुरः (रा, रं), D.;<BR>Kalahansaka makes l. to Mandārikā:<BR>कलहंसको<BR> मन्दारिकां कामयते Ma. i.;<BR>l. is cross:<BR>कामो<BR> वामः, Mr.;<BR>l. -stricken:<BR>मदनपरवशः (शा, शं),<BR>मन्मथमथ्यमान (f. ना), etc.<BR>II = darling:<BR>प्रिय (f. या).<BR>III Kindness: दया,<BR>universal<BR>benevolence is l.:<BR>दया सर्वसुखैषित्वम्, Mah.<BR>IV<BR>God of love:<BR>(1) कामः;<BR>(2) मदनः;<BR>(3)<BR>मन्मथः;<BR>(4) कन्दर्पः;<BR>(5) अनङ्गः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love
LOVE (v.):<BR>I To have l. for:<BR>(1) expr. by<BR>subs.;<BR>(2) by प्रियः (या, यं) (= dear);<BR>(3)<BR>स्निह्यति (स्निह्, c. 4) (= to feel affection<BR>for): v. Also to like, (be) pleased.<BR>II To<BR>delight in: q. v.: मोदते (मुद्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-broker
LOVE-BROKER: घटकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-favour
LOVE-FAVOUR: प्रीतिदायः, Ram. and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-knot
LOVE-KNOT: प्रेमबन्धः (?) प्रेमग्रन्थिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=425" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

love-letter
LOVE-LETTER:<BR>(1) मदनलेखः, Sa.;<BR>(2) अनङ्ग-<BR>लेखः, Ku.;<BR>(3) पत्रिका (when the sense is<BR>clear), D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loveliness
LOVELINESS: कान्तिः: v. Beauty, delightful-<BR>-ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lovely
LOVELY:<BR>(1) कान्त (f. न्ता): v. Beautiful;<BR>(2) कमनीयः (या, यं): v. Charming, de-<BR>-lightful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lover
LOVER:<BR>I Lit.: अनुरागिन् (f. णी): v. Fond.<BR>II One who is in love with:<BR>(1) प्रणयिन्<BR>(f. नी) (?);<BR>(2) प्रियः (या, यं) (= dear).<BR>Ph.:<BR>‘love is blind and l.s cannot see’:<BR>न<BR> कामवृत्तिर्वचनीयमीक्षते, Ku.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loving
LOVING (adj.):<BR>I Dear: q. v.: प्रियः (या, यं).<BR>II Expressing love: by comp.: v.<BR>Love.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loving kindness
LOVING KINDNESS: स्नेहः: v. Kindness, favour.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lovingly
LOVINGLY:<BR>(1) सस्नेहम्;<BR>(2) सानुरागम्;<BR>(3)<BR>सप्रणयम्, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

low
LOW (adj.):<BR>I Of place:<BR>(1) नीचः (चा, चं),<BR>exceedingly l.:<BR>नितरां नीचः, Bham. i. 8.;<BR>where<BR>the water is l.:<BR>यत्र जलस्य नीचत्वम्, A.c.;<BR>(2) निम्न<BR>(f. म्ना),<BR>l. parts become high lands:<BR>निम्न-<BR>प्रदेशाः स्थलतामुपागमन्, Ku.;<BR>(3) नतः (ता, तं),<BR>l.<BR>and high grounds:<BR>नतोन्नतभूमिभागाः, Sa. II. Fig.,<BR>mean, base: q. v.: नीचः (चा, चं), l. caste:<BR>नीचजातिः, Ki. III. In stature: ह्नस्व (f. स्वा):<BR>v. Short.<BR>IV Of the tide: Ph.:<BR>at l.<BR>water:<BR>क्षीणायां वेलायाम्।<BR>V Of price: स्वल्पः<BR>(ल्पा, ल्पं).<BR>VI Not loud: नीचः (चा, चं) (?).<BR>Ph.:<BR>high and l. talks:<BR>उच्चनीचप्रलापान्, D.<BR>VII. Grave (of tones): मन्द्र (f. न्द्रा).<BR>VIII Depressed, sad: विषण्ण (f. ण्णा).<BR>IX<BR>Humble, reverent: q. v.<BR>X Moderate,<BR>reasonable: स्वल्प (f. ल्पा).<BR>XI Feeble,<BR>weak: q. v.: अवसन्न (f. न्ना).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

low
LOW (adv.):<BR>I Not aloft:<BR>(1) नीचः;<BR>(2)<BR>नीच- in comp.;<BR>(3) अधस् (= down).<BR>II<BR>Not loud: नीचैः (?); मृदु (= gently), Sa.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

low
LOW (v.): रेभते (रेभ्, c. l.): v. Noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowbell
LOWBELL (v.): भीषयते (c. of भी): v. To<BR>frighten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lower
LOWER (adj.):<BR>I In place: अधस् in comp.,<BR>l. world:<BR>अधोभुवनम्;<BR>l. garment:<BR>अधोंऽशुकम्।<BR>II Socially: नीचः (चा, चं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lower
LOWER (adv.): अधस्: v. Low, below.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lower
LOWER (v. t.):<BR>I To let down: नमयति (नम्,<BR>c. 10.): v. Also to descend.<BR>II To abase,<BR>humble: q. v.: नमयति।<BR>III To diminish:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lower
LOWER (v. i.):<BR>I To decrease: q. v. II. To<BR>be gloomy:<BR>let the clouds l.:<BR>उदयन्तु नाम<BR> मेघाः, Mr. iv.<BR>III Frown: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowery
LOWERY: v. Cloudy, gloomy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowing
LOWING (subs.): रेभितम्: v. Cry, noise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowland
LOWLAND: निम्नभूमिः: v. Also level.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowliness
LOWLINESS:<BR>I Humility: q. v.: नम्रता।<BR>II<BR>Meanness: q. v.: नीचता, -त्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowly
LOWLY (adj.):<BR>I Humble: q. v.: नम्र (f.<BR>म्रा). II. Mean: q. v.: नीचः (चा, चं). III.<BR>Low: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowly
LOWLY (adv.):<BR>I Humbly, meekly: q. v.:<BR>नम्रम्।<BR>II Meanly: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lowness
LOWNESS:<BR>I Of position:<BR>(1) नीचता;<BR>(2)<BR>निम्नता।<BR>II Of birth, etc.: v. Meanness.<BR>III Of stature: स्वल्पता।<BR>IV Of price:<BR>स्वल्पता। V. Of spirit: अवसादः: v. Dejec-<BR>-tion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

low-spirited
LOW-SPIRITED: विषण्ण (f. ण्णा): v. Dejected.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loyal
LOYAL:<BR>(1) राजभक्त (f. क्ता);<BR>(2) अनुरक्त (f.<BR>क्ता) (= attached).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loyally
LOYALLY:<BR>(1) भक्त्या (?):<BR>(2) सानुरागम् (?);<BR>(3) श्रद्धापूर्बकम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

loyalty
LOYALTY:<BR>(1) राजभक्तिः;<BR>(2) अनुरागः (= attach-<BR>-ment).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lozenge
LOZENGE: I. A rhombus: q. v. II. A cake:<BR>*लोजञ्जम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lubber
LUBBER: स्थूलबुद्धि (mfn.): v. Fool, block-<BR>-head.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lubberly
LUBBERLY:<BR>I Adj.: v. Stupid.<BR>II Adv.:<BR>स्थूलबुद्ध्या।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lubricate
LUBRICATE: अभ्यनक्ति (अञ्ज्, c. 7.): v. To<BR>anoint.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lubrication
LUBRICATION: अभ्यञ्जनम्: v. To anoint be-<BR>-smear.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucent
LUCENT: रोचिष्णु (mfn.): Lucid, bright.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=426" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucern
LUCERN: आखेटिककुक्कुरविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucid
LUCID:<BR>I Resplendent, bright: q. v.:<BR>उज्ज्वलः (ला, लं).<BR>II Transparent, clear:<BR>q. v.: स्वच्छ (f. च्छा).<BR>III Distinct, pers-<BR>-picuous: q. v.: विशदः (दा, दं). Ph.: l.<BR>(interval): प्रसन्नः (न्ना, न्नं) (comp. प्रसन्नकल्पः<BR> प्रकृतिस्थ एव जातः, D. ii.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucidly
LUCIDLY: विशदम्: v. Clearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucifer
LUCIFER:<BR>I The morning star: प्रभाततारा (?).<BR>II Satan: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luck
LUCK:<BR>I Chance, accident: q. v.: दैवम्।<BR>II Fortune: q. v.: दैवम्। Ph.:<BR>I wish your<BR>good l.:<BR>शुभमस्तु भवतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luckily
LUCKILY:<BR>(1) दिष्ट्या, Mah. s. i. 11.;<BR>(2)<BR>दैवयोगात् or -योगेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luckless
LUCKLESS: दैवोपहतः (ता, तं): v. Unfortu-<BR>-nate, unlucky.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucky
LUCKY:<BR>I Fortunate: q. v.: भाग्यवत् (f. ती).<BR>II Auspicious: q. v.: शुभः (भा, भं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucrative
LUCRATIVE:<BR>(1) लाभकरः (री, रं);<BR>(2) लाभजनकः<BR>(का, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucre
LUCRE: लाभः: v. Gain, profit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucubrate
LUCUBRATE: रात्र्यध्ययनं करोति, and sim.<BR>comp.s.: v. To study.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lucubration
LUCUBRATION:<BR>I Nocturnal study: q. v.:<BR>रात्र्यध्ययनम् and sim. comp.s.<BR>II What is<BR>composed by night: (?) रात्रिविरचितः (ता,<BR> तं) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luculent
LUCULENT: विशदः (दा, दं): v. Clear, trans-<BR>-parent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ludicrous
LUDICROUS: हास्यकरः (री, रं): v. Ridiculous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ludicrously
LUDICROUSLY: expr. by adj.: v. Also ridi-<BR>-culously.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luff
LUFF: (v.): वाताभिमुखं करोति (?): v. To turn.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lug
LUG: कर्षति (कृष्, c. l.): v. To drag, pull.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luggage
LUGGAGE: साधनम् (?), K.; सामग्यः (pl. = things).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lugger
LUGGER: नौकाविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lugubrious
LUGUBRIOUS: शोकसूचक (f. चिका): v. Mournful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lukewarm
LUKEWARM:<BR>I Tepid: q. v.: कोष्ण (f. ष्णा).<BR>II Not zealous: मन्दोत्साहः (हा, हं): v.<BR>Zealous, indifferent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lukewarmly
LUKEWARMLY:<BR>I Lit.: कोष्णम्<BR>or<BR>कवोष्णम्।<BR>II<BR>Indifferently:<BR>(1) मन्दोत्साहेन;<BR>(2) औदासीन्येन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lukewarmness
LUKEWARMNESS:<BR>I Lit.: कोष्णता<BR>or<BR>कवोष्णता।<BR>II Indifference: मन्दोत्साहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lull
LULL (v. i.): शाम्यति (शम्, c. 4.): v. To<BR>subside, cease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lull
LULL (v. t.): शमयति (c. of शम्): v. To quiet,<BR>soothe. Ph.:<BR>l. to sleep:<BR>निद्रां नयति (नी,<BR>c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lull
LULL (subs.): उपशमः: v. Quiet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lullaby
LULLABY: निद्राप्रदं गीतम् (??) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lumbago
LUMBAGO: गृध्रसी (ग्रध्रसी); कटिवातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lumbar
LUMBAR: expr. by comp.: v. Loin.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lumber
LUMBER (subs.): निरर्थकद्रव्यम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luminary
LUMINARY:<BR>(1) ज्योतिस् (n.)., the lord of the<BR>l. ies (the moon): ज्योतिषां पतिः;<BR>(2) तेजस् (rare),<BR>all l. ies like the sun:<BR>सूर्यादीनि सर्वाणि तेजांसि,<BR>S.p.b. Fig.: रत्नम् (= gem.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luminous
LUMINOUS: उज्ज्वलः (ला, लं): v. Bright, lucid.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luminously
LUMINOUSLY: उज्ज्वलम्: v. Brightly, lucidly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lump
LUMP (subs.):<BR>I A heap: पिण्ड (mfn.).<BR>II<BR>A collection: q. v.: समाहारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lump
LUMP (v.):<BR>I Lit.: पिण्डीकरोति।<BR>II To<BR>collect: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lumpish
LUMPISH:<BR>I Lit.: पिण्डाकारः (रा, रं).<BR>II<BR>Dull, stupid: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lumpy
LUMPY<BR>(1) पिण्डमयः (यी, यं);<BR>(2) पिण्डितः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunacy
LUNACY: उन्मादः: v. Madness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunar
LUNAR:<BR>(1) by comp.,<BR>l. eclipse:<BR>चन्द्रग्रहणम्;<BR>the l. dynasty:<BR>चन्द्रवंशः;<BR>(2) चान्द्रः (न्द्री, न्द्रं);<BR>(3) चान्द्रमसः (सी, सं);<BR>(4) ऐन्दवः (वी, वं),<BR>l. month:<BR>ऐन्दवो मासः, Go.<BR>A l. day:<BR>तिथिः;<BR>the<BR>2nd. 3rd. 11th. l. day:<BR>द्वितीया, तृतीया, एकादशी,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunated
LUNATED: अर्धचन्द्राकारः (रा, रं) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunatic
LUNATIC: उन्मत्तः (त्ता, त्तं),<BR>released a l.:<BR>उन्मत्तं<BR> मुक्तवती, D. ii. v. Mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunch
LUNCH, LUNCHEON (subs.): जलपानम् (in some<BR>of the dialects).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunch
LUNCH (v.): जलपानं करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lung
LUNG: फु(पु)स्फु(प्फु)सः।<BR>Pain in the l. s:<BR>हृत्पीडा,<BR>Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunge
LUNGE: आघातः: v. Stroke, thrust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lungwort
LUNGWORT: गुल्मविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=427" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lunt
LUNT: *अग्निरज्जुः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lupine
LUPINE:<BR>I Subs: त्रिपुटः (?).<BR>II Adj.: expr.<BR>with वृकवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurch
LURCH (subs.):<BR>I Of a ship: पार्श्वावनतिः (?).<BR>II Ph.:<BR>to leave in the l.:<BR>कृच्छ्रे<BR>or<BR>सङ्कटे<BR> परित्यजति, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurch
LURCH (v.):<BR>I To steal: q. v.: मुष्णाति (मुष्,<BR>c. 9.).<BR>II To defeat: q. v.: हन्ति (हन्, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurcher
LURCHER:<BR>I A poacher: q. v.<BR>II A dog:<BR>कौटिककुक्कुरः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lure
LURE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: v. Decay.<BR>II Fig.:<BR>प्रलोमनम्: v. Enticement, allurement.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lure
LURE (v.):<BR>I To allure: q. v.: आकर्षति (कृष्,<BR>c. l.).<BR>II To call: q. v. आह्वयति (ह्वे,<BR>c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurid
LURID: विपाण्डु (mfn.): v. Pale, gloomy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurk
LURK: लीयते (ली, c. 4.): v. To hide.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurker
LURKER: expr. by circumlo: निभृतनिलीनः (ना,<BR> नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lurking-place
LURKING-PLACE: निभृतनिलयः (?): v. Hiding-<BR>-place.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luscious
LUSCIOUS: ललितः (ता, तं): v. Also sweet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lusciousness
LUSCIOUSNESS: लालित्यम्: v. Also sweetness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lust
LUST (subs.): कामः,<BR>possessed of l.:<BR>कामपरीतात्मन्<BR>(mfn.), Mah.; and (their)<BR>l. is said to be eight-<BR>fold:<BR>कामश्चाष्टगुणः स्मृतः, H. ;<BR>l. s. are surely<BR>troublesome enemies:<BR>कामाः कष्टा हि शत्रवः, Ki. xi.<BR>35.: v. Desire, love (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lust
LUST (v.): कामयते (nomi.) (with acc.): v. To<BR>desire.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustful
LUSTFUL:<BR>I Having lust:<BR>(1) कामुकः (की,<BR> कं);<BR>(2) कामवृत्ति (mfn.);<BR>(3) कामार्त (f. र्ता),<BR>कामान्ध (f. न्धा), etc. (= inflamed with l.);<BR>(4) कामात्मन् (mfn.), Mah.<BR>II Inciting l.:<BR>(1) कामवर्धन (f. नी);<BR>(2) कामोत्तेजक (f. जिका);<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustfully
LUSTFULLY: expr. by adj.: कामार्त (f. र्ता),<BR>मदनपरवशः (शा, शं), स्मरातुरः (रा, रं), मन्मथा-<BR>विद्धचेतस् (mfn.), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustfulness
LUSTFULNESS:<BR>(1) कामुकता;<BR>(2) कामवृत्तिः;<BR>(3) कामासक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustily
LUSTILY: ससत्त्वम्: v. Vigorously, forcibly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustiness
LUSTINESS: वीर्यम्: v. Vigour, strength.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustral
LUSTRAL:<BR>(1) विशोधक (f. धिका);<BR>(2) पावकः<BR>(की, कं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustration
LUSTRATION: शुद्धिः: v. Purification. L. of<BR>arms (Wilson): नीराजनम्, ना (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustre
LUSTRE:<BR>I Brightness, splendour: q. v.:<BR>औज्ज्वल्यम्।<BR>II Renown, distinction: q. v.:<BR>(1) प्रभा;<BR>(2) द्युतिः।<BR>III A chandelier:<BR>*प्रद्योतकः।<BR>IV A space of five years: पञ्चवर्षम्<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustrous
LUSTROUS: उज्ज्वलः (ला, लं): v. Bright, splen-<BR>-did.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lustrum
LUSTRUM:<BR>(1) पञ्चवर्षम्; etc.<BR>(2) वर्षपञ्चकम्;<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lusty
LUSTY: वीर्यवत् (f. ती): v. Vigorous, robust.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lute
LUTE:<BR>(1) वीणा;<BR>(2) वल्लकी;<BR>(3) विपञ्ची;<BR>(4)<BR>परिवादिनी। Its neck:<BR>(1) वीणादण्डः;<BR>(2) प्रवालः।<BR>Its belly:<BR>(1) ककुमः;<BR>(2) प्रसेवकः। Its bow:<BR>कोणः।<BR>To play on the l:<BR>वीणां वादयति, H.<BR>To<BR>play near God:<BR>ईश्वरमुपवीणयितुम्,: R. viii. 33.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lutheran
LUTHERAN: *लुथारीयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxate
LUXATE: विसन्धीकरोति: v. To dislocate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxation
LUXATION: विसन्धीकरणम्: v. Dislocation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxuriance
LUXURIANCE: विवृद्धिः: v. Exuberance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxuriant
LUXURIANT:<BR>I Abundant, exuberant: प्रचुरः<BR>(रा, रं).<BR>II More than necessary: उद्रिक्त<BR>or<BR>अतिरिक्त (f. क्ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxuriantly
LUXURIANTLY: प्राचुर्येणः v. Abundantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxuriate
LUXURIATE: विवर्धते (वृध्, c. l.): v. To grow,<BR>indulge.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxurious
LUXURIOUS:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) विलासप्रियः (या,<BR> यं);<BR>(2) भोगासक्त (f. क्ता);<BR>(3) विषयसुखनिरतः<BR>(ता, तं); etc.<BR>II Of things, etc.: विलासमयः<BR>(यी, यं) (?); अतिसुखावहः (हा, हं) (?).<BR>III<BR>Abundant: प्रचुरः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxuriously
LUXURIOUSLY: expr. by circumlo: प्रचुरम्<BR>(= abundantly).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

luxury
LUXURY:<BR>I In gen.:<BR>(1) ऐश्वर्यसुखम्, K. ;<BR>(2)<BR>विषयभोगः।<BR>II Of food: v. Dainty, delicacy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lyceum
LYCEUM: विद्यालयः: v. School, college.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lys
LYS: क्षारजलम् (?) and sim. expr.s. and<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lying
LYING (subs.):<BR>(1) अनृतवादित्वम्;<BR>(2) असत्य-<BR>भाषणम्, V.s.; etc.;<BR>(3) असत्यता, Si., or<BR>निःसत्यता, H.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=428" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lying
LYING (adj.):<BR>I Telling lies: अनृतवादिन् (f. नी),<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR>II Situated: अवस्थितः<BR>(ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lying in
LYING IN:<BR>I Subs: प्रसवावस्था: v. Child-<BR>-birth.<BR>II Adj.: expr. by subs. Ph.:<BR>l.<BR>chamber:<BR>सूतिकाहगृम्;<BR>(2) अरिष्टम् (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lymph
LYMPH:<BR>I Water: निर्मलजलम्।<BR>II Of the<BR>body: रसः (?), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lymphatic
LYMPHATIC: रसवाहिन् (f. नी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lynx
LYNX: वनविडालः (?), विडालवृकः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lynx-eyed
LYNX-EYED: Fig.: सूक्ष्मदर्शिन् (f. नी); सूक्ष्मदृष्टि<BR>(mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lyre
LYRE: वीणा,<BR>a player on the l.:<BR>वीणावादः: v.<BR>Lute.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lyric
LYRIC:<BR>I Lit.: expr. by comp.<BR>II In gen.<BR>sense: रसप्रधानः (ना, नं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

lyrist
LYRIST: वीणावादः, -कः; वैणिकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macadamize
MACADAMIZE: प्रस्तरखण्डैः छादयति (c. of छद्)<BR>or<BR>संहन्ति (हन्, c. 2.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macaron
MACARON: *चूर्णनाली,<BR>m. soup:<BR>चूर्णनालीमिश्रं यूषम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macaroon
MACAROON: *बादामपिष्टकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macaw
MACAW: वक्रतुण्डः: v. Parrot.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mace
MACE:<BR>I A spice: जाति(ती)पत्री, Bha.<BR>Powdered<BR>with m. cardamom, and cinnamon:<BR>त्रिजातकाव-<BR>चूर्णितः (ता, तं), D. vi.<BR>II A heavy staff:<BR>गदा, Mah.<BR>III In gen.: दण्डः: v. Staff.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mace-bearer
MACE-BEARER:<BR>(1) दण्डधरः;<BR>(2) यष्टिधरः: and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macerate
MACERATE: perh. द्रावयति (c. of द्रु): v. To<BR>steep.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maceration
MACERATION: perh. द्रावणम्, पाचनम् (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

machinate
MACHINATE: परिकल्पयति (क्ल्टप्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>contrive.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

machination
MACHINATION:<BR>(1) कुमन्त्रणा;<BR>(2) षड् यन्त्रम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

machine
MACHINE: यन्त्रम्: v. Also tool.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

machihe-maker
