machinery
MACHINERY:<BR>I Machines collectively: यन्त्राणि<BR>(n. pl.).<BR>II Working parts of a machine:<BR>expr. by circumlo.:<BR>‘m. of state’:<BR>राजकार्यवहाः<BR>(m. pl (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mackerel
MACKEREL: *मक्रलः, नीलबिन्दुः, मत्स्यविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

macrocosm
MACROCOSM:<BR>(1) विश्वम्;<BR>(2) विश्वसंसारः and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mad
MAD:<BR>I Of persons or mind:<BR>(1) उन्मत्तः<BR>(त्ता, त्तं) (best equiv (lit. and fig.) (we are)<BR>both m. about it:<BR>द्वावप्यत्रोन्मत्तौ,<BR>V ii.;<BR>o, m.<BR>woman:<BR>अयि, उन्मत्तिके, K. ii.; to go or run m.;<BR>उन्मादं गच्छति;<BR>to drive m.:<BR>उन्मत्ततां नयति,<BR>K. ;<BR>(2) वातुलः (ला, लं), वायुग्रस्तः (स्ता, स्तं),<BR>etc. (lit.)<BR>my son is m.:<BR>मम पुत्रो वायुग्रस्तः, D.<BR>ii.;<BR>(3) उन्मादिन् (f. नी), N. xiii. 40.;<BR>(4)<BR>मदोद्धतः (ता, तं) (fig.), Ki. xiv. 63.<BR>II Of<BR>acts, etc.<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) दुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं)<BR>(= vicious);<BR>(3) उद्दामः (मा, मं) (= unres-<BR>-trained).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madam
MADAM, -E:<BR>(1) देवी: v. Lady;<BR>(2) आर्या (by<BR>gentlemen).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madcap
MADCAP: प्रमत्तः (त्ता, त्तं): v. Rash, mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madden
MADDEN (v. t.):<BR>(1) उन्मादयति (c. of मद्),<BR>m. ed by your form:<BR>त्वदाकारोन्मादितः (ता, तं),<BR>D. ;<BR>(2) उन्मत्तीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madden
MADDEN (v. i.):<BR>(1) उन्माद्यति (मद्, c. 4.);<BR>(2) उन्मत्तीभवति। M. ed:<BR>(1) उन्मत्तः (त्ता, त्तं),<BR>m. ed with wine:<BR>मदोन्मत्तः;<BR>(2) अन्धः (न्धा, न्धं):<BR>v. Blind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madder
MADDER: मञ्जिष्ठा,<BR>dyed with m.:<BR>माञ्जिष्ठ (f. ष्ठी),<BR>क (f. का), Vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

made of
MADE OF:<BR>(1) -मयः (यी, यं), m. of human bone:<BR>मनुष्यास्थिमयः (यी, यं), S. p.;<BR>(2) निर्मितः, वि-<BR>(ता, तं),<BR>a monkey m. of gold:<BR>कपिः कनकनिर्मितः,<BR>Shat.;<BR>(3) घटितः (ता, तं), m. of fine thread:<BR>सूक्ष्मतन्तुघटितः (ता, तं), V. d.;<BR>(4) by a deriv.,<BR>m. of mustard:<BR>सार्षपः (पी, पं), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madhouse
MADHOUSE:<BR>(1) वातुलाश्रमः;<BR>(2) उन्मत्तालयः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madly
MADLY:<BR>I In madness: उन्मादात्, K. ii.<BR>II<BR>Like a mad man: उन्मत्तवत्; उन्मत्त (f. त्ता) इव।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madness
MADNESS:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) उन्मादः,<BR>m. is a mental<BR>disease:<BR>उन्मादो मानसो व्याधिः, Sr.;<BR>treatment<BR>of m.:<BR>उन्मादचिकित्सा, Bha.;<BR>(2) उन्मत्तता (the<BR>state);<BR>(3) वातुलता etc. (= 2).<BR>II Fig.:<BR>(1)<BR>उन्मादः;<BR>(2) वायुः, possessed of the m. of alchemy:<BR>सञ्जातधातुवादवायु (mfn.), K.<BR>III Of acts, etc.:<BR>मोहः: v. Folly, infatuation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=429" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

madrigal
MADRIGAL: no equiv.: गोपगीतम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magazine
MAGAZINE:<BR>I For arms: शस्त्रागारम् and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR>II A store-house: q. v.<BR>III A<BR>periodical: no equiv.: *कोषः<BR>or<BR>ज्ञानकोषः;<BR> पत्रिका (used in Bengali.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maggot
MAGGOT:<BR>I A worm: q. v.: कीटः, -कः।<BR>II<BR>A whim: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maggoty
MAGGOTY:<BR>I Lit.: कीटोपसृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं) and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR>II Whimsical: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magi
MAGI: *मागयः (m. pl.); पारसिकपूर्वपण्डिताः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

