magic
MAGIC, -AL (adj.): ऐन्द्रजालिकः (की, कं);<BR>(2)<BR>माया- in comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magically
MAGICALLY:<BR>(1) मायया;<BR>(2) इन्द्रजालेन; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magician
MAGICIAN:<BR>(1) ऐन्दजालिकः,<BR>m.'s brush:<BR>पिच्छिका,<BR>D.<BR>(2) मायाकारः, मायिन्<BR>or<BR>मायाविन् (gen.<BR>applied to demons etc. assuming illusive<BR>forms).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magisterial
MAGISTERIAL:<BR>I Lit.: expr. by comp.<BR>II<BR>Imperious, proud: उद्धतः (ता, तं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magisterially
MAGISTERIALLY: Lit.: दण्डनायकत्वेन (?).<BR>II<BR>Arrogantly: उद्धतम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magistracy
MAGISTRACY: दण्डनायकत्वम्<BR>or<BR>दण्डनायकाधिकारः<BR>(??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magistrate
MAGISTRATE: perh. दण्डनायकः, D.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnanimity
MAGNANIMITY:<BR>(1) माहात्म्यम्;<BR>(2) महानुभावः;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnanimous
MAGNANIMOUS:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) महात्मन्<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(2) महानुभावः (वा, वं);<BR>(3) महामनस्<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(4) उदारचेतस् (mfn.); etc.<BR>II Of<BR>acts: उदारः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnanimously
MAGNANIMOUSLY:<BR>(1) औदार्येण;<BR>(2) उदारचेतसा,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnet
MAGNET:<BR>(1) अयस्कान्तः;<BR>(2) चुम्बकः, -प्रस्तरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnetic
MAGNETIC, -AL: by comp., m. needle:<BR>अयस्कान्तशलाका (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnetism
MAGNETISM: *चुम्बकशक्तिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnetize
MAGNETIZE: *चुम्बकशक्तिमन्तं (तीं,-त्) करोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnificence
MAGNIFICENCE:<BR>(1) श्रीः (?);<BR>(2) तेजस् (?);<BR>(3) प्रतापः (?);<BR>(4) महिमन्। (m (= greatness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnificent
MAGNIFICENT:<BR>(1) रोचिष्णु (mfn.): v. Splen-<BR>-did;<BR>(2) तेजस्विन् (f. नी); v. Fiery;<BR>(3)<BR>महत् (f. ती): v. Great;<BR>(4) श्रीमत् (f. ती):<BR>v. Beautiful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnificently
MAGNIFICENTLY: expr. by adj. in comp. or<BR>by circumlo.,<BR>m. dressed:<BR>उज्ज्वलवेषः (षा, षं),<BR>Mr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnifier
MAGNIFIER: *बृंहणयन्त्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnify
MAGNIFY: बृंहयति (बृंह्, c. 10.) or by circumlo.,<BR>it m. ies objects:<BR>*अनेन पदार्था बृहतो दृश्यन्ते: v.<BR>To enlarge, extol.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magniloquence
MAGNILOQUENCE: उद्धतोक्तिः, उद्धतं वचः, Ki.;<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magniloquent
MAGNILOQUENT:<BR>(1) उद्धतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) प्रगल्भ<BR>(f. ल्भा);<BR>(3) प्रौढ (f. ढा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magnitude
MAGNITUDE: इयत्ता: v. Size, extent, great-<BR>-ness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

magpie
MAGPIE: किकिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mahometan
MAHOMETAN:<BR>I Adj.: महम्मदीयः (या, यं).<BR>II Subs.: v. Mussulman.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maid
MAID, MAIDEN:<BR>I A girl: q. v.: कन्या।<BR>II<BR>A virgin: q. v.: कन्या।<BR>III A maid-ser-<BR>-vant: चेटी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maiden
MAIDEN (adj.): Lit.: expr. by comp.<BR>II<BR>New, pure: q. v.: अभिनवः (वा, वं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maidenly
MAIDENLY: कन्यकोचितः (ता, तं) and sim.<BR>comp.s: v. Becoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maidenhair
MAIDENHAIR: a plant: *सुकेशी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maid-servant
MAID-SERVANT:<BR>(1) चेटी;<BR>(2) पण्यदासी, D. ;<BR>(3) दासी: v. Slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mail
MAIL (subs.):<BR>I Armour:<BR>(1) वर्मन् (n);<BR>(2)<BR>कवच (mn.);<BR>(3) कञ्चुकः;<BR>(4) सन्नाहः<BR>(5) कङ्कटः;<BR>(6) वारबाणः।<BR>II Letter (prop., a bag for l.):<BR>*पत्रकोषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mailed
MAILED:<BR>(1) वर्मितः (ता, तं);<BR>(2) दंशितः (ता,<BR> तं), सं-, परि-;<BR>(3) सन्नद्ध (f. द्धा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maim
MAIM (v.):<BR>(1) विकलीकरोति;<BR>(2) व्यङ्गीकरोति<BR>(= to mutilate). M. ed.:<BR>(1) विकलाङ्ग (f. ङ्गी);<BR>(2) व्यङ्ग (f. ङ्गी);<BR>(3) दुर्बलः (ला, लं) (=<BR>weak).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=430" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

main
