Mainland: महादेशः: v. Continent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mainly
MAINLY:<BR>(1) प्रधानतः;<BR>(2) प्राधान्येनः v. Prin-<BR>-cipally.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mainprize
MAINPRIZE: प्रातिभाव्येन मुक्तिः।<BR>Writ of m.:<BR>प्राति-<BR>भाव्येन मोचननिदेशः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mainsail
MAINSAIL: मुख्यवातवसनम् (?) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mainspring
MAINSPRING: Fig.: निदानम्: v. Chief, cause.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maintain
MAINTAIN:<BR>I To hold: q. v.: धरति (धृ, c.<BR>1.).<BR>II To keep, defend: रक्षति (रक्ष्, c<BR>l.).<BR>III To continue: q. v.<BR>IV To<BR>support: भरति<BR>or<BR>बिमर्ति, सं-, (भृ, c. 1. and<BR>3.), daughters should be m. ed till marriage:<BR>दुहितरः परिणयनं यावद्भर्तव्याः, Da.<BR>IV To affirm<BR>and defend:<BR>(1) भरति<BR>or<BR>बिभर्ति (?);<BR>(2)<BR>ब्रवीति (ब्रू, c. 2 (= to assert: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maintainable
MAINTAINABLE:<BR>(1) संधार्य (f. र्या);<BR>(2) रक्ष-<BR>णीयः (या, यं);<BR>(3) मर्तव्य (f. व्या): for dif.:<BR>v. To maintain.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maintainer
MAINTAINER: भर्तृ (f. र्त्री) (= supporter) or<BR>by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maintenance
MAINTENANCE:<BR>I Holding: धारणम्, -सं।<BR>II<BR>Defence: रक्षा।<BR>III Support:<BR>(1) भरणम्;<BR>(2) भृतिः।<BR>III Means of support:<BR>(1) वृत्तिः;<BR>(2) ग्रासाच्छादनम् (= food and clothing: as<BR>for wives), Da.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maize
MAIZE: मधूली (?), Bha.; भुट्टा and जुनार in<BR>modern dialects.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

major
MAJOR: Ph.: m. premise:<BR>(1) उदाहरणम्;<BR>(2)<BR>पूर्वपक्षः। M. (in the army): *अधिगुल्मपतिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

major-domo
MAJOR-DOMO: कार्याधीशः: v. Steward.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

majority
MAJORITY:<BR>I The greater number:<BR>(1) by<BR>बहु (f. ह्नी) (= great m.): v. Many.;<BR>(2)<BR>by अनेक-,<BR>the m. was for acquittal:<BR>*अनेके<BR> मुक्तिमनुमेनिरे।<BR>II Full age: वयस् (n.).<BR>One<BR>who has attained his m.:<BR>प्राप्तव्यवहारः (रा, रं).<BR>III Major's rank: *अधिगुल्मपतित्वम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make
MAKE (v. t.):<BR>I To construct:<BR>(1) करोति<BR>or<BR>कुरुते<BR>(कृ, c. 8.),<BR>to m. a bridge:<BR>सेतुं करोति, Mah.;<BR>(2) विदधाति<BR>or<BR>विधत्ते (धा, c. 3.), to m. a town:<BR>पुरं विधत्ते, Ki.<BR>II To form, fabricate:<BR>(1)<BR>करोति,<BR>with made delights:<BR>कृतकानन्दैः; m. a<BR>bed:<BR>शय्यां करोति;<BR>(2) विदधाति,<BR>that I made<BR>friendship with him:<BR>यदनेन सह मैत्री विहिता, P.<BR>i. 10.<BR>III To appoint:<BR>(1) करोति,<BR>who<BR>made him king:<BR>केनासौ राजा कृतः, H. ;<BR>(2)<BR>विदधाति,<BR>m. ing friend guards:<BR>विधाय रक्षान् परितः<BR> परेतरान्, Ki.<BR>IV To do:<BR>(1) करोति,<BR>to m.<BR>effort:<BR>उद्यमं करोति;<BR>to m. peace:<BR>सन्धिं करोति,<BR>Ve.;<BR>to m. a sound:<BR>शब्दं करोति, P. ;<BR>to m.<BR>account of:<BR>गणनां करोति;<BR>to m. bold:<BR>साहसं<BR> करोति;<BR>to m. doubt:<BR>सन्देहं करोति; to m. an oath:<BR>शपथं करोति, D. ;<BR>m. s suit to:<BR>आराधनां करोति<BR>(with gen.);<BR>m. use of:<BR>प्रयोगं करोति;<BR>(2)<BR>विदधाति,<BR>to m. abode:<BR>वसतिं विदधाति, Ch.<BR>V To<BR>gain: करोति,<BR>m. ing a lac of money:<BR>लक्षसंख्यानि<BR> धनानि कृत्वा, H. iv.<BR>VI To cause:<BR>(1) by<BR>causal verb,<BR>to m. (to) revolve:<BR>भ्रामयति, V.p.;<BR>to m. (to) believe:<BR>विश्वासयति, Ki.;<BR>(2) कारयति (c.<BR>of कृ),<BR>as I have made their friendship:<BR>यथानयोः<BR> सौहार्दं मया कारितम्, H.<BR>VII. To compel:<BR>q. v.<BR>VIII To m. up: q. v.<BR>IX To arrive<BR>at: q. v.<BR>X To pass: गच्छति (गम्, c. l.),<BR>to m. a distance:<BR>अध्वानं गच्छति, K.<BR>XI. To<BR>represent: q. v.<BR>XII To become: भवति,<BR>m. merry:<BR>हृष्टो भवति, Ph.:<BR>a made man:<BR>वृद्धिं<BR> गतो नरः;<BR>m. much of:<BR>बहु भन्यते; m. light of:<BR>लघु मन्यते, तृणाय मन्यते;<BR>m. way:<BR>श्रन्तरं ददाति<BR>(to give way)<BR>or<BR>स्थानं करोति (to clear the<BR>way);<BR>m. free with:<BR>विना सङ्कोचेन व्यवहरति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make
MAKE (v. i.):<BR>I To move: q. v.<BR>II To<BR>become: q. v.: भवति,<BR>m. against:<BR>प्रतिकूलो<BR> भवति;<BR>m. bold:<BR>साहसं करोति।<BR>III With, as if<BR>= to pretend: भावयति (c. of भू), D. ii.<BR>IV To increase: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make away with
MAKE AWAY WITH: उत्सादयति (c. of सद्): v.<BR>To do away.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make for
MAKE FOR:<BR>I To move towards: q. v.<BR>II<BR>To favour: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make good
MAKE GOOD:<BR>I To maintain, fulfil: रक्षति,<BR> सं-, (रक्ष्, c. l.).<BR>II To make compensa-<BR>-tion for: पूरयति (पूर्, c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make out
MAKE OUT:<BR>I To discover: निरूपयति (रूप्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR>II To prove, establish: q. v.:<BR>प्रतिपादयति (c. of पद्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=431" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make over
MAKE OVER: समर्पयति (c. of ऋ): v. To deli-<BR>-ver, convey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make up
MAKE UP:<BR>I To collect: सङ्कलयति (कल्, c.<BR>10.).<BR>II To complete: पूरयति (पूर्, c. 10.).<BR>III To compensate for: पूरयति।<BR>IV To<BR>determine: q. v.:<BR>one who has made up his<BR>mind:<BR>कृतमति (mfn.).<BR>V To reconcile:<BR>सं-दधाति<BR>or<BR>धत्ते (धा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make up to
MAKE UP TO: उपगच्छति (गम्, c. 1.): v. To<BR>approach.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make
MAKE (subs.): आकृति: v. Shape, form.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make-peace
MAKE-PEACE: peace-maker: v. Peace, maker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

make-weight
MAKE-WEIGHT: कृतमानम् (?) (after प्रतिमानम् of<BR>V. s.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maker
MAKER:<BR>I In gen. sense:<BR>(1) कारः in comp.<BR>or<BR>कारकः (best equiv.).<BR>Chariot-m.:<BR>रथकारः, P. ;<BR>coarse-ctoth m.:<BR>स्थूलपट्टकारकः, P. ;<BR>(2) कृत्<BR>(mfn.) in comp,<BR>m. of the world:<BR>विश्वकृत्,<BR>Ch.;<BR>(3) कर्तृ (m (rare),<BR>m. of bows and<BR>arrows:<BR>धनुःशराणां कर्ता, M.<BR>II. The crea-<BR>-tor: q. v.<BR>(1) विधातृ (m.);<BR>(2) धातृ (m.),<BR>m. of all:<BR>सर्वस्य धाता, Ku. ii. 3.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

making
MAKING (subs.): कृतिः (in all senses): v. To<BR>make.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malachite
MALACHITE: *हरितताम्रम्; मलकूटम्; अङ्गारसाराम्ल-<BR>संश्लिष्टं ताम्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maladministration
MALADMINISTRATION: कुशासनम् (?): v. Ad-<BR>-ministration, bad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malady
MALADY: आमयः: Disease.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malapropos
MALAPROPOS: अस्थाने: v. Unseasonably.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malaria
MALARIA: *मारिवातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malarious
MALARIOUS: *मारिवातजः (जा, जं); मारिवातदुष्टः<BR>(ष्टा, ष्टं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malcontent
MALCONTENT, -ED:<BR>(1) असन्तुष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं): v.<BR>Discontented;<BR>(2) विरक्तः (क्ता, क्तं): v.<BR>Seditious.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

male
MALE (adj.):<BR>I To indicate males:<BR>(1)<BR>expr. by the m. gender,<BR>a m. tiger:<BR>व्याघ्रः;<BR>(2) पुं-, in comp. (rare),<BR>a m. cuckoo:<BR>पुंस्को-<BR>किलः, Ku.<BR>II Belonging to a m.:<BR>(1) पुं-,<BR>female and. m. union:<BR>स्त्रीपुंसंयोगः, N. s.;<BR>(2)<BR>the m. organ:<BR>पुरुषाङ्गम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

male
MALE (subs.):<BR>(1) पुमान्, of the m. and the<BR>female:<BR>स्त्रीपुंसयोः, D. ;<BR>(2) पुरुषः। N.B. When<BR>standing for a m. animal, better expr. by<BR>the word itself,<BR>she said to the m.:<BR>सा टिट्टि-<BR>भमूचे, P.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malediction
MALEDICTION: शापः: v. Curse.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malefactor
MALEFACTOR: पातकिन् (f. नी): v. Criminal,<BR>guilty.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maleficent
MALEFICENT: परापकारिन् (f. णी): v. Bene-<BR>-ficent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malevolence
MALEVOLENCE:<BR>(1) हिंसा;<BR>(2) द्रोहबद्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malevolent
MALEVOLENT:<BR>(1) हिंसापरायण (f. णा) and<BR>sim. comp.s.;<BR>(2) द्रोहबुद्धि (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malevolently
MALEVOLENTLY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malformation
MALFORMATION: v. Formation, ill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malice
MALICE:<BR>(1) हिंसा;<BR>(2) द्रोहबुद्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malicious
MALICIOUS:<BR>(1) हिंसापरायण (f. णा);<BR>(2) द्रोह-<BR>बुद्धि (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maliciousness
MALICIOUSNESS: द्रोहबुद्धिता: v. Malice.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malign
MALIGN (adj.):<BR>I Malignant: q. v.<BR>II Un-<BR>-propitious: अशुभ (f. भा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malign
MALIGN (v.):<BR>(1) वि-द्वेष्टि (द्विष्, c. 2.): v.<BR>To hate.;<BR>(2) अपवदति (वद्, c. l.): v. To<BR>defame.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malignant
MALIGNANT:<BR>I Malevolent:<BR>(1) द्रोहबुद्धि<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(2) विद्वेषमावः (वा, वं).<BR>II Unpro-<BR>-pitious: अशुभः (भा, भं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malignantly
MALIGNANTLY:<BR>(1) द्रोहबुद्ध्या;<BR>(2) परमद्वेषेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maligner
MALIGNER: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malignity
MALIGNITY:<BR>(1) द्रोहबुद्धिः, अभि-;<BR>(2) परमद्वेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malleability
MALLEABILITY: ताडनवर्धनीयता (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malleable
MALLEABLE: ताडनवर्धनीयः (या, यं) (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mallet
MALLET:<BR>(1) मुद्गरः;<BR>(2) घनः (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mallow
MALLOW: *मालवः; गुल्मप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malpractice
MALPRACTICE: दुश्चेष्टितम्: v. Misdeed.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malt
MALT: यवः (comp. यावा, Bengali), m.-liquor:<BR>यवसुरम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maltreat
MALTREAT:<BR>(1) विप्रकरोति, m. ed by Tāraka:<BR>तारकेण विप्रकृताः, Ku. ii. 1.;<BR>(2) खलीकरोति,<BR>this<BR>gambler is m. ed by the gambling-master:<BR>अयं<BR> द्यूतकरः सभिकेन खलीक्रियते, Mr. ii.;<BR>(3) कदर्थयति<BR>(nomi.), Vi. vi. 29.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maltreatment
MALTREATMENT:<BR>(1) खलीकरणम्;<BR>(2) कदर्थना;<BR>(3) by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=432" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

malversation
MALVERSATION: दुराचारः (?): v. Peculation.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mamma
MAMMA: अम्बा: v. Mother.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mammal
MAMMAL: *स्तनन्धयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mammon
MAMMON:<BR>I Wealth: q. v.: धनम्।<BR>II Its<BR>god: कुबेरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mammoth
MAMMOTH:<BR>I Subs.: *ममन्तः; पूर्वकालीनहस्ति-<BR>विशेषः।<BR>II Adj.: v. Gigantic.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

man
MAN (subs.):<BR>I A human being:<BR>(1) मनुष्यः,<BR>rise and fall of men:<BR>पातोत्पाता मनुष्याणाम्, H. ;<BR>(2) मानुषः,<BR>always inaccessible to men:<BR>अगम्यो<BR> मानुषैः सदा, Mah.;<BR>(3) नरः,<BR>but m. endowed<BR>with intellect:<BR>नरास्तु बुद्धिसम्पन्नाः, Mah.;<BR>m-stealer:<BR>नरहर्ता, Mit.;<BR>(4) मानवः, m.-god:<BR>मानवदेवः, R. xiv. 32.;<BR>(5) नृ (m.),<BR>m.-<BR>eater:<BR>नृभुज् (mfn.), B. N.B. (a)<BR>of m.:<BR>मानुषः<BR>(षी, षं): v. Human.; (b) old m., young m,<BR>etc. gen. expr. by adj.,<BR>consisting chiefly of<BR>young men:<BR>युवप्रायः (या, यं), C. ; (c)<BR>a m. of<BR>straw:<BR>अकिञ्चनः, Ku.: (d) he is his own m.:<BR>अयं स्वाधीनः, K.<BR>II. The human species:<BR>expr. by above words, gen. in. pl.<BR>III As<BR>opposed to child: मानुषः,<BR>when he became a<BR>m.:<BR>यदा स मानुषोऽभवत् (comp. Beng.).<BR>IV<BR>One of manly qualities:<BR>(1) पुरुषः, how can<BR>the appellation m. (be applied)<BR>to him:<BR>पुरुषोक्तिः<BR> कथं तस्मिन्, Ki. xi. 71.;<BR>great m.:<BR>महापुरुषः, U. ;<BR>(2) पुमान्,<BR>he who has money is a m. in this<BR>world:<BR>यस्यार्थाः स पुमान् लोके, H.<BR>V. As<BR>opposed to woman, wife:<BR>(1) पुरुषः,<BR>men are<BR>treacherous hard-hearted:<BR>पुरुषाः कृतव्नाः कठिनहृदयाः,<BR>Vet. 3.;<BR>did she desire other men:<BR>किमनया पर-<BR>पुरुषोऽभिलषितः, P. i. 4.;<BR>(2) पुमान् (v. Male),<BR>better impotence in men:<BR>वरं क्लैव्यं पुंसाम्, H.<BR>VI. An attendant, servant:<BR>(1) मानुषः,<BR>(2)<BR>पुरुषः,<BR>king's men:<BR>राजपुरुषाः, P.<BR>VII. In chess:<BR>(1) शारः;<BR>(2) नरः। Ph.:<BR>m.-of-war:<BR>युद्धपोतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

man
MAN (v.):<BR>I Lit.: पुरुषाधिष्ठितं (f. तां) करोति;<BR> मनुष्यान्, etc. स्थापयति (c. of स्था) (with loc.).<BR>II Fig.: v. To strengthen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manacle
MANACLE (subs.):<BR>(1) हस्तबन्धनम्, and sim.<BR>comp.s. (?);<BR>(2) हस्तपाशः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manacle
MANACLE (v.):<BR>(1) बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9 (= to<BR>fasten);<BR>(2) निगडयति (nomi (= to fetter).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manage
MANAGE:<BR>I To administer: निर्वाहयति (c.<BR>of वह्).<BR>II To direct, control:<BR>(1) विनयति<BR>(नी, c. 1 (?);<BR>(2) चालयति (c. of चल्) (?).<BR>III To train: विनयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manageable
MANAGEABLE: विनेयः (या, यं): v. Docile,<BR>teachable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

management
MANAGEMENT:<BR>I Conduct, carrying on:<BR>(1) निर्वाहः;<BR>(2) शासनम् (= government).<BR>II<BR>Skilful practice: कौशलम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manager
MANAGER:<BR>I In gen.: निर्वाहकः (?).<BR>II Of the<BR>stage:<BR>(1) सूत्रधारः;<BR>(2) मारिषः (in addres-<BR>-sing).<BR>III A skilful handler: expr. with<BR>कुशलः (ला, लं) (with loc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mandarin
MANDARIN: मन्त्रिन् (m.).<BR>M. language:<BR>प्राकृत-<BR>चीनमाषा (?);<BR>m. duck:<BR>*चीनकादम्बः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mandate
MANDATE (subs.): आज्ञा: v. Command,<BR>order.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mandible
MANDIBLE: हनुः: v. Jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mandragora
MANDRAGORA, MANDRAKE: लताविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mane
MANE:<BR>(1) केश(स)रः,<BR>with the lustre of the hair<BR>of the m.:<BR>केशरकेशरश्मिभिः, N. ;<BR>(2) सटा,<BR>a<BR>flowing m.:<BR>सटाच्छटा, Si. M. d.: i. e.<BR>having<BR>m.:<BR>केशरिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manes
MANES: प्रेताः (m. pl.); पितरः (m. pl. = ances-<BR>-tors).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manful
MANFUL, MANFULLY, MANFULNESS: v. Manly,<BR>manliness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mange
MANGE: पशूनां कण्डूः -रोगः: v. Itch (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manger
MANGER:<BR>(1) द्रोणी;<BR>(2) गवादनी (for cows).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manginess
MANGINESS:<BR>(1) कण्डूलता (?);<BR>(2) कच्छुरता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mangle
MANGLE (subs.): वस्त्रपरिमार्जनी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mangle
MANGLE (v.):<BR>I To lacerate, back:<BR>(1)<BR>व्यवच्छिनत्ति (छिद्, c. 7.);<BR>(2) विनिकृन्तति (कृत्,<BR>c. l.). M. d.:<BR>(1) क्षतविक्षतः (ता, तं);<BR>(2)<BR>छिन्नभिन्नः (न्ना, न्नं).<BR>II To smooth with a m.:<BR>*वस्त्रपरिमार्जन्या श्लक्ष्णीकरोति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mango
MANGO: आम्रम्।<BR>M.-tree:<BR>आम्रः, चूतः (poet).<BR>M.-<BR>fool:<BR>दुग्धतालीयम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mango-fish
MANGO-FISH: तपस्विन् (m.), -मत्स्यः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mangosteen
MANGOSTEEN: *मङ्गुष्ठम्, (the m. for the tree).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mangy
MANGY:<BR>(1) कच्छुरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) कण्डूलः (ला,<BR> लं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manhood
MANHOOD:<BR>I Human nature:<BR>(1) भनुष्यत्वम्; [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">Page434</a>]<BR>(2) मानुषता।<BR>II Puberty:<BR>(1) यौवनम्<BR>(= youth);<BR>(2) वयः (= age);<BR>(3) by मानुषः (?).<BR>III Manliness: पौरुषम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=433" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mania
MANIA:<BR>II Madness: q. v.<BR>II Great pas-<BR>-sion: महाव्यसनम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maniac
MANIAC: वातुलः (ला, लं): v. Mad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manichean
MANICHEAN: *माणिकानुवर्तिन् (f. नी), and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifest
MANIFEST (adj.):<BR>(1) स्पष्ट (f. ष्टा);<BR>(2) प्रकाशः<BR>(शा, शं) V. : v. Evident.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifest
MANIFEST (v.): प्रकाशयति (c. of काश्): v.<BR>Evident, to make.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifestation
MANIFESTATION:<BR>I The act: प्रकाशनम्।<BR>II<BR>The state:<BR>(1) प्रकाशः;<BR>(2) आविर्भावः (= ap-<BR>-pearing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifestly
MANIFESTLY: प्रकाशम्: v. Evidently, clearly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifesto
MANIFESTO: perh. विज्ञापनपत्रम्: v. Proclama-<BR>-tion.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manifold
MANIFOLD:<BR>I Various:<BR>(1) नानाविधः (धा, धं);<BR>(2) विविधः (धा, धं);<BR>(3) बहुविधः (धा, धं);<BR>(4) बहुप्रकारः (रा, रं); etc.<BR>II Lit.: बहुवारान्<BR>or<BR>अनेकवारान् (adv.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maniple
MANIPLE:<BR>I Handful: मुष्टिः।<BR>II A band:<BR>दलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manipulate
MANIPULATE: हस्तं चालयति (c. of चल्) (with<BR>loc (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manipulation
MANIPULATION:<BR>(1) हस्तचालनम् (?);<BR>(2) लघु-<BR>हस्तता (= dexterity).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mankind
MANKIND:<BR>(1) by pl. मनुष्याः etc.: v. Man.;<BR>(2) मानवजातिः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manliness
MANLINESS:<BR>(1) पुरुषत्वम्;<BR>(2) पौरुषम्;<BR>(3) पौरुषे-<BR>यता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manly
MANLY (adv.):<BR>I Human: q. v.<BR>II Op-<BR>-posed to womanly:<BR>(1) पुरुष- in comp.,<BR>m.<BR>act:<BR>पुरुषकारः, H. ;<BR>(2) पौरुषः (षी, षं);<BR>(3)<BR>पौरुषेयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manly
MANLY (adv.):<BR>(1) पौरुषेण;<BR>(2) पुरुषवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manna
MANNA:<BR>I Of the Bible: *स्वरन्नम्।<BR>II Of the<BR>bamboo: वंशरो(लो)चना।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manner
MANNER:<BR>I Way: रीतिः। Ph.: in this m.:<BR>अनेन प्रकारेण: v. Thus.;<BR>in what m.:<BR>केन<BR> प्रकारेणः v. How.;<BR>in the same m.:<BR>तेन प्रकारेण:<BR>v. So.<BR>II Custom: q. v.: आचारः, the good<BR>m.s:<BR>सदाचारः;<BR>bad m.s.:<BR>दुराचारः।<BR>III<BR>Sort, kind: q. v.: प्रकारः। Ph.: in a m.:<BR>भावतः (= in purport)<BR>or<BR>कथञ्चित् (= some-<BR>-what).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mannered
MANNERED: gen. in comp.: शीलवत् (f. ती):<BR>v. Conduct.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mannerism
MANNERISM: धरणम् (used in Bengali).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mannerly
