MANOR: *बेरणभूमिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manse
MANSE:<BR>(1) धामन् (n.);<BR>(2) वेश्मन् (n.): v.<BR>House.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mansion
MANSION:<BR>(1) हर्म्यम्;<BR>(2) मन्दिरम्;<BR>(3) सौधम्;<BR>(4) सद्मन् (n.).<BR>Lunar m.:<BR>नक्षत्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manslaughter
MANSLAUGHTER: नरहत्या: v. Murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mantelet
MANTELET, MANTLET: तनुत्राणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mantel-piece
MANTEL-PIECE: *अग्निस्थानप्रावारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mantle
MANTLE (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: प्रावारः: v. Cloak.<BR>II Fig.: धुर् (f.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mantle
MANTLE (v.): प्रावृणोति (वृ, c. 5.): v. To<BR>cover.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manual
MANUAL (subs.): उपक्रमणिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manual
MANUAL (adj.): हस्त- in comp., under sign m.:<BR>कृतहस्तचिह्न (f. ह्ना).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manufactory
MANUFACTORY: शिल्पशाला; gen. with शाला or<BR>गृहम् with particular worker.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manufacture
MANUFACTURE (subs.):<BR>I The operation:<BR>निर्माणम् (= making) (?).<BR>II The thing:<BR>शिल्पद्रव्यम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

