MANUFACTURER: शिल्पकारः (?); better by<BR>circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manumission
MANUMISSION:<BR>(1) मोक्षः -णम्, परि-, वि-;<BR>(2)<BR>मुक्तिः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manumit
MANUMIT: मोक्षयति (मोक्ष्, c. 10.): v. To<BR>emancipate, liberate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manure
MANURE (subs.): सारः (used in vernacular).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=434" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

manure
