MANUSCRIPT: हस्तलिखितं पुस्तकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

many
MANY (adj.):<BR>(1) बहु (also f. बह्वी) (best<BR>equiv.),<BR>after good m. days:<BR>सुबहुदिवसापगमे,<BR>K. ;<BR>great m. advantages:<BR>बहुतर उपकारः, Viv;<BR>by not very m. attendants:<BR>नातिबहुना परिजनेन,<BR>K. ;<BR>killing very m. monkeys:<BR>वानरान् बहुशो हत्वा,<BR>A. r.;<BR>bring m. of these:<BR>बहूनीमान्युपाहर,<BR>Mah.;<BR>very m. rivers:<BR>बहुतरसरितः, Mat.;<BR>m.-<BR>headed, etc.:<BR>बहुशिरस् (mfn.), etc.;<BR>(2) अनेक or<BR>नैकः (का, कं), m. thousands of Gandharvas:<BR>अनेकानि गन्धर्वसहस्त्राणि, Kar.;<BR>(3) भूयस् (f. सी),<BR>by m. little (things): भूयोभिः क्षुद्रैः, A. r.;<BR>(4)<BR>अनल्पः (ल्पा, ल्पं), etc (= not few).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

many
MANY, AS: यावत् (f. ती),<BR>but as m. as they<BR>were in war:<BR>ते तु यावन्त एवाजौ, R. xii. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

many
MANY, HOW:<BR>(1) कति, (mfn.), h. m. years.:<BR>कति वर्षाणि, A.r.;<BR>(3) कियत् (f. ती),<BR>and in h.<BR>m. days:<BR>कियद्भिर्वा दिवसैः, K. Ph.:<BR>h. m.<BR>times:<BR>कतिशः<BR>or<BR>कति वारान्<BR>or<BR>कियतो वारान्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

many
MANY, SO:<BR>I Absol.:<BR>(1) इयत् (f. ती),<BR>so<BR>m. years:<BR>इयन्ति वर्षाणि, R. ;<BR>(2) एतावत् (f. ती),<BR>so m. days:<BR>एतावतो दिवसान्, U. i.<BR>II In<BR>connection with: यावत्, तावत् (f. ती),<BR>so m.<BR>he appeared to them:<BR>तावाञ्च ददृशे स तैः, R.<BR>xii. 45.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

many-sided
MANY-SIDED:<BR>I Lit.: बहुभुजः (जा, जं).<BR>II<BR>Fig.: v. Manifold.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

map
MAP (subs.): *मानचित्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

map
MAP (v.): अभि-लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.).<BR>II To<BR>describe: वर्णयति (वर्ण्, c. 10.).<BR>III To<BR>mark: चिह्नयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maple
MAPLE: फलविशेषे तद्टक्षे च।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mar
MAR:<BR>(1) हन्ति (हन्, c. 2.): v. To destroy;<BR>(2) दूषयति (c. of दुष्): v. To spoil: v.<BR>Also to disfigure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maraud
MARAUD (v.): अभिद्रवति (द्रु, c. l (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marauder
MARAUDER: अभिद्रवकारिन् (f. णी) (?); उपद्रविन्<BR>(f. णी) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marble
MARBLE (subs.): *मर्मरः, मर्मरोपलः; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marble
MARBLE (v.): *मर्मरयति (nomi.); चित्रीकरोति,<BR>m.-edged:<BR>चित्रधारः (रा, रं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

march
MARCH (subs.):<BR>I The month: उत्तरफाल्गुन-<BR>पूर्वचैत्रसंवादीयुरूपीयवर्षस्य तृतीयो मासः।<BR>II Journey:<BR>(1) यात्रा (also fig.),<BR>obstructor of the m. of the<BR>world:<BR>लोकयात्राविघातकः, Mah.;<BR>(2) यानम्, प्र-,<BR>broke off m. ing. for three nights:<BR>त्रिरात्रं प्रयाण-<BR>भङ्गमकरोत्, P. ;<BR>(3) प्रस्थानम् (= setting out on<BR>a m.), just ascertain a day proper for our m.:<BR>निरूप्यतां तावदस्माकं प्रस्थानयोग्यदिवसः, Mu. iv.<BR>II As measure of distance:<BR>(1) प्रयाणम्, -कम्,<BR>followed a few m. es:<BR>कतिचित्प्रयाणकान्यनुवव्राज,<BR>C. v.;<BR>(2) अध्वन् (m (= way),<BR>after three<BR>m. es:<BR>अध्वसु त्रिषु, R. xi. 57.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

march
MARCH (v.): याति, प्र-, अभि-, अभिप्र-, (या, c. 2.),<BR>let the whole army m.:<BR>प्रयातु वाहिनी सर्वा, A. r.;<BR>(2) व्रजति, अभि-, (व्रज्, c. l.);<BR>should m.<BR>against an enemy, drawing up the forces in<BR>battle-array:<BR>बलं व्यूह्य द्विषतोऽभिमुखं व्रजेत्, Ka.<BR>xviii. 2.;<BR>(3) चलति, सं-, उत् (चल्, c. 1.)<BR>(= to move),<BR>the great army m. ed:<BR>महाचमूश्च-<BR>चाल, Ki.;<BR>(4) प्रतिष्ठते (स्था, c. l (= to start),<BR>m. ed by land:<BR>प्रतस्थे स्थलवर्त्मना, R. iv. 60.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

march
MARCH (v.t.):<BR>(1) नयति (नी, c. l (= to<BR>lead: q. v.);<BR>(2) expr. by intrans.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marches
MARCHES: प्रान्ताः (m. pl.): v. Boundary.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marching
MARCHING (subs.):<BR>(1) प्रयाणम्;<BR>(2) प्रस्थानम्:<BR>v. March (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marchioness
MARCHIONESS: *नायिका; मार्क्षी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mare
MARE:<BR>(1) वामी;<BR>(2) वडवा;<BR>(3) घोटकी;<BR>(4)<BR>अश्वा;<BR>(5) हयी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

margin
MARGIN: धारः: v. Also edge, border.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marginal
MARGINAL: धारे लिखितः<BR>or<BR>धारलिखितः (ता, तं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marginally
MARGINALLY: धारे, धारतः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

margrave
MARGRAVE: सामन्तः (??).<BR>M. ine:<BR>सामन्तवधूः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marigold
MARIGOLD: *पीतपुष्पा; लताविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marine
MARINE (adj.):<BR>(1) सामुद्र (f. द्री);<BR>(2) सामुद्रिक<BR>(f. की); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marine
MARINE (subs.): *पोतयोधः and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mariner
MARINER: नाविकः: v. Sailor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marital
MARITAL: विवाह- in comp.: v. Matrimonial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maritime
MARITIME: सामुद्रिक (f. की): v. Also naval.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marjoram
MARJORAM: आमलकः, -की (? comp. Lat.<BR>amarcus).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mark
MARK (subs.):<BR>I A sign, character: चिह्नम्, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">Page436</a>]<BR>m. of one condemned to death:<BR>वध्यचिह्नम्, Na.<BR>II Characteristic:<BR>(1) चिह्नम्;<BR>(2) लक्षणम्;<BR>(3) व्यञ्जनम्।<BR>III Butt.: लक्ष्यम्(क्षम्), hitting (lit.<BR>piercing)<BR>the m.:<BR>लक्ष्यभेदः।<BR>IV A coin:<BR>मुद्राविशेषः। Ph.: (a man)<BR>of m.:<BR>लब्धवर्ण (f. र्णा);<BR>to make a m.:<BR>*लक्षणं स्थापयति (c. of स्था).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=435" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mark
MARK (v.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) चिह्नयति (nomi.), परि-,<BR> -सं-,<BR>m. ed with one's own hand:<BR>स्वहस्तपरिचिह्नितः<BR>(ता, तं), Y. ii. 95.;<BR>(2) चिह्नं करोति, Si.;<BR>(3) अङ्कयति (with lines, etc.),<BR>m. ed by the<BR>ocean:<BR>सागराङ्किता (मही), Mah.<BR>II To<BR>indicate: q. v.: सूचयति।<BR>III To attend to,<BR>regard: q. v.: लक्षयति, अभि-, उप-, सं-, (लक्ष्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mark out
MARK OUT:<BR>I Lit.: चिह्नयति: v. Also to<BR>measure.<BR>II To point out, designate:<BR>q. v.: चिह्नयति।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marker
MARKER: expr. by verb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

market
MARKET (subs.):<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) हट्टः,<BR>in every m.-<BR>place:<BR>प्रतिहट्टपथे, N.;<BR>(2) विपणिः (any place<BR>for sale).<BR>II In wider sense: expr. with<BR>पणायः: v. Also sale.<BR>III Price: q. v.:<BR>मूल्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

