MARKING (subs.):<BR>m. ink:<BR>*अक्षरमसी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=436" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marl
