MARSHAL (subs.):<BR>I General: बलाध्यक्षः।<BR>II<BR>In provision etc.: संविधातृ (f. त्री) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marshal
MARSHAL (v.): विन्यस्यति (अस्, c. 4.): v.<BR>To arrange, draw up.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

