mart
MART: क्रयविक्रयस्थानम्: v. Market.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marten
MARTEN: नकुलजातीयजन्तुभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

