marvellous
MARVELLOUS: आश्चर्य (f. र्या): v. Wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

marvellously
MARVELLOUSLY: आश्चर्यम्: v. Wonderfully.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masculine
MASCULINE:<BR>I Manly, strong: q. v.<BR>II In<BR>gram., male:<BR>m. gender:<BR>पुंलिङ्गम्; in also m.:<BR>पुंसि च।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

