mask
MASK (subs.):<BR>I Lit.: perh. नेपथ्यम्; छद्म-<BR>मुखम् (?).<BR>II Fig.: छद्मन् (n.): v. Disguise.<BR>III Masquerade: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mask
MASK (v.):<BR>I Lit.: छद्ममुखं (?) बिभर्ति (भृ, c.<BR>2.), etc.: v. To wear.<BR>II In gen.: v.<BR>To disguise.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mason
MASON:<BR>(1) सुधाजीविन् (m.);<BR>(2) लेपकारः;<BR>etc.:<BR>(3) राजशिल्पिन् (m (?) (comp.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masonry
MASONRY: इष्टकविन्यासः (?); राजशिल्पम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masoretic
MASORETIC, -AL: *मासरीयः (या, यं) and sim.<BR>deriv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

