MASQUERADE: perh. नाटनृत्यम् (comp. नटुआ<BR> नाच).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masquerader
MASQUERADER: छद्ममुखधारिन् (f. णी) (?) and<BR>sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mass
MASS (v.): v. To collect, assemble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mass
MASS (subs.):<BR>I A religious service:<BR>*नीराजना,<BR>high m.:<BR>*सङ्गीतनीराजना।<BR>II A<BR>lump: पिण्ड (mn.).<BR>III A heap: q. v.:<BR>(1) स्तोमः;<BR>(2) पुञ्जः।<BR>IV A multitude:<BR>q. v.: जनसमवायः: v. Bulk, size: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

massacre
MASSACRE (subs.):<BR>(1) विशसनम्;<BR>(2) संहारः:<BR>v. Slaughter, murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

massacre
MASSACRE (v.): विशसति (शस्, c. l.): v. To<BR>slaughter, murder.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masse
MASSE,-EN: expr. by समग्र (f. ग्रा): v. Entire,<BR>whole.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

massiness
MASSINESS:<BR>(1) स्थूलता;<BR>(2) बृहत्त्वम् (= largeness).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

massive
MASSIVE, MASSIVENESS: v. Massy, massiness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

massy
MASSY:<BR>(1) स्थूलः (ला, लं);<BR>(2) बृहत् (f. ती):<BR>v. Large:<BR>(3) पृथुलः (ला, लं): v. Also<BR>heavy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mast
MAST:<BR>I Of a vessel:<BR>(1) कूपः, -कः,<BR>the m. of<BR>the earth-vessel:<BR>क्षौणीनौकूपदण्डः, D. ;<BR>(2) गुण-<BR>वृक्षकः,<BR>m. -head:<BR>गुणवृक्षाग्रम्।<BR>II A fruit: v.<BR>Nut.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

master
MASTER (subs.):<BR>I Lord: q. v.:<BR>(1) प्रभुः,<BR>who wishing to become the m. of the three worlds:<BR>प्रभुर्बुभूषुर्भुवनत्रयस्य यः, Si. i. 49.;<BR>in the absence of<BR>my m.:<BR>प्रभुणा विना मे, R. ;<BR>(2) स्वामिन् (m.)<BR>(= owner and with ref. to servants),<BR>if a<BR>m. were to leave a servant before time:<BR>स्वामी<BR> चेद्भृ तकमपूर्णे काले जह्यात्, Mit.;<BR>(3) पतिः (= hus-<BR>-band, guardian),<BR>m. of a family:<BR>कुलपतिः;<BR>(4) भर्तृ (m (as opposed to भृत्य),<BR>m.'s<BR>pleasure:<BR>भर्तुः परितोषः, Sa. Ph.:<BR>I am not my<BR>own m.:<BR>नाहमात्मनः प्रभुः<BR>or<BR>आत्मानं नियन्तुं न<BR> शक्नोमि।<BR>II Manager, director: q. v.: नायकः,<BR>'m. of the rolls':<BR>राजपत्रनायकः।<BR>III A teacher:<BR>q. v.: शिक्षकः।<BR>IV An adept: m. of knowledge:<BR>विद्यानिधिः;<BR>m. of dialectics:<BR>तर्कवाचस्पतिः; m. [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">Page438</a>]<BR>of eloquence:<BR>श्रीकण्ठः; m. of the entire Vedas:<BR>वेदसमुदायकोविदः, D. : v. Proficient.<BR>V A<BR>painter or sculptor:<BR>the old m.s:<BR>*प्राचीन-<BR>चित्रकोविदाः।<BR>VI In addressing: not expr.:<BR>श्रीमत् (m (in writing).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=437" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

master
MASTER (v. t.):<BR>I To subdue: q. v.: वशी-<BR>करोति।<BR>II To attain familiarity with:<BR>(1)<BR>अभ्यन्तरीकरोति, D. ii.;<BR>(2) by subs.: v. Pro-<BR>-ficiency.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

master-builder
MASTER-BUILDER: प्रधानस्थपतिः and sim. comp.s.<BR>(??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masterful
MASTERFUL: प्रभुत्वसूचक (f. चिका) (?) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

master-hand
MASTER-HAND:<BR>I Skill: वैचक्षण्यम्।<BR>II Skil-<BR>-ful: विचक्षण (f. णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masterly
MASTERLY:<BR>(1) विचक्षण (f. णा): Skilful.;<BR>(2) निरुपमः (मा, मं): v. Incomparable:<BR>(3)<BR>उत्कृष्ट (f. ष्टा): v. Excellent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masterpiece
MASTERPIECE: अप्रतिमकर्मन् (n.) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mastership
MASTERSHIP:<BR>I Lit.: प्रभुत्वम्।<BR>II Mastery:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

master-stroke
MASTER-STROKE:<BR>(1) कौशलम् (?);<BR>(2) विदग्ध-<BR>कर्मन् (n (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mastery
MASTERY:<BR>I Proficiency: q. v.<BR>II Domi-<BR>-nion, supremacy: q. v.: प्रभुत्वम्।<BR>III Vic-<BR>-tory: q. v.: जयः।<BR>IV Eminence: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

masticate
MASTICATE: चर्वति<BR>or<BR>चर्वयति (चर्व्, c. l. and<BR>10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mastication
MASTICATION: चर्वणम्।<BR>Food requiring^1 m.:<BR>चर्व्यम्।<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mastiff
MASTIFF: बृहत्कुक्कुरभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mat
MAT (subs.):<BR>(1) कटः;<BR>(2) किलिञ्जकः (rare);<BR>(3) वटरः (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mat
MAT (v.): कटेन आस्तृणाति (स्तॄ, c. 9.), etc.: v.<BR>To cover.<BR>M. ted hair:<BR>जटा, -जूटः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

match
MATCH (subs.):<BR>I An equal: expr. by समः<BR>(मा, मं) etc.: v. To match.<BR>II A con-<BR>-test: q. v.: युद्धम्,<BR>boxing m.:<BR>मल्लयुद्धम्,<BR>V p.<BR>III Marriage: q. v.: घटना,<BR>I will bring about<BR>a m. between Vaiśampāyana and Madalekhā:<BR>वैशम्पायनस्य मदलेखया सह घटनां कारयामि, K.<BR>IV. For kindling: *दीपशलाका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

match
MATCH (v.):<BR>I In gen. sense: expr. by the<BR>adj.s सदृशः (शी, शं); तुल्यः (ल्या, ल्यं); अनुरूपः<BR>(पा, पं); etc.:<BR>a husband to m.:<BR>सदृश उपयन्ता,<BR>R. vii. 1.;<BR>the battle was between m. ing com-<BR>batants:<BR>तुल्यप्रतिद्वन्द्वि बभूव युद्धम्, R. vii. 37.: v.<BR>Equal, worthy.<BR>II To marry:<BR>(1) योजयति<BR>(युज्, c. 10.);<BR>(2) समानयति (c. of नी), Sa.<BR>v.;<BR>(3) घटनां कारयति (c. of कृ), K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matchless
MATCHLESS:<BR>(1) अद्वितीयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) अप्रतिमः<BR>(मा, मं): v. Incomparable.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

match-maker
MATCH-MAKER: घटकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mate
MATE (subs.):<BR>I A companion, consort:<BR>सहचर (f. री),<BR>seeing the m.:<BR>सहचरीं प्रेक्ष्य, R.<BR>ix. 57.<BR>II An assistant: सहकारिन् (f. णी).<BR>III Check. -m.: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mate
MATE (v.): v. To match.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

material
MATERIAL (adj.):<BR>I Composed of matter:<BR>(1) भौतिकः (की, कं), पाञ्च-, आधि-;<BR>(2) by<BR>comp.<BR>II Important: q. v.: प्रासङ्गिकः (की,<BR> कं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

material
MATERIAL (subs.):<BR>(1) साधनम्,<BR>m. s being<BR>collected:<BR>संभृतसाधनत्वात्, R. xvi. 38.;<BR>(2)<BR>उपकरणम्, M. n.: v. Thing.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

materialism
MATERIALISM: perh.: लोकायतम्; *विषयवादः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

materialist
MATERIALIST: perh.: लोकायतिकः; *विषयवादिन्<BR>(m.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

materiality
MATERIALITY: प्रासङ्गिकत्वम्,-ता (?): v. Impor-<BR>-tance.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

materially
MATERIALLY:<BR>(1) सारतः (= essentially);<BR>(2)<BR>यथार्थतः (really).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maternal
MATERNAL:<BR>(1) मातृकः (का, कं;<BR>(2) मात्र्य (f.<BR>त्र्या);<BR>(3) better by comp.,<BR>in m. and m.<BR>grandfather's property^1:<BR>मातृमातामहे धने, Vri.<BR>[1] Correction submitted by  on 20210319. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/csl-corrections/issues/53.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mathematic
MATHEMATIC, -AL: expr. by comp.,<BR>m. instru-<BR>ments:<BR>*गणितयन्त्राणि।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mathematically
MATHEMATICALLY: गणितानुसारेण; गणितविद्या-<BR>क्रमेण (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mathematician
MATHEMATICIAN: गणितपण्डितः,-विशारदः, -कुशलः,<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mathematics
MATHEMATICS: गणितम्।<BR>Mixed m.:<BR>*मिश्रगणितम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matin
MATIN (adj.):<BR>(1) प्रगेतनः (नी, नं);<BR>(2) प्रातः-<BR>कालीनः (ना, नं): v. Morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matins
MATINS: (प्रगेतनानि) अघमर्षणानि (n. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matricide
MATRICIDE:<BR>I The act:<BR>(1) मातृहत्या;<BR>(2) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">Page439</a>]<BR>मातृवधः।<BR>II The doer:<BR>(1) मातृघातिन् (f.<BR>नी);<BR>(2) मातृहन् (mfn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=438" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matriculate
MATRICULATE: *प्रविशति (विश्, c. 6.),<BR>m. d in<BR>the London University:<BR>लण्डनविश्वविद्यालयं प्रविवेश।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matriculation
MATRICULATION: examination: *प्रावेशिकी<BR> परीक्षा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matrimonial
MATRIMONIAL: वैवाहिकः (की, कं): v. Nuptial.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matrimony
MATRIMONY: विवाहः: v. Marriage.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matron
MATRON:<BR>(1) कुटुम्बिनी;<BR>(2) पुरन्ध्रिः<BR>or<BR>-न्ध्री,<BR>where in every house the m. s were busy:<BR>गृहे<BR> गृहे व्यग्रपुरन्ध्रिवर्गः, Ku. vii. 2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matronly
MATRONLY: expr. by comp. or with words<BR>expr. under proper, becoming.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matter
MATTER (v.): expr. with अर्थः,<BR>it does not m.<BR>to me....:<BR>अस्मिन् ममार्थो नास्ति;<BR>it does not m.<BR>whether it is caught or not:<BR>गृहीतमिदं ततः किम्?<BR> अथ न गृहीतं ततोऽपि किम्?, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matter
MATTER (subs.):<BR>I Material substance:<BR>विषयः: v. Thing.<BR>II Essence: q. v.: सारः।<BR>III Subject:<BR>(1) विषयः;<BR>(2) वस्तु (n.).<BR>IV Affair:<BR>(1) विषयः;<BR>(2) अर्थः।<BR>V Con-<BR>-cern: expr. with वर्तते (वृत्, c. l.),<BR>what is<BR>the m. with you:<BR>किं ते वृत्तम्।<BR>VI Import, con-<BR>-sequence: अर्थः।<BR>VII Difficulty, trouble:<BR>q. v.<BR>VIII Pus.: पूयम्, Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matting
MATTING (subs.): कटः: v. Mat.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mattock
MATTOCK:<BR>(1) खनित्रम् (?);<BR>(2) टङ्कः (= hat-<BR>-chet).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mattress
MATTRESS:<BR>(1) आस्तरणम् (gen. term.);<BR>(2)<BR>तुलिका (of cotton: ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mature
MATURE (adj.):<BR>I Ripe: q. v.: पक्व (f. क्वा),<BR>परि-।<BR>II Completely worked out: परिणतः<BR>(ता, तं): v. Also complete.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mature
MATURE (v.): परिपाकं नयति (नी, c. l.): v.<BR>To ripen, perfect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maturely
MATURELY:<BR>(1) expr. by adj.:<BR>(2) परिणतम्:<BR>v. Also completely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matureness
MATURENESS, MATURITY:<BR>I Ripeness: पाकः,<BR> परि-।<BR>II Perfection, completion: q. v.:<BR>परिणामः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

matutine
MATUTINE, MATUTINAL: प्रगेतनः (नी, नं): v.<BR>Morning.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maudlin
MAUDLIN: Drunk, intoxicated: q. v.: क्षीवः<BR>(वा, वं).<BR>II Silly, foolish: q. v.: मूढः<BR>(ढा, ढं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maugre
MAUGRE: v. Notwithstanding, in spite of.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maul
MAUL (v.): लगुडेन ताडयति (तड्, c. 10.), प्रहरति<BR>(हृ, c. l.), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mausoleum
MAUSOLEUM: *चित्रचूडम्,-कम्; चैत्यः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maw
MAW: जठरः: v. Belly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mawkish
MAWKISH:<BR>(1) कुत्सितः (ता, तं),<BR>(2) विरसः<BR>(सा, सं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mawkishly
MAWKISHLY:<BR>(1) कुत्सितम्;<BR>(2) विरसम् (?)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mawkishness
MAWKISHNESS:<BR>(1) कुत्सितता;<BR>(2) विरसता (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maxillary
MAXILLARY: हनु- in comp.: v. Jaw.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maxim
MAXIM:<BR>(1) सूत्रम्;<BR>(2) वचनम्: v. Also proverb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maximum
MAXIMUM: expr. with सर्व्वोच्च (f. च्चा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may
MAY (subs.): उत्तरवैशाखपूर्वज्यैष्ठसंवादीयुरुपीयवर्षस्य<BR> पञ्चमो मासः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may
MAY (v.):<BR>I = can: q. v.: by विधिलिङ्,<BR>you<BR>m. carry the burden:<BR>त्वं भारं वहेः, S. k.<BR>II Ex-<BR>-pressing desire or wish:<BR>(1) by आशीर्लिङ्,<BR>m. people live a man's life:<BR>जीव्याज्जनः पुरुषायुषम्,<BR>Vi.;<BR>(2) by लोट्, m. you have a good journey:<BR>तव वर्त्मनि वर्ततां शिवम्, N.<BR>III. Denoting con-<BR>-tingency or liability: by विधिलिङ्,<BR>an appli-<BR>cant m. or m. not get fortune:<BR>लभेत वा प्रार्थयिता न<BR> वा श्रियम्, Sa.;<BR>I might have disregarded this<BR>wretched life:<BR>कुर्यामुपेक्षां हतजीवितेऽस्मिन्, R.<BR>Ph.: m. be (= perhaps: q.v.): expr. by<BR>विधिलिङ्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may-bug
MAY-BUG: गोमयोत्थाभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may-day
MAY-DAY: मेमासस्य प्रथमदिवसः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may-pole
MAY-POLE: *मेनृत्ययूपः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

may-queen
MAY-QUEEN: *मेमासेश्वरी।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mayor
MAYOR: *अधिनायकः।<BR>M. ess:<BR>*अधिनायिका।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mayoralty
MAYORALTY: *अधिनायकत्वम्,-ता; अधिनायकपदम्<BR>or<BR>-अधिकारः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maze
MAZE (subs.): गहनम् (?): v. Labyrinth<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

maze
MAZE (v.): आकुलयति: v. To disturb, amaze.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mazy
MAZY: गहनः (ना, नं) (?); अति-, सु-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mead
MEAD (subs.):<BR>I A meadow: q. v.<BR>II A<BR>drink: मधु (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meadow
MEADOW<BR>(1) क्षेत्रम् (= field);<BR>(2) गोप्रचारः<BR>(= pasture land).<BR>M. -grass:<BR>यवस (mn).<BR>M. -sweet:<BR>गुल्मप्रभेदः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=439" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meagre
MEAGRE:<BR>I Thin, lean: q. v.: कृशः (शा,<BR> शं).<BR>II Scanty, insufficient: स्वल्प (f. ल्पा).<BR>III Wanting in richness:<BR>(1) फल्गु (mfn.);<BR>(2) असारः (रा, रं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meagrely
MEAGRELY: i. e. not richly:<BR>(1) फल्गु;<BR>(2)<BR>असारम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meagreness
MEAGRENESS:<BR>I Leanness: q. v.: कृशता।<BR>II<BR>Poorness:<BR>(1) असारता;<BR>(2) अपकृष्टता (= bad-<BR>-ness).<BR>III Scantiness: स्वल्पता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meal
MEAL (subs.):<BR>I Flour: q. v.: चूर्णम्।<BR>II<BR>A repast:<BR>(1) भोजनम्,<BR>one day taking a m. at<BR>night:<BR>एकाहं रात्रिभोजनः, Pa.;<BR>(2) भक्तम्,<BR>one<BR>day taking one m.:<BR>एकाहम् एकमक्ताशी, Pa.<BR>M.<BR>time:<BR>भोजनवेला।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mealiness
MEALINESS: चूर्णमयता etc.: v. Mealy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mealy
MEALY:<BR>I Consisting of meal: चूर्णमयः (यी, यं)<BR>etc.<BR>II Like meal: चूर्णसदृशः (शी, शं), etc.<BR>III Soft: q. v.: मृदु (f. द्वी), m.-mouthed:<BR>मृदुभाषिन् (f. णी) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mean
MEAN (subs.):<BR>I The middle point or place:<BR>मध्यम् by adj.<BR>II Instrument: उपकरणम्: v.<BR>Means.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mean
MEAN (v.):<BR>I To intend: q. v.: अभिप्रैति (इ,<BR>c. 2.).<BR>II To indicate: q. v.: सूचयति (सूच्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR>III To denote, signify: expr.<BR>with अर्थः, I will call the mistress and ascer-<BR>tain what (all this)<BR>really m.s:<BR>कुटुम्बिनीं शब्दाय्य<BR> परमार्थं ज्ञास्यामि, Mr. i.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mean
MEAN (adj.):<BR>I Middle, intermediate: q. v.:<BR>मध्यः (ध्या, ध्यं),<BR>m. deviation:<BR>मध्यविक्षेपः, Su. i.<BR>70. Ph.:<BR>in the m. time:<BR>अत्रान्तरे, C.<BR>II. Low<BR>in rank or birth:<BR>(1) निकृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं);<BR>(2) अपकृष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं).<BR>III Base, contemp-<BR>-tible: q. v.: जघन्यः (न्या, न्यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mean-spirited
MEAN-SPIRITED:<BR>(1) लघुचेतस् (mfn.);<BR>(2) क्षुद्र-<BR>मानसः (सा, सं), B. v. 40.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meander
MEANDER (v.): expr. by कुटिलः (ला, लं), वक्र<BR>(f. क्रा), etc. (= crooked: q. v.);<BR>the river<BR>m.s for a kroś:<BR>क्रोशं कुटिला नदी, S. k.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meander
MEANDER, MEANDERING (subs.): कृटिलता etc.:<BR>v. Crookedness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meaning
MEANING:<BR>I Signification: अर्थः,<BR>of double<BR>m.:<BR>द्व्यर्थकः (का, कं);<BR>this is its m.:<BR>अस्या-<BR>-यमर्थः, Da.: v. Sense (IV.).<BR>II Intention,<BR>purpose: q. v.: अभिप्रायः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meaningless
MEANINGLESS:<BR>(1) निरर्थकः (का, कं);<BR>(2) अन-<BR>र्थकः (का, कं);<BR>(3) अर्थहीनः (ना, नं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meaningly
MEANINGLY:<BR>(1) सार्थम्;<BR>(2) साकूतम्;<BR>(3) सामि-<BR>प्रायम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meanly
MEANLY:<BR>I Humbly:<BR>m. born:<BR>अपजातः (ता,<BR> तं);<BR>m. clad:<BR>कृपणवेषः (षा, षं), etc.<BR>II<BR>Dishonourably: नीचम्<BR>or<BR>नीच- in comp.<BR>III<BR>Moderately: नाधिकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meanness
MEANNESS:<BR>I Lowness:<BR>(1) निकृष्टता;<BR>(2)<BR>अपकृष्टता।<BR>II Poorness, niggardliness: कृपणता<BR>or<BR>कार्पण्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

means
MEANS:<BR>I Fortune, income: q. v.: विभवः।<BR>II Instrument: साधनम्। Ph.: by all m.:<BR>सर्वथा; by no m.: सर्वथा ॥ न; by any m.:<BR>केनापि प्रकारेण, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meanwhile
MEANWHILE:<BR>(1) अत्रान्तरे, K. ;<BR>(2) इत्येवकाले,<BR>Vet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measles
MEASLES: पाणिशीतला (?), Bha. iv.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measurable
MEASURABLE:<BR>(1) मेयः (या, यं), प्र-, परि-;<BR>(2)<BR>माप्य (प्या) (rare).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measure
MEASURE (subs.):<BR>I Standard for m. ing:<BR>मानम्,<BR>all m.s of weight:<BR>सर्वं तुलामानम्;<BR>m. of<BR>capacity:<BR>प्रतिमानम्, M. viii. 403.;<BR>cubic hand<BR>m.:<BR>घनहस्तमानम्, Li.<BR>II A m.; मानम्,<BR>hundred<BR>m.s of a crop:<BR>शस्यस्य मानशतम्, Li.<BR>III Fig.:<BR>a rule for judging: मानम्, प्र-।<BR>IV Size or<BR>extent:<BR>(1) भानम्, परि-, (rarely) प्र-;<BR>exact<BR>or rough m. of a diameter:<BR>सूक्ष्मं स्थूलं वा<BR> व्यासमानम्, Li.;<BR>(2) मितिः, परि-, Li. V. Means,<BR>plan: q. v.:<BR>(1) उपायः,<BR>to take m. s:<BR>उपायम्<BR> अवलभ्बते;<BR>(2) प्रयोगः (= active m.),<BR>employed<BR>hostile m.s:<BR>पारग्रामिकान् प्रयोगान् प्रायुंक्त, D. iv.<BR>VI Metre: q. v.: छन्दस् (n.).<BR>VII In<BR>music: लयः,<BR>steps are in m.:<BR>पादन्यासो लय-<BR>मुपगतः, Mal. ii. 8.<BR>VIII In pl., beds or<BR>strata: भूमिः। Ph.:<BR>in m.:<BR>परिमितम्;<BR>beyond<BR>m.:<BR>अतिमात्रम्;<BR>drying in some m.:<BR>मात्रया<BR> विशोष्य, D. vi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measure
MEASURE (v. i.): माति, परि-, (मा, c. 2.),<BR>m. ing<BR>8 cubits in length:<BR>कराष्टकमिता दैर्घ्ये, Li.;<BR>did<BR>not m. in the sky:<BR>न ममौ नमस्तले, Si. xiv. 75.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=440" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measure
MEASURE (v. t.):<BR>(1) माति<BR>or<BR>मिमीते, परि-, (मा,<BR>c. 2. and 3.), m.d (her) eyes with their eyes:<BR>तदीयैर्नयनैर्लोचनेऽमिमीत, Ku. v. 15.;<BR>you cannot<BR>be m.d but the world is m.d by you:<BR>अमेयो<BR> मितलोकस्त्वम्, R. x. 18.;<BR>the middle is m.d with<BR>the hand:<BR>मध्यः पाणिमितः, Mal. ii. 3.;<BR>(2) माप-<BR>यति (c. of मा) (lit.),<BR>when the heap of a crop<BR>is m.d:<BR>राशौ शस्यस्य मापिते, Li.; m.d (in<BR>music), -श्लिष्टः (ष्टा, ष्टं), Mr. iii. 5.: v. Mea-<BR>-sure (vii).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measureless
MEASURELESS:<BR>(1) अमेयः (या, यं);<BR>(2) अप्रमेयः<BR>(या, यं);<BR>(3) अपरिमेयः (या, यं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measurement
MEASUREMENT:<BR>I Measuring: मापः, -नम्।<BR>II<BR>Area: मानम्: v. Measure (IV).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measurer
MEASURER: मापकः, परि-।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

measuring
MEASURING (subs.): मानम्, परि-,<BR>m. rod:<BR>मान-<BR>दण्डः, Ku. i. 1.: v. To measure.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meat
MEAT:<BR>I Food: q.v.: आमिषम्।<BR>II Animal:<BR>(1) मांसम्;<BR>(2) आमिषम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanic
MECHANIC (subs.):<BR>(1) शिल्पिन् (m.);<BR>(2)<BR>शिल्पकारः;<BR>(3) शिल्पिकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanic
MECHANIC, -AL (adj.):<BR>I Lit.: यन्त्र- in comp.,<BR>m. contrivance:<BR>यन्त्रसाधनम् (?).<BR>II Done as if<BR>by a machine:<BR>(1) expr. with यन्त्रवत् (?);<BR>(2) संस्कारचालितः (ता, तं) (??).<BR>III Belong-<BR>-ing to artisans:<BR>(1) शिल्पि- etc. in comp.;<BR>(2) by gen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanically
MECHANICALLY:<BR>(1) by संस्कारचालितः (ता,<BR> तं) (??);<BR>(2) न बुद्धिपूर्वम् etc., (= not inten-<BR>-tionally).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanician
MECHANICIAN: *बलविज्ञानविशारदः (दा, दं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanics
MECHANICS: *बलविज्ञानम्; बलानां गत्यादिविज्ञानम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanism
MECHANISM: *यन्त्रसंविधानम् and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mechanist
MECHANIST: यन्त्रकारः: v. Also mechanician.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medal
MEDAL: *पारितोषिकमुद्रा; पुरस्कारमुद्रा; and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medalist
MEDALIST:<BR>I One who has gained a m.:<BR>*पुरस्कारमुद्राभृत् (mfn.) and sim. comp.s.<BR>II<BR>One skilled in it.: *पुरस्कारमुद्राकुशलः (ला, लं)<BR>and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medallion
MEDALLION: *महामुद्रा।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meddle
MEDDLE (v.): पराधिकारचर्चा करोति: v. To In-<BR>-terfere.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meddler
MEDDLER: expr. by verb. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meddling
MEDDLING, MEDDDLESOME (adj.): परकार्याभियुक्तः<BR>(क्ता, क्तं) (?); better by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediaeval
MEDIÆVAL: मध्यकालीनः (ना, नं): v. Also<BR>indirect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediate
MEDIATE (v.):<BR>I Intrans: सन्धिं कारयति (c.<BR>of कृ).<BR>II Trans: घटयति (c. of घट्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediately
MEDIATELY:<BR>(1) व्यवधानेन;<BR>(2) अन्तरेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediation
MEDIATION: expr. by mediator: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediator
MEDIATOR:<BR>(1) मध्यस्थ (f. स्था);<BR>(2) मध्यवर्तिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediatorial
MEDIATORIAL: expr. by comp.: v. Belong-<BR>-ing to.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medical
MEDICAL: i. e. pertaining to medicine: expr.<BR>by comp.,<BR>m. work:<BR>वैद्यकशास्त्रम्: v. Also medi-<BR>-cinal.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medically
MEDICALLY: वैद्यकशास्त्रानुसारेण; वैद्यकोपचारेण।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medicament
MEDICAMENT: v. Medicine (I).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medicate
MEDICATE:<BR>(1) औषधं ददाति (दा, c. 3.);<BR>(2)<BR>भेषजं करोति (with gen.), Mah.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medicinal
MEDICINAL:<BR>(1) by comp.;<BR>(2) औषधीयः (या,<BR> यं);<BR>(3) भैषजः (जी, जं).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medicinally
MEDICINALLY:<BR>I As a medicine: expr.<BR>with औषधम् etc.: v. Medicine.<BR>II To<BR>heal: उपचाराय।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medicine
MEDICINE:<BR>I A medical remedy:<BR>(1) औषधम्<BR>(lit. and fig.),<BR>m. is good for the sick:<BR>व्याधित-<BR>स्यौषधं पथ्यम्, H. ;<BR>in all distress there is no m.<BR>like wife:<BR>न च भार्यासमं किञ्चिदौषधं सर्वकृच्छ्रेषु,<BR>Mah.;<BR>(2) भेषजम्<BR>or<BR>भैषज्यम्, this is your m.<BR>(antidote): भेषजमिदं ते, P. iii. 10.;<BR>as in very<BR>strong m.s:<BR>अतिवीर्यवतीव भेषजे, Ki. ii. 4.;<BR>(3) अगदः (rare),<BR>is not m. drunk:<BR>अगदः किं न<BR> पीयते, H.<BR>II. The art or theory:<BR>(1) आयु-<BR>र्वेदः (= Hindu m.),<BR>teach us m.:<BR>आयुर्वेदमस्मान-<BR>ध्यापयतु, Bha.;<BR>(2) चिकित्सा,<BR>well up in m. in<BR>its eight branches:<BR>चिकित्सायामष्टाङ्गायां विशारदाः,<BR>Mah.;<BR>(3) वैद्यकम्, A. p.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediocre
MEDIOCRE: सामान्य (f. न्या) (= common:<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediocrity
MEDIOCRITY: expr. by सामान्य (f. न्या),<BR>m. of<BR>success:<BR>सामान्यसिद्धिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meditate
MEDITATE:<BR>I To cogitate: ध्यायति, अनु-, सं-, [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">Page442</a>]<BR>अभि-, प्र-, (ध्यै, c. l.): v. To think.<BR>II To<BR>contrive: intend:<BR>(1) संकल्पयति (कॢप्, c.<BR>10.);<BR>(2) ध्यायति (?),<BR>m. it:<BR>तद् ध्यायस्व, Mah.<BR>8. 59. 27.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=441" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meditation
MEDITATION:<BR>(1) ध्यानम्,<BR>whose eyes were fixed<BR>with m.:<BR>ध्यानस्तिमितलोचनः, R.;<BR>(2) समाधिः,<BR>to break m.:<BR>समाधिं भनक्ति, V. ;<BR>(3) प्रणिधानम्,<BR>R. i. 74.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meditative
MEDITATIVE:<BR>(1) ध्यानपरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) समा-<BR>हितः (ता, तं); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meditatively
MEDITATIVELY: expr. by adj. or circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mediterranean sea
MEDITERRANEAN SEA: *भूमध्यसागरः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medium
MEDIUM (subs.):<BR>I Mean.: expr. by मध्य<BR>(f. ध्या).<BR>II In paper.: *मध्यपत्रम्।<BR>III In<BR>spiritualism: *मध्यमपुरुषः; अनुवादकः।<BR>IV<BR>Channel, vehicle: expr. by द्वारम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medlar
MEDLAR:<BR>I The tree: *मास्पीलः।<BR>II The<BR>fruit: *मास्पीलम्, -फलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medley
MEDLEY:<BR>(1) सङ्करः;<BR>(2) सन्निपातः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

medullar
MEDULLAR, -Y:<BR>(1) by मज्जा- in comp.;<BR>(2)<BR>मज्जावत् (f. ती) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meed
MEED: पारितोषिकम्; v. Reward, recompense.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meek
MEEK: विनीतः (ता, तं): v. Gentle, humble.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meekly
MEEKLY: विनीतम्: v. Gently, humbly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meekness
MEEKNESS:<BR>(1) विनयः;<BR>(2) मार्दवम् (= mild-<BR>-ness);<BR>(3) नम्रता (= humility).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meerschaum
MEERSCHAUM:<BR>I Lit.: मृत्तिकाविशेषः; सागरफेनः<BR>II A pipe: *सागरफेननाली।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meet
MEET (adj.): उचितः (ता, तं): v. Proper,<BR>fit.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meet
MEET (subs.): मेला: v. Meeting.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meet
MEET (v. t.):<BR>I To come with: पश्यति (दृश्,<BR>c. l (= to see). To come or go out to m.:<BR>(1) प्रत्युद्गच्छति (गम्, c. l.);<BR>(2) प्रत्युद्याति<BR>(या, c. 2.).<BR>II To encounter: q. v.: अभि-<BR>याति, etc.,<BR>to m. death:<BR>मृत्युमेति, Mah.<BR>III<BR>To m. together, assemble: expr. with:<BR>संगच्छते (गम्, c. l.), समेति (इ, c. 2.), etc.:<BR>the<BR>lords of quarters have met:<BR>समागता लोकपालाः,<BR>V. ;<BR>the ladies have met to remove the marriage-<BR>string:<BR>देव्यः कङ्कणमोक्षणाय मिलिताः, Vi. ii. 50.<BR>IV In geo.: सम्पतति (पत्, c. l.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meet with
MEET WITH:<BR>I To find: q. v.: आसादयति<BR>(c. of सद्).<BR>II To encounter: expr. by<BR>एति (इ, c. 2.): v. To meet (II).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meeting
MEETING (subs.):<BR>I Coming together:<BR>समागमः: v. Also concourse.<BR>II An<BR>assembly: q. v.:<BR>(1) मेला;<BR>(2) समितिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meeting-house
MEETING-HOUSE:<BR>(1) सभा, -गृहम् (?);<BR>(2)<BR>मेलागृहम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meetness
MEETNESS: औचित्यम्: v. Fitness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

megrim
MEGRIM:<BR>I A pain: अर्द्धशिरःशूलम्।<BR>II A<BR>whim, fancy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melancholic
MELANCHOLIC: सदाविषादिन् (f. नी) (?) and<BR>sim. comp.s: v. Dejected, sad.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melancholy
MELANCHOLY: (subs.): सदाविषादः (?) and<BR>sim. comp.s.: v. Dejection, sadness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melancholy
MELANCHOLY (adj.):<BR>I Dejected, sad: विषण्ण<BR>(f. ण्णा).<BR>II Calamitous, afflictive: विषाद-<BR>करः (री, रं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melee
MELEE (sub.):<BR>(1) सङ्कुलम्;<BR>(2) सङ्कुलयुद्धम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melliferous
MELLIFEROUS: मधुप्रदः (दा, दं) and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mellifluous
MELLIFLUOUS: मधुस्रवः (वा, वं) and sim.<BR>comp.s.: v. Honey.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mellow
MELLOW (adj.): मधुरः (रा, रं): Also soft,<BR>ripe, sweet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mellow
MELLOW (v.): मधुरयति (nomi.): Also to ripen,<BR>soften.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mellow
MELLOW (v. i.): मधुरीभवतिः v. Also to ripen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mellowness
MELLOWNESS: मधुरता: v. Also ripeness,<BR>softness.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melodious
MELODIOUS:<BR>(1) मधुरः (रा, रं);<BR>(2) सुस्वरः (रा,<BR> रं);<BR>(3) श्रोत्रसुख (f. खा); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melodiously
MELODIOUSLY:<BR>(1) मधुरम्;<BR>(2) मञ्जुलम्;<BR>(3)<BR>सुस्वरम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melodiousness
MELODIOUSNESS:<BR>(1) मधुरता;<BR>(2) मञ्जुलता;<BR>(3) सुस्वरता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melodrama
MELODRAMA: *सङ्गीतनाटकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melodramatic
MELODRAMATIC:<BR>I Lit.: by comp.<BR>II Fig.:<BR>v. Exaggerated, wonderful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melody
MELODY:<BR>I Melodiousness: q. v.<BR>II In<BR>music: सुस्वरः।<BR>III A time: तालः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melon
MELON: स्फुटि, -फलम्।<BR>Water-m.:<BR>कालिङ्गम्।<BR>Musk-<BR>m.:<BR>खर्वुजम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melt
MELT (v. t.):<BR>(1) द्रावयति (c. of द्रु);<BR>(2) वि- [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">Page443</a>]<BR>-लाययति (c. of ली);<BR>(3) गालयति (c. of गल्):<BR>v. Melt (v. i.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=442" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melt
MELT (v. i.):<BR>(1) द्रवति,-ते (द्रु, c. l.),<BR>why does<BR>not your heart m.:<BR>द्रवते हृदयं कथं न ते, M.s.;<BR>resembling m.ed gold:<BR>द्रुतकनकनिकाशः, V. m.;<BR>(2) विलीयते, प्र-, (ली, c. 4 (lit.);<BR>(3) गलति<BR>(गल्, c. l (of metals, etc.): v. Also<BR>to soften.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melting
MELTING (subs.):<BR>I Active:<BR>(1) द्रावणम्;<BR>(2)<BR>विलायनम्:<BR>(3) विगालनम्।<BR>II Passive:<BR>(1)<BR>द्रवणम्<BR>or<BR>द्रुतिः;<BR>(2) विलयनम्।<BR>III Fig.:<BR>(1)<BR>द्रवणम्;<BR>(2) विलयनम् (of colours, etc.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

meltingly
MELTINGLY: expr. by part: v. Melt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

melting-pot
MELTING-POT: आवर्तनी: v. Crucible.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

member
MEMBER (subs.):<BR>I Of the body: अङ्गम्:<BR>v. Limb.<BR>II Of a sentence: अङ्गम्, -वाक्यम्,<BR>Nil.<BR>III Fig.: अङ्गम्,<BR>those qualities which<BR>are m.s. of sentiment:<BR>ये रसस्याङ्गिनो धर्माः, Kav.<BR>viii. 1.<BR>IV Of a society:<BR>(1) सभ्यः;<BR>(2)<BR>सदस्यः। V. Of a family: परिवाराः (m. pl.);<BR>अङ्गम्: v. Limb (II).<BR>VI Of an equation:<BR>पक्षः, Vij.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

membership
MEMBERSHIP:<BR>(1) सभ्यपदम् (?);<BR>(2) सदस्यत्वम्<BR>(?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

membrane
MEMBRANE: त्वच् (f.) (?), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

membraneous
MEMBRANEOUS: त्वचाकारः (रा, रं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memento
MEMENTO:<BR>(1) स्मृतिचिह्नम् (?);<BR>(2) स्मरणम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memoir
MEMOIR:<BR>(1) वृत्तम्;<BR>(2) विवरणम्;<BR>(3) चरित्रम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorable
MEMORABLE: प्रसिद्ध (f. द्धा) (= well-known:<BR>q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorandum
MEMORANDUM: स्मरणम्,-पत्रम्, -लेखः, etc. (??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorial
MEMORIAL (subs.):<BR>I A monument: स्मरण-<BR>चिह्नम् and sim. comp.s<BR>II A petition:<BR>आवेदनम्,-पत्रम्, etc.: v. Represent, petition.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorial
MEMORIAL (adj.): expr. by verb स्मारयति (c.<BR>of स्मृ) or by circumlo.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorialist
MEMORIALIST: आवेदनकारिन् (f. णी) (?) and<BR>sim. comps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memorialize
MEMORIALIZE: आवेदनं करोति, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

memory
MEMORY:<BR>I The faculty:<BR>(1) स्मृतिः,<BR>to cover<BR>the m.:<BR>स्मृतिमारोहति, N. ii. 44.;<BR>(2) मेधा<BR>(= retentive m.),<BR>is very skilful and has a<BR>good m.:<BR>परमनिपुणा मेधाविनी च, Mal. Ph.:<BR>committed to m.:<BR>कण्ठस्थ (f. स्था), Bha.;<BR>to<BR>consign to m.:<BR>हृदये निदधाति, N.<BR>II. Remem-<BR>-brance: q. v.: स्मृतिः,<BR>held in the m.:<BR>स्मृति-<BR>धृतः (ता, तं), N. v. 134.;<BR>loss of m.:<BR>स्मृति-<BR>लोपः, Sa. vii.<BR>III The time that can be<BR>remembered: स्मार्तकालः, within, beyond m.:<BR>स्मार्ते, अस्मार्ते काले, Mi.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

menace
MENACE (v.): तर्जयति, सं-, अभि-, (तर्ज्, c. 10.):<BR>v. To threaten.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

menace
