MENACINGLY: expr. by pres. part.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

menagerie
MENAGERIE: पशुसंग्रहः and sim. comp.s.: v.<BR>Collection.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mend
MEND (v. t.):<BR>I To repair: q. v.: नवीकरोति।<BR>II To correct: q. v.: शोधयति (c. of शुघ्).<BR>III To quicken: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mend
MEND (v. i.): expr. with विशिष्ट (f. ष्टा) or<BR>विशेषम् एति (इ, c. 2.), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

