MENDACITY:<BR>(1) मिथ्यावादित्वम्;<BR>(2) असत्यता:<BR>v. Falsehood.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

