MENDICANCY: v. Mendicity.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mendicant
MENDICANT:<BR>(1) भिक्षुः, -कः;<BR>(2) परिव्राज् (m.);<BR>(3) परिव्राजः,-कः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mendicity
MENDICITY:<BR>(1) भैक्ष्यम् (क्षम्); भिक्षुकता, -त्वम्;<BR>(3) भैक्षचर्या;<BR>(4) परिव्रज्या।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

