MENIAL (adj.):<BR>I Low: expr. by comp.,<BR>m.<BR>duties:<BR>प्रेष्यकर्म, H.<BR>II. Low, mean: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

menial
MENIAL (subs.):<BR>(1) परिजनः;<BR>(2) प्रेष्यः: v.<BR>Servant, slave.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

