MENSTRUAL: मासिकः (की, कं): v. Monthly.<BR>M. course (= menstruation) ऋतुः, -कालः,<BR>bath-<BR>ing after m.:<BR>ऋतुस्नानम्, Sr. M. discharge:<BR>(= mense) रजस् (n.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

