MENSTRUOUS:<BR>(1) रजस्वला;<BR>(2) ऋतुमती;<BR>(3)<BR>पुष्पिणी, V. t.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mensuration
MENSURATION:<BR>I Measuring: मापनम्।<BR>II<BR>In math.: क्षेत्रव्यवहारः, Li.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

