MENTAL:<BR>(1) मानसः (सी, सं);<BR>(2) मानसिकः [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">Page444</a>]<BR>(की, कं);<BR>(3) by comp.,<BR>m. agony:<BR>मनस्तापः:<BR>v. Mind.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=443" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

