MENTALLY:<BR>(1) मनसा;<BR>(2) बुद्ध्या;<BR>(3) by<BR>comp.,<BR>m. sick:<BR>मनोरोगिन् (f. णी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mention
MENTION (v.):<BR>(1) आ-ख्याति (ख्या, c. 2.),<BR>having m. ed the way to the abode of Vālmīki:<BR>आख्यातवाल्मीकिनिकेतमार्गः, R. xiv. 58.;<BR>(2)<BR>कथयति (कथ्, c. 10.): v. To speak.;<BR>(3)<BR>वक्ति (वच्, c. 2.): v. To say;<BR>(4) अभि-दधाति<BR>(धा, c. 3.): v. To announce.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mention
MENTION (subs.): उल्लेखः: v. To mention.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mentor
MENTOR: उपदेष्ट्ट (m.): v. Guide, counsellor.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

