MERCENARILY: expr. by adj.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mercenary
MERCENARY (adj.):<BR>I Lit., hired: v. To<BR>hire.<BR>II Fig.:<BR>(1) अर्थैकदृश् (mfn (?);<BR>(2) अर्थपरवशः (शा, शं) (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mercenary
MERCENARY (subs.): भृतकसैन्यः and sim.<BR>comp.s.: v. Soldier.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mercer
MERCER: कौशेयविक्रयिकः (?); ऊर्णाजीविन् (m.)<BR>(??).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

merchandise
MERCHANDISE (-ZE):<BR>I Commerce, trade:<BR>q. v.: वाणिज्यम्।<BR>II Goods, commodities:<BR>q. v.: पण्यानि (n. pl.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

merchant
MERCHANT:<BR>(1) वणिज् (m.), dealing of m.s:<BR>वणिजां पणाः, B.;<BR>voyaging m.:<BR>पोतवणिक्, H.;<BR>business of a m.:<BR>वणिक्कर्म, P.;<BR>a m. dealing in<BR>knowledge:<BR>ज्ञानपण्यो वणिक्, Mal. i. 17.;<BR>(2)<BR>श्रेष्ठिन् (m (= a class of m. s), m. quarter:<BR>श्रेष्ठिचत्वरम्, Mr. ii.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

merchantable
MERCHANTABLE: विक्रेयः (या, यं): v. Sale-<BR>-able.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

merchantman
MERCHANTMAN, MERCHANTSHIP: वाणिज्यपोतः:<BR>v. Ship.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

merciful
MERCIFUL:<BR>(1) कृपालु (mfn.); कृपामयः (यी,<BR> यं);<BR>(3) करुणामयः (यी, यं);<BR>(4) दयाशीलः<BR>(ला, लं): v. Kind, generous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

mercifully
MERCIFULLY:<BR>(1) कृपापूर्वम्;<BR>(2) सदयम्;<BR>(3)<BR>सानुकम्पम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=444" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

