philology
PHILOLOGY: भाषातत्त्वम्, भाषाविज्ञानम् and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

