PHILOPROGENITIVENESS: अपत्यस्नेहः and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

philosopher
PHILOSOPHER:<BR>(1) दार्शनिक (f. की);<BR>(2) विज्ञ<BR>(f. ज्ञा = learned, wise: q. v.). P.'s stone:<BR>(1)<BR>चिन्तामणिः;<BR>(2) स्पर्शमणिः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

philosphic
PHILOSPHIC, -AL:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) दार्शनिक (f.<BR>की).<BR>II Rational, wise: q. v.: विज्ञ (f.<BR>ज्ञा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

philosophically
