phlegm
PHLEGM:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) कफः,<BR>p. -destroying:<BR>कफघ्न<BR>(f. घ्नी), Sr.;<BR>(2) श्लेष्मन् (m.), increase of p.:<BR>श्लेष्मणो वृद्धिः, Sr.<BR>II Coldness, indifference:<BR>q. v.: जाड्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=519" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

phlegmatic
