phthisical
PHTHISICAL: of person:<BR>(1) क्षयरोगिन् (f. णी);<BR>(2) शोषाक्रान्तः (न्ता, न्तं), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

phthisis
PHTHISIS:<BR>(1) क्षयः, -रोगः;<BR>(2) राजयक्ष्मन् (m.);<BR>(3) शोषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

phylactery
PHYLACTERY:<BR>(1) रक्षाकाण्डः;<BR>(2) कवच (mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physic
PHYSIC:<BR>I Medicine: q. v.: चिकित्सा।<BR>II<BR>Purgative: q. v.: रेचकम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physical
PHYSICAL:<BR>I Bodily: q. v.: by comp.,<BR>p.<BR>strength:<BR>शरीरशक्तिः।<BR>II Natural: q. v.:<BR>p.<BR>sciences:<BR>पदार्थशास्त्राणि (?).<BR>III Individual:<BR>q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physically
PHYSICALLY:<BR>I According to physics: पदार्थ-<BR>शास्त्रानुसारेण (?).<BR>II Bodily: p. unfit:<BR>शरीरेणाक्षमः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physician
PHYSICIAN:<BR>(1) चिकित्सकः, faults of a p.:<BR>चिकित्सकदोषाः, C.;<BR>(2) वैद्यः,<BR>calling all the<BR>p. s:<BR>सर्वानाहूय वैद्यान्, C.;<BR>a disease which repels<BR>the efforts of p.s:<BR>वैद्ययत्नपरिभावी गदः, R.;<BR>(3)<BR>भिषज् (m.),<BR>incurable by p.s:<BR>भिषजामसाध्य<BR>(f. ध्या), R.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

