PHYSICS: पदार्थशास्त्रम्; पदार्थविज्ञानम्; and sim.<BR>comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiognomist
PHYSIOGNOMIST: पुरुषलक्षणविद् (mfn.), -ज्ञ (f. ज्ञा);<BR>and sim. comps.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiognomy
PHYSIOGNOMY:<BR>I Features: आकृतिः।<BR>II The<BR>art: perh. वदनलक्षणम् and sim. comp.s.;<BR>पुरुषलक्षणम्, K.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiological
PHYSIOLOGICAL: expr. by comp. or gen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiologist
PHYSIOLOGIST: *करणतत्त्वविशारद (f. दा); करण-<BR>विज्ञानविद् (mfn.); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

physiology
PHYSIOLOGY: *करणविज्ञानम् and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

piacular
PIACULAR:<BR>(1) दूषक (f. षिका), परि-;<BR>(2) दूषण<BR>(f. णी), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

piano
PIANO, -FORTE: वाद्यविशेषः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

piazza
PIAZZA: v. Portico.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pick
PICK (v.):<BR>I To pluck, gather: q. v.: चिनोति,<BR> प्र-, अभि-, (चि, c. 5.).<BR>II To pick: q. v.<BR>III Of the teeth: उल्लिखति (लिख्, c. 6.).<BR>IV To pierce: q. v.: विध्यति (व्यध्,) c. 4.).<BR>Ph.: (a)<BR>to p. one's purse:<BR>धनभस्त्रिकां मुष्णाति;<BR>(b)<BR>p. holes in one's coat:<BR>परस्य छिद्राणि समाहरति;<BR>(c)<BR>p. a quarrel:<BR>कलहम् उत्थापयति। Comp.s.:<BR>(a)<BR>P. off:<BR>उद्धरति (हृ, c. 1.): v. Also to<BR>separate. (b)<BR>P. out:<BR>आहरति with expr. s<BR>meaning from or among: v. Also to choose.<BR>(c)<BR>P. up:<BR>समाहरति: v. To gather.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pick
PICK (subs.):<BR>I In comp.: tooth -p.:<BR>दन्तोल्लेखनी;<BR>ear -p.:<BR>कर्णस्य कण्डूयनकम्, H. ii.<BR>66.;<BR>p.-wick:<BR>*दशोद्धरणी।<BR>II P. axe.: q. v.<BR>III Choice, chosen things: q. v.<BR>IV The<BR>best: विशिष्टाः (m. pl.),<BR>with the p. of the<BR>school:<BR>विद्यालयस्य विशिष्टैश्छात्रैः सह।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pickaxe
PICKAXE:<BR>(1) पाषाणदारणः, -णी;<BR>(2) पाषाणभेदनी;<BR>(3) टंकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

picket
PICKET: v. Picquet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pickle
PICKLE:<BR>I Subs.: no equiv.: *अम्लासवः,<BR> -द्रव्यम्।<BR>II Verb: *अम्लासवेन संदधाति (धा, c. 3.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pickpocket
PICKPOCKET: ग्रन्थिच्छेदः, -कः: v. Thief.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

picnic
PICNIC: विहारः<BR>or<BR>-हरणम् (= amusing),<BR>p. in a<BR>park:<BR>वनविहरणम्, Si.;<BR>let us go to the Yamunā<BR>and have a p. there and come back in the even-<BR>ing:<BR>“गच्छावो यमुनां प्रति । सुहृज्जनवृतौ तत्र विहृत्य<BR> मधुसूदन । सायाह्ने पुनरेष्यावः”, Mah. i. 220. 14-5.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

picquet
PICQUET: रक्षिकदलम् (?); गौल्मिकाः (m. pl. ?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

pictorial
PICTORIAL:<BR>(1) सचित्र (f. त्रा);<BR>(2) चित्रोपेत<BR>(f. ता) and sim. comp.s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=520" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

