syntactical
SYNTACTICAL: expr. by comp.; ph.:<BR>s.<BR>arrangement:<BR>यथाशास्त्रविन्यासः (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

syntax
SYNTAX:<BR>(1) शब्दविन्यासः (?).<BR>(2) कारकादिप्रक्रिया।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

