synthetic
SYNTHETIC, -AL: expr. by comp.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

syphilis
SYPHILIS:<BR>(1) फिर(रि)ङ्गः, -व्याधिः, Bha.;<BR>(2)<BR>उपदंशः (gen.), Sr.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

syphilitic
SYPHILITIC: फिर(रि)ङ्गिन् (f. णी), Bha.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

syringe
SYRINGE:<BR>I Subs.: *सीरञ्जम्।<BR>II Verb:<BR>*सीरञ्जयति (nomi.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

system
SYSTEM:<BR>I Proper method: perh. प्रतिपन्न- [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">Page698</a>]<BR>पद्धतिः।<BR>II Branch: q. v.: शाखा। Ph.:<BR>the<BR>solar s.:<BR>सौरं जगत्: v. World.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=697" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

systematic
SYSTEMATIC, -AL: expr. by comp. or adverb.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

systematically
SYSTEMATICALLY:<BR>(1) यथापद्धति;<BR>(2) अनुज्भ्कित-<BR>क्रमम् (=in order).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

systematize
SYSTEMATIZE: पद्धतिं बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c. 9.: with<BR>gen.); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tabard
TABARD: तनुत्रावारः (?) and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tabby
TABBY: कल्माषित (f. ता): v. Dappled, spot-<BR>-ted.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tabernacle
TABERNACLE: दूष्यम्: v. Tent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tablature
TABLATURE: a picture: आलेख्यम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

table
TABLE:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) फलकम्;<BR>(2) पत्रम् (=leaf).<BR>II A picture: आलेख्यम्।<BR>III Fig.: पत्रम्,<BR>t.<BR>of contents:<BR>निर्घण्टपत्रम्;<BR>interest-t. s:<BR>कुसीदपत्रम्।<BR>IV Of hand रेखाविन्यासः<BR>or<BR>रेखाः (f. pl.).<BR>V<BR>A piece of furniture: no equiv.: *स्तम्मलम्।<BR>Ph.:<BR>to keep a good t.:<BR>भोजनविशेषानुपकल्पयति<BR>(c. of कॢप्). T.-cloth: *स्तम्भलास्तरणम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tableland
TABLELAND: मालं क्षेत्रम् and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

table-talk
TABLE-TALK:<BR>I Lit.: *स्तम्भलालापः।<BR>II Fig.:<BR>विश्रम्भालापः, etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tablet
TABLET: v. Table (I), plate.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tabar
TABAR, TABRET: पणवः: v. Drum.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tabular
TABULAR: no equiv.: फलकीकृत (f. ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tacit
TACIT: expr. by adv.: v. Also silent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tacitly
TACITLY:<BR>(1) तूष्णीम् (= silently: q. v.);<BR>(2)<BR>मनसा (=in mind).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

taciturn
TACITURN:<BR>I Reserved: q. v.<BR>II Silent:<BR>q. v.: मौनिन् (f. नी).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

taciturnity
TACITURNITY: मौनम्: v. Silence.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tack
TACK:<BR>I To fasten: q. v.: बध्नाति (बन्ध्, c.<BR>9.).<BR>II To turn: q. v.: व्यावर्तयति (c. of<BR>वृत्).<BR>II A nail: कीलः।<BR>IV A rope: गुणः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tackle
TACKLE, -ING (subs.): मज्जा: v. Ship, equip-<BR>-ment.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tackle
TACKLE (v.):<BR>I To harness: q. v.:<BR>II<BR>Seize: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tact
TACT: perh. वैदग्धम्<BR>or<BR>कौशलम्: v. Skill.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tactician
TACTICIAN: perh. युक्तिकुशल (f. ला): v. Skilful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tactics
TACTICS: perh. युक्तिकौशलम्: v. Skill, stra-<BR>-tegy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tadpole
TADPOLE: भेकडिम्बः and sim. comp. s.: v.<BR>Young.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tag
TAG:<BR>I Subs.: अग्रम् (= point).<BR>II Put a t.<BR>to: v. To put.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tail
TAIL:<BR>I Lit.:<BR>(1) लाङ्गूलम्;<BR>(2) पुच्छ (rarely<BR>पिच्छ) (mn.);<BR>(3) बालः, -धिः;<BR>(4) लञ्जः<BR>(rare).<BR>II Fig.: पुच्छ (mn.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tailed
TAILED:<BR>(1) लाङ्गूलिन् (f. नी);<BR>(2) पुच्छवत् (f.<BR>ती); and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tailless
TAILLESS:<BR>(1) निर्लाङ्गु(ङ्गू)ल (f. ला);<BR>(2) पुच्छहीन<BR>(f. ना); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=698" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

tailor
