UNFREQUENTED: विरलसञ्चार (f. रा): v. To<BR>frequent.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unfriendly
UNFRIENDLY:<BR>(1) विप्रिय (f. या);<BR>(2) अप्रिय<BR>(f. या): v. Friendly, inimical.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unfruitful
UNFRUITFUL:<BR>(1) अफल (f. ला);<BR>(2) निष्फल<BR>(f. ला);<BR>(3) फलहीन (f. ना); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

