UNFRUITFULLY:<BR>(1) निष्फलम्;<BR>(2) वृथा (in<BR>vain: q. v.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

