UNFULFILLED:<BR>(1) अनिष्पन्न (f. न्ना);<BR>(2) अनि-<BR>ष्पादित (f. ता);<BR>(3) असमाहित (f. ता);<BR>(4)<BR>असाधित (f. ता): v. To fulfil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unfurl
UNFURL:<BR>(1) विवृणोति (वृ, c. 5.): v. To<BR>open;<BR>(2) विस्तारयति: v. To expand.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unfurnished
UNFURNISHED:<BR>(1) अपरिवर्ह (f. र्हा);<BR>(2)<BR>असज्जित (f. ता); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungainly
UNGAINLY: विरूप (f. पा): v. Awkward, ugly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungenerous
UNGENEROUS: अनुदार (f. रा): v. Generous.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungentlemanly
UNGENTLEMANLY, UNGENTEEL:<BR>(1) अभद्र (f.<BR>द्रा);<BR>(2) असभ्य (f. भ्या).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungodly
UNGODLY:<BR>I Lit.: निरीश्वर (f. रा).<BR>II<BR>Wicked, sinful: q. v. Ph.:<BR>u. hours:<BR>असमयः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uncovernable
UNCOVERNABLE:<BR>(1) अशासनीय (f. या);<BR>(2)<BR>अनियम्य (f. म्या = uncontrollable); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungraceful
UNGRACEFUL: कदर्य (f. र्या): v. Awkward,<BR>inelegant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungracious
UNGRACIOUS:<BR>I Unmerciful: अप्रसन्न (f. न्ना).<BR>II Unpleasant: अशोभन (f. ना).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungrammatical
UNGRAMMATICAL:<BR>(1) च्युतसंस्कार (f. रा), Sah.;<BR>(2) च्युतसंस्कृति (mfn.), Kav.;<BR>(3) व्याकरण-<BR>लक्षणहीन (f. ना);<BR>(4) व्याकरणविरुद्ध (f. द्धा);<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungrateful
UNGRATEFUL:<BR>(1) अकृतज्ञ (f. ज्ञा);<BR>(2) अकृत-<BR>वेदिन् (f. नी) etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

ungrudgingly
UNGRUDGINGLY:<BR>(1) निरापत्ति;<BR>(2) निरापत्तिपूर्वम्;<BR>(3) अप्रतिवादम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unguarded
UNGUARDED:<BR>(1) अरक्षित (f. ता) and sim.<BR>comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unguent
UNGUENT:<BR>(1) अभ्यञ्जनम्;<BR>(2) लेपः, विलेपनम्;<BR>(3) अनुलेपः;<BR>(4) समालम्भः, -नम्;<BR>(5) उपदेहः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhallowed
UNHALLOWED:<BR>(1) अपवित्र (f. त्रा): v. Pro-<BR>-fane, unholy.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhappily
UNHAPPILY:<BR>I Unfortunately: q. v.: दुर्दैवात्।<BR>II Miserably: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhappy
UNHAPPY:<BR>I Miserable: q. v.:<BR>(1) असुखिन्<BR>(f. नी);<BR>(2) अनिर्वृत (f. ता);<BR>(3) दुःखिन्<BR>(f. नी).<BR>II Unfortunate: q. v.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unharness
UNHARNESS: मोचयति (मुच्, c. 10.),<BR>u. ed<BR>the horses:<BR>मोचयमास तुरङ्गान्, Mah. v. ii.<BR>100-2.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhatched
UNHATCHED:<BR>I Lit.: अभृत (f. ता) (?).<BR>II<BR>Fig.: असंकल्पित (f. ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhealthiness
UNHEALTHINESS:<BR>(1) असुस्थता (of men, etc.);<BR>(2) अस्वास्थ्यकरत्वम् (of places); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhealthy
UNHEALTHY:<BR>I Of men. etc.:<BR>(1) असुस्थ<BR>(f. स्था);<BR>(2) रोगवत् (f. ती);<BR>(3) आमयिन्<BR>(f. नी); etc.<BR>II Of places, etc.:<BR>(1)<BR>अस्वास्थ्यकर (f. री);<BR>(2) रोगाकुल (f. ला);<BR>(3)<BR>आमयाविल (f. ला); and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unheard
