unheeded
UNHEEDED:<BR>(1) अवधीरित (f. ता): v. To<BR>neglect.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unheedful
UNHEEDFUL, UNHEEDING: अनवधान (f. ना): v.<BR>Unmindful.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhesitatingly
UNHESITATINGLY: अविकल्पम्, P.: v. Boldly,<BR>fearlessly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhinge
UNHINGE: विसन्धीकरोति (?),<BR>u. d:<BR>अपसन्धि<BR>(mfn.: (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unholy
UNHOLY:<BR>(1) अपुण्य (f. ण्या);<BR>(2) अपवित्र<BR>(f. त्रा);<BR>(3) अपूत (f. ता); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhoped for
UNHOPED FOR:<BR>(1) अनाकांक्षित (= unexpected);<BR>(2) आशातीत (beyond hope).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unhurt
UNHURT (adj.):<BR>(1) अक्षत (f. ता);<BR>(2) अपरिक्षत<BR>(f. ता);<BR>(3) अविक्षत (f. ता); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unicorn
UNICORN: एकःशृङ्गः<BR>or<BR>एकशृङ्गिन् (m.: (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uniform
UNIFORM:<BR>I Adj.:<BR>(1) एकाकार (f. रा), सरूप<BR>(f. पा) and sim. comp. s.;<BR>(2) एकविध (f. धा)<BR>and sim. comp. s. (= of the same kind);<BR>(3) समान (f. ना = even);<BR>(4) विशेषक (f. षिका<BR>= distinguishing).<BR>II Subs.: विशेषवेशः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uniformity
UNIFORMITY:<BR>(1) सारूय्यम्;<BR>(2) ऐकविध्यम्;<BR>(3) [<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">Page734</a>]<BR>साम्यम्;<BR>(4) वैशेष्यम्;<BR>(5) नियमः: for dif.: v.<BR>Uniform.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=733" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uniformly
UNIFORMLY: नियतम्: v. Constantly, always.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uniliteral
UNILITERAL:<BR>(1) एकाक्षर (f. रा);<BR>(2) एकवर्ण<BR>(f. र्णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unimpaired
UNIMPAIRED:<BR>(1) अक्षत (f. ता);<BR>(2) अविकल<BR>(f. ला);<BR>(3) अनून (f. ना); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unimpeachable
UNIMPEACHABLE:<BR>(1) निरवद्य (f. द्या);<BR>(2)<BR>अनिन्द्य (f. न्द्या = irreproachable).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unimportant
UNIMPORTANT:<BR>(1) लघु (f. also घ्वी);<BR>(2)<BR>अगुरु (f. also र्वी); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uninhabitable
UNINHABITABLE:<BR>(1) न वासयोग्य (f. ग्या);<BR>(2) अवास्तव्य (f. व्या); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uninhabited
UNINHABITED:<BR>(1) निर्मानुष (f. षा);<BR>(2) निर्जन<BR>(f. ना);<BR>(3) निर्मनुष्य (f. ष्या);<BR>(4) अमानुष<BR>(f. षा); and sim. comp. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uninjured
UNINJURED:<BR>(1) अक्षत (f. ता): v. Unhurt;<BR>(2) अविकल (f. ला);<BR>(3) अव्रण (f. णा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unintelligible
UNINTELLIGIBLE:<BR>(1) दुर्बोध (f. धा), and sim.<BR>comp. s.;<BR>(2) अस्पष्ट (f. ष्टा = not clear).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unintentional
UNINTENTIONAL: expr. by adv.: v. Also<BR>undesigned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unintentionally
UNINTENTIONALLY:<BR>(1) अकामतः;<BR>(2) अकामात्;<BR>(3) अकामेन।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uninteresting
UNINTERESTING: न हृदयग्राहिन् (f. णी)<BR>or<BR>हृदयङ्गम<BR>(f. मा).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

