UNINTERRUPTEDLY: अविच्छिन्नम्: v. Incessantly.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

uninterrupted
UNINTERRUPTED:<BR>(1) अविच्छिन्न (f. न्ना);<BR>(2)<BR>अपरिच्छिन्न (f. न्ना): v. Also incessant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

union
UNION:<BR>(1) योगः, सं-, समा-,<BR>when even one's body<BR>and soul are heard to have u. and separation:<BR>स्वशरीरशरीरिणावपि श्रुतसंयोगविपर्ययौ यदा, R. viii.<BR>89.; संहतिः (the state of being united),<BR>u. is<BR>good for men:<BR>संहतिः श्रेयसौ पुंसाम्, H. i. 35.;<BR>(3) सङ्गमः<BR>or<BR>समागमः (= meeting).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unique
UNIQUE:<BR>(1) अद्वितीय (f. या);<BR>(2) अपूर्व (f. र्वा<BR>= unprecedented).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unison
UNISON: एकतानः(लः): v. Also concord.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unit
UNIT: मूलम्,<BR>u. of measure:<BR>मानमूलम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unitarian
UNITARIAN:<BR>(1) अद्वैतवादिन् (f. नी (?);<BR>(2)<BR>अद्वयवादिन् (f. नी (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unitarianism
UNITARIANISM:<BR>(1) अद्वैतवादः (?);<BR>(2) अद्वयवादिता,<BR> -त्वम् (?).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unite
UNITE:<BR>I Trans.:<BR>(1) योजयति, सं-, समा- (युज्,<BR>c. 10.): v. To join;<BR>(2) संहन्ति (हन्, c. 2:<BR>as in a work),<BR>they u dly:<BR>एते संहताः, H. i.<BR>36.;<BR>(3) संघटयति (c. of घट् = to couple),<BR>to u.<BR>Bhaimī with him:<BR>अनेन भैमीं घटयिष्यन्, N. i. 46.<BR>II Intrans.:<BR>(1) संयुज्यते। (pass. of युज्);<BR>(2) better by part. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

united
UNITED (adj.): of persons:<BR>(1) संहत (f. ता);<BR>(2) मिलित (f. ता).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unitedly
UNITEDLY:<BR>(1) by adj.;<BR>(2) सम्भूय: v. Also<BR>together.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unity
UNITY:<BR>I Oneness: एकता, -त्वम्,<BR>The doctrine<BR>of u.:<BR>अद्वैतमतम्, -वादः।<BR>II Agreement:<BR>(1)<BR>ऐक्यम्;<BR>(2) ऐकमत्यम् (unanimity).<BR>III In<BR>math.: एकः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

universal
UNIVERSAL:<BR>(1) सार्वलौकिक (f. की);<BR>(2) सार्वत्रिक<BR>(f. की);<BR>(3) सार्व (f. र्वा: rare), Si.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

universality
UNIVERSALITY:<BR>(1) सार्वलौकिकत्वम्;<BR>(2) सार्व-<BR>त्रिकता, -त्वम्;<BR>(3) सर्वसाधारणता।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

universally
UNIVERSALLY:<BR>(1) सर्वत्र;<BR>(2) सर्वतः;<BR>(3) विश्वतः;<BR>(4) विष्वक्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

universe
UNIVERSE: विश्वम्,<BR>glory to Thee, the Creator of<BR>the u.:<BR>नमो विश्वसृजे तुभ्यम्, R.: v. World.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

university
UNIVERSITY: विश्वविद्यासमाजः (विश्वविद्यालयः is now<BR>used).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

univocal
UNIVOCAL:<BR>I Of words: एकार्थ (f. र्था).<BR>II<BR>of sound.: एकतानिक (f. की).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unjust
UNJUST:<BR>I Of men:<BR>(1) अन्यायपर (f. रा);<BR>(2) अधार्मिक (f. की); etc.<BR>II Of acts:<BR>(1)<BR>अन्याय्य (f. य्या);<BR>(2) न न्यायसङ्गत (f. ता);<BR>etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unjustly
UNJUSTLY:<BR>(1) अन्यायतः;<BR>(2) अन्यायेन;<BR>(3)<BR>अधर्मतः।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unkind
UNKIND:<BR>(1) निर्दय (f. या);<BR>(2) दयाहीन (f. ना);<BR>etc.: v. Merciless.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

