UNKINDLY (adv.):<BR>(1) निर्दयम्;<BR>(2) निष्करुणम्;<BR>(3) निष्कृपम्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unkindly
UNKINDLY (adj.):<BR>(1) अप्रिय (f. या);<BR>(2)<BR>अस्निग्ध (f. ग्धा); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unkindness
UNKINDNESS:<BR>I The state:<BR>(1) निग्रहः, (= dis-<BR>-favour);<BR>(2) निःस्नेहता (= want of affec-<BR>-tion);<BR>(3) निर्दयता (= mercilessness).<BR>II<BR>Unkind act: निर्दयव्यवहारः and sim. expr. s.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=734" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unknowingly
UNKNOWINGLY:<BR>(1) अज्ञानतः;<BR>(2) अजानत् (f. ती);<BR>(3) अबोधपूर्वम्; etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlace
UNLACE: मोचयति<BR>or<BR>मोक्षयति (मुच्,<BR>or<BR>मोक्ष्,<BR>c. 10.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlawful
UNLAWFUL:<BR>(1) अवैध (f. धी: (?);<BR>(2) विधि-<BR>विरुद्ध (f. द्धा: (?); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlawfully
UNLAWFULLY:<BR>(1) विधिमुल्लङ्घ्य (?);<BR>(2) विधि-<BR>विरुद्धम् (?); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlawfulness
UNLAWFULNESS:<BR>(1) अवैधता (?);<BR>(2) विधि-<BR>विरुद्धता (?); etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlearn
UNLEARN:<BR>(1) मनसो निष्काशयति (c. of काश्);<BR>(2) स्मृतेरपास्यति (अस्, c. 4.): v. To drive<BR>out, forget.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlearned
UNLEARNED:<BR>(1) अशिक्षित (f. ता);<BR>(2) अविद्वस्<BR>(f. दुषी);<BR>(3) अज्ञ (f. ज्ञा): v. Ignorant.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unless
UNLESS:<BR>(1) न(नो)चेत्, please reply u. it is secret.:<BR>न चेद्रहस्यं प्रतिवक्तुमर्हसि, Ku. v. 40.;<BR>(2) यदि न<BR>(sometimes यदि is understood),<BR>u. those who<BR>are dependents like me:<BR>न स्यादन्योऽप्यहमिव जनो यः<BR> पराधीनवृत्तिः, Me. i. 8.: v. Also except.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlettered
UNLETTERED: अशिक्षित (f. ता): v. Unlearned.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlike
UNLIKE:<BR>(1) असदृश<BR>or<BR>विसदृश (f. शी = dissi-<BR>-milar): v. Like, different;<BR>(2) with न<BR>and वत् in comp. (in contrasting),<BR>u. his<BR>father:<BR>न पितृवत्।<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlikely
UNLIKELY: असम्भव (f. वा): v. Improbable,<BR>not likely.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlimited
UNLIMITED:<BR>(1) असीम (f. मा);<BR>(2) निरवधि<BR>(mfn.);<BR>(3) अनन्त (f. न्ता = endless).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unload
UNLOAD भारमवतारयति (c. of तॄ)<BR>or<BR>अवरोपयति<BR>(c. of रुह्); etc. (with gen.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unloaded
UNLOADED:<BR>(1) अपभार (f. रा);<BR>(2) अपरोपित-,<BR> अवतारित- भार (f. रा), etc.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=BOR&page=735" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=bor" target="_blank">Correction</a>

unlock
